values
  ('1012586230752681858', 'The H.K. Triad', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Clarence Ford, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Athena Chu Yan, Diana Pang Dan, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Lee Siu-Kay, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung, Spencer Lam Seung-Yi', null, 'Two childhood friends become mortal enemies after their lives take drastically different paths and they discover that they are both in love with the same woman.', 'Two childhood friends become mortal enemies after their lives take drastically different paths and they discover that they are both in love with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRMyqFC6JUrLAZFuPLsgSnQgpeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156070'),
  ('964986833949304631', 'The Hail Mary', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Roebuck, Dan Hertzog', 'Daniel Roebuck', 'Marsha Dietlein, Joe Estevez, Duane Whitaker, James Black, Timothy E. Goodwin', 'PG', 'Sister Kathy finds an angry loner in need of redemption and leads him to his atonement by conning him into creating a football team for her Catholic School.', 'Sister Kathy finds an angry loner in need of redemption and leads him to his atonement by conning him into creating a football team for her Catholic School.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fu0jo6gwhaaoDzthfOcjpNWAHuk7.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-hail-mary-2026'),
  ('328615242374349241', 'The Hair of the Beast', 2010, 'Horror, Adventure', 'Philippe Gagnon, Steve Asselin', 'Pierre Daudelin, Stéphane J. Bureau', 'Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Viviane Audet, Antoine Bertrand, Patrice Robitaille, Pierre-Luc Lafontaine, Benoît McGinnis, Gilles Renaud, Marc Beaupré', null, 'Takes place in 1665 in New France at a time when a part of Canada was colonialized by France. Joseph Côté escapes from a prison in order to avoid death by hanging. Moreover, while some colonial soldiers are chasing him, Joseph takes the identity of a Jesuit and hides in the seigneury of Beaufort where most men are waiting for "daughters of the king." (French women who were sent to Canada in order to find a husband.) At night, Joseph finds out that there are werewolves that terrorize the village. Besides, things get complicated when he falls in love with Marie Labotte, a "daughter of the king" that no one wants to marry. All in all, by simply trying to protect his life and Marie''s, Joseph will end up fighting against the werewolves.', 'Takes place in 1665 in New France at a time when a part of Canada was colonialized by France. Joseph Côté escapes from a prison in order to avoid death by hanging. Moreover, while some colonial soldiers are chasing him, Joseph takes the identity of a Jesuit and hides in the seigneury of Beaufort where most men are waiting for "daughters of the king." (French women who were sent to Canada in order to find a husband.) At night, Joseph finds out that there are werewolves that terrorize the village. Besides, things get complicated when he falls in love with Marie Labotte, a "daughter of the king" that no one wants to marry. All in all, by simply trying to protect his life and Marie''s, Joseph will end up fighting against the werewolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ev6aXkqh9IVOqDHOQFqvbwHK7wA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58719'),
  ('672414049600589506', 'The Hairdresser', 1905, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A partially nude woman fixes and brushes her hair.', 'A partially nude woman fixes and brushes her hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I8YwzHXCncCUBgAECpovW2Auh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196211'),
  ('608569093330952374', 'The Hairdresser', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Doris Dörrie, Hanno Lentz', 'Laila Stieler', 'Gabriela Maria Schmeide, Ill-Young Kim, Rolf Zacher, Maren Kroymann, Jördis Triebel, Pierre Sanoussi-Bliss, Dorothea Walda, Christina Große', null, 'When a salon refuses to hire her because of her plump figure, irrepressible hair stylist Kathi plots revenge by opening her own beauty parlor next door. But when she faces a cash-flow problem, Kathi resorts to some creative means of raising capital.', 'When a salon refuses to hire her because of her plump figure, irrepressible hair stylist Kathi plots revenge by opening her own beauty parlor next door. But when she faces a cash-flow problem, Kathi resorts to some creative means of raising capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7iS8HgmMprSdVQHYgVMYAI9l1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42293'),
  ('461034102657959009', 'The Hairdresser''s Husband', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Patrice Leconte, Eduardo Serra, Éric Pierson', 'Claude Klotz, Patrice Leconte', 'Jean Rochefort, Anna Galiena, Roland Bertin, Maurice Chevit, Philippe Clévenot, Jacques Mathou, Claude Aufaure, Albert Delpy', null, 'Antoine has always been fascinated by a hairdresser''s delicate touch, the beguiling perfume, and the enticing figure of a woman with an opulent bosom. After all, he had always known he would marry one, completing his idealized love fantasy.', 'Antoine has always been fascinated by a hairdresser''s delicate touch, the beguiling perfume, and the enticing figure of a woman with an opulent bosom. After all, he had always known he would marry one, completing his idealized love fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0CCZOP1VILxL33O6OiVzUYVNPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11796'),
  ('380102989655412040', 'The Hairy Tooth Fairy', 2006, 'Family, Animation', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini, Miguel Abal, Cecilia Artigas', 'Enrique Cortés', 'Alejandro Awada, Mariano Chiesa, Roly Serrano, Delfina Varni, Fabián Mazzei, Ana María Orozco, Joe Rígoli, Diego Gentile', null, 'Lucía, an active little girl, looses a tooth. Santiago, her father, is an out-of-work boss, and her mother, Pilar, is a successful but overworked architect, reassure Lucía, by telling her that the Hairy Tooth Fairy (a mouse named Pérez) will come to her bedroom to collect her tooth, leaving some money in its place. A mouse who had been monitoring the situation tells another mouse, who in turn tells another mouse until finally the news reaches Pérez, The Hairy Tooth Fairy, who lives in a boat in the port along with hundreds of other mice. They receive the teeth that he collects, and then clean, shape and polish them so that they can be transformed into shiny round pearls. These pearls are then carried through the citys sewers until finally they reach the jewellers owned by Morientes, where an old friend exchanges them for their weight in gold.', 'Lucía, an active little girl, looses a tooth. Santiago, her father, is an out-of-work boss, and her mother, Pilar, is a successful but overworked architect, reassure Lucía, by telling her that the Hairy Tooth Fairy (a mouse named Pérez) will come to her bedroom to collect her tooth, leaving some money in its place. A mouse who had been monitoring the situation tells another mouse, who in turn tells another mouse until finally the news reaches Pérez, The Hairy Tooth Fairy, who lives in a boat in the port along with hundreds of other mice. They receive the teeth that he collects, and then clean, shape and polish them so that they can be transformed into shiny round pearls. These pearls are then carried through the citys sewers until finally they reach the jewellers owned by Morientes, where an old friend exchanges them for their weight in gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcWyHT39WRYLmEN9cQtBqivm71j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36617'),
  ('912908573944995855', 'The Hairy Tooth Fairy 2', 2008, 'Animation, Family', 'Andrés G. Schaer, Pablo Lorenzo, Muriel Cabeza', 'Angel E. Pariente, Natalia Jazanovich, Judith Alioua', 'Claudia Fontán, Manuel Manquiña, Matías Sandor, Camila Riveros, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Manuela Velasco, Joe Rígoli, Marcos Woinsky', null, 'Eight year old Lucas would like to know how the Tooth Fairy exchanges coins for teeth without getting caught. He is determined to stay awake all night to find out. Meanwhile, a little mouse falls into a trap set by a dishonest contractor who is desperate to tell the world his secret, that the mouse is the Tooth Fairy. Lucas and his family has to do everything in their power to help the sweet little mouse with its mission, which since time immemorial, is to make children happy...', 'Eight year old Lucas would like to know how the Tooth Fairy exchanges coins for teeth without getting caught. He is determined to stay awake all night to find out. Meanwhile, a little mouse falls into a trap set by a dishonest contractor who is desperate to tell the world his secret, that the mouse is the Tooth Fairy. Lucas and his family has to do everything in their power to help the sweet little mouse with its mission, which since time immemorial, is to make children happy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GQPIn1W4RQCkVWUMJzeZTiMgrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52611'),
  ('137237359039171647', 'The Half of It', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Alice Wu, Greta Zozula, Adam Escott', 'Alice Wu', 'Leah Lewis, Daniel Diemer, Alexxis Lemire, Enrique Murciano, Wolfgang Novogratz, Catherine Curtin, Becky Ann Baker, Collin Chou', 'PG-13', 'Shy, straight-A student Ellie is hired by sweet but inarticulate jock Paul, who needs help wooing the most popular girl in school. But their new and unlikely friendship gets tricky when Ellie discovers she has feelings for the same girl.', 'Shy, straight-A student Ellie is hired by sweet but inarticulate jock Paul, who needs help wooing the most popular girl in school. But their new and unlikely friendship gets tricky when Ellie discovers she has feelings for the same girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jC1PNXGET1ZZQyrJvdFhPfXdPP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597219'),
  ('824317556572732413', 'The Half-Naked Truth', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gregory La Cava, Bert Glennon, Hugh Walker', 'Gregory La Cava, Corey Ford', 'Lupe Vélez, Lee Tracy, Eugene Pallette, Frank Morgan, Shirley Chambers, Franklin Pangborn, Robert McKenzie, Mary Mason', 'NR', 'A carnival pitchman (Tracy) finagles his girlfriend, a fiery hoochie dancer (Vélez), into a major Broadway revue under the auspices of an impresario (Morgan).', 'A carnival pitchman (Tracy) finagles his girlfriend, a fiery hoochie dancer (Vélez), into a major Broadway revue under the auspices of an impresario (Morgan).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLws14Jz2LGvE2xIx01ZwPCCAJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97657'),
  ('1055380330473043085', 'The Halfway House', 1944, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Basil Dearden, Wilkie Cooper', 'Angus MacPhail, Diana Morgan', 'Mervyn Johns, Glynis Johns, Sally Ann Howes, Françoise Rosay, Tom Walls, Esmond Knight, Guy Middleton, Valerie White', null, 'A group of travellers, each with a personal problem that they want to hide, arrive at a mysterious Welsh country inn. There is a certain strangeness in the air as they are greeted by the innkeeper and his daughter. Why are all the newspapers a year old? And why doesn''t Gwyneth seem to cast a shadow?', 'A group of travellers, each with a personal problem that they want to hide, arrive at a mysterious Welsh country inn. There is a certain strangeness in the air as they are greeted by the innkeeper and his daughter. Why are all the newspapers a year old? And why doesn''t Gwyneth seem to cast a shadow?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83t2y4X8eeUccI6yi66hgYcNBSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103863'),
  ('241333181712931471', 'The Halfway House', 2004, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Kenneth J. Hall, Ed Polgardy, Josephina Sykes', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Mary Woronov, Janet Tracy Keijser, Shawn Savage, Stephanie Leighs, Athena Demos, Monica Shere, Joseph Tatner, Michael Gaglio', 'R', 'Young girls are disappearing in and around the Mary Magdalen Halfway House for Troubled Girls.', 'Young girls are disappearing in and around the Mary Magdalen Halfway House for Troubled Girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggIuGDehnzt5p8szBlMZDjQOSBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55681'),
  ('315205199248088294', 'The Hallelujah Trail', 1965, 'Western, Comedy', 'John Sturges, Jack N. Reddish, Robert Surtees', 'John Gay', 'Burt Lancaster, Lee Remick, Jim Hutton, Donald Pleasence, Brian Keith, Martin Landau, Pamela Tiffin, John Anderson', 'NR', 'A wagon train heads for Denver with a cargo of whisky for the miners. Chaos ensues as the Temperance League, the US cavalry, the miners and the local Indians all try to take control of the valuable cargo.', 'A wagon train heads for Denver with a cargo of whisky for the miners. Chaos ensues as the Temperance League, the US cavalry, the miners and the local Indians all try to take control of the valuable cargo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umgRSG9XnV3tIitq37gdTR4gxnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23194'),
  ('661154627792061606', 'The Hallow', 2015, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Corin Hardy, Martijn van Broekhuizen, Ivan McMahon', 'Corin Hardy, Felipe Marino', 'Joseph Mawle, Bojana Novaković, Michael McElhatton, Michael Smiley, Gary Lydon, Stuart Graham, Conor Craig Stephens, Joss Wyre', 'NR', 'Deep within the darkness of secluded forest land in rural Ireland dwells an ancient evil. Feared by the nearby superstitious villagers as cursed creatures who prey upon the lost, their secrets have been kept from civilization and remain on their hallowed ground. But when a conservationist from London moves in with his wife and infant child in order to survey the land for future construction, his actions unwittingly disturb the horde of demonic forces. Alone in a remote wilderness, he must now ensure his family''s survival from their relentless attacks.', 'Deep within the darkness of secluded forest land in rural Ireland dwells an ancient evil. Feared by the nearby superstitious villagers as cursed creatures who prey upon the lost, their secrets have been kept from civilization and remain on their hallowed ground. But when a conservationist from London moves in with his wife and infant child in order to survey the land for future construction, his actions unwittingly disturb the horde of demonic forces. Alone in a remote wilderness, he must now ensure his family''s survival from their relentless attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ6d1rDgz4kMkv1EXzfq0UzlPdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312831'),
  ('626795418171751256', 'The Halloween That Almost Wasn''t', 1979, 'Horror, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Bruce Bilson, Peter Sova, Frederic B. Blankfein', 'Coleman Jacoby', 'Judd Hirsch, Mariette Hartley, Henry Gibson, Jack Riley, Josip Elic, John Schuck, Robert Fitch, Andrew Duncan', 'PG', 'Upset by rumors that Halloween may end, Dracula calls his mild-mannered monsters together and delivers an ultimatum - either regain their frightening image, or leave his Transylvania castle forever.', 'Upset by rumors that Halloween may end, Dracula calls his mild-mannered monsters together and delivers an ultimatum - either regain their frightening image, or leave his Transylvania castle forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6rxrYxxB3yx0Yhh86jghZ2rh6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192367'),
  ('264057268276760673', 'The Halloween Tree', 1993, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Mario Piluso', null, 'Ray Bradbury, Leonard Nimoy, Annie Barker, Alex Greenwald, Edan Gross, Andrew Keegan, Kevin Smets, Darleen Carr', 'G', 'Four children learn the origins of Halloween customs while trying to save the life of their friend.', 'Four children learn the origins of Halloween customs while trying to save the life of their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phcM1B7neu6g7ysw9CmIo35Qida.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45974'),
  ('480657936493967706', 'The Hallucinated Alchemist', 1897, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'The Flicker Alley DVD "Georges Méliès: Encore New Discoveries (1896-1911)" misidentified a partial hand-colored print of the 1906 film "Alchimiste Parafaragaramus ou La cornue infernale" (The Mysterious Retort) as this film, "L''hallucination de l''alchimiste" (An Hallucinated Alchemist) from 1897, which continues to be considered a lost film.', 'The Flicker Alley DVD "Georges Méliès: Encore New Discoveries (1896-1911)" misidentified a partial hand-colored print of the 1906 film "Alchimiste Parafaragaramus ou La cornue infernale" (The Mysterious Retort) as this film, "L''hallucination de l''alchimiste" (An Hallucinated Alchemist) from 1897, which continues to be considered a lost film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyE0kzPlqmwllyxOm4bl02ZgPp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342727'),
  ('554673361183289353', 'The Hallucinations of Baron Munchausen', 1911, 'Horror', 'Georges Méliès', 'Théophile Gautier', null, null, 'After an evening of excessive wining and dining Baron Munchausen must be helped to bed by his servants. Once asleep, he has bizarre and frightening dreams.', 'After an evening of excessive wining and dining Baron Munchausen must be helped to bed by his servants. Once asleep, he has bizarre and frightening dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veBJvqrmmVLQShhesHpEGfhnROr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137412'),
  ('505216298622647391', 'The Halt', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Sergei Loznitsa', null, null, null, 'Trains travel through the night without stopping. The clatter of the carriages quickly disappears, along with the wail of the locomotive. The people at the station are all asleep. But why are they so exhausted ? And what are they waiting for? Set inside an isolated train depot, The Train Station is one of Sergei Loznitsa''s most haunting films. It is also one of his most pointed social critiques. In this film, we are brought to a remote train station deep in the Russian woods. It''s nighttime. In the distance, we hear the clatter of locomotives. The station, a small wooden building, sits silently, surrounded only by snow and train tracks.', 'Trains travel through the night without stopping. The clatter of the carriages quickly disappears, along with the wail of the locomotive. The people at the station are all asleep. But why are they so exhausted ? And what are they waiting for? Set inside an isolated train depot, The Train Station is one of Sergei Loznitsa''s most haunting films. It is also one of his most pointed social critiques. In this film, we are brought to a remote train station deep in the Russian woods. It''s nighttime. In the distance, we hear the clatter of locomotives. The station, a small wooden building, sits silently, surrounded only by snow and train tracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e19TiJTjoIab1y4fuQmHJ7gF5kW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220949'),
  ('864759473828088770', 'The Hamburg Syndrome', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Fleischmann, Colin Mounier, Beate Bach', 'Otto Jägersberg, Roland Topor, Peter Fleischmann', 'Helmut Griem, Tilo Prückner, Ulrich Wildgruber, Evelyn Künneke, Rosel Zech, Fernando Arrabal, Carline Seiser, Rainer Langhans', null, 'When a plague breaks out in Hamburg, several people break out of quarantine and make their way out of the city... only to find that the plague is more widespread.', 'When a plague breaks out in Hamburg, several people break out of quarantine and make their way out of the city... only to find that the plague is more widespread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w65zZeEj0wEs9TfNDxk311uiCSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64454'),
  ('674480878892384738', 'The Hamiltons', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Mitchell Altieri, Phil Flores, Michael Maley', 'Phil Flores, Mitchell Altieri, Adam Weis', 'Cory Knauf, Samuel Child, Joseph McKelheer, Mackenzie Firgens, Rebekah Hoyle, Brittany Daniel, Al Liner, Jena Hunt', 'R', 'The Hamiltons seem to be the picture-perfect American family. They are hardworking community members; giving to their local charities, attending town hall meetings and always respectful of their neighbors...except for the fact that they usually end up killing them.', 'The Hamiltons seem to be the picture-perfect American family. They are hardworking community members; giving to their local charities, attending town hall meetings and always respectful of their neighbors...except for the fact that they usually end up killing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/womFanfTvwZ9nr594vZc1R0fWqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15495'),
  ('2499484574662222', 'The Hammer', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Charles Herman-Wurmfeld, Rod Smith, Marco Fargnoli', 'Kevin Hench', 'Adam Carolla, Oswaldo Castillo, Harold ''House'' Moore, Christopher Darga, Jonathan Hernandez, Heather Juergensen, Jane Lynch', 'R', 'Approaching forty, Ferro is unsatisfied with his life as a construction worker and part-time boxing instructor in Los Angeles, CA. After a successful bout with a young pro boxer, Ferro decides to don the gloves one last time. The movie recounts his unlikely quest for Olympic gold.', 'Approaching forty, Ferro is unsatisfied with his life as a construction worker and part-time boxing instructor in Los Angeles, CA. After a successful bout with a young pro boxer, Ferro decides to don the gloves one last time. The movie recounts his unlikely quest for Olympic gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Q7z71vQD7Rl8ehdlFu5qfmvenv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14014'),
  ('785640187944769735', 'The Hamster Factor and Other Tales of ''Twelve Monkeys''', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Keith Fulton, Louis Pepe, Keith Fulton', 'Keith Fulton, Louis Pepe', 'Keith Fulton, Terry Gilliam, Brad Pitt, Christopher Plummer, Madeleine Stowe, Bruce Willis, Charles Roven, Lloyd Phillips', null, 'A documentary following Terry Gilliam through the creation of "Twelve Monkeys."', 'A documentary following Terry Gilliam through the creation of "Twelve Monkeys."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoeX7DIHRU90KuSNNsDWoYqhrJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30565'),
  ('785977646657725649', 'The Hand', 1960, 'Horror, Crime', 'Henry Cass, Walter J. Harvey', 'Ray Cooney, Tony Hilton', 'Derek Bond, Reed De Rouen, Bryan Coleman, Walter Randall, Tony Hilton, Harold Scott, Ray Cooney, Gwenda Ewen', 'NR', 'During World War II, a group of British soldiers are captured by the Japanese, tortured and their hands are cut off. Years later, a mad killer terrorizes London by cutting off the hands of his victims.', 'During World War II, a group of British soldiers are captured by the Japanese, tortured and their hands are cut off. Years later, a mad killer terrorizes London by cutting off the hands of his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85IN2Rgx06YkCXHxrjB6hSgZpbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34089'),
  ('1057416275740678140', 'The Hand', 1965, 'Animation, Horror', 'Jiří Trnka, Jiří Šafář', 'Jiří Trnka', 'Ladislav Fialka', null, 'A happy little potter is approached by a huge hand which wants him to sculpt its statue. The potter refuses, wanting nothing more than to be left alone with his only friend, a potted plant. As the hand''s request gives way to bribery, demands, and threats, the potter becomes more desperate to escape its clutch, leading to tragedy.', 'A happy little potter is approached by a huge hand which wants him to sculpt its statue. The potter refuses, wanting nothing more than to be left alone with his only friend, a potted plant. As the hand''s request gives way to bribery, demands, and threats, the potter becomes more desperate to escape its clutch, leading to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83YdjKErufydzHqvJgyY5D7EUme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100592'),
  ('158384119367240052', 'The Hand', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Oliver Stone, King Baggot', 'Oliver Stone', 'Michael Caine, Andrea Marcovicci, Annie McEnroe, Bruce McGill, Viveca Lindfors, Rosemary Murphy, Mara Hobel, Pat Corley', 'R', 'Jon Lansdale is a comic book artist who loses his right hand in a car accident. The hand was not found at the scene of the accident, but it soon returns by itself to follow Jon around, and murder those who anger him.', 'Jon Lansdale is a comic book artist who loses his right hand in a car accident. The hand was not found at the scene of the accident, but it soon returns by itself to follow Jon around, and murder those who anger him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUSAV9rObBlJfYIK9y4o88hmmdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42149'),
  ('117864994803828945', 'The Hand', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Doyle, Wong Kar-Wai', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Chang Chen, Gong Li, Tien Feng, Chan Chun-Luk, Chow Kin-Kwan', null, 'Hong Kong, 1960s. Zhang, a shy tailor''s assistant, is riveted by his imperious client Miss Hua. Upon meeting her, she seduces him to make sure he will truly remember her when designing her garments. After this intimate first encounter, a rapport develops between the two. Entry is for the theatrically released extended version, not the segment from the Eros anthology.', 'Hong Kong, 1960s. Zhang, a shy tailor''s assistant, is riveted by his imperious client Miss Hua. Upon meeting her, she seduces him to make sure he will truly remember her when designing her garments. After this intimate first encounter, a rapport develops between the two. Entry is for the theatrically released extended version, not the segment from the Eros anthology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yoe71wLvLaPzBD4iAIQtdljh0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846716'),
  ('994624780921208934', 'The Hand Is Pinker Than the Eye', 1967, 'Animation', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Jim Ryan', null, null, 'A cold Pink Panther sneaks into a house owned by a magician and gets irritated by a rabbit who keeps bothering him.', 'A cold Pink Panther sneaks into a house owned by a magician and gets irritated by a rabbit who keeps bothering him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kON1yuRWrx9f8Kllg7wUb9ztjOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379142'),
  ('1014299490494569476', 'The Hand of God', 2021, 'Drama', 'Daria D''Antonio, Paolo Sorrentino', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Filippo Scotti, Toni Servillo, Teresa Saponangelo, Luisa Ranieri, Marlon Joubert, Massimiliano Gallo, Betti Pedrazzi, Renato Carpentieri', 'R', 'In 1980s Naples, Italy, an awkward Italian teen struggling to find his place experiences heartbreak and liberation after he''s inadvertently saved from a freak accident by football legend Diego Maradona.', 'In 1980s Naples, Italy, an awkward Italian teen struggling to find his place experiences heartbreak and liberation after he''s inadvertently saved from a freak accident by football legend Diego Maradona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722778'),
  ('1014559683340955389', 'The Hand of God: Through the Eyes of Sorrentino', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Paolo Sorrentino', null, 'Director Paolo Sorrentino returns to Naples, his hometown, and reflects on his youth in an exclusive tour of the locations of “The Hand of God”.', 'Director Paolo Sorrentino returns to Naples, his hometown, and reflects on his youth in an exclusive tour of the locations of “The Hand of God”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQgNJGGp8uqO8V3yKsIwTTvWpph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916499'),
  ('41508987147053562', 'The Hand of Nefertiti', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Guillermo García Carsí', 'Guillermo García Carsí', null, null, 'Jeff, Tad''s dog, and Belzoni, Sara''s parrot, must guard the ancient hand of Queen Nefertiti at the Metropolitan Archaeological Museum.', 'Jeff, Tad''s dog, and Belzoni, Sara''s parrot, must guard the ancient hand of Queen Nefertiti at the Metropolitan Archaeological Museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtJgguIJse7fKFAnHCUIcI9t9fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205439'),
  ('1027639631966787061', 'The Hand That Feeds the Dead', 1974, 'Horror', 'Sergio Garrone, Emore Galeassi', 'Sergio Garrone', 'Klaus Kinski, Katia Christine, Marzia Damon, Carmen Silva, Stella Calderoni, Romano De Gironcoli, Alessandro Perrella, Ayhan Işık', null, 'Baron Ivan Rassimov, a brilliant doctor, died horribly during a fire burst in his laboratory. Since that day, his daughter Tanja retired to a life of reclusion, covering with a dark veil her disfigured face. Professor Nijinski was once a student of Rassimov; he married Tanja, and he''s trying to restore her lost beauty with a series of skin transplants. However, to reach his goal, professor Nijinski needs beautiful young victims for his transplant experiments.', 'Baron Ivan Rassimov, a brilliant doctor, died horribly during a fire burst in his laboratory. Since that day, his daughter Tanja retired to a life of reclusion, covering with a dark veil her disfigured face. Professor Nijinski was once a student of Rassimov; he married Tanja, and he''s trying to restore her lost beauty with a series of skin transplants. However, to reach his goal, professor Nijinski needs beautiful young victims for his transplant experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wijtfpys0hHRi9ZGSYh7T3aJxCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100467'),
  ('483419357840079926', 'The Hand That Rocks the Cradle', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Elswit, Curtis Hanson, Brenda Kalosh', 'Amanda Silver', 'Annabella Sciorra, Rebecca De Mornay, Matt McCoy, Ernie Hudson, Madeline Zima, Julianne Moore, John de Lancie, Kevin Skousen', 'R', 'A suburban family chooses seemingly sweet Peyton Flanders as their newborn''s nanny. Only much later does the infant''s mother, Claire Bartel, realize Peyton''s true intentions -- to destroy Claire and replace her in the family. The nail-biting suspense builds quickly in this chilling psychological thriller about deception and bitter revenge.', 'A suburban family chooses seemingly sweet Peyton Flanders as their newborn''s nanny. Only much later does the infant''s mother, Claire Bartel, realize Peyton''s true intentions -- to destroy Claire and replace her in the family. The nail-biting suspense builds quickly in this chilling psychological thriller about deception and bitter revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fBnyO3SbNBplck45js6O4pQaLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11087'),
  ('855962510097258726', 'The Hand That Rocks the Cradle', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michelle Garza Cervera, Jo Willems, James Moran', 'Amanda Silver', 'Maika Monroe, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Raúl Castillo, Mileiah Vega, Nora Contreras, Lola Contreras, Martin Starr, Yvette Lu', 'R', 'Suburban couple Caitlin and Miguel hire the seemingly sweet Polly to take care of their newborn baby. But Polly''s true motives have little to do with singing lullabies.', 'Suburban couple Caitlin and Miguel hire the seemingly sweet Polly to take care of their newborn baby. But Polly''s true motives have little to do with singing lullabies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnLwCl7HPprx3OQCPXHIRZXOfPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362315'),
  ('270242824795566780', 'The Handmaid''s Tale', 1990, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Igor Luther', 'Harold Pinter', 'Natasha Richardson, Faye Dunaway, Aidan Quinn, Elizabeth McGovern, Victoria Tennant, Robert Duvall, Blanche Baker, Traci Lind', 'R', 'In a dystopian, polluted right-wing religious tyranny, a young woman is put in sexual slavery on account of her now rare fertility.', 'In a dystopian, polluted right-wing religious tyranny, a young woman is put in sexual slavery on account of her now rare fertility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnkKQyRzoCMZliMaknTOXHqXKaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20815'),
  ('913791841105891515', 'The Handmaiden', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Bae Seon-ok, Shinsuke Fujimoto, Park Chan-wook', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Seo-kyung', 'Kim Min-hee, Kim Tae-ri, Ha Jung-woo, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Hae-sook, Moon So-ri, Lee Yong-nyeo, Kwak Eun-jin', 'R', '1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sookee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.', '1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sookee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290098'),
  ('379389628221626850', 'The Hands of Orlac', 1924, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Robert Wiene, Hans Androschin, Günther Krampf', 'Louis Nerz', 'Conrad Veidt, Alexandra Sorina, Fritz Strassny, Paul Askonas, Carmen Cartellieri, Hans Homma, Fritz Kortner', 'NR', 'A world-famous pianist loses both hands in an accident. When new hands are grafted on, he is horrified to learn they once belonged to a murderer.', 'A world-famous pianist loses both hands in an accident. When new hands are grafted on, he is horrified to learn they once belonged to a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40WWy1SSx8rh1r4mn1MNpCKIteF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2974'),
  ('1122625831136241029', 'The Handsome', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Orhan Aksoy, Mehmet Tekirdag', 'Orhan Aksoy, İlhan Engin', 'Kemal Sunal, Ayşegül Uygurer, Ülkü Ülker, Tuncer Sevi, Güzin Özipek, Muharrem Gürses, Mefharet Atalay, Suat Keskin', null, 'Selim is a paperboy who delivers the morning papers with his truck. He buys a walkie talkie to find find a friend. His codename is "The Handsome". After a while he meets the girl and they start a relationship. It is hard for them to get married.', 'Selim is a paperboy who delivers the morning papers with his truck. He buys a walkie talkie to find find a friend. His codename is "The Handsome". After a while he meets the girl and they start a relationship. It is hard for them to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/we0YmR4gaxIPSDaRlQSXpbnKoE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192596'),
  ('1056572777140706063', 'The Handsome Suit', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa', null, 'Muga Tsukaji, Shosuke Tanihara, Keiko Kitagawa, Mayumi Sada, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Nozomi Sasaki, Manami Honjo, Yusuke Yamamoto', null, 'An overweight cook is given the opportunity to woo the girl of his dreams when he is given a "handsome suit" that transforms him into an idealized human being in this absurd Japanese comedy.', 'An overweight cook is given the opportunity to woo the girl of his dreams when he is given a "handsome suit" that transforms him into an idealized human being in this absurd Japanese comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vspyiVbKPJHtEu1Yuhc5ha9XeBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88043'),
  ('285226030492249843', 'The Handsome, The Ugly, And The Stupid', 1967, 'Comedy, Western', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Aldo Giordani, Aldo Grimaldi', 'Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Mimmo Palmara, Brigitt Petry, Lothar Gunther, Pietro Ceccarelli, Enzo Andronico, Giovanni Ivan Scratuglia', null, 'Two POWs learn of a treasure of gold hidden in a cemetery, and escape from their POW camp to look for it.', 'Two POWs learn of a treasure of gold hidden in a cemetery, and escape from their POW camp to look for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUtFfD7rzW8bdVXiPMFxQHZoG3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131816'),
  ('353306797999517215', 'The Handyman', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ferran Paredes, Andrea Vellucci, Valerio Attanasio', 'Valerio Attanasio', 'Sergio Castellitto, Guglielmo Poggi, Clara Alonso, Elena Sofia Ricci, Domenico Centamore, Alberto Di Stasio, Tonino Taiuti, Marcela Serli', null, 'We are all equal before the law, but some are just more equal than others. Antonio is a trainee lawyer who dreams of joining his mentor’s prestigious firm. But Salvatore “Toti” Bellastella, the Prince of the Forum, is also an exploitative tyrant! He asks Antonio any kind of task: from being his assistant to driver, from paralegal to personal cook! When Antonio brilliantly passes the bar, he gets the offer of becoming a partner in the firm, but there is still one condition: he must marry Isabel, Toti’s lover, an Argentinian girl who needs the Italian citizenship. It looks like just another little “favor” for his boss. So Antonio accepts… and he’s really in a sea of trouble.', 'We are all equal before the law, but some are just more equal than others. Antonio is a trainee lawyer who dreams of joining his mentor’s prestigious firm. But Salvatore “Toti” Bellastella, the Prince of the Forum, is also an exploitative tyrant! He asks Antonio any kind of task: from being his assistant to driver, from paralegal to personal cook! When Antonio brilliantly passes the bar, he gets the offer of becoming a partner in the firm, but there is still one condition: he must marry Isabel, Toti’s lover, an Argentinian girl who needs the Italian citizenship. It looks like just another little “favor” for his boss. So Antonio accepts… and he’s really in a sea of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH4SC6hjOVctDgQJcTr6lmJA31D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516788'),
  ('1016345189290988027', 'The Hanged Man', 1974, 'Action, Western, TV Movie, Drama', 'Michael Caffey, Keith C. Smith', 'Ken Trevey', 'Steve Forrest, Dean Jagger, Will Geer, Sharon Acker, Brendon Boone, Rafael Campos, BarBara Luna, Cameron Mitchell', null, 'A gunfighter who survives his own hanging helps a young widow who is trying to keep a ruthless land baron from taking her ranch.', 'A gunfighter who survives his own hanging helps a young widow who is trying to keep a ruthless land baron from taking her ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqOCBSKTGLIedyZ5FOylqfCNSYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87611'),
  ('366611305394894269', 'The Hanged Man', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Juan Amorós', 'Salvador García Ruiz, Manuel Gómez Pereira', 'Clara Lago, Álvaro Cervantes, Adriana Ugarte, Cristina Brondo, Abel Folk, Víctor Valdivia, Boris Ruiz, Àngels Bassas', null, 'Two lovers break the law and struggle to stay together when carnal obsession causes tempers to flare.', 'Two lovers break the law and struggle to stay together when carnal obsession causes tempers to flare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Pr4KmnqwsG9LPc9iaeC9ubvWZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56742'),
  ('678613005519234262', 'The Hanging Garden', 1997, 'Drama', 'Thom Fitzgerald, Daniel Jobin', 'Thom Fitzgerald', 'Peter MacNeill, Chris Leavins, Kerry Fox, Joel S. Keller, Seana McKenna, Joan Orenstein, Sarah Polley, Troy Veinotte', null, 'William, a once obese and troubled teen, goes back to his family''s home after being gone, without word, for ten years and finds it (and his family) haunted with his past. He had moved to the city and become a fit, well-adjusted gay man, but during his visit home, he becomes unhinged as the newly remembered reasons for his miserable adolescence come to life in each of their presents.', 'William, a once obese and troubled teen, goes back to his family''s home after being gone, without word, for ten years and finds it (and his family) haunted with his past. He had moved to the city and become a fit, well-adjusted gay man, but during his visit home, he becomes unhinged as the newly remembered reasons for his miserable adolescence come to life in each of their presents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXhjuFB4U8xkEd6SY84S42w3Q8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35161'),
  ('489710066427509697', 'The Hanging Sun', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Francesco Carrozzini, Nicolai Brüel', 'Stefano Bises', 'Alessandro Borghi, Jessica Brown Findlay, Sam Spruell, Frederick Schmidt, Raphael Vicas, Charles Dance, Peter Mullan, Salome R. Gunnarsdottir', null, 'On the run from his former employer, a reluctant hitman seeks refuge in an isolated village where he is faced with events that test the true nature of his conscience.', 'On the run from his former employer, a reluctant hitman seeks refuge in an isolated village where he is faced with events that test the true nature of his conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLLCH7wKr2TN3wgFoMHSGx46HWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866267'),
  ('375389896556164993', 'The Hanging Tree', 1959, 'Western', 'Delmer Daves, Ted D. McCord, Russell Llewellyn', 'Halsted Welles, Wendell Mayes', 'Gary Cooper, Maria Schell, Karl Malden, George C. Scott, Karl Swenson, Virginia Gregg, John Dierkes, King Donovan', 'NR', 'Joseph "Doc" Frail is a doctor with a past he''s trying to outrun. While in Montana, he comes across a mining camp with a hanging tree and rescues a man named Rune from the noose. With Rune as his servant, Frail decides to settle down, and he takes over as town doctor. He meets Elizabeth, who is suffering from shock, and the two soon fall in love. But when Elizabeth is attacked, Frail''s attempt to help her lands them both in trouble.', 'Joseph "Doc" Frail is a doctor with a past he''s trying to outrun. While in Montana, he comes across a mining camp with a hanging tree and rescues a man named Rune from the noose. With Rune as his servant, Frail decides to settle down, and he takes over as town doctor. He meets Elizabeth, who is suffering from shock, and the two soon fall in love. But when Elizabeth is attacked, Frail''s attempt to help her lands them both in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhewmwPYrtbq6YWCFuuAkg8oxaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43008'),
  ('735194394586176769', 'The Hanging Woman', 1973, 'Horror', 'José Luis Merino, Modesto Rizzolo', 'José Luis Merino, Enrico Colombo', 'Stelvio Rosi, Maria Pia Conte, Dyanik Zurakowska, Pasquale Basile, Paul Naschy, Gérard Tichy, Aurora de Alba, Eleonora Vargas', 'R', 'Upon his uncle''s death, Serge Chekov journeys to a spooky Scottish village for the reading of the will. But when he inherits the estate, Serge runs afoul of his uncle''s jealous wife , his business partner , his maid and others. It''s not long before zombies join the fun in this Italian supernatural thriller, also starring Paul Naschy as a nutso gravedigger.', 'Upon his uncle''s death, Serge Chekov journeys to a spooky Scottish village for the reading of the will. But when he inherits the estate, Serge runs afoul of his uncle''s jealous wife , his business partner , his maid and others. It''s not long before zombies join the fun in this Italian supernatural thriller, also starring Paul Naschy as a nutso gravedigger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q89uIp4OL3ullAplUZE3JY4hIBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30568'),
  ('366041800007242994', 'The Hangman', 1959, 'Western', 'Michael Curtiz, Loyal Griggs', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Robert Taylor, Tina Louise, Fess Parker, Jack Lord, Gene Evans, Mickey Shaughnessy, Shirley Harmer, James Westerfield', 'NR', 'A marshal nicknamed "The Hangman" because of his track record in hunting down and capturing wanted criminals traces a robbery suspect to a small town. However, the man is known and liked in the town, and the citizens band together to try to help him avoid capture.', 'A marshal nicknamed "The Hangman" because of his track record in hunting down and capturing wanted criminals traces a robbery suspect to a small town. However, the man is known and liked in the town, and the citizens band together to try to help him avoid capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76nIzgoW0xJVaXIrTr948XYdO2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48409'),
  ('234940542214554104', 'The Hangman', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Bruce Wemple, LeJon Woods', 'LeJon Woods, Daniel Martin Berkey, Lindsey Dresbach, Jefferson Cox, Kaitlyn Lunardi', null, 'Troubled father Leon takes son camping in Appalachia. Local cult summons evil Hangman demon. Son goes missing. Leon must confront cult, monster to find him amid rising body count.', 'Troubled father Leon takes son camping in Appalachia. Local cult summons evil Hangman demon. Son goes missing. Leon must confront cult, monster to find him amid rising body count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rij9Eh4RVXyPet8A1BNU8pDvtmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257586'),
  ('675252059940111518', 'The Hangnail', 1999, 'Animation', 'Shane Acker', null, null, null, 'A boy, waiting for a bus. A dog, begging for potato chips. The boy sends the dog away, violently. He sees a hangnail on his finger and shows us, graphically, why you should never pick at them.', 'A boy, waiting for a bus. A dog, begging for potato chips. The boy sends the dog away, violently. He sees a hangnail on his finger and shows us, graphically, why you should never pick at them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZvLvcoCcVEtjJPuC2gvAPLSSer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270049'),
  ('450249115148429574', 'The Hangover', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Lawrence Sher, Todd Phillips, Paul Schneider', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Bradley Cooper, Ed Helms, Zach Galifianakis, Justin Bartha, Heather Graham, Sasha Barrese, Jeffrey Tambor, Ken Jeong', 'R', 'When three friends finally come to after a raucous night of bachelor-party revelry, they find a baby in the closet and a tiger in the bathroom. But they can''t seem to locate their best friend, Doug – who''s supposed to be tying the knot. Launching a frantic search for Doug, the trio perseveres through a nasty hangover to try to make it to the church on time.', 'When three friends finally come to after a raucous night of bachelor-party revelry, they find a baby in the closet and a tiger in the bathroom. But they can''t seem to locate their best friend, Doug – who''s supposed to be tying the knot. Launching a frantic search for Doug, the trio perseveres through a nasty hangover to try to make it to the church on time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0uS9rHR56FeBtpjVki16M5xxSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18785'),
  ('342960666229185053', 'The Hangover Part II', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Todd Phillips, Jeffrey Wetzel, Paul Schneider', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Bradley Cooper, Ed Helms, Zach Galifianakis, Justin Bartha, Mason Lee, Ken Jeong, Paul Giamatti, Jeffrey Tambor', 'R', 'The Hangover crew heads to Thailand for Stu''s wedding. After the disaster of a bachelor party in Las Vegas last year, Stu is playing it safe with a mellow pre-wedding brunch. However, nothing goes as planned and Bangkok is the perfect setting for another adventure with the rowdy group.', 'The Hangover crew heads to Thailand for Stu''s wedding. After the disaster of a bachelor party in Las Vegas last year, Stu is playing it safe with a mellow pre-wedding brunch. However, nothing goes as planned and Bangkok is the perfect setting for another adventure with the rowdy group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKZu0Fdkj7dmwbfMpgDqVVCkLJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45243'),
  ('434476129983361415', 'The Hangover Part III', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Todd Phillips, Lawrence Sher, Hans Bjerno', 'Todd Phillips, Craig Mazin, Scott Moore', 'Bradley Cooper, Ed Helms, Zach Galifianakis, Justin Bartha, Ken Jeong, John Goodman, Melissa McCarthy, Jeffrey Tambor', 'R', 'This time, there''s no wedding. No bachelor party. What could go wrong, right? But when the Wolfpack hits the road, all bets are off.', 'This time, there''s no wedding. No bachelor party. What could go wrong, right? But when the Wolfpack hits the road, all bets are off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtxuPWkdllLNLVyGjKYa267ntuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109439'),
  ('154256485140824131', 'The Hannas', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julia C. Kaiser, Dominik Berg', 'Julia C. Kaiser', 'Anna König, Till Butterbach, Ines Marie Westernströer, Julia Becker, Anne Ratte-Polle, Cynthia Micas, Anne von Keller, Christian Natter', null, 'Hans and Anna – together they make the Hannas: A hefty couple who love to cook. They meet sisters Kim and Nicola, both anorexic and excitingly different. Opposites attract, however, and anything goes, so the Hannas each wind up having an affair without the other’s knowledge. But Kim and Nicola have a secret of their own in store.', 'Hans and Anna – together they make the Hannas: A hefty couple who love to cook. They meet sisters Kim and Nicola, both anorexic and excitingly different. Opposites attract, however, and anything goes, so the Hannas each wind up having an affair without the other’s knowledge. But Kim and Nicola have a secret of their own in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jL6wvxapNZeYU8s40hBo06MGUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402890'),
  ('567036310208406389', 'The Hanoi Hilton', 1987, 'War, Drama', 'Lionel Chetwynd, Mark Irwin', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Michael Moriarty, John Edwin Shaw, Ken Wright, Paul Le Mat, Lawrence Pressman, Stephen Davies, David Soul, Doug Savant', 'R', 'Lionel Chetwynd''s film documents the horrific struggles that faced American POWs held in the North Vietnamese prison Hoa Lo -- more infamously known as the Hanoi Hilton -- between 1964 and 1975. Williamson (Michael Moriarty) leads a group of American servicemen who are prisoners at the detention camp. He assumes command after Cathcart (Lawrence Pressman) is dragged off to be tortured.', 'Lionel Chetwynd''s film documents the horrific struggles that faced American POWs held in the North Vietnamese prison Hoa Lo -- more infamously known as the Hanoi Hilton -- between 1964 and 1975. Williamson (Michael Moriarty) leads a group of American servicemen who are prisoners at the detention camp. He assumes command after Cathcart (Lawrence Pressman) is dragged off to be tortured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48Jl0Do3c4VBvg24S7uJ7jvJAlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73091'),
  ('621106061261259898', 'The Happening', 2008, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Tak Fujimoto, M. Night Shyamalan, Robert Guerra', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Mark Wahlberg, Zooey Deschanel, John Leguizamo, Ashlyn Sanchez, Betty Buckley, Spencer Breslin, Robert Bailey Jr., Frank Collison', 'R', 'When a deadly airborne virus threatens to wipe out the northeastern United States, teacher Elliot Moore and his wife Alma flee from contaminated cities into the countryside in a fight to discover the truth. Is it terrorism, the accidental release of some toxic military bio weapon -- or something even more sinister?', 'When a deadly airborne virus threatens to wipe out the northeastern United States, teacher Elliot Moore and his wife Alma flee from contaminated cities into the countryside in a fight to discover the truth. Is it terrorism, the accidental release of some toxic military bio weapon -- or something even more sinister?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fP4nBrtmc0teSDDHzYmDE7TLQBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8645'),
  ('257058015411166875', 'The Happiest Day in the Life of Olli Mäki', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Juho Kuosmanen, J-P Passi, Veira Airaksinen', 'Mikko Myllylahti, Juho Kuosmanen', 'Jarkko Lahti, Oona Airola, Eero Milonoff, Joanna Haartti, Esko Barquero, Elma Milonoff, Leimu Leisti, Hilma Milonoff', 'NR', 'Summer 1962 and Olli Mäki has a shot at the world championship title in featherweight boxing. From the Finnish countryside to the bright lights of Helsinki, everything has been prepared for his fame and fortune. All Olli has to do is lose weight and concentrate. But there is a problem – he has fallen in love with Raija.', 'Summer 1962 and Olli Mäki has a shot at the world championship title in featherweight boxing. From the Finnish countryside to the bright lights of Helsinki, everything has been prepared for his fame and fortune. All Olli has to do is lose weight and concentrate. But there is a problem – he has fallen in love with Raija.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFqz2dP3MYDml6hXWU2vaRN6Lf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392807'),
  ('342912787108530520', 'The Happiest Days of Your Life', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Frank Launder, Stanley Pavey, Cecil F. Ford', 'Frank Launder, John Dighton', 'Alastair Sim, Margaret Rutherford, John Turnbull, Richard Wattis, John Bentley, Guy Middleton, Percy Walsh, Arthur Howard', null, 'Nutbourne College, an old established, all-boys, boarding school is told that another school is to be billeted with due to wartime restrictions. The shock is that it''s an all-girls school that has been sent. The two head teachers are soon battling for the upper hand with each other and the Ministry. But a crisis (or two) forces them to work together.', 'Nutbourne College, an old established, all-boys, boarding school is told that another school is to be billeted with due to wartime restrictions. The shock is that it''s an all-girls school that has been sent. The two head teachers are soon battling for the upper hand with each other and the Ministry. But a crisis (or two) forces them to work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdFz4p3ShCdWitN9Jv429VqdZVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83015'),
  ('612645087169090179', 'The Happiest Girl in the World', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Radu Jude, Cristina Iliescu, Marius Panduru', 'Radu Jude, Augustina Stanciu', 'Andreea Bosneag, Violeta Haret-Popa, Vasile Muraru, Șerban Pavlu, Andi Vasluianu, Diana Gheorghian, Alexandru Georgescu, Petre Constantin Bombardel', null, 'Delia, a young Romanian girl, comes to Bucharest with her parents to collect a prize she has won in a contest organized by a soft-drinks company. The prize is a beautiful new car. All Delia has to do now is appear in front of the camera in a commercial. All goes well until it becomes clear that Delia and her parents have very different ideas about what to do with the new car. Meanwhile, the contest''s sponsor needs a radiant prize-winner with a gleaming smile. A wicked satire and a psychological portrait of a society perverted by its slavery to capitalism and consumerism', 'Delia, a young Romanian girl, comes to Bucharest with her parents to collect a prize she has won in a contest organized by a soft-drinks company. The prize is a beautiful new car. All Delia has to do now is appear in front of the camera in a commercial. All goes well until it becomes clear that Delia and her parents have very different ideas about what to do with the new car. Meanwhile, the contest''s sponsor needs a radiant prize-winner with a gleaming smile. A wicked satire and a psychological portrait of a society perverted by its slavery to capitalism and consumerism', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkOFTDSEMZKydS4ZSimW7yAUcCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80115'),
  ('1144438935439180688', 'The Happiest Millionaire', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music', 'Norman Tokar, Edward Colman', 'AJ Carothers', 'Fred MacMurray, Greer Garson, Gladys Cooper, Geraldine Page, Tommy Steele, Hermione Baddeley, John Davidson, Lesley Ann Warren', 'G', 'A happy and unbelievably lucky young Irish immigrant, John Lawless, lands a job as the butler of an unconventional millionaire, Biddle. His daughter, Cordelia Drexel Biddle, tires of the unusual antics of her father--especially since the nice young men around town all fear him. Wouldn''t you fear a father-in-law that keeps alligators for pets and teaches boxing at his daily Bible classes?', 'A happy and unbelievably lucky young Irish immigrant, John Lawless, lands a job as the butler of an unconventional millionaire, Biddle. His daughter, Cordelia Drexel Biddle, tires of the unusual antics of her father--especially since the nice young men around town all fear him. Wouldn''t you fear a father-in-law that keeps alligators for pets and teaches boxing at his daily Bible classes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPePeB56IdkQOwMz8niiFhePOsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25445'),
  ('662121004216515483', 'The Happiness of the Katakuris', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Kim Jee-woon', 'Kenji Sawada, Keiko Matsuzaka, Shinji Takeda, Naomi Nishida, Kiyoshiro Imawano, Tetsuro Tamba, Naoto Takenaka, Tamaki Miyazaki', 'R', 'The Katakuri family has just opened their guest house in the mountains. Unfortunately their first guest commits suicide and in order to avoid trouble they decide to bury him in the backyard. Things get way more complicated when their second guest, a famous sumo wrestler, dies while having sex with his underage girlfriend and the grave behind the house starts to fill up more and more.', 'The Katakuri family has just opened their guest house in the mountains. Unfortunately their first guest commits suicide and in order to avoid trouble they decide to bury him in the backyard. Things get way more complicated when their second guest, a famous sumo wrestler, dies while having sex with his underage girlfriend and the grave behind the house starts to fill up more and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iIei17w5DVEz4P9OjxIM10f7Jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16184'),
  ('635620650204524525', 'The Happy Cricket', 2001, 'Action, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Walbercy Ribas', 'Walbercy Ribas', 'Rita Almeida, Rodrigo Andreatto, Jorge Barcellos, Úrsula Bezerra', 'G', 'Happy Cricket and his cute, adorable friends will have to defeat the evil Wartlord and rescue Linda, the Night Star. This film celebrates the values of friendship, freedom and the defense of nature.', 'Happy Cricket and his cute, adorable friends will have to defeat the evil Wartlord and rescue Linda, the Night Star. This film celebrates the values of friendship, freedom and the defense of nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRzwv6korHq3tNVpi7249kWZqxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182496'),
  ('364433410184944210', 'The Happy Ending', 1969, 'Drama', 'Tom Shaw, Richard Brooks, Conrad Hall', 'Richard Brooks', 'Jean Simmons, John Forsythe, Shirley Jones, Lloyd Bridges, Teresa Wright, Dick Shawn, Nanette Fabray, Bobby Darin', 'R', 'When Fred asked for Mary''s hand in marriage, she thought she had the happy ending she only read about in fairy tales. Now it''s 16 years later; Fred has had an affair, and Mary drowns her sorrows in pills and booze, a dangerous combination that nearly resulted in her death the year before. As Mary rushes off to the Bahamas for a relaxing escape from her crumbling marriage, she reflects on the past and wonders just where it all went wrong.', 'When Fred asked for Mary''s hand in marriage, she thought she had the happy ending she only read about in fairy tales. Now it''s 16 years later; Fred has had an affair, and Mary drowns her sorrows in pills and booze, a dangerous combination that nearly resulted in her death the year before. As Mary rushes off to the Bahamas for a relaxing escape from her crumbling marriage, she reflects on the past and wonders just where it all went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kATt9l7UimdbLQldEx7BxaM6GH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94608'),
  ('741047134491165247', 'The Happy Ghost', 1984, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Bob Thompson', 'Pang Kin-Yi, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Bonnie Law Ming-Chu, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Sandy Lam San-San, Teresa Carpio, Ng Siu-Gong, Amy Chin Siu-Wai, Leung Shut-Fan', null, 'From a camping trip, a college girl took home an ancient rope to use to keep her torn backpack in place, not knowing it was used by a disgraced scholar to hang himself with decades before. The scholar''s ghost resurrects at her school and befriended her and her two friends, and teaches them the importance of academic success, love, family and friendship.', 'From a camping trip, a college girl took home an ancient rope to use to keep her torn backpack in place, not knowing it was used by a disgraced scholar to hang himself with decades before. The scholar''s ghost resurrects at her school and befriended her and her two friends, and teaches them the importance of academic success, love, family and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1QvSUXc2gtWbCjYfBXgUmCdtQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154524'),
  ('487759395044244621', 'The Happy Hooker', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nicholas Sgarro', 'William Richert', 'Lynn Redgrave, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Lovelady Powell, Tom Poston, George Dzundza, Richard Lynch, John Getz, Vincent Schiavelli', 'R', 'Having emigrated to New York and immediately got the kiss-off from her mother-besotted fiance, a Dutch lass takes a well-paid office job and starts liberally sampling the local male talent. After a while she decides to make her pleasure her business too, and as her reputation grows she graduates to a high-class bordello. Soon she realises she has the right talents to make a real success of a place of her own.', 'Having emigrated to New York and immediately got the kiss-off from her mother-besotted fiance, a Dutch lass takes a well-paid office job and starts liberally sampling the local male talent. After a while she decides to make her pleasure her business too, and as her reputation grows she graduates to a high-class bordello. Soon she realises she has the right talents to make a real success of a place of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7STxtixaSexX98SdWU55EHGffJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75848'),
  ('494359142712651779', 'The Happy Hooker Goes Hollywood', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Alan Roberts, Stephen W. Gray', 'Alan Roberts', 'Martine Beswick, Chris Lemmon, Adam West, Richard Deacon, Phil Silvers, Charles Green, Lisa London, Alexandra Morgan', 'R', 'Xaviera Hollander has to navigate some sleazy studio politics to see the production of the film version of her memoirs.', 'Xaviera Hollander has to navigate some sleazy studio politics to see the production of the film version of her memoirs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wG82foVK0eX49AS5ObrLeSbYzme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93576'),
  ('719631089260278905', 'The Happy Hooker Goes to Washington', 1977, 'Comedy', 'William A. Levey, Robert Caramico', 'Robert Kaufman', 'Joey Heatherton, George Hamilton, Ray Walston, Jack Carter, Phil Foster, David White, Will Hutchins, Joe E. Ross', 'R', 'The world''s most famous madame is called to Washington to testify before Congress.', 'The world''s most famous madame is called to Washington to testify before Congress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31Xtvm7nFngSqp69XORA7jqS3xC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112058'),
  ('1076438036889181321', 'The Happy Microbes', 1909, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Émile Cohl', null, null, null, 'A scientist has acquired a microscope and is showing it off to his friend. He takes various body samples - hair, phlegm, etc. - and puts them under the microscope. The "microbes" coalesce and form different shapes, creating caricatures of various people, such as mothers-in-law and drunks. These animated characters goof around in traditional cartoon fashion.', 'A scientist has acquired a microscope and is showing it off to his friend. He takes various body samples - hair, phlegm, etc. - and puts them under the microscope. The "microbes" coalesce and form different shapes, creating caricatures of various people, such as mothers-in-law and drunks. These animated characters goof around in traditional cartoon fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFcixZPcC9wXGjau2Y8QMiitv1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194048'),
  ('626927421741560514', 'The Happy Prince', 2018, 'Drama', 'Rupert Everett, John Conroy, Toby Sherborne', 'Rupert Everett', 'Rupert Everett, Colin Firth, Emily Watson, Colin Morgan, Edwin Thomas, Franca Abategiovanni, Alister Cameron, Anna Chancellor', 'R', 'In 1895, Oscar Wilde (1854-1900) was the most famous writer in London, and Bosie Douglas, son of the notorious Marquess of Queensberry, was his lover. Accused and convicted of gross indecency, he was imprisoned for two years and subjected to hard labor. Once free, he abandons England to live in France, where he will spend his last years, haunted by memories of the past, poverty and immense sadness.', 'In 1895, Oscar Wilde (1854-1900) was the most famous writer in London, and Bosie Douglas, son of the notorious Marquess of Queensberry, was his lover. Accused and convicted of gross indecency, he was imprisoned for two years and subjected to hard labor. Once free, he abandons England to live in France, where he will spend his last years, haunted by memories of the past, poverty and immense sadness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q82LtnWNPCrD3txCnQVm4ol4g89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427214'),
  ('595492890690172092', 'The Happy Thieves', 1961, 'Comedy, Crime', 'George Marshall', 'John Gay', 'Rita Hayworth, Rex Harrison, Joseph Wiseman, Alida Valli, Grégoire Aslan, Virgílio Teixeira, Peter Illing, Britt Ekland', 'NR', 'A suave art thief romances a wealthy duchess, only to enable him to steal a priceless painting from her collection. Complications ensue.', 'A suave art thief romances a wealthy duchess, only to enable him to steal a priceless painting from her collection. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbo93zvtjkQbATGzPalbSbrr1Cd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100064'),
  ('560108771489198201', 'The Happy Time', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Fleischer, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Earl Felton', 'Charles Boyer, Louis Jourdan, Marsha Hunt, Bobby Driscoll, Linda Christian, Kurt Kasznar, Marcel Dalio, Jeanette Nolan', 'NR', 'A violinist and his brother guide one''s son through his crush on the family maid in 1920s Ottawa.', 'A violinist and his brother guide one''s son through his crush on the family maid in 1920s Ottawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2051X5uGk207R1D9oRoch43LHeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178587'),
  ('13435276435586295', 'The Happytime Murders', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Lisa Bloch-Tobey, Daniel Silverberg, Jeffrey M. Hayes', 'Todd Berger', 'Melissa McCarthy, Bill Barretta, Leslie David Baker, Elizabeth Banks, Joel McHale, Maya Rudolph, Dorien Davies, Drew Massey', 'R', 'In a world where humans coexist with puppets—who are seen as lesser citizens—cast members of a beloved 1990s children''s television series begin getting murdered one by one. Puppet Phil Philips, an ex-LAPD detective-turned-private eye, takes on the case at the request of his old boss in order to assist his former partner, Detective Connie Edwards.', 'In a world where humans coexist with puppets—who are seen as lesser citizens—cast members of a beloved 1990s children''s television series begin getting murdered one by one. Puppet Phil Philips, an ex-LAPD detective-turned-private eye, takes on the case at the request of his old boss in order to assist his former partner, Detective Connie Edwards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWxkur51srfVnMn2QOFjE7mbq6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412988'),
  ('357716122822703288', 'The Harbinger', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Will Klipstine', 'Amy Mills, Will Klipstine', 'Madeleine McGraw, Irene Bedard, Teal Redmann, Steve Monroe, Kate Luyben, Will Klipstine, Vincent Duvall, Jamie Bozian', 'PG-13', 'A family moves their troubled daughter to a small town, where people suspect she is responsible for a series of mysterious deaths. Fearing something evil followed them, the tormented parents must do whatever it takes to save their daughter.', 'A family moves their troubled daughter to a small town, where people suspect she is responsible for a series of mysterious deaths. Fearing something evil followed them, the tormented parents must do whatever it takes to save their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7qlOysRTnpNKi3aWdTrzF2BrbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529193'),
  ('906197200662329549', 'The Harbinger', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Andy Mitton', 'Andy Mitton', 'Gabby Beans, Emily Davis, Stephanie Roth Haberle, Raymond Anthony Thomas, Laura Heisler, Jay Dunn, Cody Braverman, Anita Moreno', null, 'Monique leaves her family quarantine to help a friend who’s suffering from terrible nightmares - but she learns too late that the bad dreams are contagious, along with the demon behind them.', 'Monique leaves her family quarantine to help a friend who’s suffering from terrible nightmares - but she learns too late that the bad dreams are contagious, along with the demon behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxVgKLpA5ld2u226Bg11N5tK3KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974191'),
  ('687208617936611026', 'The Hard Corps', 2005, 'Action, Thriller', 'Douglas Milsome, Sheldon Lettich, Scott J. Ateah', 'Sheldon Lettich, George Saunders', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Razaaq Adoti, Vivica A. Fox, Peter Bryant, Ron Bottitta, Viv Leacock, Adrian Holmes, Mark Griffin', 'R', 'An Army veteran assembles a team of bodyguards to protect a former boxer. Complications arise when the boxer suspects his sister may be romantically involved with the bodyguard.', 'An Army veteran assembles a team of bodyguards to protect a former boxer. Complications arise when the boxer suspects his sister may be romantically involved with the bodyguard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrFtbuUMDMnJtlSVg5DWHFhMMGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9924'),
  ('782103874132518977', 'The Hard Guy', 1930, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arthur Hurley, Edwin B. DuPar', 'Burnet Hershey', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Alexander, Arch Hendricks, Pat Kearney, Valli Roberts', 'NR', 'Guy and Ellen are desperate to find a way to get food and medicine for their sick child. Jobs are very hard to come by during the Great Depression and many are driven to desperate measures.', 'Guy and Ellen are desperate to find a way to get food and medicine for their sick child. Jobs are very hard to come by during the Great Depression and many are driven to desperate measures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DmWBPixxak5QpArn4hEvxVdGXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144794'),
  ('679328994662411551', 'The Hard Hit', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Omie Blue, Darien Smith', 'Levi Gordon, Matthew Gonzales, Darien Smith', 'Brian Ronan Mulroy, Jamie Ohlsen, Malachi Durant, Rob LaColla Jr., Trae Ireland, Jerry G. Angelo, Richard T. Jones, Markice Moore', 'NR', 'An Interpol agent hunting the head of a global crime syndicate tracks his target to Las Vegas, but when the criminal organization kills his wife and daughter, he goes above the law to get his revenge.', 'An Interpol agent hunting the head of a global crime syndicate tracks his target to Las Vegas, but when the criminal organization kills his wife and daughter, he goes above the law to get his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whkFbOZTamHeugEG95jvQehSzAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195585'),
  ('404801396259420452', 'The Hard Truth', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kristine Peterson, Ross Berryman', 'Jonathan Tydor', 'Eric Roberts, Michael Rooker, Lysette Anthony, Ray Baker, Don Yesso, Jason Schombing, Yvonne Farrow, Katherine Cortez', null, 'A suspended cop and his girlfriend blackmail an electronics expert into helping them break into the safe of the girlfriend''s boss, a corrupt city councilman who''s on the local mob''s payroll.', 'A suspended cop and his girlfriend blackmail an electronics expert into helping them break into the safe of the girlfriend''s boss, a corrupt city councilman who''s on the local mob''s payroll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmmwhrKN9DIdwqxdEuWuUiLaPwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215137'),
  ('427609966759440644', 'The Hard Way', 1943, 'Drama', 'Vincent Sherman, James Wong Howe, Elmer Decker', 'Daniel Fuchs, Peter Viertel', 'Ida Lupino, Dennis Morgan, Joan Leslie, Jack Carson, Gladys George, Paul Cavanagh, Ann Doran, Thurston Hall', 'NR', 'Helen Chernen pushes her younger sister Katherine into show business in order to escape their small town poverty.', 'Helen Chernen pushes her younger sister Katherine into show business in order to escape their small town poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWRQ6bCL8glZ8IfSPGDlfNqbO8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36612'),
  ('1141848695135760731', 'The Hard Way', 1980, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michael Dryhurst, Henri Decaë', 'Kevin Grogan, Richard Tombleson', 'Patrick McGoohan, Lee Van Cleef, Edna O''Brien, Donal McCann, Ronan Wilmot, Kevin Flood, Joe Lynch, Derek Lord', null, 'John Connor is a soon-to-retire hitman that agrees to take on one last job. After years plying his deadly trade, he has finally had enough. Seeking to retire to Dublin and maybe salvage his dying marriage, Connor wants to leave the lonely world of the marksman behind him and melt into the background. Unfortunately, his handler O''Neal is reluctant to let him go, and, after much coertion, manages to talk him into accepting one final job.', 'John Connor is a soon-to-retire hitman that agrees to take on one last job. After years plying his deadly trade, he has finally had enough. Seeking to retire to Dublin and maybe salvage his dying marriage, Connor wants to leave the lonely world of the marksman behind him and melt into the background. Unfortunately, his handler O''Neal is reluctant to let him go, and, after much coertion, manages to talk him into accepting one final job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tloF0xEftl2OWQQ7NOYNM1ui7mP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153242'),
  ('548201093429935119', 'The Hard Way', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'John Badham, Robert Primes, Tom Warren', 'Daniel Pyne, Lem Dobbs', 'Michael J. Fox, James Woods, Stephen Lang, Annabella Sciorra, John Capodice, Luis Guzmán, LL Cool J, Mary Mara', 'R', 'Seeking to raise his credibility as an actor and to land a role as a tough cop on a new show, Hollywood action star Nick Lang works a deal with New York City Police Capt. Brix, who by chance is one of his fans. Nick will be paired with detective Lt. John Moss and learn how to act like a real cop. But when Nick drives John crazy with questions and imitating him, he gets in the way of John''s pursuit of a serial killer.', 'Seeking to raise his credibility as an actor and to land a role as a tough cop on a new show, Hollywood action star Nick Lang works a deal with New York City Police Capt. Brix, who by chance is one of his fans. Nick will be paired with detective Lt. John Moss and learn how to act like a real cop. But when Nick drives John crazy with questions and imitating him, he gets in the way of John''s pursuit of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/575f7BIovMdjk0hXh4WggZW1k8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11384'),
  ('101664580205683022', 'The Hard Way', 2019, 'Action', 'Keoni Waxman', 'Keoni Waxman', 'Michael Jai White, Luke Goss, Randy Couture, Mãdãlina Anea, Grant Campbell, George Remes, Ovidiu Niculescu, Andreea Diac', null, 'After learning of his brother''s death during a mission in Romania, a former soldier joins two allies to hunt down a mysterious enemy and take his revenge.', 'After learning of his brother''s death during a mission in Romania, a former soldier joins two allies to hunt down a mysterious enemy and take his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqkqvEkbwLYT1LIgyeK1FcD5Beu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586347'),
  ('697617654322208803', 'The Hard Word', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Scott Roberts, Brian J. Breheny, Toni Raynes', 'Scott Roberts', 'Guy Pearce, Robert Taylor, Rachel Griffiths, Joel Edgerton, Damien Richardson, Rhondda Findleton, Kate Atkinson, Vince Colosimo', 'R', 'Three fraternal bank robbers, languishing in jail, discover a profitable (if not dodgy) way to spend their time. Crime can most certainly pay, if you "know wot I mean?" However when sex and greed rear-up between the good crims and the bad cops, the consequences are both bizarre and fatal.', 'Three fraternal bank robbers, languishing in jail, discover a profitable (if not dodgy) way to spend their time. Crime can most certainly pay, if you "know wot I mean?" However when sex and greed rear-up between the good crims and the bad cops, the consequences are both bizarre and fatal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VBfmU9y6rX2CdZzPHmZeOmXiLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16311'),
  ('6326387320037346', 'The Harder They Come', 1972, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Perry Henzell', 'Trevor D. Rhone, Perry Henzell', 'Jimmy Cliff, Janet Bartley, Carl Bradshaw, Ras Daniel Hartman, Basil Keane, Bob Charlton, Winston Stona, Lucia White', 'R', 'Ivanhoe Martin arrives in Kingston, Jamaica, looking for work and, after some initial struggles, lands a recording contract as a reggae singer. He records his first song, "The Harder They Come," but after a bitter dispute with a manipulative producer named Hilton, soon finds himself resorting to petty crime in order to pay the bills. He deals marijuana, kills some abusive cops and earns local folk hero status. Meanwhile, his record is topping the charts.', 'Ivanhoe Martin arrives in Kingston, Jamaica, looking for work and, after some initial struggles, lands a recording contract as a reggae singer. He records his first song, "The Harder They Come," but after a bitter dispute with a manipulative producer named Hilton, soon finds himself resorting to petty crime in order to pay the bills. He deals marijuana, kills some abusive cops and earns local folk hero status. Meanwhile, his record is topping the charts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXcWgfds0E8T2pQLvgWLCiUmlV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7514'),
  ('78096783072111972', 'The Harder They Fall', 1956, 'Drama', 'Mark Robson, Burnett Guffey', 'Philip Yordan', 'Humphrey Bogart, Rod Steiger, Jan Sterling, Mike Lane, Max Baer, Jersey Joe Walcott, Edward Andrews, Harold J. Stone', 'NR', 'Jobless sportswriter Eddie Willis is hired by corrupt fight promoter Nick Benko to promote his current protégé, an unknown Argentinian boxer named Toro Moreno. Although Moreno is a hulking giant, his chances for success are hampered by a powder-puff punch and a glass jaw. Exploiting Willis'' reputation for integrity and standing in the boxing community, Benko arranges a series of fixed fights that propel the unsophisticated Moreno to #1 contender for the championship. The reigning champ, the sadistic Buddy Brannen, harbors resentment at the publicity Toro has been receiving and vows to viciously punish him in the ring. Eddie must now decide whether or not to tell the naive Toro the truth.', 'Jobless sportswriter Eddie Willis is hired by corrupt fight promoter Nick Benko to promote his current protégé, an unknown Argentinian boxer named Toro Moreno. Although Moreno is a hulking giant, his chances for success are hampered by a powder-puff punch and a glass jaw. Exploiting Willis'' reputation for integrity and standing in the boxing community, Benko arranges a series of fixed fights that propel the unsophisticated Moreno to #1 contender for the championship. The reigning champ, the sadistic Buddy Brannen, harbors resentment at the publicity Toro has been receiving and vows to viciously punish him in the ring. Eddie must now decide whether or not to tell the naive Toro the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93pUA2kAOeVlyvO1EeW8YmYIapt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28528'),
  ('898921806281317953', 'The Harder They Fall', 2021, 'Western', 'Mihai Malaimare Jr., G.A. Aguilar, Ricky R. Weaver', 'Jeymes Samuel, Boaz Yakin', 'Jonathan Majors, Idris Elba, Regina King, Zazie Beetz, Delroy Lindo, Danielle Deadwyler, LaKeith Stanfield, Edi Gathegi', 'R', 'Gunning for revenge, outlaw Nat Love saddles up with his gang to take down enemy Rufus Buck, a ruthless crime boss who just got sprung from prison.', 'Gunning for revenge, outlaw Nat Love saddles up with his gang to take down enemy Rufus Buck, a ruthless crime boss who just got sprung from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su9WzL7lwUZPhjH6eZByAYFx2US.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618162'),
