  ('847483886499428748', 'The Harmonica''s Howl', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ivo Lopes Araújo, Bruno Safadi', 'Bruno Safadi', 'Mariana Ximenes, Leandra Leal, Jiddú Pinheiro', null, 'A young couple, Pedro and Antônia, have their relationship weakening after meeting Luana. Romance, seduction, fear and anguish from the future are established in this story of liquid love.', 'A young couple, Pedro and Antônia, have their relationship weakening after meeting Luana. Romance, seduction, fear and anguish from the future are established in this story of liquid love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nptcslczbzeR4e02dIHyEWiCGCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230374'),
  ('711409022483552238', 'The Harmonists', 1997, 'Music, Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Klaus Richter, Jürgen Egger', 'Ben Becker, Heino Ferch, Ulrich Noethen, Heinrich Schafmeister, Max Tidof, Kai Wiesinger, Meret Becker, Katja Riemann', null, 'Comedian Harmonists tells the story of a famous, German male sextet, five vocals and piano, the "Comedian Harmonists", from the day they meet first in 1927 to the day in 1934, when they become banned by the upcoming Nazis, because three of them are Jewish.', 'Comedian Harmonists tells the story of a famous, German male sextet, five vocals and piano, the "Comedian Harmonists", from the day they meet first in 1927 to the day in 1934, when they become banned by the upcoming Nazis, because three of them are Jewish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jUWDGEOZ6MFy9gSfYZ69KLjPLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9524'),
  ('596919713183880267', 'The Harmonium in My Memory', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lee Young-jae, Jeon Jo-Myeong, Seo Byeong-chae', 'Lee Young-jae, Bang Jang-ho, Seo Byeong-chae', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Lee Byung-hun, Lee Mi-yeon, Song Ok-suk, Kim Jae-in, Seo Hye-rin, Lee Dae-yeon, Kim Seon-hwa', null, 'Hong-yun is a high school girl in little mountain village when she falls head-over-heels for a handsome new school teacher, Mr. Kang. What with taking care of her youngest baby brother for her widowed mother and the impossible age difference, it is a roller-coaster ride for her as she tries to become someone special for Mr. Kang while he seems interested in the other new teacher at the school, Miss Yang.', 'Hong-yun is a high school girl in little mountain village when she falls head-over-heels for a handsome new school teacher, Mr. Kang. What with taking care of her youngest baby brother for her widowed mother and the impossible age difference, it is a roller-coaster ride for her as she tries to become someone special for Mr. Kang while he seems interested in the other new teacher at the school, Miss Yang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWVuht8stXzNF38bfxTHgK80SOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142499'),
  ('747758240920521254', 'The Harrad Experiment', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jesse Corallo, Maxine Anderson, Richard H. Kline', 'Michael Werner, Ted Cassidy', 'James Whitmore, Tippi Hedren, Don Johnson, Bruno Kirby, Laurie Walters, Victoria Thompson, Elliott Street, Billy Sands', 'R', 'At fictional Harrad College students learn about sexuality and experiment with each other. Based on the 1966 book of the same name by Robert Rimmer, this movie deals with the concept of free love during the height of the sexual revolution which took place in the United States.', 'At fictional Harrad College students learn about sexuality and experiment with each other. Based on the 1966 book of the same name by Robert Rimmer, this movie deals with the concept of free love during the height of the sexual revolution which took place in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsZFgxeldZrG6Xi2C4pFiW7Wcmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2988'),
  ('533973003195372174', 'The Harryhausen Chronicles', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Richard Schickel', 'Richard Schickel', 'Leonard Nimoy, Ray Bradbury, Ray Harryhausen, George Lucas, Dennis Muren, Charles H. Schneer, Henry Selick, Tom Hanks', null, 'As an actor, director and producer, Ray Harryhausen has been a vibrant figure in Hollywood, working on everything from family films to mind-bending sci-fi. But his true genius lay in the creation of special effects for movies such as Mighty Joe Young and It Came from Outer Space. Narrated by Leonard Nimoy and featuring appearances by George Lucas and Ray Bradbury, this film documents Harryhausen''s remarkable life''s work.', 'As an actor, director and producer, Ray Harryhausen has been a vibrant figure in Hollywood, working on everything from family films to mind-bending sci-fi. But his true genius lay in the creation of special effects for movies such as Mighty Joe Young and It Came from Outer Space. Narrated by Leonard Nimoy and featuring appearances by George Lucas and Ray Bradbury, this film documents Harryhausen''s remarkable life''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP4CR20quD3iNi0qKxyhpjs0YNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43714'),
  ('538952009311054672', 'The Hart of London', 1970, 'Documentary, History, Mystery', 'Jack Chambers', null, null, null, '"The Hart of London" is an endlessly layered tour de force. It explores life and death, the sense of place and personal displacement, and the intricate aesthetics of representation. It is a personal and spiritual film, marked inevitably by Chambers’s knowledge that he had leukemia. The late American avant-garde filmmaker Stan Brakhage said of Hart, "If I named the five greatest films [ever made], this has got to be one of them." Even this high praise falls short of hyperbole. The Hart of London is at the centre of Chambers’s extraordinary achievement.', '"The Hart of London" is an endlessly layered tour de force. It explores life and death, the sense of place and personal displacement, and the intricate aesthetics of representation. It is a personal and spiritual film, marked inevitably by Chambers’s knowledge that he had leukemia. The late American avant-garde filmmaker Stan Brakhage said of Hart, "If I named the five greatest films [ever made], this has got to be one of them." Even this high praise falls short of hyperbole. The Hart of London is at the centre of Chambers’s extraordinary achievement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V7miC4auYdrlc0aDaBl48lPRGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113520'),
  ('368490752206521266', 'The Harvest', 1993, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'David Marconi, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'David Marconi', 'Miguel Ferrer, Leilani Sarelle, Henry Silva, Tony Denison, Tim Thomerson, George Clooney, Harvey Fierstein, Matt Clark', 'R', 'A screenwriter is sent to Mexico to develop a story that can be used to wrap up a movie presently in production. Given a very short time allotment, the writer immerses himself in the seamier side of a Mexican beach resort, but soon finds himself involved in a ''body organ for profit'' operation. Drugged, he has one of his own kidneys removed, and then, with a woman he isn''t sure he can trust, he sets out to expose the ring...', 'A screenwriter is sent to Mexico to develop a story that can be used to wrap up a movie presently in production. Given a very short time allotment, the writer immerses himself in the seamier side of a Mexican beach resort, but soon finds himself involved in a ''body organ for profit'' operation. Drugged, he has one of his own kidneys removed, and then, with a woman he isn''t sure he can trust, he sets out to expose the ring...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lFeJSx3Zzgy9s3ZRGl2Fjm441a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54817'),
  ('709662100851161250', 'The Harvest', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'John McNaughton, Rachel Morrison', 'Stephen Lancellotti', 'Samantha Morton, Michael Shannon, Natasha Calis, Charlie Tahan, Peter Fonda, Leslie Lyles, Meadow Williams, Journey Smith', 'NR', 'After becoming orphaned, a lonely girl moves in with her grandparents and tries to befriend a sick, bed-ridden boy next door, despite his mother’s strong objections. Her persistence leads to a friendship, but during secret visits, she uncovers dark secrets in the boy''s home.', 'After becoming orphaned, a lonely girl moves in with her grandparents and tries to befriend a sick, bed-ridden boy next door, despite his mother’s strong objections. Her persistence leads to a friendship, but during secret visits, she uncovers dark secrets in the boy''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/he6abiplc1atXbN7OztQAiZoYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229182'),
  ('42895163305321621', 'The Harvest Month', 1956, 'Drama', 'Esko Nevalainen, Matti Kassila', 'Matti Kassila', 'Toivo Mäkelä, Emma Väänänen, Rauni Luoma, Aino-Maija Tikkanen, Rauni Ikäheimo, Senni Nieminen, Heikki Savolainen, Tauno Kajander', null, 'The title of the Finnish film Elokuu translates to August. Directed by Matti Kassila, one of Finland''s premiere filmmakers, Elokuu was adapted from a novel by Nobel prize winning finnish author F.E. Sillanpää. Simply put, the story concerns the decline and fall of a once-proud family, thanks to the alcoholism of its paterfamilias. Toivo Makela delivers a powerfully effective performance as the inebriated protagonist, avoiding the usual "drunken" cliches. The overlong running time, coupled with the downbeat nature of the subject, limited the film''s worldwide appeal.', 'The title of the Finnish film Elokuu translates to August. Directed by Matti Kassila, one of Finland''s premiere filmmakers, Elokuu was adapted from a novel by Nobel prize winning finnish author F.E. Sillanpää. Simply put, the story concerns the decline and fall of a once-proud family, thanks to the alcoholism of its paterfamilias. Toivo Makela delivers a powerfully effective performance as the inebriated protagonist, avoiding the usual "drunken" cliches. The overlong running time, coupled with the downbeat nature of the subject, limited the film''s worldwide appeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8jFlchjruCNGrqHU8JJeaABKxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199196'),
  ('1063403058026124290', 'The Harvey Girls', 1946, 'Music, Western, Romance, Comedy', 'George J. Folsey, Mildred Griffiths, Lennie Hayton', 'Edmund Beloin, Nathaniel Curtis, Harry Crane', 'Judy Garland, John Hodiak, Ray Bolger, Angela Lansbury, Preston Foster, Virginia O''Brien, Kenny Baker, Marjorie Main', 'NR', 'On a train trip out west to become a mail-order bride, Susan Bradley meets a cheery crew of young women traveling out to open a "Harvey House" restaurant at a remote whistle-stop.', 'On a train trip out west to become a mail-order bride, Susan Bradley meets a cheery crew of young women traveling out to open a "Harvey House" restaurant at a remote whistle-stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGta8SzLwRTFsmsWtlS8d7pFKt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28907'),
  ('880227611709320100', 'The Hasty Hare', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A Martian, with his green dog-soldier, K-9, arrive on Earth with instructions to bring back an Earth creature. He chooses Bugs Bunny.', 'A Martian, with his green dog-soldier, K-9, arrive on Earth with instructions to bring back an Earth creature. He chooses Bugs Bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUDgajFI5LFFGoUkNlscGuaKMTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84587'),
  ('192448415858458929', 'The Hasty Heart', 1949, 'Drama, War', 'Vincent Sherman, Wilkie Cooper', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Ronald Reagan, Patricia Neal, Richard Todd, Anthony Nicholls, Howard Marion-Crawford, Ralph Michael, John Sherman, Alfie Bass', 'NR', 'In the final days of World War II, in a MASH unit in Burma, a severely wounded corporal watches in dismay as fellow soldiers pack-up to return home but a caring nurse and five remaining soldiers bring him solace.', 'In the final days of World War II, in a MASH unit in Burma, a severely wounded corporal watches in dismay as fellow soldiers pack-up to return home but a caring nurse and five remaining soldiers bring him solace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B2q6U3UWsxDWWV78UEmQv2tYLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74286'),
