  ('720620245179118402', 'The Hatton Garden Job', 2017, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Ronnie Thompson, Arthur Mulhern', 'Ray Bogdanovich, Dean Lines, Ronnie Thompson', 'Matthew Goode, Joely Richardson, Larry Lamb, Phil Daniels, David Calder, Clive Russell, Stephen Moyer, Mark Harris', null, 'In April 2015, the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company, an underground safe deposit facility in London''s Hatton Garden area, was burgled by 4 elderly men. With the stolen property having a value of up to £200 million, the incident has been called the "largest burglary in English history".', 'In April 2015, the Hatton Garden Safe Deposit Company, an underground safe deposit facility in London''s Hatton Garden area, was burgled by 4 elderly men. With the stolen property having a value of up to £200 million, the incident has been called the "largest burglary in English history".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHKjxdTw0e85Vo9G3VviUihvFkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448847'),
  ('505714670532676386', 'The Haunted', 1991, 'Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Robert Mandel, Michael D. Margulies', null, 'Sally Kirkland, Jeffrey DeMunn, Louise Latham, George D. Wallace, Joyce Van Patten, William O''Connell, Stephen Markle, Diane Baker', null, 'When the Smurl family moves into a duplex, they find out it''s haunted. When the Catholic Church is no help, they reach out to famous demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren', 'When the Smurl family moves into a duplex, they find out it''s haunted. When the Catholic Church is no help, they reach out to famous demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daLoku3ViXkUKOJB9X39v72KlDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49396'),
  ('819310548541462096', 'The Haunted', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mike Hodder, David Holroyd, Richard Tan', 'David Holroyd', 'Sophie Stevens, Ray MacAllan, Nick Bayly, Maggie Daniels, Kirstie Steele, Virginia Denham', 'NR', 'In a rambling, isolated house, Emily’s first night-shift as carer to an elderly dementia patient turns into a nightmare as she is tormented by a vengeful spirit and uncovers the house''s dark secrets.', 'In a rambling, isolated house, Emily’s first night-shift as carer to an elderly dementia patient turns into a nightmare as she is tormented by a vengeful spirit and uncovers the house''s dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MSE3VYrosSTLL6Mze6hvKrIRyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623034'),
  ('729595311121836353', 'The Haunted Airman', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Chris Durlacher, Jeff Baynes', 'Chris Durlacher', 'Robert Pattinson, Rachael Stirling, Julian Sands, Scott Handy, Daniel Ainsleigh, Melissa Lloyd, Peggy Popovic, Robert Whitelock', 'R', 'An injured RAF pilot, confined to a wheelchair is committed to an eerie hospital where he starts to lose his mind.', 'An injured RAF pilot, confined to a wheelchair is committed to an eerie hospital where he starts to lose his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71PbHyrUdowV9HhW7fixWAPwH2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21505'),
  ('712390384586443814', 'The Haunted Castle', 1921, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'F. W. Murnau, Laszlo Schäffer, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Carl Mayer', 'Arnold Korff, Lulu Kyser-Korff, Lothar Mehnert, Paul Bildt, Olga Tschechowa, Paul Hartmann, Hermann Vallentin, Julius Falkenstein', null, 'The sinister Count Oetsch scandalizes the aristocratic social gathering at Castle Vogelod as he announces his intention to "crash" the festivities. Baroness Safferstätt is expected shortly, and the guests are well-aware of the rumors that Count Oetsch murdered the baroness'' late husband. Oetsch refuses to leave, vowing that he will reveal the identity of the real killer. Before the weekend is through, the Count and Baroness will reveal secrets too shocking to be believed!', 'The sinister Count Oetsch scandalizes the aristocratic social gathering at Castle Vogelod as he announces his intention to "crash" the festivities. Baroness Safferstätt is expected shortly, and the guests are well-aware of the rumors that Count Oetsch murdered the baroness'' late husband. Oetsch refuses to leave, vowing that he will reveal the identity of the real killer. Before the weekend is through, the Count and Baroness will reveal secrets too shocking to be believed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FK7XuRQhKHmN3MKHkelQxiuQWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6793'),
  ('311882134978525535', 'The Haunted Castle', 1960, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy', 'Kurt Hoffmann, Rainer Erler, Eberhard Schröder', 'Heinz Pauck, Günter Neumann', 'Liselotte Pulver, Heinz Baumann, Hanne Wieder, Elsa Wagner, Herbert Hübner, Ernst Waldow, Hubert von Meyerinck, Hans Clarin', null, 'The ghosts of thieves help a beautiful young countess save her inherited castle from modern developers in this comic horror/musical.', 'The ghosts of thieves help a beautiful young countess save her inherited castle from modern developers in this comic horror/musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuuhLrot53jZJbB9Cofvzokrnul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67767'),
  ('30443882931277694', 'The Haunted Cop Shop', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Wong Kar-Wai', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong, Kitty Chan, Woo Fung, Paul Chung Fat, Joh Chung-Sing, Michelle Sima', null, 'During the Japanese occupation of Hong Kong, the soldiers had a clubhouse, where, on V-J Day, they committed seppuku. Now it''s a police station, and its inhabitants burn dolls to keep the souls at peace. However, tonight is the Ghost Festival, when ghosts are allowed one night''s leave, and the Colonel has risen, turning those he bites into vampires.', 'During the Japanese occupation of Hong Kong, the soldiers had a clubhouse, where, on V-J Day, they committed seppuku. Now it''s a police station, and its inhabitants burn dolls to keep the souls at peace. However, tonight is the Ghost Festival, when ghosts are allowed one night''s leave, and the Colonel has risen, turning those he bites into vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCvWVPdjGDhIvafWkuRiRQelV4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143217'),
