  ('70058382493563396', 'The Haunted House', 1921, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton, Elgin Lessley', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Roberts, Edward F. Cline, Natalie Talmadge, Dorothy Cassil, Mark Hamilton, Paddy McGuire', 'NR', 'A bank teller becomes involved with a hold-up, counterfeiters and a theatrical troupe posing as spooks in a haunted house.', 'A bank teller becomes involved with a hold-up, counterfeiters and a theatrical troupe posing as spooks in a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKAgNQhI55Ennhd3SmU1UxvXiQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51359'),
  ('791935369058973645', 'The Haunted House', 1929, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Mickey seeks shelter from a storm in a house that turns out to be haunted. The skeletons command him to play the organ; they dance and play along.', 'Mickey seeks shelter from a storm in a house that turns out to be haunted. The skeletons command him to play the organ; they dance and play along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFnfcyDbFhAPjqBSwqoEi2ajScq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77022'),
  ('937601486596865070', 'The Haunted House', 1982, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bruno Corbucci, Roberto Tatti, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci, Enrico Oldoini', 'Renato Pozzetto, Gloria Guida, Yorgo Voyagis, Lia Zoppelli, Angelo Pellegrino, Leo Gavero, Franco Diogene, Vittorio Ripamonti', null, 'George and Lucia are newlyweds and have also been lucky enough to find a home at a low price , very low . Maybe too low . In fact the house is haunted by two lovers who, a thousand years ago, were surprised by the girl''s mother who subsequently turned them into pillars of salt . But there is a way to break the magic and free the two lovers caught in the curse and it is all in the hands of the newlyweds on their wedding night . Will they succeed ?', 'George and Lucia are newlyweds and have also been lucky enough to find a home at a low price , very low . Maybe too low . In fact the house is haunted by two lovers who, a thousand years ago, were surprised by the girl''s mother who subsequently turned them into pillars of salt . But there is a way to break the magic and free the two lovers caught in the curse and it is all in the hands of the newlyweds on their wedding night . Will they succeed ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ldylNSdMGpjQ8Mb5Rs0lvW1Cbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58083'),
  ('104292511052183837', 'The Haunted House of Horror', 1969, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Armstrong, Nick Caris Carter, Jack Atcheler', 'Michael Armstrong', 'Frankie Avalon, Jill Haworth, Dennis Price, Mark Wynter, George Sewell, Gina Warwick, Richard O''Sullivan, Carol Dilworth', null, 'Teenagers in an old mansion are being murdered one by one. The survivors must discover who among them is the killer before they''re all finished off.', 'Teenagers in an old mansion are being murdered one by one. The survivors must discover who among them is the killer before they''re all finished off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkebRdCNbogBYhdA3jhaF4qp7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93929'),
  ('175516327061820756', 'The Haunted House Project', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Lee Cheol-ha', 'Kim Eun-Kyeong', 'Sin Gyeong Seon, Shin So-yul, Yun I-na, Lee Hwa Jeong, Hyeon Tae Ho', null, 'Over the past 42 years, six people have gone missing, eight people have died "accidently" and eleven cases of murder have occurred in a deserted house. 3 members of an abandoned house exploring club and 3 staff members of a broadcasting company go into the deserted house. All of them disappear.', 'Over the past 42 years, six people have gone missing, eight people have died "accidently" and eleven cases of murder have occurred in a deserted house. 3 members of an abandoned house exploring club and 3 staff members of a broadcasting company go into the deserted house. All of them disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWHJOWxbb0ErqarHQ6SxMkzwSy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56604'),
  ('1064428597392513154', 'The Haunted Mansion', 2003, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'Rob Minkoff, Remi Adefarasin, Jodi Lowry', 'David Berenbaum', 'Eddie Murphy, Marsha Thomason, Terence Stamp, Nathaniel Parker, Jennifer Tilly, Dina Spybey-Waters, Wallace Shawn, Marc John Jefferies', 'PG', 'Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.', 'Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGi5yio4pdDz5PkSeZCbnMQz5vK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10756'),
  ('423705692760302142', 'The Haunted Palace', 1963, 'Horror', 'Roger Corman, Paul Rapp, Floyd Crosby', 'Charles Beaumont, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Vincent Price, Debra Paget, Lon Chaney Jr., Frank Maxwell, Leo Gordon, Elisha Cook Jr., John Dierkes, Milton Parsons', null, 'A warlock burned at the stake comes back and takes over the body of his great grandson to take his revenge on the descendents of the villages that burned him.', 'A warlock burned at the stake comes back and takes over the body of his great grandson to take his revenge on the descendents of the villages that burned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2nvogtK7ts0BCzMdj9K1yp5PMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30137'),
  ('369186386352486525', 'The Haunted World of Edward D. Wood, Jr.', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Brett Thompson', 'Brett Thompson', 'Maila Nurmi, Dolores Fuller, Paul Marco, Bela Lugosi, Bela Lugosi Jr., Loretta King, Lyle Talbot, Norma McCarty', null, 'Often called the worst director in the history of cinema, Ed Wood is nevertheless a beloved figure among cult-film aficionados for his oddball productions. This documentary takes a look back at Wood''s unique career at the margins of 1950s Hollywood, speaking to those who loved him and hated him. Bela Lugosi Jr. discusses his father''s work in the abysmal "Plan 9 From Outer Space," while a Baptist reverend recalls how he was tricked into financing the film.', 'Often called the worst director in the history of cinema, Ed Wood is nevertheless a beloved figure among cult-film aficionados for his oddball productions. This documentary takes a look back at Wood''s unique career at the margins of 1950s Hollywood, speaking to those who loved him and hated him. Bela Lugosi Jr. discusses his father''s work in the abysmal "Plan 9 From Outer Space," while a Baptist reverend recalls how he was tricked into financing the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWbwYJIRisTiur9aqMQKSHkiGTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73183'),
  ('1124242415174809505', 'The Haunted World of El Superbeasto', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Music', 'Rob Zombie, Mike Disa, Joe Ekers', 'Rob Zombie, Tom Papa', 'Joe Alaskey, Ken Foree, Sheri Moon Zombie, Tom Papa, Rosario Dawson, April Winchell, Tom Kenny, Dee Wallace', 'R', 'The Haunted World of El Superbeasto is an animated comedy that also combines elements of a horror and thriller film. It is based upon the comic book series created by Rob Zombie that follows the character of El Superbeasto and his sexy sidekick sister, Suzi-X, voiced by Sheri Moon, as they confront an evil villain by the name of Dr. Satan.', 'The Haunted World of El Superbeasto is an animated comedy that also combines elements of a horror and thriller film. It is based upon the comic book series created by Rob Zombie that follows the character of El Superbeasto and his sexy sidekick sister, Suzi-X, voiced by Sheri Moon, as they confront an evil villain by the name of Dr. Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obOr6ir0UlLGqln6HVMa2My9ENs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23127'),
  ('218301725699042220', 'The Haunting', 1963, 'Horror', 'Davis Boulton, Robert Wise, David Tomblin', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Julie Harris, Claire Bloom, Richard Johnson, Russ Tamblyn, Fay Compton, Rosalie Crutchley, Lois Maxwell, Valentine Dyall', 'G', 'Dr. John Markway recruits three strangers for a sleep-disorder study at the eerie and isolated Hill House. It soon becomes clear his real interest lies in the mansion itself and its sinister history, as they are forced to confront the nature of its horror…', 'Dr. John Markway recruits three strangers for a sleep-disorder study at the eerie and isolated Hill House. It soon becomes clear his real interest lies in the mansion itself and its sinister history, as they are forced to confront the nature of its horror…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmpTnUKTcrpuxLSY23gQMUf9qu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11772'),
  ('503402408369413659', 'The Haunting', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Jan de Bont, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Paula Lucchesi', 'David Self', 'Liam Neeson, Lili Taylor, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Owen Wilson, Bruce Dern, Marian Seldes, Alix Koromzay, Todd Field', 'PG-13', 'Dr. David Marrow invites three distinct individuals to the eerie and isolated Hill House to be subjects for a sleep disorder study. The unfortunate guests discover that Marrow is far more interested in the sinister mansion itself — and they soon see the true nature of its horror.', 'Dr. David Marrow invites three distinct individuals to the eerie and isolated Hill House to be subjects for a sleep disorder study. The unfortunate guests discover that Marrow is far more interested in the sinister mansion itself — and they soon see the true nature of its horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwLldS5JnB4441iS50ha9ZrkaA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11618'),
  ('1115352726398053423', 'The Haunting at Saint Joseph''s', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jon Cohen', null, 'Tim Spriggs, Melissa Brattoni, Brandon Krum, Davida Tal, Alex Snow, Tara Jay, Elke Hinrichsen, Marvin Maddicks Jr.', null, 'An engaged Muslim doctor, her fiancé, and their friends go on a holiday at St. Joseph’s Guesthouse, unaware that it was the site of a sacrifice of an innocent centuries before. They soon come to believe that it''s haunted and causing them to go crazy, as their emotions spiral out of control.', 'An engaged Muslim doctor, her fiancé, and their friends go on a holiday at St. Joseph’s Guesthouse, unaware that it was the site of a sacrifice of an innocent centuries before. They soon come to believe that it''s haunted and causing them to go crazy, as their emotions spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDzQFxs0KTzHUPkIR0c44TSGJUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092073'),
  ('509290329380662950', 'The Haunting Hour: Don''t Think About It', 2007, 'Horror, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Alex Zamm, Jacques Haitkin', 'Dan Angel, Billy Brown', 'Emily Osment, Brittany Curran, Alex Winzenread, Michelle Duffy, John Hawkinson, Cody Linley, Tobin Bell, John P. Hopkins', 'PG', 'Cassie, a 13 year old Gothic girl, is trying to fit in at her new school. To entertain herself, she plays a series of pranks on the popular kids and her younger brother, Max. When she goes to a Halloween store looking for new tricks, she finds a little book called "The Evil Thing"', 'Cassie, a 13 year old Gothic girl, is trying to fit in at her new school. To entertain herself, she plays a series of pranks on the popular kids and her younger brother, Max. When she goes to a Halloween store looking for new tricks, she finds a little book called "The Evil Thing"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqQfKmqR2qXjEjJ2F0cH5DbwIGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21935'),
  ('475333727558612529', 'The Haunting in Connecticut', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Peter Cornwell, Adam Swica', 'Adam Simon, Tim Metcalfe', 'Virginia Madsen, Kyle Gallner, Martin Donovan, Amanda Crew, Elias Koteas, Sophi Knight, Ty Wood, D.W. Brown', 'PG-13', 'When the Campbell family moves to upstate Connecticut, they soon learn that their charming Victorian home has a disturbing history: not only was the house a transformed funeral parlor where inconceivable acts occurred, but the owner''s clairvoyant son Jonah served as a demonic messenger, providing a gateway for spiritual entities to crossover.', 'When the Campbell family moves to upstate Connecticut, they soon learn that their charming Victorian home has a disturbing history: not only was the house a transformed funeral parlor where inconceivable acts occurred, but the owner''s clairvoyant son Jonah served as a demonic messenger, providing a gateway for spiritual entities to crossover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTfL0YbTa7S59vZYmWbk6UofHkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18781'),
  ('886972134588268867', 'The Haunting in Connecticut 2: Ghosts of Georgia', 2013, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Tom Elkins, Yaron Levy', 'David Coggeshall', 'Chad Michael Murray, Katee Sackhoff, Abigail Spencer, Cicely Tyson, Emily Alyn Lind, Andrea Frankle, Lauren Pennington, Morgana Shaw', 'R', 'A young family moves into a historic home in Georgia, only to learn they are not the house''s only inhabitants. Soon they find themselves in the presence of a secret rising from underground and threatening to bring down anyone in its path.', 'A young family moves into a historic home in Georgia, only to learn they are not the house''s only inhabitants. Soon they find themselves in the presence of a secret rising from underground and threatening to bring down anyone in its path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBuk4jsOUjjjxCqS6rPgMKi1RB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150202'),
  ('311263447320672282', 'The Haunting of Alcatraz', 2020, 'Horror', 'Steve Lawson', 'Steve Lawson', 'Helen Crevel, Beau Fowler, Jonathan Hansler, Marcus Langford, Chris Lines, Mark Topping', null, 'Alcatraz. 1937. A young prison guard working the night shift experiences a string of chilling disturbances culminating in the bizarre death of an inmate at the most famous prison in the world', 'Alcatraz. 1937. A young prison guard working the night shift experiences a string of chilling disturbances culminating in the bizarre death of an inmate at the most famous prison in the world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfv77EkP1CbOCi36LZWuWlvoL4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681711'),
  ('359842825472883378', 'The Haunting of Helena', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Christian Bisceglia, Ascanio Malgarini, Antonello Emidi', 'Christian Bisceglia', 'Harriet MacMasters-Green, Sabrina Jolie Perez, Jarreth J. Merz, Matt Patresi, Susanna Cornacchia, Paolo Paoloni, Giuliano Montaldo, Massimiliano Carnevale', 'NR', 'After a divorce, Sophia moves to the south of Italy with her daughter, Helena. Their new home, an apartment within an austere building of the fascist age, is a chance for them to start a new life. But inside an old storage room hides a mysterious closet and a buried secret. After the loss of Helena’s first baby tooth, a chilling obsession begins and an apparition haunts her sleep...', 'After a divorce, Sophia moves to the south of Italy with her daughter, Helena. Their new home, an apartment within an austere building of the fascist age, is a chance for them to start a new life. But inside an old storage room hides a mysterious closet and a buried secret. After the loss of Helena’s first baby tooth, a chilling obsession begins and an apparition haunts her sleep...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB8rf8FYHGlrbmLybCo6Mpg8hNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159211'),
  ('218414652986704704', 'The Haunting of Hell House', 1999, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ivan McMahon, Michelle Fennessy, Karen Reen', 'Lev L. Spiro, Mitch Marcus', 'Michael York, Andrew Bowen, Jason Cottle, Claudia Christian, Aideen O''Donnell, Brian Glanney, Ciaron Davies, Mike Finn', 'R', 'A mysterious, morbid professor who has suffered a number of horrid events in his life tries to help a young troubled man, whose girl friend was killed during an illegal abortion.', 'A mysterious, morbid professor who has suffered a number of horrid events in his life tries to help a young troubled man, whose girl friend was killed during an illegal abortion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvJft6ruse7ezOIodSE0pBqInxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169150'),
  ('303279359685756100', 'The Haunting of Margam Castle', 2020, 'Horror', 'Andrew Jones', 'Andrew Jones', 'Caroline Munro, Jane Merrow, Derren Nesbitt, Vernon Dobtcheff, Garrick Hagon, Judy Matheson, Simon Bamford, Derek Nelson', null, 'A team of American parapsychologists travel to Wales to conduct a study of Margam Castle, one of the UK''s most haunted buildings.', 'A team of American parapsychologists travel to Wales to conduct a study of Margam Castle, one of the UK''s most haunted buildings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2BlIxjAaj0WERGrIehnczNE0On.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738542'),
  ('734303207768701473', 'The Haunting of Molly Hartley', 2008, 'Drama, Horror', 'Mickey Liddell, Sharone Meir', 'Rebecca Sonnenshine, John Travis', 'Haley Bennett, Jake Weber, Chace Crawford, Shannon Woodward, Shanna Collins, AnnaLynne McCord, Marin Hinkle, Nina Siemaszko', 'PG-13', 'When teenage Molly Hartley moves to a new town, she''s haunted by terrifying visions that may have to do with dark secrets from her past. Something evil lurks just beneath the lush surfaces of her private-school world, and it holds the rights to her very soul. On the eve of her 18th birthday, Molly is about to discover the truth of just who or what she is destined to become.', 'When teenage Molly Hartley moves to a new town, she''s haunted by terrifying visions that may have to do with dark secrets from her past. Something evil lurks just beneath the lush surfaces of her private-school world, and it holds the rights to her very soul. On the eve of her 18th birthday, Molly is about to discover the truth of just who or what she is destined to become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XSy8BKHIa19yMAt7XyO2s9oIT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14745'),
  ('54732955672013322', 'The Haunting of Morella', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Zoran Hochstätter, Jim Wynorski, Sally Mattison', 'R.J. Robertson, Jim Wynorski', 'David McCallum, Nicole Eggert, Christopher Halsted, Lana Clarkson, Maria Ford, Jonathan Farwell, Brewster Gould, Gail Harris', null, 'An executed witch inhabits her teenaged daughter''s body to continue in the pursuit of bloodshed.', 'An executed witch inhabits her teenaged daughter''s body to continue in the pursuit of bloodshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cih8gI5rXBRfhyXH3bBWj3D8bBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29905'),
  ('992828547133214614', 'The Haunting of Sarah Hardy', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Jerry London, Bojan Bazelli', null, 'Sela Ward, Michael Woods, Roscoe Born, Polly Bergen, Morgan Fairchild, Charles Bernard, Vana O''Brien, Steven Clark Pachosa', 'NR', 'Sela Ward stars as beautiful, vulnerable heiress Sarah Hardy, recently wed and returning to her isolated childhood home, The Pines, to claim her vast inheritance. But something – or someone – evil waits there for her. It could be real. Or imagined. Whatever it is , it wants to drive Sarah into madness. And on the other side of madness lies murder. Featuring a tour de force performances by Morgan Fairchild and Polly Bergen, The Haunting of Sarah Hardy is sheer gothic suspense at its most wicked.', 'Sela Ward stars as beautiful, vulnerable heiress Sarah Hardy, recently wed and returning to her isolated childhood home, The Pines, to claim her vast inheritance. But something – or someone – evil waits there for her. It could be real. Or imagined. Whatever it is , it wants to drive Sarah into madness. And on the other side of madness lies murder. Featuring a tour de force performances by Morgan Fairchild and Polly Bergen, The Haunting of Sarah Hardy is sheer gothic suspense at its most wicked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY4mDPKvSjaVtyyMYqxuOpC4sJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219878'),
  ('905871896087124953', 'The Haunting of Seacliff Inn', 1994, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror, TV Movie', 'Walter Klenhard, Rohn Schmidt, David Larson', 'Walter Klenhard, Tom Walla', 'Ally Sheedy, William R. Moses, Louise Fletcher, Lucinda Weist, Tom McCleister, Maxine Stuart, Shannon Cochran, Jay W. MacIntosh', null, 'Susan and Mark move to a seaside town to buy an old house and open an inn. They came to look at one house, but Susan is inexplicably drawn to another. The house is high on a cliff overlooking a lonely beach. Something eerie is going on. A scary black dog appears. One strange guest stays at the inn. Susan finds letters in the attic written long ago by a wife who was terrified of something.', 'Susan and Mark move to a seaside town to buy an old house and open an inn. They came to look at one house, but Susan is inexplicably drawn to another. The house is high on a cliff overlooking a lonely beach. Something eerie is going on. A scary black dog appears. One strange guest stays at the inn. Susan finds letters in the attic written long ago by a wife who was terrified of something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsiKiFTc7HaS1PSItt0AcSZ9eUI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189299'),
  ('911525799347055509', 'The Haunting of Sharon Tate', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Farrands, Carlo Rinaldi, Alan Steinman', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Hilary Duff, Jonathan Bennett, Lydia Hearst, Pawel Szajda, Ryan Cargill, Tyler Johnson, Bella Popa, Fivel Stewart', 'R', 'Pregnant with director Roman Polanski''s child and awaiting his return from Europe, 26-year-old Hollywood actress Sharon Tate becomes plagued by visions of her imminent death.', 'Pregnant with director Roman Polanski''s child and awaiting his return from Europe, 26-year-old Hollywood actress Sharon Tate becomes plagued by visions of her imminent death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzIQjfKmrTKf25y3N3VU88bFn8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503706'),
