  ('1019828414130281833', 'The Haunting of the Tower of London', 2022, 'Horror, History', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Natalie Martins, Derek Nelson, James Swanton, Greg Draven, Tessa Wood, Rory Wilton, Jake Watkins, Tim Cartwright', null, 'The Two Princes, imprisoned and allegedly murdered in the Bloody Tower within the Tower Of London by Richard III. The story tells how they allegedly came back to haunt the Tower and with guards and inmates starting to die in horrible circumstances, it becomes clear the Two Princes are out for revenge. A chilling ghost story based on the famous mystery.', 'The Two Princes, imprisoned and allegedly murdered in the Bloody Tower within the Tower Of London by Richard III. The story tells how they allegedly came back to haunt the Tower and with guards and inmates starting to die in horrible circumstances, it becomes clear the Two Princes are out for revenge. A chilling ghost story based on the famous mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3syWckCgiAcsJUjDoC4Skj3Qg2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854881'),
