  ('508922737164842215', 'The Hawks', 1956, 'Western', 'Vicente Oroná', null, 'Pedro Infante, Lilia Prado, Angélica María, Ana Bertha Lepe, José Elías Moreno, Ángel Infante, Angélica María, Hortensia Santoveña', null, 'The story of two half brothers who do not know they are such, who fight over a woman and nearly kill each other. One of them belongs to Los Gavilanes, a group of men who live live hidden and looting to give to the poor. Revenge, love and hate will at the end bring out the truth and everyone will get what he deserves.', 'The story of two half brothers who do not know they are such, who fight over a woman and nearly kill each other. One of them belongs to Los Gavilanes, a group of men who live live hidden and looting to give to the poor. Revenge, love and hate will at the end bring out the truth and everyone will get what he deserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx3INqz4JDW6aYVU8pmH1RAi5D4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102929'),
  ('433205222725553645', 'The Hawks and the Sparrows', 1966, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Carlo Morandi, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Totò, Ninetto Davoli, Femi Benussi, Umberto Bevilacqua, Renato Capogna, Alfredo Leggi, Renato Montalbano, Flaminia Siciliano', 'NR', 'A man and his son take an allegorical stroll through life with a talking bird that spouts social and political philosophy.', 'A man and his son take an allegorical stroll through life with a talking bird that spouts social and political philosophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQiV5CX94SDMGucAIZ8act7VdL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33954'),
  ('180522128557196306', 'The Hazing', 2004, 'Horror', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Brad Dourif, Tiffany Shepis, Nectar Rose, Parry Shen, Phillip Andrew, Jeremy Maxwell, David Tom, Charmaine DeGraté', null, 'The Evil Dead meets Scream as an evil professor, through an ancient staff and a book of incantation, possesses the bodies of a group of fraterity and sorority pledges during a night of "hazing" activities in an abandoned mansion. When the students meet one grisly death after another, the survivors finally realize it''s the professor who is possessing their friends and killing them all off. Now none of them trust each other-- is it their friends or puppets of the professor that they''re hanging with? Somone better figure it out quick... or none of them will make it through the hellish night of The Hazing!', 'The Evil Dead meets Scream as an evil professor, through an ancient staff and a book of incantation, possesses the bodies of a group of fraterity and sorority pledges during a night of "hazing" activities in an abandoned mansion. When the students meet one grisly death after another, the survivors finally realize it''s the professor who is possessing their friends and killing them all off. Now none of them trust each other-- is it their friends or puppets of the professor that they''re hanging with? Somone better figure it out quick... or none of them will make it through the hellish night of The Hazing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyvIDGGtkDzqUeHzUOZY8rl8UTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27619'),
  ('30514022666277670', 'The Head', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Victor Trivas, Georg Krause, Lothar Gündisch', 'Victor Trivas', 'Horst Frank, Karin Kernke, Michel Simon, Helmut Schmid, Paul Dahlke, Dieter Eppler, Kurt Müller-Graf, Christiane Maybach', 'NR', 'A scientist invents a serum that keeps a dog''s head alive after its body dies. When the scientist dies of a heart attack, his crazed assistant cuts off his head and, using the serum, keeps the doctor''s head alive and forces it to help him on an experiment to give his hunchbacked nurse assistant a new body.', 'A scientist invents a serum that keeps a dog''s head alive after its body dies. When the scientist dies of a heart attack, his crazed assistant cuts off his head and, using the serum, keeps the doctor''s head alive and forces it to help him on an experiment to give his hunchbacked nurse assistant a new body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w70cQkZlO22CpLI1uhZX49ck2hE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113128'),
  ('963733146183007448', 'The Head Hunter', 2019, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Jordan Downey, Kevin Stewart', 'Kevin Stewart, Jordan Downey', 'Christopher Rygh, Cora Kaufman, Aisha Ricketts', null, 'On the outskirts of a kingdom, a quiet but fierce medieval warrior protects the realm from monsters and the occult. His gruesome collection of heads is missing only one - the monster that killed his daughter years ago. Driven by a thirst for revenge, he travels wild expanses on horseback. When his second chance arrives, it’s in a way far more horrifying than he ever imagined.', 'On the outskirts of a kingdom, a quiet but fierce medieval warrior protects the realm from monsters and the occult. His gruesome collection of heads is missing only one - the monster that killed his daughter years ago. Driven by a thirst for revenge, he travels wild expanses on horseback. When his second chance arrives, it’s in a way far more horrifying than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol0DSLOIN8Rq1BcWDTsk6NNwas6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553141'),
  ('293656129366139572', 'The Head of the Family', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Nanni Loy, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Nanni Loy, Ruggero Maccari', 'Nino Manfredi, Leslie Caron, Claudine Auger, Ugo Tognazzi, Mario Carotenuto, Antonella Della Porta, Evi Maltagliati, Marisa Solinas', null, 'A man is delighted to hear that his wife is pregnant and he begins to prepare for the wonders of fatherhood. As time progresses along, the family grows larger with each successive child and the father feels his importance in the family has been lessened with all the children. This man''s quiet desperation to hold onto his position is an interesting lesson in the family dynamic and how everyone is an important part of the whole.', 'A man is delighted to hear that his wife is pregnant and he begins to prepare for the wonders of fatherhood. As time progresses along, the family grows larger with each successive child and the father feels his importance in the family has been lessened with all the children. This man''s quiet desperation to hold onto his position is an interesting lesson in the family dynamic and how everyone is an important part of the whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9JIJ7Mo53uBHIsnXTuVRX8pP8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195416'),
