  ('166928227224339465', 'The Heart Is a Lonely Hunter', 1968, 'Drama', 'Robert Ellis Miller, Robert J. Anderson, James Wong Howe', 'Thomas C. Ryan', 'Sondra Locke, Alan Arkin, Laurinda Barrett, Stacy Keach, Chuck McCann, Biff McGuire, Percy Rodriguez, Cicely Tyson', 'G', 'Singer is a deaf-mute whose small world brings him in contact with a young girl, Mick, who cherishes a seemingly hopeless dream of becoming a concert pianist. At first hostile, Mick soon becomes friends with Singer, hoping to enlarge his small world. Three other central characters come to Singer for help also, each of them seeing in him a powerful force.', 'Singer is a deaf-mute whose small world brings him in contact with a young girl, Mick, who cherishes a seemingly hopeless dream of becoming a concert pianist. At first hostile, Mick soon becomes friends with Singer, hoping to enlarge his small world. Three other central characters come to Singer for help also, each of them seeing in him a powerful force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOznrQ5x8IAnsY0P3T7Jz9EEGP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22176'),
  ('95418657594445659', 'The Heart Is a Muscle', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Imran Hamdulay, Kabeer Shaik', 'Imran Hamdulay', 'Keenan Arrison, Melissa De Vries, Loren Loubser, Dean Marais, Ridaa Adams', null, 'At a barbecue, Ryan''s five-year-old son briefly goes missing. Ryan''s violent reaction to this scare sets off a chain of events and unearths secrets from the past. A journey of self-discovery and forgiveness begins.', 'At a barbecue, Ryan''s five-year-old son briefly goes missing. Ryan''s violent reaction to this scare sets off a chain of events and unearths secrets from the past. A journey of self-discovery and forgiveness begins.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fce59a263b1b39bbfcf12d0dccda4128b.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-heart-is-a-muscle'),
  ('158719166508189211', 'The Heart Is Deceitful Above All Things', 2004, 'Drama', 'Eric Alan Edwards, Jennifer Fiedler, Asia Argento', 'Asia Argento, Alessandro Magania', 'Asia Argento, Jimmy Bennett, Jeremy Renner, Winona Ryder, Ornella Muti, Peter Fonda, Dylan Sprouse, Kara Kemp', 'R', 'Young Jeremiah lives in a stable environment with loving foster parents until the day his troubled mother, Sarah, returns to claim him. Jeremiah becomes swept up in his mother''s dangerous world of drugs, seedy hotels, strip joints and revolving lovers. Salvation comes in the form of the boy''s ultrareligious grandparents, but soon Jeremiah''s mother returns. Maternal love binds the pair together on the road until Sarah''s desperate and depraved lifestyle finally consumes her.', 'Young Jeremiah lives in a stable environment with loving foster parents until the day his troubled mother, Sarah, returns to claim him. Jeremiah becomes swept up in his mother''s dangerous world of drugs, seedy hotels, strip joints and revolving lovers. Salvation comes in the form of the boy''s ultrareligious grandparents, but soon Jeremiah''s mother returns. Maternal love binds the pair together on the road until Sarah''s desperate and depraved lifestyle finally consumes her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gf5wCcEvCPhpLFZkY68aLzMNAfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26579'),
  ('863206862182365270', 'The Heart Knows', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marcos Carnevale, Horacio Maira, Adriana Vior', null, 'Benjamín Vicuña, Julieta Díaz, Peto Menahem, Gloria Carrá, Bicho Gómez, Yayo Guridi, Julia Calvo, Veronica Hassan', null, 'After a heart transplant, Manuel feels a personality shift and explores his donor''s life, leading him to meet the widowed Vale and her community.', 'After a heart transplant, Manuel feels a personality shift and explores his donor''s life, leading him to meet the widowed Vale and her community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvKobzhmQ5bmkSw87YzkWYuAXFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327766'),
  ('489576306938771393', 'The Heart of a Nation', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Julien Duvivier, Jules Kruger', 'Julien Duvivier, Marcel Achard, Charles Spaak', 'Raimu, Michèle Morgan, Louis Jouvet, Suzy Prim, Renée Devillers, Georges Biscot, Colette Darfeuil, Harry Krimer', null, 'The story of how the people of Paris cope with the strains and struggles of war, from the siege of the city by the Prussians during the Franco-Prussian War of 1871 to the invasion by the Germans in World War II.', 'The story of how the people of Paris cope with the strains and struggles of war, from the siege of the city by the Prussians during the Franco-Prussian War of 1871 to the invasion by the Germans in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2koQQDGHJtpGGu0dmN6YDNmZAcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76852'),
  ('782413986394951917', 'The Heart of Justice', 1992, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bruno Barreto, Declan Quinn', 'Keith Reddin', 'Eric Stoltz, Jennifer Connelly, William H. Macy, Dennis Hopper, Harris Yulin, Dermot Mulroney, Katherine LaNasa, Vincent Price', null, 'David Leader investigates a seemingly senseless murder, and in the course of it is drawn into the labyrinth of a sinisterly unique wealthy family...', 'David Leader investigates a seemingly senseless murder, and in the course of it is drawn into the labyrinth of a sinisterly unique wealthy family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pfkkmGYocdtrj8FKVlP8ORwQwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49822'),
