  ('502245062917068774', 'The Heart of the World', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Guy Maddin, Javier Cámera, Maiah Levene', 'Guy Maddin', 'Leslie Bais, Caelum Vatnsdal, Shaun Balbar, Greg Klymkiw, Tammy Gillis, Carson Nattrass', null, 'Pure fantasia, a race to save the world from a fatal heart attack, juxtaposed against a love rivalry between two brothers - a mortician and an actor playing Christ - for the heart of a scientist studying the earth''s core.', 'Pure fantasia, a race to save the world from a fatal heart attack, juxtaposed against a love rivalry between two brothers - a mortician and an actor playing Christ - for the heart of a scientist studying the earth''s core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pbfq5zb6FXDE9GxVjfUpooWLIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41571'),
  ('232880014476276535', 'The Heartbreak Agency', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Shirel Peleg, Stephan Burchardt', 'Malte Welding, Antonia Rothe-Liermann', 'Rosalie Thomass, Laurence Rupp, Cora Trube, Jerry Hoffmann, Jakob Schreier, Denise M''Baye, Özgür Karadeniz, Charleen Deetz', 'PG-13', 'When a skeptical journalist reluctantly participates in heartbreak therapy for an article, he ends up opening his heart to his charming therapist.', 'When a skeptical journalist reluctantly participates in heartbreak therapy for an article, he ends up opening his heart to his charming therapist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkLo1lMjqloUqhnAji4YbnSH2vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216268'),
  ('263773107336418869', 'The Heartbreak Kid', 1972, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Elaine May, Owen Roizman', 'Neil Simon', 'Charles Grodin, Cybill Shepherd, Jeannie Berlin, Audra Lindley, Eddie Albert, Mitchell Jason, William Prince, Augusta Dabney', 'PG', 'Three days into his Miami honeymoon with needy and unsophisticated Lila, Lenny meets tall, blonde Kelly. This confirms his fear that he has made a serious mistake and he decides he wants to be with Kelly instead.', 'Three days into his Miami honeymoon with needy and unsophisticated Lila, Lenny meets tall, blonde Kelly. This confirms his fear that he has made a serious mistake and he decides he wants to be with Kelly instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HtYW6taG3paHleY2LOCi44Qqei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40687'),
  ('536230678959768500', 'The Heartbreak Kid', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Jenkins', 'Michael Jenkins, Robert Barrett', 'Claudia Karvan, Alex Dimitriades, Steve Bastoni, Nico Lathouris, George Vidalis, Doris Younane, Louise Mandylor, William McInnes', null, 'Christina (Claudia Karvan) is a school teacher from a wealthy Greek-Australian background, engaged to a lawyer and content with the traditional course of her life. She begins teaching at an inner-city working-class school and she finds her ideas challenged by the students. Involving herself in a campaign by a group of non-anglo students to form a soccer club in a school where the racist PE teacher only supports Australian Rules Football, Christina starts falling in love with aspiring soccer player, 17 year old Nick (Alex Dimitriades). The ensuing affair forces Christina to challenge herself, her family and the culture she lives in. Managing to effectively combine comedy with a refreshing examination of contemporary ethnic relationships in Australia, beautifully acted by a young cast, and insightfully scripted.', 'Christina (Claudia Karvan) is a school teacher from a wealthy Greek-Australian background, engaged to a lawyer and content with the traditional course of her life. She begins teaching at an inner-city working-class school and she finds her ideas challenged by the students. Involving herself in a campaign by a group of non-anglo students to form a soccer club in a school where the racist PE teacher only supports Australian Rules Football, Christina starts falling in love with aspiring soccer player, 17 year old Nick (Alex Dimitriades). The ensuing affair forces Christina to challenge herself, her family and the culture she lives in. Managing to effectively combine comedy with a refreshing examination of contemporary ethnic relationships in Australia, beautifully acted by a young cast, and insightfully scripted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dD9GZRLig0nVeZhwq9euH6zPdVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101310'),
  ('461449264544734301', 'The Heartbreak Kid', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Neil Simon', 'Ben Stiller, Malin Åkerman, Michelle Monaghan, Jerry Stiller, Rob Corddry, Mae LaBorde, Carlos Mencia, Scott Wilson', 'R', 'Eddie, the 40-year-old confirmed bachelor finally says "I do" to the beautiful and sexy Lila. But during their honeymoon in Mexico, the woman of his dreams turns out to be a total nightmare, and the guy who could never pull the trigger realizes he’s jumped the gun.', 'Eddie, the 40-year-old confirmed bachelor finally says "I do" to the beautiful and sexy Lila. But during their honeymoon in Mexico, the woman of his dreams turns out to be a total nightmare, and the guy who could never pull the trigger realizes he’s jumped the gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVWM0L3DqFpNE3Yt49WjAgTQUc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9038'),
  ('586186354818583204', 'The Hearts of Age', 1934, 'Horror', 'Orson Welles, William Vance, William Vance', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, William Vance, Edgerton Paul, Virginia Nicolson', null, 'A surreal silent short composed of symbolic imagery and allegorical tableaux centered on themes of death and mortality.', 'A surreal silent short composed of symbolic imagery and allegorical tableaux centered on themes of death and mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAEQXHR6ewsfypxe19aoyPQVFb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48443'),
  ('1080166233573117071', 'The Heat', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rezo Gigineishvili, Aleksey Kosorotov, Tatyana Bystritskaya', 'Rezo Gigineishvili', 'Aleksey Chadov, Artur Smolyaninov, Konstantin Kryukov, Timur Yunusov, Anastasiya Kochetkova, Agniya Ditkovskite, Deni Dadaev, Alexander Rapoport', null, 'Four good folks from schools got reunion in a summer café on the bank of River Moskva, and they had an unthinkable trouble to deal with check, though one of them is so rich. One by one, a friend left the table to find solution and everyone of them met with different stories. The rich one got caught, ended up in jail for a night with the help from other folks. Friendship never ends...', 'Four good folks from schools got reunion in a summer café on the bank of River Moskva, and they had an unthinkable trouble to deal with check, though one of them is so rich. One by one, a friend left the table to find solution and everyone of them met with different stories. The rich one got caught, ended up in jail for a night with the help from other folks. Friendship never ends...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr3YgraBproRryWsMCRB0F7LgSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71381'),
  ('836288048249319268', 'The Heat', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Feig, Robert D. Yeoman, Matt Rebenkoff', 'Katie Dippold', 'Sandra Bullock, Melissa McCarthy, Demián Bichir, Marlon Wayans, Michael Rapaport, Jane Curtin, Spoken Reasons, Dan Bakkedahl', 'R', 'Uptight and straight-laced, FBI Special Agent Sarah Ashburn is a methodical investigator with a reputation for excellence--and hyper-arrogance. Shannon Mullins, one of Boston P.D.''s "finest," is foul-mouthed and has a very short fuse, and uses her gut instinct and street smarts to catch the most elusive criminals. Neither has ever had a partner, or a friend for that matter. When these two wildly incompatible law officers join forces to bring down a ruthless drug lord, they become the last thing anyone expected: buddies.', 'Uptight and straight-laced, FBI Special Agent Sarah Ashburn is a methodical investigator with a reputation for excellence--and hyper-arrogance. Shannon Mullins, one of Boston P.D.''s "finest," is foul-mouthed and has a very short fuse, and uses her gut instinct and street smarts to catch the most elusive criminals. Neither has ever had a partner, or a friend for that matter. When these two wildly incompatible law officers join forces to bring down a ruthless drug lord, they become the last thing anyone expected: buddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yERBa1y5zNUOTRKQPiDCPIc2fuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136795'),
  ('181626011469862141', 'The Heavenly Body', 1944, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alexander Hall, Bill Lewis', 'Michael Arlen, Walter Reisch', 'William Powell, Hedy Lamarr, James Craig, Fay Bainter, Henry O''Neill, Spring Byington, Robert Sully, Morris Ankrum', 'NR', 'The beautiful wife of a tweedy astronomer becomes convinced that her astrologer''s prediction of a new dream man in her life will come true.', 'The beautiful wife of a tweedy astronomer becomes convinced that her astrologer''s prediction of a new dream man in her life will come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnvEFtyMht2TenJR9TF9As6sPPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33049'),
  ('815013028813124972', 'The Heavenly Kid', 1985, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Steven Poster, Cary Medoway, David Whorf', 'Cary Medoway, Martin Copeland', 'Lewis Smith, Jason Gedrick, Jane Kaczmarek, Beau Dremann, Richard Mulligan, Mark Metcalf, Stephen Gregory, Anne Sawyer', 'PG-13', 'After dying in a car crash, Bobby Fantana is forced to pay for his misdeeds by becoming someone''s guardian angel. He reluctantly agrees to watch over awkward high schooler Lenny Barnes, teaching him how to be cool and confident. As Bobby teaches Lenny, the two form a close bond.', 'After dying in a car crash, Bobby Fantana is forced to pay for his misdeeds by becoming someone''s guardian angel. He reluctantly agrees to watch over awkward high schooler Lenny Barnes, teaching him how to be cool and confident. As Bobby teaches Lenny, the two form a close bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn4ri4OJI29M6wvn2ziXhHd8EuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23614'),
  ('439381050301995157', 'The Heavy Hand of the Law', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mariana Russo, Fernán Mirás', 'Roberto Gispert, Fernán Mirás', 'Paola Barrientos, María Onetto, Darío Grandinetti, Daniel Lambertini, Fernán Mirás, Darío Barassi, Daniel La Rosa, Pacha Rosso', null, 'Gloria is a lawyer who throughout her career has never been able to defend someone who was not guilty. His new client seems to be not so different: a man accused of rape in a small town where no one believes his story.', 'Gloria is a lawyer who throughout her career has never been able to defend someone who was not guilty. His new client seems to be not so different: a man accused of rape in a small town where no one believes his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc3cOZvE0mB5xcxNgedpUUYyvt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451973'),
  ('576460486830322446', 'The Hebrew Hammer', 2003, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonathan Kesselman, Kurt Brabbee', 'Jonathan Kesselman', 'Adam Goldberg, Judy Greer, Andy Dick, Mario Van Peebles, Peter Coyote, Nora Dunn, Sean Whalen, Tony Cox', 'R', 'When a psychotic Santa tries to destroy Chanukah by hypnotizing Jewish children with bootlegged copies of the Christmas classic "It''s a Wonderful Life," it''s up to the Hebrew Hammer to save the day. Together with Mohammed, head of the Kwanzaa Liberation Front, the Hammer takes no prisoners in his quest to hunt down the renegade Santa and make the holiday season safe for all.', 'When a psychotic Santa tries to destroy Chanukah by hypnotizing Jewish children with bootlegged copies of the Christmas classic "It''s a Wonderful Life," it''s up to the Hebrew Hammer to save the day. Together with Mohammed, head of the Kwanzaa Liberation Front, the Hammer takes no prisoners in his quest to hunt down the renegade Santa and make the holiday season safe for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HryOo5fCwJ5QUbNqjYAotgoj9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19187'),
  ('547834028913721252', 'The Heckling Hare', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tex Avery', null, 'Bugs is being chased by hunting dog Willoughby, and outsmarts him at every turn, until the end, where they outsmart the audience together.', 'Bugs is being chased by hunting dog Willoughby, and outsmarts him at every turn, until the end, where they outsmart the audience together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfO3vDW9MPHLbGWsrKuaSVApBqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100365'),
  ('35989966271745270', 'The Hedgehog', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mona Achache, Patrick Blossier, Fabrice Camoin', 'Mona Achache', 'Josiane Balasko, Garance Le Guillermic, Togo Igawa, Anne Brochet, Ariane Ascaride, Wladimir Yordanoff, Sarah Le Picard, Jean-Luc Porraz', null, 'Paloma is a serious and highly articulate but deeply bored 11-year-old who has decided to kill herself on her 12th birthday. Fascinated by art and philosophy, she questions and documents her life and immediate circle, drawing trenchant and often hilarious observations on the world around her. But as her appointment with death approaches, Paloma finally meets some kindred spirits in her building''s grumpy janitor and an enigmatic, elegant neighbor, both of whom inspire Paloma to question her rather pessimistic outlook on life.', 'Paloma is a serious and highly articulate but deeply bored 11-year-old who has decided to kill herself on her 12th birthday. Fascinated by art and philosophy, she questions and documents her life and immediate circle, drawing trenchant and often hilarious observations on the world around her. But as her appointment with death approaches, Paloma finally meets some kindred spirits in her building''s grumpy janitor and an enigmatic, elegant neighbor, both of whom inspire Paloma to question her rather pessimistic outlook on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGV6PP3m871ur8pUFWR3NUysTi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19597'),
  ('820547767920824365', 'The Hedgehog', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Gu Changwei', 'Guo Fangfang, Gu Changwei', 'Ge You, Karry Wang, Li Ping, Liu Weiwei, Geng Le, Zhang Benyu, Zhao Qianzi, Li Qianyi', null, 'How does a “mental patient” live in a normal world? Wang Zhantuan (Ge You) is a strange man in the world, occasionally crazy and eccentric, but uniquely sane. Zhou Zheng (Wang Junkai), a sensitive and silent teenager who is self-absorbed due to his stutter, but has a silent backbone. The two misfits make a big family headache and farce ...... This movie is adapted from the short story “Immortal Disease” written by Zheng Zhi.', 'How does a “mental patient” live in a normal world? Wang Zhantuan (Ge You) is a strange man in the world, occasionally crazy and eccentric, but uniquely sane. Zhou Zheng (Wang Junkai), a sensitive and silent teenager who is self-absorbed due to his stutter, but has a silent backbone. The two misfits make a big family headache and farce ...... This movie is adapted from the short story “Immortal Disease” written by Zheng Zhi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm4qaRxo8zQeznN1TPGIHV7Isfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058027'),
  ('27321406307326599', 'The Hedonists', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Jia Zhangke, Zhao Tao', 'Han Sanming, Liang Jingdong, Yuan Wenqian, Jia Zhangke', null, 'The closure of an unprofitable state-run coal mine in Shanxi, China forces three middle-aged men who worked there to search for employment elsewhere.', 'The closure of an unprofitable state-run coal mine in Shanxi, China forces three middle-aged men who worked there to search for employment elsewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpCrMqwGqpnR1e5DNL48VyTwA1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409101'),
  ('724515882282819361', 'The Heifer', 1985, 'Comedy, War', 'Luis García Berlanga, José Luis García-Berlanga, Mischa Muller', 'Luis García Berlanga, Rafael Azcona', 'Alfredo Landa, Guillermo Montesinos, Santiago Ramos, Juanjo Puigcorbé, José Sacristán, Carles Velat, Eduardo Calvo, Violeta Cela', null, 'During the Spanish Civil War a platoon of mismatched Republican soldiers cross the front-line to steal the bull that the enemy is going to fight on the local holiday of the nearby village. In addition to ruining the Nationalist faction''s celebration they want the animal in order to butcher it and feed their famished troops. They get caught in the process and have to go through a series of funny and pathetic incidents before they can get back to their side.', 'During the Spanish Civil War a platoon of mismatched Republican soldiers cross the front-line to steal the bull that the enemy is going to fight on the local holiday of the nearby village. In addition to ruining the Nationalist faction''s celebration they want the animal in order to butcher it and feed their famished troops. They get caught in the process and have to go through a series of funny and pathetic incidents before they can get back to their side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUJW2FYGgn98DNCbODKUCf5EiBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71799'),
  ('1009529764228375515', 'The Heineken Kidnapping', 2011, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Maarten Treurniet, Giulio Biccari', 'Kees van Beijnum, Maarten Treurniet', 'Rutger Hauer, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, Gijs Naber, Teun Kuilboer, Korneel Evers, Menno van Beekum, Marcel Hensema, Laurie Reijs', null, 'On a cold November day in 1983, beer magnate Alfred Heineken and his chauffeur Ab Doderer are abducted. What follows is the most infamous kidnapping case the Netherlands have ever known.', 'On a cold November day in 1983, beer magnate Alfred Heineken and his chauffeur Ab Doderer are abducted. What follows is the most infamous kidnapping case the Netherlands have ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26VPDxb9HkO6mEvd3G2QBAhTA4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76808'),
  ('137142309253680360', 'The Heir Apparent: Largo Winch', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Jérôme Salle, Denis Rouden, Roberto De Angelis', 'Jérôme Salle, Julien Rappeneau', 'Tomer Sisley, Kristin Scott Thomas, Mélanie Thierry, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Karel Roden, Gilbert Melki, Anne Consigny, Steven Waddington', null, 'After a powerful billionaire is murdered, his secret adoptive son must race to prove his legitimacy, find his father''s killers and stop them from taking over his financial empire.', 'After a powerful billionaire is murdered, his secret adoptive son must race to prove his legitimacy, find his father''s killers and stop them from taking over his financial empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmJU3EEuQP3Ho52FhuiulZ2LKTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14400'),
  ('1116141057689633275', 'The Heiress', 1949, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'William Wyler, Leo Tover, Charles C. Coleman', 'Ruth Goetz, Augustus Goetz', 'Olivia de Havilland, Montgomery Clift, Ralph Richardson, Miriam Hopkins, Vanessa Brown, Mona Freeman, Ray Collins, Betty Linley', 'NR', 'In 1840s New York, the uneventful and boring days of the daughter of a wealthy doctor come to an end when she meets a dashing poorer man — who may or may not be after her inheritance.', 'In 1840s New York, the uneventful and boring days of the daughter of a wealthy doctor come to an end when she meets a dashing poorer man — who may or may not be after her inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oN0zsjw3iS1HaOLoZbmptzrD1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28571'),
  ('951978684708227401', 'The Heiresses', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Martinessi, Luis Armando Arteaga', 'Marcelo Martinessi', 'Ana Brun, Margarita Irún, Ana Ivanova, Nilda Gonzalez, María Martins, Alicia Guerra, Raúl Chamorro, Ana Banks', null, 'After her girlfriend is imprisoned on fraud charges, Chela is forced to face a new reality. Driving for the first time in years, she begins to provide a local taxi service to a group of elderly wealthy ladies. As Chela settles into her new life, she encounters the much younger Angy, forging a fresh and invigorating new connection.', 'After her girlfriend is imprisoned on fraud charges, Chela is forced to face a new reality. Driving for the first time in years, she begins to provide a local taxi service to a group of elderly wealthy ladies. As Chela settles into her new life, she encounters the much younger Angy, forging a fresh and invigorating new connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS94bbXmDKIDIoLgBrGJn3Jbwgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499152'),
  ('214925814773274431', 'The Heirloom', 2005, 'Drama, Horror', 'Leste Chen, Kwan Pung-Leung', 'Dorian Li', 'Terri Kwan, Jason Chang, Chang Chia-hui, Tender Huang, Lu Yi-ching, Cheng Kuo-Cheng, Lin Ching-Ching, Kuo Mei-Wen', null, 'A Taiwanese man returns to the island after years abroad when he inherits a house; when he and his fiancé move in, strange things start to happen.', 'A Taiwanese man returns to the island after years abroad when he inherits a house; when he and his fiancé move in, strange things start to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbPn50Sv881pFBl0RPJIGgb5ZXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65044'),
  ('504628344962193832', 'The Heirs', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jorge Hernández Aldana', 'Jorge Hernández Aldana, Gabriel Nuncio', 'Mario Escalante, Veronica Falcón, Máximo Hollander, Sebastián Aguirre, Germán Bracco, Úrsula Pruneda, Mónica del Carmen', null, 'Teenagers’ leisure at full swing: a group of friends spend their holidays at parties, having sex, boozing, and partaking in any adventure that brings them a boost of adrenaline. As they use violence for entertainment and to fulfill their authoritarian fantasies, their adventures will show the cracks and the collapse of the perfect world they live in.', 'Teenagers’ leisure at full swing: a group of friends spend their holidays at parties, having sex, boozing, and partaking in any adventure that brings them a boost of adrenaline. As they use violence for entertainment and to fulfill their authoritarian fantasies, their adventures will show the cracks and the collapse of the perfect world they live in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9ra2oRy3UP1Cm3xeUCkWcflWKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317936'),
  ('198867558260632932', 'The Heist', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'Felipe Cazals, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'José Revueltas', 'Manuel Ojeda, Salvador Sánchez, José Carlos Ruiz, María Rojo, Delia Casanova, Luz Cortázar, Álvaro Carcaño, Ana Ofelia Murguía', null, 'In Mexico City''s infamous Lecumberri prison, three drug-addicted convicts celebrate getting drugs from one of their the mothers. They are found out and locked up in the "apando," the dreaded punishment cell. Protests over the treatment of those held in the cell lead to a bloody confrontation.', 'In Mexico City''s infamous Lecumberri prison, three drug-addicted convicts celebrate getting drugs from one of their the mothers. They are found out and locked up in the "apando," the dreaded punishment cell. Protests over the treatment of those held in the cell lead to a bloody confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9WfrIUZEV5BjMJnBQkuJX8Ixir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182207'),
