  ('1125421472087260631', 'The Hell of ''63', 2009, 'Drama', 'Steven de Jong', 'Jean Ummels, Maarten Lebens, Steven de Jong', 'Chantal Janzen, Cas Jansen, Chris Zegers, Cees Geel, Chava Voor in ''t Holt, Lourens van den Akker, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Pierre Bokma', null, 'When extreme weather suddenly hits the Netherlands in 1963, a 120-mile tour skating event taking place on natural ice forces its contestants to contend with life-threatening race conditions.', 'When extreme weather suddenly hits the Netherlands in 1963, a 120-mile tour skating event taking place on natural ice forces its contestants to contend with life-threatening race conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1p3Idi1lOaJ162A7eZk1cOcTkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35840'),
  ('952963749492515347', 'The Hell''s Gate', 1989, 'Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, Sandro Mancori', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Barbara Cupisti, Pietro Genuardi, Lorenzo Majnoni, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Gaetano Russo, Andrea Damiano, Mario Luzzi, Paul Müller', null, 'As part of a science experiment, a man has spent a record-breaking length of time alone down a hole, but an hour before he''s due to re-emerge, something goes wrong and his colleagues have to go in to rescue him.', 'As part of a science experiment, a man has spent a record-breaking length of time alone down a hole, but an hour before he''s due to re-emerge, something goes wrong and his colleagues have to go in to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leHEru6tito2BdNLMCzGmBNgFhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28540'),
