  ('171530531830612546', 'The Hellcats', 1968, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robert F. Slatzer, Gil Hubbs', 'Robert F. Slatzer, Tony Huston', 'Ross Hagen, Dee Duffy, Sharyn Kinzie, Del ''Sonny'' West, Robert F. Slatzer, Tony Lorea, Eric Lidberg, Shannon Summers', 'R', 'The brother and fiancee of a dead policeman infiltrate a female-led biker gang to uncover his murderer.', 'The brother and fiancee of a dead policeman infiltrate a female-led biker gang to uncover his murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKavmw50IwxQIlEUKMcQRY3BhNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31125'),
