  ('652001069338605394', 'The Help', 2011, 'Drama', 'Tate Taylor, Stephen Goldblatt, Donald Sparks', 'Tate Taylor', 'Emma Stone, Viola Davis, Bryce Dallas Howard, Octavia Spencer, Jessica Chastain, Ahna O''Reilly, Allison Janney, Anna Camp', 'PG-13', 'Aibileen Clark is a middle-aged African-American maid who has spent her life raising white children and has recently lost her only son; Minny Jackson is an African-American maid who has often offended her employers despite her family''s struggles with money and her desperate need for jobs; and Eugenia "Skeeter" Phelan is a young white woman who has recently moved back home after graduating college to find out her childhood maid has mysteriously disappeared. These three stories intertwine to explain how life in Jackson, Mississippi revolves around "the help"; yet they are always kept at a certain distance because of racial lines.', 'Aibileen Clark is a middle-aged African-American maid who has spent her life raising white children and has recently lost her only son; Minny Jackson is an African-American maid who has often offended her employers despite her family''s struggles with money and her desperate need for jobs; and Eugenia "Skeeter" Phelan is a young white woman who has recently moved back home after graduating college to find out her childhood maid has mysteriously disappeared. These three stories intertwine to explain how life in Jackson, Mississippi revolves around "the help"; yet they are always kept at a certain distance because of racial lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kmfoWWEc9Vtyuaf9v5VipRgdjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50014'),
  ('816962718307031700', 'The Hen That Laid the Golden Eggs', 1905, 'Fantasy', 'Gaston Velle', null, null, null, 'This has more of a clear narrative than most of the films in the set although it’s still quite odd and random compared to today’s films. There are some effectively surreal and creepy sequences in this imaginative short, such as the devil’s face appearing in an egg and spewing coins as well as the finale where our protagonist is sent to an egg-filled hell.', 'This has more of a clear narrative than most of the films in the set although it’s still quite odd and random compared to today’s films. There are some effectively surreal and creepy sequences in this imaginative short, such as the devil’s face appearing in an egg and spewing coins as well as the finale where our protagonist is sent to an egg-filled hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XNFJcMtsoTilxLQghbbiwrd2oQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205250'),
  ('69368389403489579', 'The Henpecked Duck', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc', null, 'Mrs. Duck sues Daffy for divorce in Judge Porky Pig''s courtroom, charging her husband with losing their egg in an abortive magic trick.', 'Mrs. Duck sues Daffy for divorce in Judge Porky Pig''s courtroom, charging her husband with losing their egg in an abortive magic trick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJpxISqSM0qL1c7TMwSy0rsp6wO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236521'),
  ('1101838350559517129', 'The Hep Cat', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'A cat-about-town fancies himself such an irresistible "hunk" he momentarily resembles Victor Mature. His wooing of a cute kitten gets derailed by a prankster dog using a cat hand puppet to trap him.', 'A cat-about-town fancies himself such an irresistible "hunk" he momentarily resembles Victor Mature. His wooing of a cute kitten gets derailed by a prankster dog using a cat hand puppet to trap him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yHNtcAtAY4BrO0zysQsyYAPkFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100369'),
  ('606418583014152968', 'The Herb of the Rat', 2009, 'Horror, Drama', 'Júlio Bressane, Walter Carvalho', 'Júlio Bressane, Rosa Dias', 'Selton Mello, Alessandra Negrini', null, 'The names of the characters are pronouns. She is a teacher, with his father dead just three days ago. Faced with this situation, He intends to take care of her while He is alive. This is the beginning of an odd relationship.', 'The names of the characters are pronouns. She is a teacher, with his father dead just three days ago. Faced with this situation, He intends to take care of her while He is alive. This is the beginning of an odd relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iEhNYpK8uuX3IV7JWVwBCSUtf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52247'),
  ('671823065082128412', 'The Herd', 1979, 'Drama', 'Zeki Ökten, Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Tarık Akan, Melike Demirağ, Tuncel Kurtiz, Levent İnanır, Yaman Okay, Erol Demiröz, Şener Kökkaya, Savaş Yurttaş', null, 'Because of a local blood feud, a peasant family decides to sell its sheep - a most precious commodity - in far away Ankara. During their long train ride, bribes must be paid to petty officials, sheep are stolen or die in the packed, airless wagons, and the sick wife of one of the family''s sons becomes deathly ill.', 'Because of a local blood feud, a peasant family decides to sell its sheep - a most precious commodity - in far away Ankara. During their long train ride, bribes must be paid to petty officials, sheep are stolen or die in the packed, airless wagons, and the sick wife of one of the family''s sons becomes deathly ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Yb9BEfdcWvdbV9O7DNUWU1bidz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84014'),
  ('1032548245501531650', 'The Herdsman', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Huang Shuqin, Xie Jin', null, 'Xie Jin, Zhu Shimao, Cong Shan, Liu Qiong, Niu Ben, Lei Zhongqian, Qi Mengshi, Chen Xiaoyi', null, 'In 1980, Xu Jingshan, a wealthy Chinese-American businessman returns to China to find his son, Xu Lingjun, whom he had abandoned over 30 years earlier. Labeled a rightist because of his capitalist father, Lingjun has been forced to live as a humble herdsman on the grasslands. His bitter life has been transformed by a happy marriage to the wise and beautiful Xiuzhi, and more recently by his rehabilitation by the Party. When he goes to Beijing for their reunion, he discovers his father wants him to work for his chemical company in San Francisco. Lingjun tells the story of his life to his father, as he ponders his future.', 'In 1980, Xu Jingshan, a wealthy Chinese-American businessman returns to China to find his son, Xu Lingjun, whom he had abandoned over 30 years earlier. Labeled a rightist because of his capitalist father, Lingjun has been forced to live as a humble herdsman on the grasslands. His bitter life has been transformed by a happy marriage to the wise and beautiful Xiuzhi, and more recently by his rehabilitation by the Party. When he goes to Beijing for their reunion, he discovers his father wants him to work for his chemical company in San Francisco. Lingjun tells the story of his life to his father, as he ponders his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QynwqPXb0zwvp8coA1hpfNpxEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255973'),
  ('111211255067925446', 'The Heretics', 2017, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Chad Archibald, Jeff Maher, Kristen Calibaba', 'Jayme Laforest, Chad Archibald', 'Nina Kiri, Ry Barrett, Jorja Cadence, Will King, Nina Richmond, Austin Duffy, Sid McMillan, Colin Price', null, 'A young girl is abducted by a man, who claims that a cult is hunting her. His goal is to protect her until sunrise but while restrained, the young girl falls deathly ill. While her friends and family search for her, the source of her illness becomes more and more apparent. She’s not sick…she’s changing.', 'A young girl is abducted by a man, who claims that a cult is hunting her. His goal is to protect her until sunrise but while restrained, the young girl falls deathly ill. While her friends and family search for her, the source of her illness becomes more and more apparent. She’s not sick…she’s changing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYVgdFjmPxD7L0KwHLwnLh2cWUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438736'),
  ('29005141562910351', 'The Hero', 1966, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Subrata Mitra', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Uttam Kumar, Sharmila Tagore, Bireswar Sen, Somen Bose, Nirmal Ghosh, Premangshu Bose, Sumita Sanyal, Ranjit Sen', null, 'Arindam, a matinee idol, is going by train to collect an acting award. On the train, he is confronted by Aditi, a journalist who somewhat unwillingly starts to take his interview. Arindam, won over by Aditi''s naivete, starts to disclose his past, his fears and his secrets.', 'Arindam, a matinee idol, is going by train to collect an acting award. On the train, he is confronted by Aditi, a journalist who somewhat unwillingly starts to take his interview. Arindam, won over by Aditi''s naivete, starts to disclose his past, his fears and his secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXWxCRJwmw3NQYRpQHvwsrzaqfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112999'),
  ('809974434932782923', 'The Hero', 1994, 'Animation, Drama', 'Carlos Carrera', 'Carlos Carrera', null, null, 'In a subway station, a man watches a girl acting strange.', 'In a subway station, a man watches a girl acting strange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnAHoKhw7D0xhq6yJd0UuxnKBvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127824'),
  ('543401537966854711', 'The Hero', 2017, 'Drama', 'Brett Haley, Rob Givens', 'Brett Haley, Marc Basch', 'Sam Elliott, Laura Prepon, Nick Offerman, Krysten Ritter, Katharine Ross, Doug Cox, Max Gail, Jackie Joyner', 'R', 'Lee, a former Western film icon, is living a comfortable existence lending his golden voice to advertisements and smoking weed. After receiving a lifetime achievement award and unexpected news, Lee reexamines his past, while a chance meeting with a sardonic comic has him looking to the future.', 'Lee, a former Western film icon, is living a comfortable existence lending his golden voice to advertisements and smoking weed. After receiving a lifetime achievement award and unexpected news, Lee reexamines his past, while a chance meeting with a sardonic comic has him looking to the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7on6mTMVrE893E0mSwO4ZRAAD8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425751'),
  ('113784426110279729', 'The Hero', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yury Korobeynikov, Karen Oganesyan', 'Nikolai Kulikov', 'Alexander Petrov, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Vladimir Mashkov, Marina Petrenko, Konstantin Lavronenko, Anastasiya Todorescu, Yan Alabushev, Artem Grigoryev', null, 'An alumni of the Russian Foreign Intelligence Service who is settled in Europe gets a call from his father who was considered dead and he sets on a mission to find him with the help of his first love.', 'An alumni of the Russian Foreign Intelligence Service who is settled in Europe gets a call from his father who was considered dead and he sets on a mission to find him with the help of his first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkELCEpJblyUVvsElKkYCk5cTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575075'),
  ('773060006116029801', 'The Hero: Love Story of a Spy', 2003, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Anil Sharma', 'Shaktimaan Talwar', 'Sunny Deol, Preity Zinta, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Amrish Puri, Kabir Bedi, Parvin Dabas, Rajpal Yadav, Yvonne Maverick', null, 'Arun Khanna is a spy for the Indian government whose aid is enlisted to stop ISI Chief Ishak Khan. Khan is trying to build a nuclear bomb with which he can liberate Kashmir from the Indians. A battle of wits ensues. When Khan detonates a bomb at Khanna''s engagement party to a fellow spy, Khanna''s resolve is only strengthened. Now not only does he have to fight Khan, but he also has to track down his missing fiancee.', 'Arun Khanna is a spy for the Indian government whose aid is enlisted to stop ISI Chief Ishak Khan. Khan is trying to build a nuclear bomb with which he can liberate Kashmir from the Indians. A battle of wits ensues. When Khan detonates a bomb at Khanna''s engagement party to a fellow spy, Khanna''s resolve is only strengthened. Now not only does he have to fight Khan, but he also has to track down his missing fiancee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1tNXXHZwPRCiP94P7sB0NeNSRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271677'),
  ('408823197002301846', 'The Heroes', 1994, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Giacomo Lesina, Carlo Vanzina, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Enrico Vanzina, Piero De Bernardi', 'Claudio Amendola, Ricky Memphis, Monica Bellucci, Tony Sperandeo, Pier Maria Cecchini, Ugo Conti, Mirella Falco, Paolo Lombardi', null, 'Roman TV technicians Fabio and Enzo have been unable to find decent jobs. They decide to crack a safe at a jewelry in Milan. To get the layout of the store, they enlist a beautiful but unsophisticated young woman, Deborah. To find underground access to the store, they get help from a sewage worker. An obese trapeze artist is called for disarm the store alarms. The clever Mrs. Motta, old hotelier, is also involved. Will they succeed?', 'Roman TV technicians Fabio and Enzo have been unable to find decent jobs. They decide to crack a safe at a jewelry in Milan. To get the layout of the store, they enlist a beautiful but unsophisticated young woman, Deborah. To find underground access to the store, they get help from a sewage worker. An obese trapeze artist is called for disarm the store alarms. The clever Mrs. Motta, old hotelier, is also involved. Will they succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et2YAFGIpWRPhKx4oRSPwNmvXcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82358'),
  ('230851562984482182', 'The Heroes of Evil', 2015, 'Drama', 'Zoe Berriatúa', 'Zoe Berriatúa', 'Emilio Palacios, Jorge Clemente, Beatriz Medina, Macarena Gómez, Olivia Baglivi, Nacho Coronado, Paula Soldevila', null, 'Three teenagers, brought together from bullying, indulge in petty theft, sex and drugs. They inevitably realize they can resort to violence to take revenge on everyone who has humiliated them: students, teachers and other outcasts. One of them escalates to killing, and desires to kill again. Anyone can become his next victim. The other two face the question: should they resort to violence to stop the killings?', 'Three teenagers, brought together from bullying, indulge in petty theft, sex and drugs. They inevitably realize they can resort to violence to take revenge on everyone who has humiliated them: students, teachers and other outcasts. One of them escalates to killing, and desires to kill again. Anyone can become his next victim. The other two face the question: should they resort to violence to stop the killings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldOsl90vZre32wx8skZYaEs7tqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331359'),
  ('152842989860740590', 'The Heroes of Telemark', 1965, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Anthony Mann, Robert Krasker, Egil S. Woxholt', 'Ivan Moffat, Ben Barzman', 'Kirk Douglas, Richard Harris, Ulla Jacobsson, Michael Redgrave, David Weston, Anton Diffring, Eric Porter, Mervyn Johns', null, 'Set in German-occupied Norway, resistance fighter Knut Straud enlists the reluctant physicist Rolf Pedersen in an effort to destroy the German heavy water production plant in rural Telemark.', 'Set in German-occupied Norway, resistance fighter Knut Straud enlists the reluctant physicist Rolf Pedersen in an effort to destroy the German heavy water production plant in rural Telemark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKGD7tR8mj02IyQbacmBxE5RIae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16850'),
  ('553694176866896298', 'The Heroic Ones', 1970, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Ku Feng, Chan Sing, Chin Han, Pao Chia-Wen, Lo Wai, James Nam Seok-Hoon', 'NR', 'A Mogul king decides to take stealthy action to help overpower his greatest rivals. He chooses nine out thirteen of his loyal generals to embark on the mission. However, jealously amongst them sparks a treacherous family feud that could lead to catastrophic consequences for all involved.', 'A Mogul king decides to take stealthy action to help overpower his greatest rivals. He chooses nine out thirteen of his loyal generals to embark on the mission. However, jealously amongst them sparks a treacherous family feud that could lead to catastrophic consequences for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An6KCvlkKvSknllL8gzgsW6E3tB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36261'),
  ('393040162941275357', 'The Heroic Trio', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Johnnie To, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Lo Kim-Wah', 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Michelle Yeoh, Maggie Cheung, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, James Pax, Yen Shi-Kwan, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai', null, 'While one tough woman with an invisible robe has stolen 18 babies for her powerful master, two other tough women and the cops try to stop her.', 'While one tough woman with an invisible robe has stolen 18 babies for her powerful master, two other tough women and the cops try to stop her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilYFTXzy04qP5rZoQtWfz5JYH9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43636'),
  ('117292574564525983', 'The Heroics', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aurélien Fauchet, Cécile Remy-Boutang, Maxime Roy', 'Maxime Roy, François Créton', 'François Créton, Richard Bohringer, Ariane Ascaride, Clotilde Courau, Roméo Créton, Clara Ponsot, Patrick d''Assumçao, Chad Chenouga', null, 'Michel is an eternal kid who dreams only of motorcycles and hangs out with his big son Léo and his friends. At fifty, he has to deal with the baby he just had with his ex, and fights not to make the same mistakes and be a good guy.', 'Michel is an eternal kid who dreams only of motorcycles and hangs out with his big son Léo and his friends. At fifty, he has to deal with the baby he just had with his ex, and fights not to make the same mistakes and be a good guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YE9an8YESdq0XWQL3Qh4zVygkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:789578'),
  ('218404325150292497', 'The Heroin Busters', 1977, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Giovanni Bergamini, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Massimo De Rita, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Fabio Testi, David Hemmings, Sherry Buchanan, Wolfango Soldati, Massimo Vanni, Romano Puppo, Angelo Ragusa, Sergio Ruggeri', null, 'Drug use in the city of Rome is at an all-time high. Children score from dealers in front of their schools, mules waltz straight through airport security, and Interpol''s main man, Mike Hamilton, is at his wits'' end. Fed up to the back teeth with the local police force''s incompetence, his only hope is to rely on one of his own men, Fabio, an officer so deep undercover that no-one but Hamilton knows who he really is. Even as Fabio gains the trust of cartel leader Gianni, however, the dealers are edging ever closer to the truth, and when his cover is blown, the hunter becomes the hunted as Fabio finds himself alone in a desperate fight to survive.', 'Drug use in the city of Rome is at an all-time high. Children score from dealers in front of their schools, mules waltz straight through airport security, and Interpol''s main man, Mike Hamilton, is at his wits'' end. Fed up to the back teeth with the local police force''s incompetence, his only hope is to rely on one of his own men, Fabio, an officer so deep undercover that no-one but Hamilton knows who he really is. Even as Fabio gains the trust of cartel leader Gianni, however, the dealers are edging ever closer to the truth, and when his cover is blown, the hunter becomes the hunted as Fabio finds himself alone in a desperate fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5vQaJ2z5cWLhEmxjaKFWhfBDue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68863'),
  ('611539551131183606', 'The Heroine', 1973, 'Action, Crime', 'Chu Mu, Ngai Hoi-Fung', 'Ngai Hoi-Fung, Chu Mu', 'Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Yuen Qiu, Lee Man-Tai, Hu Chin, Chiang Nan, Helena Law Lan, Fung Ngai, Wong Sam', 'NR', 'Incriminating evidence against a gang is left in a cab when a gang member dies in it. The gang chases the innocent cab driver, who receives help from the dead gangster''s sister - a tough police woman.', 'Incriminating evidence against a gang is left in a cab when a gang member dies in it. The gang chases the innocent cab driver, who receives help from the dead gangster''s sister - a tough police woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LfkWHskx9ESxdt5NbxzLeEfWBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38034'),
  ('663194610402165716', 'The Heron and the Crane', 1974, 'Animation', 'Yuri Norstein, Aleksandr Zhukovskiy', 'Roman Kachanov, Yuri Norstein', 'Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy', null, 'Animated short about a love between a heron and a crane.', 'Animated short about a love between a heron and a crane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exczBuiSq7FTMtvfdIzmBHwXUK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89905'),
  ('194671896087841327', 'The Hex', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Reine Swart', 'Reine Swart', 'Coco Lloyd, Mari Molefe van Heerden, Mary-Ann Barlow, Christopher Jaftha, Hungani Ndlovu, Rowan-Raine Pretorius, Stephanie Sandows, André Velts', null, 'A grieving British girl unravels her murdered mother''s secrets connected to a South African witch doctor''s curse. She wants to put an end to this haunting hex by traveling to South Africa, but instead it casts her deeper into sinister depths.', 'A grieving British girl unravels her murdered mother''s secrets connected to a South African witch doctor''s curse. She wants to put an end to this haunting hex by traveling to South Africa, but instead it casts her deeper into sinister depths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b2d6i3LZHRaGUwIGcw4h1Wecz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718022'),
  ('771528254577345242', 'The Hexer', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Marek Brodzki', null, 'Michał Żebrowski, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Maciej Kozłowski, Grażyna Wolszczak, Maciej Łagodziński, Ewa Wiśniewska, Jerzy Nowak, Kinga Ilgner', null, 'A heroic fantasy based on the famous novels by Polish writer Andrzej Sapkowski, "The Sword of Destiny" and "The Last Wish". This film immerses us in a world inhabited by kings and knights, princesses and sorcerers, priests and magicians, where fire-breathing dragons guard untold treasures, and human greed leads to an endless struggle for power, cruelty, bloodshed, and violence. And this world has its own superheroes - fearless witchers, people with magical powers. Their mission is to protect the human race from any misfortune. The witcher Geralt of Rivia must find the young princess Ciri, kidnapped by enemies. Only her return to the small kingdom of Cintra, which was attacked by aggressors, can restore peace and order there. The brave witcher sets off on a journey, long, distant and deadly.', 'A heroic fantasy based on the famous novels by Polish writer Andrzej Sapkowski, "The Sword of Destiny" and "The Last Wish". This film immerses us in a world inhabited by kings and knights, princesses and sorcerers, priests and magicians, where fire-breathing dragons guard untold treasures, and human greed leads to an endless struggle for power, cruelty, bloodshed, and violence. And this world has its own superheroes - fearless witchers, people with magical powers. Their mission is to protect the human race from any misfortune. The witcher Geralt of Rivia must find the young princess Ciri, kidnapped by enemies. Only her return to the small kingdom of Cintra, which was attacked by aggressors, can restore peace and order there. The brave witcher sets off on a journey, long, distant and deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzyGALA6gI5IeaDLeULzs96jmIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57278'),
  ('891347739012924197', 'The Hi-Lo Country', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Stephen Frears, Oliver Stapleton', 'Walon Green', 'Billy Crudup, Woody Harrelson, Penélope Cruz, Patricia Arquette, Cole Hauser, John Diehl, Sam Elliott, Enrique Castillo', 'R', 'An intimate story of the enduring bond of friendship between two hard-living men, set against a sweeping backdrop: the American West, post-World War II, in its twilight. Pete and Big Boy are masters of the prairie, but ultimately face trickier terrain: the human heart.', 'An intimate story of the enduring bond of friendship between two hard-living men, set against a sweeping backdrop: the American West, post-World War II, in its twilight. Pete and Big Boy are masters of the prairie, but ultimately face trickier terrain: the human heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bC63XzaUEWJArFUQFKwUy77lZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1363'),
  ('697412602056969366', 'The Hick Chick', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', 'Heck Allen', 'Sara Berner, Daws Butler, Stan Freberg, Paul Frees', null, 'In this triangle drama a country chicken chooses between a country rooster and a city rooster.', 'In this triangle drama a country chicken chooses between a country rooster and a city rooster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1avz2Bzl9aBo6SKob4OQOWX7Ba9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87210'),
  ('777400866152496116', 'The Hidden', 1987, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jack Sholder, Jacques Haitkin, Benita Allen', 'Jim Kouf', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Michael Nouri, Ed O''Ross, Claudia Christian, William Boyett, Chris Mulkey, Clarence Felder, Clu Gulager', 'R', 'When average, law-abiding citizens suddenly turn to a life of hedonistic behavior and violent crime, Detective Tom Beck is tasked with helping young FBI agent Lloyd Gallagher determine the cause.', 'When average, law-abiding citizens suddenly turn to a life of hedonistic behavior and violent crime, Detective Tom Beck is tasked with helping young FBI agent Lloyd Gallagher determine the cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tImKQZsw5rx5jyr70Uc3Pxym0LJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12476'),
  ('1033232021305490623', 'The Hidden Blade', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoji Yamada, Mutsuo Naganuma, Kinichi Hanawa', 'Yoshitaka Asama, Yoji Yamada', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Takako Matsu, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Tomoko Tabata, Chieko Baisho, Kunie Tanaka, Sachiko Mitsumoto', 'R', 'Set in 19th Century Japan a young samurai who finds himself in love with a farm girl leaves his home to begin a new life. He has to take stock of his new life when he is put to the test and ordered to kill a traitor who just happens to be his dearest friend.', 'Set in 19th Century Japan a young samurai who finds himself in love with a farm girl leaves his home to begin a new life. He has to take stock of his new life when he is put to the test and ordered to kill a traitor who just happens to be his dearest friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6eOTaZJqWG9lEFWfK9jJqd03Qo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34019'),
  ('993324377879904337', 'The Hidden Child', 2021, 'Drama', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Roberto Andò', 'Roberto Andò, Franco Marcoaldi', 'Silvio Orlando, Roberto Herlitzka, Giuseppe Pirozzi, Lino Musella, Imma Villa, Sasà Striano, Tonino Taiuti, Alfonso Postiglione', null, 'Gabriele Santoro is a Professor of Pianoforte at the Music Conservatory San Pietro a Majella who lives in a working-class area of the city. One morning, while shaving his beard, the postman buzzes at the intercom to tell him he has a package. Gabriele opens the door and, before greeting him, runs to rinse his face. In that short space of time, a ten-year-old child slips into his apartment and hides away. “The maestro” – as he’s called in his neighbourhood – only notices the stowaway late at night. And when he sees him, he recognises the intruder as Ciro, a child who lives with his parents and siblings on the top floor of his building. When asked why he has fled his home, Ciro refuses to speak. Nevertheless, the maestro instinctively decides to hide him in his home, setting Ciro’s enemies a uniquely difficult challenge.', 'Gabriele Santoro is a Professor of Pianoforte at the Music Conservatory San Pietro a Majella who lives in a working-class area of the city. One morning, while shaving his beard, the postman buzzes at the intercom to tell him he has a package. Gabriele opens the door and, before greeting him, runs to rinse his face. In that short space of time, a ten-year-old child slips into his apartment and hides away. “The maestro” – as he’s called in his neighbourhood – only notices the stowaway late at night. And when he sees him, he recognises the intruder as Ciro, a child who lives with his parents and siblings on the top floor of his building. When asked why he has fled his home, Ciro refuses to speak. Nevertheless, the maestro instinctively decides to hide him in his home, setting Ciro’s enemies a uniquely difficult challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bOVuU1xyWGh6IYQkZEgrkYF4Ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743873'),
  ('346416784066646511', 'The Hidden Face', 2011, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrés Baiz', 'Andrés Baiz, Hatem Khraiche', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Martina García, Clara Lago, Alexandra Stewart, María Soledad Rodríguez, Marcela Mar, Humberto Dorado, Julio Pachón', null, 'A Spanish orchestra conductor deals with the mysterious disappearance of his girlfriend.', 'A Spanish orchestra conductor deals with the mysterious disappearance of his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk6D07ntxMgzqArCq1ufHSvxZvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80184'),
  ('876550900256916392', 'The Hidden Fortress', 2001, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Paul Drouin, Anne Sirois, Roger Cantin', 'Roger Cantin', 'Matthew Dupuis, Roxane Gaudette-Loiseau, Jérôme Leclerc-Couture, Jean-Philippe Debien, Charli Arcouette-Martineau, Xavier Dolan, Laurent-Christophe De Ruelle, Jeremy Gagnon', null, 'Just like every other summer, the children of two camp-sites play "war". But, this summer it takes an interesting turn.', 'Just like every other summer, the children of two camp-sites play "war". But, this summer it takes an interesting turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZWC1PbI3AneaXi2HsINAnpqiTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130405'),
  ('669163344999796642', 'The Hidden Fox', 2022, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Qiao Lei, Simu Feng', null, 'Zhao Huawei, Chen Yusi, Ray Lui, Chunyu Shanshan, Chen Zihan, Yang Yi, Zhao Zichong, Fu Jia', null, 'Ten years ago, in order to snatch the mysterious treasure left by Dashing King Li Zicheng, the wicked designed a decisive battle between the hero Miao Renfeng and the treasure guardian Hu. Hu and Miao died tragically, but the treasure map disappeared. In ten years, they have never given up the search for treasure. Finally, the treasure map reappeared, and the eight evil men gathered together and set off to Feihu Mountain.', 'Ten years ago, in order to snatch the mysterious treasure left by Dashing King Li Zicheng, the wicked designed a decisive battle between the hero Miao Renfeng and the treasure guardian Hu. Hu and Miao died tragically, but the treasure map disappeared. In ten years, they have never given up the search for treasure. Finally, the treasure map reappeared, and the eight evil men gathered together and set off to Feihu Mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwQyH6yID8VqYfcmvZLIaV0Jkjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000197'),
  ('236141888587964286', 'The Hidden Hand', 1942, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Benjamin Stoloff, Henry Sharp', 'Anthony Coldeway, Raymond L. Schrock', 'Craig Stevens, Elisabeth Fraser, Julie Bishop, Willie Best, Frank Wilcox, Cecil Cunningham, Ruth Ford, Milton Parsons', null, 'Eccentric wealthy old woman Lorinda Channing uses her insane brother, John Channing, to help her frighten their greedy relatives after her money.', 'Eccentric wealthy old woman Lorinda Channing uses her insane brother, John Channing, to help her frighten their greedy relatives after her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny9Tn5da6CY6f1hPiSYyEKqSlpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74631'),
  ('292793756409274906', 'The Hidden II', 1993, 'Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Seth Pinsker', 'Seth Pinsker', 'Raphael Sbarge, Kate Hodge, Jovin Montanaro, Christopher Murphy, Michael Welden, Michael A. Nickles, Tony DiBenedetto, Tom Tayback', null, 'The alien criminal from the first movie is dead, but he left a few eggs which are hatching now. The good alien, who still inhabits Tom Beck''s body, has been waiting just in case this happened. Unfortunately, his presence in the body has taken a terrible toll on it, draining it of life energy. Additionally relations with Beck''s daughter Juliet (now a cop) have deteriorated. But when the killing starts again, they will need to work together to stop the new generation of aliens.', 'The alien criminal from the first movie is dead, but he left a few eggs which are hatching now. The good alien, who still inhabits Tom Beck''s body, has been waiting just in case this happened. Unfortunately, his presence in the body has taken a terrible toll on it, draining it of life energy. Additionally relations with Beck''s daughter Juliet (now a cop) have deteriorated. But when the killing starts again, they will need to work together to stop the new generation of aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAUZdTQcONNwq5X14HhrewuzMLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68163'),
  ('1086326279232059750', 'The Hidden Life of Trees', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jan Haft, Jörg Adolph', 'Jörg Adolph', 'Peter Wohlleben', null, 'When Peter Wohlleben published his book "The Hidden Life of Trees" in 2015, he quickly entered bestseller lists. The forester wrote vividly about his experience that trees are able to communicate with each other, a thesis explored here.', 'When Peter Wohlleben published his book "The Hidden Life of Trees" in 2015, he quickly entered bestseller lists. The forester wrote vividly about his experience that trees are able to communicate with each other, a thesis explored here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orfxBna1DTVOAWpnHGMBoJy1IXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662155'),
  ('460446872679359071', 'The Hideaway', 1991, 'Drama', 'Niels Gråbøl, Jacob Banke Olesen', 'Per Daumiller, Niels Gråbøl', 'Kasper Tuxen, Allan Winther, Niels Skousen, Kristine Horn, Steen Svare, Ditte Gråbøl, Kim Jansson, Nikolaj Thide', null, '12-year-old Martin finds the going tough. Manhood is approaching, but so far mostly as aches and pain. His mother''s men friends are definitely nothing like the father he does not have. So some kind of male bonding is inevitable when he meets Funder, a juvenile droput on the run from the police. There is also girl-friend Rikke to consider. Who needs Martin the most? Coming of age isn''t so easy.', '12-year-old Martin finds the going tough. Manhood is approaching, but so far mostly as aches and pain. His mother''s men friends are definitely nothing like the father he does not have. So some kind of male bonding is inevitable when he meets Funder, a juvenile droput on the run from the police. There is also girl-friend Rikke to consider. Who needs Martin the most? Coming of age isn''t so easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIuKVIteM7AFTluBavKQ8NFKkkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60471'),
  ('82677980128600880', 'The Hideous Sun Demon', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tom Boutross, Robert Clarke, Tom Miller', 'E.S. Seeley Jr.', 'Robert Clarke, Patricia Manning, Nan Peterson, Patrick Whyte, Fred La Porta, Peter Similuk, William White, Robert Garry', 'NR', 'After exposure to radiation, an atomic research scientist finds himself changing into a murderous, lizard-like creature every time he is exposed to sunlight.', 'After exposure to radiation, an atomic research scientist finds himself changing into a murderous, lizard-like creature every time he is exposed to sunlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maXa8CxQnMFn2RZC8hBOeexrrYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41038'),
  ('92780581092647350', 'The Hideout', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pupi Avati, Roberto Farina, Justin Gebhardt', 'Pupi Avati', 'Laura Morante, Rita Tushingham, Burt Young, Treat Williams, Yvonne Sciò, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Sydne Rome, Angela Goodwin', null, 'A mystery-thriller about an Italian woman who moves to Davenport to open a restaurant. After her husband commits suicide, she spends fifteen years recovering at a Minnesota mental hospital. When she builds herself up enough to begin another restaurant, she discovers that a murder took place there fifty years earlier. She decides to investigate and finds a secret plot.', 'A mystery-thriller about an Italian woman who moves to Davenport to open a restaurant. After her husband commits suicide, she spends fifteen years recovering at a Minnesota mental hospital. When she builds herself up enough to begin another restaurant, she discovers that a murder took place there fifty years earlier. She decides to investigate and finds a secret plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C2D5HH9aJzIOdQZXpqQcTPSVul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29951'),
  ('204936985425116778', 'The Hiding Place', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'James F. Collier', 'Allan Sloane, Lawrence Holben', 'Julie Harris, Jeannette Clift, Arthur O''Connell, Pamela Sholto, Robert Rietti, Tom van Beek, Nigel Hawthorne, John Gabriel', null, 'Corrie and Betsie ten Boom are middle-aged sisters working in their father''s watchmaker shop in pre-World War II Holland. Their uneventful lives are disrupted with the coming of the Nazis. Suspected of hiding Jews and caught breaking rationing rules, they are sent to a concentration camp, where their Christian faith keeps them from despair and bitterness.', 'Corrie and Betsie ten Boom are middle-aged sisters working in their father''s watchmaker shop in pre-World War II Holland. Their uneventful lives are disrupted with the coming of the Nazis. Suspected of hiding Jews and caught breaking rationing rules, they are sent to a concentration camp, where their Christian faith keeps them from despair and bitterness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFQIDuXKTdowE2XDsTBycPXSO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37720'),
  ('284032473189473725', 'The High and the Flighty', 1956, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Salesman Daffy Duck comes upon a farm, the site of Foghorn Leghorn''s ongoing feud with the barnyard dog, and proceeds to sell Foghorn and the dog contraptions to continue their violent, mutual heckling.', 'Salesman Daffy Duck comes upon a farm, the site of Foghorn Leghorn''s ongoing feud with the barnyard dog, and proceeds to sell Foghorn and the dog contraptions to continue their violent, mutual heckling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAgM5qGnBfO3pe0VZGhVH9Ys38a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188754'),
  ('341804553347549896', 'The High and the Mighty', 1954, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Archie Stout, William A. Wellman, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'John Wayne, Claire Trevor, Laraine Day, Robert Stack, Jan Sterling, Phil Harris, Robert Newton, David Brian', 'NR', 'Dan Roman is a veteran pilot haunted by a tragic past. Now relegated to second-in-command cockpit assignments he finds himself on a routine Honolulu-to-San Francisco flight - one that takes a terrifying suspense-building turn when disaster strikes high above the Pacific Ocean at the point of no return.', 'Dan Roman is a veteran pilot haunted by a tragic past. Now relegated to second-in-command cockpit assignments he finds himself on a routine Honolulu-to-San Francisco flight - one that takes a terrifying suspense-building turn when disaster strikes high above the Pacific Ocean at the point of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/il7ZUf1ys5ElbafW2VAEnX5NWD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17761'),
  ('189863153856540619', 'The High Bright Sun', 1964, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Ernest Steward, Ralph Thomas', 'Ian Stuart Black, Bryan Forbes', 'Dirk Bogarde, George Chakiris, Susan Strasberg, Denholm Elliott, Nigel Stock, Joseph Fürst, George Pastell, Grégoire Aslan', null, 'This story of love and espionage focuses on political turmoil as a small nation struggles to free itself from colonial rule, and one man tries to serve both justice and his own heart.', 'This story of love and espionage focuses on political turmoil as a small nation struggles to free itself from colonial rule, and one man tries to serve both justice and his own heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QvjkYPdtEfmKmYgiI7oacKZRyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138881'),
  ('712243249143546777', 'The High Crusade', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Klaus Knoesel, Holger Neuhäuser, Wolfgang Aichholzer', 'Robert G. Brown, Jürgen Egger', 'John Rhys-Davies, Rick Overton, Michael Des Barres, Catherine Punch, Patrick Brymer, Debbie Lee Carrington, Rinaldo Talamonti, Frank Kanakusen', null, 'A Monty Pythonesque tale of a band of Crusaders who find themselves in possession of an alien ship and the alien to pilot it. Armed with the means to conquer the Holy Land, the naive Crusaders set off on a grand crusade, only to find themselves not in Jerusalem, but at the mercy of an entire alien world.', 'A Monty Pythonesque tale of a band of Crusaders who find themselves in possession of an alien ship and the alien to pilot it. Armed with the means to conquer the Holy Land, the naive Crusaders set off on a grand crusade, only to find themselves not in Jerusalem, but at the mercy of an entire alien world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k0VY2vmwD9kpMlId0AmLBnnjRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10446'),
  ('1098234580865883708', 'The High Note', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Nisha Ganatra, Jason McCormick, Richard L. Fox', 'Flora Greeson', 'Dakota Johnson, Tracee Ellis Ross, Ice Cube, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Bill Pullman, June Diane Raphael, Eugene Cordero, Uttera Singh', 'PG-13', 'Set in the dazzling world of the LA music scene comes the story of Grace Davis, a superstar whose talent, and ego, have reached unbelievable heights. Maggie is Grace’s overworked personal assistant who’s stuck running errands, but still aspires to her childhood dream of becoming a music producer. When Grace’s manager presents her with a choice that could alter the course of her career, Maggie and Grace come up with a plan that could change their lives forever.', 'Set in the dazzling world of the LA music scene comes the story of Grace Davis, a superstar whose talent, and ego, have reached unbelievable heights. Maggie is Grace’s overworked personal assistant who’s stuck running errands, but still aspires to her childhood dream of becoming a music producer. When Grace’s manager presents her with a choice that could alter the course of her career, Maggie and Grace come up with a plan that could change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHsu8swJSgqDrsPiu7adBjOPLlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606679'),
  ('706042206837011139', 'The High schoolers', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nicolae Corjos', 'George Șovu', 'Ștefan Bănică Jr., Oana Sîrbu, Mihai Constantin, Cesonia Postelnicu, Tudor Petruț, Ion Caramitru, Tamara Buciuceanu-Botez, Sebastian Papaiani', null, 'The love story of two students in the tenth grade. Mihai is a provincial who reached in a Bucharest high school where his passion for philosophy and mathematics will be eclipsed by love and Dana is a chess enthusiast. Their romance is full of naturalness, but will go through many trials.', 'The love story of two students in the tenth grade. Mihai is a provincial who reached in a Bucharest high school where his passion for philosophy and mathematics will be eclipsed by love and Dana is a chess enthusiast. Their romance is full of naturalness, but will go through many trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YqG0u4Qqi9FyvTtqIm1o9iZMx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141331'),
  ('1034127349823407299', 'The High Sign', 1921, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Elgin Lessley', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Bartine Burkett, Charles Dorety, Joe Roberts, Al St. John, Ingram B. Pickett', null, 'Buster is thrown off a train near an amusement park. There he gets a job in a shooting gallery run by the Blinking Buzzards mob. Ordered to kill a businessman, he winds up protecting the man and his daughter by outfitting their home with trick devices.', 'Buster is thrown off a train near an amusement park. There he gets a job in a shooting gallery run by the Blinking Buzzards mob. Ordered to kill a businessman, he winds up protecting the man and his daughter by outfitting their home with trick devices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIrAPIj3EnRGcp7IiaRrntgcMaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46510'),
