  ('432820239552065103', 'The Highway', 1983, 'Drama', 'Viktor Tregubovich, Eduard Rozovsky, Natalya Levitina', 'Viktor Tregubovich', 'Kirill Lavrov, Vsevolod Kuznetsov, Marina Tregubovich, Pavel Semenikhin, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Ivan Agafonov, Igor Dmitriev', null, 'The film takes place during one day of operation of a railway line, the capacity of which is lower than necessary. A disaster occurs: a passenger train crashes into a tank train, the driver''s assistant is killed, and traffic on the section is delayed. The film explores the patterns that led to the accident.', 'The film takes place during one day of operation of a railway line, the capacity of which is lower than necessary. A disaster occurs: a passenger train crashes into a tank train, the driver''s assistant is killed, and traffic on the section is delayed. The film explores the patterns that led to the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hxODftgixrsuvg1uBG3KUTQiQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342624'),
  ('881770943212357961', 'The Highwayman', 2022, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Steve Lawson, Jon O''Neill', 'Steve Lawson', 'Ciaron Davies, Steven Dolton, Stacey Gough, Tom Hendryk, Mollie Hindle-Pérez, Melvyn Rawlinson, Morgan Rees-Davies, Francesca Louise White', null, 'Famed highway robber Dick Turpin finds himself on the run in the English countryside having accidentally kidnapped the Earl of Pembroke''s feisty daughter, Elizabeth. As her fiance Winthroppe attempts to track them down, Elizabeth begins to fall for the dashing highwayman, leaving Turpin with no choice but to face off against Winthroppe in a fight for Elizabeth''s heart - and her fortune.', 'Famed highway robber Dick Turpin finds himself on the run in the English countryside having accidentally kidnapped the Earl of Pembroke''s feisty daughter, Elizabeth. As her fiance Winthroppe attempts to track them down, Elizabeth begins to fall for the dashing highwayman, leaving Turpin with no choice but to face off against Winthroppe in a fight for Elizabeth''s heart - and her fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVEyBmldMAfKBOIjuuLnXxFThiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973509'),
