  ('734235886978526099', 'The Hills Have Eyes Part 2', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Wes Craven, John Callas, Tony Cecere', 'Wes Craven', 'Michael Berryman, Kevin Spirtas, John Bloom, Janus Blythe, Tamara Stafford, Colleen Riley, Willard E. Pugh, Penny Johnson Jerald', 'R', 'A motocross team on their way to trial a new super-fuel head out across the desert lead by Rachel, who, unbeknownst to the rest of the group, is a survivor of the cannibal clan which menaced the Carter family several years before.', 'A motocross team on their way to trial a new super-fuel head out across the desert lead by Rachel, who, unbeknownst to the rest of the group, is a survivor of the cannibal clan which menaced the Carter family several years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pD7Qn4TmuDb7664cu2a2hD7kQg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18477'),
  ('1109369197362279935', 'The Hills of Disorder', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Aloysio Raulino, Alziro Barbosa, Fernando Coster', 'Andrea Tonacci, Sydney Possuelo, Wellington Figueiredo', 'Carapirú, Sydney Possuelo, Tiramukõn, Camairú, Magadãn, Amãparãn, Wellington Figueiredo, Luiz Antonio Pereira da Silva', null, 'Carapiru is a member of one of Brazil''s remaining indigenous peoples, living in harmony with nature and making wise use of the local flora and fauna. But Carapiru is suddenly forced to fend for himself and flees into the nearby rain forest, building a new life for himself with the help some sympathetic settlers. However, after rebuilding his life Carapiru is uprooted once again, this time by government agents. A expressive visual storytelling in this study of the native peoples of Brazil in the 21st century.', 'Carapiru is a member of one of Brazil''s remaining indigenous peoples, living in harmony with nature and making wise use of the local flora and fauna. But Carapiru is suddenly forced to fend for himself and flees into the nearby rain forest, building a new life for himself with the help some sympathetic settlers. However, after rebuilding his life Carapiru is uprooted once again, this time by government agents. A expressive visual storytelling in this study of the native peoples of Brazil in the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjpCuaTuL3XpxVVvoqWhqxR2Rm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173722'),
  ('650676922194353123', 'The Hills Run Red', 1966, 'Action, Western, Drama', 'Carlo Lizzani', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Thomas Hunter, Henry Silva, Dan Duryea, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Gianna Serra, Nando Gazzolo, Loris Loddi, Geoffrey Copleston', null, 'After the Civil War ends, two soldiers return home with a cache of stolen money. They are caught by Union troops. One escapes, but the other is sent to prison for five years. When he gets out and goes home, he finds that his wife has died in poverty because his partner kept all the money, and is now a major power in the area with an army of deadly gunmen to back him up.', 'After the Civil War ends, two soldiers return home with a cache of stolen money. They are caught by Union troops. One escapes, but the other is sent to prison for five years. When he gets out and goes home, he finds that his wife has died in poverty because his partner kept all the money, and is now a major power in the area with an army of deadly gunmen to back him up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AteKL0zhMdMYHZqcGZZ6lA7ZSl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95019'),
  ('534282254031521071', 'The Hills Run Red', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dave Parker, Vessela Bannzurkova, Silviya Asenova', 'John Dombrow', 'Sophie Monk, Tad Hilgenbrink, William Sadler, Janet Montgomery, Alex Wyndham, Ewan Bailey, Mike Straub, Hristo Mitzkov', 'R', 'A group of young horror fans go searching for a film that mysteriously vanished years ago but instead find that the demented killer from the movie is real, and he''s thrilled to meet fans who will die gruesomely for his art.', 'A group of young horror fans go searching for a film that mysteriously vanished years ago but instead find that the demented killer from the movie is real, and he''s thrilled to meet fans who will die gruesomely for his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odPuG8mbDF12uMAQ5K4LuebtyUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24001'),
  ('832232629423255451', 'The Hillside Strangler', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chuck Parello, John Pirozzi', 'Stephen Johnston, Chuck Parello', 'Allison Lange, Nicholas Turturro, C. Thomas Howell, Zarah Little, Jennifer Tisdale, Kent King, Aimee Brooks, Natasha Melnick', 'R', 'Kenneth Bianchi is a security guard whose attempts to become a police officer are repeatedly thwarted. He moves to California to live with his cousin Angelo and dates a string of women, becoming increasingly preoccupied with sex. Eventually the cousins decide to start an escort agency. After violently killing a prostitute they thought had betrayed them, Kenneth and Angelo begin committing a series of crimes that become a media sensation.', 'Kenneth Bianchi is a security guard whose attempts to become a police officer are repeatedly thwarted. He moves to California to live with his cousin Angelo and dates a string of women, becoming increasingly preoccupied with sex. Eventually the cousins decide to start an escort agency. After violently killing a prostitute they thought had betrayed them, Kenneth and Angelo begin committing a series of crimes that become a media sensation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/161tBJNqn3KH0rIdrhT7VJbOaYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24196'),
  ('134772606127346800', 'The Himalayas', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Lee Suk-hoon, Park Min-woo, Kim Tae-sung', 'Suo Jieun-min', 'Hwang Jung-min, Jung Woo, Cho Seong-ha, Kim In-kwon, Ra Mi-ran, Jeong Gyu-su, Jeon Bae-soo, Jeong Jae-heon', null, 'Based on true events, renowned mountaineer Um Hong-gil sets out on a mission to Everest to retrieve his late junior climber''s body and faces the greatest challenge of his life.', 'Based on true events, renowned mountaineer Um Hong-gil sets out on a mission to Everest to retrieve his late junior climber''s body and faces the greatest challenge of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ySHI3GAwxrhqgTdRwYvpTh3tO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374111'),
  ('536855696762987724', 'The Hindenburg', 1975, 'History, Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Wise, Robert Surtees', 'Nelson Gidding', 'George C. Scott, Anne Bancroft, William Atherton, Roy Thinnes, Gig Young, Burgess Meredith, Charles Durning, Richard Dysart', 'PG', 'Colonel Franz Ritter, a former hero pilot now working for military intelligence, is assigned to the great Hindenburg airship as its chief of security. As he races against the clock to uncover a possible saboteur aboard the doomed zeppelin he finds that any of the passengers and crew could be the culprit.', 'Colonel Franz Ritter, a former hero pilot now working for military intelligence, is assigned to the great Hindenburg airship as its chief of security. As he races against the clock to uncover a possible saboteur aboard the doomed zeppelin he finds that any of the passengers and crew could be the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCCi7FqEGITMJVCs0LV5Z7qnRJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17599'),
