  ('184889074368298180', 'The Hired Hand', 1971, 'Western', 'Peter Fonda, Hawk Koch, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Alan Sharp', 'Peter Fonda, Warren Oates, Verna Bloom, Robert Pratt, Severn Darden, Rita Rogers, Ann Doran, Ted Markland', 'R', 'Harry Collings returns home to his farm after drifting with his friend, Arch. His wife, who had given up on him, reluctantly allows him to stay, and soon believes that all will be well again. But then Harry has to make a difficult decision regarding his loyalties and priorities.', 'Harry Collings returns home to his farm after drifting with his friend, Arch. His wife, who had given up on him, reluctantly allows him to stay, and soon believes that all will be well again. But then Harry has to make a difficult decision regarding his loyalties and priorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qE1fgjbtQinQXvSA2ADnOj5SRdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42522'),
