  ('861516116191965945', 'The Hobbit', 1977, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass', 'Romeo Muller', 'Orson Bean, John Huston, Hans Conried, Richard Boone, Theodore Gottlieb, Otto Preminger, Cyril Ritchard, Paul Frees', 'PG', 'The story follows the adventures of Bilbo Baggins, a diminutive creative who resides in a place called Middle-Earth before he is compelled to go on a quest to find a treasure buried deep in the heart of the Lonely Mountain.', 'The story follows the adventures of Bilbo Baggins, a diminutive creative who resides in a place called Middle-Earth before he is compelled to go on a quest to find a treasure buried deep in the heart of the Lonely Mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ohvyMPhvjftLrM6S6Ljr6QrL0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362'),
  ('137122022419160269', 'The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey', 2012, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Peter Jackson, Andrew Lesnie, Joshua Barraud', 'Fran Walsh, Philippa Boyens, Peter Jackson', 'Martin Freeman, Ian McKellen, Richard Armitage, James Nesbitt, Ken Stott, Sylvester McCoy, Barry Humphries, Dean O''Gorman', 'PG-13', 'Bilbo Baggins, a hobbit enjoying his quiet life, is swept into an epic quest by Gandalf the Grey and thirteen dwarves who seek to reclaim their mountain home from Smaug, the dragon.', 'Bilbo Baggins, a hobbit enjoying his quiet life, is swept into an epic quest by Gandalf the Grey and thirteen dwarves who seek to reclaim their mountain home from Smaug, the dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHA9Fc37VmpUA5UncTxxo3rTGVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49051'),
  ('1012613781624336678', 'The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Peter Jackson, Andrew Lesnie, Leon Woud', 'Peter Jackson, Philippa Boyens, Guillermo del Toro', 'Ian McKellen, Martin Freeman, Richard Armitage, Orlando Bloom, Evangeline Lilly, Luke Evans, Lee Pace, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'PG-13', 'Following Smaug''s attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor''s mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo''s hands.', 'Following Smaug''s attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor''s mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo''s hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122917'),
  ('84932704454998953', 'The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug', 2013, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Peter Jackson, Andrew Lesnie, Carolynne Cunningham', 'Philippa Boyens, Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh', 'Ian McKellen, Martin Freeman, Richard Armitage, Benedict Cumberbatch, Orlando Bloom, Evangeline Lilly, Lee Pace, Luke Evans', 'PG-13', 'The Dwarves, Bilbo and Gandalf have successfully escaped the Misty Mountains, and Bilbo has gained the One Ring. They all continue their journey to get their gold back from the Dragon, Smaug.', 'The Dwarves, Bilbo and Gandalf have successfully escaped the Misty Mountains, and Bilbo has gained the One Ring. They all continue their journey to get their gold back from the Dragon, Smaug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQYiXsheRCDBA39DOrmaw1aSpbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57158'),
  ('194679344675572911', 'The Hobbit: The Fabulous Journey of Mr. Bilbo Baggins', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Vladimir Latyshev, Aleksandr Degtyarev', 'Evgeniy Veltistov, Tatyana Yakovleva', 'Mikhail Danilov, Zinoviy Gerdt, Ivan Krasko, Anatoliy Ravikovich, Aleksey Kozhevnikov, Nikolay Gavrilov, Georgiy Korolchuk, Mikhail Kuznetsov', null, 'Author J. R. R. Tolkien (Zinovij Gerdt) tells the story of Bilbo Baggins, a quiet and enjoyable hobbit, whose life is turned upside down when he decides to join the wizard Gandalf and a company of thirteen dwarves in an attempt to regain a treasure stolen from the latter. Soviet television movie adaptation of "The Hobbit".', 'Author J. R. R. Tolkien (Zinovij Gerdt) tells the story of Bilbo Baggins, a quiet and enjoyable hobbit, whose life is turned upside down when he decides to join the wizard Gandalf and a company of thirteen dwarves in an attempt to regain a treasure stolen from the latter. Soviet television movie adaptation of "The Hobbit".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNPDrtrsFtKftlt7U6ORmzVn5ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211047'),
  ('350335563399146937', 'The Hobbit: The Quest for Cantal', 2013, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Léo Pons', null, 'Arthur Rey, Nicolas Loche, Brian Senaud, Alexandre Loubeyre, Mattis Applequist, Alexis Richard, Rémi Verrier', null, 'Parody of The Lord of the Rings and The Hobbit trilogies designed to promote the French region of Cantal.', 'Parody of The Lord of the Rings and The Hobbit trilogies designed to promote the French region of Cantal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gbVLTYj5DPvYLsRH0UcaqatyCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231900'),
  ('321372162079093229', 'The Hobbit: The Return of the King of Cantal', 2015, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Léo Pons', null, 'Marc Cassot, Benoît Allemane, Arthur Rey, Roger Claude Delaunay', null, 'Cantal is attacked by Puy-de-Dôme. King Thorin cannot face them alone. Accompanied by Bilbon the Hobbit and Gandalf the Wizard, he must roam Cantal in search of allies. Will the villagers of Boisset come to their aid? Will the Lord of Marcolès rally behind their cause? And on which side does the Lord of Aurillac truly stand?', 'Cantal is attacked by Puy-de-Dôme. King Thorin cannot face them alone. Accompanied by Bilbon the Hobbit and Gandalf the Wizard, he must roam Cantal in search of allies. Will the villagers of Boisset come to their aid? Will the Lord of Marcolès rally behind their cause? And on which side does the Lord of Aurillac truly stand?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzvnyLZjsI6RN5qETxb4YuI4FlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357073'),
  ('459443028145845558', 'The Hockey Champ', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King, Lloyd L. Richardson, Harry Teitel', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald shows his nephews the moves that won him his hockey trophy. But the boys have a few moves of their own.', 'Donald shows his nephews the moves that won him his hockey trophy. But the boys have a few moves of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQhV6c3YB6EPVe7oQF3lM34q17E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68051'),
  ('1133554969701428939', 'The Holcroft Covenant', 1985, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Dennis C. Lewiston, Gerry Fisher', 'John Hopkins, Edward Anhalt, George Axelrod', 'Michael Caine, Anthony Andrews, Victoria Tennant, Lilli Palmer, Mario Adorf, Michael Lonsdale, Richard Münch, Alexander Kerst', 'R', 'A man who was a confidant of Adolf Hitler dies and leaves a fortune to make amends for his Nazi past—but his son has to search the world to find it.', 'A man who was a confidant of Adolf Hitler dies and leaves a fortune to make amends for his Nazi past—but his son has to search the world to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQtcX6Y1fBAxZL3dm2BGN0lIaEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35201'),
  ('412017930108989153', 'The Hold-Up', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Eva Lesmes', 'Luis Marías', 'Adriana Ozores, Malena Alterio, Maribel Verdú, Carmen Maura, Juan Gea, Jaime Pujol, Joaquín Climent, Antonia Martínez', null, 'Lola''s a single mom, broke, working as a janitor and maid. Silvia is pregnant, and her lover (her boss) won''t leave his wife. Maite, newly a widow, discovers she''s penniless but wants to maintain appearances and give her daughter a fancy wedding, and Pecholata, a punk kid living in a youth center, will soon be turned out on the streets. Lola, who cleans a bank every morning, decides to rob it, convincing the others to join her: they''ll use replica guns, dress as men, take Silvia hostage, and all will be smooth. But things go awry, including the fact that Lola''s ex, Gustavo, is a cop. Desperation may be the mother of invention - and a corrupt bank manager its father.', 'Lola''s a single mom, broke, working as a janitor and maid. Silvia is pregnant, and her lover (her boss) won''t leave his wife. Maite, newly a widow, discovers she''s penniless but wants to maintain appearances and give her daughter a fancy wedding, and Pecholata, a punk kid living in a youth center, will soon be turned out on the streets. Lola, who cleans a bank every morning, decides to rob it, convincing the others to join her: they''ll use replica guns, dress as men, take Silvia hostage, and all will be smooth. But things go awry, including the fact that Lola''s ex, Gustavo, is a cop. Desperation may be the mother of invention - and a corrupt bank manager its father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n4TFjmI9kawpTimlxPtwETFlvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225691'),
  ('705246866477437882', 'The Holdovers', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexander Payne, Rod Smith, John Nasraway', 'David Hemingson', 'Paul Giamatti, Dominic Sessa, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Carrie Preston, Brady Hepner, Ian Dolley, Jim Kaplan, Michael Provost', 'R', 'A curmudgeonly instructor at a New England prep school is forced to remain on campus during Christmas break to babysit the handful of students with nowhere to go. Eventually, he forms an unlikely bond with one of them — a damaged, brainy troublemaker — and with the school’s head cook, who has just lost a son in Vietnam.', 'A curmudgeonly instructor at a New England prep school is forced to remain on campus during Christmas break to babysit the handful of students with nowhere to go. Eventually, he forms an unlikely bond with one of them — a damaged, brainy troublemaker — and with the school’s head cook, who has just lost a son in Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VHSzNBTwxV8vh7wylo7O9CLdac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840430'),
  ('201553560855534044', 'The Hole', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'John Hubley', null, 'George Mathews, Dizzy Gillespie', null, 'Two men discuss the nature of accidents and the possibility of nuclear war.', 'Two men discuss the nature of accidents and the possibility of nuclear war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KFGgW66BsZGqnrh9xZSaO7lhhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234523'),
  ('194140091920769013', 'The Hole', 1997, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kim Sung-hong', 'Yeo Hye-yeong', 'Choi Ji-woo, Park Yong-woo, Yun So-jeong, Mun Su-jin, Ku Hye-ryeong', null, 'Newlywed, Su-jin, believes that nothing will interfere with her happiness or come between herself and her husband, Dong-woo. That is, until she meets her mother-in-law. Dong-woo is devoted to his mother and now that they are all living together, it isn''t long before Su-jin notices something unnatural about the amount of affection between the two. When confronted, Dong-woo promises his new wife that she will be his priority. However, he must spend a lot of time away from home because of his job granting the mother-in-law sufficient time to plot how to eliminate her rival.', 'Newlywed, Su-jin, believes that nothing will interfere with her happiness or come between herself and her husband, Dong-woo. That is, until she meets her mother-in-law. Dong-woo is devoted to his mother and now that they are all living together, it isn''t long before Su-jin notices something unnatural about the amount of affection between the two. When confronted, Dong-woo promises his new wife that she will be his priority. However, he must spend a lot of time away from home because of his job granting the mother-in-law sufficient time to plot how to eliminate her rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHjKkiAlJla9skNKE2Ctw0IhPOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267399'),
  ('648407504898853889', 'The Hole', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Pi-ying Yang', 'Yang Kuei-mei, Lee Kang-sheng, Miao Tian, Hui-Chin Lin, Lin Kun-huei, Tong Hsiang-Chu, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Daphne Han', null, 'In the final days of the year 1999, almost everyone in Taiwan has died from a strange plague that ravished the island. As rain pours down relentlessly, a single man is stuck with an unfinished plumbing job and a hole in his floor. This results in a very odd relationship with the woman who lives below him.', 'In the final days of the year 1999, almost everyone in Taiwan has died from a strange plague that ravished the island. As rain pours down relentlessly, a single man is stuck with an unfinished plumbing job and a hole in his floor. This results in a very odd relationship with the woman who lives below him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsuvfxyCxlnkzc49hGMUmPDibCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47060'),
  ('231908493743216667', 'The Hole', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Nick Hamm, Denis Crossan', 'Ben Court, Caroline Ip', 'Thora Birch, Desmond Harrington, Keira Knightley, Laurence Fox, Embeth Davidtz, Steven Waddington, Emma Griffiths Malin, Kelly Hunter', 'R', 'Four teenagers at a British private school secretly uncover and explore the depths of a sealed underground hole created decades ago as a possible bomb shelter.', 'Four teenagers at a British private school secretly uncover and explore the depths of a sealed underground hole created decades ago as a possible bomb shelter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5aMoI6AZLJzUoNbjMj0P60EYMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467'),
  ('449201949887449200', 'The Hole', 2009, 'Thriller, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Theo van de Sande, Joe Dante, Doris Deutschmann', 'Mark L. Smith', 'Chris Massoglia, Nathan Gamble, Haley Bennett, Teri Polo, Bruce Dern, Quinn Lord, John DeSantis, Doug Chapman', 'PG-13', 'After moving into a new neighbourhood, brothers Dane &amp; Lucas and their neighbour Julie discover a bottomless hole in the basement of their home. They find that once the hole is exposed, evil is unleashed. With strange shadows lurking around every corner and nightmares coming to life, they are forced to come face to face with their darkest fears to put an end to the mystery of THE HOLE.', 'After moving into a new neighbourhood, brothers Dane &amp; Lucas and their neighbour Julie discover a bottomless hole in the basement of their home. They find that once the hole is exposed, evil is unleashed. With strange shadows lurking around every corner and nightmares coming to life, they are forced to come face to face with their darkest fears to put an end to the mystery of THE HOLE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQMxsrsVtpB2D2n01nUqgOMmSWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45650'),
  ('205924779005656006', 'The Hole', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Daniele Ciprì, Daniele Ciprì, Eleni Vaporidis', 'Alessandra Acciai, Massimo Gaudioso, Daniele Ciprì', 'Sergio Castellitto, Rocco Papaleo, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Jacopo Cullin, Ivan Franěk, Teco Celio, Sonia Gessner, Lucia Ocone', null, 'Ambulance-chasing lawyers takes on the case of a convicted murderer who, just being released after doing 27 years in jail, claims he was innocent.', 'Ambulance-chasing lawyers takes on the case of a convicted murderer who, just being released after doing 27 years in jail, claims he was innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUJlxDaeVbsy7CbzEN6WNi6RIjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293476'),
  ('648209733823606091', 'The Hole Idea', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'A scientist invents the portable hole, only to have a thief steal his samples to go on a crime spree.', 'A scientist invents the portable hole, only to have a thief steal his samples to go on a crime spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UZIgw7KYi6YYocIMrICc2OMuY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226800'),
  ('353111152403546095', 'The Hole in the Fence', 2021, 'Drama', 'Joaquín del Paso, Estefania Antuñano, Salvador Guerrero', 'Lucy Pawlak, Joaquín del Paso', 'Valeria Lamm, Lucciano Kurti, Jacek Poniedziałek, Yubah Ortega, Santiago Barajas Hamue, Eric David Walker, Enrique Lascurain, Diego Lozano', null, 'As every year, the Los Pinos school, a prestigious school of the confessional type, sends its students on retreat to the countryside. Under the watchful eye of teachers and priests, the children are led on the path of their physical and moral development. Through the gaze of several middle and upper class teenagers, the film shows how their upbringing affects the future of society itself.', 'As every year, the Los Pinos school, a prestigious school of the confessional type, sends its students on retreat to the countryside. Under the watchful eye of teachers and priests, the children are led on the path of their physical and moral development. Through the gaze of several middle and upper class teenagers, the film shows how their upbringing affects the future of society itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmGuT8BOzBFFVzv752PUV6UgVqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854554'),
  ('721774487694746244', 'The Hole in the Ground', 2019, 'Horror', 'Lee Cronin, Tom Comerford', 'Lee Cronin, Stephen Shields', 'Seána Kerslake, James Quinn Markey, Simone Kirby, Steve Wall, Eoin Macken, Sarah Hanly, James Cosmo, Kati Outinen', 'R', 'Trying to escape her broken past, Sarah O’Neill is building a new life on the fringes of a backwood rural town with her young son Chris. A terrifying encounter with a mysterious neighbour shatters her fragile security, throwing Sarah into a spiralling nightmare of paranoia and mistrust, as she tries to uncover if the disturbing changes in her little boy are connected to an ominous sinkhole buried deep in the forest that borders their home.', 'Trying to escape her broken past, Sarah O’Neill is building a new life on the fringes of a backwood rural town with her young son Chris. A terrifying encounter with a mysterious neighbour shatters her fragile security, throwing Sarah into a spiralling nightmare of paranoia and mistrust, as she tries to uncover if the disturbing changes in her little boy are connected to an ominous sinkhole buried deep in the forest that borders their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DMRJzH9AwpSN5D19cExAB9vDZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484437'),
  ('991079454145438623', 'The Holiday', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nancy Meyers, Dean Cundey, Darren J. Perry', 'Nancy Meyers', 'Cameron Diaz, Kate Winslet, Jude Law, Jack Black, Eli Wallach, Edward Burns, Rufus Sewell, Miffy Englefield', 'PG-13', 'Two women, one American and one British, swap homes at Christmastime following bad breakups. Each woman finds romance with a local man but realizes that the imminent return home may end the relationship.', 'Two women, one American and one British, swap homes at Christmastime following bad breakups. Each woman finds romance with a local man but realizes that the imminent return home may end the relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n26GUumac5MrzpJiv0DPI7MMIUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1581'),
  ('44930778851606739', 'The Holiday Calendar', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Benison, Bradley Walsh', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Kat Graham, Quincy Brown, Ethan Peck, Ron Cephas Jones, Genelle Williams, Laura de Carteret, Kevin Hanchard, Ali Hassan', null, 'A talented photographer stuck in a dead-end job inherits an antique Advent calendar that may be predicting the future -- and pointing her toward love.', 'A talented photographer stuck in a dead-end job inherits an antique Advent calendar that may be predicting the future -- and pointing her toward love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiCeUExxUTGbU6FXORLf673uwvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555850'),
  ('976756098380331187', 'The Holiday Fix Up', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Brian Herzlinger, Pete Villani', 'Jessica Koosed', 'Jana Kramer, Ryan McPartlin, Maria Menounos, Steve Vinovich, Brandon Ford Green, Brian Sills, Lisa Lynn Dempsey, Isabelle Van Vleet', null, 'When Sam, the designer behind a popular home renovation show, returns to her hometown during the holidays to help renovate the Bell Harbor Inn, she gets paired with Coop as her lead contractor. The only problem — he''s the guy who broke her heart and she''s the one who got away. Sparks fly as they work closely to get the renovations done in time for the inn''s annual Christmas Eve Harborfest.', 'When Sam, the designer behind a popular home renovation show, returns to her hometown during the holidays to help renovate the Bell Harbor Inn, she gets paired with Coop as her lead contractor. The only problem — he''s the guy who broke her heart and she''s the one who got away. Sparks fly as they work closely to get the renovations done in time for the inn''s annual Christmas Eve Harborfest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gErljGRKSUeedJw8mJPndGdIGi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881245'),
  ('775410573541314322', 'The Holiday Sitter', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Ali Liebert, Mike Kam', null, 'Jonathan Bennett, George Krissa, Chelsea Hobbs, Everett Andres, Amy Goodmurphy, Matthew James Dowden, Todd Matthews, Nathan Parrott', null, 'Sam is a workaholic bachelor who babysits his niece and nephew before the holidays when his sister and her husband have to go out of town. Completely out of his element, he recruits help from their handsome neighbor Jason and finds himself in an unexpected romance.', 'Sam is a workaholic bachelor who babysits his niece and nephew before the holidays when his sister and her husband have to go out of town. Completely out of his element, he recruits help from their handsome neighbor Jason and finds himself in an unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTKNvBCoGLTfNBRl2hD0PHjhVEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027324'),
  ('459680977421780534', 'The Hollars', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Krasinski, Eric Alan Edwards', 'Jim Strouse', 'John Krasinski, Margo Martindale, Richard Jenkins, Sharlto Copley, Anna Kendrick, Charlie Day, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Randall Park', 'PG-13', 'Aspiring New York City artist John Hollar returns to his Middle America hometown on the eve of his mother’s brain surgery. Joined by his girlfriend Rebecca, eight months pregnant with their first child, John is forced to navigate the crazy world he left behind.', 'Aspiring New York City artist John Hollar returns to his Middle America hometown on the eve of his mother’s brain surgery. Joined by his girlfriend Rebecca, eight months pregnant with their first child, John is forced to navigate the crazy world he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57azlJsftQyxuQ2EXl0I1JodwjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325346'),
  ('80650339934923821', 'The Hollow', 2004, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Kyle Newman, Scott Kevan', 'Hans Rodionoff', 'Kevin Zegers, Nick Carter, Kaley Cuoco, Stacy Keach, Judge Reinhold, Ben Scott, Eileen Brennan, Nicholas Turturro', 'R', 'The presence of Ichabod Crane''s descendant in Sleepy Hollow conjures the Headless Horseman to return and resume his spooky slaughtering.', 'The presence of Ichabod Crane''s descendant in Sleepy Hollow conjures the Headless Horseman to return and resume his spooky slaughtering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RPzdYOhStgkUJpPdAYlv1VvFzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35946'),
  ('431508329706194535', 'The Hollow', 2015, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Wilson, Kevin Leslie, Eric J. Goldstein', 'Rick Suvalle, Sheldon Wilson', 'Stephanie Hunt, Sarah Dugdale, Alisha Newton, Hilary Jardine, Richard Harmon, Jonathan Whitesell, Deborah Kara Unger, Dylan Playfair', 'NR', 'It''s Halloween eve on Shelter Island, and the small town is preparing for a killer storm. But the dark clouds gathering over the island are bringing with them a curse one-hundred years in waiting. As the woods give birth to an ungodly and insatiable creature of fire, bones, and earth, three sisters must scramble to stay alive through the long dark night of the Hollow. For it''s not something you can kill. It''s only something you can try and survive.', 'It''s Halloween eve on Shelter Island, and the small town is preparing for a killer storm. But the dark clouds gathering over the island are bringing with them a curse one-hundred years in waiting. As the woods give birth to an ungodly and insatiable creature of fire, bones, and earth, three sisters must scramble to stay alive through the long dark night of the Hollow. For it''s not something you can kill. It''s only something you can try and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0k9gjdxjrG2vQKxRRrrjStTLiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361042'),
  ('313311374311364913', 'The Hollow Child', 2018, 'Horror', 'Matthew Tingey, Jackson Ezard, Jackson Ezard', 'Ben Rollo', 'Jess McLeod, Hannah Cheramy, John Emmet Tracy, Jana Mitsoula, Genevieve Buechner, Connor Stanhope, Johannah Newmarch, Craig March', 'NR', 'Samantha has lived her whole life in different foster homes. Now living in a small town, she never feels like she quite fits in, even with her own current foster family who might adopt her, or the boy who follows her around doing her classwork. So, it’s perhaps natural that she doesn’t know what to do with a curious tagalong little sister named Olivia. One day, Sam callously ditches Olivia, who wanders off into the woods on her own and disappears.', 'Samantha has lived her whole life in different foster homes. Now living in a small town, she never feels like she quite fits in, even with her own current foster family who might adopt her, or the boy who follows her around doing her classwork. So, it’s perhaps natural that she doesn’t know what to do with a curious tagalong little sister named Olivia. One day, Sam callously ditches Olivia, who wanders off into the woods on her own and disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHeNY6zvR9yA2JWF9FrIOldsc2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433419'),
  ('362221050811378796', 'The Hollow Point', 2016, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime, Western, Adventure, Mystery', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego, Chelsea Donison, David Allen Cluck', 'Nils Lyew', 'Patrick Wilson, Ian McShane, John Leguizamo, Lynn Collins, Jim Belushi, Karli Hall, David H. Stevens, Derek Boone', 'R', 'Los Reyes County, Arizona. Leland, a retired lawman, works with Wallace, the new sheriff who replaces him, when a vicious hit man, sent by a Mexican drug cartel, threatens their border small town.', 'Los Reyes County, Arizona. Leland, a retired lawman, works with Wallace, the new sheriff who replaces him, when a vicious hit man, sent by a Mexican drug cartel, threatens their border small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/I3nqs2RHuGNjhIHrU7yG3Ai0fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262982'),
  ('918927576603149604', 'The Holly and the Ivy', 1952, 'Drama', 'George More O''Ferrall, Edward Scaife, John Cox', 'Anatole de Grunwald', 'Ralph Richardson, Celia Johnson, Margaret Leighton, Denholm Elliott, John Gregson, Hugh Williams, Margaret Halstan, Maureen Delaney', 'NR', 'An English clergyman''s neglect of his grown children, in his zeal to tend to his parishioners, comes to the surface at a Christmas family gathering.', 'An English clergyman''s neglect of his grown children, in his zeal to tend to his parishioners, comes to the surface at a Christmas family gathering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivKbMaB1KLZf4gaogkxRs7EHmMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79817'),
  ('1096256724649218444', 'The Hollywood Bowl', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera, Scott Bradley', null, null, 'NR', 'Tom is conducting a symphony at the Hollywood Bowl when Jerry comes out to co-conduct.', 'Tom is conducting a symphony at the Hollywood Bowl when Jerry comes out to co-conduct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3P3msgbHTMxxSS91LmtW60WC9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93014'),
  ('977310944442905270', 'The Hollywood Knights', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Floyd Mutrux, William A. Fraker', 'Floyd Mutrux', 'Robert Wuhl, Tony Danza, Fran Drescher, Michelle Pfeiffer, Joyce Hyser, Gary Graham, Stuart Pankin, Otis Young', 'R', 'Led by their comedic and pranking leader, Newbomb Turk, the Hollywood Knights car gang raise hell throughout Beverly Hills on Halloween Night, 1965. Everything from drag racing to Vietnam to high school love.', 'Led by their comedic and pranking leader, Newbomb Turk, the Hollywood Knights car gang raise hell throughout Beverly Hills on Halloween Night, 1965. Everything from drag racing to Vietnam to high school love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKTXjzFW52n61rlXT80MGIcnEG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21879'),
  ('262639946275746560', 'The Hollywood Matador', 1942, 'Animation', 'Walter Lantz', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ben Hardaway, Kent Rogers', 'NR', 'The bull is watching through a knothole as the great bullfighter, Woody Woodpecker, is showing off for the spectators. Unable to take it no longer the bull dashes into the arena and charges Woody so hard that he makes a shambles of the stadium. Woody, as always, equal to the task at hand is soon serving bull-burgers to the crowd.', 'The bull is watching through a knothole as the great bullfighter, Woody Woodpecker, is showing off for the spectators. Unable to take it no longer the bull dashes into the arena and charges Woody so hard that he makes a shambles of the stadium. Woody, as always, equal to the task at hand is soon serving bull-burgers to the crowd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYpkOmjcl8iSqcyFPNgZtF3uRt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87024'),
  ('68287631722607829', 'The Hollywood Revue of 1929', 1929, 'Comedy, Music', 'Charles Reisner, John Arnold, Max Fabian', 'Joseph Farnham', 'Conrad Nagel, Jack Benny, John Gilbert, Norma Shearer, Joan Crawford, Bessie Love, Cliff Edwards, Stan Laurel', null, 'An all-star revue featuring MGM contract players.', 'An all-star revue featuring MGM contract players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe8dZ8LpRnfivsQ7nxLhH5AWxoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31678'),
  ('971313728201827664', 'The Hollywood Ten', 1950, 'Documentary', 'John Berry, Nicolas Hayer', 'John Berry', 'J. Parnell Thomas, Albert Maltz, Lester Cole, Samuel Ornitz, Adrian Scott, Alvah Bessie, Edward Dmytryk, Ring Lardner, Jr.', null, 'A brief look at The Hollywood Ten, a group of screenwriters and directors charged with contempt of court after challenging the House Un-American Activities Committee and their controversial and self-incriminatory questions during the red scare. With that act of defiance, they were sentenced to one year in prison simply for speaking their minds and exercising their constitutional rights as concerned citizens. This is their story, their version of the facts, and their opinions.', 'A brief look at The Hollywood Ten, a group of screenwriters and directors charged with contempt of court after challenging the House Un-American Activities Committee and their controversial and self-incriminatory questions during the red scare. With that act of defiance, they were sentenced to one year in prison simply for speaking their minds and exercising their constitutional rights as concerned citizens. This is their story, their version of the facts, and their opinions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2inNAQMZ6GLdQIx2M0FL0du7XA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34848'),
  ('887240202126696415', 'The Holy Boy', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Paolo Strippoli, Cristiano Di Nicola', 'Paolo Strippoli, Jacopo del Giudice, Milo Tissone', 'Michele Riondino, Giulio Feltri, Paolo Pierobon, Romana Maggiora Vergano, Roberto Citran, Sergio Romano, Anna Bellato, Sandra Toffolatti', null, 'A PE teacher moves to a isolated mountain village where the people appear to live in unshakeable serenity, but soon stumbles across a disturbing ritual. Once a week, the locals are freed of their pain by a lonely boy born with the power to heal one''s soul just by hugging them. Trying to rescue him from this madness, the man unleashes his dark side.', 'A PE teacher moves to a isolated mountain village where the people appear to live in unshakeable serenity, but soon stumbles across a disturbing ritual. Once a week, the locals are freed of their pain by a lonely boy born with the power to heal one''s soul just by hugging them. Trying to rescue him from this madness, the man unleashes his dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jpKQ6xhcxaNXOUDeQpyHNUcWr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092936'),
  ('274480384465320571', 'The Holy Family', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-René Duveau, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', 'Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Jérôme Beaujour', 'Laura Smet, Marthe Keller, Léa Drucker, Thierry Godard, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Inna Modja, Manuel Le Lièvre, Manali Blain', null, 'Jean, an anthropologist with no history, is appointed Minister of the Family. While he discovers the backstage of the political world, he must also deal with the events that shake his own family, with the discovery of his brother''s homosexuality, and the unexpected pregnancy of his wife.', 'Jean, an anthropologist with no history, is appointed Minister of the Family. While he discovers the backstage of the political world, he must also deal with the events that shake his own family, with the discovery of his brother''s homosexuality, and the unexpected pregnancy of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Tej2dRHplZCPFwCYQtkvA7lYvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608742'),
  ('917464358123687835', 'The Holy Girl', 2004, 'Drama', 'Lucrecia Martel, Matias Mosteirin, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Lucrecia Martel', 'María Alché, Mercedes Morán, Julieta Zylberberg, Carlos Belloso, Alejandro Urdapilleta, Mía Maestro, Marta Lubos, Arturo Goetz', 'R', 'Amalia is an adolescent girl who is caught in the throes of her emerging sexuality and her deeply held passion for her Catholic faith. These two drives mingle when the visiting Dr. Jano takes advantage of a crowd to get inappropriately close to the girl. Repulsed by him but inspired by an inner burning, Amalia decides it is her God-given mission to save the doctor from his behavior, and she begins to stalk Dr. Jano, becoming a most unusual voyeur.', 'Amalia is an adolescent girl who is caught in the throes of her emerging sexuality and her deeply held passion for her Catholic faith. These two drives mingle when the visiting Dr. Jano takes advantage of a crowd to get inappropriately close to the girl. Repulsed by him but inspired by an inner burning, Amalia decides it is her God-given mission to save the doctor from his behavior, and she begins to stalk Dr. Jano, becoming a most unusual voyeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srA4HPJe0YpDTZ4L4Nj5psD7v48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44413'),
  ('12402400875596336', 'The Holy Grail', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Daniel Gottschalk, Manuel Kreuzpaintner', 'Dietmar Jacobs, Moritz Netenjakob', 'Hape Kerkeling, Fahri Yardım, Christoph Maria Herbst, Anja Knauer, Gaby Dohm, Friedrich Mücke, Rona Regjepi, Katrin Röver', null, 'At a tennis club in rural Germany, preparations for the summer party are led by Heribert. When a separate grill is suggested for Erol, the club''s only Muslim member, tensions flare. What begins as a simple discussion quickly turns into a debate about societal and personal conflicts, threatening to tear the club apart.', 'At a tennis club in rural Germany, preparations for the summer party are led by Heribert. When a separate grill is suggested for Erol, the club''s only Muslim member, tensions flare. What begins as a simple discussion quickly turns into a debate about societal and personal conflicts, threatening to tear the club apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2izrV8KtqKND5Cy5NmdpXnzITr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1427838'),
  ('50823607149901556', 'The Holy Innocents', 1984, 'Drama', 'Mario Camus, Hans Burmann, Benito Rabal', 'Mario Camus', 'Alfredo Landa, Terele Pávez, Belén Ballesteros, Juan Sachez, Susana Sánchez, Francisco Rabal, Ágata Lys, Agustín González', null, 'In 60s Extremadura, Paco el Bajo and his relatives work during day in a farmhouse, and silently suffer submission to their masters, who exploit them and treat them almost like animals. Meanwhile, Paco dreams that one day his children will be able to study.', 'In 60s Extremadura, Paco el Bajo and his relatives work during day in a farmhouse, and silently suffer submission to their masters, who exploit them and treat them almost like animals. Meanwhile, Paco dreams that one day his children will be able to study.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbUhhlZ0gSGTp4WARxt2mm8J9Ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75877'),
  ('43528185652262100', 'The Holy Inquisition', 1974, 'Drama, History', 'Arturo Ripstein, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Arturo Ripstein, José Emilio Pacheco', 'Jorge Luke, Diana Bracho, Claudio Brook, Ana Mérida, Rafael Banquells, Mario Castillón Bracho, Jorge Fegán, Farnesio de Bernal', null, 'A plague is spreading through 16th century Mexico, and the Inquisition of the Roman Catholic Church is rooting out Jews, for they are believed to be its cause. At his father''s funeral, a monk observes his family practicing Jewish burial rite, and he reports them, leading to devastating consequences for the whole family.', 'A plague is spreading through 16th century Mexico, and the Inquisition of the Roman Catholic Church is rooting out Jews, for they are believed to be its cause. At his father''s funeral, a monk observes his family practicing Jewish burial rite, and he reports them, leading to devastating consequences for the whole family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VQiKAeII0FZQ3TjG80qkDluPdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198532'),
  ('477140006343946913', 'The Holy Man', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Charuprakash Ghosh, Rabi Ghosh, Gitali Roy, Satya Bandopadhyay, Santosh Dutta, Haridhan Mukhopadhyay, Prasad Mukhopadhyay, Satindra Bhattacharya', null, 'A wandering baba initiates a widower layer and his youngest daughter, irritating her boyfriend Satya and the ever-skeptical Nibaran.', 'A wandering baba initiates a widower layer and his youngest daughter, irritating her boyfriend Satya and the ever-skeptical Nibaran.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE1iq1xSzWoFpKw1863l9mxLZ5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198567'),
  ('247798022961714231', 'The Holy Mountain', 1926, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Arnold Fanck, Hans Schneeberger, Helmar Lerski', 'Arnold Fanck', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Luis Trenker, Ernst Petersen, Frida Richard, Hannes Schneider, Leontine Sagan, Friedrich Schneider', null, 'In the mountains, Diotima meets Karl and fall in love and have an affair. Karl''s friend Vigo mistakenly believes she''s in love with him, causing rifts in all relationships.', 'In the mountains, Diotima meets Karl and fall in love and have an affair. Karl''s friend Vigo mistakenly believes she''s in love with him, causing rifts in all relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SuhHKrIXcc7oHbQItQ9g0gf4aJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94658'),
  ('608772798540993647', 'The Holy Mountain', 1973, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Rafael Corkidi, Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Horacio Salinas, Zamira Saunders, Juan Ferrara, Adriana Page, Burt Kleiner, Valerie Jodorowsky, Nicky Nichols', 'R', 'The Alchemist assembles together a group of people from all walks of life to represent the planets in the solar system. The occult adept''s intention is to put his recruits through strange mystical rites and divest them of their worldly baggage before embarking on a trip to Lotus Island. There they ascend the Holy Mountain to displace the immortal gods who secretly rule the universe.', 'The Alchemist assembles together a group of people from all walks of life to represent the planets in the solar system. The occult adept''s intention is to put his recruits through strange mystical rites and divest them of their worldly baggage before embarking on a trip to Lotus Island. There they ascend the Holy Mountain to displace the immortal gods who secretly rule the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mP5FGQbNjFkrjcZ6AVHrvokPRe5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8327'),
  ('736153832476421207', 'The Holy Virgin Versus the Evil Dead', 1991, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Chiu Chi-On, Tang Man-Wai', 'Lee Ho-Kwan', 'Donnie Yen, Pauline Yeung Bo-Ling, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Chui Hei-Man, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Robert Mak Tak-Law, Hsu Hsia', null, 'A teacher and his five female students are attacked by a monster with neon-green eyes. The teacher escapes but his students are completely dismembered. He soon discovers the monster is worshipped by a cult whose ambition is to rule the world and tear the clothes off young girls.', 'A teacher and his five female students are attacked by a monster with neon-green eyes. The teacher escapes but his students are completely dismembered. He soon discovers the monster is worshipped by a cult whose ambition is to rule the world and tear the clothes off young girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doJzvo1DDjITa48mpG1NYdipSHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102468'),
  ('514544631071972819', 'The Holy War', 1979, 'Thriller, Drama, War, Action', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'José Carlos Ruiz, Jorge Luke, Víctor Junco, Enrique Lucero', null, 'Through the humble potter Celso we will know one of the most dramatic events in the history of Mexico in the twentieth century, in which the federal government and Catholic believers, fought a bloody struggle. Time passes and the Church and the State agree to peace. Celso and his companions are rejected by both sides.', 'Through the humble potter Celso we will know one of the most dramatic events in the history of Mexico in the twentieth century, in which the federal government and Catholic believers, fought a bloody struggle. Time passes and the Church and the State agree to peace. Celso and his companions are rejected by both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQatf4hrKtA1BhlQwwRRkW8lKyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342043'),
  ('375263835470745064', 'The Home', 2025, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Anastas N. Michos, James DeMonaco', 'James DeMonaco, Adam Cantor', 'Pete Davidson, John Glover, Mugga, Adam Cantor, Bruce Altman, Denise Burse, Stuart Rudin, Ethan Phillips', 'R', 'A troubled man starts working at a retirement home and realizes its residents and caretakers harbor sinister secrets. As he investigates the building and its forbidden fourth floor, he starts to uncover connections to his own past and upbringing as a foster child.', 'A troubled man starts working at a retirement home and realizes its residents and caretakers harbor sinister secrets. As he investigates the building and its forbidden fourth floor, he starts to uncover connections to his own past and upbringing as a foster child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyGY1k5GqAORsVhfZA3gFKirZWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926606'),
  ('858187151550818964', 'The Home and the World', 1985, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy, Santi Chatterjee', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Victor Banerjee, Swatilekha Sengupta, Gopa Aich, Jennifer Kendal, Manoj Mitra, Bimal Chatterjee, Indrapramit Roy', null, 'When the movie opens, a woman is recalling the events that molded her perspective on the world. Years ago, her husband, a wealthy Western-educated landowner, challenged tradition by providing her with schooling, and inviting her out of the seclusion in which married women were kept, to the consternation of more conservative relatives. Meeting her husband''s visiting friend from college, a leader of an economic rebellion against the British, she takes up his political cause, despite her husbands warnings. As the story progresses, the relationship between the woman and the visitor becomes more than platonic, and the political battles, pitting rich against poor and Hindu against Moslem, turn out not to be quite as simple as she had first thought.', 'When the movie opens, a woman is recalling the events that molded her perspective on the world. Years ago, her husband, a wealthy Western-educated landowner, challenged tradition by providing her with schooling, and inviting her out of the seclusion in which married women were kept, to the consternation of more conservative relatives. Meeting her husband''s visiting friend from college, a leader of an economic rebellion against the British, she takes up his political cause, despite her husbands warnings. As the story progresses, the relationship between the woman and the visitor becomes more than platonic, and the political battles, pitting rich against poor and Hindu against Moslem, turn out not to be quite as simple as she had first thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEU1eKvWPzzdMAcwzXjsH69dKro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42092'),
  ('404968619915987485', 'The Home Front', 1943, 'War, Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Phil Eastman, Dr. Seuss', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A homesick Pvt. Snafu learns that his family are almost as committed to the war efforts as himself.', 'A homesick Pvt. Snafu learns that his family are almost as committed to the war efforts as himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjb96bWhcdI8QwEmnpCjs9vSwBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100750'),
  ('1151737341574876369', 'The Home of Dark Butterflies', 2008, 'Drama', 'Dome Karukoski, Marja Pyykkö, Pini Hellstedt', 'Marko Leino', 'Niilo Syväoja, Tommi Korpela, Kati Outinen, Pertti Sveholm, Eero Milonoff, Niko Vakkuri, Iiro Panula, Ville Saksela', null, 'Haunted by his traumatic past and cautious about the prospects of an uncertain future, a fourteen year old boy named Juhani winds up in an isolated boys'' home known as The Island. Juhani has been shuttled between foster homes and temporary families for the past six years, leaving any prospect of stability in his life a faded dream. When Juhani winds up in a remote shelter for troubled youth known as The Island, he has little idea of how ruthless superintendent Olavi Harjula can truly be.', 'Haunted by his traumatic past and cautious about the prospects of an uncertain future, a fourteen year old boy named Juhani winds up in an isolated boys'' home known as The Island. Juhani has been shuttled between foster homes and temporary families for the past six years, leaving any prospect of stability in his life a faded dream. When Juhani winds up in a remote shelter for troubled youth known as The Island, he has little idea of how ruthless superintendent Olavi Harjula can truly be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sIldYzYdooHVU2NaGVfp484mBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20548'),
  ('307643458926922921', 'The Homecoming', 1973, 'Drama', 'David Watkin, Peter Hall', 'Harold Pinter', 'Paul Rogers, Ian Holm, Cyril Cusack, Terence Rigby, Michael Jayston, Vivien Merchant', null, 'In a dreary North London flat, the site of perpetual psychological warfare, a philosophy professor visits his family after a nine-year absence and introduces the four men - father, uncle and two brothers - to his wife.', 'In a dreary North London flat, the site of perpetual psychological warfare, a philosophy professor visits his family after a nine-year absence and introduces the four men - father, uncle and two brothers - to his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcFuhojTnXChYFC23Tkye22rJx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122291'),
  ('42737408325864188', 'The Homecoming: A Christmas Story', 1971, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Fielder Cook, Max Stein, Earl Rath', null, 'Patricia Neal, Richard Thomas, Edgar Bergen, Ellen Corby, Dorothy Stickney, Josephine Hutchinson, William Windom, Cleavon Little', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve, early 1930s on Walton''s Mountain. As the family prepares for the holiday, they anxiously await Pa''s return home from his job in the city some 50 miles away. He is late, and Ma and the grandparents hear on the radio a report of a bus accident that worries them. Oldest son John-Boy must step up to help grandfather cut down a Christmas tree, and upon learning the concern about Daddy sets out to find him.', 'It''s Christmas Eve, early 1930s on Walton''s Mountain. As the family prepares for the holiday, they anxiously await Pa''s return home from his job in the city some 50 miles away. He is late, and Ma and the grandparents hear on the radio a report of a bus accident that worries them. Oldest son John-Boy must step up to help grandfather cut down a Christmas tree, and upon learning the concern about Daddy sets out to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcXI79DjFThXsy4YcJaTl6PVWFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56308'),
  ('9450272600432223', 'The Homesman', 2014, 'Western, Drama', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Rosario Provenza, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Kieran Fitzgerald, Wesley Oliver', 'Hilary Swank, Tommy Lee Jones, Grace Gummer, Miranda Otto, Sonja Richter, Tim Blake Nelson, James Spader, John Lithgow', 'R', 'When three women living on the edge of the American frontier are driven mad by harsh pioneer life, the task of saving them falls to the pious, independent-minded Mary Bee Cuddy. Transporting the women by covered wagon to Iowa, she soon realizes just how daunting the journey will be, and employs a low-life drifter, George Briggs, to join her. The unlikely pair and the three women head east, where a waiting minister and his wife have offered to take the women in. But the group first must traverse the harsh Nebraska Territories marked by stark beauty, psychological peril and constant threat.', 'When three women living on the edge of the American frontier are driven mad by harsh pioneer life, the task of saving them falls to the pious, independent-minded Mary Bee Cuddy. Transporting the women by covered wagon to Iowa, she soon realizes just how daunting the journey will be, and employs a low-life drifter, George Briggs, to join her. The unlikely pair and the three women head east, where a waiting minister and his wife have offered to take the women in. But the group first must traverse the harsh Nebraska Territories marked by stark beauty, psychological peril and constant threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGpuOhkm1wG2AxEJShazH5NVGAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264656'),
  ('377865023083912622', 'The Honest Candidate', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Nonato Estrela, Marcelo Antunez', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Leandro Hassum, Luiza Valdetaro, Victor Leal, Flávia Garrafa, Arthur Claro, Giovanna Estefanio, Antonio Pedro, Luís Lobianco', null, 'João Ernesto Ribamar is a corrupt politician running for the presidency. He is in the runoff election, ahead on the polls, when he receives a "mandinga" (curse) from his grandmother, which makes him unable to lie. Now the problem begins: How to win an election by telling only the truth?', 'João Ernesto Ribamar is a corrupt politician running for the presidency. He is in the runoff election, ahead on the polls, when he receives a "mandinga" (curse) from his grandmother, which makes him unable to lie. Now the problem begins: How to win an election by telling only the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNFjUdDmyJmAST6qOz2ie10UwTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254439'),
  ('479986896037819802', 'The Honest Candidate', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Pipe Ybarra, Marya Saab, Paola Ramones', 'El Huevo Charlie Barrientos, Pablo Emiliano de la Rosa', 'Adrián Uribe, Mariana Seoane, Teresa Ruiz, Daniel Tovar, Paola Ramones, Leonardo Herrera, Luisa Huertas, Enrique Arreola', null, 'A former idealistic leader turned corrupt politician is cursed by his grandmother on the eve of the presidential election, forcing him to be honest. Can he win without lies and what will be the conditions?', 'A former idealistic leader turned corrupt politician is cursed by his grandmother on the eve of the presidential election, forcing him to be honest. Can he win without lies and what will be the conditions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmV5HPkbQuzgPo11Xm70CMQV3iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278099'),
  ('610522162977152965', 'The Honest Candidate 2', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Tuca Moraes, Cacala Carvana, Roberto Santucci', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Leandro Hassum, Rosanne Mulholland, Cássio Pandolph, Victor Leal, Flávia Garrafa, Paulinho Serra, Anderson Muller, Mila Ribeiro', null, 'Brazilian politician João Ernesto surrenders to justice and is arrested for corruption, before attempting to overturn with sincerity and real proposals.', 'Brazilian politician João Ernesto surrenders to justice and is arrested for corruption, before attempting to overturn with sincerity and real proposals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nies8ZuM673DAtSufh4Ww3dJJyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541696'),
  ('517903399818078381', 'The Honest One', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Başar Sabuncu', 'Şener Şen, Adile Naşit, Ayşen Gruda, Erdal Özyağcılar, Necati Bilgiç, Zihni Küçümen, Ergün Uçucu, Metin Çeliker', null, 'When an incorruptible government pay clerk, who isn''t taken seriously by anyone including his family, get robbed while carrying huge amount of work money, he becomes popular because people believe he faked the robbery and kept the money.', 'When an incorruptible government pay clerk, who isn''t taken seriously by anyone including his family, get robbed while carrying huge amount of work money, he becomes popular because people believe he faked the robbery and kept the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIRuL3Whe6woavlw9WeZWqchcZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180864'),
  ('939268127593941464', 'The Honey Pot', 1967, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Gianni Di Venanzo, Franco Cirino', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Rex Harrison, Susan Hayward, Cliff Robertson, Capucine, Edie Adams, Maggie Smith, Adolfo Celi, Hugh Manning', 'NR', 'In Venice, a millionaire hires an actor to help him prank three greedy exes into thinking he''s dying and leaving his fortune to one of them.', 'In Venice, a millionaire hires an actor to help him prank three greedy exes into thinking he''s dying and leaving his fortune to one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMuxOddbhc9tESDKdQtrkzAMPQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61105'),
  ('180145996494411747', 'The Honey-Mousers', 1956, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'In this spoof of TV''s "The Honeymooners", Ralph Crumden and Ned Morton are mouse versions of Jackie Gleason and Art Carney''s characters on the TV show. When new human tenants move into the apartment where the Crumden and Morton couples live, Ralph and Ned try to gain access to a banquet of food in the people''s refrigerator, which is guarded by an orange cat.', 'In this spoof of TV''s "The Honeymooners", Ralph Crumden and Ned Morton are mouse versions of Jackie Gleason and Art Carney''s characters on the TV show. When new human tenants move into the apartment where the Crumden and Morton couples live, Ralph and Ned try to gain access to a banquet of food in the people''s refrigerator, which is guarded by an orange cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/andWoI7H8S1Gl2xIWq5nSxziMJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100372'),
  ('136997316270854088', 'The Honeymoon', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Mike Stern Sterzyński, Dean Craig', 'Dean Craig', 'Pico Alexander, Maria Bakalova, Asim Chaudhry, Lucas Bravo, Flynn Allen, Kai Portman, Orsetta De Rossi, Marco Valerio Montesano', 'R', 'Englishman Adam and his American bride Sarah are about to embark on the romantic honeymoon of a lifetime in Venice, Italy. But when the newlyweds’ trip is gatecrashed by Adam’s excessively needy best friend, Ed, it inadvertently turns their perfect lovers’ holiday into a complete disaster.', 'Englishman Adam and his American bride Sarah are about to embark on the romantic honeymoon of a lifetime in Venice, Italy. But when the newlyweds’ trip is gatecrashed by Adam’s excessively needy best friend, Ed, it inadvertently turns their perfect lovers’ holiday into a complete disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyT1SavljB1WLDutl0Bj0P1sCCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871547'),
  ('209652373754549821', 'The Honeymoon Killers', 1970, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Leonard Kastle, Oliver Wood', 'Leonard Kastle', 'Shirley Stoler, Tony Lo Bianco, Mary Jane Higby, Doris Roberts, Kip McArdle, Marilyn Chris, Dortha Duckworth, Barbara Cason', 'R', 'Martha Beck, an obese nurse who is desperately lonely, joins a "correspondence club" and finds a romantic pen pal in Ray Fernandez. Martha falls hard for Ray, and is intent on sticking with him even when she discovers he''s a con man who seduces lonely single women, kills them and then takes their money. She poses as Ray''s sister and joins Ray on a wild killing spree, fueled by her lingering concern that Ray will leave her for one of his marks.', 'Martha Beck, an obese nurse who is desperately lonely, joins a "correspondence club" and finds a romantic pen pal in Ray Fernandez. Martha falls hard for Ray, and is intent on sticking with him even when she discovers he''s a con man who seduces lonely single women, kills them and then takes their money. She poses as Ray''s sister and joins Ray on a wild killing spree, fueled by her lingering concern that Ray will leave her for one of his marks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3n69M2qBFMWEYAOOQdvxYAaaDLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10237'),
  ('321217903498595184', 'The Honeymoon Machine', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Richard Thorpe, Ronald Florance, Joseph LaShelle', 'George Wells', 'Steve McQueen, Brigid Bazlen, Jim Hutton, Paula Prentiss, Dean Jagger, Jack Weston, Jack Mullaney, Marcel Hillaire', 'NR', 'Lt. Fergie Howard teams up with Lt. Beau Gilliam and Navy scientist Jason Eldridge to turn a supercomputer with missile-tracking capabilities into a tool to predict where a roulette ball will land. They dock in Venice, Italy, and begin making a killing at the casino, but their shore-to-ship signals get misinterpreted as signs of attack by Adm. Fitch, putting a serious crimp in the officers'' get-rich-quick scheme.', 'Lt. Fergie Howard teams up with Lt. Beau Gilliam and Navy scientist Jason Eldridge to turn a supercomputer with missile-tracking capabilities into a tool to predict where a roulette ball will land. They dock in Venice, Italy, and begin making a killing at the casino, but their shore-to-ship signals get misinterpreted as signs of attack by Adm. Fitch, putting a serious crimp in the officers'' get-rich-quick scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCUjitGzhcFsNwtAkIDl0e92Kbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34768'),
  ('1044964814503343279', 'The Honeymoon Phase', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Phillip G. Carroll Jr., Joe Staehly', 'Phillip G. Carroll Jr.', 'Jim Schubin, Chloe Carroll, Tara Westwood, François Chau, Michael Wetherbee, Kayla Anthony, Linda Horwatt, Mike Sutton', null, 'Struggling young lovers, Tom and Eve, must endure a 30-day scientific experiment. Room, board, $50,000 and a month alone together in research facility housing. What could possibly go wrong.', 'Struggling young lovers, Tom and Eve, must endure a 30-day scientific experiment. Room, board, $50,000 and a month alone together in research facility housing. What could possibly go wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUR787PgFeUqkbUGfAusbQL91cf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655204'),
  ('167867792164863237', 'The Honeymooners', 2005, 'Comedy', 'John Schultz, Shawn Maurer', 'Don Rhymer, Barry W. Blaustein, David Sheffield', 'Cedric the Entertainer, Mike Epps, Gabrielle Union, Regina Hall, Eric Stoltz, John Leguizamo, Ajay Naidu, Jon Polito', 'PG-13', 'Working class New York bus driver Ralph Kramden is always coming up with get-rich-quick schemes for him and his best friend, Ed Norton, who''s always around to help him get in (and out of) trouble.', 'Working class New York bus driver Ralph Kramden is always coming up with get-rich-quick schemes for him and his best friend, Ed Norton, who''s always around to help him get in (and out of) trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97rcPjnmzrIH8raQ2CU2ptY0gdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21295'),
  ('725652873419607381', 'The Honorable with His Lover under the Bed', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Federico Zanni, Alessandro Metz', 'Francesco Milizia, Alberto Silvestri', 'Lino Banfi, Janet Ågren, Alvaro Vitali, Marisa Merlini, Teo Teocoli, Gigi Reder, Leo Gullotta, Renzo Ozzano', null, 'An unemployed teacher asks for help from her lover, an MP, and finds out that he is married.', 'An unemployed teacher asks for help from her lover, an MP, and finds out that he is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFTcocBUdV3QtbAY7RZ2ZfXA8nN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107067'),
  ('407558556622635326', 'The Honorary Consul', 1983, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'John Mackenzie, Phil Meheux', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Michael Caine, Richard Gere, Bob Hoskins, Elpidia Carrillo, Joaquim de Almeida, A Martinez, Stephanie Cotsirilos, Domingo Ambriz', 'R', 'Set in a small politically unstable Latin American country, the story follows the half English and half Latino Dr. Eduardo Plarr, who left his home to find a better life. Along the way he meets an array of people, including British Consul Charley Fortnum, a representative in Latin America who is trying to keep Revolution from occurring. He is also a remorseful alcoholic. Another person the doctor meets is Clara, whom he immediately falls in love with, but there is a problem: Clara is Charley''s wife.', 'Set in a small politically unstable Latin American country, the story follows the half English and half Latino Dr. Eduardo Plarr, who left his home to find a better life. Along the way he meets an array of people, including British Consul Charley Fortnum, a representative in Latin America who is trying to keep Revolution from occurring. He is also a remorseful alcoholic. Another person the doctor meets is Clara, whom he immediately falls in love with, but there is a problem: Clara is Charley''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSkNhwE6yiAN9CknSXzxAjOUKW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69007'),
  ('112425327779263415', 'The Hoober-Bloob Highway', 1975, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Music', 'Alan Zaslove', 'Dr. Seuss', 'Hal Smith, Mel Blanc, Bob Holt, June Foray, Lennie Weinrib', null, 'The Hoober-Bloob Highway is an animated musical special written by Dr. Seuss. Visit the magical island where Mr. Hoober-Bloob sends babies to Earth in his own musical way.', 'The Hoober-Bloob Highway is an animated musical special written by Dr. Seuss. Visit the magical island where Mr. Hoober-Bloob sends babies to Earth in his own musical way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st608P5DNXdveS9JFWm3z70MW4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52456'),
  ('680628556960710683', 'The Hoodlum', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Max Nosseck, Clark Ramsey, Arthur Hammond', 'Nat Tanchuck, Sam Neuman', 'Lawrence Tierney, Allene Roberts, Marjorie Riordan, Lisa Golm, Edward Tierney, Stuart Randall, Angela Stevens, O.Z. Whitehead', 'NR', 'Vincent Lubeck is a vicious ex-convict. His criminal activities are despised by his family, but he uses and abuses them in the course of his crimes. Eventually his own brother must stand up to him.', 'Vincent Lubeck is a vicious ex-convict. His criminal activities are despised by his family, but he uses and abuses them in the course of his crimes. Eventually his own brother must stand up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vz1ey1oY7vYVlHSiY4XOyYGeDG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47256'),
  ('12840805257644259', 'The Hook', 1963, 'War, Drama', 'Donald Roberts, George Seaton, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Henry Denker', 'Kirk Douglas, Robert Walker Jr., Nick Adams, Pancho Magalona, Nehemiah Persoff, John Bleifer, Mark Miller, John Alderson', 'NR', 'Three soldiers in Korea go through inner torment when they''re ordered to execute an enemy soldier.', 'Three soldiers in Korea go through inner torment when they''re ordered to execute an enemy soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r33m2mAn5MzU2siRqbKM2iDSSqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217890'),
  ('389732941328563962', 'The Hook', 1976, 'Drama, Crime', 'Erricos Andreou, Aris Stavrou', 'Klearhos Konitsiotis', 'Barbara Bouchet, Günther Stoll, Robert Behling, Sofia Roubou, Giorgos Kyritsis, Dinos Karydis, Giorgos Vakouletos, Jessica Dublin', null, 'An adulterous woman and her lover plot to murder her husband Kostas and make it look like a yachting accident. However, unknown to them, Kostas has hired a private detective to follow them and knows of their plans in advance. A deadly game of double-crossing begins and propels all three of them towards tragedy.', 'An adulterous woman and her lover plot to murder her husband Kostas and make it look like a yachting accident. However, unknown to them, Kostas has hired a private detective to follow them and knows of their plans in advance. A deadly game of double-crossing begins and propels all three of them towards tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkK4qXErHyXou729KVVL7bkrl8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278286'),
  ('329302821719341088', 'The Hooked Generation', 1968, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Grefé', 'Ray Preston, William Grefé, Quinn Morrison', 'Jeremy Slate, Steve Alaimo, John Davis Chandler, Willie Pastrano, Socrates Ballis, William Kerwin, Milton "Butterball" Smith', 'R', 'A trio of addicts make a move into drug smuggling with an ill-fated plan to use the Cuban Navy as their supplier that leads to kidnapping and murder.', 'A trio of addicts make a move into drug smuggling with an ill-fated plan to use the Cuban Navy as their supplier that leads to kidnapping and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldRgfM59fBcaVIRDfLZPsVpvoIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50968'),
  ('1014226910218726543', 'The Hoose-Gow', 1929, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Tiny Sandford, James Finlayson, Charlie Hall', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie arrive as new inmates at a prison after apparently taking part in a hold-up raid, a raid they tell a prison officer they were only watching. The usual mayhem ensues.', 'Stan and Ollie arrive as new inmates at a prison after apparently taking part in a hold-up raid, a raid they tell a prison officer they were only watching. The usual mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfzvo1Ob7w4SfFzB9kfUdVpGteR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50899'),
  ('1107747981107240298', 'The Hop-Pickers', 1964, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Jan Stallich, Jiří Hartman, Mojmír Ticháček', 'Ladislav Rychman, Vratislav Blažek', 'Vladimír Pucholt, Ivana Pavlová, Miloš Zavadil, Irena Kačírková, Josef Kemr, Libuše Havelková, Vladimír Klos, Vladimír Kloubek', null, 'Working on the hops fields gathering hops for beer, Filip catches a glimpse of fellow worker/comrade Hanka and falls for her. Trying to keep their love secret from the field owners,fellow worker Honza becomes jealous of Filip having a romance with Hanka, which leads to Honza deciding that he will feed the hop field owners Hanka and Filip''s secret romantic hops.', 'Working on the hops fields gathering hops for beer, Filip catches a glimpse of fellow worker/comrade Hanka and falls for her. Trying to keep their love secret from the field owners,fellow worker Honza becomes jealous of Filip having a romance with Hanka, which leads to Honza deciding that he will feed the hop field owners Hanka and Filip''s secret romantic hops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sazUPmI6AZuJLJJ9TUJRxtLJbvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65890'),
  ('359497356784254787', 'The Horde', 2010, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Yannick Dahan, Benjamin Rocher, Paul-Henri Belin', 'Arnaud Bordas, Yannick Dahan, Stéphane Moïssakis', 'Claude Perron, Jean-Pierre Martins, Ériq Ebouaney, Aurélien Recoing, Doudou Masta, Antoine Oppenheim, Jo Prestia, Yves Pignot', 'R', 'A bunch of crooked cops raid a ruined building located in an impoverished suburb of Paris, determined to furiously avenge the death of one of them, murdered by the ruthless criminal gang hidden on top of the dark labyrinth that will become a deathly trap when the living, unexpectedly turned into the undead by a mysterious plague, begin to devour the world.', 'A bunch of crooked cops raid a ruined building located in an impoverished suburb of Paris, determined to furiously avenge the death of one of them, murdered by the ruthless criminal gang hidden on top of the dark labyrinth that will become a deathly trap when the living, unexpectedly turned into the undead by a mysterious plague, begin to devour the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3sYdfCg1vz6DG4XlQRpu8baxvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37905'),
  ('93292344265348690', 'The Horde', 2016, 'Action, Horror', 'Jared Cohn, Laura Beth Love', 'Paul Logan', 'Paul Logan, Matthew Willig, Bill Moseley, Costas Mandylor, Vernon Wells, Sydney Sweeney, Nestor Serrano, Tiffany Brouwer', null, 'The film follows John Crenshaw as he accompanies his girlfriend and her students on a weekend nature-photography expedition deep into the woods. What should be an educational and fun-filled weekend turns into horror as the group is besieged by an unspeakable evil - a horde of hideously disfigured, mutated humans with an insatiable taste for blood. As things go from bad to worse, Crenshaw becomes their only hope if they are going to get out alive.', 'The film follows John Crenshaw as he accompanies his girlfriend and her students on a weekend nature-photography expedition deep into the woods. What should be an educational and fun-filled weekend turns into horror as the group is besieged by an unspeakable evil - a horde of hideously disfigured, mutated humans with an insatiable taste for blood. As things go from bad to worse, Crenshaw becomes their only hope if they are going to get out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHjXFWi5WnW2idcsOUC0zfAXvQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395797'),
  ('202577765582384447', 'The Horla', 1966, 'Mystery', 'Jean-Daniel Pollet, Jean-Jacques Rochut', 'Jean-Daniel Pollet', 'Laurent Terzieff', null, 'A man who lives by himself becomes increasingly concerned that he is not alone. Based on the short story by Guy de Maupassant.', 'A man who lives by himself becomes increasingly concerned that he is not alone. Based on the short story by Guy de Maupassant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3fih9etMJxL1gwbQ9NFBAbQ44C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151502'),
  ('254553988921617173', 'The Horla', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Marion Desseigne-Ravel, Pierre Baboin', 'Olivier de Plas, Olivier Fox, Marion Desseigne-Ravel', 'Bastien Bouillon, Mouna Soualem, Milla Harbouche, Judith Zins, Guillaume Pottier, Philippe du Janerand, Miglen Mirtchev, Alix Blumberg Dit Fleurmont', null, 'Damien and Nadia, 34, leave Paris with Chloé, their 8-year-old daughter, to settle in the provinces. Graphic designer for an events company, the first negotiated a full-time telework to follow his partner who has just been offered a position at the Rivière Research Institute where her friend and colleague Marion already works. The couple are expecting a child. But behind this new beginning hides a deaf threat that will soon implode the happiness of this seemingly perfect family.', 'Damien and Nadia, 34, leave Paris with Chloé, their 8-year-old daughter, to settle in the provinces. Graphic designer for an events company, the first negotiated a full-time telework to follow his partner who has just been offered a position at the Rivière Research Institute where her friend and colleague Marion already works. The couple are expecting a child. But behind this new beginning hides a deaf threat that will soon implode the happiness of this seemingly perfect family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owImjLNvwk9lUTIxcjEtI0vnUaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023959'),
  ('141751856016174943', 'The Horn Blows at Midnight', 1945, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Sidney Hickox, Raoul Walsh', 'Sam Hellman, James V. Kern', 'Jack Benny, Alexis Smith, Dolores Moran, Allyn Joslyn, Reginald Gardiner, Guy Kibbee, John Alexander, Franklin Pangborn', 'NR', 'A trumpet player in a radio orchestra falls asleep during a commercial and dreams he''s Athanael, an angel deputized to blow the Last Trumpet at exactly midnight on Earth, thus marking the end of the world.', 'A trumpet player in a radio orchestra falls asleep during a commercial and dreams he''s Athanael, an angel deputized to blow the Last Trumpet at exactly midnight on Earth, thus marking the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fT50i4TAcxgUMHkbdrqzG1GxB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64925'),
