  ('175783867476055', 'The Horror of Blackwood Castle', 1968, 'Crime', 'Karl Löb, Alfred Vohrer', 'Herbert Reinecker', 'Heinz Drache, Karin Baal, Horst Tappert, Siegfried Schürenberg, Agnes Windeck, Ilse Pagé, Mady Rahl, Uta Levka', null, 'Scotland Yard must discover why people are being murdered by a monstrous dog at Blackwood Castle.', 'Scotland Yard must discover why people are being murdered by a monstrous dog at Blackwood Castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga9aqCr0YDbsOZw4CqbkkGAiG78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1670'),
  ('460333473065689681', 'The Horror of Frankenstein', 1970, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jimmy Sangster, Moray Grant', 'Jeremy Burnham, Jimmy Sangster', 'Ralph Bates, Kate O''Mara, Veronica Carlson, Jon Finch, Dennis Price, Graham James, Bernard Archard, James Hayter', 'R', 'Brilliant but arrogant scientist Victor Frankenstein builds a man from spare body parts, only for the monster to come alive and wreak havoc.', 'Brilliant but arrogant scientist Victor Frankenstein builds a man from spare body parts, only for the monster to come alive and wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lFv0ABZqINbHijXjCc41AmrRlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3145'),
  ('381206119010436905', 'The Horror of Party Beach', 1964, 'Horror, Music, Science Fiction', 'Del Tenney, Richard Hilliard', 'Richard Hilliard', 'John Scott, Alice Lyon, Allan Laurel, Eulabelle Moore, Marilyn Clarke, Agustin Mayor, Damon Kebroyd, Munroe Wade', 'NR', 'Radioactive waste dumped off the coastline creates mutant monsters. The beasts attack slumber parties, beaches, tourists, and terrorize a waterfront community as a scientist, his daughter, her boyfriend and the local police try to find a way to stop them.', 'Radioactive waste dumped off the coastline creates mutant monsters. The beasts attack slumber parties, beaches, tourists, and terrorize a waterfront community as a scientist, his daughter, her boyfriend and the local police try to find a way to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7ro6YyinHyhMIEROwqS0Br98mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42794'),
  ('50469175823194676', 'The Horror Show', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'James Isaac, John R. Woodward, Mac Ahlberg', 'Alan Smithee, Leslie Bohem, Allyn Warner', 'Lance Henriksen, Brion James, Rita Taggart, Dedee Pfeiffer, Aron Eisenberg, Thom Bray, Matt Clark, David Oliver', 'R', 'Vowing revenge on the detective who apprehended him, serial killer "Meat Cleaver" Max Jenke returns from beyond the grave to launch a whole new reign of terror.', 'Vowing revenge on the detective who apprehended him, serial killer "Meat Cleaver" Max Jenke returns from beyond the grave to launch a whole new reign of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVBr6iLWsTwkEwgxH6rUNMj8xTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38084'),
  ('373958604175840845', 'The Horse', 1970, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Philippe Lefebvre, Walter Wottitz', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Pascal Jardin', 'Jean Gabin, Danièle Ajoret, Michel Barbey, Christian Barbier, Pierre Dux, Armando Francioli, Julien Guiomar, Eléonore Hirt', null, 'Auguste Maroilleur, an elderly farmer, exploits 400 hectares of crop land with the help of his family, over which he rules with an iron hand. Things go awry the day he discovers one of his grandsons is involved in drug traffic. To make matters worse, the reckless youth has hidden the white powder in the Maroilleur farm. Without a moment''s hesitation, Auguste gets rid of the toxic substance but, of course, the mob has different views...', 'Auguste Maroilleur, an elderly farmer, exploits 400 hectares of crop land with the help of his family, over which he rules with an iron hand. Things go awry the day he discovers one of his grandsons is involved in drug traffic. To make matters worse, the reckless youth has hidden the white powder in the Maroilleur farm. Without a moment''s hesitation, Auguste gets rid of the toxic substance but, of course, the mob has different views...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU3vtffYpWR33nbcBHg2rpvvtnm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65887'),
  ('234760877882824922', 'The Horse', 1973, 'Drama, Western', 'Charles Burnett', 'Charles Burnett', 'Gordon Houston, Maury Wright, Gary Morrin, Roger Collins, George Williams, Larry Clark', null, 'This critically acclaimed 1973 short is about an aristocratic white farming family who has a horse that is being put away, by the father of a young black boy named William. William cares for said horse in its last moments, as the male family members eagerly wait for his dad to arrive.', 'This critically acclaimed 1973 short is about an aristocratic white farming family who has a horse that is being put away, by the father of a young black boy named William. William cares for said horse in its last moments, as the male family members eagerly wait for his dad to arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NhU00YxjVwQKhKYvceX8zWhtWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148680'),
  ('305270565409062620', 'The Horse in the Gray Flannel Suit', 1968, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Norman Tokar, William E. Snyder', 'Louis Pelletier', 'Lloyd Bochner, Ellen Janov, Morey Amsterdam, Kurt Russell, Fred Clark, Diane Baker, Dean Jones, Norman Grabowski', 'G', 'Frederick Bolton has to solve two problems. First, his boss has instructed him to come up with a reasonable campaign to promote a new product, a stomach pill named "Aspercel" - by tomorrow. The second problem is Fred''s daugther, Helen. She is absolutely fond of horses, takes riding classes and has already had decent success in some competitions. Her biggest wish is to own a horse herself, a dream her father cannot afford at all. Now Fred tries to solve both problems at once by simply combining them: A horse named "Aspercel", ridden by his daugther should bring the name of the pill into the papers and make Helen happy, too. But there''s still one more obstacle: Helen and Aspercel of course have to win a few prices to make this idea work...', 'Frederick Bolton has to solve two problems. First, his boss has instructed him to come up with a reasonable campaign to promote a new product, a stomach pill named "Aspercel" - by tomorrow. The second problem is Fred''s daugther, Helen. She is absolutely fond of horses, takes riding classes and has already had decent success in some competitions. Her biggest wish is to own a horse herself, a dream her father cannot afford at all. Now Fred tries to solve both problems at once by simply combining them: A horse named "Aspercel", ridden by his daugther should bring the name of the pill into the papers and make Helen happy, too. But there''s still one more obstacle: Helen and Aspercel of course have to win a few prices to make this idea work...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chOwOYnJ3ct76mqP5SK1TS4au7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42645'),
  ('306816944907741603', 'The Horse of Pride', 1980, 'Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', null, 'Jacques Dufilho, Bernadette Le Saché, François Cluzet, Ronan Hubert, Armel Hubert, Pierre Le Rumeur, Michel Blanc, Bernard Dumaine', null, 'In early twentieth-century Brittany, two peasants marry, have a son, and live in traditional Breton ways: three generations under one roof, a division of labor between the sexes, elders'' stories at night, politics and religion during their little free time. Times are hard: la Chienne du Monde drives some to suicide; Ankou (death) is close at hand. Pierre is born into this republican family, his lyric childhood interrupted by the outbreak of war and his father''s conscription. He learns his catechism and, as a child of a Reds, also reveres school. His grandfather and father often put him on their shoulders, giving him a ride on the horse of pride.', 'In early twentieth-century Brittany, two peasants marry, have a son, and live in traditional Breton ways: three generations under one roof, a division of labor between the sexes, elders'' stories at night, politics and religion during their little free time. Times are hard: la Chienne du Monde drives some to suicide; Ankou (death) is close at hand. Pierre is born into this republican family, his lyric childhood interrupted by the outbreak of war and his father''s conscription. He learns his catechism and, as a child of a Reds, also reveres school. His grandfather and father often put him on their shoulders, giving him a ride on the horse of pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCtq2zZdtQ8TNStPGTIcIC7v24l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42155'),
  ('854777258798775108', 'The Horse Soldiers', 1959, 'Western, War', 'William H. Clothier, John Ford, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'Martin Rackin, John Lee Mahin', 'John Wayne, William Holden, Constance Towers, Judson Pratt, Hoot Gibson, Ken Curtis, Willis Bouchey, Bing Russell', 'PG', 'A Union Cavalry outfit is sent behind confederate lines in strength to destroy a rail supply center. Along with them is sent a doctor who causes instant antipathy between him and the commander. The secret plan for the mission is overheard by a southern belle who must be taken along to assure her silence.', 'A Union Cavalry outfit is sent behind confederate lines in strength to destroy a rail supply center. Along with them is sent a doctor who causes instant antipathy between him and the commander. The secret plan for the mission is overheard by a southern belle who must be taken along to assure her silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLBwk5ppNsA0DizEocXClTi1Lmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17664'),
  ('392802114026249264', 'The Horse Thief', 1986, 'Drama', 'Tian Zhuangzhuang, Hou Yong, Zhao Fei', 'Rui Zhang', 'Rigzin Tseshang, Jiji Dan, Jamco Jayang, Daiba, Drashi, Gaoba', null, 'Devout Buddhists, Norbu and Dolma live with their young son Tashi in a clan in Tibet. Norbu is a highwayman. After Norbu is charged with stealing from the temple, he and his family are banished. Impoverished and marginalized, they can do little when their beloved son becomes ill. Tashi dies of a fever. After a second son is born, Norbu focuses his every action on keeping this child alive, seeking re-admission to the clan for his wife and child, then risking all to save them from isolation and starvation in winter.', 'Devout Buddhists, Norbu and Dolma live with their young son Tashi in a clan in Tibet. Norbu is a highwayman. After Norbu is charged with stealing from the temple, he and his family are banished. Impoverished and marginalized, they can do little when their beloved son becomes ill. Tashi dies of a fever. After a second son is born, Norbu focuses his every action on keeping this child alive, seeking re-admission to the clan for his wife and child, then risking all to save them from isolation and starvation in winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4hIycQ1SAQQEB14R6V9BsKdWMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42018'),
  ('127170264814314700', 'The Horse Whisperer', 1998, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Richardson, Robert Redford, Ruth A. Redfern', 'Richard LaGravenese, Eric Roth', 'Robert Redford, Kristin Scott Thomas, Sam Neill, Scarlett Johansson, Dianne Wiest, Chris Cooper, Cherry Jones, Ty Hillman', 'PG-13', 'The mother of a severely traumatized daughter enlists the aid of a unique horse trainer to help the girl''s equally injured horse.', 'The mother of a severely traumatized daughter enlists the aid of a unique horse trainer to help the girl''s equally injured horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptkDeHY2mRJVyNRyxb9TgyAjTYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547'),
  ('970551517213946659', 'The Horse with the Flying Tail', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Larry Lansburgh', null, null, null, 'A palimino cow pony, through a series of owners and adventures becomes a champion mount for one of the US equestrian team.', 'A palimino cow pony, through a series of owners and adventures becomes a champion mount for one of the US equestrian team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyDWALCsIicp7VMElh1VOPDrsW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114506'),
  ('208109631182351320', 'The Horse''s Mouth', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Ronald Neame, Arthur Ibbetson, Colin M. Brewer', 'Alec Guinness', 'Alec Guinness, Kay Walsh, Renée Houston, Mike Morgan, Robert Coote, Michael Gough, Veronica Turleigh, Reginald Beckwith', null, 'Gulley Jimson is a boorish aging artist recently released from prison. A swindler in search of his next art project, he hunkers down in the penthouse of would-be patrons the Beeders while they go on an extended vacation; he paints a mural on their wall, pawns their valuables and, along with the sculptor Abel, inadvertently smashes a large hole in their floor. Jimson''s next project is an even larger wall in an abandoned church.', 'Gulley Jimson is a boorish aging artist recently released from prison. A swindler in search of his next art project, he hunkers down in the penthouse of would-be patrons the Beeders while they go on an extended vacation; he paints a mural on their wall, pawns their valuables and, along with the sculptor Abel, inadvertently smashes a large hole in their floor. Jimson''s next project is an even larger wall in an abandoned church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d51I6HuDzwEk5CWZE4E4Uegz3WF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43139'),
  ('32259807081767889', 'The Horseman', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Steven Kastrissios, Mark Broadbent', 'Steven Kastrissios', 'Peter Marshall, Caroline Marohasy, Brad McMurray, Jack Henry, Evert McQueen, Christopher Sommers, Bryan Probets, Steve Tandy', 'R', 'A tender drama unfolds between a grieving father and a troubled teenage girl as they drive northbound along the quiet outback roads of Australia. What she doesn''t know is that between stops, he is leaving behind a bloody trail of bodies in a revenge motivated killing spree.', 'A tender drama unfolds between a grieving father and a troubled teenage girl as they drive northbound along the quiet outback roads of Australia. What she doesn''t know is that between stops, he is leaving behind a bloody trail of bodies in a revenge motivated killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf4N27XD78B5MVKae7j9hHYZWAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33134'),
  ('982818380405585039', 'The Horseman on the Roof', 1995, 'Adventure, Romance, History, Drama', 'Thierry Arbogast, Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Frédéric Auburtin', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Nina Companéez, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Juliette Binoche, Olivier Martinez, Pierre Arditi, François Cluzet, Jean Yanne, Isabelle Carré, Claudio Amendola, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'In a time of war and disease, a young officer gallantly tries to help a young woman find her husband.', 'In a time of war and disease, a young officer gallantly tries to help a young woman find her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsmwnxi8hGXQTNVqBRCAVsfeGON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11876'),
  ('100721734842509215', 'The Horsemen', 1971, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, José López Rodero, Claude Renoir', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Omar Sharif, Leigh Taylor-Young, Jack Palance, Peter Jeffrey, Srinanda De, George Murcell, Eric Pohlmann, Vernon Dobtcheff', 'PG', 'In Afghanistan, the ruthless sport of buzkashi is a game of great pride. When Uraz breaks his leg and loses a spirited match, he brings shame to his village, especially his father. After losing his leg below the knee, Uraz, to regain his honor, must learn to ride again and win with a special, one-of-a-kind horse.', 'In Afghanistan, the ruthless sport of buzkashi is a game of great pride. When Uraz breaks his leg and loses a spirited match, he brings shame to his village, especially his father. After losing his leg below the knee, Uraz, to regain his honor, must learn to ride again and win with a special, one-of-a-kind horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Y4EtsQwcYv0zpiAd3NhhSJOd2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68659'),
  ('11184887527038812', 'The Hospital', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Arthur Hiller, Victor J. Kemper, Peter R. Scoppa', 'Paddy Chayefsky', 'George C. Scott, Diana Rigg, Barnard Hughes, Richard Dysart, Stephen Elliott, Donald Harron, Andrew Duncan, Nancy Marchand', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Bock, the chief of medicine at a Manhattan hospital, is suicidal after the collapse of his personal life. When an intern is found dead in a hospital bed, it appears to Bock to be a case of unforgivable malpractice. Hours later, another doctor, who happens to be responsible for another case of malpractice, is found dead. Despondent, Bock finds himself drawn to Barbara, the daughter of a comatose missionary.', 'Dr. Bock, the chief of medicine at a Manhattan hospital, is suicidal after the collapse of his personal life. When an intern is found dead in a hospital bed, it appears to Bock to be a case of unforgivable malpractice. Hours later, another doctor, who happens to be responsible for another case of malpractice, is found dead. Despondent, Bock finds himself drawn to Barbara, the daughter of a comatose missionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOxi0lUCv8F9HqS8u0cEIthwhc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32082'),
  ('422417059928165526', 'The Host', 2006, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Bong Joon Ho, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Baek Chul-hyun, Bong Joon Ho, Hah Jun-won', 'Song Kang-ho, Byun Hee-bong, Park Hae-il, Bae Doona, Ko A-sung, Oh Dal-su, Lee Jae-eung, Lee Dong-ho', 'R', 'A teenage girl is captured by a giant mutated squid-like creature that appears from Seoul''s Han River after toxic waste was dumped in it, prompting her family into a frantic search for her.', 'A teenage girl is captured by a giant mutated squid-like creature that appears from Seoul''s Han River after toxic waste was dumped in it, prompting her family into a frantic search for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3OE5bpcGHMWYlPkYvgIrncuuGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255'),
  ('125640954045822020', 'The Host', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Niccol, Nicole Treston Abranian, Mike Leonard', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Saoirse Ronan, Diane Kruger, Max Irons, Jake Abel, William Hurt, Frances Fisher, Chandler Canterbury, Boyd Holbrook', 'PG-13', 'A parasitic alien soul is injected into the body of Melanie Stryder. Instead of carrying out her race''s mission of taking over the Earth, "Wanda" (as she comes to be called) forms a bond with her host and sets out to aid other free humans.', 'A parasitic alien soul is injected into the body of Melanie Stryder. Instead of carrying out her race''s mission of taking over the Earth, "Wanda" (as she comes to be called) forms a bond with her host and sets out to aid other free humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mfIZw6WgkCX310eoe0Ys14c3Fi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72710'),
  ('160011154837492673', 'The Hostage', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Nezar Shaker, Sandra Nashaat', 'Nader Salah Al-Din, Nabil Farouk', 'Ahmed Ezz, Yasmin Abdulaziz, Mohamed Sharaf, Maged El Kedwany, Nour, Salah Abdallah, Sameh El-Sereety, Ashraf Meslehi', null, 'When Mostafa arrives to Ukraine, he witnesses the kidnapping of an Egyptian scientist. Eventually he gets involved in rescuing him, in a country he knows nothing about.', 'When Mostafa arrives to Ukraine, he witnesses the kidnapping of an Egyptian scientist. Eventually he gets involved in rescuing him, in a country he knows nothing about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FYiEot1ERkgUzgCEPueQWnwy7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418433'),
  ('125972451414956273', 'The Hot Box', 1972, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Jonathan Demme, Danny Ochoa, Joe Viola', 'Jonathan Demme, Joe Viola', 'Carmen Argenziano, Andrea Cagan, Margaret Markov, Rickey Richardson, Laurie Rose, Zaldy Zshornack, Jose Romulo, Rocco Montalban', 'R', 'After a young village boy dies on San Rosario island, the leader of the People''s Army decides to kidnap a group of American nurses who have traveled there to work at the government medical center, demanding that they help set up a public health dispensary and teach the revolutionaries medical procedures and first aid.', 'After a young village boy dies on San Rosario island, the leader of the People''s Army decides to kidnap a group of American nurses who have traveled there to work at the government medical center, demanding that they help set up a public health dispensary and teach the revolutionaries medical procedures and first aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghKdpvv7pKQqmZkqQt7e6nzc4dY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97653'),
  ('265245270871737961', 'The Hot Chick', 2002, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tim Suhrstedt, Tom Brady, John P. Aguirre', 'Tom Brady, Rob Schneider', 'Rob Schneider, Anna Faris, Matthew Lawrence, Eric Christian Olsen, Robert Davi, Melora Hardin, Alexandra Holden, Rachel McAdams', 'PG-13', 'Not only is Jessica Spencer the most popular girl in school -- she is also the meanest. But things change for the attractive teen when a freak accident involving a cursed pair of earrings and a chance encounter at a gas station causes her to switch bodies with Clive, a sleazy crook. Jessica, in the form of the repulsive Clive, struggles to adjust to this radical alteration and sets out to get her own body back before the upcoming prom.', 'Not only is Jessica Spencer the most popular girl in school -- she is also the meanest. But things change for the attractive teen when a freak accident involving a cursed pair of earrings and a chance encounter at a gas station causes her to switch bodies with Clive, a sleazy crook. Jessica, in the form of the repulsive Clive, struggles to adjust to this radical alteration and sets out to get her own body back before the upcoming prom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnnGE4TKa05t20SZ2batuAhXCp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11852'),
  ('564597361586503492', 'The Hot Flashes', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Susan Seidelman, Frankie DeMarco', 'Brad Hennig', 'Brooke Shields, Daryl Hannah, Wanda Sykes, Andrea Frankle, Virginia Madsen, Camryn Manheim, Eric Roberts, Jessica Rothe', 'R', 'An unlikely basketball team of unappreciated middle-aged Texas women, all former high school champs, challenge the current high school girls’ state champs to raise money for breast cancer prevention. Sparks fly as the women go to comic extremes to prove themselves on and off the court, become a national media sensation, and gain a new lease on life.', 'An unlikely basketball team of unappreciated middle-aged Texas women, all former high school champs, challenge the current high school girls’ state champs to raise money for breast cancer prevention. Sparks fly as the women go to comic extremes to prove themselves on and off the court, become a national media sensation, and gain a new lease on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snonsl2O76GjYWOeyMH5DvPLBcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170752'),
  ('598850669564816004', 'The Hot Girl Juliet', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Ignacio F. Iquino, Ignacio F. Iquino', 'Ignacio F. Iquino, Ricard Reguant', 'Andrea Albani, Eva Lyberten, Antonio Maroño, Joaquín Gómez, Vicky Palma, Jordi Vila, Lluís Torner, José Miralles', null, 'A woman visits her former lesbian lover who''s stuck in a boring marriage. They begin an affair. The lover''s husband and his best friend are also having affairs - with each other''s wives. The girls decide to seduce the other wife.', 'A woman visits her former lesbian lover who''s stuck in a boring marriage. They begin an affair. The lover''s husband and his best friend are also having affairs - with each other''s wives. The girls decide to seduce the other wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYfw22etr0cKgo2pSNTesmUtpAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342213'),
  ('925555505267665770', 'The Hot Nights of Linda', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jesús Franco, Richard Bigotini, Gérard Brisseau', 'Nicole Guettard', 'Alice Arno, Paul Müller, Pierre Taylou, Lina Romay, James Harris, Catherine Lafferière, Monica Swinn, Angelo Bassi', null, 'A young woman is hired to care for an elderly man who lives on an island off the Greek coast. When she arrives there the man warns her that his daughters are evil and dangerous. The woman discovers that one of the daughters is a crazed nymphomaniac who pursues, and seduces, everyone in the house, including her crippled sister.', 'A young woman is hired to care for an elderly man who lives on an island off the Greek coast. When she arrives there the man warns her that his daughters are evil and dangerous. The woman discovers that one of the daughters is a crazed nymphomaniac who pursues, and seduces, everyone in the house, including her crippled sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shNvaIePF3VwELcO3bHRmSMnJuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219814'),
  ('272795212856784463', 'The Hot Rock', 1972, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Peter Yates, Nicholas Sgarro, Ted Zachary', 'William Goldman', 'Robert Redford, George Segal, Ron Leibman, Paul Sand, Moses Gunn, William Redfield, Topo Swope, Charlotte Rae', 'PG', 'Dortmunder and his pals plan to steal a huge diamond from a museum. But this turns out to be only the first time they have to steal it...', 'Dortmunder and his pals plan to steal a huge diamond from a museum. But this turns out to be only the first time they have to steal it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzfGNqmANfRbavk5XdQTsfnjmeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46059'),
  ('120800197804243066', 'The Hot Snow', 1972, 'War, Drama', 'Gavriil Egiazarov, Fyodor Dobronravov, Vladimir Kurgansky', 'Evgeniy Grigorev, Gavriil Egiazarov, Yuri Bondarev', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Vadim Spiridonov, Boris Tokarev, Nikolay Eryomenko, Tamara Sedelnikova, Ara Babadzhanyan, Yuriy Nazarov', null, 'In November, 1942, near the Volga, Stanlingrad is under siege of Commander Friederich Paulus and his 330,000 men. The Russian high command unleashes an operation to protect the Mishkova River to avoid that about four hundred tanks join Paulus'' army. The Soviet artillery soldiers protect their position with their lives in a bloodshed with few survivors.', 'In November, 1942, near the Volga, Stanlingrad is under siege of Commander Friederich Paulus and his 330,000 men. The Russian high command unleashes an operation to protect the Mishkova River to avoid that about four hundred tanks join Paulus'' army. The Soviet artillery soldiers protect their position with their lives in a bloodshed with few survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BrGmWRwUpvv6yb8xltVsPMfzmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63716'),
