  ('616093399623357102', 'The Hound of the Baskervilles', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Rodney Gibbons, Eric Cayla', null, 'Matt Frewer, Kenneth Welsh, Jason London, Emma Campbell, Gordon Masten, Robin Wilcock, Arthur Holden, Leni Parker', null, 'The mysterious death of Sir Charles Baskerville is blamed on a longstanding curse that has followed the Baskerville family for two hundred years. Enigmatic sleuth Sherlock Holmes is on the case to uncover the truth about a monstrous, supernatural hound who roams the moors, waiting to attack the latest heir to the Baskerville estate. Written by Echo Bridge Home Entertainment', 'The mysterious death of Sir Charles Baskerville is blamed on a longstanding curse that has followed the Baskerville family for two hundred years. Enigmatic sleuth Sherlock Holmes is on the case to uncover the truth about a monstrous, supernatural hound who roams the moors, waiting to attack the latest heir to the Baskerville estate. Written by Echo Bridge Home Entertainment', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOaXPlbnWAGIgcu6amLr7v7yCqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25293'),
  ('65548300595762384', 'The Hound of the Baskervilles', 2002, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Drama, Mystery', 'David Attwood, Peter Stenning, James Welland', 'Allan Cubitt', 'Richard Roxburgh, Ian Hart, Richard E. Grant, Matt Day, John Nettles, Geraldine James, Neve McIntosh, Ron Cook', null, 'Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called in to unravel a mysterious curse that has plagued the Baskerville family for generations. When Sir Charles Baskerville is found dead, his heir, Sir Henry, begs Holmes to save him from the terrifying supernatural hound that has brought fear and death to his household.', 'Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called in to unravel a mysterious curse that has plagued the Baskerville family for generations. When Sir Charles Baskerville is found dead, his heir, Sir Henry, begs Holmes to save him from the terrifying supernatural hound that has brought fear and death to his household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVC7KS1LSKJ18yGqk8a6CfGOCuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28486'),
  ('626477347985151440', 'The Hour and Turn of Augusto Matraga', 1965, 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Ivan de Souza, Roberto Santos, Hélio Silva', 'Roberto Santos', 'Leonardo Villar, Jofre Soares, Maria Ribeiro, Maurício do Valle, Flávio Migliaccio, Emmanuel Cavalcanti, Solano Trindade, Áurea Campos', null, 'Augusto Matraga is a violent agressive farmer who, after being betrayed by his wife and trapped by several enemies, is bitten up and left for dead, being rescued by a couple of humble small farmers who nurse him for a long time until he is well again. Influenced by the couple, Matraga starts a long penitent life while waiting for his hour and chance to payback, starting a fight between his violent nature, his hidden desire of vengeance and the mysticism and goodness which is also part of him.', 'Augusto Matraga is a violent agressive farmer who, after being betrayed by his wife and trapped by several enemies, is bitten up and left for dead, being rescued by a couple of humble small farmers who nurse him for a long time until he is well again. Influenced by the couple, Matraga starts a long penitent life while waiting for his hour and chance to payback, starting a fight between his violent nature, his hidden desire of vengeance and the mysticism and goodness which is also part of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eroRmpZTYV2xLOZ88MPab6CZw6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194785'),
  ('977517571841389754', 'The Hour of the Furnaces', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Fernando E. Solanas, Octavio Getino, Juan Carlos Desanzo', 'Fernando E. Solanas, Octavio Getino', 'María de la Paz, Fernando E. Solanas, Edgardo Suárez, Juan Domingo Perón, Che Guevara, Fidel Castro', null, 'An impassioned three-part documentary of the liberation struggle waged throughout Latin America, using Argentina as a historical example of the imperialist exploitation of the continent. Part I: Neo-Colonialism and Violence is a historical, geographic, and economic analysis of Argentina. Part II: An Act For Liberation examines the ten-year reign of Juan Perón (1945-55) and the activities of the Peronist movement after his fall from power. Part III: Violence and Liberation studies the role of violence in the national liberation process and constitutes a call for action.', 'An impassioned three-part documentary of the liberation struggle waged throughout Latin America, using Argentina as a historical example of the imperialist exploitation of the continent. Part I: Neo-Colonialism and Violence is a historical, geographic, and economic analysis of Argentina. Part II: An Act For Liberation examines the ten-year reign of Juan Perón (1945-55) and the activities of the Peronist movement after his fall from power. Part III: Violence and Liberation studies the role of violence in the national liberation process and constitutes a call for action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/750AVmOtNEXAaOzW9ArwbP8IrRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89681'),
  ('109815288570014670', 'The Hour of the Pig', 1993, 'Drama, History, Thriller, Crime, Romance, Mystery', 'Leslie Megahey, John Hooper', 'Leslie Megahey', 'Colin Firth, Ian Holm, Donald Pleasence, Amina Annabi, Nicol Williamson, Michael Gough, Harriet Walter, Jim Carter', 'R', 'In medieval France, young lawyer Richard Courtois leaves Paris for the simpler life in the country. However, he is soon drawn into amorous and political intrigues. At the same time, he is pushed to defend a pig, owned by the mysterious gypsy Samira. The pig has been arrested for the murder of a young boy.', 'In medieval France, young lawyer Richard Courtois leaves Paris for the simpler life in the country. However, he is soon drawn into amorous and political intrigues. At the same time, he is pushed to defend a pig, owned by the mysterious gypsy Samira. The pig has been arrested for the murder of a young boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6JNPDyNlbVMgLPT7Dbd5WRRHij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70912'),
  ('1149948273757297622', 'The Hourglass Sanatorium', 1973, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Wojciech Has, Witold Sobociński, Halina Garus', 'Wojciech Has', 'Jan Nowicki, Tadeusz Kondrat, Irena Orska, Filip Zylber, Halina Kowalska, Gustaw Holoubek, Mieczysław Voit, Bożena Adamek', null, 'Jozef visits a dilapidated Sanatorium to see his father. Jozef undertakes a strange journey through the many rooms of the sanatorium, each which conjures worlds composed of his memories, dreams and nightmares.', 'Jozef visits a dilapidated Sanatorium to see his father. Jozef undertakes a strange journey through the many rooms of the sanatorium, each which conjures worlds composed of his memories, dreams and nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV6LsDuRHPGbQqRsaAAu3xHgflW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45698'),
  ('642650947667924981', 'The Hours', 2002, 'Drama', 'Seamus McGarvey, Stephen Daldry, Kenny Bates', 'David Hare', 'Julianne Moore, Nicole Kidman, Meryl Streep, Stephen Dillane, Miranda Richardson, Linda Bassett, Lyndsey Marshal, Christian Coulson', 'PG-13', 'The story of three women searching for more potent, meaningful lives. Each is alive at a different time and place, all are linked by their yearnings and their fears. Their stories intertwine, and finally come together in a surprising, transcendent moment of shared recognition.', 'The story of three women searching for more potent, meaningful lives. Each is alive at a different time and place, all are linked by their yearnings and their fears. Their stories intertwine, and finally come together in a surprising, transcendent moment of shared recognition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4myDtowDJQPQnkEDB1IWGtJR1Fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590'),
  ('1130866373551664689', 'The Hours and Times', 1991, 'Drama', 'Christopher Münch', 'Christopher Münch', 'Ian Hart, David Angus, Stephanie Pack, Robin McDonald, Sergio Moreno, Unity Grimwood', null, 'A fictionalized account of what may have happened when John Lennon and Brian Epstein went on holiday together to Spain in 1963.', 'A fictionalized account of what may have happened when John Lennon and Brian Epstein went on holiday together to Spain in 1963.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26OR8tO2BC1BfbnoQQ0woRixLqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32881'),
  ('512766552360530991', 'The Hours of the Day', 2003, 'Drama', 'Jaime Rosales, Óscar Durán, Pep Armengol', 'Enric Rufas, Jaime Rosales', 'Àlex Brendemühl, Vicente Romero Sánchez, María Antonia Martínez, Àgata Roca, Josep Maria Domènech, Isabel Rocatti, Pape Monsoriu, Anna Sahun', null, 'Abel lives with his mother in a small town on the outskirts of Barcelona. His life, grey and boring, is based on the small family business, his mother''s house, his girlfriend''s bed, and the town bars. However under an appearance of quiet and gentle man, Abel hides a dark and morbid personality.', 'Abel lives with his mother in a small town on the outskirts of Barcelona. His life, grey and boring, is based on the small family business, his mother''s house, his girlfriend''s bed, and the town bars. However under an appearance of quiet and gentle man, Abel hides a dark and morbid personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQX5H4xAApoiGkDQVeXYM5oiT03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102514'),
  ('851232896043150708', 'The House', 1997, 'Drama', 'Šarūnas Bartas, Šarūnas Bartas, Rimvydas Leipus', 'Šarūnas Bartas, Yekaterina Golubeva', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Leos Carax, Eglė Kuckaitė, Viktorija Nareiko, Jean-Louis Loca, Alex Descas, Oksana Chernych, Micaela Cardoso', null, 'A moving world of spirits and ghosts, condemned to brush against one another without really meeting since they have all emerged from a single perpetual dream: that of a young man who no longer wants to wake up, immersed as he is in this world of fascinating spectres.', 'A moving world of spirits and ghosts, condemned to brush against one another without really meeting since they have all emerged from a single perpetual dream: that of a young man who no longer wants to wake up, immersed as he is in this world of fascinating spectres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqPr7qnM3J2XoXrOsr3ZmSOY0ZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32712'),
  ('463345387719503414', 'The House', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Allan Graf, Andrew J. Cohen, Jas Shelton', 'Brendan O''Brien, Andrew J. Cohen', 'Amy Poehler, Will Ferrell, Jason Mantzoukas, Ryan Simpkins, Nick Kroll, Allison Tolman, Rob Huebel, Christina Offley', 'R', 'When Scott and Kate Johansen’s daughter gets into the college of her dreams it’s cause for celebration. That is, until Scott and Kate learn that the scholarship they were counting on didn’t come through, and they’re now on the hook for tuition they can’t begin to afford. With the help of their friend and neighbor Frank also in need of a major payday they decide to open an illegal casino in his suburban house, risking everything together on a Vegas-style bacchanal where money flows, inhibitions are checked at the door, and all bets are off.', 'When Scott and Kate Johansen’s daughter gets into the college of her dreams it’s cause for celebration. That is, until Scott and Kate learn that the scholarship they were counting on didn’t come through, and they’re now on the hook for tuition they can’t begin to afford. With the help of their friend and neighbor Frank also in need of a major payday they decide to open an illegal casino in his suburban house, risking everything together on a Vegas-style bacchanal where money flows, inhibitions are checked at the door, and all bets are off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkmWkVgirei79bwds23Hr0lWSXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345914'),
  ('818136266831618207', 'The House', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Stefan Ciupek, Nessie Nesslauer, Rick Ostermann', 'Rick Ostermann, Patrick Brunken', 'Tobias Moretti, Valery Tscheplanowa, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Lisa Vicari, Max von der Groeben, Samir Fuchs, Daniel Krauss, Alexander Wipprecht', null, 'A married couple retreats to a luxury, high-tech, fully automated house on a remote island. The house AI system goes rogue and turns against them.', 'A married couple retreats to a luxury, high-tech, fully automated house on a remote island. The house AI system goes rogue and turns against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TQR2KEWbtBtabKIBwadrVmLydY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876566'),
  ('461254445322620131', 'The House', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Valérie Wery, Yann Maritaud, Denis Mauguit', 'Anissa Bonnefont, Diastème', 'Ana Girardot, Aure Atika, Rossy de Palma, Yannick Renier, Philippe Rebbot, Gina Jimenez, Nikita Bellucci, Lucas Englander', null, 'Emma, a French novelist aged 27, decide to go to Berlin and join a brothel to uncover the prostitution world, the subject of her new book. Such as gonzo journalism, Emma become a prostitute and her experience, which was supposed to last a few weeks, will last two years. Was writing her book an excuse for Emma to live a shameful fantasy?', 'Emma, a French novelist aged 27, decide to go to Berlin and join a brothel to uncover the prostitution world, the subject of her new book. Such as gonzo journalism, Emma become a prostitute and her experience, which was supposed to last a few weeks, will last two years. Was writing her book an excuse for Emma to live a shameful fantasy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz6h2hfQ692jeeEkzfgFceyd50Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960139'),
  ('1051264473721517514', 'The House', 2024, 'Drama', 'Álex Montoya, Guillem Oliver, Gloria Guillot', 'Álex Montoya, Joana M. Ortueta', 'David Verdaguer, Luis Callejo, Óscar de la Fuente, Olivia Molina, María Romanillos, Lorena López, Marta Belenguer, Jordi Aguilar', null, 'After the death of their father, three siblings return to the family home where they grew up. They intend to sell it and follow their very different paths. But as memories surface in every corner, a fear of getting rid of the past and an impulse to reunite grows in them. As a last tribute to their father, there may still be time to make up for lost time and the house may witness new stories.', 'After the death of their father, three siblings return to the family home where they grew up. They intend to sell it and follow their very different paths. But as memories surface in every corner, a fear of getting rid of the past and an impulse to reunite grows in them. As a last tribute to their father, there may still be time to make up for lost time and the house may witness new stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpic0UkV1imMnAxL26QOktRXtDg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244869'),
  ('482009239905345901', 'The House Across the Bay', 1940, 'Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Myles Connolly, Kathryn Scola', 'George Raft, Joan Bennett, Lloyd Nolan, Walter Pidgeon, Gladys George, Billy Wayne, June Knight, Peggy Shannon', 'NR', 'Nightclub owner Steve Larwitt sees his empire of investments collapse as he faces tax evasion charges and attacks by rivals. Believing Steve will be safer in prison for one year, his wife, Brenda, testifies against him on advice from his lawyer, Slant Kolma, who is in love with her. After Steve receives 10 years in Alcatraz, Brenda moves to be near him and avoids advances of airplane builder Tim Nolan, who knows nothing about her past.', 'Nightclub owner Steve Larwitt sees his empire of investments collapse as he faces tax evasion charges and attacks by rivals. Believing Steve will be safer in prison for one year, his wife, Brenda, testifies against him on advice from his lawyer, Slant Kolma, who is in love with her. After Steve receives 10 years in Alcatraz, Brenda moves to be near him and avoids advances of airplane builder Tim Nolan, who knows nothing about her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvev9b5FZ4IJplUJpVta6sgmN05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37956'),
  ('455321718519392219', 'The House Across the Lake', 1954, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ken Hughes, Walter J. Harvey, Jimmy Sangster', 'Ken Hughes', 'Alex Nicol, Hillary Brooke, Sidney James, Susan Stephen, Paul Carpenter, Alan Wheatley, Peter Illing, Gordon McLeod', 'NR', 'Sensuous and desirable, Carol Forrest has always attracted the attention of men. Expert in the art of manipulation and control she married an older man, loving only his vast wealth and continued to amuse herself with indiscreet affairs. But when neighbour Mark Kendrick lets slip that her husband intends cutting her out of his will Carol concentrates all her attentions on the unsuspecting Kendrick, obtaining his help to dispose of this irritating obstacle.', 'Sensuous and desirable, Carol Forrest has always attracted the attention of men. Expert in the art of manipulation and control she married an older man, loving only his vast wealth and continued to amuse herself with indiscreet affairs. But when neighbour Mark Kendrick lets slip that her husband intends cutting her out of his will Carol concentrates all her attentions on the unsuspecting Kendrick, obtaining his help to dispose of this irritating obstacle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNbER9xrXtNtJPUKBOGvzruWGYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32941'),
  ('1085617022612810420', 'The House Among the Cactuses', 2022, 'Drama', 'Carlota González-Adrio, María Rodrigo, Kiko de la Rica', 'Paul Pen', 'Ariadna Gil, Daniel Grao, Ricardo Gómez, Zoé Arnao, Aina Picarolo', null, 'The island of Gran Canaria. At the end of the 70s. Rosa and Emilio live with their five daughters, isolated from the world in the middle of a valley. In this wild place, they lead an alternative, harmonious life, until the appearance of a lost hiker, who they agree to help. This occurrence, very much out of the ordinary for the family, will lead to an extreme and hostile situation and will reveal the suffocating, dark nature of the house among the cactuses and its inhabitants.', 'The island of Gran Canaria. At the end of the 70s. Rosa and Emilio live with their five daughters, isolated from the world in the middle of a valley. In this wild place, they lead an alternative, harmonious life, until the appearance of a lost hiker, who they agree to help. This occurrence, very much out of the ordinary for the family, will lead to an extreme and hostile situation and will reveal the suffocating, dark nature of the house among the cactuses and its inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3imivupchNPZjXCeFUVbo1YzWqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895957'),
  ('534116547867640452', 'The House at the End of Time', 2013, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Alejandro Hidalgo', 'Alejandro Hidalgo', 'Ruddy Rodriguez, Gonzalo Cubero, Guillermo García, Adriana Calzadilla, Rosmel Bustamante, Hector Mercado, Miguel Flores, Simona Chirinos', null, 'The story of Dulce, a mother who has encounters with apparitions inside her old house. She must decipher a mystery that could trigger a prophecy: the death of her family.', 'The story of Dulce, a mother who has encounters with apparitions inside her old house. She must decipher a mystery that could trigger a prophecy: the death of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88keS5TaMqlbuqCZIgwwusmv4tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207686'),
  ('588656617808966126', 'The House Bunny', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Fred Wolf, Shelly Johnson', 'Karen McCullah, Kirsten Smith', 'Anna Faris, Colin Hanks, Emma Stone, Kat Dennings, Hugh Hefner, Christopher McDonald, Beverly D''Angelo, Katharine McPhee', 'PG-13', 'Shelley is living a carefree life until a rival gets her tossed out of the Playboy Mansion. With nowhere to go, fate delivers her to the sorority girls from Zeta Alpha Zeta. Unless they can sign a new pledge class, the seven socially clueless women will lose their house to the scheming girls of Phi Iota Mu. In order to accomplish their goal, they need Shelley to teach them the ways of makeup and men; at the same time, Shelley needs some of what the Zetas have - a sense of individuality. The combination leads all the girls to learn how to stop pretending and start being themselves.', 'Shelley is living a carefree life until a rival gets her tossed out of the Playboy Mansion. With nowhere to go, fate delivers her to the sorority girls from Zeta Alpha Zeta. Unless they can sign a new pledge class, the seven socially clueless women will lose their house to the scheming girls of Phi Iota Mu. In order to accomplish their goal, they need Shelley to teach them the ways of makeup and men; at the same time, Shelley needs some of what the Zetas have - a sense of individuality. The combination leads all the girls to learn how to stop pretending and start being themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oGGJ824vqIqDtyMvMuK44pDEmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12620'),
  ('1063308501856198738', 'The House by the Cemetery', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Lucio Fulci, Sergio Salvati, Roberto Giandalia', 'Lucio Fulci, Giorgio Mariuzzo, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Catriona MacColl, Paolo Malco, Ania Pieroni, Giovanni Frezza, Silvia Collatina, Dagmar Lassander, Giovanni De Nava, Gianpaolo Saccarola', 'NR', 'After a doctor kills his mistress and himself while researching the mysterious previous owner of his Boston home, his colleague, Dr. Norman Boyle, takes over his studies and moves his family into the Boston mansion. Soon after, Boyle''s young son Bob becomes plagued by visions of a young girl, who warns him of the danger within the house.', 'After a doctor kills his mistress and himself while researching the mysterious previous owner of his Boston home, his colleague, Dr. Norman Boyle, takes over his studies and moves his family into the Boston mansion. Soon after, Boyle''s young son Bob becomes plagued by visions of a young girl, who warns him of the danger within the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNUXcoopDqshs5xd2lOwUl1g4Df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28794'),
  ('236198141336376967', 'The House by the Lake', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Fruet, Robert Saad', 'William Fruet', 'Brenda Vaccaro, Don Stroud, Chuck Shamata, Richard Ayres, Kyle Edwards, Don Granbery, Ed McNamara, Michael Kirby', 'R', 'Harry is a rich dentist who often brings women up to his rural lakehouse. One weekend, he invites Diane, a former fashion model. On their way to the house, Diane runs a gang of thugs off the road. Humiliated, the thugs track down the couple for revenge.', 'Harry is a rich dentist who often brings women up to his rural lakehouse. One weekend, he invites Diane, a former fashion model. On their way to the house, Diane runs a gang of thugs off the road. Humiliated, the thugs track down the couple for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64WSTKOOknDQCd6slTwBqbN6UUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40343'),
  ('262870622191572032', 'The House by the Sea', 2017, 'Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Pierre Milon, Ferdinand Verhaeghe', 'Robert Guédiguian, Serge Valletti', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Jacques Boudet, Anaïs Demoustier, Robinson Stévenin, Yann Trégouët, Geneviève Mnich', null, 'By a little bay near Marseille lies a picturesque villa owned by an old man. His three children have gathered by his side for his last days. It’s time for them to weigh up what they have inherited of their father’s ideals and the community spirit he created in this magical place. The arrival, at a nearby cove, of a group of boat people will throw these moments of reflection into turmoil.', 'By a little bay near Marseille lies a picturesque villa owned by an old man. His three children have gathered by his side for his last days. It’s time for them to weigh up what they have inherited of their father’s ideals and the community spirit he created in this magical place. The arrival, at a nearby cove, of a group of boat people will throw these moments of reflection into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwBFXdxxh3CWtWgPlfT8MxnfApz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468207'),
  ('709028878337538812', 'The House Elf', 2019, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Evgeniy Bedarev, Andrey Kuznetsov', 'Evgeniy Bedarev, Dmitriy Bedarev', 'Ekaterina Guseva, Sergey Chirkov, Pavel Derevyanko, Yuliya Sules, Olga Ostroumova-Gutshmidt, Alexandra Politik, Tatyana Orlova, Sergey Rubeko', null, 'In an ordinary Moscow there is an unusual House — with a strange apartment in which not a single resident has stayed for long. And as soon as an independent mother and her lovely 8-year-old daughter moved there, the new residents find out that their living space is not that ordinary, and that the real House Elf lives there. But the House Elf has long been offended by the whole human race and would do all imaginable filth in order to remain alone in the ill-fated apartment.', 'In an ordinary Moscow there is an unusual House — with a strange apartment in which not a single resident has stayed for long. And as soon as an independent mother and her lovely 8-year-old daughter moved there, the new residents find out that their living space is not that ordinary, and that the real House Elf lives there. But the House Elf has long been offended by the whole human race and would do all imaginable filth in order to remain alone in the ill-fated apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amn6ZxnazHGZAONxVVfra08L40M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576026'),
  ('29293019583931876', 'The House I Live In', 1945, 'Drama, Music', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Robert De Grasse, Axel Stordahl', 'Albert Maltz', 'Frank Sinatra, Teddy Infuhr, Harry McKim, Merrill Rodin, Axel Stordahl', 'NR', 'Frank Sinatra teaches a group of young boys a lesson in religious tolerance.', 'Frank Sinatra teaches a group of young boys a lesson in religious tolerance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFFiSdNXdWIvMNU1YDDUN75DB7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148075'),
  ('574863048479913846', 'The House I Live In', 1957, 'Drama', 'Yakov Segel, Lev Kulidzhanov, Vyacheslav Shumskiy', 'Iosif Olshansky', 'Valentina Telegina, Nikolai Yelizarov, Vladimir Zemlyanikin, Yuri Myasnikov, Yevgeny Matveyev, Rimma Shorokhova, Pavel Shalnov, Mikhail Ulyanov', null, '1935. Two families — Davydov''s with three children and the newlyweds Lida and Dmitri Kashirin''s — enter the new house on the outskirts of Moscow into a common communal apartment. The children grow up, and they and the adults around them are looking for their place in life, looking for answers to the questions of who to be and what to be, quarreling, making peace, building relationships, destroying them. Six years later, the peaceful lives of characters, with their joys and misfortunes, quarrels and reconciliations, and complex personal relationships, are blown up by a war that connects everyone at once, forcing them to see the meaning of their days, their attitudes to each other and their life values in a different way. For some of them, war is a fatal trait.', '1935. Two families — Davydov''s with three children and the newlyweds Lida and Dmitri Kashirin''s — enter the new house on the outskirts of Moscow into a common communal apartment. The children grow up, and they and the adults around them are looking for their place in life, looking for answers to the questions of who to be and what to be, quarreling, making peace, building relationships, destroying them. Six years later, the peaceful lives of characters, with their joys and misfortunes, quarrels and reconciliations, and complex personal relationships, are blown up by a war that connects everyone at once, forcing them to see the meaning of their days, their attitudes to each other and their life values in a different way. For some of them, war is a fatal trait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHQfQsAOoOBq613ODKrPF1jgEgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94691'),
  ('186852578638773654', 'The House I Live In', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Eugene Jarecki, Sam Cullman, Derek Hallquist', 'Eugene Jarecki', 'Eugene Jarecki, Joe Biden, George H. W. Bush, Rudolph Giuliani, John McCain, Nelson Rockefeller, Hillary Clinton, Bill Clinton', 'NR', 'In the past 40 years, the War on Drugs has accounted for 45 million arrests, made America the world''s largest jailer, and destroyed impoverished communities at home and abroad. Yet drugs are cheaper, purer, and more available today than ever. Where did we go wrong?', 'In the past 40 years, the War on Drugs has accounted for 45 million arrests, made America the world''s largest jailer, and destroyed impoverished communities at home and abroad. Yet drugs are cheaper, purer, and more available today than ever. Where did we go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij5f92p8wdZMmLc1wmaDzkGdz7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84284'),
  ('609917607652067467', 'The House in Karp Lane', 1965, 'Drama', 'Kurt Hoffmann, Josef Illík, Helmut Schmid', 'Gerd Angermann', 'Edith Schultze-Westrum, František Filipovský, Ladislav Kríz, Wolfgang Kieling, Rosel Schäfer, Helmut Schmid, Walter Taub, Hana Vítová', null, 'The film depicts the fate of the residents of an apartment block in Prague’s Jewish quarter following the invasion by German troops in 1939. Among them is an elderly widow who had once disowned her son and now wishes to bring him to Brazil; there are also the owners of a stationery shop, who are driven to ruin by the German occupiers. The caretaker Glaser, who is of German descent, also comes under pressure when his son is arrested in a communist pub. To save his own skin, he informs on two young people who are active in the resistance.', 'The film depicts the fate of the residents of an apartment block in Prague’s Jewish quarter following the invasion by German troops in 1939. Among them is an elderly widow who had once disowned her son and now wishes to bring him to Brazil; there are also the owners of a stationery shop, who are driven to ruin by the German occupiers. The caretaker Glaser, who is of German descent, also comes under pressure when his son is arrested in a communist pub. To save his own skin, he informs on two young people who are active in the resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbxG6ZnGBak01KZ8wAgfgMJ0gVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265121'),
  ('175812399976990237', 'The House in Marsh Road', 1960, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Montgomery Tully, Douglas Hickox', 'Maurice J. Wilson', 'Tony Wright, Patricia Dainton, Sandra Dorne, Derek Aylward, Sam Kydd, Llewellyn Rees, Anita Sharp-Bolster, Roddy Hughes', null, 'When a woman inherits a valuable house, her nasty husband and his mistress plot murder. But the house has a protective poltergeist who thwarts the wicked pair.', 'When a woman inherits a valuable house, her nasty husband and his mistress plot murder. But the house has a protective poltergeist who thwarts the wicked pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zjdKB8TPCdrPsQxSTtPzfjUOYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119207'),
  ('150726084439545511', 'The House in Nightmare Park', 1973, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Peter Sykes, Michael Dryhurst, Ian Wilson', 'Clive Exton, Terry Nation', 'Frankie Howerd, Ray Milland, Hugh Burden, Kenneth Griffith, John Bennett, Rosalie Crutchley, Ruth Dunning, Elizabeth MacLennan', 'PG', 'Comedy legend Frankie Howerd stars as the victim of sinister shenanigans in this hilarious spoof of British horror films of the early ‘70s. Starring Hugh Burden and Oscar winner Ray Milland, and written by Terry Nation. Foster Twelvetrees, a struggling tragedian who scrapes a living by giving hammy performances from the classics, can hardly believe his luck when he’s invited to give a dramatic reading at the country home of a well-off family. Joy soon turns to outraged horror when he discovers dead bodies, foul intentions, lots of snakes and a madwoman in the attic. Can he uncover the hidden family secret before he comes to a sticky end..?', 'Comedy legend Frankie Howerd stars as the victim of sinister shenanigans in this hilarious spoof of British horror films of the early ‘70s. Starring Hugh Burden and Oscar winner Ray Milland, and written by Terry Nation. Foster Twelvetrees, a struggling tragedian who scrapes a living by giving hammy performances from the classics, can hardly believe his luck when he’s invited to give a dramatic reading at the country home of a well-off family. Joy soon turns to outraged horror when he discovers dead bodies, foul intentions, lots of snakes and a madwoman in the attic. Can he uncover the hidden family secret before he comes to a sticky end..?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0YxNjeoIe4eglkVYxTlYhXLnhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143369'),
  ('634796213082171981', 'The House in the Middle', 1954, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Short film that emphasizes the importance of keeping a tidy home when facing an atomic bomb.', 'Short film that emphasizes the importance of keeping a tidy home when facing an atomic bomb.', null, 'tmdb:movie:148438'),
  ('537870912971774326', 'The House in the Square', 1951, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Georges Périnal, Roy Ward Baker', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Tyrone Power, Ann Blyth, Michael Rennie, Dennis Price, Beatrice Campbell, Kathleen Byron, Raymond Huntley, Irene Browne', 'NR', 'Atomic scientist Peter Standish travels back in time to 1784, an era he has read about in his forefather''s diaries. He falls in love with his forefather''s cousin, Helen, but his contemporaries of 1784 are perplexed by his strange talk and the odd knowledge he possesses. Remake of Berkeley Square (1933).', 'Atomic scientist Peter Standish travels back in time to 1784, an era he has read about in his forefather''s diaries. He falls in love with his forefather''s cousin, Helen, but his contemporaries of 1784 are perplexed by his strange talk and the odd knowledge he possesses. Remake of Berkeley Square (1933).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOwY5WyyMpRRF6uRWrDQWdH6SDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68439'),
  ('1141303426354737705', 'The House Is Black', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Forugh Farrokhzad, Soleyman Minasian', 'Forugh Farrokhzad', 'Forugh Farrokhzad, Ebrahim Golestan, Hossein Mansouri', null, 'Set in a leper colony in the north of Iran, The House is Black juxtaposes "ugliness," of which there is much in the world as stated in the opening scenes, with religion and gratitude.', 'Set in a leper colony in the north of Iran, The House is Black juxtaposes "ugliness," of which there is much in the world as stated in the opening scenes, with religion and gratitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPiSeBkcIRL0r3XQ0FeNhh19mW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44065'),
  ('962758636681609747', 'The House Next Door', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeff Woolnough, David Herrington, William Spahic', 'Suzette Couture', 'Lara Flynn Boyle, Colin Ferguson, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Noam Jenkins, Julie Stewart, Heather Hanson, Charlotte Sullivan, Natalie Lisinska', null, 'Walker Kennedy and his wife Col are a happy, voluntarily childless suburban couple. Then the thing they fear the most happens: part of their green surrounding is turned into a building site, for what turns out to be the widely acclaimed first house built by attractive, brilliant, obsessively devoted architect Kim (30), who has a short affair with Col. Kim is even enchanted by his own house, just like everyone else. However each subsequent couple that moves into the house soon turns nasty, never staying for long, ending in tears and/or blood. When Kim finally buys it with his wife, Col who believes he somehow curses all his buildings insists it''s time to deal with him, permanently.', 'Walker Kennedy and his wife Col are a happy, voluntarily childless suburban couple. Then the thing they fear the most happens: part of their green surrounding is turned into a building site, for what turns out to be the widely acclaimed first house built by attractive, brilliant, obsessively devoted architect Kim (30), who has a short affair with Col. Kim is even enchanted by his own house, just like everyone else. However each subsequent couple that moves into the house soon turns nasty, never staying for long, ending in tears and/or blood. When Kim finally buys it with his wife, Col who believes he somehow curses all his buildings insists it''s time to deal with him, permanently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spz8wKhIuhWVrSCuDagDDvzkviQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18742'),
  ('61358322874427917', 'The House Next Door: Meet the Blacks 2', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Dave Perkal, Yor-El Francis, Nicholas Hiles', 'Corey Harrell', 'Mike Epps, Katt Williams, Bresha Webb, Lil Duval, Zulay Henao, Andrew Bachelor, Tyrin Turner, Michael Blackson', 'R', 'Bestselling author Carl Black moves his family back to his childhood home, he must team up with oddball neighbors to do battle with a pimp, who may or may not be an actual vampire.', 'Bestselling author Carl Black moves his family back to his childhood home, he must team up with oddball neighbors to do battle with a pimp, who may or may not be an actual vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Yo3wwbzlKLgzH7Wd8YZniNYC24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583116'),
  ('1136742593617008707', 'The House of Bernarda Alba', 1987, 'Drama', 'Mario Camus, Mischa Muller, Walter Prieto', 'Mario Camus, Antonio Larreta', 'Irene Gutiérrez Caba, Ana Belén, Florinda Chico, Enriqueta Carballeira, Vicky Peña, Aurora Pastor, Mercedes Lezcano, Pilar Puchol', null, 'After the death of her husband Bernarda Alba puts her daughters under a rigurous mourning which does not even allow them to leave the house.', 'After the death of her husband Bernarda Alba puts her daughters under a rigurous mourning which does not even allow them to leave the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UzzZIVuy3YUe7FeUrBKfsNvdMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98997'),
  ('481379973629387000', 'The House of Branching Love', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Mark Lwoff, Elina Pohjola', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Sami Keski-Vähälä, Petri Karra', 'Elina Knihtilä, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Kati Outinen, Anna Easteden, Antti Reini, Tommi Eronen, Irina Björklund, Kari Väänänen', null, 'The story recounts the breakup of a thirty-something professional couple - Juhani, a family therapist, and his wife, Tuula, a successful business trainer.', 'The story recounts the breakup of a thirty-something professional couple - Juhani, a family therapist, and his wife, Tuula, a successful business trainer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8au9fWMhLYPjXbXZwnqCFgvobu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29007'),
  ('50229773225363759', 'The House of Clocks', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Lucio Fulci, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Daniele Stroppa', 'Keith Van Hoven, Karina Huff, Paolo Paoloni, Bettine Milne, Peter Hintz, Al Cliver, Carla Cassola, Paolo Bernardini', null, 'A gang of ruthless thugs intent on robbery prey upon a seemingly harmless elderly couple, Vittorio and Sara. The simple plan turns into a terrifying nightmare, as Vittorio''s antique clock collection mysteriously turns back time. Now the hunters become the hunted and the old couple becomes a vengeful, malevolent force.', 'A gang of ruthless thugs intent on robbery prey upon a seemingly harmless elderly couple, Vittorio and Sara. The simple plan turns into a terrifying nightmare, as Vittorio''s antique clock collection mysteriously turns back time. Now the hunters become the hunted and the old couple becomes a vengeful, malevolent force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQjBerIRbkV6B0BzA3rF1AzhlNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39992'),
  ('516234737009196803', 'The House of Exorcism', 1975, 'Horror', 'Mario Bava, Alfredo Leone, Cecilio Paniagua', 'Mario Bava, Alberto Cittini, Alfredo Leone', 'Telly Savalas, Elke Sommer, Robert Alda, Sylva Koscina, Alida Valli, Gabriele Tinti, Espartaco Santoni, Eduardo Fajardo', 'R', 'A re-edited version of Mario Bava''s "Lisa and the Devil" for the U.S. market, including newly filmed scenes involving a possessed Lisa.', 'A re-edited version of Mario Bava''s "Lisa and the Devil" for the U.S. market, including newly filmed scenes involving a possessed Lisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cWz58SkhQ0RAhdkvdm7KyWv4hS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262871'),
  ('410565622762743977', 'The House of Fear', 1945, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, Virgil Miller', 'Roy Chanslor', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Aubrey Mather, Paul Cavanagh, Dennis Hoey, Harry Cording, Holmes Herbert, Sally Shepherd', 'NR', 'The Good Comrades are a collection of varied gentlemen who crave one thing - solitude. They reside at Drearcliff House, ancestral home of their eldest member. All seems serene and convivial until one by one the members begin to perish in the most grisly of manners. Foul play is suspected by the Good Comrades'' insurance agent, who turns to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. John Watson for guidance.', 'The Good Comrades are a collection of varied gentlemen who crave one thing - solitude. They reside at Drearcliff House, ancestral home of their eldest member. All seems serene and convivial until one by one the members begin to perish in the most grisly of manners. Foul play is suspected by the Good Comrades'' insurance agent, who turns to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. John Watson for guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tHTXEnBmnTX4tJUQ5JAIKosp3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33419'),
  ('427514936285736794', 'The House of Flowers Presents: The Funeral', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Manolo Caro', 'Manolo Caro', 'Cecilia Suárez, Aislinn Derbez, Dario Yazbek Bernal, Juan Pablo Medina, Paco León, Luis de la Rosa, Arturo Ríos, Verónica Langer', 'R', 'The de la Mora siblings publicly mourn the death of their mother amid multiple surprises and mishaps at Virginia''s funeral.', 'The de la Mora siblings publicly mourn the death of their mother amid multiple surprises and mishaps at Virginia''s funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDUU1r7pFCbBuuGwRv2X4z0BqGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693359'),
  ('1148327603233060531', 'The House of Flowers: The Movie', 2021, 'Drama', 'Manolo Caro, Sebastián Hiriart, Andrea Toca', 'Manolo Caro', 'Cecilia Suárez, Aislinn Derbez, Dario Yazbek Bernal, Juan Pablo Medina, Paco León, Angélica María, Isabel Burr, Ximena Sariñana', 'R', 'The De La Mora siblings concoct a mischievous plan to break into their old family home to retrieve a hidden treasure of significant importance.', 'The De La Mora siblings concoct a mischievous plan to break into their old family home to retrieve a hidden treasure of significant importance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzbwTwSo8aKuvAytaPG6s0xGVE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833971'),
  ('282779494817935695', 'The House of Fools', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marek Koterski, Krzysztof Rogala, Monika Skowrońska', 'Marek Koterski', 'Tadeusz Łomnicki, Bohdana Majda, Marek Kondrat, Leszek Teleszyński, Anna Nehrebecka, Dorota Radzimińska, Bożena Adamek, Cezary Morawski', null, 'The feature film debut of director Marek Koterski. Thirty-year-old Adaś Miauczyński visits his parents, which ends with his nervous breakdown.', 'The feature film debut of director Marek Koterski. Thirty-year-old Adaś Miauczyński visits his parents, which ends with his nervous breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pgDR3LNpABVJ1GBuKY47mIWoG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280477'),
  ('684557062927503628', 'The House of Looks', 2025, 'Drama', 'Luca Zingaretti, Maurizio Calvesi, Franco Nardella', 'Luca Zingaretti, Stefano Rulli, Daniele Mencarelli', 'Gianmarco Franchini, Federico Tocci, Riccardo Lai, Alessio Moneta, Chiara Celotto, Marco Felli, Cristian Di Sante, Luca Zingaretti', null, '20-year-old Marco is remarkably attuned to the suffering of people everywhere. He writes poetry but turns to drugs and drink to achieve “the forgetting”, that unconscious state that is impenetrable to his existential angst and other fears. He’s fleeing pain but above all, he’s fleeing from himself. When he goes to work for the cleaners’ cooperative at Bambin Gesù Hospital, he’s sure that this experience, the contact with sick children, will be the death of him.', '20-year-old Marco is remarkably attuned to the suffering of people everywhere. He writes poetry but turns to drugs and drink to achieve “the forgetting”, that unconscious state that is impenetrable to his existential angst and other fears. He’s fleeing pain but above all, he’s fleeing from himself. When he goes to work for the cleaners’ cooperative at Bambin Gesù Hospital, he’s sure that this experience, the contact with sick children, will be the death of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xARoDLBwQtWWtCV12NHxADsLANH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180318'),
  ('410886169610997109', 'The House of Lost Souls', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Umberto Lenzi', 'Joseph Alan Johnson, Stefania Orsola Garello, Matteo Gazzolo, Laurentina Guidotti, Gianluigi Fogacci, Hal Yamanouchi, Licia Colò, Costantino Meloni', null, 'A handful of young geologists are unlucky enough to be forced to stay at a rundown hotel in the middle of nowhere. What they don''t know is that the hotel has been abandoned for twenty years because the owner of the hotel had killed his family and all the guests two decades ago. Strange things begin to happen, and suddenly murders are committed...', 'A handful of young geologists are unlucky enough to be forced to stay at a rundown hotel in the middle of nowhere. What they don''t know is that the hotel has been abandoned for twenty years because the owner of the hotel had killed his family and all the guests two decades ago. Strange things begin to happen, and suddenly murders are committed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liD7FlR4H1LzOKzqlaoySn4GYxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44930'),
  ('1092853077024026052', 'The House of Lost Women', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jesús Franco, Juan Soler', 'Jesús Franco', 'Lina Romay, Antonio Mayans, Carmen Carrión, Asunción Calero, Antonio Rebollo', null, 'Desdemona lives on an isolated island with her strange family: her father Mario, her stepmother Dulcinea and her mentally challenged sister Paulova. As the only inhabitants on the island loneliness and desolation engulf all members of her family. Desdemona tries to ward off her boredom by taking long walks along the beach or engaging in acts of self-gratification. She often tries to seduce her own father Mario to engage in acts of a sexual nature. Their daily routine is interrupted by the arrival (by boat) of a robust male stranger who brings friction into Desdemona''s family.', 'Desdemona lives on an isolated island with her strange family: her father Mario, her stepmother Dulcinea and her mentally challenged sister Paulova. As the only inhabitants on the island loneliness and desolation engulf all members of her family. Desdemona tries to ward off her boredom by taking long walks along the beach or engaging in acts of self-gratification. She often tries to seduce her own father Mario to engage in acts of a sexual nature. Their daily routine is interrupted by the arrival (by boat) of a robust male stranger who brings friction into Desdemona''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aXf9C8ZoE4cgGBCqtfm4Yh8H8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329881'),
  ('807656176320175479', 'The House of Magic', 2013, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Ben Stassen, Jérémie Degruson', 'Ben Stassen, James Flynn, Domonic Paris', 'Brianne Siddall, Shanelle Gray, Robin Atkin Downes, Doug Stone, Grant George, Joey Camen, Elisa Gabrielli, Cinda Adams', 'G', 'Thunder, an abandoned young cat seeking shelter from a storm, stumbles into the strangest house imaginable, owned by an old magician and inhabited by a dazzling array of automatons and gizmos. Not everyone welcomes the new addition to the troupe as Jack Rabbit and Maggie Mouse plot to evict Thunder. The situation gets worse when the magician lands in hospital and his scheming nephew sees his chance to cash in by selling the mansion. Our young hero is determined to earn his place and so he enlists the help of some wacky magician''s assistants to protect his magical new home.', 'Thunder, an abandoned young cat seeking shelter from a storm, stumbles into the strangest house imaginable, owned by an old magician and inhabited by a dazzling array of automatons and gizmos. Not everyone welcomes the new addition to the troupe as Jack Rabbit and Maggie Mouse plot to evict Thunder. The situation gets worse when the magician lands in hospital and his scheming nephew sees his chance to cash in by selling the mansion. Our young hero is determined to earn his place and so he enlists the help of some wacky magician''s assistants to protect his magical new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3R13g2XgblynIrQGF8geFZJPNvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202575'),
  ('88659927968433212', 'The House of Mirth', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Terence Davies, Remi Adefarasin, Adrian Johnston', 'Terence Davies', 'Gillian Anderson, Dan Aykroyd, Eleanor Bron, Terry Kinney, Anthony LaPaglia, Laura Linney, Jodhi May, Elizabeth McGovern', null, 'In early 20th century New York City, an impoverished socialite desperately seeks a suitable husband as she gradually finds herself betrayed by her friends and exiled from high society.', 'In early 20th century New York City, an impoverished socialite desperately seeks a suitable husband as she gradually finds herself betrayed by her friends and exiled from high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCEboOrNXFmqE5pKUn42fTHZx8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25520'),
  ('219907610197453212', 'The House of Pleasure', 1994, 'Drama', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', null, 'Irina Kramer, Nick Nicholson, Marc Gosálvez, Liezl Santos', null, 'Lord Gregory Hutton takes his beautiful young wife Eleanore on a business trip to the Far East for their honeymoon. They stay at the house of Lin, a young local owner of a silk farm and fashion factory whose father only recently died. Lady Eleanor finds herself attracted to Lin and soon is tempted by his advances. But it is not all as it seems. Lord Gregory seems more and more indifferent, and Lady Eleanor starts to get confused. Money is in the game.', 'Lord Gregory Hutton takes his beautiful young wife Eleanore on a business trip to the Far East for their honeymoon. They stay at the house of Lin, a young local owner of a silk farm and fashion factory whose father only recently died. Lady Eleanor finds herself attracted to Lin and soon is tempted by his advances. But it is not all as it seems. Lord Gregory seems more and more indifferent, and Lady Eleanor starts to get confused. Money is in the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbI3MxWezphs7CKQDVjAeyuEV3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376438'),
  ('733473491453332383', 'The House of Rothschild', 1934, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Alfred L. Werker, J. Peverell Marley, William Forsyth', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'George Arliss, Boris Karloff, Loretta Young, C. Aubrey Smith, Robert Young, Arthur Byron, Helen Westley, Reginald Owen', null, 'The story of the rise of the Rothschild financial empire founded by Mayer Rothschild and continued by his five sons. From humble beginnings the business grows and helps to finance the war against Napoleon, but it''s not always easy, especially because of the prejudices against Jews.', 'The story of the rise of the Rothschild financial empire founded by Mayer Rothschild and continued by his five sons. From humble beginnings the business grows and helps to finance the war against Napoleon, but it''s not always easy, especially because of the prejudices against Jews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emqmRhpoMpN565Djn4yps3GnZal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57035'),
  ('161341705866396803', 'The House of Sand', 2005, 'Drama', 'Andrucha Waddington, Ricardo Della Rosa', 'Andrucha Waddington', 'Fernanda Montenegro, Fernanda Torres, Ruy Guerra, Seu Jorge, Luiz Melodia, Enrique Díaz, Stênio Garcia, Emiliano Queiroz', 'R', 'A woman is taken along with her mother in 1910 to a far-away desert by her husband, and after his passing, is forced to spend the next 59 years of her life hopelessly trying to escape it.', 'A woman is taken along with her mother in 1910 to a far-away desert by her husband, and after his passing, is forced to spend the next 59 years of her life hopelessly trying to escape it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6XEC7B7bJ9igsxkQb9ZMFEAv9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29262'),
  ('1101992140218061848', 'The House of Secrets', 1936, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Roland D. Reed', 'John W. Krafft', 'Leslie Fenton, Muriel Evans, Noel Madison, Sidney Blackmer, Morgan Wallace, Holmes Herbert, Ian Maclaren, Jameson Thomas', 'NR', 'Two men stumble into an old mansion, and get involved with a crazed scientist, torture chambers and sinister medical experiments.', 'Two men stumble into an old mansion, and get involved with a crazed scientist, torture chambers and sinister medical experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSoPC0q0ExX8lAF8k7HVORhUhUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79258'),
  ('851559349794732011', 'The House of Seven Corpses', 1974, 'Horror', 'Paul Harrison, Don Jones, Marty Hornstein', 'Paul Harrison, Thomas J. Kelly', 'John Ireland, Faith Domergue, John Carradine, Carole Wells, Charles Macaulay, Jerry Strickler, Ron Foreman, Dennis Record', null, 'A director is filming on location in a house where seven murders were committed. The caretaker warns them not to mess with things they do not understand (the murders were occult related), but the director wants to be as authentic as possible and has his cast re-enact rituals that took place in the house thus summoning a ghoul from the nearby cemetery to bump the whole film crew off one by one.', 'A director is filming on location in a house where seven murders were committed. The caretaker warns them not to mess with things they do not understand (the murders were occult related), but the director wants to be as authentic as possible and has his cast re-enact rituals that took place in the house thus summoning a ghoul from the nearby cemetery to bump the whole film crew off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdZg9zbVNDR9RCyH8pQkOp7K4Nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42452'),
  ('276328574084277125', 'The House of Smiles', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marco Ferreri, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Liliana Betti, Marco Ferreri, Antonino Marino', 'Ingrid Thulin, Dado Ruspoli, Enzo Cannavale, María Mercader, Lucia Vasini, Francesca Antonelli, Elisabeth Kaza, Nuccia Fumo', null, 'A septuagenarian couple are attracted to each other in a retirement home but find the institution and their fellow patients frown on their relationship.', 'A septuagenarian couple are attracted to each other in a retirement home but find the institution and their fellow patients frown on their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBhYGT6qFEDZAtB8hEjPb1hzJAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148757'),
