  ('455780082678489154', 'The House of the Angel', 1957, 'Drama', 'Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, Aníbal González Paz, Orlando Zumpano', 'Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, Martín Rodríguez Mentasti, Beatriz Guido', 'Elsa Daniel, Lautaro Murúa, Berta Ortegosa, Guillermo Battaglia, Bárbara Mújica, Alejandro Rey, Yordana Fain, Lilí Gacel', null, 'A young teen has been raised by a despotic mother overcome with religious zeal and a father who rules over the household with a heavy, iron hand. Forcibly kept innocent of the sexual nuances of some adult relationships, she is not too clear on her rights, his intentions, or the consequences when her father''s best friend starts to lust after her.', 'A young teen has been raised by a despotic mother overcome with religious zeal and a father who rules over the household with a heavy, iron hand. Forcibly kept innocent of the sexual nuances of some adult relationships, she is not too clear on her rights, his intentions, or the consequences when her father''s best friend starts to lust after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiXViC8aU1WUobup3Cq8cv6KRt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199194'),
  ('610672050506422316', 'The House of the Bories', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Doniol-Valcroze, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Anne Tromelin', 'Marie Dubois, Maurice Garrel, Mathieu Carrière, Hélène Vallier, Claude Titre, Madeleine Barbulée, Jean-François Vlerick, Marie Véronique Maurin', null, 'Julien, a renowned geologist, lives with his wife Isabelle and their two children in a country house. But his sullen, uncompromising attitude leaves tensions high. The arrival of Carl-Stephane, a young German student, brings a breath of fresh air and lightness to the household.', 'Julien, a renowned geologist, lives with his wife Isabelle and their two children in a country house. But his sullen, uncompromising attitude leaves tensions high. The arrival of Carl-Stephane, a young German student, brings a breath of fresh air and lightness to the household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2PzET48IohL8Nppjaj0phv3xzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292845'),
  ('1005120927801700537', 'The House of the Dead', 1978, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Ken Gibb, Sharron Miller', 'David O''Malley', 'John Ericson, Ivor Francis, Judith Novgrod, Burr DeBenning, Charles Aidman, Bernard Fox, Richard Gates, Elizabeth MacRae', 'PG', 'When a philandering husband accidentally finds himself lost during a rainstorm, he’s taken in by an elderly mortician and is forced to learn the ghastly origins of four freshly arrived corpses.', 'When a philandering husband accidentally finds himself lost during a rainstorm, he’s taken in by an elderly mortician and is forced to learn the ghastly origins of four freshly arrived corpses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77aIcIiYidhg4YFlNEXChaBk9R6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77156'),
  ('1032574357342613104', 'The House of the Devil', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ti West, Eliot Rockett, Zeke Dunn', 'Ti West', 'Jocelin Donahue, Tom Noonan, Mary Woronov, Greta Gerwig, AJ Bowen, Dee Wallace, Heather Robb, Darryl Nau', 'R', 'A young college student who’s struggling financially takes a strange babysitting job which coincides with a full lunar eclipse. She slowly realizes her clients harbor a terrifying secret, putting her life in mortal danger.', 'A young college student who’s struggling financially takes a strange babysitting job which coincides with a full lunar eclipse. She slowly realizes her clients harbor a terrifying secret, putting her life in mortal danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4abKUbc9IbsndbaY1hacN1iPM0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25983'),
  ('730364582560098645', 'The House of the Lost on the Cape', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Shinya Takano, Eriko Kimura, Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mana Ashida, Sari Awano, Shinobu Otake, Takuya Tasso, Sally Amaki, Mikio Date, Shohei Uno, Takeshi Tomizawa', null, 'A strange old woman allows a teenage runaway and a young orphan to stay in an abandoned house that overlooks the sea. However, when a menacing entity threatens their new home, they must band together and face their fears to save it.', 'A strange old woman allows a teenage runaway and a young orphan to stay in an abandoned house that overlooks the sea. However, when a menacing entity threatens their new home, they must band together and face their fears to save it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5afJWPrNwm7a220mOccwB30PCOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760758'),
  ('970394238509519379', 'The House of the Seven Gables', 1940, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Joe May, Milton Krasner', 'Harold Greene, Nathaniel Hawthorne, Lester Cole', 'George Sanders, Margaret Lindsay, Vincent Price, Nan Grey, Dick Foran, Cecil Kellaway, Alan Napier, Gilbert Emery', 'NR', 'In 1828, the bankrupt Pyncheon family fight over Seven Gables, the ancestral mansion. To obtain the house, Jaffrey Pyncheon obtains his brother Clifford''s false conviction for murder. Hepzibah, Clifford''s sweet fiancée, patiently waits twenty years for his release, whereupon Clifford and his former cellmate, abolitionist Matthew, have a certain scheme in mind.', 'In 1828, the bankrupt Pyncheon family fight over Seven Gables, the ancestral mansion. To obtain the house, Jaffrey Pyncheon obtains his brother Clifford''s false conviction for murder. Hepzibah, Clifford''s sweet fiancée, patiently waits twenty years for his release, whereupon Clifford and his former cellmate, abolitionist Matthew, have a certain scheme in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvruNVi91OtVwFyWkWnC7VYhMdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28373'),
  ('113187695152185488', 'The House of the Seven Hawks', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Thorpe, Michael Stevenson', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Robert Taylor, Nicole Maurey, Linda Christian, Donald Wolfit, David Kossoff, Eric Pohlmann, Philo Hauser, Gerard Heinz', 'NR', 'A ship''s captain gets mixed up with murder during the hunt for lost Nazi treasure.', 'A ship''s captain gets mixed up with murder during the hunt for lost Nazi treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPm5pLrF7HRHkctQQpFgPEpBAU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90023'),
  ('157504858494340417', 'The House of the Spirits', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bille August, Jörgen Persson, Guy Travers', 'Bille August', 'Meryl Streep, Glenn Close, Jeremy Irons, Winona Ryder, Antonio Banderas, Armin Mueller-Stahl, María Conchita Alonso, Vincent Gallo', 'R', 'A rancher, his clairvoyant wife and their family face turbulent years in South America.', 'A rancher, his clairvoyant wife and their family face turbulent years in South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS5xqILNBxcjRqLZROIkO4wszrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2259'),
  ('915544640880206653', 'The House of the Yellow Carpet', 1983, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Carlo Lizzani, Giuliano Giustini', 'Aldo Selleri, Lucio Battistrada, Filiberto Bandini', 'Erland Josephson, Béatrice Romand, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Milena Vukotić', null, 'Franca and her husband Antonio decide to sell a yellow rug which was a gift of Franca''s stepfather. One day, while Antonio is out, a strange man rings saying he wishes to buy the rug. But the man''s visit begins a twisted a nightmare.', 'Franca and her husband Antonio decide to sell a yellow rug which was a gift of Franca''s stepfather. One day, while Antonio is out, a strange man rings saying he wishes to buy the rug. But the man''s visit begins a twisted a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9iP7GUQs5cLKKCGpSPkDbFVlqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84984'),
  ('949028222834743894', 'The House of Tomorrow', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Frank Graham, Joi Lansing, Don Messick', null, 'Tex Avery''s narrator shows us the amazing features of the ultra-modern House of Tomorrow.', 'Tex Avery''s narrator shows us the amazing features of the ultra-modern House of Tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYt18Kk3cwZkyrTqEdBbYwT1bF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87211'),
  ('309601833735192825', 'The House of Tomorrow', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Livolsi, Corey Walter', 'Peter Livolsi', 'Asa Butterfield, Alex Wolff, Nick Offerman, Michaela Watkins, Maude Apatow, Ellen Burstyn, Fred Armisen, Alec George', null, 'The film tells futurist, architect, and inventor R. Buckminster Fuller''s incredible story through two teens hoping to get laid, become punk gods, and survive high school.', 'The film tells futurist, architect, and inventor R. Buckminster Fuller''s incredible story through two teens hoping to get laid, become punk gods, and survive high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D9mvVo7nJ7YYZXoNKQiABYAR55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433503'),
  ('643316027461162451', 'The House of Us', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Yoon Ga-eun, Kim Ji-hyun, Jeong Ik-jung', 'Yoon Ga-eun', 'Kim Na-yeon, Kim Si-a, Joo Ye-rim, Ahn Ji-ho, Choi Jeong-in, Lee Ju-won, Jung Eun-kyoung, Kim Jun-beom', null, 'A girl from a troubled family befriends two younger girls and begins to feel a sense of normalcy as they go adventuring at the seaside.', 'A girl from a troubled family befriends two younger girls and begins to feel a sense of normalcy as they go adventuring at the seaside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/losNmoCPywJs6I0f7wQJ9pBlNJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575720'),
  ('462361589175671437', 'The House of Usher', 1989, 'Horror', 'Alan Birkinshaw, K.C. Jones, Paul Rynhoud', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Oliver Reed, Donald Pleasence, Romy Walthall, Rufus Swart, Norman Coombes, Philip Godawa, Anne Stradi, Carole Farquhar', 'R', 'An updated version of the classic horror tale by Edgar Allen Poe. Ryan and his girlfriend Molly are going to visit Ryan''s uncle, Roderick Usher, at his mansion. They find, however, that Roderick''s brother Walter has gone insane, and Roderick himself isn''t far behind. Can Ryan and Molly escape from the doomed mansion before the curse of Usher claims them as well?', 'An updated version of the classic horror tale by Edgar Allen Poe. Ryan and his girlfriend Molly are going to visit Ryan''s uncle, Roderick Usher, at his mansion. They find, however, that Roderick''s brother Walter has gone insane, and Roderick himself isn''t far behind. Can Ryan and Molly escape from the doomed mansion before the curse of Usher claims them as well?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mb8X8ghs976CP2Z3iKQrYQLuXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47674'),
  ('347152436304341875', 'The House of Usher', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Hayley Cloake, Eric Trageser', 'Collin Chang', 'Austin Nichols, Izabella Miko, Beth Grant, Stephen Fischer', 'R', 'Three years after her lover, Rick Usher, and her best friend, Maddy Usher, had suddenly disappeared from her life without explanation, Jill Masters receives a phone call with news of Maddy''s death. Her last wish was for Jill to attend her funeral. Conflicted, Jill returns to the house of Usher, a remote New England enclave. Her love affair with Rick is rekindled as she learns he suffers from the same malady that robbed his twin sister, Maddy, of her sharp mind before taking her life. His affliction is manifested in a rare nerve condition, which renders him hyper-sensitive. Under the watchful eye of the caretaker, Nurse Thatcher, Jill appears to be haunted by the ghost of Maddy, and the secret of the house of Usher is exposed.', 'Three years after her lover, Rick Usher, and her best friend, Maddy Usher, had suddenly disappeared from her life without explanation, Jill Masters receives a phone call with news of Maddy''s death. Her last wish was for Jill to attend her funeral. Conflicted, Jill returns to the house of Usher, a remote New England enclave. Her love affair with Rick is rekindled as she learns he suffers from the same malady that robbed his twin sister, Maddy, of her sharp mind before taking her life. His affliction is manifested in a rare nerve condition, which renders him hyper-sensitive. Under the watchful eye of the caretaker, Nurse Thatcher, Jill appears to be haunted by the ghost of Maddy, and the secret of the house of Usher is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQgo1j61syTX2LaJqb2gvzETsYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74254'),
  ('93832876492699909', 'The House of Witchcraft', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Umberto Lenzi, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Umberto Lenzi, Daniele Stroppa', 'Andy J. Forest, Sonia Petrovna, Zuzana Martinková, Marina Giulia Cavalli, Paul Müller, Maria Stella Musy, Alberto Frasca, Maria Cumani Quasimodo', null, 'A man discharged from the hospital after suffering a nervous breakdown is taken to a remote Italian villa by his strangely-behaving wife. But he has strong premonitions that the house is possessed by some force of witchcraft, which he has been experiencing in his recurring nightmare.', 'A man discharged from the hospital after suffering a nervous breakdown is taken to a remote Italian villa by his strangely-behaving wife. But he has strong premonitions that the house is possessed by some force of witchcraft, which he has been experiencing in his recurring nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4zvREzBK9d4JMF2ZChs04pDGLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57625'),
  ('1066500978908033164', 'The House of Yes', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Waters, Michael Alperowitz, Michael Spiller', 'Mark Waters, Wendy MacLeod', 'Parker Posey, Josh Hamilton, Tori Spelling, Freddie Prinze Jr., Geneviève Bujold, Rachael Leigh Cook, David Love', 'R', 'Jackie-O is anxiously awaiting the visit of her brother home for Thanksgiving, but isn''t expecting him to bring a friend — and she''s even more shocked to learn that this friend is his fiance. It soon becomes clear that her obsession with Jackie Kennedy is nothing compared to her obsession with her brother, and she isn''t the only member of the family with problems.', 'Jackie-O is anxiously awaiting the visit of her brother home for Thanksgiving, but isn''t expecting him to bring a friend — and she''s even more shocked to learn that this friend is his fiance. It soon becomes clear that her obsession with Jackie Kennedy is nothing compared to her obsession with her brother, and she isn''t the only member of the family with problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42mp1sJw6E7BDNMrF65IOZ4j4zq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33344'),
