  ('158040786230629286', 'The House That Jack Built', 2018, 'Drama, Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Manuel Alberto Claro, Dustin Grella, Lars von Trier', 'Lars von Trier', 'Matt Dillon, Bruno Ganz, Uma Thurman, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Sofie Gråbøl, Riley Keough, Jeremy Davies, Jack McKenzie', 'R', 'Failed architect, engineer and vicious murderer Jack narrates the details of some of his most elaborately orchestrated crimes, each of them a towering piece of art that defines his life''s work as a serial killer for twelve years.', 'Failed architect, engineer and vicious murderer Jack narrates the details of some of his most elaborately orchestrated crimes, each of them a towering piece of art that defines his life''s work as a serial killer for twelve years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMUGNkPaHOurcBK9g3XpJx3fxuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398173'),
  ('355661739349762562', 'The House That Never Dies', 2014, 'Drama, Horror, Romance, Mystery', 'Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Xu Xiao Giang', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Li Jing Ling, Sakura Yang', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Tony Yang, Ruby Lin, Pat Ha Man-Jik, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Qin Hailu, Yuen Cheung-Yan', null, 'Story based on the legendary mansion at No. 81 on Chaoyangmennei Street in Beijing, which local legend says is haunted by the ghost of a Kuomintang official''s wife, who committed suicide in the home around the time of the Cultural Revolution. The film follows Xu Ruoqing a woman whose presence in the notorious mansion draws up the spirits that have taken residence there.', 'Story based on the legendary mansion at No. 81 on Chaoyangmennei Street in Beijing, which local legend says is haunted by the ghost of a Kuomintang official''s wife, who committed suicide in the home around the time of the Cultural Revolution. The film follows Xu Ruoqing a woman whose presence in the notorious mansion draws up the spirits that have taken residence there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88uIQJzMWUvf3o4saEJrfw894W0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293021'),
  ('1051777992489982919', 'The House That Screamed', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador, Manuel Berenguer, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Chicho Ibáñez Serrador', 'Lilli Palmer, Cristina Galbó, John Moulder-Brown, Maribel Martín, Mary Maude, Cándida Losada, Pauline Challoner, Tomás Blanco', null, 'Southern France, 19th century. Teresa, a young girl, arrives at an isolated female boarding school that is tyrannically mastered by Mrs. Fourneau, the strict headmistress, whose protective shadow haunts Luis, her weak son.', 'Southern France, 19th century. Teresa, a young girl, arrives at an isolated female boarding school that is tyrannically mastered by Mrs. Fourneau, the strict headmistress, whose protective shadow haunts Luis, her weak son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6rUOhmr14mXx7pDRJskFv2GpH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64624'),
