  ('398405202419664235', 'The House That Would Not Die', 1970, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Fleet Southcott, Richard Caffey', 'Henry Farrell', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Richard Egan, Michael Anderson Jr., Kitty Winn, Doreen Lang, Mabel Albertson', 'NR', 'A tale of witchcraft, black magic and a haunted house in the Amish country.', 'A tale of witchcraft, black magic and a haunted house in the Amish country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auK8SR6NTr7S7LTXqoQlb025wFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101060'),
  ('1023796775033894647', 'The House Where Evil Dwells', 1982, 'Horror', 'Kevin Connor, Jacques Haitkin', 'Robert Suhosky', 'Edward Albert, Susan George, Doug McClure, Amy Barrett, Mako Hattori, Toshiya Maruyama, Shunji Sasaki, Tsuyako Okajima', 'R', 'At the prompting of his diplomat friend, Alex, writer Ted Fletcher takes his wife, Laura, and daughter, Amy, on an extended working holiday. Alex finds a house for them in Kyoto, Japan, and the Fletchers move in, laughing off rumors that the place is haunted. But the ghost of 19th-century samurai Shigero turns out to be very real, and is intent on making the family re-enact an ancient murder-suicide.', 'At the prompting of his diplomat friend, Alex, writer Ted Fletcher takes his wife, Laura, and daughter, Amy, on an extended working holiday. Alex finds a house for them in Kyoto, Japan, and the Fletchers move in, laughing off rumors that the place is haunted. But the ghost of 19th-century samurai Shigero turns out to be very real, and is intent on making the family re-enact an ancient murder-suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfG3zZd6eUON364BSJn3psEQlBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86068'),
  ('154047587884222758', 'The House Where the Mermaid Sleeps', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Daisuke Soma, Hiroyuki Ishizaka', 'Eriko Shinozaki', 'Ryoko Shinohara, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Kurumi Inagaki, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Rina Kawaei, Keiko Matsuzaka, Sayaka Yamaguchi, Tetsushi Tanaka', null, 'Kaoruko and Kazumasa Harima are a separated couple with two children. They plan to divorce once their daughter, Mizuho, enters elementary school. One day, they receive devastating news of their daughter falling into a coma after a near-drowning accident at a pool. The doctors declare her brain dead with no prospect of recovery and the couple must decide if they should donate her organs to others in need or to wait until her heart stops beating.', 'Kaoruko and Kazumasa Harima are a separated couple with two children. They plan to divorce once their daughter, Mizuho, enters elementary school. One day, they receive devastating news of their daughter falling into a coma after a near-drowning accident at a pool. The doctors declare her brain dead with no prospect of recovery and the couple must decide if they should donate her organs to others in need or to wait until her heart stops beating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr4i2qXMUn7I7uparbvpZepIFUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507034'),
  ('61940794765622222', 'The House with a Clock in Its Walls', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Horror, Mystery', 'Dawn Swiderski, Eli Roth, Rogier Stoffers', 'Eric Kripke', 'Jack Black, Cate Blanchett, Owen Vaccaro, Kyle MacLachlan, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Colleen Camp, Sunny Suljic, Lorenza Izzo', 'PG', 'When ten-year-old Lewis is suddenly orphaned, he is sent to live with his Uncle Jonathan in a creaky (and creepy) old mansion with a mysterious ticking noise that emanates from the walls. Upon discovering that his uncle is a warlock, Lewis begins learning magic, but when he rebelliously resurrects an evil warlock he must find the secret of the house and save the world from destruction.', 'When ten-year-old Lewis is suddenly orphaned, he is sent to live with his Uncle Jonathan in a creaky (and creepy) old mansion with a mysterious ticking noise that emanates from the walls. Upon discovering that his uncle is a warlock, Lewis begins learning magic, but when he rebelliously resurrects an evil warlock he must find the secret of the house and save the world from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qM66Hv4ByAxnilr0jaqCA9uOD4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463821'),
  ('620119199475432017', 'The House with Laughing Windows', 1976, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Cesare Bastelli', 'Antonio Avati, Pupi Avati, Gianni Cavina', 'Lino Capolicchio, Francesca Marciano, Gianni Cavina, Giulio Pizzirani, Bob Tonelli, Vanna Busoni, Pietro Brambilla, Ferdinando Orlandi', null, 'Stefano, a young restorer, is commissioned to save a controversial mural located in the church of a small, isolated village.', 'Stefano, a young restorer, is commissioned to save a controversial mural located in the church of a small, isolated village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oinsJI8Rlz8EjSOO6ahsFDsDhwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57447'),
  ('820613674261771412', 'The Housekeeper', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Claude Berri, Éric Gautier, Thierry Mauvoisin', 'Claude Berri', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Émilie Dequenne, Brigitte Catillon, Catherine Breillat, Jacques Frantz, Axelle Abbadie, Apollinaire Louis-Philippe Dogue, Amalric Gérard', null, 'After his wife leaves him for another man, Jacques hires a housekeeper, Laura, to keep his Paris apartment in order. As he starts increasing her hours and spending more time with her on her days off, Jacques is torn between the pleasure of Laura''s company, and the headache that such an intrusion brings to his new domain of singlehood.', 'After his wife leaves him for another man, Jacques hires a housekeeper, Laura, to keep his Paris apartment in order. As he starts increasing her hours and spending more time with her on her days off, Jacques is torn between the pleasure of Laura''s company, and the headache that such an intrusion brings to his new domain of singlehood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOdswLSfHZ69RZkNodL2nmztD7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34840'),
  ('139520546657372', 'The Housemaid', 1960, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kim Deok-jin, Kim Ki-young, Jeong Hyo-seop', 'Kim Ki-young', 'Lee Eun-shim, Kim Jin-kyu, Ju Jeung-nyeo, Um Aing-ran, Go Seon-ae, Gang Seok-je, Wang Suk-rang, Ra Jeong-ok', null, 'A piano composer''s family moves into a new house; when his pregnant wife collapses from working to support the family, he hires a housemaid to help with housework.', 'A piano composer''s family moves into a new house; when his pregnant wife collapses from working to support the family, he hires a housemaid to help with housework.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFRG3soeb7ceKjWoXu4EFDc8grO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42506'),
  ('56575841088734929', 'The Housemaid', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Im Sang-soo, Park Se-moon, Lee Hyung-deok', 'Im Sang-soo', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Lee Jung-jae, Seo Woo, Youn Yuh-jung, Park Ji-young, An Seo-hyun, Hwang Jeong-min, Moon So-ri', null, 'Eun-yi is hired as a maid in a mansion owned by a wealthy businessman. He quickly starts seducing his employee who seemingly has little choice but to comply with his sexual advances. Soon the women of the family plot against Eun-yi who must fight an equally devious battle to protect herself.', 'Eun-yi is hired as a maid in a mansion owned by a wealthy businessman. He quickly starts seducing his employee who seemingly has little choice but to comply with his sexual advances. Soon the women of the family plot against Eun-yi who must fight an equally devious battle to protect herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acrlZuaS7ypiEUb3oZRA28Ox7TV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45202'),
  ('478213398695248174', 'The Housemaid', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Roman Perez Jr.', null, 'Kylie Verzosa, Jaclyn Jose, Alma Moreno, Albert Martinez, Louise delos Reyes, Elia Ilano, Debbie Garcia', null, 'Daisy''s task as a new maid to a wealthy family is to watch over a young kid, but unknowingly she''s being watched by the kid''s father. When temptation kicks in Daisy and the wealthy family''s lives start to shatter in pieces.', 'Daisy''s task as a new maid to a wealthy family is to watch over a young kid, but unknowingly she''s being watched by the kid''s father. When temptation kicks in Daisy and the wealthy family''s lives start to shatter in pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QgSlS0IV9jlDadjdVrrN4quqEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759297'),
  ('962168167509583131', 'The Housemaid', 2025, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Feig, John Schwartzman, Artist W. Robinson', 'Rebecca Sonnenshine', 'Sydney Sweeney, Amanda Seyfried, Brandon Sklenar, Michele Morrone, Elizabeth Perkins, Indiana Elle, Amanda Joy Erickson, Sarah Cooper', 'R', 'Trying to escape her past, Millie Calloway accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina and Andrew Winchester. But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous—a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power.', 'Trying to escape her past, Millie Calloway accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina and Andrew Winchester. But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous—a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWsBscZzwu5brg9YjNkGewRUvJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1368166'),
  ('787879368813356721', 'The Houses October Built', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bobby Roe, Andrew Strahorn, Jeff Larson', 'Bobby Roe, Zack Andrews, Jason Zada', 'Brandy Schaefer, Zack Andrews, Bobby Roe, Mikey Roe, Jeff Larson, Chloë Crampton, Jim Tavaré, Ian Roberts', null, 'Beneath the fake blood and cheap masks of countless haunted house attractions across the country, there are whispers of truly terrifying alternatives. Looking to find an authentic, blood-curdling good fright for Halloween, five friends set off on a road trip in an RV to track down these underground Haunts. Just when their search seems to reach a dead end, strange and disturbing things start happening and it becomes clear that the Haunt has come to them…', 'Beneath the fake blood and cheap masks of countless haunted house attractions across the country, there are whispers of truly terrifying alternatives. Looking to find an authentic, blood-curdling good fright for Halloween, five friends set off on a road trip in an RV to track down these underground Haunts. Just when their search seems to reach a dead end, strange and disturbing things start happening and it becomes clear that the Haunt has come to them…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGTHvZE1ggog8w06kqg1HyTANjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293572'),
  ('611642942507761111', 'The Houses October Built 2', 2017, 'Horror', 'Bobby Roe, Cesar Antonio Martinez, Elliott Augustine', 'Zack Andrews, Bobby Roe', 'Brandy Schaefer, Zack Andrews, Mikey Roe, Bobby Roe, Jeff Larson, Tamara Lynn Chambers, Takeru Kobayashi', 'NR', 'Recovering from the trauma of being kidnapped last Halloween by the Blue Skeleton - a group who take "extreme haunt" to another level - five friends decide they must face their fears in order to move on. Heading back out on the road to visit more haunted house attractions, signs of the Blue Skeleton start appearing again and a new terror begins.', 'Recovering from the trauma of being kidnapped last Halloween by the Blue Skeleton - a group who take "extreme haunt" to another level - five friends decide they must face their fears in order to move on. Heading back out on the road to visit more haunted house attractions, signs of the Blue Skeleton start appearing again and a new terror begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ePD42CjuXgwsFNDl3EC8KRi0XC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466344'),
  ('1067929640704720519', 'The Howards of Virginia', 1940, 'Drama, History, War', 'Frank Lloyd, Bert Glennon', 'Sidney Buchman', 'Cary Grant, Martha Scott, Cedric Hardwicke, Alan Marshal, Richard Carlson, Paul Kelly, Irving Bacon, Elisabeth Risdon', 'NR', 'Beautiful young Virginian Jane steps down from her proper aristocratic upbringing when she marries down-to-earth surveyor Matt Howard. Matt joins the Colonial forces in their fight for freedom against England. Matt will meet Jane''s father in the battlefield.', 'Beautiful young Virginian Jane steps down from her proper aristocratic upbringing when she marries down-to-earth surveyor Matt Howard. Matt joins the Colonial forces in their fight for freedom against England. Matt will meet Jane''s father in the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yngj5fihIRXufFqzH0MVhC1HdPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52360'),
  ('726833085231000114', 'The Howl', 1970, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tinto Brass, Silvano Ippoliti, Alan Sekers', 'Tinto Brass, Franco Longo', 'Tina Aumont, Gigi Proietti, Nino Segurini, Germano Longo, Edoardo Florio, Giorgio Gruden, Osiride Pevarello, Attilio Corsini', null, 'A young bride flees the ceremony with a stranger and, together, they set off on an epic journey though increasingly bizarre lands. They encounter talking animals and mournful exhibitionists, converse with a discoursing rock, journey through a surrealist''s psychedelic hotel, instigate a prison riot, escape from naked cannibals living in a tree, and battle a wind-up midget dictator!', 'A young bride flees the ceremony with a stranger and, together, they set off on an epic journey though increasingly bizarre lands. They encounter talking animals and mournful exhibitionists, converse with a discoursing rock, journey through a surrealist''s psychedelic hotel, instigate a prison riot, escape from naked cannibals living in a tree, and battle a wind-up midget dictator!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8S08gJvFKsP2u7l8jfsHeLgdte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32352'),
  ('205436209033420474', 'The Howl of the Devil', 1988, 'Horror', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Salvador Sáinz', 'Paul Naschy, Caroline Munro, Howard Vernon, Fernando Hilbeck, Joseph Garco, Roberta Kuhn, Carmen Plate, Mariano Vidal Molina', null, 'Hector Doriani is a stage and screen actor who feels himself living in the shadow of his dead twin brother, Alex Doriani, once a famous star of horror movies. Alex’s young son, Adrian, now lives with Hector in an isolated mansion in the countryside. To keep alive the memory of his father, the boy imagines himself visited by the spirit of the dead man, incarnated in a series of classic horror characters from the past. Eric, Alex’s former butler, now also works for Hector. His main role is to locate and bring to the mansion a series of women who are paid large sums of money by Hector to take part in various sadistic sex games. To complicate matters even further, the games always seem to end with the women getting slaughtered in various gruesome ways by a black gloved, masked killer. Also on hand is horror diva Caroline Munro, as Hector’s housekeeper and cook, who is being pursued by a local priest with whom she once had a much-regretted affair.', 'Hector Doriani is a stage and screen actor who feels himself living in the shadow of his dead twin brother, Alex Doriani, once a famous star of horror movies. Alex’s young son, Adrian, now lives with Hector in an isolated mansion in the countryside. To keep alive the memory of his father, the boy imagines himself visited by the spirit of the dead man, incarnated in a series of classic horror characters from the past. Eric, Alex’s former butler, now also works for Hector. His main role is to locate and bring to the mansion a series of women who are paid large sums of money by Hector to take part in various sadistic sex games. To complicate matters even further, the games always seem to end with the women getting slaughtered in various gruesome ways by a black gloved, masked killer. Also on hand is horror diva Caroline Munro, as Hector’s housekeeper and cook, who is being pursued by a local priest with whom she once had a much-regretted affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuYQzAFW0j2GN2q5AQoTDIxnV5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208917'),
  ('367322997403641514', 'The Howling', 1981, 'Horror', 'John Hora, Joe Dante, Jack Cummins', 'John Sayles, Terence H. Winkless', 'Dee Wallace, Patrick Macnee, Dennis Dugan, Christopher Stone, Belinda Balaski, Kevin McCarthy, John Carradine, Slim Pickens', 'R', 'After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a newswoman is sent to a rehabilitation center whose inhabitants may not be what they seem.', 'After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a newswoman is sent to a rehabilitation center whose inhabitants may not be what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRTonikdpMUYr3y3RXESLBhRUov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11298'),
  ('1140446252179077100', 'The Howling: Reborn', 2011, 'Horror', 'Joe Nimziki, Benoit Beaulieu', 'Joe Nimziki', 'Landon Liboiron, Lindsey Shaw, Ivana Miličević, Jesse Rath, Niels Schneider, Erin Agostino, Kristian Hodko, Frank Schorpion', 'R', 'On the eve of his high school graduation, unremarkable Will Kidman finally bonds with the girl he has long yearned for, reclusive Eliana Wynter. But he also discovers a dark secret from his past... that he is about to become a werewolf. Now, in an effort to fight destiny and save their love as well as their lives, they must battle not only Will''s growing blood lust but an army of fearsome beasts bent on killing them... and then, us all.', 'On the eve of his high school graduation, unremarkable Will Kidman finally bonds with the girl he has long yearned for, reclusive Eliana Wynter. But he also discovers a dark secret from his past... that he is about to become a werewolf. Now, in an effort to fight destiny and save their love as well as their lives, they must battle not only Will''s growing blood lust but an army of fearsome beasts bent on killing them... and then, us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BSPC26lfw1WThhDaYaRMe6OBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75623'),
  ('633717839346760008', 'The Hucksters', 1947, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jack Conway, Harold Rosson, Douglas Shearer', 'Luther Davis', 'Clark Gable, Deborah Kerr, Sydney Greenstreet, Adolphe Menjou, Ava Gardner, Keenan Wynn, Edward Arnold, Aubrey Mather', null, 'A World War II veteran wants to return to advertising on his own terms, but finds it difficult to be successful and maintain his integrity.', 'A World War II veteran wants to return to advertising on his own terms, but finds it difficult to be successful and maintain his integrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJJJKpwh0VI3WxBtBWXTHjLr7Ds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88812'),
  ('771800184004282806', 'The Hudsucker Proxy', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Joel Coen, Roger Deakins, John Cameron', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, Sam Raimi', 'Tim Robbins, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Paul Newman, Charles Durning, Jim True-Frost, John Mahoney, Bill Cobbs, Bruce Campbell', 'PG', 'A naive business graduate is installed as president of a manufacturing company as part of a stock scam.', 'A naive business graduate is installed as president of a manufacturing company as part of a stock scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp5Kg9iT9oSXsECgDkNJVqvIrxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11934'),
  ('1059859637722752088', 'The Human Bullet', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Hiroshi Murai', 'Kihachi Okamoto', 'Minori Terada, Naoko Ohtani, Yūnosuke Itō, Hideyo Amamoto, Masumi Harukawa, Tanie Kitabayashi, Sue Mitobe, Tatsuya Nakadai', null, 'A soldier has been in the Japanese military for the entirety of WWII, and in that time, his dedication to the army has never faltered. However, as the war draws to a close, his commanding officers become increasingly desperate and push their men to ever more absurd extremes. The ridiculousness of the orders from above peak when the hero of the story is assigned to drive a one-man submarine straight into the hull of an enemy battleship.', 'A soldier has been in the Japanese military for the entirety of WWII, and in that time, his dedication to the army has never faltered. However, as the war draws to a close, his commanding officers become increasingly desperate and push their men to ever more absurd extremes. The ridiculousness of the orders from above peak when the hero of the story is assigned to drive a one-man submarine straight into the hull of an enemy battleship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2abb8gpPLLy2PeeeqNXAFzh8fk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104442'),
  ('686367820400589882', 'The Human Centipede (First Sequence)', 2009, 'Horror', 'Tom Six, Goof de Koning', 'Tom Six', 'Dieter Laser, Ashley C. Williams, Ashlynn Yennie, Akihiro Kitamura, Andreas Leupold, Peter Blankenstein, Rosemary Annabella', 'R', 'During a stopover in Germany in the middle of a carefree road trip through Europe, two American girls find themselves alone at night when their car breaks down in the woods. Searching for help at a nearby villa, they are wooed into the clutches of a deranged retired surgeon, who has a very disturbed vision.', 'During a stopover in Germany in the middle of a carefree road trip through Europe, two American girls find themselves alone at night when their car breaks down in the woods. Searching for help at a nearby villa, they are wooed into the clutches of a deranged retired surgeon, who has a very disturbed vision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMtjxIkEi0hnTV5lPHbgeZ4ZpUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37169'),
  ('423659230204987472', 'The Human Centipede 2 (Full Sequence)', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'David Meadows, Tom Six', 'Tom Six', 'Laurence R. Harvey, Ashlynn Yennie, Dominic Borrelli, Georgia Goodrick, Maddi Black, Kandace Caine, Lucas Hansen, Lee Nicholas Harris', 'R', 'Inspired by the fictional Dr. Heiter, disturbed loner Martin dreams of creating a 12-person centipede and sets out to realize his sick fantasy.', 'Inspired by the fictional Dr. Heiter, disturbed loner Martin dreams of creating a 12-person centipede and sets out to realize his sick fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YEUMnMhIjD5ek4zIqOhLSnTnJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74997'),
  ('875640358257326747', 'The Human Centipede 3 (Final Sequence)', 2015, 'Horror', 'Tom Six, David Meadows', 'Tom Six', 'Dieter Laser, Bree Olson, Eric Roberts, Laurence R. Harvey, Robert LaSardo, Tommy Lister Jr., Jay Tavare, Clayton Rohner', 'R', 'Taking inspiration from The Human Centipede films, the warden of a notorious and troubled prison looks to create a 500-person human centipede as a solution to his problems.', 'Taking inspiration from The Human Centipede films, the warden of a notorious and troubled prison looks to create a 500-person human centipede as a solution to his problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUk5AGcGvybPBvvMqrDPbAFAknD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94365'),
  ('758148062147064310', 'The Human Comedy', 1943, 'Drama, Family', 'Clarence Brown, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Mickey Rooney, Frank Morgan, James Craig, Marsha Hunt, Fay Bainter, Ray Collins, Van Johnson, Donna Reed', 'NR', 'Teenager Homer Macauley stays at home in the small town of Ithaca, California to support his family while his older brother Marcus prepares to go to war.', 'Teenager Homer Macauley stays at home in the small town of Ithaca, California to support his family while his older brother Marcus prepares to go to war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHOLe1QIQn7NVdvqvkrC3z88f7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48993'),
  ('649998663451818542', 'The Human Condition I: No Greater Love', 1959, 'War, Drama, History', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Koichi Inagaki, Yûgorô Imai', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Zenzō Matsuyama', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Michiyo Aratama, Chikage Awashima, Ineko Arima, So Yamamura, Akira Ishihama, Kōji Nanbara, Seiji Miyaguchi', null, 'After handing in a report on the treatment of Chinese colonial labor, Kaji is offered the post of labour chief at a large mining operation in Manchuria, which also grants him exemption from military service. He accepts and moves with his newlywed wife Michiko, but when he tries to put his ideas of more humane treatment into practice, he finds himself at odds with scheming officials, cruel foremen, and the military police.', 'After handing in a report on the treatment of Chinese colonial labor, Kaji is offered the post of labour chief at a large mining operation in Manchuria, which also grants him exemption from military service. He accepts and moves with his newlywed wife Michiko, but when he tries to put his ideas of more humane treatment into practice, he finds himself at odds with scheming officials, cruel foremen, and the military police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7godavx5XEbeVxEeqi4pmiOKdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31217'),
  ('764131557550422510', 'The Human Condition II: Road to Eternity', 1959, 'War, Drama, History', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Koichi Inagaki, Yoshio Miyajima', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Zenzō Matsuyama', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Michiyo Aratama, Kokinji Katsura, Jun Tatara, Michirō Minami, Kei Satō, Kunie Tanaka, Ryōhei Uchida', null, 'Kaji, sent to the Japanese army labeled Red, witnesses cruelties in the army and revolts against the abusive treatment against a fellow recruit. He also sees his friend Shinjô defecting to the Russian border, and he ends in the front to fight a lost battle against the Russian tanks division.', 'Kaji, sent to the Japanese army labeled Red, witnesses cruelties in the army and revolts against the abusive treatment against a fellow recruit. He also sees his friend Shinjô defecting to the Russian border, and he ends in the front to fight a lost battle against the Russian tanks division.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jfv1C4t06VGenQxf3HbmLVmUHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34528'),
  ('2358573226362455', 'The Human Condition III: A Soldier''s Prayer', 1961, 'War, Drama, History', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Koichi Inagaki, Yoshio Miyajima', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Koichi Inagaki, Zenzō Matsuyama', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Michiyo Aratama, Tamao Nakamura, Yūsuke Kawazu, Chishū Ryū, Taketoshi Naitō, Kyôko Kishida, Reiko Hitomi', null, 'After the Japanese defeat to the Russians, Kaji leads the last remaining men through Manchuria. Intent on returning to his old life, he faces great odds in a variety of different harrowing circumstances as he and his men sneak behind enemy lines.', 'After the Japanese defeat to the Russians, Kaji leads the last remaining men through Manchuria. Intent on returning to his old life, he faces great odds in a variety of different harrowing circumstances as he and his men sneak behind enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pag7gyxSFe7vTl6riHfZ5Xci6q7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34530'),
  ('553760107224987307', 'The Human Contract', 2008, 'Drama', 'Jada Pinkett Smith, Michael J. Moore, Marvin Williams', 'Jada Pinkett Smith', 'Paz Vega, Jason Clarke, Idris Elba, Jada Pinkett Smith, T.J. Thyne, Joanna Cassidy, Steven Brand, Ted Danson', 'R', 'A free-spirited woman leads a businessman down a path of reckless abandon.', 'A free-spirited woman leads a businessman down a path of reckless abandon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGzk7eIGscDHzTaIRrIUDdece7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22633'),
  ('654789320342685327', 'The Human Duplicators', 1965, 'Science Fiction', 'Hugo Grimaldi, Monroe P. Askins, Jesse Corallo', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'George Nader, Barbara Nichols, George Macready, Dolores Faith, Hugh Beaumont, Richard Arlen, Richard Kiel, John Indrisano', null, 'An alien is dispatched from a faraway galaxy to take over the Earth by "duplicating" humans and creating a race of zombies.', 'An alien is dispatched from a faraway galaxy to take over the Earth by "duplicating" humans and creating a race of zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyLZfhEGuZ8xqLmwzK5U6zCBb5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42743'),
  ('488674860858404832', 'The Human Factor', 1975, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ousama Rawi, Fernando C. Bozzo Monaco, Ray Frift', 'Thomas Hunter, Peter Powell', 'George Kennedy, John Mills, Raf Vallone, Barry Sullivan, Rita Tushingham, Shane Rimmer, Thomas Hunter, Frank Avianca', 'R', 'After his family is brutally murdered for an unknown reason, a computer engineer sets out to find those responsible.', 'After his family is brutally murdered for an unknown reason, a computer engineer sets out to find those responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IWD14KhQTjMgGiHH7GZheS6SNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31950'),
  ('528011305723271341', 'The Human Factor', 1979, 'Thriller', 'Otto Preminger, Kip Gowans, Mike Molloy', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Nicol Williamson, Richard Attenborough, Derek Jacobi, John Gielgud, Iman, Joop Doderer, Robert Morley, Ann Todd', 'R', 'When a leak of information in the African section of British Intelligence is discovered, a security man is brought in to investigate.', 'When a leak of information in the African section of British Intelligence is discovered, a security man is brought in to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u3aUUbjPGFKgdtkR0wlHGPddMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39293'),
