  ('439292957252881721', 'The Human Fly', 1902, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'This is a moving picture that moves. Positively the greatest magical picture ever offered. A Hindoo magician appears and dances for the entertainment of six pretty maidens. Then, to the astonishment of all, he runs up the wall, dances and turns handsprings in mid-air, introducing many tricks that are entirely new in animated photography. The most puzzling of all the mystical series. (Star Film Catalog)', 'This is a moving picture that moves. Positively the greatest magical picture ever offered. A Hindoo magician appears and dances for the entertainment of six pretty maidens. Then, to the astonishment of all, he runs up the wall, dances and turns handsprings in mid-air, introducing many tricks that are entirely new in animated photography. The most puzzling of all the mystical series. (Star Film Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KoR4aXJFfmUIDsvzkMCqfTV0ah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108285'),
  ('810081112384312753', 'The Human Jungle', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ellis W. Carter, Joseph M. Newman', 'Daniel Fuchs', 'Gary Merrill, Jan Sterling, Regis Toomey, Lamont Johnson, Patrick Waltz, Chuck Connors, Claude Akins, Paula Raymond', 'NR', 'Danforth is assigned to take over the police department in a section of a large city saddled with juvenile delinquency, petty crimes, graft and also a recent unsolved murder of a strip-tease dancer. Recognizing the laxity of the department he implements many changes and soon finds himself under fire by the newspapers, the attorney of a racket leader and the denizens of this human jungle.', 'Danforth is assigned to take over the police department in a section of a large city saddled with juvenile delinquency, petty crimes, graft and also a recent unsolved murder of a strip-tease dancer. Recognizing the laxity of the department he implements many changes and soon finds himself under fire by the newspapers, the attorney of a racket leader and the denizens of this human jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZOcfBUILoqNKkbky88xbqK7Dk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37182'),
  ('837607808501716457', 'The Human Pyramid', 1961, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jean Rouch', 'Jean Rouch', 'Nadine Ballot, Denise, Elola, Jean-Claude, Nathalie, Raymond, Alain Tusques', null, 'Jean Rouch gives a group of black and white teenagers a "what if" question: what if they socialised with each other? The teenagers then improvise their own characters and situations.', 'Jean Rouch gives a group of black and white teenagers a "what if" question: what if they socialised with each other? The teenagers then improvise their own characters and situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66vlFfJ5M5dRTpb1pG7tc5LY7v7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168409'),
  ('444625564621063379', 'The Human Race', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Paul Hough, Matt Fore', 'Paul Hough', 'Paul McCarthy-Boyington, Eddie McGee, Brianna Lauren Jackson, B. Anthony Cohen, Trista Robinson, T. Arthur Cottam, Fred Coury, Noel Britton', null, 'A cancer survivor, an amputee, several immigrants, and many others are snatched from a Los Angeles street and forced to take part in a deadly race.', 'A cancer survivor, an amputee, several immigrants, and many others are snatched from a Los Angeles street and forced to take part in a deadly race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fndNxZPL4XXN0e9n9SauYlwt25H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185267'),
  ('498639180688437978', 'The Human Shield', 1992, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Ted Post', 'Mann Rubin', 'Michael Dudikoff, Tommy Hinkley, Hana Azoulay-Hasfari, Steve Inwood, Uri Gavriel, Avi Keidar', 'R', 'The Human Shield is a 1991 film directed by Ted Post. It stars Michael Dudikoff and Tommy Hinkley. It is about a former government agent who must save his diabetic brother from Iraqi abductors.', 'The Human Shield is a 1991 film directed by Ted Post. It stars Michael Dudikoff and Tommy Hinkley. It is about a former government agent who must save his diabetic brother from Iraqi abductors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SkGXzI0i1RQFffhAwewvlfj8rZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110631'),
  ('612816152657793727', 'The Human Stain', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Benton, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Nicholas Meyer', 'Anthony Hopkins, Nicole Kidman, Ed Harris, Gary Sinise, Wentworth Miller, Jacinda Barrett, Harry Lennix, Clark Gregg', 'R', 'Coleman Silk is a worldly and admired professor who loses his job after unwittingly making a racial slur. To clear his name, Silk writes a book about the events with his friend and colleague Nathan Zuckerman, who in the process discovers a dark secret Silk has hidden his whole life. All the while, Silk engages in an affair with Faunia Farley, a younger woman whose tormented past threatens to unravel the layers of deception Silk has constructed.', 'Coleman Silk is a worldly and admired professor who loses his job after unwittingly making a racial slur. To clear his name, Silk writes a book about the events with his friend and colleague Nathan Zuckerman, who in the process discovers a dark secret Silk has hidden his whole life. All the while, Silk engages in an affair with Faunia Farley, a younger woman whose tormented past threatens to unravel the layers of deception Silk has constructed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRgYzYpcXyXznlSc4swqNpXcnVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10922'),
  ('114263587496253433', 'The Human Surge', 2017, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Williams, Eduardo Williams, Joaquín Neira', 'Eduardo Williams', 'Sergio Morosini, Shine Marx, Domingos Marengula, Chai Fonacier, Irene Doliente Paña, Manuel Asucan, Rixel Manimtim', 'NR', 'Buenos Aires. Exe, 25 years old, has just lost his job and is not looking for another one. His neighbors and friends seem as odd to him as they always do. Online, he meets Alf, a boy from Mozambique who is also bored with his job and who is about to follow Archie, another boy who has run away into the jungle. Through the dense vegetation of the forest, Archie tracks ants back to their nest. One of them wanders off course and comes across Canh, a Filipino, sitting on top of a giant heap of earth and who is about to go back to his strange, beautiful home town, where he too has a miserable job.', 'Buenos Aires. Exe, 25 years old, has just lost his job and is not looking for another one. His neighbors and friends seem as odd to him as they always do. Online, he meets Alf, a boy from Mozambique who is also bored with his job and who is about to follow Archie, another boy who has run away into the jungle. Through the dense vegetation of the forest, Archie tracks ants back to their nest. One of them wanders off course and comes across Canh, a Filipino, sitting on top of a giant heap of earth and who is about to go back to his strange, beautiful home town, where he too has a miserable job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAeLgAGItyVADxCUseArsEt20QN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405446'),
  ('1086024817919259738', 'The Human Tornado', 1976, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Cliff Roquemore, Ayanna DuLaney, D''Urville Martin', 'Jerry Jones', 'Rudy Ray Moore, Lady Reed, J.B. Baron, Ernie Hudson, Gloria Delaney, Jimmy Lynch, Jerry Jones, Java', 'R', 'Dolemite comes to the rescue of Queen Bee, whose nightclub is threatened by the Mafia.', 'Dolemite comes to the rescue of Queen Bee, whose nightclub is threatened by the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTwLcUMwjktY6XZnUSJZlWGfWt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32100'),
  ('894674123505635251', 'The Human Vapor', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Koji Kajita', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Yoshio Tsuchiya, Kaoru Yachigusa, Tatsuya Mihashi, Keiko Sata, Bokuzen Hidari, Yoshibumi Tajima, Hisaya Ito, Tatsuo Matsumura', null, 'A failed science experiment gives a librarian the ability to turn into a gaseous substance. He goes on to rob banks to fund his dancer girlfriend''s career, killing those who interfere. Now Tokyo''s most wanted criminal, can authorities stop him?', 'A failed science experiment gives a librarian the ability to turn into a gaseous substance. He goes on to rob banks to fund his dancer girlfriend''s career, killing those who interfere. Now Tokyo''s most wanted criminal, can authorities stop him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSkAiTb5BICIygujPIetfVVhldP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125266'),
  ('1026005286940121888', 'The Human Voice', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pedro Almodóvar, José Luis Alcaine', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Tilda Swinton, Agustín Almodóvar, Miguel Almodóvar, Pablo Almodóvar, Diego Pajuelo, Carlos García Cambero', 'R', 'A woman watches time pass beside the suitcases of her ex-lover (who is supposed to come pick them up but never arrives) and a restless dog who doesn''t understand that his master has abandoned him.', 'A woman watches time pass beside the suitcases of her ex-lover (who is supposed to come pick them up but never arrives) and a restless dog who doesn''t understand that his master has abandoned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YWYbBAQ1keap6P5K2Yq1LK70KV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671577'),
  ('546791534217280371', 'The Humanity Bureau', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mark Dobrescu, Trevor Cunningham, Jesse Nelson', 'Dave Schultz', 'Nicolas Cage, Sarah Lind, Jakob Davies, Hugh Dillon, Vicellous Shannon, Jett Klyne, Lorne Cardinal, Destee Klyne', 'R', 'In 2030 the world is in a permanent state of economic recession and facing serious environmental problems as a result of global warming.', 'In 2030 the world is in a permanent state of economic recession and facing serious environmental problems as a result of global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qf4wJoaYAXwY0Lov4OfBhSGbTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456048'),
  ('700979442816646774', 'The Humanoid', 1979, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Aldo Lado, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Adriano Bolzoni, Aldo Lado', 'Richard Kiel, Corinne Cléry, Barbara Bach, Leonard Mann, Arthur Kennedy, Ivan Rassimov, Massimo Serato, Marco Yeh', null, 'Hoping to overthrow his brother as ruler of the planet Metropolis, the evil Graal enlists the help of the insane Dr. Kraspin, who has invented a chemical capable of turning an ordinary person into a perfect soldier. They test this chemical on the pilot Golob, turning the unsuspecting victim into a mindless but indestructible automaton possessing superhuman strength. The people of Metropolis must somehow outwit Graal before he can create an army of these soldiers, or their planet will be destroyed.', 'Hoping to overthrow his brother as ruler of the planet Metropolis, the evil Graal enlists the help of the insane Dr. Kraspin, who has invented a chemical capable of turning an ordinary person into a perfect soldier. They test this chemical on the pilot Golob, turning the unsuspecting victim into a mindless but indestructible automaton possessing superhuman strength. The people of Metropolis must somehow outwit Graal before he can create an army of these soldiers, or their planet will be destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUPf4cx3o9IWtC4dDs46B4oNb9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73065'),
  ('585995583775411785', 'The Humans', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kether Abeles, Ada Mitchev, Vic Coram', 'Stephen Karam', 'Richard Jenkins, Jayne Houdyshell, Amy Schumer, Beanie Feldstein, Steven Yeun, June Squibb', 'R', 'Erik Blake has gathered three generations of his Pennsylvania family to celebrate Thanksgiving at his daughter’s apartment in lower Manhattan. As darkness falls outside and eerie things start to go bump in the night, the group’s deepest fears are laid bare.', 'Erik Blake has gathered three generations of his Pennsylvania family to celebrate Thanksgiving at his daughter’s apartment in lower Manhattan. As darkness falls outside and eerie things start to go bump in the night, the group’s deepest fears are laid bare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQsDWmkvzzJxlrc3HCqkfQRH11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588367'),
  ('452345195512234112', 'The Humbling', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Barry Levinson, Adam Jandrup, Soren Miltich', 'Buck Henry, Michal Zebede', 'Al Pacino, Greta Gerwig, Dylan Baker, Charles Grodin, Nina Arianda, Kyra Sedgwick, Dianne Wiest, Dan Hedaya', 'R', 'Following a breakdown and suicide attempt, an aging actor becomes involved with a much younger woman but soon finds that it''s difficult to keep pace with her.', 'Following a breakdown and suicide attempt, an aging actor becomes involved with a much younger woman but soon finds that it''s difficult to keep pace with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8x8NUmtcuNqlIH1JDAoxUjoDX7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254023'),
  ('91328850233153888', 'The Hummingbird', 2022, 'Drama', 'Francesca Archibugi, Luca Bigazzi, Elisabetta Boni', 'Francesca Archibugi, Laura Paolucci, Francesco Piccolo', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Kasia Smutniak, Bérénice Bejo, Laura Morante, Sergio Albelli, Alessandro Tedeschi, Benedetta Porcaroli, Massimo Ceccherini', null, 'Everyone in Marco''s life seems constantly restless, from his brilliant but unhappily married parents to his own wife Marina, or even Luisa, the real love of his life, a girl he met during a fateful summer in the ''70s and always stayed in touch with. Tragedy and fate seem to haunt him, yet he somehow manages never to get ensnared in the chaos—like his namesake, “the hummingbird”, he focuses all his energy at standing still.', 'Everyone in Marco''s life seems constantly restless, from his brilliant but unhappily married parents to his own wife Marina, or even Luisa, the real love of his life, a girl he met during a fateful summer in the ''70s and always stayed in touch with. Tragedy and fate seem to haunt him, yet he somehow manages never to get ensnared in the chaos—like his namesake, “the hummingbird”, he focuses all his energy at standing still.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lgbElaJ0oOia0C4U8QdqPrNeWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807986'),
  ('1042764705227753516', 'The Hummingbird Project', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Olivier Chouinard, Pascal Elissalde, Raphaël Hébert', 'Kim Nguyen', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Alexander Skarsgård, Salma Hayek Pinault, Michael Mando, Johan Heldenbergh, Ayisha Issa, Kaniehtiio Horn, Mark Slacke', 'R', 'A pair of high-frequency traders go up against their old boss in an effort to make millions in a fiber-optic cable deal.', 'A pair of high-frequency traders go up against their old boss in an effort to make millions in a fiber-optic cable deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cx7CuTtcJvjZAP6ZFWoxylCXKFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489243'),
  ('64376071185324382', 'The Humpbacked Horse', 1941, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, George Reysgof, Nikolai Ozornov', 'Vladimir Shveytser', 'Pyotr Aleynikov, Georgi Millyar, Marina Kovalyova, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Veniamin Gut, Lev Potyomkin, Anatoliy Zhukov, Nikolay Gorlov', null, 'Surreal Soviet fantasy movie about a man whose love is kidnapped by the Tsar and he must save her with the help of a humpbacked horse.', 'Surreal Soviet fantasy movie about a man whose love is kidnapped by the Tsar and he must save her with the help of a humpbacked horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcDxseR8qTqq3X4ocMb8fvg33Ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88308'),
  ('863454298053287371', 'The Humpbacked Horse', 1975, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Boris Butakov, Mikhail Druyan', 'Anatoliy Volkov, Ivan Ivanov-Vano', 'Aleksei Gribov, Mariya Vinogradova, Georgiy Vitsin, Vera Yenyutina, Svetlana Kharlap, Aleksandr Khanov, Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Roman Filippov', null, 'Remake of the 1947 Soviet film directed by Ivan Ivanov-Vano and produced by the Soyuzmultfilm studio in Moscow.', 'Remake of the 1947 Soviet film directed by Ivan Ivanov-Vano and produced by the Soyuzmultfilm studio in Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QRDGh7qVn6L3NiHpeGzfOmhZk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73924'),
  ('569389452000747074', 'The Hunchback', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Medak, Elemér Ragályi', null, 'Mandy Patinkin, Richard Harris, Salma Hayek Pinault, Edward Atterton, Benedick Blythe, Nigel Terry, Jim Dale, Trevor Baxter', null, 'Based on Victor Hugo''s famed novel, the story of Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer of Notre Dame, and his unrequited love for the gypsy girl, Esmeralda.', 'Based on Victor Hugo''s famed novel, the story of Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer of Notre Dame, and his unrequited love for the gypsy girl, Esmeralda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xch2lgon3mGYT9jT0SMFpBPdSPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148636'),
  ('129562641192146782', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame', 1923, 'Romance, Drama, Horror', 'Wallace Worsley, Robert Newhard, William Wyler', 'Chester L. Roberts, Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Lon Chaney, Patsy Ruth Miller, Norman Kerry, Kate Lester, Winifred Bryson, Nigel De Brulier, Brandon Hurst, Ernest Torrence', 'NR', 'In 15th century France, a gypsy girl is framed for murder by the infatuated Chief Justice, and only the deformed bellringer of Notre Dame Cathedral can save her.', 'In 15th century France, a gypsy girl is framed for murder by the infatuated Chief Justice, and only the deformed bellringer of Notre Dame Cathedral can save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oheTQrTuqS1jPUW6GOc65ZbM5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18987'),
  ('294271396089575848', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame', 1939, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'William Dieterle, Joseph H. August', 'Sonya Levien', 'Charles Laughton, Cedric Hardwicke, Thomas Mitchell, Maureen O''Hara, Edmond O''Brien, Alan Marshal, Walter Hampden, Harry Davenport', 'NR', 'Paris, France, 1482. Frollo, Chief Justice of benevolent King Louis XI, gets infatuated by the beauty of Esmeralda, a young Romani girl. The hunchback Quasimodo, Frollo''s protege and bell-ringer of Notre Dame, lives in peace among the bells in the heights of the immense cathedral until he is involved by the twisted magistrate in his malicious plans to free himself from Esmeralda''s alleged spell, which he believes to be the devil''s work.', 'Paris, France, 1482. Frollo, Chief Justice of benevolent King Louis XI, gets infatuated by the beauty of Esmeralda, a young Romani girl. The hunchback Quasimodo, Frollo''s protege and bell-ringer of Notre Dame, lives in peace among the bells in the heights of the immense cathedral until he is involved by the twisted magistrate in his malicious plans to free himself from Esmeralda''s alleged spell, which he believes to be the devil''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6fsyHeqSQs4tktk9q3awgo7IzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31685'),
  ('1142983975795355482', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame', 1956, 'Drama, Horror', 'Michel Kelber, Jean Delannoy', 'Jean Aurenche, Jacques Prévert', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Anthony Quinn, Alain Cuny, Jean Danet, Damia, Marianne Oswald, Danielle Dumont, Valentine Tessier', 'PG', 'Paris, 1482. Today is the festival of the fools, taking place like each year in the square outside Cathedral Notre Dame. Among jugglers and other entertainers, Esmeralda, a sensuous gypsy, performs a bewitching dance in front of delighted spectators. From up in a tower of the cathedral, Frollo, an alchemist, gazes at her lustfully. Later in the night, Frollo orders Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer and his faithful servant, to kidnap Esmeralda. But when the ugly freak comes close to her is touched by the young woman''s beauty...', 'Paris, 1482. Today is the festival of the fools, taking place like each year in the square outside Cathedral Notre Dame. Among jugglers and other entertainers, Esmeralda, a sensuous gypsy, performs a bewitching dance in front of delighted spectators. From up in a tower of the cathedral, Frollo, an alchemist, gazes at her lustfully. Later in the night, Frollo orders Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer and his faithful servant, to kidnap Esmeralda. But when the ugly freak comes close to her is touched by the young woman''s beauty...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds4pCq0GOEarBHI35bYSN2PC0KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11594'),
  ('1029830333485559414', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie, Horror', 'Michael Tuchner, Jack Lowin, Ken Baker', 'John Gay', 'Anthony Hopkins, Derek Jacobi, David Suchet, Lesley-Anne Down, John Gielgud, Tim Pigott-Smith, Robert Powell, Nigel Hawthorne', null, 'Quasimodo, the hunchback bellringer of Notre Dame''s cathedral, meets a beautiful gypsy dancer, Esmeralda, and falls in love with her. So does Quasimodo''s guardian, the archdeacon of the cathedral, and a poor street poet. But Esmeralda''s in love with a handsome soldier. When a mob mistakes her for a witch, it''s up to Quasimodo to rescue her and claim sanctuary for her in the cathedral.', 'Quasimodo, the hunchback bellringer of Notre Dame''s cathedral, meets a beautiful gypsy dancer, Esmeralda, and falls in love with her. So does Quasimodo''s guardian, the archdeacon of the cathedral, and a poor street poet. But Esmeralda''s in love with a handsome soldier. When a mob mistakes her for a witch, it''s up to Quasimodo to rescue her and claim sanctuary for her in the cathedral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AltsK3wrdWJLUmwO3axZjjPNsvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80385'),
  ('776540847895754024', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame', 1996, 'Drama, Animation, Family', 'Gary Trousdale, Kirk Wise, Paul Brizzi', 'Irene Mecchi, Tab Murphy, Jonathan Roberts', 'Tom Hulce, Demi Moore, Kevin Kline, Tony Jay, Charles Kimbrough, Mary Wickes, Jason Alexander, Paul Kandel', 'G', 'Isolated bell-ringer Quasimodo wishes to leave Notre Dame tower against the wishes of Judge Claude Frollo, his stern guardian and Paris'' strait-laced Minister of Justice. His first venture to the outside world finds him Esmeralda, a kind-hearted and fearless Romani woman who openly stands up to Frollo''s tyranny.', 'Isolated bell-ringer Quasimodo wishes to leave Notre Dame tower against the wishes of Judge Claude Frollo, his stern guardian and Paris'' strait-laced Minister of Justice. His first venture to the outside world finds him Esmeralda, a kind-hearted and fearless Romani woman who openly stands up to Frollo''s tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hImMgT9B27evYSRmfztqdDtX6qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10545'),
  ('317028795427975923', 'The Hunchback of Notre Dame II', 2002, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Bradley Raymond, Hiroshi Kawamata, Terry Lennon', 'Jule Selbo, Cindy Marcus, Flip Kobler', 'Tom Hulce, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Jason Alexander, Paul Kandel, Charles Kimbrough, Michael McKean, Demi Moore, Kevin Kline', 'G', 'Now that Frollo is gone, Quasimodo rings the bell with the help of his new friend and Esmeralda''s and Phoebus'' little son, Zephyr. But when Quasi stops by a traveling circus owned by evil magician Sarousch, he falls for Madellaine, Sarouch''s assistant.', 'Now that Frollo is gone, Quasimodo rings the bell with the help of his new friend and Esmeralda''s and Phoebus'' little son, Zephyr. But when Quasi stops by a traveling circus owned by evil magician Sarousch, he falls for Madellaine, Sarouch''s assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14PSM6n9VSsiUwJhT0WZbgOuNvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12448'),
  ('921294128553194374', 'The Hunchback of Paris', 1959, 'Adventure, History', 'André Hunebelle, Marcel Grignon, Bernard Toublanc-Michel', 'Jean Halain, Pierre Foucaud, André Hunebelle', 'Jean Marais, Bourvil, Sabine Sesselmann, François Chaumette, Jean Le Poulain, Hubert Noël, Paulette Dubost, Edmond Beauchamp', null, 'Duke Philippe de Nevers is an influential and popular man who is married to a beautiful wife called Aurore. His rival Philippe de Gonzague hates him enough to organise an attempt on him. The Duke is accompagnied by Henri de Lagardère when de Gonzague''s henchmen altogether attack him. Lagardère cannot save his friend because the both of them are hopelessly outnumbered. He has to escape in order to save the Duke''s daughter and swears revenge. Together with his old buddy Passepoil he raises the little girl in Spain. At the same time he returns frequently to France where he detects confronts his friend''s murderers and puts them to the sword one by one until only their former leader is left. Finally he discovers that Philippe de Gonzague is the man for whom he is looking.', 'Duke Philippe de Nevers is an influential and popular man who is married to a beautiful wife called Aurore. His rival Philippe de Gonzague hates him enough to organise an attempt on him. The Duke is accompagnied by Henri de Lagardère when de Gonzague''s henchmen altogether attack him. Lagardère cannot save his friend because the both of them are hopelessly outnumbered. He has to escape in order to save the Duke''s daughter and swears revenge. Together with his old buddy Passepoil he raises the little girl in Spain. At the same time he returns frequently to France where he detects confronts his friend''s murderers and puts them to the sword one by one until only their former leader is left. Finally he discovers that Philippe de Gonzague is the man for whom he is looking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWdifU3NZ0FCU5Cb36hhefyX04R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54880'),
  ('1117274276453102085', 'The Hunchback of Soho', 1966, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Herbert Reinecker', 'Günther Stoll, Pinkas Braun, Monika Peitsch, Siegfried Schürenberg, Eddi Arent, Agnes Windeck, Gisela Uhlen, Hubert von Meyerinck', null, 'A woman is kidnapped and her identity is stolen by criminals attempting to collect her inheritance.', 'A woman is kidnapped and her identity is stolen by criminals attempting to collect her inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbi7IWs1tb7SUHzpOLobc0Xinvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74190'),
  ('1027600252122655343', 'The Hunchedback Horse', 1947, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Nikolay Voinov, Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya', 'Evgeniy Pomeshchikov, Nikolai Rozhkov', 'Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Georgi Millyar, Valentina Sperantova, Georgiy Vitsin, Alik Kachanov, Leonid Pirogov, Georgi Chernovolenko, Galina Novozhilova', null, 'Adventures of Ivan the Fool and humpbacked horse in the world of kind magical creatures and cruel people.', 'Adventures of Ivan the Fool and humpbacked horse in the world of kind magical creatures and cruel people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/np2JxCCeu0Dq3R2i8mTODMfJjnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116733'),
  ('254305650986536514', 'The Hundred-Foot Journey', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lasse Hallström, Linus Sandgren, Mishka Cheyko', 'Steven Knight', 'Helen Mirren, Manish Dayal, Om Puri, Charlotte Le Bon, Rohan Chand, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Farzana Dua Elahe, Dillon Mitra', 'PG', 'A story centered around an Indian family who moves to France and opens a restaurant across the street from a Michelin-starred French restaurant.', 'A story centered around an Indian family who moves to France and opens a restaurant across the street from a Michelin-starred French restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vFhSr7INoulu18smHqicft05i8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228194'),
  ('61201624267507144', 'The Hunger', 1983, 'Horror, Drama', 'Tony Scott, Stephen Goldblatt, Tom Mangravite', 'Michael Thomas, James Costigan', 'Catherine Deneuve, David Bowie, Susan Sarandon, Cliff DeYoung, Beth Ehlers, Dan Hedaya, Rufus Collins, Suzanne Bertish', 'R', 'Five-thousand-year-old vampire Miriam promises her lovers the gift of eternal life. When John, her cellist companion for centuries, discovers that he has suddenly begun growing old, he attempts to seek out the help of Dr. Sarah Roberts, a researcher on the mechanisms of aging.', 'Five-thousand-year-old vampire Miriam promises her lovers the gift of eternal life. When John, her cellist companion for centuries, discovers that he has suddenly begun growing old, he attempts to seek out the help of Dr. Sarah Roberts, a researcher on the mechanisms of aging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFTDtRtK8J55A1LTpwigV7QGQg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11654'),
  ('43204059943705670', 'The Hunger Games', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Gary Ross, Tom Stern, Lindsey Moran', 'Gary Ross, Billy Ray, Suzanne Collins', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Liam Hemsworth, Woody Harrelson, Elizabeth Banks, Lenny Kravitz, Stanley Tucci, Donald Sutherland', 'PG-13', 'In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.', 'In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXCbOiVDCxO71zI7cuwBRXdftq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70160'),
  ('93875262312456235', 'The Hunger Games: Catching Fire', 2013, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Francis Lawrence, Jo Willems, John Collins', 'Michael Arndt, Simon Beaufoy', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Liam Hemsworth, Woody Harrelson, Elizabeth Banks, Donald Sutherland, Lenny Kravitz, Philip Seymour Hoffman', 'PG-13', 'After surviving the Hunger Games, Katniss and Peeta struggle with the consequences of their victory as unrest spreads across Panem. Forced back into the spotlight, they become symbols of hope and resistance while the Capitol prepares a new and deadly challenge that will change the future of the nation forever.', 'After surviving the Hunger Games, Katniss and Peeta struggle with the consequences of their victory as unrest spreads across Panem. Forced back into the spotlight, they become symbols of hope and resistance while the Capitol prepares a new and deadly challenge that will change the future of the nation forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrQHDXjVmbYzadOXQ0UaObunoy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101299'),
  ('441392078632758624', 'The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Francis Lawrence, Justin O''Neal Miller, Jo Willems', 'Danny Strong, Peter Craig', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Liam Hemsworth, Woody Harrelson, Elizabeth Banks, Julianne Moore, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jeffrey Wright', 'PG-13', 'After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.', 'After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131631'),
  ('855838254938219527', 'The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 2', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Francis Lawrence, Jo Willems, David Scheunemann', 'Danny Strong, Peter Craig', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Josh Hutcherson, Liam Hemsworth, Woody Harrelson, Elizabeth Banks, Julianne Moore, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jeffrey Wright', 'PG-13', 'As the war between the Capitol and the districts reaches its peak, Katniss Everdeen embarks on a perilous mission to liberate Panem and confront President Snow. Joined by a team of trusted allies, she navigates deadly traps, shifting loyalties, and the heavy cost of rebellion, determined to bring freedom to her people and end the Hunger Games once and for all.', 'As the war between the Capitol and the districts reaches its peak, Katniss Everdeen embarks on a perilous mission to liberate Panem and confront President Snow. Joined by a team of trusted allies, she navigates deadly traps, shifting loyalties, and the heavy cost of rebellion, determined to bring freedom to her people and end the Hunger Games once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lImKHDfExAulp16grYm8zD5eONE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131634'),
  ('714016134138349297', 'The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Francis Lawrence, Jeremy Braben, Jo Willems', 'Billy Ray, Michael Lesslie', 'Joseph Zada, Mckenna Grace, Jesse Plemons, Ralph Fiennes, Glenn Close, Whitney Peak, Ben Wang, Molly McCann', null, 'Return to the world of Panem 24 years before the events of The Hunger Games for the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.', 'Return to the world of Panem 24 years before the events of The Hunger Games for the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kONfwpf0AZzvL1zqjZV9C89g1PY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1300968'),
  ('321414192044192162', 'The Hunger Games: The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Jo Willems, Franziska Hoh, Nadim Suleiman', 'Michael Lesslie, Michael Arndt', 'Tom Blyth, Rachel Zegler, Peter Dinklage, Jason Schwartzman, Hunter Schafer, Josh Rivera, Viola Davis, Fionnula Flanagan', 'PG-13', '64 years before he becomes the tyrannical president of Panem, Coriolanus Snow sees a chance for a change in fortunes when he mentors Lucy Gray Baird, the female tribute from District 12.', '64 years before he becomes the tyrannical president of Panem, Coriolanus Snow sees a chance for a change in fortunes when he mentors Lucy Gray Baird, the female tribute from District 12.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBaXZ95R2OxueZhvQbcEWy2DqyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695721'),
  ('452445252312998959', 'The Hungover Games', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Josh Stolberg, Kat Hess, Andrew Strahorn', 'Kyle Barnett Anderson, David Bernstein', 'Ben Begley, Herbert Russell, Ross Nathan, Sam Pancake, John Livingston, Rita Volk, Tara Reid, Jamie Kennedy', 'R', 'Each year, drunk people are selected to participate in torturous games the morning after a big night out. There''s no sunglasses, no water, and no headache medicine. "The Hungover Games," a film that manages to merge the premises of both "The Hunger Games" and "The Hangover" and throw in references to "Ted," "Django Unchained," "The Lord of the Rings," "Carrie," "The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills" and whatever else crossed the writers'' fevered brains during the probably very drunken "development process."', 'Each year, drunk people are selected to participate in torturous games the morning after a big night out. There''s no sunglasses, no water, and no headache medicine. "The Hungover Games," a film that manages to merge the premises of both "The Hunger Games" and "The Hangover" and throw in references to "Ted," "Django Unchained," "The Lord of the Rings," "Carrie," "The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills" and whatever else crossed the writers'' fevered brains during the probably very drunken "development process."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOqB812jWYgcHCyT2PVEk3RBtSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244688'),
  ('842511842965774132', 'The Hungry', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bornila Chatterjee, Nick Cooke, Sajid Ali', 'Kurban Kassam, Bornila Chatterjee, Tanaji Dasgupta', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Tisca Chopra, Neeraj Kabi, Arjun Gupta, Sayani Gupta, Suraj Sharma, Antonio Aakeel, Karan A. Pandit', 'NR', 'Tulsi Joshi, a widow and bride to be comes to her own wedding seeking revenge for the brutal murder of her first born son.', 'Tulsi Joshi, a widow and bride to be comes to her own wedding seeking revenge for the brutal murder of her first born son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJieLTdLdIQ0CJEQVmuJt0no9Ql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470642'),
  ('349092826925170856', 'The Hungry Lion', 2018, 'Drama', 'Takaomi Ogata, Kenichi Negishi', 'Takaomi Ogata', 'Urara Matsubayashi, Mariko Tsutsui, Tomomi Sugai, Nanami Hidaka, Sakiko Kato, Miku Uehara, Daikichi Sugawara, Toshimitsu Kokido', null, 'A high-school teacher is arrested for having sexual relations with a minor. Young Hiromi finds herself in the eye of the storm when she is suspected of featuring in her teacher’s leaked sex video and her innocence is questioned by everyone around her.', 'A high-school teacher is arrested for having sexual relations with a minor. Young Hiromi finds herself in the eye of the storm when she is suspected of featuring in her teacher’s leaked sex video and her innocence is questioned by everyone around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bV8nrkiK9IpaAE8UV5o3ihXVV7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499444'),
  ('22046874550990469', 'The Hunley', 1999, 'History, War, Action, Drama', 'John Gray, John Thomas', null, 'Armand Assante, Donald Sutherland, Chris Bauer, Gerry Becker, Sebastian Roché, Michael Stuhlbarg, Alex Jennings, Michael Dolan', 'PG', 'CSS Hunley tells the incredible true story of the crew of the manually propelled submarine CSS Hunley, during the siege of Charleston of 1864. It is a story of heroism in the face of adversity, the Hunley being the first submersible to sink an enemy boat in time of war. It also relates the human side of the story relating the uncommon and extaordinary temperament of the 9 men who led the Hunley into history and died valiantly accomplishing this feat.', 'CSS Hunley tells the incredible true story of the crew of the manually propelled submarine CSS Hunley, during the siege of Charleston of 1864. It is a story of heroism in the face of adversity, the Hunley being the first submersible to sink an enemy boat in time of war. It also relates the human side of the story relating the uncommon and extaordinary temperament of the 9 men who led the Hunley into history and died valiantly accomplishing this feat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPmwzVG7AGHGoFyR8PpiswGiQ8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65431'),
  ('668767370211253196', 'The Hunt', 1964, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Manoel de Oliveira, Paulo Rocha', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'António Rodrigues Sousa, João Rocha Almeida, Albino Freitas, Manuel De Sá', null, 'Two friends decide to go hunting but without guns, so that no accident will happen. As they stroll and talk, one of them falls into a hole in a hidden marshland. His friend runs away, and manages to gather a number of men that were in the vicinity. They form a human chain to pull the victim out, but their affliction mounts, as they have no strategy for doing it, and they can''t understand each other.', 'Two friends decide to go hunting but without guns, so that no accident will happen. As they stroll and talk, one of them falls into a hole in a hidden marshland. His friend runs away, and manages to gather a number of men that were in the vicinity. They form a human chain to pull the victim out, but their affliction mounts, as they have no strategy for doing it, and they can''t understand each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPf9dAWgbsCLq5zAsbGq1Utk8Er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186946'),
  ('1006713806695350843', 'The Hunt', 1966, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Saura, Luis Cuadrado', 'Angelino Fons, Carlos Saura', 'Ismael Merlo, Alfredo Mayo, José María Prada, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Fernando Sánchez Polack, Violeta García, María Sánchez Aroca', null, 'Three veterans of the Spanish Civil War go rabbit hunting. While doing so, old wounds open up.', 'Three veterans of the Spanish Civil War go rabbit hunting. While doing so, old wounds open up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lODWq6rLdcb8hLuQpt9qHSAatW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114333'),
  ('36326570706541103', 'The Hunt', 1979, 'Animation', 'Eduard Nazarov, Mikhail Druyan, Tatyana Lytko', 'Alexander Kostinsky', null, null, 'Short Russian animated film. The boy comes to the hunting shop considers trophies and imagines that he is in the African savannah.', 'Short Russian animated film. The boy comes to the hunting shop considers trophies and imagines that he is in the African savannah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etM1ItlJprOSuJfLunKvpLUGzUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339434'),
  ('34891012434192185', 'The Hunt', 2011, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Thomas Szczepanski', 'François Gaillard', 'Clara Vallet, Jellali Mouina, Sarah Lucide, Mari-Christine Jeanney, Frédéric Sassine, Zuriel de Peslouan, Michel Coste', null, 'An undercover reporter is commissioned to write a story about a series of gruesome murders. His investigation leads him to a secret society of wealthy businessman who hunt humans for money. Caught in a spiral of violence, he is forced to participate in the game until he discovers that he has become the hunted.', 'An undercover reporter is commissioned to write a story about a series of gruesome murders. His investigation leads him to a secret society of wealthy businessman who hunt humans for money. Caught in a spiral of violence, he is forced to participate in the game until he discovers that he has become the hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZiOV6dd4nN479voV83fSYMhmwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152578'),
  ('143906439793547638', 'The Hunt', 2012, 'Drama', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Charlotte Bruus Christensen, Peter Hingebjerg', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Tobias Lindholm', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Thomas Bo Larsen, Annika, Lasse Fogelstrøm, Susse Wold, Anne Louise Hassing, Lars Ranthe, Alexandra Rapaport', 'R', 'A teacher lives a lonely life, all the while struggling over his son’s custody. His life slowly gets better as he finds love and receives good news from his son, but his new luck is about to be brutally shattered by an innocent little lie.', 'A teacher lives a lonely life, all the while struggling over his son’s custody. His life slowly gets better as he finds love and receives good news from his son, but his new luck is about to be brutally shattered by an innocent little lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkixsXzRh28q3PCqFoWcf7unghT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103663'),
  ('7087114992605329', 'The Hunt', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Park Jong-cheol, Lee Woo-chul', 'Cheon Jin-wu', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Cho Jin-woong, Han Ye-ri, Kwon Yul, Son Hyun-joo, Park Byung-eun, Han Jae-yeong, Kim Yoon-sung', null, 'When raw gold is discovered deep in the woods, a group of gold hunters arrive to mine it. Several neighbors in the area witness the hunters by chance and find themselves in danger. Among the witnesses, hunter Ki-sung risks his life to protect the other witnesses and engages the gold hunters in a cat-and-mouse game of death.', 'When raw gold is discovered deep in the woods, a group of gold hunters arrive to mine it. Several neighbors in the area witness the hunters by chance and find themselves in danger. Among the witnesses, hunter Ki-sung risks his life to protect the other witnesses and engages the gold hunters in a cat-and-mouse game of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEsVRnapfthNZv6Pjueo47LAmho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400421'),
  ('585557171903439011', 'The Hunt', 2020, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Craig Zobel, Lars P. Winther, Darran Tiernan', 'Nick Cuse, Damon Lindelof', 'Betty Gilpin, Hilary Swank, Ethan Suplee, Teri Wyble, Ike Barinholtz, Wayne Duvall, Emma Roberts, Christopher Berry', 'R', 'Twelve strangers wake up in a clearing. They don''t know where they are—or how they got there. In the shadow of a dark internet conspiracy theory, ruthless elitists gather at a remote location to hunt humans for sport. But their master plan is about to be derailed when one of the hunted turns the tables on her pursuers.', 'Twelve strangers wake up in a clearing. They don''t know where they are—or how they got there. In the shadow of a dark internet conspiracy theory, ruthless elitists gather at a remote location to hunt humans for sport. But their master plan is about to be derailed when one of the hunted turns the tables on her pursuers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxPhn4ef1EAo5njxwBkAEVrlJJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514847'),
  ('1114316086189834001', 'The Hunt', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Marco Bocci, Federico Annicchiarico', 'Marco Bocci, Alessandro Pondi', 'Laura Chiatti, Filippo Nigro, Paolo Pierobon, Pietro Sermonti, Salvatore Langella, Imma Piro, Marco Bocci, Peppino Mazzotta', null, 'A family drama about four siblings, three boys and a girl, who reunite, after several years of distance, after the sudden death of their father.', 'A family drama about four siblings, three boys and a girl, who reunite, after several years of distance, after the sudden death of their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4v33AqmeCMrTzbZk90cf8tBkNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056302'),
  ('546511256750692553', 'The Hunt for Eagle One', 2006, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Thriller, War', 'Brian Clyde, Andrea V. Rossotto, Glen Parian', 'Michael Henry Carter', 'Mark Dacascos, Theresa Randle, Rutger Hauer, Joe Suba, Zach McGowan, Rey Malonzo, Ricardo Cepeda, Joe Mari Avellana', 'R', 'A group of US Marines are sent to rescue captured a US Marine and a Filipino Captain while stopping a group of Al-Qaeda-backed local rebels from launching biological weapons.', 'A group of US Marines are sent to rescue captured a US Marine and a Filipino Captain while stopping a group of Al-Qaeda-backed local rebels from launching biological weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuCx5R4LcpI4d97f1MRfY8yntcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18819'),
  ('714669770948259903', 'The Hunt for Red October', 1990, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jan de Bont, John McTiernan, Beau Marks', 'Larry Ferguson, Donald E. Stewart', 'Sean Connery, Alec Baldwin, Scott Glenn, Sam Neill, James Earl Jones, Joss Ackland, Richard Jordan, Peter Firth', 'PG-13', 'A new technologically-superior Soviet nuclear sub, the Red October, is heading for the U.S. coast under the command of Captain Marko Ramius. The American government thinks Ramius is planning to attack. Lone CIA analyst Jack Ryan has a different idea: he thinks Ramius is planning to defect, but he has only a few hours to find him and prove it - because the entire Russian naval and air commands are trying to find Ramius, too. The hunt is on!', 'A new technologically-superior Soviet nuclear sub, the Red October, is heading for the U.S. coast under the command of Captain Marko Ramius. The American government thinks Ramius is planning to attack. Lone CIA analyst Jack Ryan has a different idea: he thinks Ramius is planning to defect, but he has only a few hours to find him and prove it - because the entire Russian naval and air commands are trying to find Ramius, too. The hunt is on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVl7zidse4KiWtGMqHFtZCx4X3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1669'),
  ('1082800718452988425', 'The Hunt for the Amber Room', 2012, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Action', 'Florian Baxmeyer, Peter Krause', 'Derek Meister, Simon X. Rost', 'Kai Wiesinger, Bettina Zimmermann, Fabian Busch, Sonja Gerhardt, Annika Blendl, Ralph Herforth, Clemens Schick, Andreas Grusinski', null, 'It''s the greatest myth of the German post-war era: The Amber Room. Since its disappearance in 1945 from Koenigsberg Castle, legions of treasure hunters have tried and failed to find the room. It is said that Physics genius, Albert Einstein hid the legendary Amber Room from the Nazis in the turmoil of the last days of the war. It bears a secret within its amber - in wrong hands, it could destroy mankind! Our adventurers, Eik, Katharina and Justus, come across an incredible trace and with the help of Einstein''s great-granddaughter Mila, together they fight off a ruthless pharmaceutical magnate who spares no effort to get ahold of the Amber Room. From Europe''s biggest monument in Leipzig, through the halls of Munich''s German Museum, across the dunes of St. Peter-Ording, to the Nazi caves of the Berchtesgaden Alps. The adventurous hunt begins. Written by Dreamtool Entertainment', 'It''s the greatest myth of the German post-war era: The Amber Room. Since its disappearance in 1945 from Koenigsberg Castle, legions of treasure hunters have tried and failed to find the room. It is said that Physics genius, Albert Einstein hid the legendary Amber Room from the Nazis in the turmoil of the last days of the war. It bears a secret within its amber - in wrong hands, it could destroy mankind! Our adventurers, Eik, Katharina and Justus, come across an incredible trace and with the help of Einstein''s great-granddaughter Mila, together they fight off a ruthless pharmaceutical magnate who spares no effort to get ahold of the Amber Room. From Europe''s biggest monument in Leipzig, through the halls of Munich''s German Museum, across the dunes of St. Peter-Ording, to the Nazi caves of the Berchtesgaden Alps. The adventurous hunt begins. Written by Dreamtool Entertainment', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJAygUYpDKxEGoR0onsyOgfyijB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74264'),
  ('608370459871359166', 'The Hunt For the BTK Killer', 2005, 'TV Movie, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Stephen Kay, Bobby Bukowski, Mary Reynolds', null, 'Robert Forster, Michael Michele, Maury Chaykin, Mimi Kuzyk, Gregg Henry, Donna Goodhand, Michael Filipowich, Daniel Kash', null, 'After 31 years at-large, detectives in Wichita, Kansas hone in on the serial killer known as BTK.', 'After 31 years at-large, detectives in Wichita, Kansas hone in on the serial killer known as BTK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psVRNJ46jPn5ub5RwXDC35nf6aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26301'),
  ('300309047777320049', 'The Hunt for the Unicorn Killer', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'William A. Graham, Ralf D. Bode', 'Bruce Graham', 'Kevin Anderson, Tom Skerritt, Naomi Watts, Kellie Overbey, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Kirby Morrow, Angela Vint, Brian Kerwin', null, 'An account of early 1970s social activist Ira Einhorn, who allegedly murdered his girlfriend and then fled the country.', 'An account of early 1970s social activist Ira Einhorn, who allegedly murdered his girlfriend and then fled the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Qz4Gz2WxymvvFWQYwkX88SSPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125990'),
  ('164693930644769412', 'The Hunted', 1948, 'Drama, Crime', 'Harry Neumann, Jack Bernhard, Frank Fox', 'Steve Fisher', 'Preston Foster, Belita, Pierre Watkin, Edna Holland, Russell Hicks, Frank Ferguson, Joseph Crehan, Larry J. Blake', 'NR', 'A cop investigating a jewel robbery finds that all trails lead to his girlfriend - but she claims she''s being framed.', 'A cop investigating a jewel robbery finds that all trails lead to his girlfriend - but she claims she''s being framed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmHXINKNvjpcqHmu7IkcR2IqSB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47305'),
  ('917669062097903843', 'The Hunted', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'J.F. Lawton, Buddy Joe Hooker, Cellin Gluck', 'J.F. Lawton', 'Christopher Lambert, John Lone, Yoshio Harada, Yoko Shimada, Tak Kubota, Mari Natsuki, James Saito, Joan Chen', 'R', 'Paul Racine, a high-powered American business executive in Japan, is catapulted into a maze of danger and intrigue after he and his sexy companion are the targets of assassins hired by the ruthless Kinjo. To survive, Racine must join forces with a powerful samurai and together they will fight the force of evil in an awesome battle rooted in centuries of brutal conflict.', 'Paul Racine, a high-powered American business executive in Japan, is catapulted into a maze of danger and intrigue after he and his sexy companion are the targets of assassins hired by the ruthless Kinjo. To survive, Racine must join forces with a powerful samurai and together they will fight the force of evil in an awesome battle rooted in centuries of brutal conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luCVuKiRBcQjr9MuY9mRCTehjpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32631'),
  ('333247987857043675', 'The Hunted', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'William Friedkin, Caleb Deschanel, J. Michael Haynie', 'David Griffiths, Peter Griffiths, Art Monterastelli', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Benicio del Toro, Connie Nielsen, Leslie Stefanson, John Finn, José Zúñiga, Ron Canada, Mark Pellegrino', 'R', 'In the wilderness of British Columbia, two hunters are tracked and viciously murdered by Aaron Hallam. A former Special Operations instructor is approached and asked to apprehend Hallam—his former student—who has ''gone rogue'' after suffering severe battle stress from his time in Kosovo.', 'In the wilderness of British Columbia, two hunters are tracked and viciously murdered by Aaron Hallam. A former Special Operations instructor is approached and asked to apprehend Hallam—his former student—who has ''gone rogue'' after suffering severe battle stress from his time in Kosovo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvdBPe2XSKm3cGyTKFgbquC2jCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10632'),
  ('129818892022278116', 'The Hunted', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Louis Lagayette, Amandine Klee', 'Jérôme Genevray, Louis Lagayette', 'Lily Banda, Alec Newman, Raj Bajaj, Vassilis Koukalani, Kostis Kallivretakis, Joshua Edoze, Mylène Jampanoï, Marlene Kaminsky', 'R', 'After their boat capsizes in the Mediterranean Sea, a group of refugees are rescued by rich Europeans who offer them shelter on an idyllic island. But the miracle soon becomes a nightmare when the saviors turn into ruthless manhunters.', 'After their boat capsizes in the Mediterranean Sea, a group of refugees are rescued by rich Europeans who offer them shelter on an idyllic island. But the miracle soon becomes a nightmare when the saviors turn into ruthless manhunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgx7I0JfmHbGcbveNk4EK3jFuMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026819'),
  ('784725868925984835', 'The Hunter', 1980, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Buzz Kulik, Fred J. Koenekamp, Richard Learman', 'Peter Hyams, Ted Leighton', 'Steve McQueen, Eli Wallach, Kathryn Harrold, LeVar Burton, Ben Johnson, Richard Venture, Tracey Walter, Thomas Rosales Jr.', 'PG', 'During his long career, bounty hunter Ralph "Papa" Thorson has caught over 5,000 criminals. Now, while he is working on apprehending fugitives in Illinois, Texas and Nebraska, he himself is being hunted by a psychotic killer.', 'During his long career, bounty hunter Ralph "Papa" Thorson has caught over 5,000 criminals. Now, while he is working on apprehending fugitives in Illinois, Texas and Nebraska, he himself is being hunted by a psychotic killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3bTmSw62c0yP3oxbVICeho4PCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5922'),
  ('652336890527318815', 'The Hunter', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Adventure', 'Daniel Nettheim, Kevin Scott, Robert Humphreys', 'Alice Addison', 'Willem Dafoe, Frances O''Connor, Sam Neill, Jacek Koman, Callan Mulvey, Dan Wyllie, Sullivan Stapleton, Morgan Davies', 'R', 'Martin, a mercenary, is sent from Europe by an anonymous biotech company to the Tasmanian wilderness on a hunt for the last Tasmanian tiger.', 'Martin, a mercenary, is sent from Europe by an anonymous biotech company to the Tasmanian wilderness on a hunt for the last Tasmanian tiger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KgFYNh3GE36FrXjo9udZbnV1z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70954'),
  ('38316818968705900', 'The Hunter''s Prayer', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Darrin Prescott, Jonathan Mostow, Zsuzsa Kismarty-Lechner', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Sam Worthington, Odeya Rush, Amy Landecker, Dean S. Jagger, Verónica Echegui, Martin Compston, Katia Bokor, Matt Townsend', 'R', 'An assassin forges an unlikely partnership with one of his targets: a woman seeking revenge for the murder of her family.', 'An assassin forges an unlikely partnership with one of his targets: a woman seeking revenge for the murder of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5MEdS2Q1HpZyqaRZ54VrzHfq4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302150'),
  ('960601132441880028', 'The Hunters', 1958, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Dick Powell, Charles G. Clarke, Ad Schaumer', 'Wendell Mayes', 'Robert Mitchum, Robert Wagner, Richard Egan, May Britt, Lee Philips, John Gabriel, Stacy Harris, Victor Sen Yung', 'NR', 'With its electrifying flight sequences and high-powered cast, The Hunters is a mesmerizing film based on the best-selling novel by veteran fighter pilot James Salter. Set during the height of the Korean War, the story centers on Major Cleve Saville (Robert Mitchum), a master of the newly operational F-86 Sabre fighter jets. But adept as he is at flying, Saville¹s personal life takes a nosedive when he falls in love with his wingman¹s (Lee Philips) beautiful wife (May Britt). To make matters worse, Saville must cope with a loud-mouthed rookie (Robert Wagner) in a daring rescue mission that threatens all their lives in this well-crafted war drama.', 'With its electrifying flight sequences and high-powered cast, The Hunters is a mesmerizing film based on the best-selling novel by veteran fighter pilot James Salter. Set during the height of the Korean War, the story centers on Major Cleve Saville (Robert Mitchum), a master of the newly operational F-86 Sabre fighter jets. But adept as he is at flying, Saville¹s personal life takes a nosedive when he falls in love with his wingman¹s (Lee Philips) beautiful wife (May Britt). To make matters worse, Saville must cope with a loud-mouthed rookie (Robert Wagner) in a daring rescue mission that threatens all their lives in this well-crafted war drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKywOWIo1GVj7XjoxFWegiOkoXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45520'),
  ('828570616408261583', 'The Hunters', 1977, 'Drama, History', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Nicholas Triandafyllidis, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Stratis Karras, Theo Angelopoulos', 'Mairi Hronopoulou, Eva Kotamanidou, Betty Valassi, Aliki Georgouli, Vangelis Kazan, Giorgos Danis, Ilias Stamatiou, Stratos Pahis', null, 'During a hunting party on New Year''s Eve 1976, five representatives of the bourgeoisie encounter with their companion the body of a partisan from the Civil War of the late forties. What they are most confused about is the fact that the corpse that lies at their feet is still bleeding…', 'During a hunting party on New Year''s Eve 1976, five representatives of the bourgeoisie encounter with their companion the body of a partisan from the Civil War of the late forties. What they are most confused about is the fact that the corpse that lies at their feet is still bleeding…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7AUf7Ffi2PCw7hwz40i69p1yfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114570'),
  ('859651289984947722', 'The Hunters', 1996, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Kjell Lagerroos, Ulf Hansson', 'Kjell Sundvall, Björn Carlström', 'Rolf Lassgård, Lennart Jähkel, Jarmo Mäkinen, Tomas Norström, Thomas Hedengran, Göran Forsmark, Rolf Degerlund, Editha Domingo', null, 'A policeman from Stockholm come to Norrbotten in Sweden, to join his brother, now when their father is dead. While there he starts to work on a long-running case where reindeers have been poached and soon discovers that his brother is involved...', 'A policeman from Stockholm come to Norrbotten in Sweden, to join his brother, now when their father is dead. While there he starts to work on a long-running case where reindeers have been poached and soon discovers that his brother is involved...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ez8MDtedHPGWtkHFOKOXAJ8ns5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16003'),
  ('364966128917110614', 'The Hunters', 2013, 'Adventure', 'Nisha Ganatra, C. Kim Miles', 'Matthew Huffman, Jeff Schechter', 'Robbie Amell, Keenan Tracey, Michelle Forbes, Victor Garber, Alexa PenaVega, Kira Clavell, Darryl Quon, Eric Breker', 'PG', 'Imagine if all mythical artifacts, from Jason''s Golden Fleece to Cinderella''s glass slippers, were real. Well, they are -- and for centuries, a secret society called the Hunters has been sworn to protect them from an evil force called the Krugen.', 'Imagine if all mythical artifacts, from Jason''s Golden Fleece to Cinderella''s glass slippers, were real. Well, they are -- and for centuries, a secret society called the Hunters has been sworn to protect them from an evil force called the Krugen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubR6x50z4aLflgzJcw7X7HflKKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231474'),
