  ('229251831030142481', 'The Hunting Ground', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick, Thaddeus Wadleigh, Aaron Kopp', null, 'Andrea Pino, Annie Clark, Claire Potter, Melinda Manning, Claire Potter, Kimberly Theidon, Kamilah Willingham, Caroline Heldman', null, 'A startling expose of rape crimes on US campuses, their institutional cover-ups, and the devastating toll they take on students and their families. The film follows the lives of several undergraduate assault survivors as they attempt to pursue—despite incredible push back, harassment and traumatic aftermath—both their education and justice.', 'A startling expose of rape crimes on US campuses, their institutional cover-ups, and the devastating toll they take on students and their families. The film follows the lives of several undergraduate assault survivors as they attempt to pursue—despite incredible push back, harassment and traumatic aftermath—both their education and justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1BsAt0pbBKhZvcs0Gjh2ZHy1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319091'),
