  ('994565444725586813', 'The Huntsman: Winter''s War', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Steve Street, Simon Crane, Frank Walsh', 'Craig Mazin, Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Chris Hemsworth, Charlize Theron, Emily Blunt, Jessica Chastain, Nick Frost, Sam Claflin, Rob Brydon, Sheridan Smith', 'PG-13', 'As two evil sisters prepare to conquer the land, two renegades—Eric the Huntsman, who aided Snow White in defeating Ravenna in Snowwhite and the Huntsman, and his forbidden lover, Sara—set out to stop them.', 'As two evil sisters prepare to conquer the land, two renegades—Eric the Huntsman, who aided Snow White in defeating Ravenna in Snowwhite and the Huntsman, and his forbidden lover, Sara—set out to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekHPrneEoa1EoDclWdillOKznqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290595'),
  ('596362005259085135', 'The Hurdy-Gurdy', 1955, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stelios Zografakis, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Mimis Fotopoulos, Vasilis Avlonitis, Jenny Karezi, Hristos Tsaganeas, Alekos Alexandrakis, Dimitris Voudouris, Nikos Fermas, Niki Linardou', null, 'Two poor portable barrel piano players ramble through Greek countryside and play in fairs. They meet by chance with a rich runaway girl whose father offers a large reward to her finders.They have to choose between getting the reward or helping the girl with her renegade love affair.', 'Two poor portable barrel piano players ramble through Greek countryside and play in fairs. They meet by chance with a rich runaway girl whose father offers a large reward to her finders.They have to choose between getting the reward or helping the girl with her renegade love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aVO1aW7mEhZEFoprxW82FAOnSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301491'),
  ('31579385153466531', 'The Hurricane', 1937, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'John Ford, Alexander Golitzen, Bert Glennon', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Jon Hall, Dorothy Lamour, Raymond Massey, Mary Astor, C. Aubrey Smith, Thomas Mitchell, Jerome Cowan, Al Kikume', 'NR', 'A Polynesian sailor is separated from his wife when he''s unjustly imprisoned for defending himself against a colonial bully. Members of the community petition the governor for clemency but all pretense of law and order are soon shattered by an incoming tropical storm.', 'A Polynesian sailor is separated from his wife when he''s unjustly imprisoned for defending himself against a colonial bully. Members of the community petition the governor for clemency but all pretense of law and order are soon shattered by an incoming tropical storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0glopWioudJW9kzIxZpSbbQCem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77250'),
  ('818881264266163329', 'The Hurricane', 1999, 'Drama', 'Norman Jewison, Roger Deakins', 'Dan Gordon, Armyan Bernstein', 'Denzel Washington, Vicellous Shannon, Deborah Kara Unger, Liev Schreiber, John Hannah, Dan Hedaya, Debbi Morgan, Clancy Brown', 'R', 'The story of Rubin "Hurricane" Carter, a boxer wrongly imprisoned for murder, and the people who aided in his fight to prove his innocence.', 'The story of Rubin "Hurricane" Carter, a boxer wrongly imprisoned for murder, and the people who aided in his fight to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10400'),
  ('1083163060939103185', 'The Hurricane Express', 1932, 'Adventure, Mystery, Crime, Action', 'J.P. McGowan, Armand Schaefer, Carl Wester', 'J.P. McGowan, Harold Tarshis, George Morgan', 'John Wayne, Tully Marshall, Conway Tearle, Shirley Grey, Edmund Breese, Lloyd Whitlock, Al Bridge, Matthew Betz', 'NR', 'The Wrecker wrecks trains on the L & R Railroad. One of his victims is Larry Baker''s father. Baker wants to find the evildoer, among a host of suspects, but it will be difficult since the Wrecker can disguise himself to look like almost anyone', 'The Wrecker wrecks trains on the L & R Railroad. One of his victims is Larry Baker''s father. Baker wants to find the evildoer, among a host of suspects, but it will be difficult since the Wrecker can disguise himself to look like almost anyone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87gqfLkfEVxUgvbf9nKhn6DfxQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38662'),
