  ('210432868820373394', 'The Hyperboloid of Engineer Garin', 1965, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Aleksandr Gintsburg, Aleksandr Rybin, D. Zotov', 'Iosif Manevich, Aleksandr Gintsburg', 'Evgeniy Evstigneev, Vsevolod Safonov, Mikhail Astangov, Natalya Klimova, Vladimir Druzhnikov, Mikhail Kuznetsov, Yuriy Sarantsev, Pavel Shpringfeld', null, 'A Russian engineer Petr Garin possesses a unique beam-shooting weapon that can destroy any target. His goal is to achieve world domination with the help of this weapon. Vasily Shelga is out to stop him and also to prevent others getting possession of this weapon.', 'A Russian engineer Petr Garin possesses a unique beam-shooting weapon that can destroy any target. His goal is to achieve world domination with the help of this weapon. Vasily Shelga is out to stop him and also to prevent others getting possession of this weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xFH5438AHXAg4nuvHw9016CjCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74695'),
  ('615105949968740493', 'The Hyperions', 2022, 'Action', 'Jon McDonald', 'Jon McDonald', 'Cary Elwes, Penelope Mitchell, Elaine Tan, Alphonso McAuley, Tanner Buchanan, Sal Lopez, Andrew Patrick Ralston, Annie Korzen', 'R', 'In 1960, Professor Ruckus Mandulbaum invented the Titan badge - a device that enables humans to have a particular super power. He took in three down-on-their-luck youths, creating an unusual family of superheroes and they quickly rose to fame and prestige. Over time, however, the commercial family fractured and the Professor replaced the team with a new set of super hero teens. Cut to 1979, when two of the original superheroes are all grown up and wanting their Titan badges back, even if it means robbing the Professor''s museum and taking a few hostages accidentally.', 'In 1960, Professor Ruckus Mandulbaum invented the Titan badge - a device that enables humans to have a particular super power. He took in three down-on-their-luck youths, creating an unusual family of superheroes and they quickly rose to fame and prestige. Over time, however, the commercial family fractured and the Professor replaced the team with a new set of super hero teens. Cut to 1979, when two of the original superheroes are all grown up and wanting their Titan badges back, even if it means robbing the Professor''s museum and taking a few hostages accidentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45ySjyM2aB0RXSTjGKu06VOjMJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568271'),
  ('863042874626157669', 'The Hypnosis', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Choi Jae-hoon', 'Choi Jae-hoon', 'David Lee, Shin Jee-won, Kim Do-hoon, Nam Min-woo, Kim Nam-woo, Son Byung-ho, Seo Yi-sook, Moon Ho-jin', null, 'Jin-ho lost his parents in an accident when he was a child, he receives hypnosis to treat his trauma related to the accident. Do-hyun, a college student gets interested in Jin-ho''s hypnosis and he tries doing it too.', 'Jin-ho lost his parents in an accident when he was a child, he receives hypnosis to treat his trauma related to the accident. Do-hyun, a college student gets interested in Jin-ho''s hypnosis and he tries doing it too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjxbafEDcxt3qwqsWYbZdtOJ7M2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799668'),
  ('910725852026541728', 'The Hypnosis', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ernst De Geer, Jonathan Bjerstedt', 'Ernst De Geer, Mads Stegger', 'Asta Kamma August, Herbert Nordrum, Andrea Edwards, David Fukamachi Regnfors, Moa Nilsson, Simon Rajala, Aviva Wrede, Alexandra Zetterberg', null, 'André and Vera are a young entrepreneurial couple. They get the opportunity to pitch their female health app at a prestigious competition. Before going there, Vera tries hypnotherapy to quit smoking. From this point, her attitude changes and André starts to behave unexpectedly.', 'André and Vera are a young entrepreneurial couple. They get the opportunity to pitch their female health app at a prestigious competition. Before going there, Vera tries hypnotherapy to quit smoking. From this point, her attitude changes and André starts to behave unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e0lbHdHd33FTjsutp9p2oyazLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005972'),
  ('733877093499554422', 'The Hypnotic Eye', 1960, 'Horror', 'George Blair, Ray Gosnell Jr.', 'William Read Woodfield, Gitta Woodfield', 'Jacques Bergerac, Merry Anders, Marcia Henderson, Allison Hayes, Joe Patridge, Fred Demara, Lawrence Lipton, Eric Nord', null, 'A mysterious hypnotist is suspected by the police of being responsible for a wave of young, attractive women committing various forms of self-mutilation.', 'A mysterious hypnotist is suspected by the police of being responsible for a wave of young, attractive women committing various forms of self-mutilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLiWVA0w8uxqA9sPK1NROmJWmz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43045'),
  ('181220987297992451', 'The Hypnotist', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lasse Hallström, Mattias Montero', 'Paolo Vacirca', 'Tobias Zilliacus, Mikael Persbrandt, Lena Olin, Helena af Sandeberg, Jonatan Bökman, Oscar Pettersson, Eva Melander, Anna Azcárate', 'R', 'After a young woman and her parents are murdered by a killer determined to wipe out the entire family, Detective Inspector Joona Linna works with a psychiatrist to hypnotize the son who narrowly escaped death in order to find the one surviving daughter before the murderer does.', 'After a young woman and her parents are murdered by a killer determined to wipe out the entire family, Detective Inspector Joona Linna works with a psychiatrist to hypnotize the son who narrowly escaped death in order to find the one surviving daughter before the murderer does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLVoHZ46TAdHgKVcb1ns0YkQ6KH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133458'),
  ('102745304204897350', 'The Hypo-Chondri-Cat', 1950, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Those crazy mice Hubie &amp; Bertie are at it again with Claude. This time the mice see that Claude is seriously ill, so they give him an operation.', 'Those crazy mice Hubie &amp; Bertie are at it again with Claude. This time the mice see that Claude is seriously ill, so they give him an operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pKYykGG2j8tMinpfETAwGq6arc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100374'),
  ('756993693742073407', 'The Hypocrites', 2019, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ezequiel Salinas, Santiago Sgarlatta, Carlos Ignacio Trioni', 'Santiago Sgarlatta, Carlos Ignacio Trioni', 'Santiago Zapata, Ramiro Mendez Roy, Camila Murias, Eva Bianco, Pablo Limarzi, Marcelo Arbach, Eduardo Rivetto, Leandro Naranjo', null, 'The hypocrites tells the story of Nicolás, a young cameraman who works filming social events, but doesn’t feel fulfilled with his profession. In the middle of a high profile wedding, he accidentally records a compromising situation between the bride, Martina, and her brother, Esteban. Realising about what is in the tape, he sees the opportunity of leaving his tedious life behind through blackmailing the people involved. However, he does not know this secret could endanger his own life.', 'The hypocrites tells the story of Nicolás, a young cameraman who works filming social events, but doesn’t feel fulfilled with his profession. In the middle of a high profile wedding, he accidentally records a compromising situation between the bride, Martina, and her brother, Esteban. Realising about what is in the tape, he sees the opportunity of leaving his tedious life behind through blackmailing the people involved. However, he does not know this secret could endanger his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUELlV4u3m50eN5pRnhzqLjEvFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600301'),
  ('1120338137457983413', 'The Hypothesis of the Stolen Painting', 1978, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Raúl Ruiz, Sacha Vierny', 'Raúl Ruiz, Pierre Klossowski', 'Jean Rougeul, Gabriel Gascon, Raymond Pierson, Jean Reno, Chantal Paley, Jean Raynaud, Daniel Grimm, Isidro Romero', null, 'Two narrators, one seen and one unseen, discuss possible connections between a series of paintings. The on-screen narrator walks through three-dimensional reproductions of each painting, featuring real people, sometimes moving, in an effort to explain the series'' significance.', 'Two narrators, one seen and one unseen, discuss possible connections between a series of paintings. The on-screen narrator walks through three-dimensional reproductions of each painting, featuring real people, sometimes moving, in an effort to explain the series'' significance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PTfpEp96NccwdaFQkiq0wVkFQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88034'),
  ('543974526691810932', 'The I Inside', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Roland Suso Richter, Martin Langer, Fraser Fennell-Ball', 'Michael Cooney, Timothy Scott Bogart', 'Ryan Phillippe, Sarah Polley, Piper Perabo, Robert Sean Leonard, Stephen Rea, Rakie Ayola, Paul John Borde, Peter Egan', null, 'When Simon awakens in the hospital after surviving a near-fatal accident, amnesia has erased the last two years from his memory. He learns that his brother was killed, he has married a woman he doesn''t remember and he''s haunted by strange visions of the woman he loved.', 'When Simon awakens in the hospital after surviving a near-fatal accident, amnesia has erased the last two years from his memory. He learns that his brother was killed, he has married a woman he doesn''t remember and he''s haunted by strange visions of the woman he loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGPMhj7Pp2bxubm7JsCyTB3Tg6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11588'),
  ('571121804986728770', 'The Ice Age Adventures of Buck Wild', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'John C. Donkin, Meruan Salim, Marshall Fels Elliott', 'Ray DeLaurentis, William Schifrin, Jim Hecht', 'Simon Pegg, Vincent Tong, Aaron Harris, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Justina Machado, Sean Kenin, Dominique Jennings, Jake Green', 'PG', 'The fearless one-eyed weasel Buck teams up with mischievous possum brothers Crash & Eddie as they head off on a new adventure into Buck''s home: The Dinosaur World.', 'The fearless one-eyed weasel Buck teams up with mischievous possum brothers Crash & Eddie as they head off on a new adventure into Buck''s home: The Dinosaur World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzXFM4FKDG7l1ufrAkwQYv2xvnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774825'),
  ('1088491306237758927', 'The Ice Cream Truck', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Megan Freels Johnston, Stephen Tringali', 'Megan Freels Johnston', 'Deanna Russo, Emil Johnsen, John Redlinger, Sam Schweikert, Hilary Barraford, Bailey Anne Borders, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Dan Sutter', 'NR', 'Mary moves back to her suburban hometown to find that the suburbs are scarier in more ways than she ever remembered.', 'Mary moves back to her suburban hometown to find that the suburbs are scarier in more ways than she ever remembered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOQwPf4OyhM5l5RRQ8GLxNNmS14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434389'),
  ('633192776469857479', 'The Ice Demon', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ivan Kapitonov, Evgeny Musin', 'Ivan Kapitonov, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Nataliya Dubovaya', 'Olga Lomonosova, Alina Babak, Alexandra Cherkasova, Aleksey Rozin, Gleb Kalyuzhny, Igor Khripunov, Valeriya Volodko, Anastasiya Gribova', 'NR', 'Ksyusha barely remembers her father: he went missing when she was a child. Incredibly, he is showing signs of life, despite being in a coma. The man is returned home in this condition. His wife has now remarried. The family is thrown into disarray by the return of the former master of the house – terrifying things are happening in the house, and Ksyusha’s mom starts acting weird… Ksyusha begins to suspect that something supernatural, icy, and lifeless has come home with her father. And now Ksyusha and her stepfather are about to find themselves protecting their family from a demon.', 'Ksyusha barely remembers her father: he went missing when she was a child. Incredibly, he is showing signs of life, despite being in a coma. The man is returned home in this condition. His wife has now remarried. The family is thrown into disarray by the return of the former master of the house – terrifying things are happening in the house, and Ksyusha’s mom starts acting weird… Ksyusha begins to suspect that something supernatural, icy, and lifeless has come home with her father. And now Ksyusha and her stepfather are about to find themselves protecting their family from a demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmcJtAuEUvGhlp9253h6PBFBnyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598252'),
  ('482469665680054885', 'The Ice Follies of 1939', 1939, 'Music, Drama', 'Reinhold Schünzel, Edward Woehler, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Florence Ryerson, Leonard Praskins, Edgar Allan Woolf', 'Joan Crawford, James Stewart, Lew Ayres, Lewis Stone, Bess Ehrhardt, Roy Shipstad, Eddie Shipstad, Oscar Johnson', null, 'Mary and Larry are are a modestly successful skating team. Shortly after their marriage, Mary gets a picture contract, while Larry is sitting at home, out of work.', 'Mary and Larry are are a modestly successful skating team. Shortly after their marriage, Mary gets a picture contract, while Larry is sitting at home, out of work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI9Utvd7Kh34KJsQE0gm1KqBe1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178337'),
  ('364657044768190956', 'The Ice Forest', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Claudio Noce, Michele D''Attanasio, Francesca Coticoni', 'Claudio Noce, Elisa Amoruso, Francesca Manieri', 'Emir Kusturica, Kseniya Rappoport, Domenico Diele, Adriano Giannini, Giovanni Vettorazzo, Maria Roveran, Rinat Khismatouline, Danilo Panzeri', null, 'In the harsh snowy landscape of the Italian Alps, a young technician arrives to repair an electric power plant of a village plagued by blackouts. There, he encounters a strange disappearance.', 'In the harsh snowy landscape of the Italian Alps, a young technician arrives to repair an electric power plant of a village plagued by blackouts. There, he encounters a strange disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRDGUTmiwHTXHhHFCiYcHXLCeHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298864'),
  ('24462620935304324', 'The Ice Harvest', 2005, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Harold Ramis, Alar Kivilo', 'Richard Russo, Robert Benton', 'John Cusack, Billy Bob Thornton, Connie Nielsen, Randy Quaid, Oliver Platt, Mike Starr, Ned Bellamy, T.J. Jagodowski', 'R', 'A shady lawyer attempts a Christmas Eve crime, hoping to swindle the local mob out of some money. But his partner, a strip club owner, might have different plans for the cash.', 'A shady lawyer attempts a Christmas Eve crime, hoping to swindle the local mob out of some money. But his partner, a strip club owner, might have different plans for the cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8N2X2u6nPoPEwRLIZbKacJw1xrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9005'),
  ('340104183158485798', 'The Ice House', 1978, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Derek Lister', 'John Bowen', 'John Stride, Elizabeth Romilly, Geoffrey Burridge, David Beames, Gladys Spencer, Eirene Beck, Sam Avent', null, 'After his wife leaves him, Paul seeks solace at a sophisticated health spa run by a pair of sinister siblings. Strangely attracted by the scent of a vine that grows on the old ice house in the spa''s grounds, Paul is drawn ever deeper into a horrifying mystery.', 'After his wife leaves him, Paul seeks solace at a sophisticated health spa run by a pair of sinister siblings. Strangely attracted by the scent of a vine that grows on the old ice house in the spa''s grounds, Paul is drawn ever deeper into a horrifying mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmdP3DD0LpLDV9wEpNLerx1jcub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144402'),
  ('1082364055741617313', 'The Ice Pirates', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Stewart Raffill, Bill Carroll', 'Stanford Sherman, Stewart Raffill', 'Robert Urich, Mary Crosby, Michael D. Roberts, Anjelica Huston, John Matuszak, Ron Perlman, John Carradine, Natalie Core', 'PG', 'In the not too distant future, where by far the most precious commodity in the galaxy is water. The last surviving water planet was somehow removed to the unreachable centre of the galaxy at the end of the galactic trade wars. The galaxy is ruled by an evil emperor presiding over a trade oligarchy that controls all mining and sale of ice from asteroids and comets.', 'In the not too distant future, where by far the most precious commodity in the galaxy is water. The last surviving water planet was somehow removed to the unreachable centre of the galaxy at the end of the galactic trade wars. The galaxy is ruled by an evil emperor presiding over a trade oligarchy that controls all mining and sale of ice from asteroids and comets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv2iZbQYWwKcWOUWVFxOhcchKZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10179'),
  ('422808904209070700', 'The Ice Road', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tom Stern, Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Liam Neeson, Amber Midthunder, Marcus Thomas, Holt McCallany, Laurence Fishburne, Matt McCoy, Martin Sensmeier, Matt Salinger', 'PG-13', 'After a remote diamond mine collapses in far northern Canada, an ice road driver must lead an impossible rescue mission over a frozen ocean to save the trapped miners.', 'After a remote diamond mine collapses in far northern Canada, an ice road driver must lead an impossible rescue mission over a frozen ocean to save the trapped miners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl1dlX9sKYpiKujq80Yxve7l4yg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646207'),
  ('298625311176789876', 'The Ice Storm', 1997, 'Drama', 'Ang Lee, Stephen Wertimer, Lisa M. Rowe', 'James Schamus', 'Kevin Kline, Joan Allen, Sigourney Weaver, Jamey Sheridan, Christina Ricci, Tobey Maguire, Elijah Wood, Adam Hann-Byrd', 'R', 'In the weekend after thanksgiving 1973 the Hood family is skidding out of control. Then an ice storm hits, the worst in a century.', 'In the weekend after thanksgiving 1973 the Hood family is skidding out of control. Then an ice storm hits, the worst in a century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a6uLta7K8Dzojps4RoJAPHD0km.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68924'),
  ('284868541081170226', 'The Ice Tower', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović, Arthur Dezanneau, Ethan Renault', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović, Geoff Cox', 'Marion Cotillard, Clara Pacini, August Diehl, Marine Gesbert, Lila-Rose Gilberti, Gaspar Noé, Dounia Sichov, Valentina Vezzoso', 'NR', 'Jeanne, a 15-year-old orphan, witnesses the shoot for a film adaptation of the fairy tale The Snow Queen, and she becomes fascinated by its star, Cristina, an actress who is just as mysterious and alluring as the Queen she is playing.', 'Jeanne, a 15-year-old orphan, witnesses the shoot for a film adaptation of the fairy tale The Snow Queen, and she becomes fascinated by its star, Cristina, an actress who is just as mysterious and alluring as the Queen she is playing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b68s4eH45pRE8giLVM5tFUgVDcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143440'),
  ('186456784666419754', 'The Icebreaker', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Nikolay Khomeriki, Fedor Lyass', 'Aleksey Onishchenko, Andrey Zolotarev', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Sergey Puskepalis, Anna Mikhalkova, Olga Smirnova, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Aleksandr Pal, Vitaliy Khaev, Dmitriy Podnozov', null, 'The story is based on the real events of 1985. The team of a Russian polar icebreaker “Mikhail Gromov” discovered a giant iceberg. The ship came into collision while attempting to take cover from the weather and is forced to drift with ice along the Amundsen Sea coast. The crew of “Gromov” spent 133 days of polar night trying to find a way out of their icy trap. They have no room for mistakes; one wrong move and the vessel is crushed by ice.', 'The story is based on the real events of 1985. The team of a Russian polar icebreaker “Mikhail Gromov” discovered a giant iceberg. The ship came into collision while attempting to take cover from the weather and is forced to drift with ice along the Amundsen Sea coast. The crew of “Gromov” spent 133 days of polar night trying to find a way out of their icy trap. They have no room for mistakes; one wrong move and the vessel is crushed by ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvVjhgkuGXivxdyYK8nTAfpROLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393277'),
  ('613841801521919677', 'The Iceman', 2012, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ariel Vromen, Bobby Bukowski', 'Jim Thebaut', 'Michael Shannon, Winona Ryder, Ray Liotta, Chris Evans, David Schwimmer, James Franco, Stephen Dorff, Robert Davi', 'R', 'The true story of Richard Kuklinski, the notorious contract killer and family man.', 'The true story of Richard Kuklinski, the notorious contract killer and family man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56KPE9tPYh2WBdnUMq9EIOwEXGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68812'),
  ('1060680827186502641', 'The Iceman and the Psychiatrist', 2004, 'Documentary, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Arthur Ginsberg, Mead Hunt', null, 'Richard Kuklinski, Park Dietz', null, 'For the third time, HBO cameras go inside Trenton State Maximum Security Prison--and inside the mind of one of the most prolific killers in U.S. history--in this gripping documentary. Mafia hit man Richard Kuklinski freely admits to killing more than 100 people, but in this special, he speaks with top psychiatrist Dr. Park Dietz in an effort to face the truth about his condition. Filled with more never-before-revealed confessions, it''s the most chillingly candid Iceman special yet as it combines often-confrontational interview footage between Kuklinski and Dietz with photos, crime reenactments and home movies that add new layers to this evolving and fascinating story.', 'For the third time, HBO cameras go inside Trenton State Maximum Security Prison--and inside the mind of one of the most prolific killers in U.S. history--in this gripping documentary. Mafia hit man Richard Kuklinski freely admits to killing more than 100 people, but in this special, he speaks with top psychiatrist Dr. Park Dietz in an effort to face the truth about his condition. Filled with more never-before-revealed confessions, it''s the most chillingly candid Iceman special yet as it combines often-confrontational interview footage between Kuklinski and Dietz with photos, crime reenactments and home movies that add new layers to this evolving and fascinating story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11b2ebyJ951PSTyGh2k8uqj1sVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278388'),
  ('849668970100409933', 'The Iceman Cometh', 1973, 'Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Ralph Woolsey', 'Thomas Quinn Curtiss', 'Lee Marvin, Fredric March, Robert Ryan, Jeff Bridges, Bradford Dillman, Sorrell Booke, Hildy Brooks, Juno Dawson', 'PG', 'Set in 1912, inside a dive bar named The Last Chance Saloon, its destitute patrons eagerly await the arrival of Hickey, who arrives annually and props everyone up with free drinks and spirited stories of his travels. However, when Hickey does show up this year, it is with a message of temperance and an exhortation to give up hopeless dreams and face reality.', 'Set in 1912, inside a dive bar named The Last Chance Saloon, its destitute patrons eagerly await the arrival of Hickey, who arrives annually and props everyone up with free drinks and spirited stories of his travels. However, when Hickey does show up this year, it is with a message of temperance and an exhortation to give up hopeless dreams and face reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLfwOPSoSTy9iRZm9Sxk6kEDuus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41461'),
  ('531131560703521950', 'The Iceman Cometh', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Clarence Ford, Poon Hang-Sang, Cheng Wing-Chiu', 'Johnny Mak Tong-Hung, Stephen Shiu Yeuk-Yuen', 'Yuen Biao, Yuen Wah, Maggie Cheung, Lam Chung, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung, Anthony Wong Yiu-Ming, Eva Lai, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', null, 'When 16th-century Ming guard Fong Sau-Ching sets out to capture vicious rapist Fung San, both men end up falling into a glacier to be frozen in time. Thawed out by scientists over 300 years later, the confused guard must learn to cope with the modern world and continue in his quest to vanquish his opponent.', 'When 16th-century Ming guard Fong Sau-Ching sets out to capture vicious rapist Fung San, both men end up falling into a glacier to be frozen in time. Thawed out by scientists over 300 years later, the confused guard must learn to cope with the modern world and continue in his quest to vanquish his opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bKp7GuqjQEEzET8MX33ERWEoLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45454'),
  ('543814498374984621', 'The Iceman Confesses: Secrets of a Mafia Hitman', 2001, 'Documentary, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Arthur Ginsberg', null, 'Richard Kuklinski, Mark Musto, Rocco Fazzolari, Rich Lounello', 'NR', 'Richard Kuklinski was a devoted husband, a loving father...and a ruthless killer. A decade after HBO last visited him in prison, the convicted murderer, who freely admits having whacked more than 100 people in cold blood, takes viewers back inside his cold, calculating mind. In this follow-up to America Undercover''s 1992 film The Iceman Tapes: Conversations with a Killer, Kuklinski provides all-new insights about his exploits as one of the Mafia''s most notorious assassins...and reveals some shocking confessions for a number of previously unsolved murders.', 'Richard Kuklinski was a devoted husband, a loving father...and a ruthless killer. A decade after HBO last visited him in prison, the convicted murderer, who freely admits having whacked more than 100 people in cold blood, takes viewers back inside his cold, calculating mind. In this follow-up to America Undercover''s 1992 film The Iceman Tapes: Conversations with a Killer, Kuklinski provides all-new insights about his exploits as one of the Mafia''s most notorious assassins...and reveals some shocking confessions for a number of previously unsolved murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4d36q3fUSJE1TmeciZ0qnjj93eB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216043'),
  ('1133625820136280844', 'The Iceman Ducketh', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Phil Monroe, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'When Daffy hears that the Klondike trading post is paying good money for furs, Bugs'' pelt becomes endangered.', 'When Daffy hears that the Klondike trading post is paying good money for furs, Bugs'' pelt becomes endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NBAFHI15eXhHSyhrewrOPSvWUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234425'),
  ('747365063455717893', 'The Iceman Tapes: Conversations with a Killer', 1992, 'Documentary, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Tom Spain, Arthur Ginsberg', 'Richard Kuklinski', 'Richard Kuklinski, Michael Baden, Robert J. Carroll, Lee Grant, Chuck Scarborough, Barbara Kuklinski', null, 'Richard Kuklinski was a devoted husband, loving father--and ruthless killer of over 100 people. You''ll meet him in this powerful documentary that features one of the most vivid and disturbing interviews ever recorded--taped behind the walls of the prison where Kuklinski is serving two consecutive life sentences for multiple homicide.', 'Richard Kuklinski was a devoted husband, loving father--and ruthless killer of over 100 people. You''ll meet him in this powerful documentary that features one of the most vivid and disturbing interviews ever recorded--taped behind the walls of the prison where Kuklinski is serving two consecutive life sentences for multiple homicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9vrdu90UpZBBS5ZK6Up7PXlbrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118424'),
  ('434527188989672110', 'The Icicle Thief', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Mario Battistoni, Laura Zagordi', 'Mauro Monti, Maurizio Nichetti', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Caterina Sylos Labini, Federico Rizzo, Renato Scarpa, Heidi Komarek, Carlina Torta, Massimo Sacilotto, Claudio G. Fava', null, 'Director Maurizio Nichetti is invited on TV to introduce a screening of his neo-realist classic ''The Icicle Thief''. He is horrified to discover that his black-and-white tale of life in poverty is constantly interrupted by garish color commercials, and even more horrified when a power cut in the studio causes film and commercials to mix up – a glamorous model finds herself in the arms of an unemployed pauper, while his wife finds herself in consumers'' heaven. Nichetti has to break into the film to try to sort everything out.', 'Director Maurizio Nichetti is invited on TV to introduce a screening of his neo-realist classic ''The Icicle Thief''. He is horrified to discover that his black-and-white tale of life in poverty is constantly interrupted by garish color commercials, and even more horrified when a power cut in the studio causes film and commercials to mix up – a glamorous model finds herself in the arms of an unemployed pauper, while his wife finds herself in consumers'' heaven. Nichetti has to break into the film to try to sort everything out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvv62lACM2AVxFg56FAlNSpFnEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41937'),
  ('176167019701384978', 'The Idea', 1932, 'Animation', 'Berthold Bartosch', null, null, null, '"Bartosch showed that animation could be poetic... It was Bartosch who first dared to give animation the dimension of a great art, trusting it to voice his pain, to lay bare his heart, to tell of his hope for a better future - which he never saw." - Alexander Alexeieff and Claire Parker, 1969', '"Bartosch showed that animation could be poetic... It was Bartosch who first dared to give animation the dimension of a great art, trusting it to voice his pain, to lay bare his heart, to tell of his hope for a better future - which he never saw." - Alexander Alexeieff and Claire Parker, 1969', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwJFXuTDOtpewxLIxXsW7MnAyr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105773'),
  ('480889381824108049', 'The Idea of You', 2024, 'Music, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Showalter, Jim Frohna, Aaron Gordon', 'Jennifer Westfeldt, Michael Showalter', 'Anne Hathaway, Nicholas Galitzine, Ella Rubin, Annie Mumolo, Reid Scott, Perry Mattfeld, Jordan Aaron Hall, Mathilda Gianopoulos', 'R', '40-year-old single mom Solène begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet. As they begin a whirlwind romance, it isn''t long before Hayes'' superstar status poses unavoidable challenges to their relationship, and Solène soon discovers that life in the glare of his spotlight might be more than she bargained for.', '40-year-old single mom Solène begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet. As they begin a whirlwind romance, it isn''t long before Hayes'' superstar status poses unavoidable challenges to their relationship, and Solène soon discovers that life in the glare of his spotlight might be more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y5P4Q3q8nrruZ9aD3wXeJS2Plg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843527'),
  ('388264883358718605', 'The Ideal', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Beigbeder, Gilles Porte', 'Thierry Gounaud, Nicolas Charlet, Frédéric Beigbeder', 'Gaspard Proust, Audrey Fleurot, Anamaria Vartolomei, Jonathan Lambert, Camille Rowe, Alexandrina Turcan, Nikolett Barabas, Olivier Broche', null, 'Octave Parango, the former concept creator/editor of 99 francs has become a model scout in Moscow. This cynical hedonist leads a very pleasant life in the arms of young Russian models and in the private jets of his oligarch friends... until the day that he is contacted by The Ideal, the world''s leading cosmetics firm, embroiled in a huge media scandal. Our antihero has seven days to find a new muse by traveling through the confines of post-Communist Russia, under the orders of Valentine Winfield, a hard and authoritarian visual director.', 'Octave Parango, the former concept creator/editor of 99 francs has become a model scout in Moscow. This cynical hedonist leads a very pleasant life in the arms of young Russian models and in the private jets of his oligarch friends... until the day that he is contacted by The Ideal, the world''s leading cosmetics firm, embroiled in a huge media scandal. Our antihero has seven days to find a new muse by traveling through the confines of post-Communist Russia, under the orders of Valentine Winfield, a hard and authoritarian visual director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAQXUdlzlNvQ9oJvIcqFEmOyOv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384727'),
  ('825180720570557104', 'The Ideal City', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Marco Tosti, Nico Marzano', 'Luigi Lo Cascio', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Luigi Maria Burruano, Catrinel Marlon, Aida Burruano, Barbara Enrichi, Massimo Foschi, Alfonso Santagata, Roberto Herlitzka', null, 'Actor turned director Luigi Lo Cascio stars as the talented architect and fervent environmentalist Michele who has moved from Palermo to his ideal city, Siena. He holds a successful job and is living out a dream experiment of functioning one year without running water or electricity. Not surprisingly, he also displays a passionate opposition to cars and driving. One evening, after being forced to borrow his boss’ car in order to collect a colleague for a work function, Michele’s life takes an unexpected turn. In the blinding rain Michele hits something he cannot identify. After leaving a note on a parked car he believes he damaged, he continues down the road only to come across a dead body a few miles down which he later discovers belongs to one of Siena’s most important luminaries. Michele immediately calls the police, but in doing so, he unwittingly brings intense suspicion on himself as his uncertainty raises more questions than he has answers for.', 'Actor turned director Luigi Lo Cascio stars as the talented architect and fervent environmentalist Michele who has moved from Palermo to his ideal city, Siena. He holds a successful job and is living out a dream experiment of functioning one year without running water or electricity. Not surprisingly, he also displays a passionate opposition to cars and driving. One evening, after being forced to borrow his boss’ car in order to collect a colleague for a work function, Michele’s life takes an unexpected turn. In the blinding rain Michele hits something he cannot identify. After leaving a note on a parked car he believes he damaged, he continues down the road only to come across a dead body a few miles down which he later discovers belongs to one of Siena’s most important luminaries. Michele immediately calls the police, but in doing so, he unwittingly brings intense suspicion on himself as his uncertainty raises more questions than he has answers for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIW8KQ4OXNjreZJpXQx44qz4y5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185918'),
  ('104134706111512108', 'The Ideal Palace', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Nils Tavernier, Amandine Escoffier, Véronique Lamarche', 'Fanny Desmarès, Nils Tavernier, Laurent Bertoni', 'Jacques Gamblin, Laetitia Casta, Florence Thomassin, Bernard Le Coq, Natacha Lindinger, Zélie Rixhon, Éric Savin, Louka Petit-Taborelli', null, 'Follows Joseph Ferdinand Chavel a French postman who built a palace in the French countryside over 33 years.', 'Follows Joseph Ferdinand Chavel a French postman who built a palace in the French countryside over 33 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqGo8TBqEsx3oz0VwUgQSLEJbnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510455'),
  ('944047457992273160', 'The Idealists', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Nailea Norvind, Claudia Ramírez, Yolanda Ventura, Tiaré Scanda, Juan Pablo Medina, Víctor González, Juan Pablo Hermida, Andrés Palacios', null, 'A group of adults who met while studying college gather together a few years later.', 'A group of adults who met while studying college gather together a few years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCkNgexaBjovYPDAQVOEN2lzXWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568768'),
  ('763878382333438665', 'The Identical', 2014, 'Music, Drama', 'Dustin Marcellino, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Howard Klausner', 'Blake Rayne, Ashley Judd, Ray Liotta, Amanda Crew, Seth Green, Danny Woodburn, Brian Geraghty, Joe Pantoliano', 'PG', 'During the Great Depression, identical twins are separated at birth. One, Drexel Hemsley becomes a wildly successful ''50s rock star, while the other, Ryan Wade, struggles to balance his passion for music and pleasing his parents, who want him to become a preacher. Finally, Ryan rebels against his parents'' wishes and launches his own music career -- performing the hits of Drexel Hemsley. Ryan later learns the truth about Drexel when their fates tragically collide.', 'During the Great Depression, identical twins are separated at birth. One, Drexel Hemsley becomes a wildly successful ''50s rock star, while the other, Ryan Wade, struggles to balance his passion for music and pleasing his parents, who want him to become a preacher. Finally, Ryan rebels against his parents'' wishes and launches his own music career -- performing the hits of Drexel Hemsley. Ryan later learns the truth about Drexel when their fates tragically collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGLnfqQVr3tPXQtnXBiS3zIb2XE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279914'),
  ('904027899908755431', 'The Ides of March', 2011, 'Drama', 'George Clooney, Phedon Papamichael, David Webb', 'Beau Willimon, Grant Heslov, George Clooney', 'Ryan Gosling, George Clooney, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Paul Giamatti, Evan Rachel Wood, Marisa Tomei, Jeffrey Wright, Max Minghella', 'R', 'Dirty tricks stand to soil an ambitious young press spokesman''s idealism in a cutthroat presidential campaign where ''victory'' is relative.', 'Dirty tricks stand to soil an ambitious young press spokesman''s idealism in a cutthroat presidential campaign where ''victory'' is relative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8t4UnJnC24S9ygoaFgmMzRbErd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10316'),
  ('442932696306224932', 'The Idiot', 1946, 'Drama', 'Christian Matras, Georges Lampin, Rodolphe Marcilly', 'Georges Raevsky, Charles Spaak', 'Gérard Philipe, Edwige Feuillère, Lucien Coëdel, Sylvie, Jean Debucourt, Nathalie Nattier, Jane Marken, Marguerite Moreno', null, 'Muichkine, a young Russian prince, returns home to St. Petersburg from a mental institution, determined to spread decency and kindness in the harsh and cruel world. He becomes betrothed to an innocent young girl while trying to save a less-innocent woman from her own travail, but jealousy and his own naivete conjoin to bring about unimaginable tragedy.', 'Muichkine, a young Russian prince, returns home to St. Petersburg from a mental institution, determined to spread decency and kindness in the harsh and cruel world. He becomes betrothed to an innocent young girl while trying to save a less-innocent woman from her own travail, but jealousy and his own naivete conjoin to bring about unimaginable tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lqB6hhX40HXB0x92U4o7ONZJEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4736'),
  ('1030932198352777905', 'The Idiot', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akira Kurosawa, Toshio Ubukata', 'Akira Kurosawa, Eijiro Hisaita', 'Setsuko Hara, Masayuki Mori, Toshirō Mifune, Yoshiko Kuga, Takashi Shimura, Chieko Higashiyama, Eijirō Yanagi, Minoru Chiaki', null, 'A gentle, war-shattered ex-soldier, Kinji Kameda, arrives in wintry Hokkaidō and is pulled into a volatile tangle of love and pity between the disgraced Taeko Nasu, the proud Ayako, and his possessive friend Akama. Kameda’s saintly compassion exposes everyone’s wounds, steering the quartet toward jealousy, violence, and inexorable tragedy. Adapted from Dostoevsky’s novel.', 'A gentle, war-shattered ex-soldier, Kinji Kameda, arrives in wintry Hokkaidō and is pulled into a volatile tangle of love and pity between the disgraced Taeko Nasu, the proud Ayako, and his possessive friend Akama. Kameda’s saintly compassion exposes everyone’s wounds, steering the quartet toward jealousy, violence, and inexorable tragedy. Adapted from Dostoevsky’s novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a6zhVb9a9KEnxNevKrJLfuGhm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24774'),
  ('212433699575628651', 'The Idiot', 1958, 'Drama', 'Valentin Pavlov, Ivan Pyryev, Evgeniya Indlina', 'Ivan Pyryev', 'Yuriy Yakovlev, Yuliya Borisova, Nikita Podgornyj, Leonid Parkhomenko, Raisa Maksimova, Vera Pashennaya, Nikolai Pazhitnov, Klavdiya Polovikova', null, 'The film is based on the first part of the novel of the same name by Fyodor Dostoevsky. Prince Myshkin returns to Russia from Switzerland, where he was treated in a psychiatric clinic. On the train, on the way to St. Petersburg, the prince meets Parfyon Rogozhin, who tells him of his passionate love for Nastasya Filippovna, the former containment woman of the millionaire Totsky. In St. Petersburg, the prince finds himself in the house of his distant relative – Lizaveta Yepanchina (General''s wife), meets her husband, their daughters, as well as the Secretary of General – Ganya Ivolgin. The portrait of Nastasya Filippovna, accidentally seen on the general’s table, makes a great impression on the prince...', 'The film is based on the first part of the novel of the same name by Fyodor Dostoevsky. Prince Myshkin returns to Russia from Switzerland, where he was treated in a psychiatric clinic. On the train, on the way to St. Petersburg, the prince meets Parfyon Rogozhin, who tells him of his passionate love for Nastasya Filippovna, the former containment woman of the millionaire Totsky. In St. Petersburg, the prince finds himself in the house of his distant relative – Lizaveta Yepanchina (General''s wife), meets her husband, their daughters, as well as the Secretary of General – Ganya Ivolgin. The portrait of Nastasya Filippovna, accidentally seen on the general’s table, makes a great impression on the prince...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zERfbWGo8skWpOmDzDgylZKDihB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208408'),
  ('224370815036809232', 'The Idiot Returns', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Štěpán Kučera, Saša Gedeon, Benjamin Tuček', 'Saša Gedeon', 'Pavel Liška, Tatiana Dyková, Anna Geislerová, Jiří Langmajer, Jiří Macháček, Zdena Hadrbolcová, Jitka Smutná, Pavel Marek', null, 'Frantisek, the main character is returning to his family. Until now he''s been, "successfully" avoiding all relationships. He is an ingenuous and a pure person and thus, is regarded as an idiot. He becomes involved in various love and family conflicts. It is because he hasn''t experienced much of the "real" life that he is able to perceive human relationships in their genuineness.', 'Frantisek, the main character is returning to his family. Until now he''s been, "successfully" avoiding all relationships. He is an ingenuous and a pure person and thus, is regarded as an idiot. He becomes involved in various love and family conflicts. It is because he hasn''t experienced much of the "real" life that he is able to perceive human relationships in their genuineness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2dkRZbXcUzBPVqoMkhz1mnkIrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46804'),
  ('17304506511039634', 'The Idiots', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lars von Trier, Lars von Trier, Casper Holm', 'Lars von Trier', 'Bodil Jørgensen, Jens Albinus, Anne Louise Hassing, Troels Lyby, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Louise Mieritz, Henrik Prip, Luis Mesonero', 'R', 'A group of people gather at a Copenhagen suburban home to break all the limitations and to bring out the ''inner idiot'' in themselves.', 'A group of people gather at a Copenhagen suburban home to break all the limitations and to bring out the ''inner idiot'' in themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZUgHe2XH8egBFerMC6yLoqUqii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452'),
  ('672322566703035645', 'The Idle Class', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh, Charles Reisner', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Henry Bergman, Al Ernest Garcia, Lita Grey, Lillian McMurray, John Rand, Rex Storey', null, 'At an upper class golf resort, a tramp discovers he''s the lookalike of a rich man with a beautiful, unhappy wife.', 'At an upper class golf resort, a tramp discovers he''s the lookalike of a rich man with a beautiful, unhappy wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAzmADW8akx67FOcAidLXSyvWCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42510'),
  ('711649528317701868', 'The Idlers of the Fertile Valley', 1978, 'Drama', 'Nikos Panayotopoulos, Marianna Spanoudakis, Andreas Bellis', 'Nikos Panayotopoulos', 'Olga Karlatos, George Dialegmenos, Dimitris Poulikakos, Nikitas Tsakiroglou, Vasilis Diamantopoulos, Kostas Sfikas, Ivi Mavridi, Thanassis Koniaris', null, 'A wealthy member of the upper classes and his three sons withdraw to a country villa where they spend their days in complete idleness, having everything done for them by their young and beautiful maid. They surrender to the pleasure of sleep, while idleness permeates the tiny world of these living dead, with the exception of the woman who is the sole representative of positive values, will-power and action. Finally, the youngest son will try to break free.', 'A wealthy member of the upper classes and his three sons withdraw to a country villa where they spend their days in complete idleness, having everything done for them by their young and beautiful maid. They surrender to the pleasure of sleep, while idleness permeates the tiny world of these living dead, with the exception of the woman who is the sole representative of positive values, will-power and action. Finally, the youngest son will try to break free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wt9jDF5KL3iVn1OfD5NXt4mquZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258026'),
  ('192024891624507994', 'The Idol', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mikhaela Rosen, Ehab Assal, Rima Haj', 'Hany Abu-Assad, Sameh Zoabi', 'Tawfeek Barhom, Qais Attaallah, Hiba Attalah, Ahmad Qasem, Abdel Kareem Barakeh, Teya Hussein, Dima Awawdeh, Ahmed Al Rokh', null, 'Mohammed Assaf, an aspiring musician living in Gaza, sets a seemingly impossible goal: to compete on the program "Arab Idol."', 'Mohammed Assaf, an aspiring musician living in Gaza, sets a seemingly impossible goal: to compete on the program "Arab Idol."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIgYZNpkof7x8MzQnnj7uDkTcXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353460'),
  ('95041079978374178', 'THE iDOLM@STER MOVIE: Beyond the Brilliant Future!', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Akira Takata, Atsushi Nishigori, Atsushi Nishigori', 'Atsushi Nishigori, Tatsuya Takahashi', 'Akiko Hasegawa, Rie Kugimiya, Asami Shimoda, Chiaki Takahashi, Naomi Wakabayashi, Hiromi Hirata, Azumi Asakura, Yumi Hara', null, 'The idols of 765 Production continue on their neverending journey—towards a new stage, towards a bright and shiny future! The girls and their producer have gone through thick and thin, and have stood face to face with all kinds of difficulties. It''s time again for the girls to foster their friendship, and through great discipline, they step forward to their starry future.', 'The idols of 765 Production continue on their neverending journey—towards a new stage, towards a bright and shiny future! The girls and their producer have gone through thick and thin, and have stood face to face with all kinds of difficulties. It''s time again for the girls to foster their friendship, and through great discipline, they step forward to their starry future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRSWfyHssE7NJAIPvMg4ChcqBnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297188'),
  ('1084216790432081409', 'The Idolmaker', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Taylor Hackford, Adam Holender', 'Edward di Lorenzo', 'Ray Sharkey, Peter Gallagher, Joe Pantoliano, Paul Land, JoJo D''Amore, Maureen McCormick, Olympia Dukakis, Jimmy Carter', 'PG', 'Based on the life of rock promoter/producer Bob Marucci, who discovered, among others, Frankie Avalon and Fabian.', 'Based on the life of rock promoter/producer Bob Marucci, who discovered, among others, Frankie Avalon and Fabian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQoGkwIMsfIhfC0ukouBvWOTIpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42159'),
  ('534764857255559113', 'The Igman March', 1983, 'Drama, War', 'Zdravko Šotra', null, 'Tihomir Arsić, Branislav Lečić, Milan Štrljić, Velimir Živojinović, Slavko Štimac, Aleksandar Berček, Željka Cvjetan, Boro Begović', null, 'The story of a forced march of the first proletarian shock brigade during World War II.', 'The story of a forced march of the first proletarian shock brigade during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6U9pa9kV8fdZTu08AVW2nsDjPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183078'),
  ('10298275129399866', 'The Ignorance of Blood', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Angie Paul Risque, Aitor Mantxola', 'Nicolás Saad', 'Paz Vega, Juan Diego Botto, Alberto San Juan, Dacio Caballero, Cuca Escribano, Francesc Garrido, Hamza Zaidi, Marco Corrientes', null, 'Javier Falcón, Chief of the Sevilla Homicide Division, must solve two different cases in a short time. In the first case he is personally involved. An old friend of his infiltrated an Islamic terrorist cell and now the group is trying to recruit his young son for their cause. The same case hits even closer at home. A war is raging between two clans in the Russian Mafia. When an important mobster tries to defect, he gets killed in a car crash. On the scene, the police find an encrypted USB stick with highly explosive information. Then the son of Falcon’s girlfriend Consuelo is kidnapped. They are contacted by both Mafia clans claiming they have the kid and wanting to get their hands on the information. And both say they will kill him if Falcon doesn’t give them the stick', 'Javier Falcón, Chief of the Sevilla Homicide Division, must solve two different cases in a short time. In the first case he is personally involved. An old friend of his infiltrated an Islamic terrorist cell and now the group is trying to recruit his young son for their cause. The same case hits even closer at home. A war is raging between two clans in the Russian Mafia. When an important mobster tries to defect, he gets killed in a car crash. On the scene, the police find an encrypted USB stick with highly explosive information. Then the son of Falcon’s girlfriend Consuelo is kidnapped. They are contacted by both Mafia clans claiming they have the kid and wanting to get their hands on the information. And both say they will kill him if Falcon doesn’t give them the stick', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4snaEQBG6DNGnO7QHLx5zDAM43k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291199'),
  ('574179655852127700', 'The Iguana with the Tongue of Fire', 1971, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Riccardo Freda, Silvano Ippoliti, Leo Jahn', 'Riccardo Freda, Sandro Continenza, Günter Ebert', 'Luigi Pistilli, Dagmar Lassander, Anton Diffring, Arthur O''Sullivan, Werner Pochath, Dominique Boschero, Renato Romano, Sergio Doria', null, 'In Dublin, the acid-scarred, razor-slashed corpse of a young woman is discovered in the boot of the Swiss Ambassador''s limousine. The Ambassador, his family and employees all become immediate suspects. Faced with the problem of diplomatic immunity, the police officer in charge of the case brings in John Norton, an ex-Inspector known for his brutal methods, to carry out an "unoffical" investigation. While Norton develops a relationship with the Ambassdor''s attractive daughter, several more gruesome murders occur...', 'In Dublin, the acid-scarred, razor-slashed corpse of a young woman is discovered in the boot of the Swiss Ambassador''s limousine. The Ambassador, his family and employees all become immediate suspects. Faced with the problem of diplomatic immunity, the police officer in charge of the case brings in John Norton, an ex-Inspector known for his brutal methods, to carry out an "unoffical" investigation. While Norton develops a relationship with the Ambassdor''s attractive daughter, several more gruesome murders occur...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dA8NnCvQ2yfAyBXp8eqASlGDcGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99449'),
  ('528540608122840796', 'The Illusion', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Roberto Andò, Maurizio Calvesi, Roberto Giliberto', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Roberto Andò, Ugo Chiti', 'Toni Servillo, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Tommaso Ragno, Giulia Andò, Pascal Greggory, Leonardo Maltese, Andrea Gherpelli', null, '1860. Giuseppe Garibaldi began from Quarto the adventure of the Thousand surrounded by the enthusiasm of the young idealists who had come from all regions of Italy, and with his loyal group of officers, among whom a new profile stands out, that of Palermo Colonel Vincenzo Giordano Orsini. Among the many militiamen recruited were two Sicilians, Domenico Tricò, a farmer who had emigrated to the North, and Rosario Spitale, an illusionist. Having landed in Sicily, at Marsala, the Thousand begin fighting with the Bourbon army, whose numerical preponderance is immediately evident. Under these conditions, it appears almost impossible for the general to breach the enemy defense and penetrate Palermo. But when he is almost forced to retreat, Garibaldi devises an ingenious plan.', '1860. Giuseppe Garibaldi began from Quarto the adventure of the Thousand surrounded by the enthusiasm of the young idealists who had come from all regions of Italy, and with his loyal group of officers, among whom a new profile stands out, that of Palermo Colonel Vincenzo Giordano Orsini. Among the many militiamen recruited were two Sicilians, Domenico Tricò, a farmer who had emigrated to the North, and Rosario Spitale, an illusionist. Having landed in Sicily, at Marsala, the Thousand begin fighting with the Bourbon army, whose numerical preponderance is immediately evident. Under these conditions, it appears almost impossible for the general to breach the enemy defense and penetrate Palermo. But when he is almost forced to retreat, Garibaldi devises an ingenious plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28P3B0QTxDFmU1ncJk5lVfJsoQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1288328'),
  ('81310441789054781', 'The Illusionist', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Jos Stelling', 'Jos Stelling, Freek de Jonge', 'Freek de Jonge, Jim van der Woude, Gerard Thoolen, Catrien Wolthuizen, Carel Lapere, Craig Eubanks, Gerrie van der Klei', null, 'Two brothers end up separated for one of them has mental issues. Meanwhile one of the two follows his dream in becoming a magician.', 'Two brothers end up separated for one of them has mental issues. Meanwhile one of the two follows his dream in becoming a magician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9oWv2krlJlIh5Kqz6XNX0qgiku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72593'),
  ('69173247709224341', 'The Illusionist', 2006, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Neil Burger, Dick Pope, Jakub Dvorak', 'Neil Burger', 'Edward Norton, Paul Giamatti, Jessica Biel, Rufus Sewell, Eddie Marsan, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Eleanor Tomlinson, Jake Wood', 'PG-13', 'With his eye on a lovely aristocrat, a gifted illusionist named Eisenheim uses his powers to win her away from her betrothed, a crown prince. But Eisenheim''s scheme creates tumult within the monarchy and ignites the suspicion of a dogged inspector.', 'With his eye on a lovely aristocrat, a gifted illusionist named Eisenheim uses his powers to win her away from her betrothed, a crown prince. But Eisenheim''s scheme creates tumult within the monarchy and ignites the suspicion of a dogged inspector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O9jUvqkHaGBMVRyOJz1AlkmALW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1491'),
  ('876417260467111871', 'The Illusionist', 2009, 'Animation', 'Amy Nicholls', null, 'Sean Hall', null, 'The journey of a magician performing illusions to amaze and humour.', 'The journey of a magician performing illusions to amaze and humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyS8erHnRP3UUHEf7BzdmAdDtGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70824'),
  ('1037255721515204087', 'The Illusionist', 2010, 'Animation, Drama', 'Sylvain Chomet, Paul Dutton', 'Jacques Tati', 'Jean-Claude Donda, Eilidh Rankin, Didier Gustin, Jil Aigrot, Jacques Tati, Duncan MacNeil, Raymond Mearns, James T. Muir', 'PG', 'A French illusionist travels to Scotland to work. He meets a young woman in a small village. Their ensuing adventure in Edinburgh changes both their lives forever.', 'A French illusionist travels to Scotland to work. He meets a young woman in a small village. Their ensuing adventure in Edinburgh changes both their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac2tNYW9sRaOhmtMJQuhf2mvo00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41201'),
  ('280102476670348681', 'The Illustrated Man', 1969, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Horror', 'Jack Smight, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Howard B. Kreitsek', 'Rod Steiger, Claire Bloom, Robert Drivas, Don Dubbins, Jason Evers, Tim Weldon, Christine Matchett', 'PG', 'A man who has a body almost completely covered in tattoos is searching for the woman who cursed him with the "skin illustrations". Each tattoo reveals a bizarre story, which is experienced by staring at the scene depicted. When the illustrated man meets a fellow tramp on the road a strange voyage begins.', 'A man who has a body almost completely covered in tattoos is searching for the woman who cursed him with the "skin illustrations". Each tattoo reveals a bizarre story, which is experienced by staring at the scene depicted. When the illustrated man meets a fellow tramp on the road a strange voyage begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxTncIosSPstrHNE9ynivvXfjI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25874'),
  ('372157623823846560', 'The Image', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Armstrong, Ousama Rawi', 'Michael Armstrong', 'Michael Byrne, David Bowie', null, 'An artist''s painting comes to life, and haunts him.', 'An artist''s painting comes to life, and haunts him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukRK0LY33CAnJRU9iNcYpofEVgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178272'),
  ('456525023605933106', 'The Image Book', 2018, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville, Jean-Pierre Gos, Buster Keaton, Jean Gabin, Douglas Fairbanks, Jean Marais, Jean Cocteau', 'NR', 'In Le Livre d’Image, Jean-Luc Godard recycles existing images (films, documentaries, paintings, television archives, etc.), quotes excerpts from books, uses fragments of music. The driving force is poetic rhyme, the association or opposition of ideas, the aesthetic spark through editing, the keystone. The author performs the work of a sculptor. The hand, for this, is essential. He praises it at the start. “There are the five fingers. The five senses. The five parts of the world (…). The true condition of man is to think with his hands. Jean-Luc Godard composes a dazzling syncopation of sequences, the surge of which evokes the violence of the flows of our contemporary screens, taken to a level of incandescence rarely achieved. Crowned at Cannes, the last Godard is a shock film, with twilight beauty.', 'In Le Livre d’Image, Jean-Luc Godard recycles existing images (films, documentaries, paintings, television archives, etc.), quotes excerpts from books, uses fragments of music. The driving force is poetic rhyme, the association or opposition of ideas, the aesthetic spark through editing, the keystone. The author performs the work of a sculptor. The hand, for this, is essential. He praises it at the start. “There are the five fingers. The five senses. The five parts of the world (…). The true condition of man is to think with his hands. Jean-Luc Godard composes a dazzling syncopation of sequences, the surge of which evokes the violence of the flows of our contemporary screens, taken to a level of incandescence rarely achieved. Crowned at Cannes, the last Godard is a shock film, with twilight beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5y1mTTYPVvaPeKIVqy3DymE6osv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414030'),
  ('130784876112456877', 'The Image of You', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Jeff Fisher, Graham Robbins, Chris Copier', 'Chris Sivertson', 'Sasha Pieterse, Parker Young, Mira Sorvino, Nestor Carbonell, Michele Nordin, Rebekah Graf, Ben Milliken, Ogy Durham', 'R', 'Identical twins Anna and Zoe find their bond tested over Anna''s new love, Nick. While the trusting Anna is head over heels, her skeptical sister Zoe senses a web of deceit. But as Zoe digs for the truth, they''re all pulled into a dangerous game where honesty could prove fatal.', 'Identical twins Anna and Zoe find their bond tested over Anna''s new love, Nick. While the trusting Anna is head over heels, her skeptical sister Zoe senses a web of deceit. But as Zoe digs for the truth, they''re all pulled into a dangerous game where honesty could prove fatal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gboq2oB6QNBcW32V0A8uOajTwXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183002'),
  ('1116691347760778875', 'The Imaginarium of Doctor Parnassus', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Terry Gilliam, Nicola Pecorini, Lee Grumett', 'Terry Gilliam, Charles McKeown', 'Christopher Plummer, Lily Cole, Heath Ledger, Andrew Garfield, Verne Troyer, Tom Waits, Johnny Depp, Jude Law', 'PG-13', 'After a carnival troupe saves his life, a man agrees to help its immortal leader collect five souls and win a bet with the devil.', 'After a carnival troupe saves his life, a man agrees to help its immortal leader collect five souls and win a bet with the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DtrqQHa0wT9AWrk2WA9beROJJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8054'),
  ('863092987782716181', 'The Imaginary', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Kenichi Konishi, Yoshiyuki Momose, Koji Kasamatsu', 'Yoshiaki Nishimura', 'Kokoro Terada, Rio Suzuki, Sakura Ando, Riisa Naka, Takayuki Yamada, Atsuko Takahata, Issey Ogata, Akira Terao', 'PG', 'Amanda and her imaginary friend Rudger go on thrilling make-believe adventures. But when Rudger finds himself alone, he faces a mysterious threat.', 'Amanda and her imaginary friend Rudger go on thrilling make-believe adventures. But when Rudger finds himself alone, he faces a mysterious threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2a9eQaoI91EuKnhGbE8yvPfmyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913001'),
  ('1082142346193235797', 'The Imaginary Doctor', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ahmed Hamidi, Yannick Ressigeac', 'Fatsah Bouyahmed', 'Fatsah Bouyahmed, Alban Ivanov, Saâdia Ladib, Rawane El Kadiri, Clotilde Courau, Smaïn, Booder, Karim Haffad', null, 'Alex, aka DJ Wethu, is a star of the night world. On the verge of burnout, he plays concerts all over the world... Until the day when, in the middle of a festival in Morocco, Alex takes a bad fall and falls off the stage. Immobilized on the spot during his convalescence, he is placed under the vigilance of Abdel, who dreams of becoming an assistant nurse. The problem is that he is not quite! An unexpected encounter, to say the least...', 'Alex, aka DJ Wethu, is a star of the night world. On the verge of burnout, he plays concerts all over the world... Until the day when, in the middle of a festival in Morocco, Alex takes a bad fall and falls off the stage. Immobilized on the spot during his convalescence, he is placed under the vigilance of Abdel, who dreams of becoming an assistant nurse. The problem is that he is not quite! An unexpected encounter, to say the least...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XX6OAT9SfYhZTei3QHl6NyHuTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764393'),
