  ('182199452323814091', 'The Immigrant', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Gray, Darius Khondji, Alison Ford', 'Ric Menello, James Gray', 'Marion Cotillard, Joaquin Phoenix, Jeremy Renner, Dagmara Dominczyk, Yelena Solovey, Jicky Schnee, Maja Wampuszyc, Ilia Volok', 'R', '1921 New York. An immigrant woman is tricked into a life of burlesque and vaudeville until a dazzling magician tries to save her and reunite her with her sister who is being held in the confines of Ellis Island.', '1921 New York. An immigrant woman is tricked into a life of burlesque and vaudeville until a dazzling magician tries to save her and reunite her with her sister who is being held in the confines of Ellis Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArWRRQYeXL3nG4jYpMOPoBvgmy9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152599'),
  ('1132784101209657996', 'The Immigrants', 1978, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alan J. Levi, Frank Thackery', 'Richard Collins', 'Stephen Macht, Sharon Gless, Aimée Eccles, Richard Anderson, Ina Balin, Lloyd Bochner, Kevin Dobson, Michael Durrell', null, 'The rags-to-riches saga of a young Italian immigrant who battles his way out of the San Francisco earthquake to become a shipping magnate, rise to the top of Nob Hill''s society through a loveless marriage to the daughter of the city''s wealthiest family, and find happiness with an Asian mistress despite the collapse of his fortune during the Wall Street crash.', 'The rags-to-riches saga of a young Italian immigrant who battles his way out of the San Francisco earthquake to become a shipping magnate, rise to the top of Nob Hill''s society through a loveless marriage to the daughter of the city''s wealthiest family, and find happiness with an Asian mistress despite the collapse of his fortune during the Wall Street crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXxCnO3Nif1Wa0pCEnXhfT9jsuy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412508'),
