  ('740525448159632438', 'The Immortal', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Marco D''Amore, Guido Michelotti, Lorenzo Grasso', 'Leonardo Fasoli, Maddalena Ravagli, Francesco Ghiaccio', 'Marco D''Amore, Giuseppe Aiello, Salvatore D''Onofrio, Giovanni Vastarella, Marianna Robustelli, Martina Attanasio, Gennaro Di Colandrea, Aleksey Guskov', null, 'After reuniting with his first mentor Bruno and receiving his latest mission, an exiled Ciro is left to fearlessly confront whatever comes his way, navigating a new chapter of gang warfare while grappling with devastating memories of loss and trauma. Weaving between his past as an orphan in Naples'' cruel underworld and present as a hardened, cunning assassin with nothing left to lose, Ciro is plunged into the cold, dark depths of a world where immortality is just another form of damnation.', 'After reuniting with his first mentor Bruno and receiving his latest mission, an exiled Ciro is left to fearlessly confront whatever comes his way, navigating a new chapter of gang warfare while grappling with devastating memories of loss and trauma. Weaving between his past as an orphan in Naples'' cruel underworld and present as a hardened, cunning assassin with nothing left to lose, Ciro is plunged into the cold, dark depths of a world where immortality is just another form of damnation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWLsOI2CPpdCBiAxpAXPdoE9435.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599845'),
