  ('370506446791527835', 'The Incredible Shrinking Man', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Adventure, Horror', 'Jack Arnold, Ellis W. Carter, Wilbur Mosier', 'Richard Matheson, Richard Alan Simmons', 'Grant Williams, Randy Stuart, April Kent, Paul Langton, Raymond Bailey, William Schallert, Frank J. Scannell, Helene Marshall', 'NR', 'A dangerous combination of radiation and insecticide causes the unfortunate Scott Carey to shrink, slowly but surely, until he is only a few inches tall. His home becomes a wilderness where he must survive everything from spiders living in the cellar to his beloved cat.', 'A dangerous combination of radiation and insecticide causes the unfortunate Scott Carey to shrink, slowly but surely, until he is only a few inches tall. His home becomes a wilderness where he must survive everything from spiders living in the cellar to his beloved cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vI7IdqfvsyoQAjAzRWS2fYvUoOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31682'),
  ('538307497253275835', 'The Incredible Shrinking Wknd', 2019, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jon Mikel Caballero, Eva Ferradas, Tânia da Fonseca', 'Jon Mikel Caballero', 'Iria del Río, Adam Quintero, Nadia de Santiago, Irene Ruiz, Adrián Expósito, Jimmy Castro, Luis Tosar, Zaira Valcarce', null, 'Navarra, Spain. Alba has just turned thirty and is about to enjoy a weekend with her boyfriend and her friends in an isolated country house, but soon she will notice that this particular weekend is not at all like any other that she has lived before.', 'Navarra, Spain. Alba has just turned thirty and is about to enjoy a weekend with her boyfriend and her friends in an isolated country house, but soon she will notice that this particular weekend is not at all like any other that she has lived before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyktxeSo9d6k2iwdBA9KadINl6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588004'),
  ('988416594944121059', 'The Incredible Shrinking Woman', 1981, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Joel Schumacher, Bruce Logan, Katy Emde', 'Jane Wagner', 'Lily Tomlin, Charles Grodin, Ned Beatty, Henry Gibson, Elizabeth Wilson, Mark Blankfield, Maria Smith, Pamela Bellwood', 'PG', 'After being exposed to a bizarre mixture of household chemicals, Pat Kramer begins to shrink. This baffles scientists, makes parenting difficult, warms the hearts of Americans, and captures the attention of a group of people who want to take over the world. This evil group plots to kidnap Pat and perform experiments on her so that they can eventually shrink everyone.', 'After being exposed to a bizarre mixture of household chemicals, Pat Kramer begins to shrink. This baffles scientists, makes parenting difficult, warms the hearts of Americans, and captures the attention of a group of people who want to take over the world. This evil group plots to kidnap Pat and perform experiments on her so that they can eventually shrink everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6Hgp9LS0TQiawk6sPefjg1mHbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12472'),
  ('1068935393826288460', 'The Incredible Snow Woman', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sébastien Betbeder, Pierre-Hubert Martin, Laure Cochener', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'Blanche Gardin, Philippe Katerine, Bastien Bouillon, Ole Eliassen, Martin Jensen, Laurent Papot, Ferdinand Redouloux, Clémentine Baert', null, 'Fired from her job, dumped by her partner, and in poor health, 46-year-old adventurer Coline Morel, a Far North specialist, sees her life falling apart. But "The Incredible Snow Woman" will attempt one last comeback.', 'Fired from her job, dumped by her partner, and in poor health, 46-year-old adventurer Coline Morel, a Far North specialist, sees her life falling apart. But "The Incredible Snow Woman" will attempt one last comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2bH7Wrca5JNUeDcVAsuxzGzWp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221711'),
  ('473190639315925311', 'The Incredible Story of the Giant Pear', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Philip Einstein Lipski, Jørgen Lerdam, Amalie Næsby Fick', 'Bo Hr. Hansen', 'Alfred Bjerre Larsen, Liva Elvira Magnussen, Peter Frödin, Henrik Koefoed, Peter Plaugborg, Søren Pilmark, Jakob Oftebro, Peter Zhelder', null, 'Life in Solby is nice and peaceful until one day Mitcho and Sebastian find a message in a bottle by the harbour. The bottle is from the missing mayor of Solby with a message that he is on a mysterious island and has made a great discovery. Now they must embark on a perilous journey to help save the mayor and bring him home, and in the process they uncover something that will bring great pleasure to the city of Solby – a giant pear.', 'Life in Solby is nice and peaceful until one day Mitcho and Sebastian find a message in a bottle by the harbour. The bottle is from the missing mayor of Solby with a message that he is on a mysterious island and has made a great discovery. Now they must embark on a perilous journey to help save the mayor and bring him home, and in the process they uncover something that will bring great pleasure to the city of Solby – a giant pear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziBy2wFxLI3sGBqbfu8VVtO8mdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469310'),
  ('912736849100827862', 'The Incredible Torture Show', 1976, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Joel M. Reed, Ron Dorfman', 'Joel M. Reed', 'Seamus O''Brien, Viju Krem, Niles McMaster, Dan Fauci, Alan Dellay, Luis De Jesus, Helen Thompson, Ellen Faison', 'NR', 'Sardu, master of the Theatre of the Macabre, and his assistant Ralphus run a show in which, under the guise of ''magic'', they torture and murder people in front of their audience. But what the punters see as a trick is actually real.', 'Sardu, master of the Theatre of the Macabre, and his assistant Ralphus run a show in which, under the guise of ''magic'', they torture and murder people in front of their audience. But what the punters see as a trick is actually real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRFWfces1Aa2yPRzDt4NVuYrysQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34023'),
  ('400454855296710008', 'The Incredibles', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Brad Bird, Andrew Jimenez, Patrick Lin', 'Brad Bird', 'Craig T. Nelson, Holly Hunter, Sarah Vowell, Spencer Fox, Jason Lee, Samuel L. Jackson, Elizabeth Peña, Eli Fucile', 'PG', 'Bob Parr has given up his superhero days to log in time as an insurance adjuster and raise his three children with his formerly heroic wife in suburbia. But when he receives a mysterious assignment, it''s time to get back into costume.', 'Bob Parr has given up his superhero days to log in time as an insurance adjuster and raise his three children with his formerly heroic wife in suburbia. But when he receives a mysterious assignment, it''s time to get back into costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LqaLgk4Z226KkgPJuiOQ58wvrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9806'),
  ('411784940869879704', 'The Incredibly Strange Creatures Who Stopped Living and Became Mixed-Up Zombies!!?', 1964, 'Horror, Music', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Joseph V. Mascelli', 'Gene Pollock, Robert Silliphant', 'Ray Dennis Steckler, Carolyn Brandt, Brett O''Hara, Atlas King, Sharon Walsh, Pat Kirkwood, Erina Enyo, Don Russell', null, 'Jerry, his girlfriend Angela, and their friend Harold take a trip to a local seaside carnival, but when the carnival''s fortune teller, Madame Estrella, predicts death for someone close to Angela, strange things begin to happen.', 'Jerry, his girlfriend Angela, and their friend Harold take a trip to a local seaside carnival, but when the carnival''s fortune teller, Madame Estrella, predicts death for someone close to Angela, strange things begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfXLgQk5s1bzQfWV1LnS8Ch1Sbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31383'),
  ('247892625578540506', 'The Incredibly True Adventure of Two Girls in Love', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Maria Maggenti, Ted Shields, Aimee House', 'Maria Maggenti', 'Laurel Holloman, Nicole Ari Parker, Maggie Moore, Kate Stafford, Sabrina Artel, Toby Poser, Stephanie Berry, Dale Dickey', 'R', 'An adventurous love story between two young women of different social and economic backgrounds who find themselves going through all the typical struggles of a new romance.', 'An adventurous love story between two young women of different social and economic backgrounds who find themselves going through all the typical struggles of a new romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPbYJaH1j7sgj1NuA4VRyb7O4Mt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29371'),
  ('1031126302240464510', 'The Indecent Woman', 1991, 'Drama', 'Ben Verbong', 'Marianne Dikker, Pea Fröhlich, Jean van de Velde', 'José Way, Coen van Vrijberghe de Coningh, Huub Stapel, Lydia van Nergena, Theo de Groot, Peter Bolhuis, Niels Wolf, Peter Smits', null, 'A woman with a steady marriage and a little daughter, goes bezerk and enters a seducing game.', 'A woman with a steady marriage and a little daughter, goes bezerk and enters a seducing game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPylI3E6K2GgLrJNLfSPMSD76Io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74661'),
  ('27110611839621308', 'The Independent', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'David Johnson, Amy Rice', 'Evan Parter', 'Jodie Turner-Smith, Brian Cox, Ali Marsh, Luke Kirby, John Cena, Ann Dowd, Margaret Odette, Alysia Reiner', 'R', 'It''s the final weeks of the most consequential presidential election in history. America is poised to elect either its first female president or its first viable independent candidate. Reporting history as it''s made, an idealistic young journalist teams up with her idol, legendary journalist Nick Booker, to uncover a conspiracy that places the fate of the election, and the country, in their hands.', 'It''s the final weeks of the most consequential presidential election in history. America is poised to elect either its first female president or its first viable independent candidate. Reporting history as it''s made, an idealistic young journalist teams up with her idol, legendary journalist Nick Booker, to uncover a conspiracy that places the fate of the election, and the country, in their hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhlc1nsD8nnnGymEFaZ0twMH6M6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878183'),
  ('611939896123025225', 'The Indian Fighter', 1955, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Jack Voglin, Anne Douglas', 'Ben Hecht, Frank Davis', 'Kirk Douglas, Elsa Martinelli, Walter Matthau, Diana Douglas, Walter Abel, Lon Chaney Jr., Eduard Franz, Harry Landers', null, 'A scout leading a wagon train through hostile Indian country gets involved with a Sioux chief''s daughter.', 'A scout leading a wagon train through hostile Indian country gets involved with a Sioux chief''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reWmkD0D2QGYivWZ5Lv9pVC75CS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57258'),
  ('1052697600851363203', 'The Indian in the Cupboard', 1995, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Russell Carpenter, Frank Oz, Eric Brevig', 'Melissa Mathison', 'Hal Scardino, Litefoot, Lindsay Crouse, Richard Jenkins, Rishi Bhat, Steve Coogan, David Keith, Sakina Jaffrey', 'PG', 'A nine-year-old boy gets a plastic Indian and a cupboard for his birthday and finds himself involved in adventure when the Indian comes to life and befriends him.', 'A nine-year-old boy gets a plastic Indian and a cupboard for his birthday and finds himself involved in adventure when the Indian comes to life and befriends him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozQAmW85tTJu2dhRe3evzyY03Nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11359'),
  ('147984204952007486', 'The Indian Runner', 1991, 'Drama', 'Sean Penn, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Sean Penn', 'David Morse, Viggo Mortensen, Valeria Golino, Patricia Arquette, Charles Bronson, Sandy Dennis, Dennis Hopper, Jordan Rhodes', 'R', 'Two brothers cannot overcome their opposite perceptions of life. One brother sees and feels bad in everyone and everything, subsequently he is violent, antisocial and unable to appreciate or enjoy the good things which his brother desperately tries to point out to him.', 'Two brothers cannot overcome their opposite perceptions of life. One brother sees and feels bad in everyone and everything, subsequently he is violent, antisocial and unable to appreciate or enjoy the good things which his brother desperately tries to point out to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NmjsvXcqe4yyGKfOwLDcxl4HLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25598'),
  ('951822845459757643', 'The Indian Scarf', 1963, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'George Hurdalek, Harald G. Petersson', 'Heinz Drache, Corny Collins, Klaus Kinski, Gisela Uhlen, Hans Nielsen, Siegfried Schürenberg, Hans Clarin, Eddi Arent', null, 'When a wealthy man dies, his avaricious relatives look forward to inheriting all his money. However, he leaves a provision in his will that they all must spend a week together in his castle before they will be able to inherit anything. At the castle (which is cut off from the outside world), the relatives soon begin to be killed off one by one, each strangled with an Indian scarf.', 'When a wealthy man dies, his avaricious relatives look forward to inheriting all his money. However, he leaves a provision in his will that they all must spend a week together in his castle before they will be able to inherit anything. At the castle (which is cut off from the outside world), the relatives soon begin to be killed off one by one, each strangled with an Indian scarf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFOjlEGk5pfc1ZQQPs5xHBOejle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9634'),
  ('100749278921642391', 'The Indian Sorcerer', 1908, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A sorcerer turns a small egg into a bigger one and keeps repeating this trick until the egg is large enough to do other things including delivering children.', 'A sorcerer turns a small egg into a bigger one and keeps repeating this trick until the egg is large enough to do other things including delivering children.', null, 'tmdb:movie:144450'),
  ('61646853374877220', 'The Indian Tomb', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Frank Winterstein, Richard Angst', 'Fritz Lang, Werner Jörg Lüddecke', 'Debra Paget, Paul Hubschmid, Walther Reyer, Claus Holm, Luciana Paluzzi, Sabine Bethmann, René Deltgen, Jochen Brockmann', null, 'Seetha and Harold Berger are rescued from the desert by a caravan and brought to a small village. However, the greedy owner of the house where they are lodged betrays the law of hospitality and reveals their location to Prince Ramigani. The couple tries to escape but is hunted and captured by Ramigani and his men. Meanwhile Irene Rhode and her husband Walter Rhode suspect that Maharaja Chandra is not telling the truth about Harold''s destiny. The conspirator Ramigani forces Seetha to accept to get married with Chandra to provoke the wrath of the priests and get the alliance of Prince Padhu and his army. In the meantime, Harold succeeds in escaping from the dungeon and seeks out Seetha to save her.', 'Seetha and Harold Berger are rescued from the desert by a caravan and brought to a small village. However, the greedy owner of the house where they are lodged betrays the law of hospitality and reveals their location to Prince Ramigani. The couple tries to escape but is hunted and captured by Ramigani and his men. Meanwhile Irene Rhode and her husband Walter Rhode suspect that Maharaja Chandra is not telling the truth about Harold''s destiny. The conspirator Ramigani forces Seetha to accept to get married with Chandra to provoke the wrath of the priests and get the alliance of Prince Padhu and his army. In the meantime, Harold succeeds in escaping from the dungeon and seeks out Seetha to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4N9uLLo7L2xE0uW9cN2FEJluZzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70555'),
  ('91907183306225678', 'The Indian Tomb, Part I: The Mission of the Yoghi', 1921, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Joe May', 'Thea von Harbou, Fritz Lang', 'Olaf Fønss, Mia May, Conrad Veidt, Erna Morena, Bernhard Goetzke, Lya De Putti, Paul Richter, Karl Platen', null, 'Ayan, Maharajah of Eschnapur, believes that his wife, Princess Savitri, has been unfaithful to him with officer Mac Allan. He decides to bury her alive, so he sends the Yogi Ramigani to England to look for Herbert Rowland, an architect; but when he orders him to build a tomb, Rowland refuses.', 'Ayan, Maharajah of Eschnapur, believes that his wife, Princess Savitri, has been unfaithful to him with officer Mac Allan. He decides to bury her alive, so he sends the Yogi Ramigani to England to look for Herbert Rowland, an architect; but when he orders him to build a tomb, Rowland refuses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfregqnBEHlXGF68xD57RNJrRfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175360'),
  ('1103260498423269805', 'The Indian Tomb, Part II: The Tiger of Eschnapur', 1921, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Joe May', 'Thea von Harbou, Fritz Lang', 'Olaf Fønss, Mia May, Conrad Veidt, Erna Morena, Bernhard Goetzke, Lya De Putti, Paul Richter, Georg John', null, 'Rowland falls sick with leprosy while Mac Allan is captured by the Maharajah, who offers Irene a deal: one night with him in exchange for letting Rowland to be cured. She accepts, but tries to commit suicide.', 'Rowland falls sick with leprosy while Mac Allan is captured by the Maharajah, who offers Irene a deal: one night with him in exchange for letting Rowland to be cured. She accepts, but tries to commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7Dk64iKZprSDJymdfGkWHoB91x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175361'),
  ('578796760739742187', 'The Inerasable', 2016, 'Horror', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Yukihiro Okimura', 'Kenichi Suzuki', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Ai Hashimoto, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Kenichi Takitoh, Yorie Yamashita, Ryo Narita, Ken Yoshizawa', null, 'A novelist receives a letter from a female university student named Kubo about strange sounds that emanate from a room in her apartment. They begin to investigate incidents involving former residents, and eventually discover the shocking truths lurking inside the building.', 'A novelist receives a letter from a female university student named Kubo about strange sounds that emanate from a room in her apartment. They begin to investigate incidents involving former residents, and eventually discover the shocking truths lurking inside the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eKF02D3h8eZ2MMDUU1YtgcFxcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365283'),
  ('526881641892896594', 'The Inevitable', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Eduardo Pinto, Fercks Castellani', 'Fercks Castellani', 'Luciano Cáceres, Juana Viale, Daryna Butryk, Javier Godino, Carlos Portaluppi', null, 'A family takes refuge in an old country house the last hours before the announced final judgment. But the unexpected appearance of an intruder, who claims to be a savior, puts their faith and destiny at risk.', 'A family takes refuge in an old country house the last hours before the announced final judgment. But the unexpected appearance of an intruder, who claims to be a savior, puts their faith and destiny at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mA20job57iS7BVChpC0c1gsMCFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679915'),
  ('694091068894461664', 'The Inevitable Defeat of Mister & Pete', 2013, 'Drama', 'Reed Morano, George Tillman Jr.', 'Michael Starrbury', 'Skylan Brooks, Ethan Dizon, Jennifer Hudson, Jordin Sparks, Anthony Mackie, Jeffrey Wright, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Michael Chmiel', 'R', 'Coming of age story about two inner city youths, who are left to fend for themselves over the summer after their mothers are taken away by the authorities.', 'Coming of age story about two inner city youths, who are left to fend for themselves over the summer after their mothers are taken away by the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh6xU7IKEPdrBPYKezf6iKi1Jgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158908'),
  ('813238376315430289', 'The Inextinguishable Fire', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Harun Farocki, Helke Sander', 'Harun Farocki', 'Harun Farocki, Caroline Gremm, Gerd Volker Bussäus, Hans-Peter Krüger, Ingrid Oppermann, Eckart Kammer', null, 'An austere treatise on the military-industrial complex that produces napalm.', 'An austere treatise on the military-industrial complex that produces napalm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/np0ANWMcV3faDUcvYBB9okrKIGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89625'),
  ('60413785148599524', 'The Infallibles', 2024, 'Comedy, Action', 'Christian Abomnes, Frédéric Forestier', 'Kévin Debonne', 'Inès Reg, Kévin Debonne, Vincent Rottiers, Moussa Maaskri, François Neycken, Pierre Olivier, Hugo Gonzalez, Daphné Huynh', null, 'When a gang of robbers provokes chaos in Paris and humiliates the police, the Minister of the Interior wants new blood at the helm of the investigation: Alia is from Marseille, fiery-tempered and unmanageable, Hugo is Parisian, valedictorian and meticulous. In short, they have every reason to hate each other. A forced alliance, for better or for worse, or maybe blossoming into something else?', 'When a gang of robbers provokes chaos in Paris and humiliates the police, the Minister of the Interior wants new blood at the helm of the investigation: Alia is from Marseille, fiery-tempered and unmanageable, Hugo is Parisian, valedictorian and meticulous. In short, they have every reason to hate each other. A forced alliance, for better or for worse, or maybe blossoming into something else?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PoIAvL3Io5v0HyBliXfXZruQTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143019'),
  ('2640339636886981', 'The Infernal Cake-Walk', 1903, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Pluto, having seen the earth, comes back home amazed at the success of that well-known dance, the "cake-walk." He has brought back with him two noted well-known dancers, who start their favorite dance amidst the flames.', 'Pluto, having seen the earth, comes back home amazed at the success of that well-known dance, the "cake-walk." He has brought back with him two noted well-known dancers, who start their favorite dance amidst the flames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RfB1qUcS1tNsH4890dE5NE6sXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96701'),
  ('242467180830419124', 'The Infernal Cauldron', 1903, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A green-skinned demon places a woman and two courtiers into a flaming cauldron.', 'A green-skinned demon places a woman and two courtiers into a flaming cauldron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KS5ZLXSB0iRKO5MSda8xxgLg2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16465'),
  ('1120477420024872997', 'The Infernal Machine', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrew Hunt', 'Andrew Hunt', 'Guy Pearce, Alice Eve, Jeremy Davies, Alex Pettyfer, Iris Cayatte, Rachel De Fontes, Ana Lopes, Georgia Goodman', 'R', 'Reclusive and controversial author Bruce Cogburn is drawn out of hiding by an obsessive fan, forcing the novelist to confront a past that he thought he could escape, and to account for events set in motion by his bestseller decades earlier. Cogburn''s search for who is behind the manipulation and mental torment he encounters leads to an emotional roller-coaster ride full of fear and danger, where things are not always as clear as they seem to be, and where past deeds can have dire consequences.', 'Reclusive and controversial author Bruce Cogburn is drawn out of hiding by an obsessive fan, forcing the novelist to confront a past that he thought he could escape, and to account for events set in motion by his bestseller decades earlier. Cogburn''s search for who is behind the manipulation and mental torment he encounters leads to an emotional roller-coaster ride full of fear and danger, where things are not always as clear as they seem to be, and where past deeds can have dire consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSqpOGzaKBdGkBLmcm1JJIVryYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916605'),
  ('668777500130116535', 'The Infernal Rapist', 1988, 'Crime, Horror', 'Damián Acosta Esparza, José Medina', 'Cristóbal Martell', 'Noé Murayama, Princesa Lea, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Marisol Cervantes, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Arturo Mason, Viviana Oliva, Ramón Blanco', null, 'Carlos "El Gato" is a serial rapist who''s condemned to the electric chair. Immediately after his electrocution, he makes a deal with Satan and gets resurrected. Carlos begins raping and killing in the name of the devil.', 'Carlos "El Gato" is a serial rapist who''s condemned to the electric chair. Immediately after his electrocution, he makes a deal with Satan and gets resurrected. Carlos begins raping and killing in the name of the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qXCcZS2fVJmxoTKs0eyyHthOUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152373'),
  ('896865489949534785', 'The Infernal Trio', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Andréas Winding, Francis Girod', 'Francis Girod, Jacques Rouffio', 'Michel Piccoli, Romy Schneider, Mascha Gonska, Philippe Brizard, Jean Rigaux, Monica Fiorentini, Hubert Deschamps, Monique Tarbès', null, 'Marseilles, 1919. Georges Sarret is a distinguished and respected lawyer, recently honoured for his services in the First World War. He takes as his lover Philomène Schmidt, a young German woman, who has just lost her job and home. To enable Philomène to remain in France, Georges finds her a husband – who dies conveniently of natural causes a month after the wedding. Georges repeats the trick with Philomène''s sister, Catherine – marrying her off to an old man who dies suddenly so that the scheming trio can profit from his life insurance. When an accomplice in the scheme, Marcel Chambon, threatens to blackmail them, Georges and his two lovers have no option but to kill him and his mistress...', 'Marseilles, 1919. Georges Sarret is a distinguished and respected lawyer, recently honoured for his services in the First World War. He takes as his lover Philomène Schmidt, a young German woman, who has just lost her job and home. To enable Philomène to remain in France, Georges finds her a husband – who dies conveniently of natural causes a month after the wedding. Georges repeats the trick with Philomène''s sister, Catherine – marrying her off to an old man who dies suddenly so that the scheming trio can profit from his life insurance. When an accomplice in the scheme, Marcel Chambon, threatens to blackmail them, Georges and his two lovers have no option but to kill him and his mistress...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t97SXV2CdLXfrvPTHdb0xTBYVJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3477'),
  ('280177605896763529', 'The Inferno', 1979, 'Horror', 'Tatsumi Kumashiro, Shigeru Akatsuka, Akiyasu Tawarazaka', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Mieko Harada, Ken Nishida, Kyôko Kishida, Kunie Tanaka, Jun Hamamura, Kazuko Inano, Renji Ishibashi, Yoshi Katō', null, 'Hell manifests itself through the sins, shame and desires of an upper class rural family and a mother''s grief from beyond the grave.', 'Hell manifests itself through the sins, shame and desires of an upper class rural family and a mother''s grief from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ7tPqJ7lUZ38Knxz0WN0ORjDQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261932'),
  ('259717679095762736', 'The Infidel', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Josh Appignanesi, Natasha Braier', 'David Baddiel', 'Omid Djalili, Richard Schiff, Archie Panjabi, Igal Naor, Stewart Scudamore, Mina Anwar, James Floyd, Leah Fatania', null, 'Based in a London suburb Mahmud Nasir lives with his wife, Saamiya, and two children, Rashid and Nabi. His son plans to marry Uzma, the step-daughter of Egyptian-born Arshad Al-Masri, a so-called ''Hate Cleric'' from Waziristan, Pakistan. Mahmud, who is not exactly a devout Muslim, he drinks alcohol, and does not pray five times, but does agree that he will appease Arshad, without whose approval the marriage cannot take place. Shortly thereafter Mahmud, while going over his recently deceased mother''s documents, will find out that he was adopted, his birth parents were Jewish, and his name is actually Solly Shimshillewitz.', 'Based in a London suburb Mahmud Nasir lives with his wife, Saamiya, and two children, Rashid and Nabi. His son plans to marry Uzma, the step-daughter of Egyptian-born Arshad Al-Masri, a so-called ''Hate Cleric'' from Waziristan, Pakistan. Mahmud, who is not exactly a devout Muslim, he drinks alcohol, and does not pray five times, but does agree that he will appease Arshad, without whose approval the marriage cannot take place. Shortly thereafter Mahmud, while going over his recently deceased mother''s documents, will find out that he was adopted, his birth parents were Jewish, and his name is actually Solly Shimshillewitz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LxwGYJQUFcxzIFOVT4pmxCVjia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42171'),
  ('8456497247256082', 'The Infiltrator', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Brad Furman, Joshua Reis, Tim Wooster', 'Ellen Brown Furman', 'Bryan Cranston, Diane Kruger, John Leguizamo, Daniel Mays, Benjamin Bratt, Amy Ryan, Elena Anaya, Joseph Gilgun', 'R', 'A U.S Customs official uncovers a massive money laundering scheme involving Pablo Escobar.', 'A U.S Customs official uncovers a massive money laundering scheme involving Pablo Escobar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/758F57DxVRLe38S1Je4O1Bjx2u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325789'),
  ('147678199220122163', 'The Infinite Husk', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Aaron Silverstein', 'Aaron Silverstein', 'Peace Ikediuba, Foreste Jean Feely, Circus-Szalewski', 'Not Rated', 'An alien consciousness, sent to Earth to spy on one of its own kind, learns what it means to be human.', 'An alien consciousness, sent to Earth to spy on one of its own kind, learns what it means to be human.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6dKjVN1kTkut6qWlyXln1FV4qVQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-infinite-husk'),
  ('271956061452686753', 'The Infinite Man', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Drew Bailey, Marden Dean, Hugh Sullivan', 'Hugh Sullivan', 'Josh McConville, Hannah Marshall, Alex Dimitriades', null, 'A man''s attempts to construct the ultimate romantic weekend backfire when his quest for perfection traps his lover in an infinite loop.', 'A man''s attempts to construct the ultimate romantic weekend backfire when his quest for perfection traps his lover in an infinite loop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFAHx3bJBE3ZpLpIlYCLSE4eKqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253307'),
  ('859994886031577548', 'The Influence', 2019, 'Horror', 'Denis Rovira van Boekholt', 'Michel Gaztambide, Denis Rovira van Boekholt', 'Manuela Vellés, Maggie Civantos, Emma Suárez, Alain Hernández, Claudia Placer, David Luque, Marta Castellote, Bianca Kovacs', null, 'After moving back to her family home to care for her dying mother, a nurse haunted by her childhood memories must struggle with an evil force in the house.', 'After moving back to her family home to care for her dying mother, a nurse haunted by her childhood memories must struggle with an evil force in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGUMfHIiEzuNVGeRAggLprzo1gG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605373'),
  ('680559047757722262', 'The Informant', 1997, 'Action, War, Thriller', 'Affonso Beato, Jim McBride', 'Nicholas Meyer', 'Cary Elwes, Anthony Brophy, Timothy Dalton, Maria Lennon, Sean McGinley, John Kavanagh, Frankie McCafferty, Stuart Graham', 'R', 'A former Irish Republican Army fighter, Gingy McAnally (Anthony Brophy), is reluctant about being called back into service after serving time in prison. He executes the grisly task but ends up captured by a sympathetic British police lieutenant named Ferris (Cary Elwes). The intimidating Chief Inspector of the Belfast Police (Timothy Dalton) convinces Gingy that his best hope is to become an informant and turn in other IRA operatives. As Gingy''s marriage unravels under the stress, he is forced to come to terms with the fact that in this war both sides lose. Three men, three political circles, each fighting for their lives, each with their own agenda in the battle for Northern Ireland.', 'A former Irish Republican Army fighter, Gingy McAnally (Anthony Brophy), is reluctant about being called back into service after serving time in prison. He executes the grisly task but ends up captured by a sympathetic British police lieutenant named Ferris (Cary Elwes). The intimidating Chief Inspector of the Belfast Police (Timothy Dalton) convinces Gingy that his best hope is to become an informant and turn in other IRA operatives. As Gingy''s marriage unravels under the stress, he is forced to come to terms with the fact that in this war both sides lose. Three men, three political circles, each fighting for their lives, each with their own agenda in the battle for Northern Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgO6uvpH43DpYVkmEGN9K6xV6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38275'),
  ('734807585062255101', 'The Informant', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Julien Leclercq, Thierry Pouget', 'Abdel Raouf Dafri', 'Gilles Lellouche, Tahar Rahim, Riccardo Scamarcio, Mélanie Bernier, Raphaëlle Agogué, Fernando Soto, Philippe Nahon, Aidan Devine', null, 'A story centered on a man who works as an informant for the French border patrol.', 'A story centered on a man who works as an informant for the French border patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qquxjG5lKt8cbKgovckoxORZwS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204046'),
  ('947010186849438479', 'The Informant!', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Scott Z. Burns', 'Matt Damon, Scott Bakula, Joel McHale, Melanie Lynskey, Tom Papa, Rick Overton, Thomas F. Wilson, Clancy Brown', 'R', 'A rising star at agri-industry giant Archer Daniels Midland (ADM), Mark Whitacre suddenly turns whistleblower. Even as he exposes his company’s multi-national price-fixing conspiracy to the FBI, Whitacre envisions himself being hailed as a hero of the common man and handed a promotion.', 'A rising star at agri-industry giant Archer Daniels Midland (ADM), Mark Whitacre suddenly turns whistleblower. Even as he exposes his company’s multi-national price-fixing conspiracy to the FBI, Whitacre envisions himself being hailed as a hero of the common man and handed a promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wT6uYA8RQ9tYvWUT91480LR0Dnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11323'),
  ('225358053996871135', 'The Informer', 1929, 'Drama', 'Arthur Robison, Werner Brandes, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Rolf E. Vanloo', 'Lya De Putti, Lars Hanson, Warwick Ward, Carl Harbord, Dennis Wyndham, Janice Adair, Daisy Campbell, Craighall Sherry', null, 'A man betrays his best friend, a member of a terrorist organisation, to the authorities and is then pursued by the other members of the organisation.', 'A man betrays his best friend, a member of a terrorist organisation, to the authorities and is then pursued by the other members of the organisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3CWVMfa7QnsAaxWM3WkSkkqbRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191381'),
  ('1033802642781834281', 'The Informer', 1935, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Ford, Edward O''Fearna, Edward Donahue', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Victor McLaglen, Heather Angel, Preston Foster, Margot Grahame, Wallace Ford, Una O''Connor, J.M. Kerrigan, Joe Sawyer', 'NR', 'Gypo Nolan is a former Irish Republican Army man who drowns his sorrows in the bottle. He''s desperate to escape his bleak Dublin life and start over in America with his girlfriend. So when British authorities advertise a reward for information about his best friend, current IRA member Frankie, Gypo cooperates. Now Gypo can buy two tickets on a boat bound for the States, but can he escape the overwhelming guilt he feels for betraying his buddy?', 'Gypo Nolan is a former Irish Republican Army man who drowns his sorrows in the bottle. He''s desperate to escape his bleak Dublin life and start over in America with his girlfriend. So when British authorities advertise a reward for information about his best friend, current IRA member Frankie, Gypo cooperates. Now Gypo can buy two tickets on a boat bound for the States, but can he escape the overwhelming guilt he feels for betraying his buddy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFsyHdVg93uPMZc64kCaCR3Y7Vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43896'),
  ('487521727494406141', 'The Informer', 1983, 'Crime', 'Serge Leroy, André Domage', 'Didier Decoin', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Daniel Auteuil, Pascale Rocard, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Michel Beaune, Christian Bouillette, Marie-Catherine Conti, Danielle Durou', null, 'The girlfriend of an associate of a gangland boss, is persuaded by a police detective to inform about her lover''s associates.', 'The girlfriend of an associate of a gangland boss, is persuaded by a police detective to inform about her lover''s associates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIIJxebJrFnobz43MFqqqHDtYEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327221'),
  ('186655772595760427', 'The Informer', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrea Di Stefano, David Doran, Jonathan Midlane', 'Matt Cook, Rowan Joffé, Andrea Di Stefano', 'Joel Kinnaman, Rosamund Pike, Common, Ana de Armas, Clive Owen, Sam Spruell, Ruth Bradley, Eugene Lipinski', 'R', 'In New York, former convict Pete Koslow, related to the Polish mafia, must deal with both Klimek the General, his ruthless boss, and the twisted ambitions of two federal agents, as he tries to survive and protect the lives of his loved ones.', 'In New York, former convict Pete Koslow, related to the Polish mafia, must deal with both Klimek the General, his ruthless boss, and the twisted ambitions of two federal agents, as he tries to survive and protect the lives of his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbGveUC8mk0QRkdXpERPLbMFnrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466081'),
  ('1049226300295502127', 'The Informers', 1963, 'Crime', 'Ken Annakin, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Paul Durst, Alun Falconer', 'Nigel Patrick, Katherine Woodville, Colin Blakely, Derren Nesbitt, Harry Andrews, Roy Kinnear, Margaret Whiting, John Cowley', 'NR', 'When the detective in charge of investigating a series of bank robberies starts to get too close to the culprits, they set up a blackmail scheme to warn him off. But when the crooks begin to fall out with each other, the police learn the truth.', 'When the detective in charge of investigating a series of bank robberies starts to get too close to the culprits, they set up a blackmail scheme to warn him off. But when the crooks begin to fall out with each other, the police learn the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfCkM9UqJhzJpzQZ4L6tYiYhkiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284440'),
  ('1100176442613371692', 'The Informers', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gregor Jordan, Pablo Ramos, Petra Korner', 'Bret Easton Ellis, Nicholas Jarecki', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Kim Basinger, Jon Foster, Amber Heard, Winona Ryder, Mickey Rourke, Rhys Ifans, Chris Isaak', 'R', 'A collection of intersecting short stories set in early 1980s Los Angeles, depicts a week in the lives of an assortment of socially alienated, mainly well-off characters who numb their sense of emptiness with casual sex, violence, and drugs.', 'A collection of intersecting short stories set in early 1980s Los Angeles, depicts a week in the lives of an assortment of socially alienated, mainly well-off characters who numb their sense of emptiness with casual sex, violence, and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiXkvghbkYMQ3iMyhiI08GgtonC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17436'),
  ('350429238091397273', 'The Inglorious Bastards', 1978, 'Action, War, Adventure', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Mario Maffei, Giovanni Bergamini', 'Sandro Continenza, Laura Toscano, Romano Migliorini', 'Bo Svenson, Fred Williamson, Peter Hooten, Michael Pergolani, Jackie Basehart, Michel Constantin, Debra Berger, Raimund Harmstorf', 'R', 'Set in Europe during WWII, a group of American soldiers on their way to military prison are beset upon by a German artillery attack, escaping with Switzerland in their sights. Before making it any farther, they volunteer to steal a V2 warhead for the French Underground - taking them deep into the heart of German territory.', 'Set in Europe during WWII, a group of American soldiers on their way to military prison are beset upon by a German artillery attack, escaping with Switzerland in their sights. Before making it any farther, they volunteer to steal a V2 warhead for the French Underground - taking them deep into the heart of German territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8f7PoX7TveyKrndh3bZZcBvR55Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22311'),
  ('635437480171150815', 'The Inhabitant', 2018, 'Horror', 'Guillermo Amoedo', 'Guillermo Amoedo', 'María Evoli, Vanesa Restrepo, Natasha Cubría, Carla Adell, Gabriela de la Garza, Fernando Becerril', null, 'Three sisters enter the house of a senator with the intention of stealing money obtained from bribes, but once inside, they begin to hear strange cries coming from the basement.', 'Three sisters enter the house of a senator with the intention of stealing money obtained from bribes, but once inside, they begin to hear strange cries coming from the basement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E1ryc3622t0iQqyqJTZnhHripg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477187'),
  ('96306448806456409', 'The Inhabitant', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jerren Lauder', 'Kevin Bachar', 'Odessa A''zion, Leslie Bibb, Dermot Mulroney, Lizze Broadway, Michael Cooper Jr., Mary Buss, Jackson Dean Vincent, Kenneisha Thompson', 'NR', 'Like any other teenage girl, Tara is just surviving high school — yet her father and mother seem strangely distant. Amidst a nearby spree of gruesome ax murders, Tara has sightings of terrifying entities, forcing her to question her own sanity and shocking ancestry.', 'Like any other teenage girl, Tara is just surviving high school — yet her father and mother seem strangely distant. Amidst a nearby spree of gruesome ax murders, Tara has sightings of terrifying entities, forcing her to question her own sanity and shocking ancestry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1hH2FXEUHuY5kzm9bEBxEmdD8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772973'),
  ('682225969851713445', 'The Inhabited Island', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Anton Gridchin, Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky', 'Serhiy Dyachenko, Marina Dyachenko, Eduard Volodarskiy', 'Vasily Stepanov, Pyotr Fyodorov, Yuliya Snigir, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Sergey Garmash, Mikhail Evlanov, Anna Mikhalkova, Sergey Barkovsky', null, 'On the threshold of 22nd century, furrowing the space, protagonist from the Free Search Group makes emergency landing on an unknown planet where he must stay. People who are living on this planet have remained at the stone level of the 20th century, with its social problems, miserable ecology and shaky world..', 'On the threshold of 22nd century, furrowing the space, protagonist from the Free Search Group makes emergency landing on an unknown planet where he must stay. People who are living on this planet have remained at the stone level of the 20th century, with its social problems, miserable ecology and shaky world..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ6Cox1ycTpvEgLKAHRzRerwEL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16911'),
  ('430839020782219179', 'The Inhabited Island 2: Rebellion', 2009, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Jevgenia Opekine, Artyom Aksenenko', 'Eduard Volodarskiy, Serhiy Dyachenko, Marina Dyachenko', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Sergey Barkovsky, Gosha Kutsenko, Pyotr Fyodorov, Vasily Stepanov, Yuliya Snigir, Mikhail Evlanov, Aleksey Serebryakov', null, 'Maxim Kammerer fights for his love and freedom. He leads a rebel movement challenging the five greedy rulers. One of the rulers, Strannik, knows how dangerous Maxim can be. He makes up his mind to stop the young man at any cost. The last close fight will decide everything.', 'Maxim Kammerer fights for his love and freedom. He leads a rebel movement challenging the five greedy rulers. One of the rulers, Strannik, knows how dangerous Maxim can be. He makes up his mind to stop the young man at any cost. The last close fight will decide everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZuRkOM3t714W1MTJ4K6uqSIqvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18122'),
  ('917390250625882470', 'The Inheritance', 1962, 'Drama', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Takashi Kawamata, Ichirô Mizunuma', 'Koichi Inagaki', 'Keiko Kishi, Tatsuya Nakadai, So Yamamura, Seiji Miyaguchi, Yūsuke Kawazu, Mari Yoshimura, Minoru Chiaki, Misako Watanabe', 'PG', 'A dying businessman intends to will ¥200 million to his three illegitimate children, but his associates scheme to take advantage of the situation.', 'A dying businessman intends to will ¥200 million to his three illegitimate children, but his associates scheme to take advantage of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8WTsuLlx5sytaFX3CjDxgBezUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159414'),
  ('272005529189552975', 'The Inheritance', 1976, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Dino Squizzato, Gianfranco Giagni', 'Ugo Pirro, Sergio Bazzini', 'Anthony Quinn, Fabio Testi, Dominique Sanda, Gigi Proietti, Adriana Asti, Paolo Bonacelli, Rossella Rusconi, Harold Bromley', null, 'In 1880 Rome, a patriarch closes the family bakery. His ambitious daughter-in-law manipulates her brothers-in-law to prevent their father''s remarriage, securing her inheritance.', 'In 1880 Rome, a patriarch closes the family bakery. His ambitious daughter-in-law manipulates her brothers-in-law to prevent their father''s remarriage, securing her inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSOOxYtUk1wLNYlaliSsa3vYngz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106224'),
  ('12054362828659185', 'The Inheritance', 1980, 'Drama', 'Márta Mészáros, Elemér Ragályi', 'Ildikó Kórody, Márta Mészáros, Jan Nowicki', 'Isabelle Huppert, Lili Monori, Jan Nowicki, Zita Perczel, Szabó Sándor, Zsolt Körtvélyessy, Witold Holtz, Éva Gyulányi', null, 'During the rising of nazism, Sylvia, a rich but sterile woman, needs an heir to inherit her father''s money. So she bribes Irene, a Jewish girl, to have a child by her husband.', 'During the rising of nazism, Sylvia, a rich but sterile woman, needs an heir to inherit her father''s money. So she bribes Irene, a Jewish girl, to have a child by her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNLJRY9JKyj8h4i65dx88VatCdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198507'),
  ('108987825094750828', 'The Inheritance', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Bobby Roth, Lynn Kressel', null, 'Cari Shayne, Brigitta Dau, Paul Anthony Stewart, Brigid Brannagh, Michael Gallagher, Max Gail, Thomas Gibson, Tom Conti', null, 'A beautiful orphan of mysterious parentage is asked by her adoptive family to help find a husband for their niece, but when two suitors both fall for the orphan girl, the niece instigates a scheme to discredit her in the eyes of her guardians. Based on the novel by Louisa May Alcott.', 'A beautiful orphan of mysterious parentage is asked by her adoptive family to help find a husband for their niece, but when two suitors both fall for the orphan girl, the niece instigates a scheme to discredit her in the eyes of her guardians. Based on the novel by Louisa May Alcott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQIUZCJrePvref6WC4jV5HzKaz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46200'),
  ('547175592652467286', 'The Inheritance', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Filho, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Miguel Falabella, Mark Haskell Smith, João Emanuel Carneiro', 'Glória Pires, Andréa Beltrão, Palomma Duarte, Lília Cabral, Herson Capri, Dennis Carvalho, Marcello Antony, Chica Xavier', null, 'Reunited for their mother’s funeral, four sisters – Selma, Regina, Laura and Lúcia – find themselves forced to divide much more than an apartment in Copacabana. While dividing the articles, the sisters compare options, destinies, lifestyles, and expectations. The turbulent sale of the apartment represents a turning point in their lives: they know they have never been so deeply involved as accomplices, or as sisters.', 'Reunited for their mother’s funeral, four sisters – Selma, Regina, Laura and Lúcia – find themselves forced to divide much more than an apartment in Copacabana. While dividing the articles, the sisters compare options, destinies, lifestyles, and expectations. The turbulent sale of the apartment represents a turning point in their lives: they know they have never been so deeply involved as accomplices, or as sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRJo3MdzhfS4dkiMjGv2zdOZfFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17355'),
  ('63794086678254232', 'The Inheritance', 2003, 'Drama', 'Harald Gunnar Paalgard, Per Fly, Malene From', 'Dorthe Warnø Høgh, Kim Leona, Per Fly', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Lisa Werlinder, Ghita Nørby, Lars Brygmann, Karina Skands, Peter Steen, Ulf Pilgaard, Diana Axelsen', null, 'A young Danish man, Christoffer, lives a life of joy and happiness with his wife Maria in Stockholm. When his father dies his mother insists that Christoffer take over management of the family industry which is in danger of bankruptcy. He is torn between his chosen life and his sense of duty to his family and its past. When he chooses to step in as manager his family life and self-respect languish.', 'A young Danish man, Christoffer, lives a life of joy and happiness with his wife Maria in Stockholm. When his father dies his mother insists that Christoffer take over management of the family industry which is in danger of bankruptcy. He is torn between his chosen life and his sense of duty to his family and its past. When he chooses to step in as manager his family life and self-respect languish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPRNBFoKpuhvwOfguCAka3fIrTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15824'),
  ('529449511323190015', 'The Inheritance', 2024, 'Horror', 'Alejandro Brugués, Vincent De Paula, Kirsty Graham', 'Joe Russo, Chris LaMont', 'Bob Gunton, Peyton List, Briana Middleton, Rachel Nichols, Austin Stowell, David Walton, Reese Alexander, Keith Arbuthnot', null, 'Billionaire Charles Abernathy, on the eve of his 75th birthday, invites his four estranged children back home out of fear that tonight someone – or something – is coming to kill him. To ensure his family will help protect him from whatever’s coming, Abernathy puts each of their inheritances on the line – they’ll get nothing if he’s found dead by dawn.', 'Billionaire Charles Abernathy, on the eve of his 75th birthday, invites his four estranged children back home out of fear that tonight someone – or something – is coming to kill him. To ensure his family will help protect him from whatever’s coming, Abernathy puts each of their inheritances on the line – they’ll get nothing if he’s found dead by dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qQok7BPKVcM0DA9Zu5OeMzzmk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821499'),
  ('577926416975239378', 'The Inheritance or Fuckoffguysgoodday', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Věra Chytilová, Ervín Sanders, Stanislav Čumbál Rovný', 'Bolek Polívka, Věra Chytilová', 'Bolek Polívka, Miroslav Donutil, Ivana Chýlková, Anna Pantůčková, Dagmar Havlová Veškrnová, Šárka Vojtková, Pavel Zatloukal, Břetislav Rychlík', null, 'Bohus is indolent and spends his days drinking brandy. One day he finds he has inherited a brickworks, several shops and a five-star hotel. Bohus sets out to tour his new empire, insulting everyone on the way.', 'Bohus is indolent and spends his days drinking brandy. One day he finds he has inherited a brickworks, several shops and a five-star hotel. Bohus sets out to tour his new empire, insulting everyone on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AZZnvDakfZoMO0cUdrZeaaU0kS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40573'),
  ('89106828724618310', 'The Inheritor', 1973, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Philippe Labro, Jean Penzer', 'Philippe Labro', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Carla Gravina, Jean Rochefort, Charles Denner, Jean Desailly, Jean Martin, Maurice Garrel, Pierre Grasset', null, 'After his father is killed in a plane crash, Bart Cordell returns back home to France to claim his inheritance: to lead the industrial empire his father built. But when a prostitute tries to set him up for a drug smuggling charge, he is forced to accept that his father may have been assassinated and that the killers are out to get him as well...', 'After his father is killed in a plane crash, Bart Cordell returns back home to France to claim his inheritance: to lead the industrial empire his father built. But when a prostitute tries to set him up for a drug smuggling charge, he is forced to accept that his father may have been assassinated and that the killers are out to get him as well...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2t1mD2WoOHcT9lqkzmRZ3zwiSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57194'),
  ('227651110629254616', 'The Inheritors', 1983, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Walter Bannert, Hanus Polak', 'Walter Bannert', 'Nikolas Vogel, Wolfgang Gasser, Kurt Jaggberg, Alexander Wussow, Rudi Schippel, Roger Schauer, Anneliese Stöckl-Eberhard, Jaromír Borek', null, 'A neo-Nazi organization is recruiting in the 1980s, and two youths of high-school age join for similar reasons, despite class differences. Thomas is the son of a self-made industrialist father and a scolding social-climbing mother. He attends private school and has a brother who''s an accomplished musician, but neither can satisfy mom''s constant demands for school and social success. She belittles them, and there''s incessant bickering at their table. Charly, a dropout, is the son of an abusive, alcoholic laborer. In the youth group, each finds order, respect, camaraderie, and adults who seem to value them. Where do domestic abuse and sanctioned political violence end?', 'A neo-Nazi organization is recruiting in the 1980s, and two youths of high-school age join for similar reasons, despite class differences. Thomas is the son of a self-made industrialist father and a scolding social-climbing mother. He attends private school and has a brother who''s an accomplished musician, but neither can satisfy mom''s constant demands for school and social success. She belittles them, and there''s incessant bickering at their table. Charly, a dropout, is the son of an abusive, alcoholic laborer. In the youth group, each finds order, respect, camaraderie, and adults who seem to value them. Where do domestic abuse and sanctioned political violence end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Gv5bWQa6PQL21fD2Y2XkVkga0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42126'),
  ('176285973812173643', 'The Inheritors', 1998, 'Drama', 'Peter von Haller, Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Simon Schwarz, Sophie Rois, Lars Rudolph, Tilo Prückner, Ulrich Wildgruber, Julia Gschnitzer, Elisabeth Orth, Werner Prinz', 'R', 'In a small farming valley in Austria in the beginning of the 20th century a tyrannical farmer is found dead, and all the farmhands are relieved to be free of their tyrant. But the farmer was childless, so suddenly they all inherit the farm together. Now conflicts begin, as nobody is the boss and nobody has to obey.', 'In a small farming valley in Austria in the beginning of the 20th century a tyrannical farmer is found dead, and all the farmhands are relieved to be free of their tyrant. But the farmer was childless, so suddenly they all inherit the farm together. Now conflicts begin, as nobody is the boss and nobody has to obey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6aCatHljw795MLscZwW1gYtOu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039'),
  ('84766195686240445', 'The Inhuman Woman', 1924, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Marcel L''Herbier, Philippe Hériat, Roche', 'Marcel L''Herbier, Pierre Mac Orlan, Georgette Leblanc', 'Georgette Leblanc, Jaque Catelain, Léonid Walter de Malte, Fred Kellerman, Philippe Hériat, Marcelle Pradot, Kiki of Montparnasse, Lili Samuel', null, 'A famous singer Claire Lescot, who lives on the outskirts of Paris, is courted by many men, including a maharajah, Djorah de Nopur, and a young Swedish scientist, Einar Norsen. At her lavish parties she enjoys their amorous attentions but she remains emotionally aloof and heartlessly taunts them. When she is told that Norsen has killed himself because of her, she shows no feelings. At her next concert she is booed by an audience outraged at her coldness and she decides to visit the vault in which Norsen''s body lies.', 'A famous singer Claire Lescot, who lives on the outskirts of Paris, is courted by many men, including a maharajah, Djorah de Nopur, and a young Swedish scientist, Einar Norsen. At her lavish parties she enjoys their amorous attentions but she remains emotionally aloof and heartlessly taunts them. When she is told that Norsen has killed himself because of her, she shows no feelings. At her next concert she is booed by an audience outraged at her coldness and she decides to visit the vault in which Norsen''s body lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOr8W7pos3WOTcHBrUKnzkGJdGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54539'),
  ('1984356888064850', 'The Initiated', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Juan Felipe Orozco, Camilo Monsalve, Andrés Barrientos', 'Esteban Orozco, Nicolás Serrano', 'Andrés Parra, Aria Jara, Juan Pablo Urrego, Jorge Cao, Francisco Denis, Julio Pachón, Silvia Santamaría, Ana Wills', null, 'Based on the novels by Colombian writer Mario Mendoza and on the character of detective Frank Molina, the filming of Los Initiados took place in Bogotá. In the saga of Frank Molina, which uses the books Lady Massacre, La melancolia de los feos, El diario del fin del mundo and Akelarre, the story of an alcoholic private investigator who unmasks sinister plots within the underworld of Bogotá is told.', 'Based on the novels by Colombian writer Mario Mendoza and on the character of detective Frank Molina, the filming of Los Initiados took place in Bogotá. In the saga of Frank Molina, which uses the books Lady Massacre, La melancolia de los feos, El diario del fin del mundo and Akelarre, the story of an alcoholic private investigator who unmasks sinister plots within the underworld of Bogotá is told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xcxeh9BBWlEMrbdCssMljb0Yui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1133923'),
  ('1021437667668759258', 'The Initiated: Written from the Shadows', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Carlos Moreno', null, 'Andrés Parra, Ángela Cano, Christian Tappán, Cristina Umaña, Jorge Cao, Patricia Tamayo, Jimena Durán, Francisco Denis', null, 'The formerly revered journalist Frank Molina finds himself in hiding, with his career shattered. However, he continues to write anonymously hidden in the shadows. Frank’s sense of calm is abruptly interrupted when a pair of severed eyes and a blood-soaked note appear at his door. As the number of victims increases, Frank will need to unblock his traumatic past if he seeks to find the killer.', 'The formerly revered journalist Frank Molina finds himself in hiding, with his career shattered. However, he continues to write anonymously hidden in the shadows. Frank’s sense of calm is abruptly interrupted when a pair of severed eyes and a blood-soaked note appear at his door. As the number of victims increases, Frank will need to unblock his traumatic past if he seeks to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6340ZG3qHfS7q8ES5rwf4AQ0U1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362648'),
  ('715498997828211775', 'The Initiation', 1984, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Larry Stewart, George Tirl, John M. Colwell', 'Charles Pratt, Jr.', 'Vera Miles, Clu Gulager, Daphne Zuniga, James Read, Marilyn Kagan, Robert Dowdell, Patti Heider, Frances Peterson', 'R', 'An amnesiac sorority member who has been plagued by a recurring nightmare is stalked alongside other coeds by a killer in a deserted department store where they are completing a hazing ritual.', 'An amnesiac sorority member who has been plagued by a recurring nightmare is stalked alongside other coeds by a killer in a deserted department store where they are completing a hazing ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fO5wtb8CIrYNTzq8wJ3ZjowMFuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63360'),
  ('615701721619577283', 'The Initiation of Sarah', 1978, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Robert Day, Ric Waite', null, 'Kay Lenz, Shelley Winters, Tony Bill, Kathryn Grant, Morgan Fairchild, Morgan Brittany, Robert Hays, Tisa Farrow', null, 'Shy misfit Sarah Goodwin has a secret gift: the ability to control — and destroy — with her mind. When Sarah goes off to college with her more outgoing and popular sister, Patty, their plans to join the most prestigious sorority on campus are scuttled by snobby president, Jennifer Lawrence. Separated from her sister, Sarah is taken in by a rival, less popular sorority, whose mysterious house mother, Mrs. Hunter, is harboring a secret of her own: a scheme to harness Sarah''s terrifying power for revenge. Betrayed by Patty, humiliated by Jennifer, it can only be a matter of time before Sorority Hell Week erupts in flame!', 'Shy misfit Sarah Goodwin has a secret gift: the ability to control — and destroy — with her mind. When Sarah goes off to college with her more outgoing and popular sister, Patty, their plans to join the most prestigious sorority on campus are scuttled by snobby president, Jennifer Lawrence. Separated from her sister, Sarah is taken in by a rival, less popular sorority, whose mysterious house mother, Mrs. Hunter, is harboring a secret of her own: a scheme to harness Sarah''s terrifying power for revenge. Betrayed by Patty, humiliated by Jennifer, it can only be a matter of time before Sorority Hell Week erupts in flame!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scDcr5mSsV3OGKWKGH7Bxkefgz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23692'),
  ('621475464375053064', 'The Initiation of Sarah', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Stuart Gillard, Manfred Guthe, Ann C. Salzer', null, 'Mika Boorem, Summer Glau, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Tessa Thompson, Morgan Fairchild, Jennifer Tilly, Amber Brooke, Caitlin Wehrle', null, 'A sorority girl unwittingly becomes the focus of a battle between good and evil.', 'A sorority girl unwittingly becomes the focus of a battle between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEKsxnAzllNBIL1OaI7NWnxqYdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23691'),
  ('851944846622798765', 'The Inkwell', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matty Rich, John L. Demps Jr.', 'Paris Qualles, Trey Ellis', 'Larenz Tate, Joe Morton, Suzzanne Douglas, Glynn Turman, Vanessa Bell Calloway, A.J. Johnson, Morris Chestnut, Jada Pinkett Smith', 'R', 'The Inkwell is about a 16-year-old boy coming of age on Martha''s Vineyard in the summer of 1976.', 'The Inkwell is about a 16-year-old boy coming of age on Martha''s Vineyard in the summer of 1976.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5qUq9l6ci9KzzAqYhpdxzjY7qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59930'),
  ('87868161296960171', 'The Inn of the Sixth Happiness', 1958, 'War, Drama', 'Mark Robson, David Middlemas, Freddie Young', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Ingrid Bergman, Curd Jürgens, Burt Kwouk, Robert Donat, Tsai Chin, Richard Wattis, Athene Seyler, Ronald Squire', 'NR', 'All her life, Englishwoman Gladys Aylward knew that China was the place where she belonged. Not qualified to be sent there as a missionary, Gladys works as a domestic to earn the money to send herself to a poor, remote village. There she eventually lives a full and happy life: running the inn, acting as "foot inspector", advising the local Mandarin, and even winning the heart of mixed race Captain Lin Nan. But Gladys discovers her real destiny when the country is invaded by Japan and the Chinese children need her to save their lives. Based on a true story.', 'All her life, Englishwoman Gladys Aylward knew that China was the place where she belonged. Not qualified to be sent there as a missionary, Gladys works as a domestic to earn the money to send herself to a poor, remote village. There she eventually lives a full and happy life: running the inn, acting as "foot inspector", advising the local Mandarin, and even winning the heart of mixed race Captain Lin Nan. But Gladys discovers her real destiny when the country is invaded by Japan and the Chinese children need her to save their lives. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSkuoH1e3pUO2sbwESHqq2CNPel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37451'),
  ('1098938384078421430', 'The Inn on the River', 1962, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Gerhard F. Hummel, Harald G. Petersson, Egon Eis', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Brigitte Grothum, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Klaus Kinski, Eddi Arent, Richard Münch, Jan Hendriks, Heinz Engelmann', null, 'A serial killer named The Shark is terrorizing London by killing his victims with a speargun and then, dressed in a scruba-diver''s wetsuit, using the city''s sewer tunnels to make his getaway.', 'A serial killer named The Shark is terrorizing London by killing his victims with a speargun and then, dressed in a scruba-diver''s wetsuit, using the city''s sewer tunnels to make his getaway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiWm7y8AKNHztxwfPJTlkYGAWsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6585'),
  ('6995325610469360', 'The Inn Where No Man Rests', 1903, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A traveller is shown to a room in an inn. After a brief dispute with the hostess and a porter, he is left to himself. But strange things begin to happen in his room, and before long he has created a disturbance that has everyone running to his room to find out what is going on.', 'A traveller is shown to a room in an inn. After a brief dispute with the hostess and a porter, he is left to himself. But strange things begin to happen in his room, and before long he has created a disturbance that has everyone running to his room to find out what is going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IsRtsQdwb45h4GQFptqTQKYTlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114143'),
  ('116782360316810900', 'The Inner Cage', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Maria Putorti, Laura Iandolo, Massimo Loi', 'Valia Santella, Bruno Oliviero, Leonardo Di Costanzo', 'Toni Servillo, Silvio Orlando, Fabrizio Ferracane, Salvatore Striano, Roberto De Francesco, Pietro Giuliano, Nicola Sechi, Leonardo Capuano', null, 'A prison drama where an old mobster and a prison guard must find a way to coexist so that imprisonment can become less so, and perhaps reveal the paradox that is behind the very concept of captivity.', 'A prison drama where an old mobster and a prison guard must find a way to coexist so that imprisonment can become less so, and perhaps reveal the paradox that is behind the very concept of captivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT8cjGXzdSUe8CV2tnfY4wVT6zX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768331'),
