  ('188982064544817064', 'The Inner Circle', 1992, 'Drama, History', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Anatoli Usov, Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Tom Hulce, Lolita Davidovich, Bob Hoskins, Aleksandr Zbruev, Feodor Chaliapin Jr., Bess Meyer, Mariya Baranova, Irina Kupchenko', 'PG-13', 'Life changes for a Moscow worker when he''s made Stalin''s personal film projectionist but cannot tell his bride.', 'Life changes for a Moscow worker when he''s made Stalin''s personal film projectionist but cannot tell his bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qruy6W5qwn7nBLRXAawfphNuPbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73376'),
