  ('845685953737145096', 'The Innocents', 1987, 'Drama', 'André Téchiné, Renato Berta', 'Pascal Bonitzer, André Téchiné', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Jean-Claude Brialy, Simon de La Brosse, Abdellatif Kechiche, Tanya Lopert, Jacques Nolot, Christine Paolini, Marthe Villalonga', null, 'A woman becomes trapped in the middle of a feud between two men while attempting to free her younger brother from a life of petty crime.', 'A woman becomes trapped in the middle of a feud between two men while attempting to free her younger brother from a life of petty crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vfoq3Y5lG96NiDkgjfJsBjVICu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65615'),
  ('51705378721368217', 'The Innocents', 2015, 'Horror', 'Mauricio Brunetti', 'Mauricio Brunetti, Natacha Caravia, Andrés Gelós', 'Beatriz Spelzini, Lito Cruz, Ludovico Di Santo, Sabrina Garciarena, María Eugenia Arboleda, María Nela Sinisterra, Stella Delphino, Tomás Diaz', null, '19th century Argentina. After having had to leave the country fifteen years ago, prodigal son Rodrigo finally returns to the family farm in Mercedaria to introduce his wife Bianca to his parents. He’s not really looking forward to this family reunion. His youth was spent working with the slaves on the farm who were treated without mercy by his parents. His father regularly abused the female slaves, while his mother even burned one alive to save the family honor. It’s time for some ghostly revenge and this happens to coincide with Rodrigo’s return.', '19th century Argentina. After having had to leave the country fifteen years ago, prodigal son Rodrigo finally returns to the family farm in Mercedaria to introduce his wife Bianca to his parents. He’s not really looking forward to this family reunion. His youth was spent working with the slaves on the farm who were treated without mercy by his parents. His father regularly abused the female slaves, while his mother even burned one alive to save the family honor. It’s time for some ghostly revenge and this happens to coincide with Rodrigo’s return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5O3vRNS3FMz9Ox2gxL8LoYe7YR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381994'),
  ('33878050361248062', 'The Innocents', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Anne Fontaine, Caroline Champetier, Bogusław Bielański', 'Sabrina B. Karine, Alice Vial', 'Lou de Laâge, Agata Buzek, Agata Kulesza, Vincent Macaigne, Joanna Kulig, Eliza Rycembel, Katarzyna Dąbrowska, Anna Próchniak', 'PG-13', 'Poland, 1945. Mathilde, a young French Red Cross doctor, is on a mission to help the war survivors. When a nun seeks for her help, she is brought to a convent where several pregnant sisters are hiding, unable to reconcile their faith with their pregnancy. Mathilde becomes their only hope.', 'Poland, 1945. Mathilde, a young French Red Cross doctor, is on a mission to help the war survivors. When a nun seeks for her help, she is brought to a convent where several pregnant sisters are hiding, unable to reconcile their faith with their pregnancy. Mathilde becomes their only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZSPkyzq80jBVezRlC80kvV6QZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364051'),
  ('617391763137629887', 'The Innocents', 2021, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Ida Neerbye, Eskil Vogt, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Eskil Vogt', 'Rakel Lenora Fløttum, Alva Brynsmo Ramstad, Sam Ashraf, Mina Yasmin Bremseth Asheim, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Morten Svartveit, Kadra Yusuf, Lisa Tønne', null, 'Four children become friends during the summer holidays, and out of sight of the adults they discover they have hidden powers. While exploring their newfound abilities in the nearby forests and playgrounds, their innocent play takes a dark turn and strange things begin to happen.', 'Four children become friends during the summer holidays, and out of sight of the adults they discover they have hidden powers. While exploring their newfound abilities in the nearby forests and playgrounds, their innocent play takes a dark turn and strange things begin to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqvkxOLmnHgDOqZlT7GgMWEQViR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660942'),
