  ('485226213996713220', 'The Inquisitor', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Miller, Bruno Nuytten, Jean-Pierre Vergne', 'Claude Miller, Jean Herman', 'Lino Ventura, Michel Serrault, Romy Schneider, Guy Marchand, Pierre Maguelon, Serge Malik, Jean-Claude Penchenat, Yves Pignot', null, 'Martinaud, an illustrious notary suspected of being the perpetrator of two horrendous crimes, voluntarily agrees to be questioned by Inspector Gallien on New Year''s Eve. What initially is a routine procedure, soon becomes a harsh interrogation that seems to confirm the initial suspicions.', 'Martinaud, an illustrious notary suspected of being the perpetrator of two horrendous crimes, voluntarily agrees to be questioned by Inspector Gallien on New Year''s Eve. What initially is a routine procedure, soon becomes a harsh interrogation that seems to confirm the initial suspicions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bl8tgNFtaZ3joXNi2eEl5kDtFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5062'),
  ('399386345148395443', 'The Insanity', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Rao Xiaozhi, Liu Yin', 'Lei Zhilong, Rao Xiaozhi', 'Wan Qian, Zhou Yiwei, Wang Zijian, King Shih-chieh, Li Hongchen, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Liang-Tso Liu, Cao Weiyu', null, 'Seven people are confined into a lunatic asylum strangely, everyone tries his/her best to attest his/her normality.', 'Seven people are confined into a lunatic asylum strangely, everyone tries his/her best to attest his/her normality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpyzaw4hnyeffmJVgpgcvP5Rz99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445303'),
  ('288677893221859427', 'The Insatiable', 1971, 'Drama', 'Norifumi Suzuki, Tomômi Yoda', 'Norifumi Suzuki', 'Reiko Ike, Sandra Julien, Hiroshi Miyauchi, Yōko Mihara, Miki Sugimoto, Miwako Onaya, Keishiro Kojima, Masazumi Okabe', null, 'Yuki Onozaki, who was studying at a Women''s College in Tokyo, was originally a young and ignorant girl, but her life changed completely in the summer of a certain year. During the summer vacation, Yuki returned to her hometown of Kyoto, only to be raped by the lover of her mother. Yuki then abandoned her studies and chose a depraved life. She met the gang leader Kiyoshi Oba and factory industrialists. Although these men could give her more or less physical comfort, they could not open Yuki''s locked heart. It was not until the appearance of the young architect Yoichiro Honma that Yuki''s love flower gradually bloomed. Soon, Yoichiro''s first love while studying in France, Sandra, finds her, which makes Yuki''s heart surge. After several twists and turns, Yoichiro decided to marry Yuki, but the trials never stopped...', 'Yuki Onozaki, who was studying at a Women''s College in Tokyo, was originally a young and ignorant girl, but her life changed completely in the summer of a certain year. During the summer vacation, Yuki returned to her hometown of Kyoto, only to be raped by the lover of her mother. Yuki then abandoned her studies and chose a depraved life. She met the gang leader Kiyoshi Oba and factory industrialists. Although these men could give her more or less physical comfort, they could not open Yuki''s locked heart. It was not until the appearance of the young architect Yoichiro Honma that Yuki''s love flower gradually bloomed. Soon, Yoichiro''s first love while studying in France, Sandra, finds her, which makes Yuki''s heart surge. After several twists and turns, Yoichiro decided to marry Yuki, but the trials never stopped...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXJU9fwYTMtsGRzjldFlTRSRk9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143638'),
  ('234251667005679589', 'The Insatiable', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance', 'Chuck Konzelman, Cary Solomon, Mike Washlesky', 'Chuck Konzelman, Cary Solomon, J.R. McGarrity', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Michael Biehn, Charlotte Ayanna, Jon Huertas, Josh Hopkins, Boyd Kestner, Brad Rowe, Amanda Noret', 'PG-13', 'A drab, run-of-the-mill guy witnesses a vampiress devour a bum and becomes so infatuated with her, he tracks her down and traps her in a basement so she can''t kill again.', 'A drab, run-of-the-mill guy witnesses a vampiress devour a bum and becomes so infatuated with her, he tracks her down and traps her in a basement so she can''t kill again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HZqIELULJb13CINWARpn06N8YA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32220'),
  ('150620221625881401', 'The Insect Woman', 1963, 'Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Tadahiko Isomi, Shinsaku Himeda', 'Shōhei Imamura, Keiji Hasebe', 'Sachiko Hidari, Jitsuko Yoshimura, Shoichi Ozawa, Hiroyuki Nagato, Kayoko Honoo, Masumi Harukawa, Emiko Aizawa, Emiko Higashi', 'NR', 'A woman, Tome, is born to a lower class family in Japan in 1918. The title refers to an insect, repeating its mistakes, as in an infinite circle. Imamura, with this metaphor, introduces the life of Tome, who keeps trying to change her poor life.', 'A woman, Tome, is born to a lower class family in Japan in 1918. The title refers to an insect, repeating its mistakes, as in an infinite circle. Imamura, with this metaphor, introduces the life of Tome, who keeps trying to change her poor life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIY9Phiuk1rQOSpXLe4d4j0Msd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42984'),
  ('22060141443437418', 'The Inseparables', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Jérémie Degruson', 'Cal Brunker, Bob Barlen, Jérémie Degruson', 'Monica Young, Danny Fehsenfeld, Olivier Paris, Dakota West, Jordan Baird, Art Brown, Donte Paris', 'G', 'The animated buddy movie follows the misadventures of Don, a runaway puppet with boundless imaginations, and DJ Doggy Dog, an abandoned plush looking for a friend, who cross paths in Central Park and team up against all odds for a epic friendship adventure in New York.', 'The animated buddy movie follows the misadventures of Don, a runaway puppet with boundless imaginations, and DJ Doggy Dog, an abandoned plush looking for a friend, who cross paths in Central Park and team up against all odds for a epic friendship adventure in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmftU2Rnmv9KTteMUwjalOuZHke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059264'),
  ('651855326426476266', 'The Inside Man', 1984, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Tom Clegg, Jörgen Persson', 'Alan Plater', 'Dennis Hopper, Hardy Krüger, Gösta Ekman, Kåre Mölder, David Wilson, Celia Gregory, Lena Endre, Per Mattsson', null, 'In 1981, after the successful test of a submarine tracker device developed by the Swedish scientist Paul Mandell and sponsored by the US government through his representative Miller, his industry is totally burned and the laser device is stolen. Stig Larsson from the Swedish Secret Agency suspects of an inside job and brings the Swedish Marine Thomas Kallin to investigate Paul undercover as his driver. The naive Kallin is double-crossed but continues his investigation while Larsson finds the truth about the heist.', 'In 1981, after the successful test of a submarine tracker device developed by the Swedish scientist Paul Mandell and sponsored by the US government through his representative Miller, his industry is totally burned and the laser device is stolen. Stig Larsson from the Swedish Secret Agency suspects of an inside job and brings the Swedish Marine Thomas Kallin to investigate Paul undercover as his driver. The naive Kallin is double-crossed but continues his investigation while Larsson finds the truth about the heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD6h41uNijH3u0FVnN0cKXbCMDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31295'),
  ('861355924569623451', 'The Insider', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Mann, Dante Spinotti, Erik Olson', 'Eric Roth, Michael Mann', 'Al Pacino, Russell Crowe, Christopher Plummer, Diane Venora, Philip Baker Hall, Lindsay Crouse, Debi Mazar, Stephen Tobolowsky', 'R', 'A research chemist comes under personal and professional attack when he decides to appear in a 60 Minutes exposé on Big Tobacco.', 'A research chemist comes under personal and professional attack when he decides to appear in a 60 Minutes exposé on Big Tobacco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJCyIBPfvk41uETq6K6u4upyGO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9008'),
  ('711476695775779962', 'The Insomnia Club', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Iván Vilchis Ibarra, Sergio Goyri Jr., Joseduardo Giordano', 'Joseduardo Giordano, Sergio Goyri Jr.', 'Cassandra Ciangherotti, Alejandra Ambrosi, Leonardo Ortizgris, Humberto Busto, Fernando Becerril, Alexandra de la Mora, Mónica Dionne, Fernando Luján', 'PG-13', 'Three people with insomnia get together at a supermarket where they share their experiences.', 'Three people with insomnia get together at a supermarket where they share their experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c58nNHhaewdDmGY4VBtheKOIfkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347009'),
  ('285660654674523054', 'The Inspection', 2022, 'Drama', 'Elegance Bratton, Lachlan Milne, Daniel Ornitz', 'Elegance Bratton', 'Jeremy Pope, Gabrielle Union, Bokeem Woodbine, Raúl Castillo, McCaul Lombardi, Nicholas Logan, Eman Esfandi, Aaron Dominguez', 'R', 'Ellis French is a young, gay Black man, rejected by his mother and with few options for his future, decides to join the Marines, doing whatever it takes to succeed in a system that would cast him aside. But even as he battles deep-seated prejudice and the grueling routines of basic training, he finds unexpected camaraderie, strength, and support in this new community, giving him a hard-earned sense of belonging that will shape his identity and forever change his life.', 'Ellis French is a young, gay Black man, rejected by his mother and with few options for his future, decides to join the Marines, doing whatever it takes to succeed in a system that would cast him aside. But even as he battles deep-seated prejudice and the grueling routines of basic training, he finds unexpected camaraderie, strength, and support in this new community, giving him a hard-earned sense of belonging that will shape his identity and forever change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7m962Crc1p4C4gM6ZJBArAikM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837938'),
  ('25297568667341234', 'The Inspector', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Dunne, Charles Blair, Kip Gowans', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Stephen Boyd, Dolores Hart, Leo McKern, Hugh Griffith, Donald Pleasence, Harry Andrews, Robert Stephens, Marius Goring', null, 'At the end of WW2, a compassionate Dutch policeman helps smuggle a Jewish woman into British Palestine.', 'At the end of WW2, a compassionate Dutch policeman helps smuggle a Jewish woman into British Palestine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41sxpuxo4U4baj5TK5ap8NliBMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183247'),
  ('988064225073646453', 'The Inspector General', 1949, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Elwood Bredell, Arthur Lueker', 'Harry Kurnitz, Philip Rapp', 'Danny Kaye, Walter Slezak, Barbara Bates, Elsa Lanchester, Gene Lockhart, Alan Hale, Walter Catlett, Rhys Williams', 'NR', 'An illiterate stooge in a traveling medicine show wanders into a strange town and is picked up on a vagrancy charge. The town''s corrupt officials mistake him for the inspector general whom they think is traveling in disguise. Fearing he will discover they''ve been pocketing tax money, they make several bungled attempts to kill him.', 'An illiterate stooge in a traveling medicine show wanders into a strange town and is picked up on a vagrancy charge. The town''s corrupt officials mistake him for the inspector general whom they think is traveling in disguise. Fearing he will discover they''ve been pocketing tax money, they make several bungled attempts to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEseNGrq1lSdomjayEflNn0xjaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40206'),
  ('888763935875566472', 'The Inspector Wears Skirts', 1988, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Rocky Lai Keung-Ken, Kwan Yiu-Wing', 'Cheng Kam-Fu', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Ann Bridgewater, Regina Kent, Ellen Chan Nga-Lun, Lee Pooi-Ling', null, 'The film revolves around a crack squad of female police officers who have to deal with harassment and a lack of respect from their male colleagues, personal issues, as well as some serious criminals.', 'The film revolves around a crack squad of female police officers who have to deal with harassment and a lack of respect from their male colleagues, personal issues, as well as some serious criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iArllGjB61rjqyCFP0o2F9yu2Vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68868'),
  ('1043341826880350154', 'The Inspector Wears Skirts II', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Cheung Yiu-Cho', 'Abe Kwong Man-Wai, Lee Man-Choi', 'Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, May Lo Mei-Wei, Regina Kent, Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Joanna Chan, Tiffany Lau Yuk-Ting', null, 'Four new Banshee Squad Members join the Hong Kong Police Academy to undergo training supervised by Madam Wu. Their personalities don''t click with the current Squad Members, resulting in petty arguments and duels. However, they later make peace with one another as they join the Tiger Squad Members, supervised by Inspector Kan, to undergo new training courses together and combine forces to take down a band of terrorists.', 'Four new Banshee Squad Members join the Hong Kong Police Academy to undergo training supervised by Madam Wu. Their personalities don''t click with the current Squad Members, resulting in petty arguments and duels. However, they later make peace with one another as they join the Tiger Squad Members, supervised by Inspector Kan, to undergo new training courses together and combine forces to take down a band of terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1ImpiqX7EgwHRhPw66cEgQchW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80606'),
  ('90394094777685853', 'The Inspector-General', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Vladimir Petrov, Vakhtang Shvelidze, Yuri Yekelchik', 'Vladimir Petrov', 'Igor Gorbachyov, Anastasiya Georgiyevskaya, Tamara Nosova, Aleksandr Polinskiy, Yuriy Tolubeev, Elena Ponsova, Ivan Ryzhov, Anatoliy Kubatskiy', null, 'Khlestakov is a young flamboyant crook, who is broke. He finds himself in a small Russian town, where local authorities are waiting for an undercover inspector from the capital St. Petersburg. Khlestakov is mistaken for an undercover inspector, and uses the situation for taking bribes from the local governor and flirting with both his wife and daughter. Khlestakov abuses the corruption and hypocrisy of the local authorities until, at the end, the real inspector shows up...', 'Khlestakov is a young flamboyant crook, who is broke. He finds himself in a small Russian town, where local authorities are waiting for an undercover inspector from the capital St. Petersburg. Khlestakov is mistaken for an undercover inspector, and uses the situation for taking bribes from the local governor and flirting with both his wife and daughter. Khlestakov abuses the corruption and hypocrisy of the local authorities until, at the end, the real inspector shows up...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YmbVqkj5LX0QJPLCQ06VYB8LsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295108'),
  ('195295179393613979', 'The Inspectors', 1998, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Brad Turner, Albert J. Dunk', 'Bruce Zimmerman', 'Louis Gossett Jr., Jonathan Silverman, Samantha Ferris, Ty Olsson, Tobias Mehler, Greg Thirloway, JR Bourne, Shaun Johnston', 'NR', 'U.S Postal Inspectors are called in when a suburban couple are killed by a mail bomb. Suspicion immediately falls on the couple''s estranged and heavily in debt son, who also just happens to be a Navy munitions expert. But investigations reveal that he is on the run from a past event in his life that is associated with the bombings.', 'U.S Postal Inspectors are called in when a suburban couple are killed by a mail bomb. Suspicion immediately falls on the couple''s estranged and heavily in debt son, who also just happens to be a Navy munitions expert. But investigations reveal that he is on the run from a past event in his life that is associated with the bombings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/py4FOsOlGcYuYs1v7VEXjSMnMOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247695'),
  ('342495561108517418', 'The Instigators', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Doug Liman, Henry Braham, Josh Muzaffer', 'Chuck MacLean, Casey Affleck', 'Matt Damon, Casey Affleck, Ving Rhames, Jack Harlow, Michael Stuhlbarg, Alfred Molina, Owen Earls, Hong Chau', 'R', 'Rory and Cobby are unlikely partners thrown together for a heist. But when it goes awry, they team up with an unusual accomplice — Rory''s therapist — to outrun police, backward bureaucrats, and a vengeful crime boss.', 'Rory and Cobby are unlikely partners thrown together for a heist. But when it goes awry, they team up with an unusual accomplice — Rory''s therapist — to outrun police, backward bureaucrats, and a vengeful crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnYWsIFDmygCjNg65rY3uBymx81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059064'),
  ('950751456787911274', 'The Institute', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Pamela Romanowsky, James Franco', 'Matt Rager, Adam Rager', 'Allie Gallerani, James Franco, Joe Pease, Scott Haze, Lori Singer, Amber Viera, Val Lauren, Zoë Bleu Sidel', 'R', 'In 19th century Baltimore, Isabel Porter, a girl stricken with grief from her parents'' untimely death, voluntarily checks herself into the Rosewood Institute. Subjected to bizarre and increasingly violent pseudo-scientific experiments in personality modification, brainwashing and mind control, she must escape the clutches of the Rosewood and exact her revenge, or else be forever lost.', 'In 19th century Baltimore, Isabel Porter, a girl stricken with grief from her parents'' untimely death, voluntarily checks herself into the Rosewood Institute. Subjected to bizarre and increasingly violent pseudo-scientific experiments in personality modification, brainwashing and mind control, she must escape the clutches of the Rosewood and exact her revenge, or else be forever lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Gg6p1nTwklozFWnPr0YvSAekan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416166'),
