  ('116737891709685956', 'The Interrogation of Michael Crowe', 2002, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Don McBrearty, Rhett Morita', 'Alan Hines', 'Ally Sheedy, Mark Rendall, John Bourgeois, Hannah Lochner, Andre Noble, Rosemary Dunsmore, Karl Pruner, Michael Riley', 'G', 'When 12-year-old Stephanie Crowe is brutally murdered at her home in her small home town, the authorities foolishly jump to conclusions that her 14-year-old brother Michael must be responsible. They completely ignore strong evidence that suggests another suspect is the one. They work hard to force Michael to falsely confess to what he did not do, in order to avoid tougher investigation.', 'When 12-year-old Stephanie Crowe is brutally murdered at her home in her small home town, the authorities foolishly jump to conclusions that her 14-year-old brother Michael must be responsible. They completely ignore strong evidence that suggests another suspect is the one. They work hard to force Michael to falsely confess to what he did not do, in order to avoid tougher investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LozgZP8J7NHsC8fXiq2tIfKoCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56523'),
  ('219324845243024661', 'The Interrupted Journey', 1949, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Birt, Erwin Hillier, Cecil R. Foster Kemp', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Richard Todd, Valerie Hobson, Christine Norden, Tom Walls, Alexander Gauge, Ralph Truman, Vida Hope, Dora Bryan', null, 'When John North, a budding author, pulls the communication cord of a late night train that is taking him away on a weekend with his publishers wife, he sets in motion a series of events that lead to a train crash, a murder and a police man hunt, but all is not what it seems.', 'When John North, a budding author, pulls the communication cord of a late night train that is taking him away on a weekend with his publishers wife, he sets in motion a series of events that lead to a train crash, a murder and a police man hunt, but all is not what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/273XuYzCsi4ApdZMv9KaG7UPOCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185079'),
  ('417363382171599276', 'The Interrupters', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Steve James', 'Alex Kotlowitz', 'Tio Hardiman, Ameena Matthews, Cobe Williams, Gary Slutkin, Caprysha Anderson, Eddie Bocanegra, "Lil'' Mikey" Davis', 'NR', 'The Interrupters tells the moving and surprising stories of three Violence Interrupters — former gang members who try to protect their Chicago communities from the violence they once caused.', 'The Interrupters tells the moving and surprising stories of three Violence Interrupters — former gang members who try to protect their Chicago communities from the violence they once caused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9CKFs1NhIUUcqUziBhcvkkUjwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72711'),
  ('976960079831735884', 'The Interval', 2012, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Luca Bigazzi', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Maurizio Braucci, Mariangela Barbanente', 'Francesca Riso, Alessio Gallo, Antonio Buíl, Carmine Paternoster, Salvatore Ruocco, Jean Yves Morard', null, 'A boy and a girl are locked in an enormous abandoned building in a rundown area. She is a prisoner and the local clan leader has forced him to be her warder. Despite their youth, both of them have grown up too fast. Veronica acts like a mature and open-minded woman whilst Salvatore is like a man who wants to hold on to his job and lead a quiet life. Thus, when faced with the violence of this incarceration, the two young people have different reactions: Veronica is restless and rebellious; Salvatore is more remissive and accommodating, either out of fear or realism. They are both victims but it is almost as though each blames the other for their reclusion. However, as the hours go by, their mutual hostility is transformed into an inevitable intimacy, consisting of reciprocal discoveries and confessions. Between the walls of that isolated and frightening place, Veronica and Salvatore fi nd a way to rekindle those adolescent dreams and ideas put aside too soon.', 'A boy and a girl are locked in an enormous abandoned building in a rundown area. She is a prisoner and the local clan leader has forced him to be her warder. Despite their youth, both of them have grown up too fast. Veronica acts like a mature and open-minded woman whilst Salvatore is like a man who wants to hold on to his job and lead a quiet life. Thus, when faced with the violence of this incarceration, the two young people have different reactions: Veronica is restless and rebellious; Salvatore is more remissive and accommodating, either out of fear or realism. They are both victims but it is almost as though each blames the other for their reclusion. However, as the hours go by, their mutual hostility is transformed into an inevitable intimacy, consisting of reciprocal discoveries and confessions. Between the walls of that isolated and frightening place, Veronica and Salvatore fi nd a way to rekindle those adolescent dreams and ideas put aside too soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1QqcuUn82hdjoHL1XkYYzdh2Cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128106'),
  ('1009321962839959302', 'The Intervention', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Clea DuVall, Polly Morgan', 'Clea DuVall', 'Natasha Lyonne, Cobie Smulders, Melanie Lynskey, Jason Ritter, Clea DuVall, Ben Schwartz, Vincent Piazza, Alia Shawkat', 'R', 'A weekend getaway for four couples takes a sharp turn when one of the couples discovers the entire trip was orchestrated to host an intervention on their marriage.', 'A weekend getaway for four couples takes a sharp turn when one of the couples discovers the entire trip was orchestrated to host an intervention on their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPgppin50E0pxKgL1lmKlFbhTF1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351242'),
  ('454584131723493699', 'The Interview', 1998, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Craig Monahan, Karan Monkhouse, Ed Raymond', 'Craig Monahan, Gordon Davie', 'Hugo Weaving, Tony Martin, Aaron Jeffery, Paul Sonkkila, Michael Caton, Peter McCauley, Glynis Angel, Leverne McDonnell', null, 'A duel between a suspected murderer and a detective pressed by people who want results. But whose skin is really wanted?', 'A duel between a suspected murderer and a detective pressed by people who want results. But whose skin is really wanted?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW462Tqs3pGcYFaNAAYlsfeDpcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19846'),
  ('1100972269093160691', 'The Interview', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonathan Watson, Josy Capkun, Evan Goldberg', 'Dan Sterling', 'James Franco, Seth Rogen, Lizzy Caplan, Randall Park, Diana Bang, Timothy Simons, Reese Alexander, James Yi', 'R', 'Dave Skylark and his producer Aaron Rapaport run the celebrity tabloid show "Skylark Tonight". When they land an interview with a surprise fan, North Korean dictator Kim Jong-un, they are recruited by the CIA to turn their trip to Pyongyang into an assassination mission.', 'Dave Skylark and his producer Aaron Rapaport run the celebrity tabloid show "Skylark Tonight". When they land an interview with a surprise fan, North Korean dictator Kim Jong-un, they are recruited by the CIA to turn their trip to Pyongyang into an assassination mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIDC4xT65l7a8qbgg8GvwD5g8c5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228967'),
  ('314782473075280703', 'The Intimate', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Eun-tae', 'Chang-hun Yun', 'Sung Hyun-ah, Cho Dong-hyuk, Kim Ye-ryeong, Ji Dae-han, Kil Hae-yeon, Park Se-jin', null, 'Her lover has never taken a dangerous risk in his life. She has been for seven years and is going to get married next month. One day she meets a handsome stranger, who asked her to spend one day with him. It might be a mistake to accept his proposal, but over the next day she will experience a level of excitement and intimacy, she has never experienced before, and this could change her life all of sudden.', 'Her lover has never taken a dangerous risk in his life. She has been for seven years and is going to get married next month. One day she meets a handsome stranger, who asked her to spend one day with him. It might be a mistake to accept his proposal, but over the next day she will experience a level of excitement and intimacy, she has never experienced before, and this could change her life all of sudden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2V783yXuFOHW0FSCg4fvufs2iBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142093'),
  ('393088384280893960', 'The Intimate Stranger', 1956, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Joseph Losey, Gerald Gibbs', 'Howard Koch', 'Richard Basehart, Mary Murphy, Constance Cummings, Roger Livesey, Faith Brook, Mervyn Johns', 'NR', 'Film producer Reggie Wilson is worried he may have a dual personality. Fleeing Hollywood, he finds himself in England and married to the studio boss''s daughter after which he quickly rises through the studio ranks. Then the letters begin to appear from a lovesick American actress who wants to know why he has thrown her over.', 'Film producer Reggie Wilson is worried he may have a dual personality. Fleeing Hollywood, he finds himself in England and married to the studio boss''s daughter after which he quickly rises through the studio ranks. Then the letters begin to appear from a lovesick American actress who wants to know why he has thrown her over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMUygxrJcFVKLeDs3gNE5TmtPKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93006'),
  ('707100664510106663', 'The Intouchables', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache, Mathieu Vadepied', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache', 'François Cluzet, Omar Sy, Anne Le Ny, Audrey Fleurot, Joséphine de Meaux, Clotilde Mollet, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Cyril Mendy', 'R', 'A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.', 'A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QU7HKgsQbGpzsJbJK4pAVQV9F5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77338'),
  ('689953394787421360', 'The Intruder', 1962, 'Drama', 'Steven Bernhardt, Roger Corman, Taylor Byars', 'Charles Beaumont', 'William Shatner, Frank Maxwell, Beverly Lunsford, Robert Emhardt, Leo Gordon, Charles Barnes, Charles Beaumont, Katherine Smith', 'PG-13', 'A man in a gleaming white suit comes to a small Southern town on the eve of integration. He calls himself a social reformer. But what he does is stir up trouble--trouble he soon finds he can''t control.', 'A man in a gleaming white suit comes to a small Southern town on the eve of integration. He calls himself a social reformer. But what he does is stir up trouble--trouble he soon finds he can''t control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikbXTVJcAwxVA68kVLEios2Np5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79827'),
  ('257927113284099918', 'The Intruder', 1986, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jopi Burnama, Jopi Burnama', 'Deddy Armand', 'Peter O''Brian, Craig Gavin, Lia Waroka, Dana Christina, Kaharuddin Syah, Harry Capri, Yenny Farida, Adrian Nugraha', null, 'They''ve beaten and tortured him. They''ve raped and killed his woman. But they''ve made one big mistake. They didn''t kill him. Alex Trambuan, known to his friends as Rambu, is a lone vigilante and former police officer who takes revenge on the entire Columbian drug cartel that killed his wife. There can be only one winner in this game of death, his name is Rambu, this is his private war and this city will never forget his legacy of vengeance.', 'They''ve beaten and tortured him. They''ve raped and killed his woman. But they''ve made one big mistake. They didn''t kill him. Alex Trambuan, known to his friends as Rambu, is a lone vigilante and former police officer who takes revenge on the entire Columbian drug cartel that killed his wife. There can be only one winner in this game of death, his name is Rambu, this is his private war and this city will never forget his legacy of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjqjMjelXN7m8NEuLwVrjOOuVuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81944'),
  ('110506077060793399', 'The Intruder', 1999, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'David Bailey, Jean Lépine', 'Paul Mayersberg, Jamie Brown', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, John Hannah, Nastassja Kinski, Charles Powell, Molly Parker, Charles Papasoff, Mike Tsar, Angelo Tsarouchas', 'R', 'Catherine moves to a new city, and Nick Girard, a composer of film scores, catches her eye. They marry, but almost instantly something seems amiss. Nick had a previous wife named Stella, but she was killed two years earlier and her presence seems to still reside in the apartment. The neighbours in the building aren''t exactly welcoming, either. Catherine begins to think that an unseen force is trying to warn her about Nick, who starts to doubt her sanity.', 'Catherine moves to a new city, and Nick Girard, a composer of film scores, catches her eye. They marry, but almost instantly something seems amiss. Nick had a previous wife named Stella, but she was killed two years earlier and her presence seems to still reside in the apartment. The neighbours in the building aren''t exactly welcoming, either. Catherine begins to think that an unseen force is trying to warn her about Nick, who starts to doubt her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwQqT1jAsaOXYLFmEW1AWRxfHyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86023'),
  ('251677765789821048', 'The Intruder', 2005, 'Drama', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Paul Allegre, Bruno Via', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Pol Fargeau', 'Michel Subor, Grégoire Colin, Béatrice Dalle, Florence Loiret Caille, Yekaterina Golubeva, Bambou, Lolita Chammah, Alex Descas', 'NR', 'An emotionally cold man leaves the safety of his Alpine home to seek a heart transplant and an estranged son.', 'An emotionally cold man leaves the safety of his Alpine home to seek a heart transplant and an estranged son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGsSkKVZq8RRB2TDuqfeqqYnyL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47143'),
  ('435979298381878327', 'The Intruder', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Thanadol Nuansut, Thammanoon Sukulboontanom, Arnon Chunprasert', 'Thammanoon Sukulboontanom, Thanadol Nuansut', 'Akara Amarttayakul, Kwankao Savetawimon, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Peerawit Bunnag, Vasana Chalakorn, Aungkana Timdee, Sukol Pongsathat, Sarocha Watittapan', null, 'In an old house, a man is bitten to death by a snake. The special services and the media congregate but are only able to find a few snakes. Later, a group of cobras invade the building which threatens the lives of the habitants.', 'In an old house, a man is bitten to death by a snake. The special services and the media congregate but are only able to find a few snakes. Later, a group of cobras invade the building which threatens the lives of the habitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96vFoTktDIUgAgR58dosnvTGI0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57568'),
  ('903879484159253267', 'The Intruder', 2017, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Hélène Louvart', 'Leonardo Di Costanzo, Maurizio Braucci, Bruno Oliviero', 'Raffaella Giordano, Valentina Vannino, Martina Abbate, Anna Patierno, Flavio Rizzo, Marcello Fonte, Christian Giroso, Carmine Paternoster', null, 'Naples. Present day. Giovanna, a combative 60-year-old social worker on the frontline of the daily war against pervasive criminality, is confronted, like a modern Antigone, with a moral dilemma that threatens to destroy her work and her life. Giovanna runs an after-school centre that takes care of underprivileged children; a grassroots alternative to the mafia dominance of the city. But one day, young Maria, wife of a ruthless Camorra criminal on the run, and her two children take refuge at the centre, and ask Giovanna for protection.', 'Naples. Present day. Giovanna, a combative 60-year-old social worker on the frontline of the daily war against pervasive criminality, is confronted, like a modern Antigone, with a moral dilemma that threatens to destroy her work and her life. Giovanna runs an after-school centre that takes care of underprivileged children; a grassroots alternative to the mafia dominance of the city. But one day, young Maria, wife of a ruthless Camorra criminal on the run, and her two children take refuge at the centre, and ask Giovanna for protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTXDYPYX1j9rP1ElUn0nL1BVF5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453274'),
  ('723106979707287669', 'The Intruder', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Larry Lerner, Patricia Dyer Walden, Stacy Fish', 'David Loughery', 'Michael Ealy, Joseph Sikora, Meagan Good, Alvina August, Dennis Quaid, Erica Cerra, Kurt Evans, Carolyn Anderson', 'PG-13', 'A psychological thriller about a young married couple who buys a beautiful Napa Valley house on several acres of land only to find that the man they bought it from refuses to let go of the property.', 'A psychological thriller about a young married couple who buys a beautiful Napa Valley house on several acres of land only to find that the man they bought it from refuses to let go of the property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9xKyetr0ihJ2K6HJMeXzc4IwEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524247'),
  ('577945407287361406', 'The Intruder', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Natalia Meta, Bárbara Álvarez, Marcello Pozzo', 'Natalia Meta, Leonel D''Agostino', 'Érica Rivas, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Daniel Hendler, Cecilia Roth, Agustín Rittano, Guillermo Arengo, Mirta Busnelli', null, 'Inés works as a dubbing actress and sings in a choir in Buenos Aires. While on an idyllic trip she suffers a traumatic episode that she can’t recover from. She has trouble sleeping and experiences very vivid nightmares as strange sounds begin to emerge from inside her. Awake, Inés feels suddenly surrounded by people that seem to come from her dreams.', 'Inés works as a dubbing actress and sings in a choir in Buenos Aires. While on an idyllic trip she suffers a traumatic episode that she can’t recover from. She has trouble sleeping and experiences very vivid nightmares as strange sounds begin to emerge from inside her. Awake, Inés feels suddenly surrounded by people that seem to come from her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGD9CiO6vCk1nmvk0SzlhgYB5fz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667757'),
