  ('172074554050282601', 'The Inventor: Out for Blood in Silicon Valley', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Lincoln Else, Antonio Rossi', 'Alex Gibney', 'Elizabeth Holmes, Alex Gibney, Dan Ariely, Roger Parloff, Ken Auletta, Erika Cheung, Cheryl Gafner, Dave Philippides', null, 'With a magical new invention that promised to revolutionize blood testing, Elizabeth Holmes became the world’s youngest self-made billionaire, heralded as the next Steve Jobs. Then, overnight, her 10-billion-dollar company dissolved. The rise and fall of Theranos is a window into the psychology of fraud.', 'With a magical new invention that promised to revolutionize blood testing, Elizabeth Holmes became the world’s youngest self-made billionaire, heralded as the next Steve Jobs. Then, overnight, her 10-billion-dollar company dissolved. The rise and fall of Theranos is a window into the psychology of fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u21ImPnHHX2SFgkdHIjwlpEwRux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566228'),
  ('1073575940960616298', 'The Investigation of Lucy Letby', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Dominic Sivyer', null, 'Lucy Letby', 'PG-13', 'An engaging and thought-provoking look at Lucy Letby, the former nurse serving life in prison after being convicted of the murders of seven infants and the attempted murders of seven others.', 'An engaging and thought-provoking look at Lucy Letby, the former nurse serving life in prison after being convicted of the murders of seven infants and the attempted murders of seven others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhNThwc72GqihJhXaP29Af5hJ2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1620991'),
  ('91736329497907982', 'The Investigator', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Chris Oxley', 'Barbara Machin', 'Helen Baxendale, Christopher Fulford, Laura Fraser, Gary Webster, Ian Burfield, Sean Gilder, Zara Turner, Tracy Keating', null, '1989: Caroline Meagher is a sergeant with the Royal Military Police, with 12 years'' experience, stationed in Northern Ireland. Two men from internal affairs grill her for four days: someone has accused her of being a lesbian. It''s an offense that leads to court martial. In a series of flashbacks, we see her enthusiasm when she joins the force, her various assignments including investigating suspected lesbians, and her own slow discovery of her sexual nature. She, like others in her situation, must go to great lengths to avoid detection. Once reported, will she withstand the interrogation? Meagher herself comments on camera at the end of the film.', '1989: Caroline Meagher is a sergeant with the Royal Military Police, with 12 years'' experience, stationed in Northern Ireland. Two men from internal affairs grill her for four days: someone has accused her of being a lesbian. It''s an offense that leads to court martial. In a series of flashbacks, we see her enthusiasm when she joins the force, her various assignments including investigating suspected lesbians, and her own slow discovery of her sexual nature. She, like others in her situation, must go to great lengths to avoid detection. Once reported, will she withstand the interrogation? Meagher herself comments on camera at the end of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPQdHDmwF2aODftAwwQFO9S68fE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51783'),
  ('1054478004628955398', 'The Investigator', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Attila Gigor', 'Attila Gigor', 'Zsolt Anger, Judit Rezes, Sándor Terhes, Ildikó Tóth, Éva Kerekes, Zsolt Zágoni, Péter Blaskó, Ilona Kassai', null, 'Tibor Malkáv is an andaverage 37-year-old man, who though not rich, leads a comfortable and uncomplicated life. All this changes when he finds out his mother is dying of cancer and the cost of surgery is well beyond his means. A one-eyed man known as the Cyclops offers Tibor a solution to his financial woes, however, there is a catch and Tibor has to kill someone in return. What follows is a chain reaction that has long-lasting and unexpected results.', 'Tibor Malkáv is an andaverage 37-year-old man, who though not rich, leads a comfortable and uncomplicated life. All this changes when he finds out his mother is dying of cancer and the cost of surgery is well beyond his means. A one-eyed man known as the Cyclops offers Tibor a solution to his financial woes, however, there is a catch and Tibor has to kill someone in return. What follows is a chain reaction that has long-lasting and unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxgDkvaV9RtTDoM0Br45i84lnVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40895'),
  ('163222391836322320', 'The Invincible', 2008, 'Action', 'Oleg Pogodin, Marina Nigmatulina, Viktor Bozhinov', 'Oleg Pogodin, Friedrich Neznansky', 'Vladimir Yepifantsev, Vladimir Turchinsky, Vladimir Steklov, Sergei Astakhov, Harry Borg, Nikovich Sammut, Sergey Veksler, Olga Fadeyeva', null, 'Yegor is a Russian special agent on a mission to Malta to catch Mikhail Shering fugitive. According to special services, Mikhail was in possession of documents of interest to both the government and the Russian mafia. Therefore, difficulties in bringing Mikhail begin and guns strafed.', 'Yegor is a Russian special agent on a mission to Malta to catch Mikhail Shering fugitive. According to special services, Mikhail was in possession of documents of interest to both the government and the Russian mafia. Therefore, difficulties in bringing Mikhail begin and guns strafed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tVL9QxOiFBL6XXmmuFPCCtqvDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29299'),
  ('794868164172570499', 'The Invincible Armour', 1977, 'Thriller, Action', 'Ng See-Yuen, Raymond Chang, Lee Doo-yong', 'Ng See-Yuen, Tung Lo', 'John Liu, Hwang Jang-Lee, Tino Wong, Phillip Ko Fai, Corey Yuen, Yuen Shun-Yi, Lee Hoi-Sang, Choi Foo-Gwai', 'NR', 'Hwang Jang Lee is a corrupt Ming guard who frames John Liu for murder. A wanted fugitive, John hides out with a teen who is an expert in the infamous Iron Armor technique, a technique that means the expert can withstand anything. However, Hwang is an expert in it as well as the Eagle Claw''s. Can John stop Hwang before it''s too late?', 'Hwang Jang Lee is a corrupt Ming guard who frames John Liu for murder. A wanted fugitive, John hides out with a teen who is an expert in the infamous Iron Armor technique, a technique that means the expert can withstand anything. However, Hwang is an expert in it as well as the Eagle Claw''s. Can John stop Hwang before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJVKiX7AVhxKkEmJBRoWZpcCx8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56095'),
  ('271908202417643893', 'The Invincible Dragon', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Fruit Chan, Cheyenne Peng', 'Jason Lam Kee-To, Fruit Chan', 'Max Zhang, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Annie Liu Xin-You, Stephy Tang Lai-Yan, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, JuJu Chan, Anderson Silva, Endy Chow', null, 'The undercover agent with dragon tattoo Kowloon continually helped the police to solve mysterious cases, which made him known as a rising star. However, his impulsive personality dragged him into endless troubles. He got himself into fights with the Macau detective, as well as an American Army veteran Alexander who has a secret linkage to Kowloon’s background…', 'The undercover agent with dragon tattoo Kowloon continually helped the police to solve mysterious cases, which made him known as a rising star. However, his impulsive personality dragged him into endless troubles. He got himself into fights with the Macau detective, as well as an American Army veteran Alexander who has a secret linkage to Kowloon’s background…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15GQh5pUXzPSvZ0GmqsYeUSlhUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449998'),
  ('860069119224276404', 'The Invincible Fist', 1969, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Ma, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang', 'Li Ching, Lo Lieh, David Chiang Da-Wei, Fang Mian, Chang Pei-Shan, Ku Feng, Chan Sing, Wu Ma', null, 'Here Lo Lieh plays a dedicated chief constable for Tsang Chou village, who falls in love with the blind daughter of a bandit who is wreaking havoc.', 'Here Lo Lieh plays a dedicated chief constable for Tsang Chou village, who falls in love with the blind daughter of a bandit who is wreaking havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPaoiU3xoQJecKiKKWk72FTfZzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66975'),
  ('978228324503165634', 'The Invincible Gladiator', 1961, 'Action, Drama', 'Antonio Momplet, Alberto De Martino, Michelangelo Panaro', 'Alberto De Martino, Francesco De Feo, Francesco Thellung', 'Richard Harrison, Isabelle Corey, Livio Lorenzon, Leo Anchóriz, Edoardo Nevola, José Marco, Jole Mauro, Ricardo Canales', null, 'A Roman warrior leads a revolt against an evil ruler. A young, diminutive ruler makes a big decision to unseat a nobleman whose ego has outgrown him. But can the 10-year-old take on such an impressive nemesis?', 'A Roman warrior leads a revolt against an evil ruler. A young, diminutive ruler makes a big decision to unseat a nobleman whose ego has outgrown him. But can the 10-year-old take on such an impressive nemesis?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zela8yXh9bWUBab7911vSLb9OGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164728'),
  ('1141546794728634551', 'The Invincible Iron Man', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Frank Paur, Jay Oliva, Patrick Archibald', 'Greg Johnson', 'Marc Worden, Gwendoline Yeo, John McCook, Fred Tatasciore, Elisa Gabrielli, Rodney Saulsberry, James Sie, Stephen Mendillo', 'PG-13', 'When a cocky industrialist''s efforts to raise an ancient Chinese temple leads him to be seriously wounded and captured by enemy forces, he must use his ideas for a revolutionary power armor in order to fight back as a superhero.', 'When a cocky industrialist''s efforts to raise an ancient Chinese temple leads him to be seriously wounded and captured by enemy forces, he must use his ideas for a revolutionary power armor in order to fight back as a superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eebNTSRa5Hh5skPKGdGJIJpo9Ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13647'),
  ('263239732728049919', 'The Invincibles', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Dominik Graf, Diethard Prengel, Michael Zens', 'Günter Schütter', 'Herbert Knaup, Katja Flint, Hansa Czypionka, Heinz Hoenig, Hannes Jaenicke, Meret Becker, Heinrich Schafmeister, Michael Breitsprecher', null, 'Simon, the leader of a police special unit, becomes caught up in a complex scheme involving bribery and money-laundering, as well as an affair with the beautiful wife of a government official investigating organized crime and political corruption. After the official is kidnapped, the chase leads to a dramatic conclusion high in the Bavarian Alps.', 'Simon, the leader of a police special unit, becomes caught up in a complex scheme involving bribery and money-laundering, as well as an affair with the beautiful wife of a government official investigating organized crime and political corruption. After the official is kidnapped, the chase leads to a dramatic conclusion high in the Bavarian Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viFD2bllJX5WY2iibuSPRoabFhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4610'),
  ('228934704716116882', 'The Invisible', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Simon Sandquist, Joel Bergvall', 'Mick Davis', 'Gustaf Skarsgård, Tuva Novotny, Catherine Hansson, Joel Kinnaman, Thomas Hedengran, Pär Luttropp, Sara Lindh, Eivin Dahlgren', null, 'A teenager is assaulted and killed, but returns as a ghost to find his killer.', 'A teenager is assaulted and killed, but returns as a ghost to find his killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vinvtwxUlNlcnsTwh17NvoFcC5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13040'),
  ('951670462076614347', 'The Invisible', 2007, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Mystery', 'David S. Goyer, Gabriel Beristain, John Alvarez', 'Mick Davis, Christine Roum', 'Justin Chatwin, Margarita Levieva, Marcia Gay Harden, Alex O''Loughlin, Michelle Harrison, Ryan Kennedy, Andrew Francis, Maggie Ma', 'PG-13', 'After an attack leaves him in limbo -- invisible to the living and also near death -- a teenager discovers the only person who might be able help him is his attacker.', 'After an attack leaves him in limbo -- invisible to the living and also near death -- a teenager discovers the only person who might be able help him is his attacker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSJloUNJSKWJzQ4RbxBFKOA2p2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9785'),
  ('529507615349773951', 'The Invisible', 2020, 'Drama', 'Antonio Ordóñez, Gracia Querejeta, Juan Borrell', 'Santos Mercero, Gracia Querejeta', 'Emma Suárez, Adriana Ozores, Nathalie Poza, Blanca Portillo, Fernando Cayo, Pedro Casablanc, Paqui Horcajo', null, 'Three women. One same age. Three ways to face it.', 'Three women. One same age. Three ways to face it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiYQxyplSb1oHT32GYoV64yPXQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650625'),
