  ('578768710346832878', 'The Invisible Boy', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Herman Hoffman, Harold E. Wellman', 'Cyril Hume', 'Richard Eyer, Philip Abbott, Diane Brewster, Harold J. Stone, Robert H. Harris, Dennis McCarthy, Alexander Lockwood, John O''Malley', null, 'A supercomputer plans world domination with the help of Robby the Robot and a 10 year old boy, who is the son of the computer''s inventor.', 'A supercomputer plans world domination with the help of Robby the Robot and a 10 year old boy, who is the son of the computer''s inventor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppZdGVHD6HpV6v8M0Ar5YQoydy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26155'),
  ('845697656522102070', 'The Invisible Boy', 2014, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Davide Bertoni, Margherita Zanobetti, Giorgio Servillo', 'Stefano Sardo, Ludovica Rampoldi, Alessandro Fabbri', 'Ludovico Girardello, Valeria Golino, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Noa Zatta, Christo Jivkov, Kseniya Rappoport, Assil Kandil, Filippo Valese', null, 'Michele is thirteen year old, shy, unpopular at school, and in love with Stella. After wearing a costume for a Halloween party, he finds out that he''s invisible.', 'Michele is thirteen year old, shy, unpopular at school, and in love with Stella. After wearing a costume for a Halloween party, he finds out that he''s invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmuU1ExeIZ6tKlr0690cSs7WY59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303542'),
  ('84768073036910109', 'The Invisible Boy: Second Generation', 2018, 'Fantasy', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Ludovica Rampoldi, Alessandro Fabbri, Stefano Sardo', 'Ludovico Girardello, Kseniya Rappoport, Galatea Bellugi, Ivan Franěk, Dario Cantarelli, Katia Mironova, Emilio De Marchi, Mikołaj Chroboczek', null, 'Three years later Michele (The Invisible boy) meets his mother and his twin sister. Both have stories and superpowers but their intentions may not be what Michele thinks.', 'Three years later Michele (The Invisible boy) meets his mother and his twin sister. Both have stories and superpowers but their intentions may not be what Michele thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oi6CgVTaDQAuCRbQqXjevlpa8kk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433150'),
  ('333714135692683910', 'The Invisible Children', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Lisandro Duque Naranjo, Raúl Pérez Ureta', 'Lisandro Duque Naranjo, Gabriel García Márquez', 'Guillermo Castañeda, Ingrid Cielo Ospina, Gustavo Angarita, Gustavo Camacho, Juvenal Camacho, Inés Prieto, Hernando Montenegro, Carolina Vivas', null, 'A young boy and his friends attempt to become invisible to get closer to the girls they desire. They must steal the magic recipe and its ingredients without getting caught to perform the ritual.', 'A young boy and his friends attempt to become invisible to get closer to the girls they desire. They must steal the magic recipe and its ingredients without getting caught to perform the ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNDhkrCaxGsxQmxhE5Nm0TnqbEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242928'),
  ('273160276622446335', 'The Invisible Circus', 2001, 'Drama', 'Adam Brooks, Coralie Fargeat, Henry Braham', 'Adam Brooks', 'Cameron Diaz, Jordana Brewster, Christopher Eccleston, Blythe Danner, Camilla Belle, Patrick Bergin, Isabelle Pasco, Moritz Bleibtreu', 'R', 'After learning that her sister, Faith, has committed suicide in Portugal, Phoebe, an 18-year-old hippie, decides to uproot from her San Francisco home to travel to Europe. Phoebe hopes to discover and experience the life that led to her sister''s death by retracing her footsteps, which eventually leads to Wolf -- Faith''s boyfriend. However, as Phoebe''s journey continues, a series of visions of Faith pushes her mind to the brink.', 'After learning that her sister, Faith, has committed suicide in Portugal, Phoebe, an 18-year-old hippie, decides to uproot from her San Francisco home to travel to Europe. Phoebe hopes to discover and experience the life that led to her sister''s death by retracing her footsteps, which eventually leads to Wolf -- Faith''s boyfriend. However, as Phoebe''s journey continues, a series of visions of Faith pushes her mind to the brink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJD7zRuGJ9HbgbmKSTRkKysWhu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18856'),
  ('75334738867573447', 'The Invisible Dr. Mabuse', 1962, 'Crime, Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke, Carl von Barany', 'Ladislas Fodor', 'Lex Barker, Karin Dor, Werner Peters, Siegfried Lowitz, Walo Lüönd, Wolfgang Preiss, Kurd Pieritz, Rudolf Fernau', null, 'Strange things happen in a revue theatre. The dancer Maria seems to be hunted by an invisible admirer. When the body of a probable FBI agent is found in a trunk the police asks FBI man Joe Como for help. Como gets interested in the revue theatre and an ominous transport firm soon. When he is receiving mysterious threatening letters he is sure that Dr. Mabuse has risen again. But what is going on at "Enterprise X" so that both the goverment and the mad genius in crime are interested in it?', 'Strange things happen in a revue theatre. The dancer Maria seems to be hunted by an invisible admirer. When the body of a probable FBI agent is found in a trunk the police asks FBI man Joe Como for help. Como gets interested in the revue theatre and an ominous transport firm soon. When he is receiving mysterious threatening letters he is sure that Dr. Mabuse has risen again. But what is going on at "Enterprise X" so that both the goverment and the mad genius in crime are interested in it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqFrdTS4YrIYsOA7kKBUSrKX0Qb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19130'),
  ('120861180526123603', 'The Invisible Eye', 2010, 'Drama', 'Diego Lerman, Tomás Pernich, Federico Rotstein', 'María Meira, Diego Lerman', 'Julieta Zylberberg, Osmar Núñez, Marta Lubos, Gaby Ferrero, Diego Vegezzi, Pablo Sigal, Jorge García Marino, Magdalena Capobianco', null, 'A teaching assistant at a private Buenos Aires school begins obsessively spying on her students in the early 1980s, as the public rises up against the military dictatorship.', 'A teaching assistant at a private Buenos Aires school begins obsessively spying on her students in the early 1980s, as the public rises up against the military dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YN79NSIhB93UjQt7Yyo9NyJDa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51548'),
  ('51762146705314471', 'The Invisible Girl', 2011, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Dominik Graf, Michael Wiesweg', 'Friedrich Ani, Ina Jung', 'Elmar Wepper, Ulrich Noethen, Ronald Zehrfeld, Silke Bodenbender, Anja Schiffel, Tim Bergmann, Lisa Kreuzer, Thomas Lawinky', null, 'Eleven years ago, an 8-year-old girl disappeared from a small German town on the German-Czech border. Although her body was never found, nor were there any traces of blood or DNA evidence, a mentally-disabled man was coerced to confess to the crime. Even though he withdrew his admission of guilt two days later, the forced confession was enough to convince the ruling judge. The responsible investigator Altendorf was discharged so that the investigation could be sped along by another colleague.', 'Eleven years ago, an 8-year-old girl disappeared from a small German town on the German-Czech border. Although her body was never found, nor were there any traces of blood or DNA evidence, a mentally-disabled man was coerced to confess to the crime. Even though he withdrew his admission of guilt two days later, the forced confession was enough to convince the ruling judge. The responsible investigator Altendorf was discharged so that the investigation could be sped along by another colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIGt2qR5nOkioIuY8VPWV2ggK0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100200'),
  ('410960953883987772', 'The Invisible Girl', 2020, 'Family, Romance, Comedy', 'Maurício Eça, Keller Kdg, Yuri Scocuglia', 'Livia Alcade, C. Jos Bravo', 'Sophia Valverde, Matheus Ueta, Mharessa Fernanda, Guilherme Brumatti, Bianca Paiva, Bia Jordão, Kaik Pereira, Clarinha Jordão', null, 'Ariana always went unnoticed until she accidentally posted a video in which she declared her love for the most popular boy in school. Now his ex-girlfriend will do everything she can to ruin the romance and make her wish she could go back to being invisible.', 'Ariana always went unnoticed until she accidentally posted a video in which she declared her love for the most popular boy in school. Now his ex-girlfriend will do everything she can to ruin the romance and make her wish she could go back to being invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msJs7UwmWUd7iql36JoN4Rp0hoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774758'),
  ('312388301245797876', 'The Invisible Guardian', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Fernando González Molina, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Luiso Berdejo', 'Marta Etura, Elvira Mínguez, Francesc Orella, Colin McFarlane, Susi Sánchez, Patricia López Arnaiz, Javier Botet, Arlette Torres', null, 'When the naked body of a teenage girl is found on the banks of the River Baztán, it is quickly linked to a similar murder one month before. Soon, rumours are flying in the nearby village of Elizondo. Is this the work of a ritualistic killer or is it the basajaun, the ‘invisible guardian’ of Basque mythology? Inspector Amaia Salazar leads the investigation, taking her back to the heart of the Basque country where she was born, and where she hoped never to return. Shrouded in mist and surrounded by impenetrable forests, it is a place of unresolved conflicts and a terrible secret from Amaia’s childhood that will come back to haunt her. Faced with the superstitions of the village, Amaia must fight the demons of her past to confront the reality of a serial killer on the loose. But as she is drawn deeper into the investigation, she feels the presence of something darker lurking in the shadows…', 'When the naked body of a teenage girl is found on the banks of the River Baztán, it is quickly linked to a similar murder one month before. Soon, rumours are flying in the nearby village of Elizondo. Is this the work of a ritualistic killer or is it the basajaun, the ‘invisible guardian’ of Basque mythology? Inspector Amaia Salazar leads the investigation, taking her back to the heart of the Basque country where she was born, and where she hoped never to return. Shrouded in mist and surrounded by impenetrable forests, it is a place of unresolved conflicts and a terrible secret from Amaia’s childhood that will come back to haunt her. Faced with the superstitions of the village, Amaia must fight the demons of her past to confront the reality of a serial killer on the loose. But as she is drawn deeper into the investigation, she feels the presence of something darker lurking in the shadows…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxR7CqLRdQ2QuOPP9ymunPrRBCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392207'),
  ('864459237887142106', 'The Invisible Guest', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Daniela Forn, Anna Rua, Olga Pujalte López', 'Lara Sendim', 'Mario Casas, Ana Wagener, Jose Coronado, Bárbara Lennie, Francesc Orella, Paco Tous, David Selvas, Iñigo Gastesi', null, 'Barcelona, Spain. Adrián Doria, a young and successful businessman accused of murder, meets one night with Virginia Goodman, an expert interrogation lawyer, in order to devise a defense strategy.', 'Barcelona, Spain. Adrián Doria, a young and successful businessman accused of murder, meets one night with Virginia Goodman, an expert interrogation lawyer, in order to devise a defense strategy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fptnZJbLzKUHeNlYrAynbyoL5YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411088'),
  ('524988159157280758', 'The Invisible Guest', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Chen Zhuo', 'Jiang Miaomiao, Chen Zhuo, Oriol Paulo', 'Greg Hsu, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Yin Zheng, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Qian Yi, Li Feng, Maiqian Guo, Xue Xuchun', null, 'A greedy police chief learns that a wealthy businesswoman has been wrongly accused of murder and strikes a deal with her – her freedom for a large sum of money. As the case progresses, a revelation that a sadistic politician and the businesswoman have a long standing relationship, the details of which will uncover the truth about the murder.', 'A greedy police chief learns that a wealthy businesswoman has been wrongly accused of murder and strikes a deal with her – her freedom for a large sum of money. As the case progresses, a revelation that a sadistic politician and the businesswoman have a long standing relationship, the details of which will uncover the truth about the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpnXb8wQNTQzbWkMPOiEMITN5vB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159242'),
  ('1018991043202959601', 'The Invisible Hand', 2017, 'Drama', 'David Macián', 'David Macián, Daniel Cortázar', 'Josean Bengoetxea, Elisabet Gelabert, Daniel Pérez Prada, Anahí Beholi, Eduardo Ferrés, Christen Joulin, Marta Larralde, Esther Ortega', null, 'An industrial warehouse is turned into a stage where a group of ordinary professionals are assembled daily to perform different tasks with apparent normality. Meanwhile, from the darkness of the auditorium, dozens of visitors observe the "wonderful" work show.', 'An industrial warehouse is turned into a stage where a group of ordinary professionals are assembled daily to perform different tasks with apparent normality. Meanwhile, from the darkness of the auditorium, dozens of visitors observe the "wonderful" work show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoC7v9vqjavrYlDZ47LvYqx7fuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426413'),
  ('277607246860190525', 'The Invisible Kid', 1988, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Avery Crounse, Michael Barnard, Melitta Fitzer', 'Avery Crounse', 'Jay Underwood, Wallace Langham, Chynna Phillips, Mike Genovese, Karen Black, Kristephan Warren-Stevens, Nicolas De Toth, Thomas Cross', null, 'A nerdy teenage scientist discovers a formula for invisibility, and uses it to take revenge on all those who have wronged him--and also to spy on the girls'' shower room.', 'A nerdy teenage scientist discovers a formula for invisibility, and uses it to take revenge on all those who have wronged him--and also to spy on the girls'' shower room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MhM7mOAXkuScxDXIwZxbItpo0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31448'),
  ('382004258181175199', 'The Invisible Man', 1933, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'James Whale, Arthur Edeson, Joseph A. McDonough', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'Claude Rains, Gloria Stuart, William Harrigan, Henry Travers, Una O''Connor, Forrester Harvey, Holmes Herbert, E. E. Clive', 'NR', 'After experimenting on himself and becoming invisible, scientist Jack Griffin, now aggressive due to the drug''s effects, seeks a way to reverse the experiment at any cost.', 'After experimenting on himself and becoming invisible, scientist Jack Griffin, now aggressive due to the drug''s effects, seeks a way to reverse the experiment at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewfUA5pMEJrmQCdI4TsHmLlIUbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10787'),
  ('417938770154354039', 'The Invisible Man', 1985, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Aleksandr Zakharov, Yuri Kolcheyev, Yevgeni Pozdnyakov', 'Andrey Dmitriev, Aleksandr Zakharov', 'Andrey Kharitonov, Romualdas Ramanauskas, Leonid Kuravlyov, Natalya Danilova, Oleg Golubitsky, Nina Agapova, Viktor Sergachyov, Yuri Katin-Yartsev', null, 'Based upon the famous novel by H.G.Wells. A poor scientist named Griffin discovers a way to make things invisible. Since he has no money to continue his research, he decides to perform his only experiment on himself. After becoming invisible, Griffin has a lot of trouble trying to conceal this from other people.', 'Based upon the famous novel by H.G.Wells. A poor scientist named Griffin discovers a way to make things invisible. Since he has no money to continue his research, he decides to perform his only experiment on himself. After becoming invisible, Griffin has a lot of trouble trying to conceal this from other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfE4QZw68IpG2wKW8QoDssVpqBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75294'),
  ('261493789599530127', 'The Invisible Man', 2020, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Killian Maguire, Jane Griffin, Leigh Whannell', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Elisabeth Moss, Aldis Hodge, Storm Reid, Michael Dorman, Harriet Dyer, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Benedict Hardie, Zara Michales', 'R', 'When Cecilia''s abusive ex takes his own life and leaves her his fortune, she suspects his death was a hoax. As a series of coincidences turn lethal, Cecilia works to prove that she is being hunted by someone nobody can see.', 'When Cecilia''s abusive ex takes his own life and leaves her his fortune, she suspects his death was a hoax. As a series of coincidences turn lethal, Cecilia works to prove that she is being hunted by someone nobody can see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EufsDwXdY2CVttYOk2WtYhgKpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570670'),
