  ('924465490424809416', 'The Invitation', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Claude Goretta, Jean Zeller', 'Michel Viala, Claude Goretta', 'Jean-Luc Bideau, Jean Champion, Corinne Coderey, Neige Dolsky, Jacques Rispal, Michel Robin, Rosine Rochette, François Simon', null, 'Rémi, a confirmed bachelor and model bureaucrat, invites his colleagues and superiors to a magnificent house to celebrate an inheritance. Under the influence of drink, they drop all pretence and reveal their true selves. But what will remain of this brief interlude the following day?', 'Rémi, a confirmed bachelor and model bureaucrat, invites his colleagues and superiors to a magnificent house to celebrate an inheritance. Under the influence of drink, they drop all pretence and reveal their true selves. But what will remain of this brief interlude the following day?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3M1LrjEIJ5M0sLN7K6wnYTNjCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109815'),
