  ('208337718263249562', 'The Iron Claw', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Sean Durkin, Alisa Fredericks, Mark A. Terry', 'Sean Durkin', 'Zac Efron, Jeremy Allen White, Harris Dickinson, Stanley Simons, Holt McCallany, Maura Tierney, Lily James, Michael Harney', 'R', 'The true story of the inseparable Von Erich brothers, who made history in the intensely competitive world of professional wrestling in the early 1980s. Through tragedy and triumph, under the shadow of their domineering father and coach, the brothers seek larger-than-life immortality on the biggest stage in sports.', 'The true story of the inseparable Von Erich brothers, who made history in the intensely competitive world of professional wrestling in the early 1980s. Through tragedy and triumph, under the shadow of their domineering father and coach, the brothers seek larger-than-life immortality on the biggest stage in sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2VLjcykJfwplJNGT5iEeCA0mRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850165'),
  ('747398191634504187', 'The Iron Commissioner', 1978, 'Crime, Action', 'Stelvio Massi, Danilo Massi, Sergio Rubini', 'Roberto Gianviti', 'Maurizio Merli, Janet Ågren, Ettore Manni, Chris Avram, Massimo Mirani, Giampiero Becherelli, Mariangela Giordano, Walter Di Santo', null, 'Comissioneer Mariani leads investigates a group of kidnappers.', 'Comissioneer Mariani leads investigates a group of kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGmHRof7P7BFYIBGbNKktW3iMW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128563'),
  ('1052346824223131627', 'The Iron Crown', 1941, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Václav Vích, Mario Craveri', 'Guglielmo Zorzi, Renato Castellani, Corrado Pavolini', 'Gino Cervi, Massimo Girotti, Luisa Ferida, Elisa Cegani, Rina Morelli, Primo Carnera, Paolo Stoppa, Osvaldo Valenti', null, 'In the kingdom of Kindaor, traitor Sedesmondo kills his brother, the King of Kindaor, and becomes the tyrant of kingdom. He abandons the prince Arminio to beasts in the woods, but lions don''t kill him and breed him as one of them.', 'In the kingdom of Kindaor, traitor Sedesmondo kills his brother, the King of Kindaor, and becomes the tyrant of kingdom. He abandons the prince Arminio to beasts in the woods, but lions don''t kill him and breed him as one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4uEFgeex8diBvg5tSgd1wfZFX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68058'),
  ('1131280643065957033', 'The Iron Curtain', 1948, 'Thriller', 'William A. Wellman, Charles G. Clarke', 'Igor Gouzenko', 'Dana Andrews, Gene Tierney, June Havoc, Berry Kroeger, Edna Best, Stefan Schnabel, Nicholas Joy, Eduard Franz', null, 'The Iron Curtain is based on the actual 1945 case of Soviet cipher clerk Igor Gouzenko, (Dana Andrews), who, after careful training, was assigned to the U.S.S.R. Embassy in Ottawa, Canada in the midst of World War II. Eventually, Gouzenko defected with 109 pages of material implicating several high level Canadian officials, outlined the steps taken to secure information about the the details of the nuclear bomb via numerous sleeper cells established throughout North America. The scandal that resulted when details of this case were publicized by American columnist Drew Pearson in early 1946 involved Canada, Britain and the United States.', 'The Iron Curtain is based on the actual 1945 case of Soviet cipher clerk Igor Gouzenko, (Dana Andrews), who, after careful training, was assigned to the U.S.S.R. Embassy in Ottawa, Canada in the midst of World War II. Eventually, Gouzenko defected with 109 pages of material implicating several high level Canadian officials, outlined the steps taken to secure information about the the details of the nuclear bomb via numerous sleeper cells established throughout North America. The scandal that resulted when details of this case were publicized by American columnist Drew Pearson in early 1946 involved Canada, Britain and the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkdfF5ZrmwdreS2M2A6PK7Tawi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26747'),
  ('470079329490989336', 'The Iron Giant', 1999, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Drama', 'Steven Wilzbach, Brad Bird, Michael Leung', 'Tim McCanlies, Brad Bird', 'Jennifer Aniston, Harry Connick Jr., Vin Diesel, James Gammon, Cloris Leachman, Christopher McDonald, John Mahoney, Eli Marienthal', 'PG', 'In the small town of Rockwell, Maine in October 1957, a giant metal machine befriends a nine-year-old boy and ultimately finds its humanity by unselfishly saving people from their own fears and prejudices.', 'In the small town of Rockwell, Maine in October 1957, a giant metal machine befriends a nine-year-old boy and ultimately finds its humanity by unselfishly saving people from their own fears and prejudices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct04FCFLPImNG5thcPLRnVsZlmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10386'),
  ('542585762368465171', 'The Iron Horse', 1925, 'Western, Drama, History, Romance', 'John Ford, George Schneiderman, Edward O''Fearna', 'Charles Darnton', 'George O''Brien, Madge Bellamy, Charles Edward Bull, Cyril Chadwick, Will Walling, Francis Powers, J. Farrell MacDonald, Jim Welch', null, 'Brandon, a surveyor, dreams of building a railway to the west. He sets off with his son, Davy, to survey a route. They discover a new pass which will shave 200 miles off the expected distance, but they are set upon by a party of Cheyenne. One of them, a white renegade with only two fingers on his right hand, kills Brandon and scalps him. Davy is all alone now.', 'Brandon, a surveyor, dreams of building a railway to the west. He sets off with his son, Davy, to survey a route. They discover a new pass which will shave 200 miles off the expected distance, but they are set upon by a party of Cheyenne. One of them, a white renegade with only two fingers on his right hand, kills Brandon and scalps him. Davy is all alone now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atYzXs2gdfKRKvVlP0Gj4hEsmuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71068'),
  ('862217499771620076', 'The Iron Ladies', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Jira Maligool, Yongyoot Thongkongtoon', 'Visuttchai Boonyakarnjawa, Jira Maligool, Yongyoot Thongkongtoon', 'Jesdaporn Pholdee, Sahaphap Veerakamin, Tankhun Jitissara, Kokkorn Benjathikoon, Giorgio Maiocchi, Chaichan Nimpulsawasdi, Phomsit Sitthijamroenkhun, Sutthipong Sitthijamroenkhun', 'NR', 'A group of volleyball players, who are either transvestites or gay, form a team after they suffer discrimination and compete to win games amidst the hostility around them.', 'A group of volleyball players, who are either transvestites or gay, form a team after they suffer discrimination and compete to win games amidst the hostility around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oshXupyCh2hkGfDVtQvZ84wnMNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106230'),
  ('314653706527626899', 'The Iron Ladies 2', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Yongyoot Thongkongtoon, Sasivimon Chinnavajkitwanit, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Yongyoot Thongkongtoon', 'Jesdaporn Pholdee, Sahaphap Veerakamin, Kokkorn Benjathikoon, Giorgio Maiocchi, Chaichan Nimpulsawasdi, Aphichart Vongkavee, Phomsit Sitthijamroenkhun, Sutthipong Sitthijamroenkhun', 'NR', 'A volleyball team made up of individuals, who are homosexual, face several challenges as fame gets in the way of their bond coupled with their other differences.', 'A volleyball team made up of individuals, who are homosexual, face several challenges as fame gets in the way of their bond coupled with their other differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7R2E3mJQ2HPG6qx3Jc2adYHCSI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148227'),
  ('27216114656879335', 'The Iron Lady', 2011, 'History, Drama', 'Phyllida Lloyd, Elliot Davis', 'Abi Morgan', 'Meryl Streep, Jim Broadbent, Olivia Colman, Roger Allam, Susan Brown, Nick Dunning, Nicholas Farrell, Iain Glen', 'PG-13', 'A look at the life of Margaret Thatcher, the former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom, with a focus on the price she paid for power.', 'A look at the life of Margaret Thatcher, the former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom, with a focus on the price she paid for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx7wpKXOht7WOkeOslvErbrf69Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71688'),
  ('345249445536209301', 'The Iron Mask', 1929, 'Adventure, History', 'Allan Dwan', null, 'Douglas Fairbanks, Belle Bennett, Marguerite De La Motte, Dorothy Revier, Vera Lewis, Rolfe Sedan, William Bakewell, Nigel De Brulier', null, 'King Louis XIII of France is thrilled to have born to him a son - an heir to the throne. But when the queen delivers a twin, Cardinal Richelieu sees the second son as a potential for revolution, and has him sent off to Spain to be raised in secret to ensure a peaceful future for France. Alas, keeping the secret means sending Constance, lover of D''Artagnan, off to a convent. D''Artagnan hears of this and rallies the Musketeers in a bid to rescue her. Unfortunately, Richelieu out-smarts the Musketeers and banishes them forever.', 'King Louis XIII of France is thrilled to have born to him a son - an heir to the throne. But when the queen delivers a twin, Cardinal Richelieu sees the second son as a potential for revolution, and has him sent off to Spain to be raised in secret to ensure a peaceful future for France. Alas, keeping the secret means sending Constance, lover of D''Artagnan, off to a convent. D''Artagnan hears of this and rallies the Musketeers in a bid to rescue her. Unfortunately, Richelieu out-smarts the Musketeers and banishes them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9t60V0eJ2pLwCl0YsBnvXQmRNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79761'),
  ('645229866305256679', 'The Iron Mask', 1962, 'Adventure', 'Henri Decoin, Pierre Petit', 'Jacques Laurent, Gerald Devriès', 'Jean Marais, Sylva Koscina, Jean-François Poron, Gisèle Pascal, Philippe Lemaire, Noël Roquevert, Jean Rochefort, Claudine Auger', null, 'The story of the Three Musketeers, D''Artagnan, and the imprisonment in an iron mask of the identical twin of the King of France, Louis XIV.', 'The story of the Three Musketeers, D''Artagnan, and the imprisonment in an iron mask of the identical twin of the King of France, Louis XIV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CNxHnuLGzo707Mbv7KvP5ULfqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85746'),
  ('216931034880078298', 'The Iron Mistress', 1952, 'History, Drama, Action, Western, Romance', 'Gordon Douglas, John F. Seitz, Oren Haglund', 'James R. Webb', 'Alan Ladd, Virginia Mayo, Joseph Calleia, Phyllis Kirk, Alf Kjellin, Douglas Dick, Anthony Caruso, Nedrick Young', 'NR', 'In this biopic, Jim Bowie goes to New Orleans, where he falls for Judalon and befriends her brother, Narcisse. Soon, Jim is forced to avenge Narcisse''s murder, but Judalon takes up with another man. Jim eventually has another romantic interlude with Judalon and is forced to kill one of her suitors in self-defense. Jim leaves town, and falls for the daughter of a Texas politician, but his entanglement with Judalon continues to bedevil him.', 'In this biopic, Jim Bowie goes to New Orleans, where he falls for Judalon and befriends her brother, Narcisse. Soon, Jim is forced to avenge Narcisse''s murder, but Judalon takes up with another man. Jim eventually has another romantic interlude with Judalon and is forced to kill one of her suitors in self-defense. Jim leaves town, and falls for the daughter of a Texas politician, but his entanglement with Judalon continues to bedevil him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqVwYQMBdVasyZkdfdbshfEploH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95012'),
  ('779758956328996909', 'The Iron Monkey', 1977, 'Action', 'Chen Kuan-Tai', null, 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Chi Kuan-Chun, Chin Kang, Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Shih Chung-Tien, Wu Ma, Chia-Lin Sun', null, 'Iron is the son of a rebel leader, but prefers to spend his days gambling and getting into fights. When his father''s group is arrested and executed, Iron is forced to flee and hide in the woods as a beggar and thief. After being taken in by a Shaolin monastery and trained in the art of Monkey-Style Kung Fu, Iron vows to hunt down his father''s killer and avenge his death.', 'Iron is the son of a rebel leader, but prefers to spend his days gambling and getting into fights. When his father''s group is arrested and executed, Iron is forced to flee and hide in the woods as a beggar and thief. After being taken in by a Shaolin monastery and trained in the art of Monkey-Style Kung Fu, Iron vows to hunt down his father''s killer and avenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toZvOawvakQZ4gM8IKanKJH0OPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114980'),
  ('452377562665078715', 'The Iron Mule', 1925, 'Comedy', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Grover Jones', 'Grover Jones', 'Al St. John, Buster Keaton, George Davis, Glen Cavender, Doris Deane, Billy Franey', 'NR', 'A train known as the Iron Mule is loaded with passengers, and starts off on its trip. Along the way, the train faces numerous obstacles and delays. The engineer is prepared for most of them, but the real challenges come when the train is ambushed by Indians.', 'A train known as the Iron Mule is loaded with passengers, and starts off on its trip. Along the way, the train faces numerous obstacles and delays. The engineer is prepared for most of them, but the real challenges come when the train is ambushed by Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hJI0IXb3GVlYzhzjwxE1QPa4qD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106061'),
  ('697844223380408473', 'The Iron Petticoat', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward, James H. Ware', 'Ben Hecht', 'Bob Hope, Katharine Hepburn, Noelle Middleton, James Robertson Justice, Robert Helpmann, David Kossoff, Alan Gifford, Nicholas Phipps', 'NR', 'Captain Vinka Kovalenko defects from Russia, but not for political reasons. She defects because she feels discriminated against as a woman. Captain Chuck Lockwood gets the order to show her the bright side of capitalism, while she tries to convince him of the superiority of communism. Naturally, they fall in love, but there''s still the KGB, which doesn''t like the idea of having a defected Russian officer running around in London.', 'Captain Vinka Kovalenko defects from Russia, but not for political reasons. She defects because she feels discriminated against as a woman. Captain Chuck Lockwood gets the order to show her the bright side of capitalism, while she tries to convince him of the superiority of communism. Naturally, they fall in love, but there''s still the KGB, which doesn''t like the idea of having a defected Russian officer running around in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hL66vNYhj5rY0Y7dA25oVmaspRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40953'),
  ('657014284507057529', 'The Iron Rose', 1973, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jean Rollin, Jean-Noël Delamarre, Michel Maïofis', 'Jean Rollin', 'Françoise Pascal, Hugues Quester, Mireille Dargent, Natalie Perrey, Michel Delesalle, Jean Rollin', null, 'A young couple out for a walk decide to take a stroll through a large cemetery. As darkness begins to fall they realize they can''t find their way out, and soon their fears begin to overtake them.', 'A young couple out for a walk decide to take a stroll through a large cemetery. As darkness begins to fall they realize they can''t find their way out, and soon their fears begin to overtake them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEch3pkYG4w5Zuc296LxjGB1g4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84473'),
  ('213512831862501669', 'The Iron Stairs', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Denis Malleval, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty', 'Jacques Santamaria', 'Laurent Gerra, Annelise Hesme, Nicolas Marié, Audrey Beaulieu, Anaïs Beluze, Jérémy Charbonnel, Yvette Férréol, Luc Gentil', null, 'A meek, mild-mannered man begins to suspect that his beautiful wife is poisoning him after he realizes that his acute stomach aches occur only after he eats at home. As a result, he investigates the death of his predecessor-- his wife''s first husband.', 'A meek, mild-mannered man begins to suspect that his beautiful wife is poisoning him after he realizes that his acute stomach aches occur only after he eats at home. As a result, he investigates the death of his predecessor-- his wife''s first husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nKiAXHMvJ9utWqdiUSeR8Do2oe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296403'),
  ('200569895225075689', 'The Iron Super Man', 1975, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kwok Ting-Hung', 'Kwok Ting-Hung', 'Maggie Lee, Paul Chun Pui, Stephan Yip Tin-Hang, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Shao Hua Liang', null, 'An Earth Defence Brigade is formed to protect the world against invaders from outer space. The ruthless Frang Gang begins its raid against the earth on land, sea and by air. But they meet their match in the super robots of the Earth Defence Brigade.', 'An Earth Defence Brigade is formed to protect the world against invaders from outer space. The ruthless Frang Gang begins its raid against the earth on land, sea and by air. But they meet their match in the super robots of the Earth Defence Brigade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jenlBEwszTf6R621pZLKnVRewGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88642'),
  ('203415108076464916', 'The Iron Triangle', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Eric Weston, Irv Goodnoff', 'John A. Bushelman, Larry Hilbrand, Eric Weston', 'Beau Bridges, Haing S. Ngor, Liem Whatley, Johnny Hallyday, Jim Ishida, Ping Wu, Jack Ong, Arsenio Trinidad', null, 'Based on the diary of an unknown Viet Cong soldier, this film provides a sympathetic look at a Viet Cong soldier who protected a captured American soldier whom he believed did not kill him when the American had the opportunity. Written by John Sacksteder', 'Based on the diary of an unknown Viet Cong soldier, this film provides a sympathetic look at a Viet Cong soldier who protected a captured American soldier whom he believed did not kill him when the American had the opportunity. Written by John Sacksteder', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BWYeZNX6EG3Xlr1zA522P3KoeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99937'),
  ('445211975291373556', 'The Iron-Fisted Monk', 1977, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Danny Lee Yau-Tong, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Huang Feng, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Chan Sing, James Tien Chun, Lo Hoi-Pang, Wang Hsieh, Fung Hak-On, Wu Ma, Lam Ching-Ying', 'R', 'Husker is a student of the Shaolin monks, learning kung fu so that he can avenge his uncle who was murdered by the Manchus who control the province. He leaves his training early, desperate to teach the killers a lesson, and teams up with a martial artist monk who is teaching a group of factory workers how to defend themselves. When the Manchus strike again, Husker and his Buddhist pal decide it''s time to even the score.', 'Husker is a student of the Shaolin monks, learning kung fu so that he can avenge his uncle who was murdered by the Manchus who control the province. He leaves his training early, desperate to teach the killers a lesson, and teams up with a martial artist monk who is teaching a group of factory workers how to defend themselves. When the Manchus strike again, Husker and his Buddhist pal decide it''s time to even the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abrnUx9l5xMpn8yz5XlrA2d5SmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39881'),
  ('179158572072865766', 'The Irony of Fate, or Enjoy Your Bath!', 1975, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Yuriy Rabinovich', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Andrey Myagkov, Barbara Brylska, Yuriy Yakovlev, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Georgi Burkov, Aleksandr Belyavskiy, Liya Akhedzhakova, Valentina Talyzina', null, 'A group of old friends have a tradition of going to a public bathing house on New Year''s Eve. Occasionally too much vodka and beer makes two of them unconscious. The problem is that one of them (Sasha) has to go to Leningrad but another one (Zhenya) goes. Zhenya wakes up at Leningrad airport. Believing that he is still in Moscow he takes a taxi and goes home. The street name, building and even apartment number, the way an apartment complex looks the same and the key coincide completely - just typical Soviet-type ''economy'' architecture. Imagine the surprise of Nadya when she enters her apartment and finds a man without trousers in her bed. What''s more - Nadya''s fiancé also finds him there...', 'A group of old friends have a tradition of going to a public bathing house on New Year''s Eve. Occasionally too much vodka and beer makes two of them unconscious. The problem is that one of them (Sasha) has to go to Leningrad but another one (Zhenya) goes. Zhenya wakes up at Leningrad airport. Believing that he is still in Moscow he takes a taxi and goes home. The street name, building and even apartment number, the way an apartment complex looks the same and the key coincide completely - just typical Soviet-type ''economy'' architecture. Imagine the surprise of Nadya when she enters her apartment and finds a man without trousers in her bed. What''s more - Nadya''s fiancé also finds him there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlkG0yVVamCyBnLLbD2zOaHMJEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43430'),
  ('507392460917685967', 'The Irony of Fate: Continuation', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Sergey Trofimov, Yuliya Pavlova', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Eldar Ryazanov, Emil Braginskiy', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Sergei Bezrukov, Andrey Myagkov, Yuriy Yakovlev, Barbara Brylska, Mikhail Efremov, Roman Madyanov', null, 'Thirty years have passed since Zhenya and Nadya met—they broke up, and Nadya moved to Leningrad. The friends still go to the bathhouse, and now they are joined by Konstantin, Zhenya''s son. Uncle Pasha and Uncle Sasha persuade Kostya to arrange a New Year''s miracle for his father and send him to St. Petersburg. Nadya''s daughter lives at that very address, and on the same day, her fiancé, Irakli, is planning to propose to her.', 'Thirty years have passed since Zhenya and Nadya met—they broke up, and Nadya moved to Leningrad. The friends still go to the bathhouse, and now they are joined by Konstantin, Zhenya''s son. Uncle Pasha and Uncle Sasha persuade Kostya to arrange a New Year''s miracle for his father and send him to St. Petersburg. Nadya''s daughter lives at that very address, and on the same day, her fiancé, Irakli, is planning to propose to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzjLu5rTsIVHYmvMciUjmT3lJBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27046'),
  ('67209694642166388', 'The Irrefutable Truth About Demons', 2000, 'Horror', 'Glenn Standring, Simon Baumfield, Euan Frizzell', 'Glenn Standring', 'Karl Urban, Katie Wolfe, Sally Stockwell, Tony MacIver, Phil Grieve, Kelson Henderson, Neill Rea, Danny Mulheron', null, 'In the place between what you know, and what you fear, demons rule. All hope is stripped away as demonic forces overcome you. Dr. Harry Ballard has just unearthed the essence of evil. He’s a marked man, a living sacrifice, thrown to the depths of the demon world. At his side is a beautiful young woman – an ex-cult member who’s experienced their immeasurable power.', 'In the place between what you know, and what you fear, demons rule. All hope is stripped away as demonic forces overcome you. Dr. Harry Ballard has just unearthed the essence of evil. He’s a marked man, a living sacrifice, thrown to the depths of the demon world. At his side is a beautiful young woman – an ex-cult member who’s experienced their immeasurable power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUDeAFislZ7xkCQn8VMt35nEtGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15701'),
  ('929262385548096497', 'The Irregular at Magic High School: The Girl Who Summons the Stars', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Takashi Mamezuka, Satoshi Motoyama, Risako Yoshida', 'Muneo Nakamoto', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Saori Hayami, Yumi Uchiyama, Takuma Terashima, Satomi Sato, Atsushi Tamaru, Sora Amamiya, Yuiko Tatsumi', null, 'In the story, the seasons have changed and it will soon be the second spring. Tatsuya and Miyuki have finished their first year at First Magic High School and are on their spring break. The two go to their villa on the Ogasawara Island archipelago. After only a small moment of peace a lone young woman named Kokoa appears before them. She has abandoned the Naval base and she tells Tatsuya her one wish.', 'In the story, the seasons have changed and it will soon be the second spring. Tatsuya and Miyuki have finished their first year at First Magic High School and are on their spring break. The two go to their villa on the Ogasawara Island archipelago. After only a small moment of peace a lone young woman named Kokoa appears before them. She has abandoned the Naval base and she tells Tatsuya her one wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUttStQFPGp8rCXn7JYfC5IIlQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431821'),
  ('910843644684878592', 'The Irresistible Piano', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A piano entices anyone who comes near.', 'A piano entices anyone who comes near.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUZkpvgSIeih0kNDOWkKIpkv0ll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120039'),
  ('313656384759611500', 'The Island', 1980, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Ritchie, Henri Decaë, Mishka Cheyko', 'Peter Benchley', 'Michael Caine, David Warner, Angela Punch McGregor, Frank Middlemass, Don Henderson, Dudley Sutton, Colin Jeavons, Zakes Mokae', 'R', 'David Nau leads a band of modern day pirates who raid yachts and sail boats of people on vacation in the Caribbean. When reporter Blair Maynard and his son arrive to investigate the mystery of the disappearing boats, Nau and his band of raiders decide to induct them into their tribe.', 'David Nau leads a band of modern day pirates who raid yachts and sail boats of people on vacation in the Caribbean. When reporter Blair Maynard and his son arrive to investigate the mystery of the disappearing boats, Nau and his band of raiders decide to induct them into their tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sRdwKeWAfXEThF8v3Oz9qMUhIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7988'),
  ('102693592117935388', 'The Island', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Michael Bay, Mauro Fiore, Steve Battaglia', 'Caspian Tredwell-Owen, Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman', 'Ewan McGregor, Scarlett Johansson, Djimon Hounsou, Sean Bean, Steve Buscemi, Michael Clarke Duncan, Ethan Phillips, Brian Stepanek', 'PG-13', 'In 2019, Lincoln Six-Echo is a resident of a seemingly "Utopian" but contained facility. Like all of the inhabitants of this carefully-controlled environment, Lincoln hopes to be chosen to go to The Island — reportedly the last uncontaminated location on the planet. But Lincoln soon discovers that everything about his existence is a lie.', 'In 2019, Lincoln Six-Echo is a resident of a seemingly "Utopian" but contained facility. Like all of the inhabitants of this carefully-controlled environment, Lincoln hopes to be chosen to go to The Island — reportedly the last uncontaminated location on the planet. But Lincoln soon discovers that everything about his existence is a lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MaZYEyFmQwNeDTxZGQEN8E0e4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1635'),
  ('208919319504720793', 'The Island', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pavel Lungin, Andrei Zhegalov, Vladimir Litrovnik', 'Pavel Lungin, Dmitry Sobolev', 'Pyotr Mamonov, Viktor Sukhorukov, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Viktoriya Isakova, Aleksey Zelensky, Timofey Tribuntsev, Nina Usatova', 'PG-13', 'Somewhere in Northern Russia in a small Russian Orthodox monastery lives an unusual man whose bizarre conduct confuses his fellow monks, while others who visit the island believe that the man has the power to heal, exorcise demons and foretell the future.', 'Somewhere in Northern Russia in a small Russian Orthodox monastery lives an unusual man whose bizarre conduct confuses his fellow monks, while others who visit the island believe that the man has the power to heal, exorcise demons and foretell the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSDxhbDj95lsE25myWgJuWYCyzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22358'),
  ('920599819561564223', 'The Island', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Omar Roushdy Hamed, Khaled Al-Halafawi, Islam Hamza', 'Mohamed Diab', 'Ahmed Al Saqqa, Mahmoud Yassin, Hend Sabry, Khaled El Sawy, Mahmoud Abdel Moghny, Zeina, Bassem Samra, Asser Yassin', null, 'Mansour El-Hefny’s wealthy family rule an Upper Egyptian island. Some police officers facilite their arms dealing in exchange for information, and corrupt parliament members use their immunity to par-take in their drug trade.', 'Mansour El-Hefny’s wealthy family rule an Upper Egyptian island. Some police officers facilite their arms dealing in exchange for information, and corrupt parliament members use their immunity to par-take in their drug trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOi6bm9M2K1XZBFYeMtdAdrVwLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58476'),
  ('566028909518445057', 'The Island', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Christos Dimas, Giorgos Argyroiliopoulos, Stella Haritopoulou', 'Kostis Papadopoulos, Elena Solomou', 'Eleni Kastani, Elisavet Konstantinidou, Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Tania Trypi, Dimitris Tzoumakis, Michalis Marinos, Odysseas Papaspiliopoulos, Zeta Douka', null, 'The death of a prominent citizen reveals the corruption that festers behind closed doors on a seemingly beautiful serene Greek island of Sifnos.', 'The death of a prominent citizen reveals the corruption that festers behind closed doors on a seemingly beautiful serene Greek island of Sifnos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efK2kker8j4NJdThkhOFeGhoRbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35396'),
  ('650889524811528948', 'The Island', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Huang Bo, Zeng Jian, Noh Nam-seok', 'Huang Bo, Cui Siwei, Huang Zhanzhong', 'Huang Bo, Shu Qi, Wang Baoqiang, Zhang Yixing, Yu Hewei, Wang Xun, Li Qinqin, Li Youlin', null, 'A cataclysmic event causes a man, who dreams of winning the lottery, to become stranded on an island with his co-workers.', 'A cataclysmic event causes a man, who dreams of winning the lottery, to become stranded on an island with his co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHCKsCcjGwERPGvZa4JUrfKbi2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535170'),
  ('923816259770186489', 'The Island', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Shaun Paul Piccinino, Brad Rushing, Tesean Wilkin', 'Michael Caissie, Philippe Martinez', 'Michael Jai White, Jackson Rathbone, Gillian White, Edoardo Costa, Wayne Gordon, Amber Townsend, Cami Storm, Victor Young', 'R', 'When his brother is killed, LAPD officer Mark leaves the city to return to the island he grew up on. Seeking answers and ultimately vengeance, he soon finds himself in a bloody battle with the corrupt tycoon who''s taken over the island paradise.', 'When his brother is killed, LAPD officer Mark leaves the city to return to the island he grew up on. Seeking answers and ultimately vengeance, he soon finds himself in a bloody battle with the corrupt tycoon who''s taken over the island paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajb1rMiorchfRemYHZCkbV9DBg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138749'),
  ('682873011095354856', 'The Island at the Top of the World', 1974, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Robert Stevenson', 'John Whedon', 'Donald Sinden, David Hartman, Jacques Marin, Mako, David Gwillim, Agneta Eckemyr, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Gunnar Öhlund', 'G', 'A Victorian gentleman hopes to find his long-lost son, who vanished while searching for a mysterious Viking community in a volcanic valley somewhere in uncharted Arctic regions. The gentleman puts together an expedition team to go on the search, but when they reach their destination they must escape from some Viking descendants who will kill to keep their existence a secret.', 'A Victorian gentleman hopes to find his long-lost son, who vanished while searching for a mysterious Viking community in a volcanic valley somewhere in uncharted Arctic regions. The gentleman puts together an expedition team to go on the search, but when they reach their destination they must escape from some Viking descendants who will kill to keep their existence a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jceLUcdtxgveyABliSM5JFRSRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42453'),
  ('281272161666821717', 'The Island Bird', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Ivan Rousseau, Laure-Anne Nicolet, Gérard Jugnot', 'Alexandre Fouchard, Marie-Claire Javoy, Serge Lamadie', 'Marc Lavoine, Soan Arhimann, Gérard Jugnot, Stéfi Celma, Philippe Duquesne, Ornela Dalèle, Zakarie Rochette, Delixia Perrine', null, 'In a village somewhere on Reunion Island, Nelson, 10, dreams of being a singer and has signed up for Star Kids. Her friend Mia, accompanied by her little brother Zizou, decides to find a coach for her to help her prepare for the competition. His choice fell on Pierre Leroy, singer coming from Paris on a singing tour in a hotel by the sea, where Nelson''s mother works. But the current does not pass between Pierre, lonely and disillusioned, and Nelson, proud and obstinate. Will their one thing in common, the love of singing, be strong enough to bring them together and heal their wounds?', 'In a village somewhere on Reunion Island, Nelson, 10, dreams of being a singer and has signed up for Star Kids. Her friend Mia, accompanied by her little brother Zizou, decides to find a coach for her to help her prepare for the competition. His choice fell on Pierre Leroy, singer coming from Paris on a singing tour in a hotel by the sea, where Nelson''s mother works. But the current does not pass between Pierre, lonely and disillusioned, and Nelson, proud and obstinate. Will their one thing in common, the love of singing, be strong enough to bring them together and heal their wounds?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auzycsCKtxg2hWWe2PtRo48Topk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756935'),
  ('686081307974949867', 'The Island Closest to Heaven', 1984, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Wataru Kenmotsu', 'Tomoyo Harada, Miyoko Akaza, Wakaba Irie, Nenji Kobayashi, Kayo Matsuo, Tori Miki, Toru Minegishi, Hideo Murota', null, 'A Japanese teenager travels to New Caledonia in search of the fabled "island closest to heaven" that her late father had told her about.', 'A Japanese teenager travels to New Caledonia in search of the fabled "island closest to heaven" that her late father had told her about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO5oT8nAANrGcvcAOiRwft9oSiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298972'),
  ('501993925935865660', 'The Island Monster', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Roberto Bianchi Montero', 'Alberto Vecchietti, Roberto Bianchi Montero', 'Boris Karloff, Renato Vicario, Jole Fierro, Patrizia Remiddi, Franca Marzi, Carlo Duse, Giuseppe Chinnici, Salvatore Scibetta', null, 'An Italian government agent is assigned to break up a drug smuggling ring on the island of Ischia but his daughter is kidnapped by the gang.', 'An Italian government agent is assigned to break up a drug smuggling ring on the island of Ischia but his daughter is kidnapped by the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIoPQae2STt4iJ6AwkAiuxfiWjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65380'),
  ('80212405854524128', 'The Island of Dr. Moreau', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Don Taylor, Gerry Fisher', 'Al Ramrus, John Herman Shaner', 'Burt Lancaster, Michael York, Nigel Davenport, Barbara Carrera, Richard Basehart, Nick Cravat, The Great John L., Bob Ozman', 'PG', 'A ship-wrecked man floats ashore on an island in the Pacific Ocean. The island is inhabited by a scientist, Dr. Moreau, who in an experiment has turned beasts into human beings.', 'A ship-wrecked man floats ashore on an island in the Pacific Ocean. The island is inhabited by a scientist, Dr. Moreau, who in an experiment has turned beasts into human beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5kWAWxb3eWCkxFNT6WCipAnpQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26932'),
  ('386279729642608524', 'The Island of Dr. Moreau', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'John Frankenheimer, William A. Fraker, James Sbardellati', 'Richard Stanley, Ron Hutchinson', 'Marlon Brando, Val Kilmer, David Thewlis, Fairuza Balk, Ron Perlman, Marco Hofschneider, Temuera Morrison, William Hootkins', 'PG-13', 'A plane crash surviving attorney stumbles upon a mysterious island and is shocked to discover that a brilliant scientist and his lab assistant have found a way to combine human and animal DNA—with horrific results.', 'A plane crash surviving attorney stumbles upon a mysterious island and is shocked to discover that a brilliant scientist and his lab assistant have found a way to combine human and animal DNA—with horrific results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOJeQXve8W9rNRhdgC1WV3GQJyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9306'),
  ('490605484599234016', 'The Island of Giant Insects', 2019, 'Animation, Horror', 'Takeo Takahashi', 'Shigeru Morita', 'Momo Asakura, Rika Tachibana, Mao Ichimichi, Marina Inoue, Yurika Kubo, Chiaki Takahashi, Takuya Eguchi, Misato Fukuen', null, 'After an airplane crash during a school trip, Oribe Mutsumi and her classmates were stranded on a seemingly deserted island. Mutsumi found the other survivors, and used her wilderness knowledge to help them. She expects that they will be rescued in about three days, which doesn''t seem so long to endure. However, she didn''t account for the fact that the island is populated with gigantic killer insects. Her knowledge of butterflies, wasps, and more may be the only thing that will help any of her classmates survive to be rescued!', 'After an airplane crash during a school trip, Oribe Mutsumi and her classmates were stranded on a seemingly deserted island. Mutsumi found the other survivors, and used her wilderness knowledge to help them. She expects that they will be rescued in about three days, which doesn''t seem so long to endure. However, she didn''t account for the fact that the island is populated with gigantic killer insects. Her knowledge of butterflies, wasps, and more may be the only thing that will help any of her classmates survive to be rescued!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gCBTBqrBFjrpmmw4vpGykcnnsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576617'),
  ('19970187860540387', 'The Island of Giant Insects', 2020, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama, Horror, Adventure', 'Yuki Uemura, Naoyuki Tatsuwa, Takeo Takahashi', 'Shigeru Morita', 'Momo Asakura, Takuya Eguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mao Ichimichi, Marina Inoue, Wataru Komada, Yurika Kubo, Rika Tachibana', null, 'After an airplane crash during a school trip, Oribe Mutsumi and her classmates were stranded on a seemingly deserted island. Mutsumi found the other survivors, and used her wilderness knowledge to help them. She expects that they will be rescued in about three days, which doesn''t seem so long to endure. However, she didn''t account for the fact that the island is populated with gigantic killer insects. Her knowledge of butterflies, wasps, and more may be the only thing that will help any of her classmates survive to be rescued!', 'After an airplane crash during a school trip, Oribe Mutsumi and her classmates were stranded on a seemingly deserted island. Mutsumi found the other survivors, and used her wilderness knowledge to help them. She expects that they will be rescued in about three days, which doesn''t seem so long to endure. However, she didn''t account for the fact that the island is populated with gigantic killer insects. Her knowledge of butterflies, wasps, and more may be the only thing that will help any of her classmates survive to be rescued!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJFki1BLHvEi4gaPCJvy9SZQZpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658558'),
  ('387109521590120210', 'The Island of Lies', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paula Cons, Lucía Baleato, Aitor Mantxola', 'Luis Marías', 'Nerea Barros, Darío Grandinetti, Aitor Luna, Victoria Teijeiro, Ana Oca, Milo Taboada, Celso Bugallo, Pedro Galiza', null, 'Galicia, northern Spain, January 2, 1921. The steamship Santa Isabel, sailing towards Argentina with more than two hundred emigrants on board, sinks off the coast of Sálvora Island. Three island women, María, Josefa and Cipriana, who have bravely set sail aboard a fragile skiff to save the shipwrecked, are treated as heroes by the cynical authorities; but León, an inquisitive and tenacious Argentinean journalist, starts asking uncomfortable questions.', 'Galicia, northern Spain, January 2, 1921. The steamship Santa Isabel, sailing towards Argentina with more than two hundred emigrants on board, sinks off the coast of Sálvora Island. Three island women, María, Josefa and Cipriana, who have bravely set sail aboard a fragile skiff to save the shipwrecked, are treated as heroes by the cynical authorities; but León, an inquisitive and tenacious Argentinean journalist, starts asking uncomfortable questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5Ws8kN2cBazdClVBomiayqtSSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703145'),
  ('689515247681223307', 'The Island of the Dinosaurs', 1967, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Rafael Portillo', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Armando Silvestre, Elsa Cárdenas, Genaro Moreno, Crox Alvarado, Cavernario Galindo, Jesús "Murciélago" Velázquez, Cecilia Leger, Alma Delia Fuentes', null, 'A group of scientists in search of lost Atlantis are plane wrecked on an uncharted island full of stock footage monsters fresh from One Million BC. Occasionally we get an original papier mache monster peaking out from behind an alcove, but for the most part this is typical Mexican filmmaking for the period. With Armond Silvestre and Alma Delia Fuentes.', 'A group of scientists in search of lost Atlantis are plane wrecked on an uncharted island full of stock footage monsters fresh from One Million BC. Occasionally we get an original papier mache monster peaking out from behind an alcove, but for the most part this is typical Mexican filmmaking for the period. With Armond Silvestre and Alma Delia Fuentes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ukN6uGgEqSxOUNElEdOqqDHvga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278690'),
  ('1124266896330901623', 'The Island of Thirty Coffins', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Marcel Cravenne', 'Robert Scipion', 'Claude Jade, Jean-Paul Zehnacker, Yves Beneyton, Georges Marchal, Pascal Sellier, Julie Philippe, Marie Mergey, Pierre Semmler', null, 'The story takes place in 1917. Véronique is a young woman of 35 years, nurse at the military hospital of Besançon. She suddenly learns of the murder of her husband, the mysterious Count Vorski, whom she has not seen for fourteen years. Her research will also lead her to the track of her father and son whom she believed to have died in a shipwreck, already a long time ago. From clue to clue, here we are in Brittany, on this island with a name so ill-fitting... Brutal deaths, enigmatic words written... by whom? A frightening prophecy, the superstitious terror of the island''s inhabitants, and suddenly, Veronica d''Hergemont can no longer leave this island. She''s stuck alone. Almost alone...', 'The story takes place in 1917. Véronique is a young woman of 35 years, nurse at the military hospital of Besançon. She suddenly learns of the murder of her husband, the mysterious Count Vorski, whom she has not seen for fourteen years. Her research will also lead her to the track of her father and son whom she believed to have died in a shipwreck, already a long time ago. From clue to clue, here we are in Brittany, on this island with a name so ill-fitting... Brutal deaths, enigmatic words written... by whom? A frightening prophecy, the superstitious terror of the island''s inhabitants, and suddenly, Veronica d''Hergemont can no longer leave this island. She''s stuck alone. Almost alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHYx4ClWbx6g7pYCMW1gb32dCEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2378'),
  ('1125058038915851200', 'The Island on Bird Street', 1997, 'Drama, War', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen, Marek Piestrak, Jarosław Marszewski', 'John Goldsmith, Tony Grisoni', 'Patrick Bergin, Jordan Kiziuk, Jack Warden, James Bolam, Michael Byrne, Stefan Sauk, Suzanna Hamilton, Marek Grabowski', null, 'Alex is an 11-year old boy who, during WWII, hides in the Jewish ghetto from Nazis after all his relatives have been sent to the concentration camp. The movie portrays the ghetto through his eyes.', 'Alex is an 11-year old boy who, during WWII, hides in the Jewish ghetto from Nazis after all his relatives have been sent to the concentration camp. The movie portrays the ghetto through his eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8IXiMGnid3jSk5GAJAyjvDHL4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45614'),
  ('70081638986838839', 'The Islanders', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alantė Kavaitė, Benoit Seiller, Anaïs Coué', 'Alantė Kavaitė, Sara Wikler', 'Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Daphné Patakia, Dali Benssalah, Miou-Miou, Patrick Chesnais, Jean-Claude Drouot, Féodor Atkine, Alexandra Stewart', null, 'The story takes us to an island with no future, given that it’s already partly submerged underwater. A woman is caring for ten or so very elderly individuals, but the arrival of five travellers turns their lives upside down…', 'The story takes us to an island with no future, given that it’s already partly submerged underwater. A woman is caring for ten or so very elderly individuals, but the arrival of five travellers turns their lives upside down…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MyDCKQmHTV5y9EtB4860XR2DOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186830'),
  ('340442560013828956', 'The Isle', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Seo-shik Hwang, Kim Ki-duk, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Yu-seok, Suh Jung, Seo Won, Son Min-seok, Cho Jae-hyun, Jang Hang-seon, Han Ji-Sun, Yoon Hee-won', null, 'Mute Hee-Jin is working as a clerk in a fishing resort in the Korean wilderness; selling baits, food and occasionally her body to the fishing tourists. One day she falls in love with Hyun-Shik, who is on the run from the police, and rescues him with a fish hook when he tries to commit suicide.', 'Mute Hee-Jin is working as a clerk in a fishing resort in the Korean wilderness; selling baits, food and occasionally her body to the fishing tourists. One day she falls in love with Hyun-Shik, who is on the run from the police, and rescues him with a fish hook when he tries to commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkDx0Go36JEzR9dW7n7A6tleLNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8653'),
  ('256944155815119612', 'The Isle', 2019, 'Thriller, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Matthew Butler-Hart, Pete Wallington', 'Matthew Butler, Tori Butler-Hart', 'Conleth Hill, Alex Hassell, Tori Butler-Hart, Fisayo Akinade, Alix Wilton Regan, Graham Butler, Emma King, Dickon Tyrrell', 'NR', '1840 and another ship crashes on the rocks of an almost deserted island in Scotland. Three sailors survive the wreck and make it to shore where the few locals take them in as they wait for the mainland boat to come for them. But the sailors'' survival story has only just started as they uncover the strange past of the once vibrant island.', '1840 and another ship crashes on the rocks of an almost deserted island in Scotland. Three sailors survive the wreck and make it to shore where the few locals take them in as they wait for the mainland boat to come for them. But the sailors'' survival story has only just started as they uncover the strange past of the once vibrant island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4XDWsBWMzpoNm5fUMjr9cyY5rI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463364'),
  ('282544979793732160', 'The Isle of Pingo Pongo', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Tex Avery', null, null, null, 'A travelogue spotlights the tropical island of Pingo Pongo, showing the unusual flora and fauna and the lives of the happy natives. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'A travelogue spotlights the tropical island of Pingo Pongo, showing the unusual flora and fauna and the lives of the happy natives. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NtACu7fZVs5BIdO6yt3PPzGvnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205882'),
  ('1025148053924748906', 'The Italian', 2005, 'Drama', 'Andrey Kravchuk, Aleksandr Burov, Galla Kapitskaya', 'Andrey Romanov', 'Kolya Spiridonov, Mariya Kuznetsova, Nikolay Reutov, Denis Moiseenko, Sasha Sirotkin, Polina Vorobeva, Olga Shuvalova, Dima Zemlyanko', 'PG-13', 'Set in 2002, an abandoned 5-year-old boy living in a rundown orphanage in a small Russian village is adopted by an Italian family.', 'Set in 2002, an abandoned 5-year-old boy living in a rundown orphanage in a small Russian village is adopted by an Italian family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHZ51evGQBu6TEHRLMiHa84Gg8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17388'),
  ('536617163923323406', 'The Italian', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux', 'Éric Besnard, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Kad Merad, Valérie Benguigui, Roland Giraud, Philippe Lefebvre, Guillaume Gallienne, Sid Ahmed Agoumi, Farida Ouchani, Saphia Azzeddine', null, 'Dino Fabrizzi is the number one seller of the Maserati dealership in Nice. At 42, he arrives at a turning point in his life, the position of director is openly proposed and his companion for a year, Helen, has the firm intention to marry her. For Dino, life is great, except that this perfect life was built on a lie. Dino is actually called Mourad Ben Saoud. Neither his boss nor Helen and even less his parents are aware of this false identity. In ten days begins Ramadan and Mourad who passes every year will this time assume the promise made to his sick father. Taking part in Ramadan, For Dino - the Italian - it will not be easy.', 'Dino Fabrizzi is the number one seller of the Maserati dealership in Nice. At 42, he arrives at a turning point in his life, the position of director is openly proposed and his companion for a year, Helen, has the firm intention to marry her. For Dino, life is great, except that this perfect life was built on a lie. Dino is actually called Mourad Ben Saoud. Neither his boss nor Helen and even less his parents are aware of this false identity. In ten days begins Ramadan and Mourad who passes every year will this time assume the promise made to his sick father. Taking part in Ramadan, For Dino - the Italian - it will not be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3pUrmCzx0cNG79c5Ocmm2YiebT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44155'),
  ('243356381233572314', 'The Italian Connection', 1972, 'Crime, Action', 'Fernando Di Leo, Franco Villa, Franco Lo Cascio', 'Fernando Di Leo, Augusto Finocchi, Ingo Hermes', 'Mario Adorf, Henry Silva, Woody Strode, Adolfo Celi, Luciana Paluzzi, Franco Fabrizi, Femi Benussi, Gianni Macchia', 'R', 'When a shipment of heroin disappears between Italy and New York, a small-time pimp in Milan is framed for the theft. Two professional hitmen are dispatched from New York to find him, but the real thieves want to get rid of him before the New York killers get to him to eliminate any chance of them finding out he''s the wrong man.', 'When a shipment of heroin disappears between Italy and New York, a small-time pimp in Milan is framed for the theft. Two professional hitmen are dispatched from New York to find him, but the real thieves want to get rid of him before the New York killers get to him to eliminate any chance of them finding out he''s the wrong man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vheVwwD7ua4PtV41Sei3UUix7Pv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61462'),
  ('605109065576240978', 'The Italian Job', 1969, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Peter Collinson, Douglas Slocombe, Scott Wodehouse', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Michael Caine, Noël Coward, Benny Hill, Margaret Blye, Raf Vallone, Tony Beckley, Rossano Brazzi, Irene Handl', 'G', 'Charlie''s got a ''job'' to do. Having just left prison he finds one of his friends has attempted a high-risk job in Torino, Italy, right under the nose of the mafia. Charlie''s friend doesn''t get very far, so Charlie takes over the ''job''. Using three Mini Coopers, a couple of Jaguars, and a bus, he hopes to bring Torino to a standstill, steal a fortune in gold and escape in the chaos.', 'Charlie''s got a ''job'' to do. Having just left prison he finds one of his friends has attempted a high-risk job in Torino, Italy, right under the nose of the mafia. Charlie''s friend doesn''t get very far, so Charlie takes over the ''job''. Using three Mini Coopers, a couple of Jaguars, and a bus, he hopes to bring Torino to a standstill, steal a fortune in gold and escape in the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NOw3HPHkcBndJW2K6ofbcSb7WD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10536'),
  ('139124046000702349', 'The Italian Job', 2003, 'Action, Crime', 'F. Gary Gray, Wally Pfister, Jon Billington', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Mark Wahlberg, Charlize Theron, Edward Norton, Seth Green, Jason Statham, Yasiin Bey, Donald Sutherland, Olek Krupa', 'PG-13', 'Charlie Croker pulled off the crime of a lifetime. The one thing that he didn''t plan on was being double-crossed. Along with a drop-dead gorgeous safecracker, Croker and his team take off to re-steal the loot and end up in a pulse-pounding, pedal-to-the-metal chase that careens up, down, above and below the streets of Los Angeles.', 'Charlie Croker pulled off the crime of a lifetime. The one thing that he didn''t plan on was being double-crossed. Along with a drop-dead gorgeous safecracker, Croker and his team take off to re-steal the loot and end up in a pulse-pounding, pedal-to-the-metal chase that careens up, down, above and below the streets of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSkjK4kctyrWpFhxl35GPvSs6tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9654'),
  ('579955938198341530', 'The Italian Straw Hat', 1928, 'Comedy', 'René Clair', 'Eugène Labiche', 'Albert Préjean, Geymond Vital, Olga Tschechowa, Marise Maia, Yvonneck, Louis Pré Fils, Albert Préjean, Geymond Vital', null, 'On the day of Fadinard''s wedding, his horse eats a lady''s hat on a bush at the roadside, while the lady is hidden behind the bush with her lover Lieutenant Tavernier. Because she is married, she cannot return home hatless without being compromised, and Tavernier orders Fadinard to replace the hat with one exactly like it - or else he will wreck his new home. In an elaborate sequence of complications, Fadinard tries to find a hat while keeping to his marriage schedule', 'On the day of Fadinard''s wedding, his horse eats a lady''s hat on a bush at the roadside, while the lady is hidden behind the bush with her lover Lieutenant Tavernier. Because she is married, she cannot return home hatless without being compromised, and Tavernier orders Fadinard to replace the hat with one exactly like it - or else he will wreck his new home. In an elaborate sequence of complications, Fadinard tries to find a hat while keeping to his marriage schedule', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tm4GQoVWx1s0Ado9K3awHkiiF9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99875'),
  ('176334186139452696', 'The Item', 1999, 'Horror', 'Dan Clark, Michael Mayhew', 'Dan Clark', 'DawnMarie Ferrara, Dan Clark, David Pressler, Dan Lake, Ron Fitzgerald, Romy J. Sharf, Judy Jean Kwon, Kyle B. Cunningham', 'R', 'Four felons are contacted by an anonymous client via the internet. They are instructed to go to a remote desert island and pick up an "item" and keep it safe for 24 hours. It will then be picked up and they will be paid. However, upon getting it back to their apartment, their curiosity gets the better of them and they decide to investigate their package. They discover that they have a telepathic worm connected to a life support system. The film then disintegrates into a slasher film as one by one the protectors are killed in grisly fashion.', 'Four felons are contacted by an anonymous client via the internet. They are instructed to go to a remote desert island and pick up an "item" and keep it safe for 24 hours. It will then be picked up and they will be paid. However, upon getting it back to their apartment, their curiosity gets the better of them and they decide to investigate their package. They discover that they have a telepathic worm connected to a life support system. The film then disintegrates into a slasher film as one by one the protectors are killed in grisly fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IklKezIvHPSZKK2ovCpwJqecf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86685'),
  ('790823043655848342', 'The Itsy Bitsy Spider', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matthew O''Callaghan', 'Jerry Rapp, Michael O''Donoghue', 'Andrea Martin, Thora Birch, Frank Welker, Jim Carrey', null, 'During a piano lesson, a music teacher discovers a harmless spider, so she calls in The Exterminator.', 'During a piano lesson, a music teacher discovers a harmless spider, so she calls in The Exterminator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ii0ezgkjwwWbBRJIrFcm1iTZyiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209688'),
  ('389837496796382266', 'The Ivory Game', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Kief Davidson, Richard Ladkani, Richard Ladkani', null, 'Ofir Drori', null, 'Wildlife activists and investigators put their lives on the line to battle the illegal African ivory trade, in this suspenseful on-the-ground documentary.', 'Wildlife activists and investigators put their lives on the line to battle the illegal African ivory trade, in this suspenseful on-the-ground documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWFyOj0wk8AFLqC8PH5LRD3kJht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411023'),
  ('1058469992578430906', 'The Ivy', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ana Cristina Barragán, Adrian Durazo', 'Ana Cristina Barragán', 'Simone Bucio, Francis Eddú Llumiquinga, Marine Lepoutre, Alejandro Cisneros, Nicolás Fernández', null, 'Azucena, a woman in her thirties, approaches Julio, a teenage boy living in a group home, for reasons he doesn''t understand. As they spend time together, an uneasy closeness grows, changing the shape of a bond neither expected to find.', 'Azucena, a woman in her thirties, approaches Julio, a teenage boy living in a group home, for reasons he doesn''t understand. As they spend time together, an uneasy closeness grows, changing the shape of a bond neither expected to find.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmMcPaTjvQ0TSnL541ULuHGICFQx.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-ivy-2026'),
  ('1009412515518429199', 'The J Team', 2021, 'Music, Family, TV Movie', 'Thomas M. Harting, Michael Lembeck', 'Eydie Faye', 'JoJo Siwa, Tisha Campbell, Laura Soltis, Kyra Leroux, Julia Marley, Kiara T. Romero, Kerrynton Jones, Kenya Jordan', null, 'The story follows a young girl named JoJo whose life is turned upside down when her beloved dance coach decides to retire and is replaced by a sparkle-hating instructor named Poppy. Wanting to stay in the running for an upcoming dance competition, JoJo and her best friends, The Rubies, must try their hardest to abide by Poppy’s new, harsh rules. Realizing she cannot hide her sparkle or bow anymore, JoJo is kicked out of her dance troupe and must rediscover what dancing means to her.', 'The story follows a young girl named JoJo whose life is turned upside down when her beloved dance coach decides to retire and is replaced by a sparkle-hating instructor named Poppy. Wanting to stay in the running for an upcoming dance competition, JoJo and her best friends, The Rubies, must try their hardest to abide by Poppy’s new, harsh rules. Realizing she cannot hide her sparkle or bow anymore, JoJo is kicked out of her dance troupe and must rediscover what dancing means to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRCYKdzUxEZVfAd97C1vDv4lBvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798293'),
  ('460613695035419213', 'The Jack Bull', 1999, 'Western, TV Movie', 'John Badham, Gale Tattersall', 'Dick Cusack', 'John Cusack, John Goodman, L.Q. Jones, Miranda Otto, John Savage, Rex Linn, John C. McGinley, Kurt Fuller', 'R', 'When the law fails to punish a fellow rancher that has abused his horses, a Wyoming horse trader sacrifices it all in a quest for justice.', 'When the law fails to punish a fellow rancher that has abused his horses, a Wyoming horse trader sacrifices it all in a quest for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPbvb9cHQxcg9GzXG8DCb0yMSJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16331'),
  ('1134194728219391951', 'The Jack in the Box', 2019, 'Horror', 'Lawrence Fowler, Cameron Bryson, Robert Howgate', 'Lawrence Fowler', 'Ethan Taylor, Robert Strange, Lucy-Jane Quinlan, Philip Ridout, Darrie Gardner, Stacey Lynn Crowe, Vinnie Clarke, Charles Abomeli', null, 'When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is un-earthed and opened, it''s new owners soon have reason to believe the creepy clown doll within has a life of its own.', 'When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is un-earthed and opened, it''s new owners soon have reason to believe the creepy clown doll within has a life of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suaQ6oScsa5rrfx3osJHyQp1ZXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622420'),
  ('790109075679612766', 'The Jack in the Box Rises', 2024, 'Horror', 'Lawrence Fowler', 'Geoff Fowler, Lawrence Fowler', 'Nicholas Anscombe, Isabella Colby Browne, Derek Nelson, Georgia Conlan, James Reynard, Leona Clarke, Georgina Jane, Oli Meredith', null, 'When a creepy Jack-in-the-Box is discovered and opened on the grounds of an exclusive girls'' school, six brave students soon enter a fight to the finish against the unleashed demon.', 'When a creepy Jack-in-the-Box is discovered and opened on the grounds of an exclusive girls'' school, six brave students soon enter a fight to the finish against the unleashed demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDVjlCTSyF6Fh8Fpm683MyGGnSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207898'),
  ('227639216568826044', 'The Jack in the Box: Awakening', 2022, 'Horror', 'Lawrence Fowler, Robert Howgate', 'Lawrence Fowler', 'Matt McClure, Mollie Hindle-Pérez, James Swanton, Nicola Wright, Nicholas Anscombe, Michaela Longden, Erina Mashate, Jason Farries', null, 'When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is opened by a dying woman, she enters into a deal with the demon within that would see her illness cured in return for helping it claim six innocent victims.', 'When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is opened by a dying woman, she enters into a deal with the demon within that would see her illness cured in return for helping it claim six innocent victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ib8vlWTrAKRrTWUrTrZPOMW4jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801071'),
  ('1054843528401766239', 'The Jackal', 1997, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Dennis Bosher', 'Kenneth Ross', 'Bruce Willis, Richard Gere, Sidney Poitier, Diane Venora, J.K. Simmons, Mathilda May, John Cunningham, Jack Black', 'R', 'Hired by a powerful member of the Russian mafia to avenge an FBI sting that left his brother dead, a psychopathic hitman known only as The Jackal proves an elusive target for the people charged with the task of bringing him down: a deputy FBI director, a Russian MVK Major, and a jailed IRA terrorist who can recognize him.', 'Hired by a powerful member of the Russian mafia to avenge an FBI sting that left his brother dead, a psychopathic hitman known only as The Jackal proves an elusive target for the people charged with the task of bringing him down: a deputy FBI director, a Russian MVK Major, and a jailed IRA terrorist who can recognize him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXF26QmDEaRaH9Fbhs3NXtcnryx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4824'),
  ('1038318254864308799', 'The Jacket', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, Fantasy', 'John Maybury, Peter Deming, Karen Richards', 'Massy Tadjedin', 'Adrien Brody, Keira Knightley, Kris Kristofferson, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Kelly Lynch, Brad Renfro, Daniel Craig, Angel Coulby', 'R', 'A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.', 'A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bt89UfRhjAvJDAO9CWJnRFXAN3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9667'),
  ('579010945337054514', 'The Jackie Robinson Story', 1950, 'Drama, Family', 'Maurie M. Suess, Ernest Laszlo, Alfred E. Green', 'Lawrence Taylor, Arthur Mann', 'Jackie Robinson, Ruby Dee, Minor Watson, Louise Beavers, Richard Lane, Harry Shannon, Ben Lessy, William ''Bill'' Spaulding', null, 'Biography of Jackie Robinson, the first black major league baseball player in the 20th century. Traces his career in the negro leagues and the major leagues.', 'Biography of Jackie Robinson, the first black major league baseball player in the 20th century. Traces his career in the negro leagues and the major leagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cx13WcbLX3dU7Lo6ZcVwygQpdtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43392'),
  ('885447355617185683', 'The Jackpot', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Joseph LaShelle, Walter Lang', 'Phoebe Ephron, Henry Ephron', 'James Stewart, Barbara Hale, James Gleason, Fred Clark, Alan Mowbray, Patricia Medina, Natalie Wood, Tommy Rettig', 'NR', 'Bill Lawrence wins a bevy of prizes from a radio program, but ends up having to sell them in order to pay the taxes incurred.', 'Bill Lawrence wins a bevy of prizes from a radio program, but ends up having to sell them in order to pay the taxes incurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Gsw3T73hYtoduoQEKla8EHKBzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111732'),
  ('603190660762197443', 'The Jackpot!', 1991, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Denis Seurat, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Simon Michaël, Didier Kaminka, Claude Zidi', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Miou-Miou, Eddy Mitchell, Michel Boujenah, Hélène Zidi, Annick Alane, Bérangère Jean, Sagamore Stévenin', null, 'To his family, François Voisin is nothing more than a humdrum civil servant. In truth, for the past twenty years he has been working as a secret agent. All goes well until circumstances put his secret in danger.', 'To his family, François Voisin is nothing more than a humdrum civil servant. In truth, for the past twenty years he has been working as a secret agent. All goes well until circumstances put his secret in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTn3hsc9wqOIOaYzucy97putFFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75944'),
  ('897384984363325913', 'The Jade Mask', 1945, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Phil Rosen, Harry Neumann', 'George Callahan', 'Sidney Toler, Mantan Moreland, Edwin Luke, Hardie Albright, Janet Warren, Al Bridge, Edith Evanson, Dorothy Granger', 'NR', 'The latest assignment for respected detective Charlie Chan has come directly from the government and involves the disappearance of a scientist named Harper, who was working on an extremely important serum. When the scientist is killed, Chan must sort through all very likely suspects, including the man''s sister and his butler.', 'The latest assignment for respected detective Charlie Chan has come directly from the government and involves the disappearance of a scientist named Harper, who was working on an extremely important serum. When the scientist is killed, Chan must sort through all very likely suspects, including the man''s sister and his butler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yC9a3Vcxp215OAiJHeMQ6LCCQb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38468'),
  ('379913919122677150', 'The Jade Tiger', 1977, 'Action, Adventure', 'Chor Yuen, Wong Chit', 'Gu Long, Chor Yuen', 'Ti Lung, Elliot Ngok Wah, Ku Feng, Lily Li, Fan Mei-Sheng, Lo Lieh, Derek Yee, Shih Szu', null, 'Zhao Wuji, son of the leader of the Zhao Clan, embarks on a tragic adventure full of intrigue to avenge his father, who is beheaded by a traitor working for the rival Tang Clan.', 'Zhao Wuji, son of the leader of the Zhao Clan, embarks on a tragic adventure full of intrigue to avenge his father, who is beheaded by a traitor working for the rival Tang Clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgG2yCUyI3lLLjJ6c0GmFEXDml5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64993'),
  ('798596351302343105', 'The Jail: The Women''s Hell', 2006, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Bruno Mattei', 'Antonio Tentori', 'Yvette Yzon, Dyane Craystan, Amelie Pontailler, Jim Gaines, Odette Khan, Mike Monty', null, 'Three women are sent by steamboat to an undisclosed jungle prison called "The Home of Lost Souls". Here they experience the usual beatings, whippings, cat fights and humiliations. The butch warden has a deal on the side with a local pimp who forces them to dance in bikinis at a nightclub and sexually service the patrons. Tired of cages, rape, torture and rats, the girls kill the resident snitch and escape into the jungle.', 'Three women are sent by steamboat to an undisclosed jungle prison called "The Home of Lost Souls". Here they experience the usual beatings, whippings, cat fights and humiliations. The butch warden has a deal on the side with a local pimp who forces them to dance in bikinis at a nightclub and sexually service the patrons. Tired of cages, rape, torture and rats, the girls kill the resident snitch and escape into the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihjD8igyNxFe3VqpRUnKIPuNz7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73196'),
  ('321431625429561975', 'The James Bond Story', 1999, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sean Connery, Roger Moore, Pierce Brosnan', null, 'Bond... James Bond! Perhaps the greatest fictional cinema icon ever. He first appeared on the big screen in 1962 in Dr. No and has remained the most powerful action hero ever since. The secret to his success is his adaptability. No matter what tight spots he finds himself in, he always appears to be suave, sophisticated and cool. This is the full story -- from the creation of the character, the men who played him, all the toys, and all the women. Everything you wanted to know about James Bond... and more.', 'Bond... James Bond! Perhaps the greatest fictional cinema icon ever. He first appeared on the big screen in 1962 in Dr. No and has remained the most powerful action hero ever since. The secret to his success is his adaptability. No matter what tight spots he finds himself in, he always appears to be suave, sophisticated and cool. This is the full story -- from the creation of the character, the men who played him, all the toys, and all the women. Everything you wanted to know about James Bond... and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wG1iksqapNCNNZuIneHuF6j9Sg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44650'),
  ('186214988703289693', 'The James Dean Story', 1957, 'Documentary', 'Robert Altman, George W. George', 'Stewart Stern', 'James Dean, Martin Gabel, Lew Bracker, Marvin Carter, Patsy D''Amore, Charles Dean, Emma Dean, Louis de Liso', null, 'Released two years after James Dean''s death, this documentary chronicles his short life and career via black-and-white still photographs, interviews with the aunt and uncle who raised him, his paternal grandparents, a New York City cabdriver friend, the owner of his favorite Los Angeles restaurant, outtakes from East of Eden, footage of the opening night of Giant, and Dean''s ironic PSA for safe driving.', 'Released two years after James Dean''s death, this documentary chronicles his short life and career via black-and-white still photographs, interviews with the aunt and uncle who raised him, his paternal grandparents, a New York City cabdriver friend, the owner of his favorite Los Angeles restaurant, outtakes from East of Eden, footage of the opening night of Giant, and Dean''s ironic PSA for safe driving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmjihTFH7ROwJuthIZvoLC99AtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5652'),
  ('876402428969586521', 'The Jane Austen Book Club', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robin Swicord, John Toon', 'Robin Swicord', 'Kathy Baker, Maria Bello, Emily Blunt, Amy Brenneman, Hugh Dancy, Maggie Grace, Lynn Redgrave, Jimmy Smits', 'PG-13', 'Six Californians start a club to discuss the works of Jane Austen. As they delve into Austen''s literature, the club members find themselves dealing with life experiences that parallel the themes of the books they are reading.', 'Six Californians start a club to discuss the works of Jane Austen. As they delve into Austen''s literature, the club members find themselves dealing with life experiences that parallel the themes of the books they are reading.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O8LgoBqOGrKXpYFQXVHOxoRNg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5951'),
  ('782285166662945655', 'The Janes', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Tia Lessin, Emma Pildes, Keith Walker', null, 'Heather Booth, Judith Arcana, Marie Leaner, Diane Stevens, Eleanor Oliver, Martin Luther King Jr., Walter Cronkite, Hugh Hefner', null, 'Defying the state legislature that outlawed abortion, the Catholic Church that condemned it, and the Chicago Mob that was profiting from it, the members of “Jane” risked their personal and professional lives to support women with unwanted pregnancies. In the pre-Roe v. Wade era — a time when abortion was a crime in most states and even circulating information about abortion was a felony in Illinois — the Janes provided low-cost and free abortions to an estimated 11,000 women.', 'Defying the state legislature that outlawed abortion, the Catholic Church that condemned it, and the Chicago Mob that was profiting from it, the members of “Jane” risked their personal and professional lives to support women with unwanted pregnancies. In the pre-Roe v. Wade era — a time when abortion was a crime in most states and even circulating information about abortion was a felony in Illinois — the Janes provided low-cost and free abortions to an estimated 11,000 women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKWJ0hw1tWOONaQliyrp2wC6Rcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913829'),
  ('428857912996884210', 'The January Man', 1989, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'Pat O''Connor, Risa Bramon Garcia, Billy Hopkins', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Kevin Kline, Susan Sarandon, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Harvey Keitel, Danny Aiello, Rod Steiger, Alan Rickman, Faye Grant', 'R', 'Nick and Frank Starkey were both policemen. A scandal forced Nick to leave the force, now a serial killer has driven the police to take him back. A web that includes Frank''s wife, bribery, and corruption all are in the background as Nick tries to uncover the secret of where the killer will strike next, and finally must lay a trap without the police.', 'Nick and Frank Starkey were both policemen. A scandal forced Nick to leave the force, now a serial killer has driven the police to take him back. A web that includes Frank''s wife, bribery, and corruption all are in the background as Nick tries to uncover the secret of where the killer will strike next, and finally must lay a trap without the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CZznrNvFLacr0mb4CYmlpJ4Tsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32059'),
  ('832696706882218444', 'The Japanese Wife Next Door', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Yutaka Ikejima', 'Kyoko Godai', 'Naohiro Hirakawa, Reiko Yamaguchi, Lemon Hanazawa, Kaoru Akitsu, Koji Makimura, Kikujiro Honda', null, 'Office worker Takashi shares a drink one night with two women: Ryoko and Sakura. Fate intervenes and he subsequently ends up marrying Sakura. The newlywed couple move into Takashi’s family home (shared with his sister, father and grandfather), but Sakura’s nymphomaniac sex drive soon starts to cause tensions.', 'Office worker Takashi shares a drink one night with two women: Ryoko and Sakura. Fate intervenes and he subsequently ends up marrying Sakura. The newlywed couple move into Takashi’s family home (shared with his sister, father and grandfather), but Sakura’s nymphomaniac sex drive soon starts to cause tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBuo2H8scmxdBl0On977QvvR36E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81452'),
  ('306515181801995223', 'The Japanese Wife Next Door: Part 2', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Yutaka Ikejima', 'Kyoko Godai', 'Akane Yazaki, Reiko Yamaguchi, Naohiro Hirakawa, Azusa Sakai, Lemon Hanazawa, Koji Makimura, Kikujiro Honda', null, 'A businessman’s life is almost complete; all he needs is a wife. He meets two women… and this time he marries the rich one — whose family just happens to be a bunch of sadomasochistic sociopaths!', 'A businessman’s life is almost complete; all he needs is a wife. He meets two women… and this time he marries the rich one — whose family just happens to be a bunch of sadomasochistic sociopaths!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRCo2drnssdlhcGAwYPoOeqhv6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99436'),
  ('232302530411577933', 'The Japon', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo, Valentín Álvarez', 'Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor, Álvaro Díaz Lorenzo', 'María León, Dani Rovira, Antonio Dechent, Cinta Ramírez, Iker Castiñeira, Maya Murofushi, José Ramón Bocanegra', 'PG', 'In 1614 a Japanese expedition led by the emperor''s grandson landed in the Sevillian town of Coria del Río, and the heir to the throne fell in love with a beautiful Sevillian, formed a family and never returned to Japan. 400 years later, Emperor Satohito dies and the rightful heir turns out to be Paco Japan, a 37-year-old neighbor of Coria del Río. The life of Paco and his family will change dramatically when he sees himself overnight living in the Imperial Palace and preparing to be the new Emperors of Japan. The cultural and linguistic clash between Japanese and Andalusian will cause funny and crazy situations in this adventure where East and West shake hands.', 'In 1614 a Japanese expedition led by the emperor''s grandson landed in the Sevillian town of Coria del Río, and the heir to the throne fell in love with a beautiful Sevillian, formed a family and never returned to Japan. 400 years later, Emperor Satohito dies and the rightful heir turns out to be Paco Japan, a 37-year-old neighbor of Coria del Río. The life of Paco and his family will change dramatically when he sees himself overnight living in the Imperial Palace and preparing to be the new Emperors of Japan. The cultural and linguistic clash between Japanese and Andalusian will cause funny and crazy situations in this adventure where East and West shake hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2Th4u8f74JRPJd0LpC8i0L0ZmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529209'),
  ('271894875282741682', 'The Jar', 1984, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Bruce Toscano, Cameron MacLeod, Marla Simon', 'George Bradley', 'Gary Wallace, Karin Sjöberg, Robert Gerald Witt, Dean Schoepter, Les Miller, Don Donovan, Torna Jackson, Robert Cameron Arundel', 'R', 'A motorist who comes upon an auto accident finds a bottle at the scene. The bottle contains a demon who proceeds to possess him.', 'A motorist who comes upon an auto accident finds a bottle at the scene. The bottle contains a demon who proceeds to possess him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mhXTLL1xJGaXl7kPv3LY6a09m3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171367'),
  ('865640004325219146', 'The Jar', 1992, null, 'Ebrahim Forouzesh', 'Houshang Moradi Kermani', 'Behzad Khodaveisi, Fatemeh Azrah, Abbas Khavaninzadeh, Hassein Balai, Alireza Haji-Ghasemi, Sakineh Mehrizi, Ramazan Moila-Abbasi, Shamsoddin Olfat', null, 'In the yard of an Iranian village school stands in the shade of a tree a large stoneware jar from which all the pupils drink fresh water. On an unfortunate day, the jar starts leaking. The schoolmaster tries hard to get a new one but in vain. The only solution is to have it fixed...', 'In the yard of an Iranian village school stands in the shade of a tree a large stoneware jar from which all the pupils drink fresh water. On an unfortunate day, the jar starts leaking. The schoolmaster tries hard to get a new one but in vain. The only solution is to have it fixed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rupg2QX2BAVlwbD6zMWxZa3kIO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275096'),
  ('187687299499080362', 'The Jayhawkers!', 1959, 'Action, Western', 'Melvin Frank, Loyal Griggs, Daniel McCauley', 'A.I. Bezzerides, Frank Fenton, Melvin Frank', 'Jeff Chandler, Fess Parker, Nicole Maurey, Henry Silva, Herbert Rudley, Frank De Kova, Don Megowan, Leo Gordon', 'NR', 'Before the U.S. Civil War rebel leader Luke Darcy sees himself as leader of a new independent Republic of Kansas but the military governor sends an ex-raider to capture Darcy.', 'Before the U.S. Civil War rebel leader Luke Darcy sees himself as leader of a new independent Republic of Kansas but the military governor sends an ex-raider to capture Darcy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE9oSBiqeljFMW6TRnhPcVKfkHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6587'),
  ('139788692613968408', 'The Jayne Mansfield Story', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Paul Lohmann, Thomas M. Hammel', null, 'Loni Anderson, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Ray Buktenica, Kathleen Lloyd, G.D. Spradlin, Dave Shelley, Laura Jacoby, Whitney Rydbeck', 'PG-13', 'The story of the 1950s platinum-blonde sex symbol whose search for stardom and meteoric (if brief) career ended in an automobile accident when she was 36.', 'The story of the 1950s platinum-blonde sex symbol whose search for stardom and meteoric (if brief) career ended in an automobile accident when she was 36.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22YrfWuibWxpac2WdGlwSSMcyRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79365'),
  ('651688263484620306', 'The Jazz Fool', 1929, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Horace pulls a wagon with a a small pipe organ, with Mickey at the keys; a sign on the side reads "Mickey''s Big Road Show." They arrive, and Mickey''s suitcase labeled "Jazz Fool" unfolds to a piano, which he plays (and sings about 8 notes). At the end, the piano attacks him. There is no dialogue, aside from the nonsense syllables sung.', 'Horace pulls a wagon with a a small pipe organ, with Mickey at the keys; a sign on the side reads "Mickey''s Big Road Show." They arrive, and Mickey''s suitcase labeled "Jazz Fool" unfolds to a piano, which he plays (and sings about 8 notes). At the end, the piano attacks him. There is no dialogue, aside from the nonsense syllables sung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0XlbkaCWKAhJOmap2YuYLEw5cH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190365'),
  ('155589474223108307', 'The Jazz Singer', 1927, 'Drama, Music', 'Alan Crosland, Hal Mohr, Gordon Hollingshead', 'Alfred A. Cohn', 'Al Jolson, May McAvoy, Warner Oland, Eugenie Besserer, Otto Lederer, Robert Gordon, Richard Tucker, Yossele Rosenblatt', 'NR', 'A young Jewish man is torn between tradition and individuality when his old-fashioned family objects to his career as a jazz singer. This is the first full length feature film to use synchronized sound, and is the original film musical.', 'A young Jewish man is torn between tradition and individuality when his old-fashioned family objects to his career as a jazz singer. This is the first full length feature film to use synchronized sound, and is the original film musical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr8Pt1GO87cwB3210TO3JTNDsUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939'),
