  ('1031031178500004507', 'The Jericho Mile', 1980, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Mann, Ross Brown, Frank Beetson', null, 'Peter Strauss, Roger E. Mosley, Richard Lawson, Brian Dennehy, Geoffrey Lewis, Billy Green Bush, Ed Lauter, Beverly Todd', null, 'A runner, serving a life sentence at Folsom Prison, works at becoming the world''s fastest miler and wins a chance to compete for a spot on the Olympic team.', 'A runner, serving a life sentence at Folsom Prison, works at becoming the world''s fastest miler and wins a chance to compete for a spot on the Olympic team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cinQBqd5K5jDqEJ0ECbXA58dXt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57537'),
  ('914503272947907505', 'The Jerk', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Carl Reiner, Victor J. Kemper', 'Steve Martin, Carl Gottlieb, Michael Elias', 'Steve Martin, Bernadette Peters, Catlin Adams, Mabel King, Richard Ward, Carl Gottlieb, Dick Anthony Williams, Bill Macy', 'R', 'After discovering he''s not really black like the rest of his family, likable dimwit Navin Johnson sets off on a hilarious misadventure that takes him from rags to riches and back again. The slaphappy jerk strikes it rich, but life in the fast lane isn''t all it''s cracked up to be and, in the end, all that really matters to Johnson is his true love.', 'After discovering he''s not really black like the rest of his family, likable dimwit Navin Johnson sets off on a hilarious misadventure that takes him from rags to riches and back again. The slaphappy jerk strikes it rich, but life in the fast lane isn''t all it''s cracked up to be and, in the end, all that really matters to Johnson is his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIjOWtUofyt9Jawge7FbvITjU3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6471'),
  ('954286315913523457', 'The Jerk Theory', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Scott S. Anderson, T.C. Christensen', 'Scott S. Anderson, Abraham Taylor', 'Josh Henderson, Jenna Dewan, Tom Arnold, Lauren Storm, Derek Lee Nixon, Jesse Heiman, Anthony Gaskins, Abraham Taylor', 'PG-13', 'An aspiring recording artist, Adam, is burned by a bad relationship experience and decides that if women won''t respond to the "nice guy" then he''ll be "the jerk." This is wildly successful with meaningless relationships, but when Adam meets and falls for Molly, who doesn''t fall for his jerk routine, Adam is forced to reconsider his dating philosophy.', 'An aspiring recording artist, Adam, is burned by a bad relationship experience and decides that if women won''t respond to the "nice guy" then he''ll be "the jerk." This is wildly successful with meaningless relationships, but when Adam meets and falls for Molly, who doesn''t fall for his jerk routine, Adam is forced to reconsider his dating philosophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iimMsIA5xrTMNoyaiXzJkH7QSh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34188'),
  ('904128147054549236', 'The Jerks', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Giorgos Konstantinou', 'Giorgos Konstantinou', 'Giorgos Konstantinou, Tasos Psomopoulos, Markos Lezes, Frini Arvaniti, Kostas Karagiorgis, Kostas Palios, Giannis Vouros, Yiorgos Petrohilos', null, 'Leonidas is tricked into thinking he will hit the jackpot by a guy from the underworld, Babis, also well-known on the street as "the teacher". So, he sets up an ad hoc gang with his close friends in order to rob a bank. The operation, however, is crowned by complete failure. Actually, Babis used Leonidas to create a diversion in order to rob a jeweler''s shop. Leonidas flies into a rage and swears to take revenge on the "teacher". The scuffle that follows results in all of them ending up in hospital.', 'Leonidas is tricked into thinking he will hit the jackpot by a guy from the underworld, Babis, also well-known on the street as "the teacher". So, he sets up an ad hoc gang with his close friends in order to rob a bank. The operation, however, is crowned by complete failure. Actually, Babis used Leonidas to create a diversion in order to rob a jeweler''s shop. Leonidas flies into a rage and swears to take revenge on the "teacher". The scuffle that follows results in all of them ending up in hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBRXcNXHJVG51OxNk3aMFUIhvWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38038'),
  ('442884223898919437', 'The Jerky Boys', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime', 'James Melkonian, Ueli Steiger', 'Rich Wilkes', 'John G. Brennan, Kamal Ahmed, Alan Arkin, William Hickey, Vincent Pastore, Alan North, Suzanne Shepherd, Ozzy Osbourne', 'R', 'When two unemployed telephone pranksters decide to use their vocal "talents" to impersonate a Chicago mob boss and curry favor with organized crime in New York, the trouble begins. It isn''t long before Johnny and Kamal (the "Jerky Boys" of crank call fame) are wanted by the local mafia, the police, and their neighbor.', 'When two unemployed telephone pranksters decide to use their vocal "talents" to impersonate a Chicago mob boss and curry favor with organized crime in New York, the trouble begins. It isn''t long before Johnny and Kamal (the "Jerky Boys" of crank call fame) are wanted by the local mafia, the police, and their neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUbdqyZaeaoNKBQmnmtim1IIAf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18713'),
  ('1042628344479825055', 'The Jester', 1987, 'Drama', 'Mário de Carvalho, José Álvaro Morais, Octávio Espírito Santo', 'Rafael Godinho, José Álvaro Morais', 'Fernando Heitor, Paula Guedes, Luís Lucas, Raul Solnado, Jasmim de Matos, Carlos Farinha, Margarida Vila-Nova, Rogério Samora', null, 'Set four years after the Portuguese revolution and the simultaneous loss of the Portuguese empire in Africa, the story concerns a director who sells guns to finance his play.', 'Set four years after the Portuguese revolution and the simultaneous loss of the Portuguese empire in Africa, the story concerns a director who sells guns to finance his play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySgo1fMuNhbVIP35VGxuluMF9Cw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128966'),
  ('373180529423841480', 'The Jester', 2016, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Colin Krawchuk', null, 'Colin Krawchuk, Michael Sheffield', 'NR', 'The Jester is the titular main antagonist of the horror/thriller analogy short films of the same name. He is an enigmatic and malevolent being who enjoys inducing suffering to individuals he comes across who don''t appreciate his own tricks or break the rules of Halloween.', 'The Jester is the titular main antagonist of the horror/thriller analogy short films of the same name. He is an enigmatic and malevolent being who enjoys inducing suffering to individuals he comes across who don''t appreciate his own tricks or break the rules of Halloween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqBXZ7FrIU51uqtpC8PkS9CPv12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693467'),
  ('566198053875642603', 'The Jester 2', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Colin Krawchuk, Kevin Duggin', 'Colin Krawchuk', 'Michael Sheffield, Kaitlyn Trentham, Dingani Beza, Hassen Kacem, Jessica Ambuehl, Charles Mckee, Patrick Loree', 'NR', 'When teen magician Max crosses paths with the sinister Jester on Halloween night, she must outsmart a supernatural killer whose magic is all too real and whose tricks always end up in blood.', 'When teen magician Max crosses paths with the sinister Jester on Halloween night, she must outsmart a supernatural killer whose magic is all too real and whose tricks always end up in blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47dsw1jSOV0Be5zmy7CtLhYpqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1519168'),
  ('933677743447548199', 'The Jester: Chapter 3', 2019, 'Horror', 'Colin Krawchuk', null, 'Michael Sheffield', 'NR', 'On Halloween night, a young girl has no one to go trick-or-treating with....until The Jester offers to tag along.', 'On Halloween night, a young girl has no one to go trick-or-treating with....until The Jester offers to tag along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOjUdRVJyMv4nMovJRwBnZj3ahl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693475'),
  ('44575068384948974', 'The Jester''s Supper', 1942, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Mario Craveri', 'Renato Castellani, Alessandro Blasetti', 'Amedeo Nazzari, Osvaldo Valenti, Clara Calamai, Valentina Cortese, Elisa Cegani, Luisa Ferida, Alfredo Varelli, Memo Benassi', null, 'In Florence, at the time of Lorenzo de Medici, known also as Lorenzo the Magnificent, the aristocrat brothers Chiaramantesi rule with an iron fist the streets of the city. Ruthless and fierce, the two brothers have chosen as their special victim the innocent and harmless Giannetto. Even though determined to not react to the cruel pranks of the brothers, Giannetto is forced to take a stand when Ginevra, a beautiful girl that works in the Chiaramantesi household, is dragged into the game. To defend his honor and protect the girl, Giannetto works out a fiendish plot that will end in blood and madness.', 'In Florence, at the time of Lorenzo de Medici, known also as Lorenzo the Magnificent, the aristocrat brothers Chiaramantesi rule with an iron fist the streets of the city. Ruthless and fierce, the two brothers have chosen as their special victim the innocent and harmless Giannetto. Even though determined to not react to the cruel pranks of the brothers, Giannetto is forced to take a stand when Ginevra, a beautiful girl that works in the Chiaramantesi household, is dragged into the game. To defend his honor and protect the girl, Giannetto works out a fiendish plot that will end in blood and madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrMGZeklOhi8ecKBu9lnzBGDlyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288918'),
  ('1030611433297680699', 'The Jester''s Tale', 1964, 'Adventure, Comedy, History', 'Karel Zeman, Miroslav Kubišta, Jana Rozbrojová', 'Karel Zeman, Pavel Juráček, Radovan Krátký', 'Petr Kostka, Miloslav Holub, Emília Vášáryová, Valentina Thielová, Eduard Kohout, Vladimír Menšík, Čestmír Řanda, Karel Effa', null, 'An anti-war black comedy set during the Thirty Years'' War. It follows ploughman Petr, recruiter Matěj and country girl Lenka who get caught up in both sides of the war and experience many adventures before they find happiness. The film combines live action with animation to suggest the artistic style of the engraver Matthäus Merian.', 'An anti-war black comedy set during the Thirty Years'' War. It follows ploughman Petr, recruiter Matěj and country girl Lenka who get caught up in both sides of the war and experience many adventures before they find happiness. The film combines live action with animation to suggest the artistic style of the engraver Matthäus Merian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plmsCBKSZexAFFPcCdYHEh4mE9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57983'),
  ('105212719307668033', 'The Jesus Rolls', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'John Turturro, Francisco Ortiz, Matt Lake', 'John Turturro', 'John Turturro, Audrey Tautou, Bobby Cannavale, Sonia Braga, Jon Hamm, Christopher Walken, Susan Sarandon, Pete Davidson', 'R', 'Hours after his release from prison, Jesus Quintana pairs up with fellow misfits Petey and Marie for a freewheeling joyride of petty crime and romance.', 'Hours after his release from prison, Jesus Quintana pairs up with fellow misfits Petey and Marie for a freewheeling joyride of petty crime and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxXZXYNn1H5eVRbpTZVFvWBvjlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429416'),
  ('110714298627155763', 'The Jet Cage', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Friz Freleng', 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Tweety sits in his house, forlorn over the fact he can''t fly outside like other birds because of his hungry feline predator, Sylvester.', 'Tweety sits in his house, forlorn over the fact he can''t fly outside like other birds because of his hungry feline predator, Sylvester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z26RIbby3NWmTkbt99jAYEuFcQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234527'),
  ('241243975152863138', 'The Jetsons & WWE: Robo-WrestleMania', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Bell', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', 'Jeff Bergman, Grey DeLisle, Trevor Devall, Tania Gunadi, Tress MacNeille, Danica McKellar, Frank Welker, Eric Bauza', 'NR', 'Blast off to adventure in this animated feature where our favorite space-age family, The Jetsons, meet the superstars of WWE! When George unearths WWE’s Big Show, who has been frozen for 100 years, the futuristic face-off begins! Once thawed, Big Show wastes no time in taking the WWE belt from the current robot champ as well as taking total control of Orbit City. It’s up to The Jetsons to travel back in time and enlist help from WWE’s brightest stars: Sheamus, Alicia Fox, Roman Reigns, Seth Rollins and the Uso brothers. Can this cosmic tag-team prevail and set this twisted time-warp straight? Tune in and see with The Jetsons and WWE!', 'Blast off to adventure in this animated feature where our favorite space-age family, The Jetsons, meet the superstars of WWE! When George unearths WWE’s Big Show, who has been frozen for 100 years, the futuristic face-off begins! Once thawed, Big Show wastes no time in taking the WWE belt from the current robot champ as well as taking total control of Orbit City. It’s up to The Jetsons to travel back in time and enlist help from WWE’s brightest stars: Sheamus, Alicia Fox, Roman Reigns, Seth Rollins and the Uso brothers. Can this cosmic tag-team prevail and set this twisted time-warp straight? Tune in and see with The Jetsons and WWE!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IGnSewlijRC8lqYJVpYcszSu6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444510'),
  ('471976448320456299', 'The Jetsons Meet the Flintstones', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Ray Patterson, Don Lusk', 'Don Nelson, Arthur Alsberg', 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler, Don Messick, Henry Corden, Jon Bauman, Hamilton Camp, Julie McWhirter, George O''Hanlon', 'NR', 'Elroy Jetson invents a time machine that takes him back to prehistoric times, where he meets the Flintstone family.', 'Elroy Jetson invents a time machine that takes him back to prehistoric times, where he meets the Flintstone family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NJTAlOapW5jNVkt0ZZrTelfuiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36868'),
  ('346291423911426809', 'The Jewel', 2011, 'Drama', 'Andrea Molaioli, Luca Bigazzi', 'Andrea Molaioli, Ludovica Rampoldi, Gabriele Romagnoli', 'Toni Servillo, Remo Girone, Sarah Felberbaum, Fausto Maria Sciarappa, Lino Guanciale, Vanessa Compagnucci, Renato Carpentieri, Lisa Galantini', null, 'Amanzio Rastelli appointed several of his relations to managerial positions in his firm. They decided to think internationally and now business is heavily in debt. Luckily for the Rastellis, Bolta the accountant uses all the tricks of his art to cook the books, but catastrophe awaits.', 'Amanzio Rastelli appointed several of his relations to managerial positions in his firm. They decided to think internationally and now business is heavily in debt. Luckily for the Rastellis, Bolta the accountant uses all the tricks of his art to cook the books, but catastrophe awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/N9x1jRZXPtuDrWkjZBiKPTiURX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58060'),
  ('1120238985149971646', 'The Jewel of the Nile', 1985, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Lewis Teague, Jan de Bont, Glenn Randall Jr.', 'Mark Rosenthal, Lawrence Konner', 'Michael Douglas, Kathleen Turner, Danny DeVito, Spiros Focás, Avner Eisenberg, Paul David Magid, Howard Jay Patterson, Randall Edwin Nelson', 'PG', 'Joan Wilder is thrust back into a world of murder, chases, foreign intrigue... and love. This time out she''s duped by a duplicitous Arab dignitary who brings her to the Middle East, ostensibly to write a book about his life. Of course, he''s up to no good, and Joan is just another pawn in his wicked game. But Jack Colton and his sidekick Ralph show up to help our intrepid heroine save the day.', 'Joan Wilder is thrust back into a world of murder, chases, foreign intrigue... and love. This time out she''s duped by a duplicitous Arab dignitary who brings her to the Middle East, ostensibly to write a book about his life. Of course, he''s up to no good, and Joan is just another pawn in his wicked game. But Jack Colton and his sidekick Ralph show up to help our intrepid heroine save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VjsIhnIcrz2XdQVHdsMj5DdSa1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10303'),
  ('837498804744750313', 'The Jewel Thief', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Landon Van Soest, Juliette Marquis', null, null, 'R', 'Gerald Blanchard''s surprising, first-hand account as a calculating and accomplished criminal mastermind. Two unlikely detectives track him worldwide as he commits increasingly elaborate heists in a quest for fame.', 'Gerald Blanchard''s surprising, first-hand account as a calculating and accomplished criminal mastermind. Two unlikely detectives track him worldwide as he commits increasingly elaborate heists in a quest for fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXkcAw1vbLpPgW5G1C9jiW3zgRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109715'),
  ('223341697796052526', 'The Jews', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Yvan Attal, Rémy Chevrin', 'Yvan Attal, Émilie Frèche', 'Yvan Attal, Benoît Poelvoorde, Valérie Bonneton, Dany Boon, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Gilles Lellouche, François Damiens, Freya Mavor', null, 'Four separate stories deal with stereotypical ideas about Jews: their alleged influence on politics, the stereotype of Jewish business-mindedness, the Mossad, the Jewish world conspiracy and the memory of the Holocaust.', 'Four separate stories deal with stereotypical ideas about Jews: their alleged influence on politics, the stereotype of Jewish business-mindedness, the Mossad, the Jewish world conspiracy and the memory of the Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO2e8IVtpWtdM3lawEE6svyfvhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393407'),
  ('859077388789901157', 'The Jigsaw Man', 1983, 'Thriller', 'Terence Young, Freddie Francis', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Michael Caine, Laurence Olivier, Susan George, Robert Powell, Charles Gray, Morteza Kazerouni, Michael Medwin, Eric Sevareid', null, 'Philip Kimberly, the former head of the British Secret Service who defected to Russia, is given plastic surgery and sent back to Britain by the KGB to retrieve some vital documents. With the documents in hand, he instead plays off MI6 and the KGB against each other.', 'Philip Kimberly, the former head of the British Secret Service who defected to Russia, is given plastic surgery and sent back to Britain by the KGB to retrieve some vital documents. With the documents in hand, he instead plays off MI6 and the KGB against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb9oG0jovLKZh5X8SFpnosS1ivW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32665'),
  ('428153036671221541', 'The Jigsaw Murders', 1989, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jag Mundhra, Rodney McDonald, Howard Wexler', 'Allen B. Ury', 'Chad Everett, Michelle Johnson, Yaphet Kotto, Michael Sabatino, Dena Drotar, Jill Jacobson, Eli Rich, Paul Kent', 'R', 'A jigsaw puzzle is the key in a detective''s investigation of a gruesome murder.', 'A jigsaw puzzle is the key in a detective''s investigation of a gruesome murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8YGzuoYZAmuvcSUknzR5JVsBaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291284'),
  ('983603779128733163', 'The Jinn', 2013, 'Horror', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Fulya Zenginer, Serdal Genç, Oğuzhan Yıldız, Hande Kaptan, Alper Kadayıfçı, Sevinç Erol, Ebru Unurtan, Elif Erdal', null, 'A group of friends were haunted respectively with a supernatural forces due to their faulty deed against a little snake.', 'A group of friends were haunted respectively with a supernatural forces due to their faulty deed against a little snake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgAQcvMeDgfPFzdqlsrcvckh9Qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343775'),
  ('714309439286188687', 'The JK Years: A Political Trajectory', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Silvio Tendler, Lúcio Kodato, Francisco Moreira', 'Claudio Bojunga', 'Juscelino Kubitschek, Tancredo Neves, Renato Archer, Othon Bastos', null, 'Documentary about Brazilian history, from 1945 until the 70s, focusing on president Juscelino Kubitschek, his political rise, his philosophy of economical development, his gigantic project ...', 'Documentary about Brazilian history, from 1945 until the 70s, focusing on president Juscelino Kubitschek, his political rise, his philosophy of economical development, his gigantic project ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daq7OuwrfFXDxuEw8Mn4iy7SsAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272399'),
  ('114776128687633517', 'The Jodorowsky Constellation', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Louis Mouchet', 'Louis Mouchet', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Peter Gabriel, Marcel Marceau, Jean Giraud, Fernando Arrabal, Louis Mouchet', null, 'This documentary depicts the filmmaker Alejandro Jodorowsky talking about his life, his loves, his career as a filmmaker, graphic novelist, and workshop leader, and his eccentricities including tarot reader and theatrical director during The Panic Movement. Directed by Louis Mouchet, La Constellation Jodorowsky includes a lengthy on-camera interview with Jodorowsky in Spanish with subtitles. Marcel Marceau, Fernando Arrabal, Peter Gabriel, Jean "Moebius" Giraud, and Jean Pierre Vignau make appearances discussing their various projects with the director. In addition to the interview and film clips, Mouchet features some bizarre footage from Jodorowsky’s absurdist plays in which topless women splattered with paint writhe around the stage in a theatrical production meant to represent The Panic Movement, i.e., an artistic expression in which reason cannot fully express the human experience.', 'This documentary depicts the filmmaker Alejandro Jodorowsky talking about his life, his loves, his career as a filmmaker, graphic novelist, and workshop leader, and his eccentricities including tarot reader and theatrical director during The Panic Movement. Directed by Louis Mouchet, La Constellation Jodorowsky includes a lengthy on-camera interview with Jodorowsky in Spanish with subtitles. Marcel Marceau, Fernando Arrabal, Peter Gabriel, Jean "Moebius" Giraud, and Jean Pierre Vignau make appearances discussing their various projects with the director. In addition to the interview and film clips, Mouchet features some bizarre footage from Jodorowsky’s absurdist plays in which topless women splattered with paint writhe around the stage in a theatrical production meant to represent The Panic Movement, i.e., an artistic expression in which reason cannot fully express the human experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJzhDcMZ1ahtxf69T9Nnhvw8hqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37621'),
  ('121063809636462194', 'The Johnsons', 1992, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Rudolf van den Berg, Theo Bierkens', 'Roy Frumkes', 'Monique van de Ven, Esmée de la Bretonière, Kenneth Herdigein, Rik van Uffelen, Otto Sterman, Olga Zuiderhoek, Nelly Frijda, Kees Hulst', null, 'According to an ancient Indian tale a giant monster embryo residing in a crystal vase is predetermined to fertilize a blue-eyed woman. She will give birth to something evil to unleash horror and destruction upon human kind. Ugly septuplet brothers reproduced within the framework of mysterious genetic experiments terrorize a young innocent girl who seems to be chosen for the sinister predestination.', 'According to an ancient Indian tale a giant monster embryo residing in a crystal vase is predetermined to fertilize a blue-eyed woman. She will give birth to something evil to unleash horror and destruction upon human kind. Ugly septuplet brothers reproduced within the framework of mysterious genetic experiments terrorize a young innocent girl who seems to be chosen for the sinister predestination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSZYO3YsDTQ1E68jakJaAUDduww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76449'),
  ('128177680521816860', 'The Joint Brothers', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Hervé Palud, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Jean-Marie Pallardy, Hervé Palud', 'Gérard Lanvin, Jacques Villeret, Josiane Balasko, Michel Galabru, Valérie Mairesse, Philippe Khorsand, Daniel Russo, Dominique Lavanant', null, 'After he is dismissed from his umpteenth job, Momo is kicked out of the family home by his fed-up father. He immediately joins his buddy Manu, who is also penniless having just lost his job at a cafeteria. The two decide to ask shady nightclub owner Sammy for a job, and he promptly hires them to transport back two statuettes from Amsterdam. Momo and Manu soon find out that these art objects are stuffed with drugs, but still manage to carry out their mission. They receive one kilo of grass in exchange, which they sell immediately. But while the business is lucrative, they discover that it''s not so easy to become a full-fledged drug dealer...', 'After he is dismissed from his umpteenth job, Momo is kicked out of the family home by his fed-up father. He immediately joins his buddy Manu, who is also penniless having just lost his job at a cafeteria. The two decide to ask shady nightclub owner Sammy for a job, and he promptly hires them to transport back two statuettes from Amsterdam. Momo and Manu soon find out that these art objects are stuffed with drugs, but still manage to carry out their mission. They receive one kilo of grass in exchange, which they sell immediately. But while the business is lucrative, they discover that it''s not so easy to become a full-fledged drug dealer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FbKr4BlZucrR0pa0SmkN11EP4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51257'),
  ('621914767335166445', 'The Joke', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jaromil Jireš, Ivana Skabranská, Eliška Štíbrová', 'Jaromil Jireš, Milan Kundera', 'Josef Somr, Jana Dítětová, Luděk Munzar, Jaroslava Obermaierová, Evald Schorm, Milan Svrčina, Miloš Rejchrt, Věra Křesadlová', null, 'In the 1950s, Ludvik Jahn was expelled from the Communist Party and the University by his fellow students, because of a politically incorrect note he sent to his girlfriend. Fifteen years later, he tries to get his revenge by seducing Helena, the wife of one of his accusers.', 'In the 1950s, Ludvik Jahn was expelled from the Communist Party and the University by his fellow students, because of a politically incorrect note he sent to his girlfriend. Fifteen years later, he tries to get his revenge by seducing Helena, the wife of one of his accusers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koQFbDEnbq1JPZO4KrlQhdHjTSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105627'),
  ('260622366058607725', 'The Joker', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer, Georges Pellegrin', 'Philippe de Broca, Daniel Boulanger', 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Anouk Aimée, Pierre Palau, Geneviève Cluny, Georges Wilson, Anne Tonietti, François Maistre, Jean-Pierre Rambal', null, 'A young man who lives on women meets his match in the young wife of a rich industrialist. Their affair is doomed by her taste for luxury and his dislike of her coolness.', 'A young man who lives on women meets his match in the young wife of a rich industrialist. Their affair is doomed by her taste for luxury and his dislike of her coolness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqyuWC8PWbVXCKzq8M8mK2QslMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142379'),
  ('392276197759959614', 'The Joker is Wild', 1957, 'Drama, Music', 'Charles Vidor, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Oscar Saul', 'Frank Sinatra, Mitzi Gaynor, Jeanne Crain, Eddie Albert, Beverly Garland, Jackie Coogan, Barry Kelley, Ted de Corsia', null, 'A Prohibition-era nightclub crooner has his career is cut short when his throat is slashed by a mob boss.', 'A Prohibition-era nightclub crooner has his career is cut short when his throat is slashed by a mob boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AqFWME7ycwPKVLKChrZqHgzV33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133792'),
  ('1001624725662567003', 'The Jokers', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ken Hodges, Ken Softley, Ariel Levy', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Michael Crawford, Oliver Reed, Harry Andrews, James Donald, Michael Hordern, Daniel Massey, Gabriella Licudi, Lotte Tarp', 'NR', 'Brothers Michael and David Tremayne decide to steal the Crown Jewels from the Tower of London, not for criminal purposes, but to make themselves famous.', 'Brothers Michael and David Tremayne decide to steal the Crown Jewels from the Tower of London, not for criminal purposes, but to make themselves famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zk20ihdIQqsoPgpZi5gJVVxgfVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155450'),
  ('1016570321088503543', 'The Jokes', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Enzo Salvi, Carlo Buccirosso, Max Cavallari, Bruno Arena, Gigi Proietti, Biagio Izzo, Max Giusti, Vito', null, 'In many small episodes, various characters represent the typical vices and comedy of Italian society in early 2000.', 'In many small episodes, various characters represent the typical vices and comedy of Italian society in early 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgzygvWq1rZ5h2qn1hX3h73Fs29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61821'),
  ('403175840407875427', 'The Jolly Forgers', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yolande Moreau, Jacques Royer, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Yolande Moreau, Frédérique Moreau', 'Yolande Moreau, Grégory Gadebois, Sergi López, Estéban, Thomas Guy, William Sheller, Anne Benoît, François Morel', null, 'Mireille Stockaert is a lonely and broken woman. In love with painting and poetry, she makes do with her work in the cafeteria of the Beaux-Arts in Namur. Her life changes when she chooses to live in the large family house she inherits. Not having the means to maintain it, she decides to take in three tenants. Three men who will upset her routine.', 'Mireille Stockaert is a lonely and broken woman. In love with painting and poetry, she makes do with her work in the cafeteria of the Beaux-Arts in Namur. Her life changes when she chooses to live in the large family house she inherits. Not having the means to maintain it, she decides to take in three tenants. Three men who will upset her routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFhfNX8jVGCP4svlgaohmHjkUhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966355'),
  ('427650594322659946', 'The Jolly Monkey', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ryan Ebert', 'Ryan Ebert', 'Dominic Keating, Jane Hajduk, Courtney Fulk, Neirin Winter, Lisa Cole, Anthony Jensen, Landon Jacob Lee, Aria Surrec', null, '40 years ago, families disappeared near the isolated Jolly Monkey motel. Today, the family of the owners return to discuss what to do with the place. One by one they are killed by a someone dressed as the motel''s mascot and need to escape.', '40 years ago, families disappeared near the isolated Jolly Monkey motel. Today, the family of the owners return to discuss what to do with the place. One by one they are killed by a someone dressed as the motel''s mascot and need to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QVc7y4t9h8aHX51Hu2xb2XdjHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440641'),
  ('401147260993099854', 'The Jolson Story', 1946, 'Drama, Music', 'Alfred E. Green, Joseph Walker', 'Stephen Longstreet', 'Larry Parks, Evelyn Keyes, William Demarest, Bill Goodwin, Ludwig Donath, Scotty Beckett, Tamara Shayne, Jo-Carroll Dennison', 'NR', 'At the turn of the 20th century, young Asa Yoelson decides to go against the wishes of his cantor father and pursue a career in show business. Gradually working his way up through the vaudeville ranks, Asa — now calling himself Al Jolson — joins a blackface minstrel troupe and soon builds a reputation as a consummate performer. But as his career grows in size, so does his ego, resulting in battles in business as well as in his personal life.', 'At the turn of the 20th century, young Asa Yoelson decides to go against the wishes of his cantor father and pursue a career in show business. Gradually working his way up through the vaudeville ranks, Asa — now calling himself Al Jolson — joins a blackface minstrel troupe and soon builds a reputation as a consummate performer. But as his career grows in size, so does his ego, resulting in battles in business as well as in his personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TA8OqACOphikMD16HLeohJqPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31206'),
  ('550348795843867404', 'The Joneses', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Derrick Borte, Craig Borden, Yaron Orbach', 'Derrick Borte', 'David Duchovny, Demi Moore, Amber Heard, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Lauren Hutton, Catherine Dyer, Gary Cole, Glenne Headly', 'R', 'A seemingly perfect family moves into a suburban neighborhood, but when it comes to the truth as to why they''re living there, they don''t exactly come clean with their neighbors.', 'A seemingly perfect family moves into a suburban neighborhood, but when it comes to the truth as to why they''re living there, they don''t exactly come clean with their neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YINGouZK9pmPdMPAHv158eQf3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41479'),
  ('246910124995733307', 'The Jönsson Gang - The Master Plan', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alain Darborg, Benjam Orre', 'Piotr Marciniak, Alain Darborg', 'Simon J. Berger, Alexander Karim, Torkel Petersson, Susanne Thorson, Jens Hultén, Andrea Edwards, Niklas Falk, Juan Rodríguez', null, 'Charles Ingvar Jönsson gathers three criminals to take vengeance upon the people who killed his uncle.', 'Charles Ingvar Jönsson gathers three criminals to take vengeance upon the people who killed his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUDcDA4AsUa51HRIiIfMJoqSfI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308160'),
  ('939556563260885134', 'The Jönsson Gang & Dynamite Harry', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mikael Ekman, Lasse Björne', 'Erik Balling, Henning Bahs', 'Gösta Ekman, Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Nils Brandt, Carl Billquist, Weiron Holmberg, Mona Seilitz, Dan Ekborg', null, 'Sickan, Vanheden and Rocky try to rob the Berns nightclub one night, but Vanheden has made the mistake to invite his constantly drunk cousin, the old dynamiter Dynamite-Harry and he ruins the plan. Sickan is arrested, and has to spend 10 months in a small, locked room. When he is released, he has a new plan, but Rocky and Vanheden have decided to go straight. Together with Dynamite-Harry, Sickan plans to rob a cold store, managed by their arch-enemy, Wall-Enberg.', 'Sickan, Vanheden and Rocky try to rob the Berns nightclub one night, but Vanheden has made the mistake to invite his constantly drunk cousin, the old dynamiter Dynamite-Harry and he ruins the plan. Sickan is arrested, and has to spend 10 months in a small, locked room. When he is released, he has a new plan, but Rocky and Vanheden have decided to go straight. Together with Dynamite-Harry, Sickan plans to rob a cold store, managed by their arch-enemy, Wall-Enberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnwoaPImq7OJBUuIAxbEH0tpllC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29224'),
  ('39538762218616652', 'The Jönsson Gang at High Stakes', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Rolf Lindström, Thomas Ryberger, Sanna Ekman', 'Björn Gustafson', 'Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Johan Ulveson, Birgitta Andersson, Margreth Weivers, Per Grundén, Weiron Holmberg, Helge Skoog', null, 'Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry are approached by Sickan''s grandmother and Sickan''s younger brother Sven-Ingvar. Their evil nemesis Wall-Enberg are planning to steal billions of euros of the European Union''s grants to culture. The grant of 350 million kronor, paid by an Italian bank acting as intermediary, equals 60 billion lire but through assistance of a Sicilian "businessman", this sum becomes 60 billion kronor when transferred. The money is to be transferred to a large number of bank accounts, and the account numbers are saved on a floppy disc that the Jönsson gang is trying to steal.', 'Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry are approached by Sickan''s grandmother and Sickan''s younger brother Sven-Ingvar. Their evil nemesis Wall-Enberg are planning to steal billions of euros of the European Union''s grants to culture. The grant of 350 million kronor, paid by an Italian bank acting as intermediary, equals 60 billion lire but through assistance of a Sicilian "businessman", this sum becomes 60 billion kronor when transferred. The money is to be transferred to a large number of bank accounts, and the account numbers are saved on a floppy disc that the Jönsson gang is trying to steal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qrDx7n1BVsVI81kcO0Av8vVplz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37730'),
  ('326486813455440552', 'The Jönsson Gang Gets Gold Fever', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mikael Ekman, Lasse Björne', 'Rolf Börjlind', 'Gösta Ekman, Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Birgitta Andersson, Per Grundén, Weiron Holmberg, Carl Billquist, Sten Ljunggren', null, 'Sickan has a new plan. This time, the gang are going to steal a small computer micro chip which contains a top secret plan of what the government intends to do with Sweden in the future. But, Wall-Enberg is also planning to steal the chip. The payment will be 55 million Swedish crowns in gold and diamonds to whoever can deliver the chip to the foreign investors. Who will grab hold of the chip, the Jönsson gang or Wall-Enberg?', 'Sickan has a new plan. This time, the gang are going to steal a small computer micro chip which contains a top secret plan of what the government intends to do with Sweden in the future. But, Wall-Enberg is also planning to steal the chip. The payment will be 55 million Swedish crowns in gold and diamonds to whoever can deliver the chip to the foreign investors. Who will grab hold of the chip, the Jönsson gang or Wall-Enberg?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tbPYgBRvgjxX4dAkgo5eNHR0bX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37727'),
  ('774663954132560871', 'The Jönsson Gang in Mallorca', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Dan Myhrman, Mikael Ekman, Mikael Ruttkay Hylin', 'Rolf Börjlind, Gösta Ekman, Mikael Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Birgitta Andersson, Per Grundén, Margaretha Krook, Johann Neumann, Roland Jansson', null, 'Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry, together with Harry''s fiancée Doris, are in Mallorca while Sickan is still in Stockholm. However, Wall-Enberg talks him into doing a break-in at Las Palmas cathedral in Mallorca. Once persuaded, he can''t resist the temptation and travels to Mallorca as well. However, Wall-Enberg obviously can''t be trusted. Sickan is framed, caught and put in jail. While being escorted home to Sweden again, Vanheden and Harry sets up a plan to break him free. Sickan, once free, wants payback. The gang discover that an antiques dealer called Germann has something to do with the whole thing and that she''s also collaborating with Wall-Enberg. The gang then decide to take a closer look at her and her antiques and they discover that there''s a heist being planned against the cathedral in Palma.', 'Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry, together with Harry''s fiancée Doris, are in Mallorca while Sickan is still in Stockholm. However, Wall-Enberg talks him into doing a break-in at Las Palmas cathedral in Mallorca. Once persuaded, he can''t resist the temptation and travels to Mallorca as well. However, Wall-Enberg obviously can''t be trusted. Sickan is framed, caught and put in jail. While being escorted home to Sweden again, Vanheden and Harry sets up a plan to break him free. Sickan, once free, wants payback. The gang discover that an antiques dealer called Germann has something to do with the whole thing and that she''s also collaborating with Wall-Enberg. The gang then decide to take a closer look at her and her antiques and they discover that there''s a heist being planned against the cathedral in Palma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJyOupPvVi3f8dFnctDtekSEgs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37728'),
  ('454969093919425501', 'The Jönsson Gang Turns Up Again', 1986, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Gunnar Källström, Mikael Ekman', 'Rolf Börjlind, Gösta Ekman, Mikael Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Birgitta Andersson, Per Grundén, Johannes Brost, Lars Dejert, Kent Andersson', null, 'As always, Sickan has come up with a new plan. This time he wants to rob the IKEA furniture store. During their nightly break-in Sickan discovers that the store is used as a secret smuggling central for sending American computers to the Soviet Union. The computers are picked up by Soviet submarines sneaking into the Swedish archipelago. Naturally, it is their arch enemy Wall-Enberg who is behind all of this.', 'As always, Sickan has come up with a new plan. This time he wants to rob the IKEA furniture store. During their nightly break-in Sickan discovers that the store is used as a secret smuggling central for sending American computers to the Soviet Union. The computers are picked up by Soviet submarines sneaking into the Swedish archipelago. Naturally, it is their arch enemy Wall-Enberg who is behind all of this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz2lW37nwwl7wGBq7m9g85Q9jXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22192'),
  ('623715215669141519', 'The Jönsson Gang''s Greatest Robbery', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Hans Åke Gabrielsson, Rolf Lindström, Carolina Häggström', 'Hans Åke Gabrielsson', 'Ulf Brunnberg, Björn Gustafson, Stellan Skarsgård, Birgitta Andersson, Peter Haber, Elias Ringquist, Per Grundén, Weiron Holmberg', null, 'When Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry tries to break doctor Busé out of jail, they get Herman Melvin instead. He has been working at the Swedish Mint and the doctor, who has started to think like Sickan, has written a plan for making a burglary there, on Melvin''s back. However, something goes wrong. They don''t get a lot of Deutsch-marks as they planned but instead, they end up on a ship going to Poland, together with bunches and bunches of Polish Zlotys (the Polish currency). In Poland, they discover that the mafia are very interested in that money and Wall-Enberg is working with the mafia.', 'When Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry tries to break doctor Busé out of jail, they get Herman Melvin instead. He has been working at the Swedish Mint and the doctor, who has started to think like Sickan, has written a plan for making a burglary there, on Melvin''s back. However, something goes wrong. They don''t get a lot of Deutsch-marks as they planned but instead, they end up on a ship going to Poland, together with bunches and bunches of Polish Zlotys (the Polish currency). In Poland, they discover that the mafia are very interested in that money and Wall-Enberg is working with the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmJT07tBpHsFOfXCXHoSNkYDyLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37731'),
  ('303970741281132262', 'The Josephine Baker Story', 1991, 'Drama, History, Music, TV Movie', 'Brian Gibson, Elemér Ragályi', null, 'Lynn Whitfield, Rubén Blades, David Dukes, Louis Gossett Jr., Craig T. Nelson, Kene Holliday, Vivian Bonnell, Mayah McCoy', null, 'Biography of the African-American who became a major performer in the Paris cabarets of the 1920s and 1930s. The film follows her life beginning as a struggling performer in 1917 St. Louis, her frustrations leading to her move to France, and follows to her death in 1975. Written by John Sacksteder', 'Biography of the African-American who became a major performer in the Paris cabarets of the 1920s and 1930s. The film follows her life beginning as a struggling performer in 1917 St. Louis, her frustrations leading to her move to France, and follows to her death in 1975. Written by John Sacksteder', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjwf8huzfK4TULeraBZeQxrA2Kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88614'),
  ('550631446588750698', 'The Journalist', 2019, 'Drama', 'Tatsuya Hirayama, Keisuke Imamura, Michihito Fujii', 'Michihito Fujii, Akihiko Takaishi, Roba Shimori', 'Shim Eun-kyung, Tori Matsuzaka, Tsubasa Honda, Amane Okayama, Kaku Tomohiro, Tsutomu Takahashi, Seiya Osada, Hina Miyano', null, 'It is the job of the press to cover corporate crime, government plots and society. It is in this context that young female reporter on the beat Erika rolls up her sleeves and goes to work regarding what seems to be a government cover up. She is dealing with a government bureaucrat called Sugihara. It seems as if a clash is inevitable.', 'It is the job of the press to cover corporate crime, government plots and society. It is in this context that young female reporter on the beat Erika rolls up her sleeves and goes to work regarding what seems to be a government cover up. She is dealing with a government bureaucrat called Sugihara. It seems as if a clash is inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hscbSxqEMM5YWxwOlaqUDydr8O2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611257'),
  ('388939421016808890', 'The Journey', 1959, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Anatole Litvak, Jack Hildyard, Noël Howard', 'George Tabori', 'Deborah Kerr, Yul Brynner, Jason Robards, Robert Morley, E.G. Marshall, Anne Jackson, Ron Howard, Flip Mark', 'NR', 'A Communist officer falls hard for a married woman trying to escape from Hungary.', 'A Communist officer falls hard for a married woman trying to escape from Hungary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HXN8SKOYnasVRPY1JUYiWzMFia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76714'),
  ('980514715188901026', 'The Journey', 1992, 'Drama', 'Félix "Chango" Monti, Fernando E. Solanas', 'Fernando E. Solanas', 'Walter Quiroz, Soledad Alfaro, Ricardo Bartis, Christina Becerra, Marc Berman, Chiquinho Brandão, Dominique Sanda, Fito Páez', null, 'A young man living in a cold southern village in South America, decides to start a trip looking for his father. By doing this he discovers unexpected facts about his Latin American essence.', 'A young man living in a cold southern village in South America, decides to start a trip looking for his father. By doing this he discovers unexpected facts about his Latin American essence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2Yqfvxjk1dyWS6VTHVFziQ6JuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12124'),
  ('893728251637048547', 'The Journey', 2015, 'Drama', 'Adriano Valerio, Jonathan Ricquebourg', 'Ezio Abbate, Adriano Valerio', 'Edoardo Gabbriellini, Elena Radonicich, Ștefan Velniciuc, Piera Degli Esposti, Ovanes Torosian', null, 'Bari, a city caught in the relentless economic crisis. Ivo is an agronomist, but the lack of opportunities pushes him to accept a job in the fertile region of Banat in Romania. Clara has just ended a relationship and is about to lose her job at the Bari harbor. Ivo and Clara meet by chance and seem to immediately understand each other. They spend only one night together before Ivo''s departure, but that is enough to create a bond and wanting to meet again. When Clara visits him in Romania, they fall in love. But is exile their only way to happiness?', 'Bari, a city caught in the relentless economic crisis. Ivo is an agronomist, but the lack of opportunities pushes him to accept a job in the fertile region of Banat in Romania. Clara has just ended a relationship and is about to lose her job at the Bari harbor. Ivo and Clara meet by chance and seem to immediately understand each other. They spend only one night together before Ivo''s departure, but that is enough to create a bond and wanting to meet again. When Clara visits him in Romania, they fall in love. But is exile their only way to happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPBqdqdKsaiEGyX6djq3Ux1GLUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360324'),
  ('804926989484141132', 'The Journey', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nick Hamm, Greg Gardiner', 'Colin Bateman', 'Timothy Spall, Colm Meaney, Freddie Highmore, Toby Stephens, John Hurt, Catherine McCormack, Ian McElhinney, Ian Beattie', 'PG-13', 'Firebrand Democratic Unionist Party leader Ian Paisley and Sinn Fein politician Martin McGuinness, two implacable enemies in Northern Ireland, are forced to take a short journey together in which they will take the biggest leap of faith and change the course of history.', 'Firebrand Democratic Unionist Party leader Ian Paisley and Sinn Fein politician Martin McGuinness, two implacable enemies in Northern Ireland, are forced to take a short journey together in which they will take the biggest leap of faith and change the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avmWN1YGYbzW4n1cbffw4uLCZSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408616'),
  ('242930644657182237', 'The Journey', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Yoichi Senzui, Tomoyuki Kawamura, Kei Tsushima', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Toru Furuya, Kotono Mitsuishi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Kazuya Nakai, Takaya Kuroda', null, 'As a ruthless invader threatens to enslave their people and destroy the Kaaba, a sacred sanctuary, the people of Mecca take up arms. Only able to muster a small force against the massive army, defeat seems all but inevitable. Aus, a seemingly simple potter fighting to protect his family, is forced to reveal his dark past. Abraha''s army is fast approaching, and the fate of Mecca and its people hangs in the balance. Will the people of Mecca defeat the colossal army with nothing but their simple defenses and their love for their city?', 'As a ruthless invader threatens to enslave their people and destroy the Kaaba, a sacred sanctuary, the people of Mecca take up arms. Only able to muster a small force against the massive army, defeat seems all but inevitable. Aus, a seemingly simple potter fighting to protect his family, is forced to reveal his dark past. Abraha''s army is fast approaching, and the fate of Mecca and its people hangs in the balance. Will the people of Mecca defeat the colossal army with nothing but their simple defenses and their love for their city?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noA8RnhSDDhW8Od4C7s0J9muNYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641951'),
  ('70265446647693668', 'The Journey of August King', 1995, 'Drama', 'John Duigan, Sławomir Idziak', 'John Ehle', 'Jason Patric, Thandiwe Newton, Larry Drake, Sam Waterston, Eric Mabius, Sarah-Jane Wylde', null, 'The Journey of August King is a multi-dimensional drama about a North Carolina farmer in 1815. August King, a widower, is on his way home as he does every year after selling his produce and purchasing the stock and goods he will need to survive the winter. On his journey, he comes upon a run-away slave, a young woman about 19 and August King must decide to violate the law and help this slave to freedom or else leave her to be hunted down and, ultimately, returned to her slave owner.', 'The Journey of August King is a multi-dimensional drama about a North Carolina farmer in 1815. August King, a widower, is on his way home as he does every year after selling his produce and purchasing the stock and goods he will need to survive the winter. On his journey, he comes upon a run-away slave, a young woman about 19 and August King must decide to violate the law and help this slave to freedom or else leave her to be hunted down and, ultimately, returned to her slave owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kWPXnCyUo20QCrv8lwQhTFPj9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61548'),
  ('834332326122033179', 'The Journey of Natty Gann', 1985, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Jeremy Kagan, Dick Bush', 'Jeanne Rosenberg', 'Meredith Salenger, John Cusack, Ray Wise, Lainie Kazan, Scatman Crothers, Barry Miller, Verna Bloom, Bruce M. Fischer', 'PG', 'America is in the depths of the Great Depression. Families drift apart when faraway jobs beckon. A courageous young girl confronts overwhelming odds when she embarks on a cross-country search for her father. During her odyssey, she forms a close bond with two diverse traveling companions: a magnificent, protective wolf, and a hardened drifter.', 'America is in the depths of the Great Depression. Families drift apart when faraway jobs beckon. A courageous young girl confronts overwhelming odds when she embarks on a cross-country search for her father. During her odyssey, she forms a close bond with two diverse traveling companions: a magnificent, protective wolf, and a hardened drifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2eHb3ih4k9zannMKn3wmVvYAis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35144'),
  ('132496846081387889', 'The Journey to Melonia', 1989, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Per Åhlin, Piotr Jaworski, Per Svensson', 'Karl Rasmusson, Per Åhlin', 'Allan Edwall, Robyn, Olle Sarri, Tomas von Brömssen, Ernst Günther, Jan-Olof Strandberg, Ingvar Kjellson, Eva Rydberg', null, 'When a ship sinks during a storm, a slave from the industrial island of Plutonia is washed up on the beaches of paradise island Melonia, where the "all-powerful" wizard Prospero and his strange friends reside.', 'When a ship sinks during a storm, a slave from the industrial island of Plutonia is washed up on the beaches of paradise island Melonia, where the "all-powerful" wizard Prospero and his strange friends reside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMCsWJfZLPGqJp0AX7IB70koJCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50201'),
  ('367630155053614381', 'The Joy Luck Club', 1993, 'Drama', 'Wayne Wang, Amir Mokri', 'Ronald Bass, Amy Tan', 'Tsai Chin, Kieu Chinh, Lisa Lu, France Nuyen, Rosalind Chao, Lauren Tom, Tamlyn Tomita, Ming-Na Wen', 'R', 'Through a series of flashbacks, four Chinese women born in America and their respective mothers born in feudal China explore their pasts.', 'Through a series of flashbacks, four Chinese women born in America and their respective mothers born in feudal China explore their pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1Sk0hhVARNs7i9wqRHqbCriu8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19931'),
  ('330881641110843564', 'The Joy of Life', 1934, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Hector Hoppin, Anthony Gross', null, null, null, 'A blond and a raven-haired beauty move with verve and style through a changing landscape. The fabric of their dresses flows and floats, adding to their allure. One loses a shoe. A young man picks it up and pursues them on his bicycle.', 'A blond and a raven-haired beauty move with verve and style through a changing landscape. The fabric of their dresses flows and floats, adding to their allure. One loses a shoe. A young man picks it up and pursues them on his bicycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fz4jN2LFPDE9BHIZX0UGwjX7sIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174298'),
  ('1051540887725218607', 'The Joy of Living', 1961, 'Comedy', 'René Clément, Henri Decaë, Gianfranco Mingozzi', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, René Clément', 'Alain Delon, Barbara Lass, Gino Cervi, Rina Morelli, Ugo Tognazzi, Paolo Stoppa, Gastone Moschin, Fanfulla', null, 'Ulisse is a naive young man out looking for a job after being released from the army. He drops the offer he gets from a group of fascists to go in with the Fossatis, a family of anarchists (unknown to him).', 'Ulisse is a naive young man out looking for a job after being released from the army. He drops the offer he gets from a group of fascists to go in with the Fossatis, a family of anarchists (unknown to him).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33EXHRPzS5d1vNy5rAssuRGoRCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142979'),
  ('869648144549352210', 'The Joy of Singing', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ilan Duran Cohen, Christophe Graillot', 'Philippe Lasry, Ilan Duran Cohen', 'Marina Foïs, Lorànt Deutsch, Caroline Ducey, Pierre Palmade, Jeanne Balibar, Julien Baumgartner, Nathalie Richard, Dominique Reymond', null, 'A banker has died. He trafficked in nuclear material, so French intelligence assign two agents to find his list of contacts, which are on a flash drive: Muriel - the boss, acerbic, willing to sleep with any man, wondering if she should have a child - and Philippe, younger, boyish, meticulous, bothered by Muriel''s frank sexual interest. They watch Constance, the banker''s widow: a naïve, friendly, open, trusting. She''s taking opera lessons, so the French spies join the class, which Muriel enjoys. It seems that other spies are after the same USB, and some of them sing as well. Singing, spying, and sex lead to duets of all kinds as well as to an eventual showdown.', 'A banker has died. He trafficked in nuclear material, so French intelligence assign two agents to find his list of contacts, which are on a flash drive: Muriel - the boss, acerbic, willing to sleep with any man, wondering if she should have a child - and Philippe, younger, boyish, meticulous, bothered by Muriel''s frank sexual interest. They watch Constance, the banker''s widow: a naïve, friendly, open, trusting. She''s taking opera lessons, so the French spies join the class, which Muriel enjoys. It seems that other spies are after the same USB, and some of them sing as well. Singing, spying, and sex lead to duets of all kinds as well as to an eventual showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpb1P8MkQ4T6LS6lALay0GXShox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18756'),
  ('373933133940124534', 'The Judge', 1949, 'Drama', 'Benjamin H. Kline, Elmer Clifton, Ray Foster', 'Anson Bond, Samuel Newman, Elmer Clifton', 'Milburn Stone, Katherine DeMille, Paul Guilfoyle, Stanley Waxman, Norman Budd, Jonathan Hale, John Hamilton, Joseph Forte', null, 'A study of an amoral and sleazy defense lawyer who suddenly tries to "go straight" when he finds out that his tart wife is cheating on him; as well as the similarities he has in life with one of his clients.', 'A study of an amoral and sleazy defense lawyer who suddenly tries to "go straight" when he finds out that his tart wife is cheating on him; as well as the similarities he has in life with one of his clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icX9JTOS0QcfjLTzxM5i5XRDXb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48229'),
  ('942132227364505657', 'The Judge', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Dobkin, Janusz Kamiński', 'Bill Dubuque, Nick Schenk', 'Robert Downey Jr., Robert Duvall, Vera Farmiga, Vincent D''Onofrio, Jeremy Strong, Dax Shepard, Billy Bob Thornton, Leighton Meester', 'R', 'A successful lawyer returns to his hometown for his mother''s funeral only to discover that his estranged father, the town''s judge, is suspected of murder.', 'A successful lawyer returns to his hometown for his mother''s funeral only to discover that his estranged father, the town''s judge, is suspected of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K93GWotLXe4FqpErri0xkpLaD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205587'),
  ('487493530788492910', 'The Judge and the Assassin', 1976, 'History, Crime, Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Pierre Bost, Jean Aurenche', 'Philippe Noiret, Michel Galabru, Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Claude Brialy, Renée Faure, Cécile Vassort, Jean-Roger Caussimon, Jean Bretonnière', null, 'France, 1893. Joseph Bouvier attempts to shoot his love who refused to marry him and to commit suicide. Upon release from the filthy asylum where he was placed, with bullets still remaining in his head, he wanders the country roads and rapes and murders many teenagers over years. The judge Rousseau captures him, but to serve his ambition seeks to avoid that Bouvier is simply declared insane.', 'France, 1893. Joseph Bouvier attempts to shoot his love who refused to marry him and to commit suicide. Upon release from the filthy asylum where he was placed, with bullets still remaining in his head, he wanders the country roads and rapes and murders many teenagers over years. The judge Rousseau captures him, but to serve his ambition seeks to avoid that Bouvier is simply declared insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FwFJvyktddFy8eJc9jMmn6efYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38080'),
  ('574795961756456232', 'The Judgement', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sander Burger', 'Sander Burger, Bert Bouma', 'Fedja van Huêt, Yorick van Wageningen, Lies Visschedijk, Mark Kraan, George Tobal, Porgy Franssen, Marike Mingelen, Ortál Vriend', null, 'A Dutch TV journalist finds himself challenging the police, courts and media as he attempts to uncover the truth about the controversial 1999 Deventer murder case.', 'A Dutch TV journalist finds himself challenging the police, courts and media as he attempts to uncover the truth about the controversial 1999 Deventer murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmajnbYU1uRqokxo04p13CuPhX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844530'),
  ('838520977997295353', 'The Juggler', 1953, 'Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, J. Roy Hunt, Irving J. Moore', 'Michael Blankfort', 'Kirk Douglas, Paul Stewart, Milly Vitale, Joseph Walsh, Alf Kjellin, Charles Lane, Beverly Washburn, John Banner', 'NR', 'A Holocaust survivor moves to Israel and experiences difficulty adjusting to life.', 'A Holocaust survivor moves to Israel and experiences difficulty adjusting to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TZ96LIcOI0qRAeZr97yd0VJlaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283329'),
  ('450040025404985095', 'The Juliette Year', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Le Guay, Pierre Novion', 'Philippe Le Guay, Jean-Louis Richard', 'Fabrice Luchini, Valérie Stroh, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Marine Delterme, Didier Flamand, Jean-Louis Richard, Bernard Ballet, Daniel Martín', null, 'Camille Prader, back from a physicians'' meeting, is waiting for his suitcase on the Airport conveyor belt. Clémentine, his girlfriend of the day, has come to fetch him. With a radiant smile, she tells Fabrice that she left everything to live with him. When Camille picks a case he realizes ha has taken the wrong one. The label shows it belongs to a musician called Juliette Graveur. Hegrasps the occasion to run away from Clémentine by claiming Juliette is his mistress....', 'Camille Prader, back from a physicians'' meeting, is waiting for his suitcase on the Airport conveyor belt. Clémentine, his girlfriend of the day, has come to fetch him. With a radiant smile, she tells Fabrice that she left everything to live with him. When Camille picks a case he realizes ha has taken the wrong one. The label shows it belongs to a musician called Juliette Graveur. Hegrasps the occasion to run away from Clémentine by claiming Juliette is his mistress....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSlPrKQNFtmKucIJhkvb6KJhuWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187277'),
  ('612122593496142330', 'The Julius House: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2016, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Michelle Fitzpatrick, Grace Alvarez, Chris Johnson', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Lexa Doig, Stephanie Bennett, Yannick Bisson, Ellie Harvie, Chilton Crane, Miranda Frigon, Julie Lynn-Mortensen', 'NR', 'Aurora Teagarden is a beautiful young librarian with a passion for solving murders. After an exhaustive search for the perfect home, Aurora finally purchases her dream house, unaware of its murky history. As she prepares to move in, Aurora discovers that the family who once lived there mysteriously disappeared without a trace.', 'Aurora Teagarden is a beautiful young librarian with a passion for solving murders. After an exhaustive search for the perfect home, Aurora finally purchases her dream house, unaware of its murky history. As she prepares to move in, Aurora discovers that the family who once lived there mysteriously disappeared without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBwyOSg4JtgoZEpz9WQGFSVu4Yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414768'),
  ('490941455482606620', 'The Jungle', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Crystel Fournier, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Julien Rappeneau, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Patrick Mille, Guillaume Gallienne, Olivia Magnani, Sophie Cattani, Lara Guirao, Anémone, Guy Bedos, Antoine Oppenheim', null, 'Vincent and Mathias are two friends, in their thirties, who live off Vincent’s father. One day, during a meal where the wine and talk both flow a little too freely, Vincent’s father offers the two friends a bet. If they can survive seven days and seven nights in Paris with just seven Euros in their pocket, he will pay off all of their debts. If not, they will have to learn to fend for themselves. Confident of their abilities to survive in the jungle that is Paris, Vincent and Mathias willingly accept the offer, but soon regret doing so...', 'Vincent and Mathias are two friends, in their thirties, who live off Vincent’s father. One day, during a meal where the wine and talk both flow a little too freely, Vincent’s father offers the two friends a bet. If they can survive seven days and seven nights in Paris with just seven Euros in their pocket, he will pay off all of their debts. If not, they will have to learn to fend for themselves. Confident of their abilities to survive in the jungle that is Paris, Vincent and Mathias willingly accept the offer, but soon regret doing so...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7NjGR3z8c7GFUUHhl4Srp3Rfi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60026'),
  ('1054893675643968654', 'The Jungle', 2012, 'Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Alexander Voitinsky, Igor Grinyakin, Sergey Trofimov', 'Oleg Malovichko, Alexey Fedorov, Roman Nepomnyashchiy', 'Vera Brezhneva, Sergey Svetlakov, Aleksandr Makogon, Marina Dyuzheva, Mikhail Efremov, Aleksandr Polovtsev, Irina Medvedeva, Amporn Pankratok', null, 'A comedy about funny adventures of the married couple on the remote island.', 'A comedy about funny adventures of the married couple on the remote island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTDrZsWBnF75Z78wU5LnlaEY8BK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148347'),
  ('212955502561046190', 'The Jungle Book', 1967, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Wolfgang Reitherman, Milt Kahl, Ollie Johnston', null, 'Bruce Reitherman, Phil Harris, Sebastian Cabot, George Sanders, Sterling Holloway, Louis Prima, J. Pat O''Malley, Clint Howard', 'G', 'The boy Mowgli makes his way to the man-village with Bagheera, the wise panther. Along the way he meets jazzy King Louie, the hypnotic snake Kaa and the lovable, happy-go-lucky bear Baloo, who teaches Mowgli "The Bare Necessities" of life and the true meaning of friendship.', 'The boy Mowgli makes his way to the man-village with Bagheera, the wise panther. Along the way he meets jazzy King Louie, the hypnotic snake Kaa and the lovable, happy-go-lucky bear Baloo, who teaches Mowgli "The Bare Necessities" of life and the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yN1kuupnPTLUprgfvC5WapgrxG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9325'),
  ('877459986385067698', 'The Jungle Book', 1994, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Stephen Sommers, Juan Ruiz Anchía, David R. Ellis', 'Stephen Sommers, Ronald Yanover, Mark Geldman', 'Jason Scott Lee, Cary Elwes, Lena Headey, Sam Neill, John Cleese, Jason Flemyng, Stefan Kalipha, Ron Donachie', 'PG', 'Raised by wild animals since childhood, Mowgli is drawn away from the jungle by the beautiful Kitty. But Mowgli must eventually face corrupt Capt. Boone, who wants both Kitty''s hand and the treasures of Monkey City – a place only Mowgli can find.', 'Raised by wild animals since childhood, Mowgli is drawn away from the jungle by the beautiful Kitty. But Mowgli must eventually face corrupt Capt. Boone, who wants both Kitty''s hand and the treasures of Monkey City – a place only Mowgli can find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYoE6cuup9Ofam6AuYaiJLxF9OO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10714'),
  ('458242813261279644', 'The Jungle Book', 2016, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jon Favreau, Bill Pope, Andrew L. Jones', 'Justin Marks', 'Neel Sethi, Bill Murray, Ben Kingsley, Idris Elba, Scarlett Johansson, Christopher Walken, Lupita Nyong''o, Giancarlo Esposito', 'PG', 'After a threat from the tiger Shere Khan, Mowgli, a man-cub fostered by wolves, is forced to flee the jungle, and he embarks on a journey of self-discovery with the help of the panther, Bagheera, and the free-spirited bear, Baloo.', 'After a threat from the tiger Shere Khan, Mowgli, a man-cub fostered by wolves, is forced to flee the jungle, and he embarks on a journey of self-discovery with the help of the panther, Bagheera, and the free-spirited bear, Baloo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Epx7F9X7DrFptn4seqn4mzBVks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278927'),
  ('957244723290605791', 'The Jungle Book 2', 2003, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Steve Trenbirth', 'Roger S.H. Schulman', 'Haley Joel Osment, John Goodman, Mae Whitman, Connor Funk, Bob Joles, Tony Jay, John Rhys-Davies, Jim Cummings', 'G', 'Mowgli has been living in the man-village with his little stepbrother Ranjan and his best friend Shanti. But the man-cub still has that jungle rhythm in his heart, and he misses his old buddies Baloo and Bagheera. When Mowgli wanders back to the wild for some swingin'' fun, he soon finds the man-eating tiger Shere Khan is lurking in the shadows and planning his revenge.', 'Mowgli has been living in the man-village with his little stepbrother Ranjan and his best friend Shanti. But the man-cub still has that jungle rhythm in his heart, and he misses his old buddies Baloo and Bagheera. When Mowgli wanders back to the wild for some swingin'' fun, he soon finds the man-eating tiger Shere Khan is lurking in the shadows and planning his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21GanxizOIL1CN0HLx7j3je8k87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14873'),
  ('1020958843367097504', 'The Jungle Book: Mowgli''s Story', 1998, 'Family, Adventure', 'Nick Marck', 'Jose Rivera, Jim Herzfeld', 'Clancy Brown, Sherman Howard, Brandon Baker, Brian Doyle-Murray, Nancy Cartwright, Marty Ingels, Dee Bradley Baker, Wallace Shawn', 'G', 'Told from Mowgli''s point of view, it''s the story of how a boy became a mancub and a mancub became a man.', 'Told from Mowgli''s point of view, it''s the story of how a boy became a mancub and a mancub became a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4tLYYrZAYnDJlNGgiUneDsuOBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109176'),
  ('151732547710740663', 'The Jungle Bunch', 2017, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Animation', 'David Alaux', 'Jean-François Tosti, David Alaux, Eric Tosti', 'Philippe Bozo, Emmanuel Curtil, Laurent Morteau, Pascal Casanova, Céline Monsarrat, Paul Borne, Maik Darah, Richard Darbois', 'G', 'Maurice may look like a penguin - but he''s a real tiger inside! Raised by a tigress, he''s the clumsiest kung-fu master ever. Along with his friends, The Jungle Bunch, he intends to maintain order and justice in the jungle, as his mother did before he. But Igor, an evil koala, wants to destroy the jungle once and for all—helped by his army of silly baboons.', 'Maurice may look like a penguin - but he''s a real tiger inside! Raised by a tigress, he''s the clumsiest kung-fu master ever. Along with his friends, The Jungle Bunch, he intends to maintain order and justice in the jungle, as his mother did before he. But Igor, an evil koala, wants to destroy the jungle once and for all—helped by his army of silly baboons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZ0T0yRe8iDqAgeZXRNvpAJh5z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448779'),
  ('1038973363410594621', 'The Jungle Bunch: Operation Meltdown', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Yannick Moulin, Benoît Somville, Laurent Bru', 'David Alaux, Eric Tosti, Jean-François Tosti', 'Philippe Bozo, Laurent Morteau, Pascal Casanova, Céline Monsarrat, Emmanuel Curtil, Paul Borne, Léopoldine Serre, Frédéric Cerdal', null, 'A vicious beaver blankets the jungle with a dangerous pink substance that explodes when coming into contact with water. With the rainy season approaching, the miscellaneous team of animals must hurry to find the antidote.', 'A vicious beaver blankets the jungle with a dangerous pink substance that explodes when coming into contact with water. With the rainy season approaching, the miscellaneous team of animals must hurry to find the antidote.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxkvv9KAhJFeIRDtg7OKtYsHziC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034055'),
  ('965538770572041067', 'The Jungle Bunch: The Movie', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'David Alaux, Eric Tosti', 'David Alaux, Eric Tosti, Jean-François Tosti', 'Michel Mella, Emmanuel Curtil, Paul Borne, Laurent Morteau, Pascal Casanova, Laurent Morteau', null, 'At the South Pole, the walruses install a rule of terror for the penguins. Tommy and his sister travel to the Equator, where legend says a jungle ''penguin warrior'' and his six companions live, who can come rescue them. Tiger-striped bird ''tiger'' Maurice is flattered and accepts the task. After recruiting gorilla Miguel, warthog Fred, frogs Bob and Al plus tarsier Gilbert, they set out. On the way they meet and recruit bat Batricia. After a long journey, they arrive in Antarctica and take on the giant bullies.', 'At the South Pole, the walruses install a rule of terror for the penguins. Tommy and his sister travel to the Equator, where legend says a jungle ''penguin warrior'' and his six companions live, who can come rescue them. Tiger-striped bird ''tiger'' Maurice is flattered and accepts the task. After recruiting gorilla Miguel, warthog Fred, frogs Bob and Al plus tarsier Gilbert, they set out. On the way they meet and recruit bat Batricia. After a long journey, they arrive in Antarctica and take on the giant bullies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2o5ergZ22IM9lHmXHUMjZ1EmAsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808264'),
  ('289791150904149322', 'The Jungle Captive', 1945, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Maury Gertsman, Paul Sawtell, Harold Young', 'M. Coates Webster, Dwight V. Babcock', 'Otto Kruger, Vicky Lane, Amelita Ward, Phil Brown, Jerome Cowan, Rondo Hatton, Eddie Acuff, Ernie Adams', 'NR', 'Once again Paula the ape woman is brought back to life, this time by a mad doctor and his disfigured assistant, who also kidnaps a nurse in order to have a female blood donor.', 'Once again Paula the ape woman is brought back to life, this time by a mad doctor and his disfigured assistant, who also kidnaps a nurse in order to have a female blood donor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixraVEU6w5UgdKoVI8X1hwkbAZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84711'),
  ('917401499169977005', 'The Juniper Tree', 1990, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Nietzchka Keene, Ólafur Engilbertsson, Randolph Sellars', 'Nietzchka Keene', 'Björk, Bryndis Petra Bragadóttir, Valdimar Örn Flygenring, Guðrún Gísladóttir, Geirlaug Sunna Þormar', 'NR', 'Margit and her older sister Katla flee for safety after their mother is burned to death for witchcraft. Finding shelter with Johan and his resentful young son, Jonas, the sisters help form an impromptu family unit that’s soon strained by Katla’s burgeoning sorcery.', 'Margit and her older sister Katla flee for safety after their mother is burned to death for witchcraft. Finding shelter with Johan and his resentful young son, Jonas, the sisters help form an impromptu family unit that’s soon strained by Katla’s burgeoning sorcery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcKxbhJ41JZM3QqauFG6YgL9gpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29460'),
  ('441923074554554907', 'The Junk Shop', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Květa Lehovcová, Juraj Herz, Rudolf Milič', 'Juraj Herz, Bohumil Hrabal', 'Václav Halama, František Ketzek, Bobina Maršátová, Libuše Palečková, Jan Vlček, Olga Novotná, Růžena Vlčková, Radim Cvrček', null, 'Juraj Herz adapts Bohumil Hrabal''s story about a man who works in a junk shop.', 'Juraj Herz adapts Bohumil Hrabal''s story about a man who works in a junk shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf3G2Lijcc6ilMZWzQmQ9NcdV6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119451'),
  ('981328589463914171', 'The Junkman', 1982, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Comedy, Drama', 'H.B. Halicki, Daniel Pearl, Tony Syslo', 'H.B. Halicki', 'H.B. Halicki, Christopher Stone, Susan Shaw, Lang Jeffries, Bruce Cameron, Jack Vacek, Kelly Busia, Richard L. Muse', 'PG', 'As film-maker Harlan Hollis drives to a James Dean festival, he''s unaware that killers are tracking his every move. The fast and furious race to avoid their net, stay alive and discover who is behind this lethal plan, will take Hollis through a fiery battle, turning highways and city streets into a blazing junkyard.', 'As film-maker Harlan Hollis drives to a James Dean festival, he''s unaware that killers are tracking his every move. The fast and furious race to avoid their net, stay alive and discover who is behind this lethal plan, will take Hollis through a fiery battle, turning highways and city streets into a blazing junkyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNg0NIKfxAolOkYWORjxX8zgcbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54498'),
  ('390119171572007885', 'The Junky''s Christmas', 1993, 'Animation, Drama', 'Nick Donkin, Melodie McDaniel', 'James Grauerholz', 'William S. Burroughs, Susan Ashline, Dayton Bard, Jon Blumb, Jennifer Brosseau', null, 'Burroughs takes down a book and reads us the story of Danny the Carwiper, who spends Christmas Day trying to score a fix, but finds the Christmas spirit instead.', 'Burroughs takes down a book and reads us the story of Danny the Carwiper, who spends Christmas Day trying to score a fix, but finds the Christmas spirit instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSFjC4Nb8MOfeZfSpKtT6mnUDlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102022'),
  ('1102343012360998067', 'The Jurassic Games', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Josh McKamie, Ryan Bellgardt', 'Ryan Bellgardt', 'Ryan Merriman, Perrey Reeves, Adam Hampton, Katie Burgess, Daniel Barton, Ron Clemons, Dylan Cox, Erika Daly', null, 'In the near future, 10 death row convicts are forced to compete in a virtual reality game that pits them against dinosaurs and each other.', 'In the near future, 10 death row convicts are forced to compete in a virtual reality game that pits them against dinosaurs and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjcoKGhJ5KR1lNoMsMzHeQ8xefo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504982'),
  ('634210169728356711', 'The Juror', 1996, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Brian Gibson, Jamie Anderson, Amy Sayres', 'Ted Tally', 'Demi Moore, Alec Baldwin, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Anne Heche, James Gandolfini, Lindsay Crouse, Tony Lo Bianco, Michael Constantine', 'R', 'With his gangster boss on trial for murder, a mob thug known as "the Teacher" tells Annie Laird she must talk her fellow jurors into a not-guilty verdict, implying that he''ll kill her son Oliver if she fails. She manages to do this, but, when it becomes clear that the mobsters might want to silence her for good, she sends Oliver abroad and tries to gather evidence of the plot against her, setting up a final showdown.', 'With his gangster boss on trial for murder, a mob thug known as "the Teacher" tells Annie Laird she must talk her fellow jurors into a not-guilty verdict, implying that he''ll kill her son Oliver if she fails. She manages to do this, but, when it becomes clear that the mobsters might want to silence her for good, she sends Oliver abroad and tries to gather evidence of the plot against her, setting up a final showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31mRYhJvaknQx8PQnR2UV7YCkLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9623'),
  ('535615905233600187', 'The Jut-Nuts I', 1988, 'Family, Comedy', 'Finn Henriksen', 'Jacob Haugaard, Steen Herdel, Finn Henriksen', 'Jacob Haugaard, Finn Nørbygaard, Kirsten Lehfeldt, Søren Østergaard, Pia Koch, Ellen Winther Lembourn, Michelle Bjørn-Andersen, Paul Hüttel', null, 'Jacob and Finn establish their own private detective agency at a car-wrecking dump, then set out to ensnare clients. Once they have one, they proceed to make a hopeless mess out of everything for everybody. They remain, of course, blissfully unaware of their own ineptitude.', 'Jacob and Finn establish their own private detective agency at a car-wrecking dump, then set out to ensnare clients. Once they have one, they proceed to make a hopeless mess out of everything for everybody. They remain, of course, blissfully unaware of their own ineptitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPZnuNI7hzw9y6uZkAO0qL9PGha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53278'),
  ('1131354436318256098', 'The K.E.O.P/S System', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy, Mystery, Action', 'Nicolás Goldbart, Diego Poleri, Máximo Báncora', 'Nicolás Goldbart', 'Daniel Hendler, Alan Sabbagh, Rodrigo Noya, Violeta Urtizberea, Gastón Cocchiarale, Nico García, Esteban Lamothe, Martín Garabal', null, 'Belgrano neighborhood, Buenos Aires, Argentina. Someone is watching Fernando Berlasky from one of the countless windows in front of his apartment and sending him e-mails.', 'Belgrano neighborhood, Buenos Aires, Argentina. Someone is watching Fernando Berlasky from one of the countless windows in front of his apartment and sending him e-mails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VsBqTnU6PEF01pKhWzaRhP21R1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944399'),
  ('778450904419651710', 'The Kaiser''s Lackey', 1951, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Staudte, Robert Baberske', 'Wolfgang Staudte, Fritz Staudte', 'Werner Peters, Paul Esser, Blandine Ebinger, Renate Fischer, Carola Braunbock, Emmy Burg, Sabine Thalbach, Friedel Nowack', null, 'Diederich Heßling is scared of everything and everyone. But as he grows up, he comes to realize that he has to offer his services to the powers-that-be if he wants to wield power himself. His life motto now runs: bow to those at the top and tread on those below. In this way, he always succeeds: as a student in a duel-fighting student fraternity and as a businessman in a paper factory. He cajoles the obese district administrative president Von Wulkow and wins his favor. He slanders his financial rivals and hatches a plot with the social democrats in the town council. On his honeymoon with his rich wife Guste, he finally finds a chance to do his beloved Kaiser a favor. And when a memorial to the Kaiser is unveiled in the town where Diederich lives and works, he delivers the address. He stands behind the lectern in the pouring rain, saluting his Kaiser. The crowd is dispersed. Everything is laid in ruins...', 'Diederich Heßling is scared of everything and everyone. But as he grows up, he comes to realize that he has to offer his services to the powers-that-be if he wants to wield power himself. His life motto now runs: bow to those at the top and tread on those below. In this way, he always succeeds: as a student in a duel-fighting student fraternity and as a businessman in a paper factory. He cajoles the obese district administrative president Von Wulkow and wins his favor. He slanders his financial rivals and hatches a plot with the social democrats in the town council. On his honeymoon with his rich wife Guste, he finally finds a chance to do his beloved Kaiser a favor. And when a memorial to the Kaiser is unveiled in the town where Diederich lives and works, he delivers the address. He stands behind the lectern in the pouring rain, saluting his Kaiser. The crowd is dispersed. Everything is laid in ruins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh4Vj2csTcHaTb1amtchb2EeRy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36922'),
  ('767255417049172088', 'The Kangaroo Chronicles', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Filip Zumbrunn, Johannes Rhein, Tatiana Merizalde Dobles', 'Marc-Uwe Kling', 'Dimitrij Schaad, Marc-Uwe Kling, Rosalie Thomass, Henry Hübchen, Adnan Maral, Tim Seyfi, Carmen-Maja Antoni, Bettina Lamprecht', null, 'A communist kangaroo moves in with an artist in Berlin.', 'A communist kangaroo moves in with an artist in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlCpJa19IweniPMoIkbeXJDsCFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639564'),
  ('18506896006052182', 'The Kangaroo Conspiracy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marc-Uwe Kling, Alexander Berner, Markus Nestroy', 'Marc-Uwe Kling, Jan Cronauer', 'Marc-Uwe Kling, Dimitrij Schaad, Rosalie Thomass, Petra Kleinert, Tim Seyfi, Adnan Maral, Carmen-Maja Antoni, Michael Ostrowski', null, 'The cabaret artist Marc-Uwe and the kangaroo are faced with a problem: Lisbeth, the mother of Maria has taken a wrong turn somewhere and is now denying the climate crisis on the Internet. How can she be brought to her senses? The two make a bet with each other: If they don''t manage to bring Maria''s mother to her senses, they will lose their apartment. So Marc-Uwe and the marsupial embark on a trip to the Conspiracy Convention in Bielefeld and shortly thereafter become part of a tangible conspiracy led by conspiracy guru Adam Krieger and his followers. As the two flatmates talk their heads off, it''s no longer just about their apartment for Marc-Uwe and the kangaroo, it''s more than that: it''s a matter of life and death!', 'The cabaret artist Marc-Uwe and the kangaroo are faced with a problem: Lisbeth, the mother of Maria has taken a wrong turn somewhere and is now denying the climate crisis on the Internet. How can she be brought to her senses? The two make a bet with each other: If they don''t manage to bring Maria''s mother to her senses, they will lose their apartment. So Marc-Uwe and the marsupial embark on a trip to the Conspiracy Convention in Bielefeld and shortly thereafter become part of a tangible conspiracy led by conspiracy guru Adam Krieger and his followers. As the two flatmates talk their heads off, it''s no longer just about their apartment for Marc-Uwe and the kangaroo, it''s more than that: it''s a matter of life and death!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWbLOZfqFQ9xQmx1jQgBads8GCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979251'),
  ('1127080500607048444', 'The Karadedeler Incident', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Erdogan Bagbakan, Erkan Bagbakan', 'Erdogan Bagbakan, Erkan Bagbakan', 'Murat Han, Berk Balcı, İpek Ayaz Kortunç, Saim Karakale, Oğuzhan Koca, Kadir Yüksel, Ada Hackett', null, 'In a remote village, some strange creatures are patrolling around. After 5 pm, no one dares to go out. A young journalist comes to the village and stays for 10 days but nothing happens. He gives the camera to a 14-year-old boy in the village and then he leaves. The plan was that if the boy sees something strange, he would record it for the journalist and send the tapes back to him. After a while the boy and 6 other people are found murdered, and the camera was still recording...', 'In a remote village, some strange creatures are patrolling around. After 5 pm, no one dares to go out. A young journalist comes to the village and stays for 10 days but nothing happens. He gives the camera to a 14-year-old boy in the village and then he leaves. The plan was that if the boy sees something strange, he would record it for the journalist and send the tapes back to him. After a while the boy and 6 other people are found murdered, and the camera was still recording...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeiSUbUXWTf9fBsGQFhttnueeO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85579'),
  ('107600416627431765', 'The Karate Dog', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Family, TV Movie', 'Bob Clark, Maher Maleh, Brian Pearson', 'Gregory Poppen, Steven Paul', 'Chevy Chase, Jon Voight, Simon Rex, Jaime Pressly, Pat Morita, Thomas Kretschmann, Ron Lester, Bonnie Paul', 'PG', 'When LAPD computer expert Peter Fowler investigates the killing of an old man in Chinatown, he finds the only witness is his dog, Cho Cho. But Fowler soon discovers Cho Cho is the only dog in the world who can speak to humans... not only that, Cho Cho is an expert in martial arts. When they join forces to track down the mastermind behind the death of Cho Cho''s master, it leads these unusual partners into uncovering a dangerous conspiracy which puts both of their lives in danger.', 'When LAPD computer expert Peter Fowler investigates the killing of an old man in Chinatown, he finds the only witness is his dog, Cho Cho. But Fowler soon discovers Cho Cho is the only dog in the world who can speak to humans... not only that, Cho Cho is an expert in martial arts. When they join forces to track down the mastermind behind the death of Cho Cho''s master, it leads these unusual partners into uncovering a dangerous conspiracy which puts both of their lives in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLlNug11CXPc5oFaK1gnCZtGxt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42303'),
  ('337249072447940345', 'The Karate Kid', 1984, 'Action, Drama', 'James Crabe, John G. Avildsen, Clifford C. Coleman', 'Robert Mark Kamen', 'Ralph Macchio, Pat Morita, Elisabeth Shue, William Zabka, Martin Kove, Randee Heller, Ron Thomas, Rob Garrison', 'PG', 'New Jersey teen Daniel LaRusso moves to Los Angeles with his mother, and soon strikes up a relationship with Ali. He quickly finds himself the target of bullying by a group of thugs, led by Ali''s ex-boyfriend Johnny, who study karate at the Cobra Kai dojo under ruthless sensei John Kreese. Fortunately, Daniel befriends Mr. Miyagi, an unassuming repairman who just happens to be a martial arts master himself. Miyagi takes Daniel under his wing, training him in a more compassionate form of karate for self-defense and, later, preparing him to compete against the brutal Cobra Kai.', 'New Jersey teen Daniel LaRusso moves to Los Angeles with his mother, and soon strikes up a relationship with Ali. He quickly finds himself the target of bullying by a group of thugs, led by Ali''s ex-boyfriend Johnny, who study karate at the Cobra Kai dojo under ruthless sensei John Kreese. Fortunately, Daniel befriends Mr. Miyagi, an unassuming repairman who just happens to be a martial arts master himself. Miyagi takes Daniel under his wing, training him in a more compassionate form of karate for self-defense and, later, preparing him to compete against the brutal Cobra Kai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mp4ViklKvA0WXXsNvNx0RBuiit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1885'),
  ('183142057066433761', 'The Karate Kid', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Harald Zwart, Roger Pratt, Doug Coleman', 'Christopher Murphey', 'Jaden Smith, Jackie Chan, Taraji P. Henson, Wenwen Han, Zac Wang, Yu Rongguang, Wu Zhensu, Wang Ji', 'PG', '12-year-old Dre Parker could''ve been the most popular kid in Detroit, but his mother''s latest career move has landed him in China. Dre immediately falls for his classmate Mei Ying but the cultural differences make such a friendship impossible. Even worse, Dre''s feelings make him an enemy of the class bully, Cheng. With no friends in a strange land, Dre has nowhere to turn but maintenance man Mr. Han, who is a kung fu master. As Han teaches Dre that kung fu is not about punches and parries, but maturity and calm, Dre realizes that facing down the bullies will be the fight of his life.', '12-year-old Dre Parker could''ve been the most popular kid in Detroit, but his mother''s latest career move has landed him in China. Dre immediately falls for his classmate Mei Ying but the cultural differences make such a friendship impossible. Even worse, Dre''s feelings make him an enemy of the class bully, Cheng. With no friends in a strange land, Dre has nowhere to turn but maintenance man Mr. Han, who is a kung fu master. As Han teaches Dre that kung fu is not about punches and parries, but maturity and calm, Dre realizes that facing down the bullies will be the fight of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1RBy3l297N0c7PHjlz35cClWju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38575'),
  ('54003903513781465', 'The Karate Kid Part II', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance, Family', 'John G. Avildsen, Clifford C. Coleman, Dennis Maguire', 'Robert Mark Kamen', 'Ralph Macchio, Pat Morita, Danny Kamekona, Nobu McCarthy, Yuji Okumoto, Tamlyn Tomita, Joey Miyashima, Arsenio Trinidad', 'PG', 'Summoned by his dying father, Miyagi returns to his homeland of Okinawa, with Daniel, after a 40-year exile. There he must confront Yukie, the love of his youth, and Sato, his former best friend turned vengeful rival. Sato is bent on a fight to the death, even if it means the destruction of their village. Daniel finds his own love in Yukia''s niece, Kumiko, and his own enemy in Sato''s nephew, the vicious Chozen. Now, far away from the tournaments, cheering crowds and safety of home, Daniel will face his greatest challenge ever when the cost of honor is life itself.', 'Summoned by his dying father, Miyagi returns to his homeland of Okinawa, with Daniel, after a 40-year exile. There he must confront Yukie, the love of his youth, and Sato, his former best friend turned vengeful rival. Sato is bent on a fight to the death, even if it means the destruction of their village. Daniel finds his own love in Yukia''s niece, Kumiko, and his own enemy in Sato''s nephew, the vicious Chozen. Now, far away from the tournaments, cheering crowds and safety of home, Daniel will face his greatest challenge ever when the cost of honor is life itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0OwgRR6PNu7h3SiqpCbRdZWNaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8856'),
  ('918809204011842577', 'The Karate Kid Part III', 1989, 'Action, Family, Drama, Adventure', 'John G. Avildsen, Steve Yaconelli, David N. Schrager', 'Robert Mark Kamen', 'Ralph Macchio, Pat Morita, Robyn Lively, Thomas Ian Griffith, Martin Kove, Sean Kanan, Jonathan Avildsen, William Christopher Ford', 'PG', 'Despondent over the closing of his karate school, Cobra Kai teacher John Kreese joins a ruthless businessman and martial artist to get revenge on Daniel and Mr. Miyagi.', 'Despondent over the closing of his karate school, Cobra Kai teacher John Kreese joins a ruthless businessman and martial artist to get revenge on Daniel and Mr. Miyagi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVZ3r0iDwGejlCvFEvXGzhQB9ds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10495'),
  ('458153871969613395', 'The Karate Killers', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Barry Shear, Fred J. Koenekamp, Bill Finnegan', 'Norman Hudis', 'Robert Vaughn, David McCallum, Joan Crawford, Curd Jürgens, Herbert Lom, Telly Savalas, Terry-Thomas, Leo G. Carroll', 'NR', 'International spies Napoleon Solo and Illya Kuryakin travel around the globe in an effort to track down a secret formula that was divided into four parts and left by a dying scientist with his four of five daughters, all of whom live in different countries. His widow, Amanda, is murdered at the beginning by the counter-spies of the organization THRUSH. Evil THRUSH agent Randolph also wants the formula, and is aided by his karate-chopping henchmen.', 'International spies Napoleon Solo and Illya Kuryakin travel around the globe in an effort to track down a secret formula that was divided into four parts and left by a dying scientist with his four of five daughters, all of whom live in different countries. His widow, Amanda, is murdered at the beginning by the counter-spies of the organization THRUSH. Evil THRUSH agent Randolph also wants the formula, and is aided by his karate-chopping henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5noYUlgOZ5NGKSP5dIbbm8AWoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6319'),
  ('339570965891619841', 'The Karen Carpenter Story', 1989, 'Drama, Music, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Richard Carpenter, Kees Van Oostrum', 'Barry Morrow', 'Cynthia Gibb, Mitchell Anderson, Peter Michael Goetz, Michael McGuire, Lise Hilboldt, Kip Gilman, Richard Minchenberg, Scott Burkholder', 'NR', 'Story of the meteoric rise and sudden fall of Karen Carpenter, who became a famous singer before battling anorexia and bulimia. This made-for-TV movie is the authorized version of the life of Karen Carpenter and was made with the approval of Richard Carpenter and the Carpenter family.', 'Story of the meteoric rise and sudden fall of Karen Carpenter, who became a famous singer before battling anorexia and bulimia. This made-for-TV movie is the authorized version of the life of Karen Carpenter and was made with the approval of Richard Carpenter and the Carpenter family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EVVJIpi0WVLTg5Dbxpa3xtsFpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69898'),
