  ('1018399527033070743', 'The Karnival Kid', 1929, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney, Ub Iwerks', null, 'Walt Disney, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mickey Mouse is working as a hot dog vendor at a carnival when he meets and quickly falls for Minnie the "Shimmy Dancer". That night, Mickey and a pair of alley cats serenade her by performing the song "Sweet Adeline", much to the dismay of Kat Nipp, who is trying to sleep. The short marks Mickey''s first speaking appearance.', 'Mickey Mouse is working as a hot dog vendor at a carnival when he meets and quickly falls for Minnie the "Shimmy Dancer". That night, Mickey and a pair of alley cats serenade her by performing the song "Sweet Adeline", much to the dismay of Kat Nipp, who is trying to sleep. The short marks Mickey''s first speaking appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xV96lRPxiO62MGd7jtFFfOHMIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99037'),
  ('164607592563008798', 'The Karski Report', 2010, 'Documentary', 'William Lubtchansky, Caroline Champetier, Claude Lanzmann', 'Claude Lanzmann', 'Claude Lanzmann, Jan Karski', null, 'A powerful new film about Jan Karski, the Polish resistance figure who attempted to expose the Warsaw Ghetto and Belzec, and met with President Franklin D. Roosevelt and Supreme Court Justice Felix Frankfurter.', 'A powerful new film about Jan Karski, the Polish resistance figure who attempted to expose the Warsaw Ghetto and Belzec, and met with President Franklin D. Roosevelt and Supreme Court Justice Felix Frankfurter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOZrlHAyEhxgQqLW59KcH6dwIan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201195'),
  ('647086853197474453', 'The Kashmir Files', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Vivek Agnihotri, Uday Singh Mohite, Ritesh Verma', 'Vivek Agnihotri', 'Mithun Chakraborty, Anupam Kher, Darshan Kumaar, Pallavi Joshi, Chinmay Mandlekar, Puneet Issar, Prakash Belawadi, Mrinal Kulkarni', null, 'Based on a true tragedy, the emotionally triggering film sheds light on the plight of Kashmiri Pandits (Hindus), a religious minority in the 1990s Kashmir valley, who were compelled to flee their homes by the Islamic militants.', 'Based on a true tragedy, the emotionally triggering film sheds light on the plight of Kashmiri Pandits (Hindus), a religious minority in the 1990s Kashmir valley, who were compelled to flee their homes by the Islamic militants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VvjJFDBFYkVgr89BjqbUl26QyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900783'),
  ('331387149576931636', 'The Kautokeino Rebellion', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Nils Gaup, Philip Øgaard', 'Nils Gaup, Reidar Jönsson, Nils Isak Eira', 'Mikkel Gaup, Anni-Kristiina Juuso, Aslat Mahtte Gaup, Nils Peder Gaup, Mikael Persbrandt, Bjørn Sundquist, Sverre Porsanger, Peter Andersson', null, 'Religious and cultural reawakening inspires rebellion in a 19th century Norwegian village.', 'Religious and cultural reawakening inspires rebellion in a 19th century Norwegian village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4euGED9y7Lt6QzQWw7z9HDwtPW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13221'),
  ('199865314043448433', 'The Keep', 1983, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Michael Mann, Alex Thomson, Callum McDougall', 'Michael Mann', 'Scott Glenn, Alberta Watson, Jürgen Prochnow, Robert Prosky, Gabriel Byrne, Ian McKellen, William Morgan Sheppard, Royston Tickner', 'R', 'Set during World War II, a German army garrison is sent to guard a mountain pass in a village in Romania''s Carpathian mountains and sets up barracks in an ancient stone fortress. Two of the soldiers unwittingly release a mysterious entity that kills or corrupts those within its influence, drawing the attention of a Gestapo commander, a Jewish scholar, and a mysterious traveller.', 'Set during World War II, a German army garrison is sent to guard a mountain pass in a village in Romania''s Carpathian mountains and sets up barracks in an ancient stone fortress. Two of the soldiers unwittingly release a mysterious entity that kills or corrupts those within its influence, drawing the attention of a Gestapo commander, a Jewish scholar, and a mysterious traveller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yd9wU3oajNxwaFHQ02rtTBuSFJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26198'),
  ('304453551596815361', 'The Keeper', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Lynch, Curtis Petersen', 'Gerald Sanford', 'Dennis Hopper, Asia Argento, Helen Shaver, Lochlyn Munro, Charles Frederick, Alex Zahara, Alejandro Abellan, Fred Keating', 'R', 'When an apparently exemplary cop abducts and secretly imprisons a beautiful dancer, a deadly battle of wills between captor and captive ensues.', 'When an apparently exemplary cop abducts and secretly imprisons a beautiful dancer, a deadly battle of wills between captor and captive ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3XWVNbVLk8fcbZdKWKXVsOzWXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40990'),
  ('668674285925123082', 'The Keeper', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Keoni Waxman, Nathan Wilson', 'Steven Seagal', 'Steven Seagal, Liezl Carstens, Arron Shiver, Johnnie Hector, Steph DuVall, Luce Rains, Kevin Wiggins, Trine Christensen', 'R', 'Roland Sallinger is an LA cop who after nearly being killed by his greedy partner, and eventually being forced to retire for medical reasons, flees to San Antonio, Texas, after being asked to work as a bodyguard for the daughter of a wealthy businessman. The businessman had been a colleague of Sallinger years before, when they were both cops. When mobsters kidnap the businessman''s daughter, he hunts them down to rescue her and protect her', 'Roland Sallinger is an LA cop who after nearly being killed by his greedy partner, and eventually being forced to retire for medical reasons, flees to San Antonio, Texas, after being asked to work as a bodyguard for the daughter of a wealthy businessman. The businessman had been a colleague of Sallinger years before, when they were both cops. When mobsters kidnap the businessman''s daughter, he hunts them down to rescue her and protect her', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdk015b9zxIwipDcXBZQMK6NCXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26583'),
  ('670316095838578520', 'The Keeper', 2018, 'Drama, War, History', 'Benedict Hoermann, Benedict Hoermann, Nigel Pollock', 'Nicholas J. Schofield, Marcus H. Rosenmüller', 'David Kross, Freya Mavor, John Henshaw, Gary Lewis, Harry Melling, Michael Socha, Julian Sands, Dave Johns', null, 'The story of a man whose love for football, for England and for the love of his life, Margaret, saw him rise from Nazi ''villain'' to British hero. Bert Trautmann, the German goalkeeper won over even his harshest opponents by winning the FA Cup Final for Manchester City in 1956 - playing on with a broken neck to secure victory.', 'The story of a man whose love for football, for England and for the love of his life, Margaret, saw him rise from Nazi ''villain'' to British hero. Bert Trautmann, the German goalkeeper won over even his harshest opponents by winning the FA Cup Final for Manchester City in 1956 - playing on with a broken neck to secure victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNPsc5USXEr90FoFaXXljaC1O3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489763'),
  ('1055335010886910808', 'The Keeper of Lost Causes', 2013, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Mikkel Nørgaard, Eric Kress, Anders Barlebo', 'Jussi Adler-Olsen, Nikolaj Arcel', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Fares Fares, Sonja Richter, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Søren Pilmark, Peter Plaugborg, Per Scheel Krüger, Troels Lyby', 'NR', 'Denmark, 2013. Police officers Carl Mørck and Hafez el-Assad, sole members of Department Q, which is focused on closing cold cases, investigate the disappearance of politician Merete Lynggaard, vanished when she and her brother were traveling aboard a ferry five years ago.', 'Denmark, 2013. Police officers Carl Mørck and Hafez el-Assad, sole members of Department Q, which is focused on closing cold cases, investigate the disappearance of politician Merete Lynggaard, vanished when she and her brother were traveling aboard a ferry five years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYnZnDAnWNPrImvznLm7SUQQvAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196024'),
  ('140691934695388796', 'The Keeper of the Bees', 1935, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Christy Cabanne, Harry Neumann', 'Gene Stratton-Porter, George Waggner, Adele Buffington', 'Neil Hamilton, Betty Furness, Emma Dunn, Edith Fellows, Hobart Bosworth, Helen Jerome Eddy, Marion Shilling, James P. Burtis', 'NR', 'A severely traumatized World War I veteran, believing that he''s living on borrowed time, comes upon a peaceful little village and meets an old man called Bee Master and his protégé, Little Scout, who try to convince him that he has more to live for than he thinks he does.', 'A severely traumatized World War I veteran, believing that he''s living on borrowed time, comes upon a peaceful little village and meets an old man called Bee Master and his protégé, Little Scout, who try to convince him that he has more to live for than he thinks he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0Qf3MjD0rct3H36hE75iYvOmAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192461'),
  ('741339461468150060', 'The Keeping Hours', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Karen Moncrieff, Anastas N. Michos', 'Rebecca Sonnenshine', 'Lee Pace, Carrie Coon, Sander Thomas, Ray Baker, Amy Smart, Julian LaTourelle, Ana Ortiz, Cliff Chamberlain', 'PG-13', 'A supernatural love story that centers on two parents whose life together falls apart after their son dies. The man, now a successful lawyer, and the woman, now married and an author, get a chance at reconciliation ten years later.', 'A supernatural love story that centers on two parents whose life together falls apart after their son dies. The man, now a successful lawyer, and the woman, now married and an author, get a chance at reconciliation ten years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34IyXcl44VG9VVEps0rBgNo9jQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364220'),
  ('582163586416962449', 'The Keeping Room', 2014, 'Western, Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Barber, Martin Ruhe, Diana Ghinea', 'Julia Hart', 'Hailee Steinfeld, Sam Worthington, Brit Marling, Muna Otaru, Nicholas Pinnock, Charles Jarman, Kyle Soller, Ned Dennehy', 'R', 'In this radically reimagined American Western set towards the end of the Civil War, Southerner Augusta encounters two renegade, drunken soldiers who are on a mission of pillage and violence. After escaping an attempted assault, Augusta races back to the isolated farmhouse that she shares with her sister Louise and their female slave Mad. When the pair of soldiers track Augusta down intent on exacting revenge, the trio of women are forced to take up arms to fend off their assailants, finding ways to resourcefully defend their home––and themselves––as the escalating attacks become more unpredictable and relentless.', 'In this radically reimagined American Western set towards the end of the Civil War, Southerner Augusta encounters two renegade, drunken soldiers who are on a mission of pillage and violence. After escaping an attempted assault, Augusta races back to the isolated farmhouse that she shares with her sister Louise and their female slave Mad. When the pair of soldiers track Augusta down intent on exacting revenge, the trio of women are forced to take up arms to fend off their assailants, finding ways to resourcefully defend their home––and themselves––as the escalating attacks become more unpredictable and relentless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hj2RoLiD31AuUfnYKA2HBlIb6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284284'),
  ('206623485971276116', 'The Kennel Murder Case', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Michael Curtiz, William Rees, Maxwell Arnow', 'S.S. Van Dine', 'William Powell, Mary Astor, Eugene Pallette, Ralph Morgan, Robert McWade, Robert Barrat, Frank Conroy, Etienne Girardot', 'NR', 'Philo Vance, accompanied by his prize-losing Scottish terrier, investigates the locked-room murder of a prominent and much-hated collector whose broken Chinese vase provides an important clue.', 'Philo Vance, accompanied by his prize-losing Scottish terrier, investigates the locked-room murder of a prominent and much-hated collector whose broken Chinese vase provides an important clue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLVl74dMT8JF7HiBqwqqASnEeHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53873'),
