  ('140410207267737751', 'The Kentucky Fried Movie', 1977, 'Comedy', 'John Landis, Robert E. Collins, Stephen M. Katz', 'Jim Abrahams, David Zucker, Jerry Zucker', 'Evan C. Kim, Bong Soo Han, Agneta Eckemyr, Marilyn Joi, Saul Kahan, Marcy Goldman, Bill Bixby, John Landis', 'R', 'A series of loosely connected skits that spoof news programs, commercials, porno films, kung-fu films, disaster films, blaxploitation films, spy films, mafia films, and the fear that somebody is watching you on the other side of the TV.', 'A series of loosely connected skits that spoof news programs, commercials, porno films, kung-fu films, disaster films, blaxploitation films, spy films, mafia films, and the fear that somebody is watching you on the other side of the TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk0iXBQgP6b4xfS2bIUNBSENJAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11598'),
  ('1151715503412748390', 'The Kerala Story 2 Goes Beyond', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kamakhya Narayan Singh, Kena Punde, Abhijeet Chaudhari, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Amarnath Jha, Vipul Amrutlal Shah', 'Smanoj C.P.K Verma, Manoj Muntashir, Ulka Gupta, Aishwarya Ojha, Aditi Bhatia', null, 'Three young Indian women across different states choose love over tradition, only to become trapped. Their parallel lives show how romance and rebellion transform into control and silence, turning love into a weapon that destroys freedom.', 'Three young Indian women across different states choose love over tradition, only to become trapped. Their parallel lives show how romance and rebellion transform into control and silence, turning love into a weapon that destroys freedom.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F97jAFQcAnspd416cupbAbGMNT9z.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-kerala-story-2-goes-beyond'),
  ('1006797106594872703', 'The Ketchup Effect', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Teresa Fabik', 'Teresa Fabik', 'Amanda Renberg, Björn Kjellman, Ellen Fjæstad, Linn Persson, Filip Berg, Marcus Hasselborg, Carla Abrahamsen, Manuel Bjelke', 'R', 'A teenager''s reputation is destroyed when she falls asleep drunk at a party and some boys take provocative photos of her.', 'A teenager''s reputation is destroyed when she falls asleep drunk at a party and some boys take provocative photos of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv9wzD01o9ODfjkNQHfy7VCjeyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17010'),
  ('881672081706822390', 'The Key', 1934, 'Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Ernest Haller, Maxwell Arnow', 'Laird Doyle', 'William Powell, Edna Best, Colin Clive, Hobart Cavanaugh, Halliwell Hobbes, Donald Crisp, J.M. Kerrigan, Henry O''Neill', 'NR', 'A British officer stationed in Ireland falls for the wife of an intelligence man.', 'A British officer stationed in Ireland falls for the wife of an intelligence man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z76ZF6VTFGnHah5u2CNJF8vpB6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53865'),
  ('820118216824003642', 'The Key', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Carol Reed, Oswald Morris', 'Carl Foreman', 'William Holden, Sophia Loren, Trevor Howard, Bernard Lee, Oskar Homolka, Kieron Moore, Noel Purcell, Bryan Forbes', 'NR', 'In wartime England, circa 1941, poorly-armed tugs are sent into "U-Boat Alley" to rescue damaged Allied ships. An American named David Ross arrives to captain one of these tugs. He''s given a key by a fellow tugboat-man -- a key to an apartment and its pretty female resident. Should something happen to the friend, Ross can use the key.', 'In wartime England, circa 1941, poorly-armed tugs are sent into "U-Boat Alley" to rescue damaged Allied ships. An American named David Ross arrives to captain one of these tugs. He''s given a key by a fellow tugboat-man -- a key to an apartment and its pretty female resident. Should something happen to the friend, Ross can use the key.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30lPhoDVPyZNQ3cjjTlsYuO4x0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102081'),
  ('299459635812297443', 'The Key', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tinto Brass, Luca Lachin, Carlo Montanaro', 'Tinto Brass', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Frank Finlay, Franco Branciaroli, Barbara Cupisti, Armando Marra, Maria Grazia Bon, Gino Cavalieri, Piero Bortoluzzi', null, 'In 1940s Venice, after twenty years'' marriage, retired art critic Nino Rolfe and his younger wife Teresa feel their passion waning. To help her shed her inhibitions and rekindle their relationship, the professor records his sexual fantasies in a diary.', 'In 1940s Venice, after twenty years'' marriage, retired art critic Nino Rolfe and his younger wife Teresa feel their passion waning. To help her shed her inhibitions and rekindle their relationship, the professor records his sexual fantasies in a diary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6g2geNLgFzMbriH6EvSJZD78nx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28468'),
  ('671816731864884249', 'The Key', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Pierre Trividic', 'Marie Gillain, Vanessa Paradis, Guillaume Canet, Josiane Balasko, Thierry Lhermitte, Jean Rochefort, Yves Verhoeven, Gilles Cohen', null, 'Depuis peu Eric Vincent, trentenaire sans histoire, a un fort sentiment de malaise. Est-ce la peur d''avoir un enfant ou celle de voir brutalement resurgir le fantôme d''un père qu''il n''a jamais connu ? Un matin, un inconnu l''appelle pour lui proposer de récupérer les cendres de son père. D''abord réticent, il finit par accepter et se retrouve plongé au coeur d''une machination infernale.', 'Depuis peu Eric Vincent, trentenaire sans histoire, a un fort sentiment de malaise. Est-ce la peur d''avoir un enfant ou celle de voir brutalement resurgir le fantôme d''un père qu''il n''a jamais connu ? Un matin, un inconnu l''appelle pour lui proposer de récupérer les cendres de son père. D''abord réticent, il finit par accepter et se retrouve plongé au coeur d''une machination infernale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18uwmEhy4CmrxlMfCAc85UqIyxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49708'),
  ('893404637971862624', 'The Key Game', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Vicente Villanueva', 'Verónica Bellver, Marta Buchaca, Sandro Halphen', 'Fernando Guallar, Eva Ugarte, Miren Ibarguren, Tamar Novas, Alina Nastase, María Castro, Justina Bustos, Richard Farré', 'R', 'Laura has been with Antonio all her life and, just when she begins to wonder if that is really the life she wants, Sergio and Siena cross paths in their lives. Sergio is a former high school classmate and Siena, his millennial girlfriend who arrives to revolutionize everyone''s lives. Laura, Raquel and Cris, close friends for years, convince their respective husbands to play a game that Siena proposes to them: the game of keys. The game consists of everyone putting their keys in a bowl. At random, each one chooses some keys and he must go to spend the night with the owner of the keys. This game will revolutionize the group of friends and their lives. It will make them discover who they are and what they really want.', 'Laura has been with Antonio all her life and, just when she begins to wonder if that is really the life she wants, Sergio and Siena cross paths in their lives. Sergio is a former high school classmate and Siena, his millennial girlfriend who arrives to revolutionize everyone''s lives. Laura, Raquel and Cris, close friends for years, convince their respective husbands to play a game that Siena proposes to them: the game of keys. The game consists of everyone putting their keys in a bowl. At random, each one chooses some keys and he must go to spend the night with the owner of the keys. This game will revolutionize the group of friends and their lives. It will make them discover who they are and what they really want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gT6LThQL32bToudOdqZ0U8QgL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901908'),
  ('622462213648674319', 'The Key Is in the Door', 1978, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yves Boisset', 'Marie Cardinal, Yves Boisset', 'Annie Girardot, Patrick Dewaere, Éléonore Klarwein, Stéphane Jobert, Barbara Steele, Philippe Taccini', null, 'Marie (Annie Girardot) teaches high school and has a 16-year-old daughter in her class. Divorced some years previously, she has some vague egalitarian notions about friendship with her students and leaves her door open to them. One of her protégés is found beaten up just outside her door, and an emergency physician comes by to treat her. When her daughter starts seeing someone she doesn''t much like, and she begins having a brief affair (her first since the divorce) with the ER doctor, she begins to reconsider her policy.', 'Marie (Annie Girardot) teaches high school and has a 16-year-old daughter in her class. Divorced some years previously, she has some vague egalitarian notions about friendship with her students and leaves her door open to them. One of her protégés is found beaten up just outside her door, and an emergency physician comes by to treat her. When her daughter starts seeing someone she doesn''t much like, and she begins having a brief affair (her first since the divorce) with the ER doctor, she begins to reconsider her policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eX4uONwvFcLahnaSbt47G7G10rP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80329'),
  ('643205603175799574', 'The Key That Should Not Be Handed On', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dinara Asanova, Dmitriy Dolinin, Yuriy Veksler', 'Georgi Polonsky', 'Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Zinoviy Gerdt, Marina Levtova, Lyubov Malinovskaya, Aleksey Petrenko, Elena Proklova, Elena Tsyplakova, Yekaterina Vasilyeva', null, 'AKirill Sergeyevich, a retired Army officer, becomes the new school Headmaster. Used to a strict and orderly routine, he at first finds the chaotic bustle of everyday school life hard... It is not easy to deal with both the children and the teachers, especially with the students'' favorite Marina Maximovna who teaches Literature. Well then, wasn''t Marina surprised to discover the "martinet" Nazarov to be a perceptive and tactful person and an experienced tutor.', 'AKirill Sergeyevich, a retired Army officer, becomes the new school Headmaster. Used to a strict and orderly routine, he at first finds the chaotic bustle of everyday school life hard... It is not easy to deal with both the children and the teachers, especially with the students'' favorite Marina Maximovna who teaches Literature. Well then, wasn''t Marina surprised to discover the "martinet" Nazarov to be a perceptive and tactful person and an experienced tutor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssCPshnLmNRXwTSnn5MtoUGp3mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158133'),
  ('237219808622990211', 'The Key to Reserva', 2007, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Harris Savides, Martin Scorsese, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Ted Griffin', 'Simon Baker, Kelli O''Hara, Michael Stuhlbarg, Christopher Denham, Richard Easton, Martin Scorsese, Thelma Schoonmaker, Ted Griffin', null, 'Finding an unfinished script written by Alfred Hitchcock, Martin Scorsese attempts to recreate it himself as Hitchcock would have.', 'Finding an unfinished script written by Alfred Hitchcock, Martin Scorsese attempts to recreate it himself as Hitchcock would have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0mogTthfoOhTtGtJYz6KwaGJvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5804'),
  ('851756759096946215', 'The Key to Sex', 1999, 'Comedy', 'John Quinn', 'Christopher Byrne', 'Maria Ford, Monique Parent, Jacqueline Lovell, Jeannie Millar, Scott Carson, Eric Acsell, Mason Marconi, Christian Malmin', null, 'When brainy office assistant Simon is left in charge of the boss''s Hollywood mansion, the weekend becomes an opportunity of a lifetime. Entrusted by power-hungry movie producer Alan to guard the estate, Simon thinks he''s finally made the grade until he learns that his friends and co-workers have their own plans for the place...', 'When brainy office assistant Simon is left in charge of the boss''s Hollywood mansion, the weekend becomes an opportunity of a lifetime. Entrusted by power-hungry movie producer Alan to guard the estate, Simon thinks he''s finally made the grade until he learns that his friends and co-workers have their own plans for the place...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKEvxQ6Ef1HCq10AErPqZjgRUkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91017'),
  ('160394040816137869', 'The Keyhole', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Barney McGill, Maxwell Arnow', 'Robert Presnell Sr.', 'Kay Francis, George Brent, Glenda Farrell, Monroe Owsley, Allen Jenkins, Helen Ware, Henry Kolker, Ferdinand Gottschalk', null, 'A private eye specializing in divorce cases falls for the woman he''s been hired to frame.', 'A private eye specializing in divorce cases falls for the woman he''s been hired to frame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iB7MIPedjmRg7wFHivtFdpld5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221702'),
  ('848188021666175006', 'The Keys of the Kingdom', 1944, 'Drama', 'Howard W. Koch, John M. Stahl, Arthur C. Miller', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Nunnally Johnson', 'Gregory Peck, Thomas Mitchell, Vincent Price, Rose Stradner, Roddy McDowall, Edmund Gwenn, Cedric Hardwicke, Peggy Ann Garner', 'NR', 'A young priest, Father Chisholm is sent to China to establish a Catholic parish among the non-Christian Chinese. While his boyhood friend, also a priest, flourishes in his calling as a priest in a more Christian area of the world, Father Chisholm struggles. He encounters hostility, isolation, disease, poverty and a variety of set backs which humble him, but make him more determined than ever to succeed.', 'A young priest, Father Chisholm is sent to China to establish a Catholic parish among the non-Christian Chinese. While his boyhood friend, also a priest, flourishes in his calling as a priest in a more Christian area of the world, Father Chisholm struggles. He encounters hostility, isolation, disease, poverty and a variety of set backs which humble him, but make him more determined than ever to succeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5VPdAR9DmZKS57wYuEH3n6vLCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18050'),
  ('996309095687011593', 'The Keys to the House', 2004, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Luca Bigazzi', 'Stefano Rulli', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Andrea Rossi, Alla Faerovich, Pierfrancesco Favino, Manuel Katzy, J. Michael Weiss, Ingrid Appenroth, Dimitri Süsin', null, 'Meeting his handicapped son for the first time, a young father attempts to forge a relationship with the teenager.', 'Meeting his handicapped son for the first time, a young father attempts to forge a relationship with the teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQJtW76ln4tbOYlhkwoV1LkPy7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42420'),
  ('367060039931170675', 'The Kick', 2011, 'Comedy, Action', 'Prachya Pinkaew, Teerawat Rujintham', 'Lee Jong-suk', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Ye Ji-won, Na Tae-joo, Taemi, Petchtai Wongkamlao, JeeJa Yanin, Do Shi-gang, Lee Kwan-hun', null, 'Korean family made up of taekwondo experts moves to Thailand, where they set up a taekwondo gym. However, one member of the family, Taeju, wants to become a famous pop singer instead. The family becomes famous after stopping treasure robbers.', 'Korean family made up of taekwondo experts moves to Thailand, where they set up a taekwondo gym. However, one member of the family, Taeju, wants to become a famous pop singer instead. The family becomes famous after stopping treasure robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xaPPrP3le8S0xBEinTclSfAaYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82469'),
  ('365776773429373267', 'The Kick of Sirocco', 1979, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Arcady', 'Alexandre Arcady, Jan Saint-Hamont', 'Roger Hanin, Marthe Villalonga, Michel Auclair, Jacques Duby, Patrick Bruel, Lucien Layani, Marie-Anne Chazel, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'A shady Parisian tries to take advantage of a family of French-descended Algerians forced to move to France.', 'A shady Parisian tries to take advantage of a family of French-descended Algerians forced to move to France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWQLZ4RqapEU6BFDR2o9Pbt6bBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114862'),
  ('1048059830881032816', 'The Kid', 2000, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Jon Turteltaub, Peter Menzies Jr., William M. Elvin', 'Audrey Wells', 'Bruce Willis, Spencer Breslin, Emily Mortimer, Lily Tomlin, Jean Smart, Chi McBride, Daniel von Bargen, Dana Ivey', 'PG', 'Powerful businessman Russ Duritz is self-absorbed and immersed in his work. But by the magic of the moon, he meets Rusty, a chubby, charming 8-year-old version of himself who can''t believe he could turn out so badly – with no life and no dog. With Rusty''s help, Russ is able to reconcile the person he used to dream of being with the man he''s actually become.', 'Powerful businessman Russ Duritz is self-absorbed and immersed in his work. But by the magic of the moon, he meets Rusty, a chubby, charming 8-year-old version of himself who can''t believe he could turn out so badly – with no life and no dog. With Rusty''s help, Russ is able to reconcile the person he used to dream of being with the man he''s actually become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMRZhiF08nDiO5aRb81Np5a4d6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4244'),
  ('1139824479689126708', 'The Kid', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Monzón, Sergio Francisco', 'Daniel Monzón, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Jesús Castro, Bárbara Lennie, Moussa Maaskri, Ian McShane, Luis Tosar, Eduard Fernández, Sergi López, Jesús Carroza', null, 'Two youths, Niño and Compi, enter the world of drug smuggling in the Strait of Gibraltar; while two police officers, Jesús and Eva, try to eradicate the contraband.', 'Two youths, Niño and Compi, enter the world of drug smuggling in the Strait of Gibraltar; while two police officers, Jesús and Eva, try to eradicate the contraband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOSAcaVdqQoyX7VDigjAy94mMaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247182'),
  ('595140492102303367', 'The Kid', 2019, 'Western, Drama, Action', 'Angelique Midthunder, James Currier, Michael Chochol', 'Andrew Lanham', 'Ethan Hawke, Dane DeHaan, Jake Schur, Leila George, Adam Baldwin, Chris Pratt, Charlie Chappell, Clint Obenchain', 'R', 'New Mexico Territory, 1880. Rio Cutler and his older sister Sara must abandon their home after an unfortunate event happens. In their desperate flee to Santa Fe, they cross paths with the infamous outlaw Billy the Kid and his gang, who are ruthlessly pursued by a posse led by Sheriff Pat Garret.', 'New Mexico Territory, 1880. Rio Cutler and his older sister Sara must abandon their home after an unfortunate event happens. In their desperate flee to Santa Fe, they cross paths with the infamous outlaw Billy the Kid and his gang, who are ruthlessly pursued by a posse led by Sheriff Pat Garret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62kTr2OP9itiyboPCpbhdvty9eV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492565'),
  ('167247909175017653', 'The Kid Brother', 1927, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ted Wilde, J.A. Howe, Walter Lundin', 'John Grey, Lex Neal, Howard J. Green', 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, Walter James, Leo Willis, Olin Francis, Constantine Romanoff, Eddie Boland, Frank Lanning', 'NR', 'The timid youngest son of the most important family in town must use his wits to win the respect of his strong father and the love of a beautiful new woman in town.', 'The timid youngest son of the most important family in town must use his wits to win the respect of his strong father and the love of a beautiful new woman in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH5VcRHUdR0ZIb938mVEbPzF13c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16661'),
  ('473129835597607188', 'The Kid Detective', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Michèle DesLauriers, Lauren Vesterdal, Evan Morgan', 'Evan Morgan', 'Adam Brody, Sophie Nélisse, Tzi Ma, Peter MacNeill, Maurice Dean Wint, Jonathan Whittaker, Wendy Crewson, Sarah Sutherland', 'R', 'A once-celebrated kid detective, now 31, continues to solve the same trivial mysteries between hangovers and bouts of self-pity. Until a naive client brings him his first ''adult'' case, to find out who brutally murdered her boyfriend.', 'A once-celebrated kid detective, now 31, continues to solve the same trivial mysteries between hangovers and bouts of self-pity. Until a naive client brings him his first ''adult'' case, to find out who brutally murdered her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WrT8AZUcDicvf5m8KVgspQEHK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720755'),
  ('790760169200658794', 'The Kid from Borneo', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Robert F. McGowan', null, 'Matthew Beard, Tommy Bond, Dorothy DeBorba, Bobby ''Wheezer'' Hutchins, George McFarland, Dickie Moore, Dickie Jackson, Henry Hanna', null, 'The gang goes to a circus sideshow to visit Dickie, Dorothy, and Spanky''s uncle, mistakenly believing he is "The Wild Man from Borneo."', 'The gang goes to a circus sideshow to visit Dickie, Dorothy, and Spanky''s uncle, mistakenly believing he is "The Wild Man from Borneo."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/errqsrH6G4VuKZJjvnKdSvhdqF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161868'),
  ('1076114058599578849', 'The Kid from Brooklyn', 1946, 'Comedy', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Gregg Toland, Stewart Chaney', 'Grover Jones, Frank Butler, Richard Connell', 'Danny Kaye, Virginia Mayo, Vera-Ellen, Steve Cochran, Eve Arden, Walter Abel, Lionel Stander, Fay Bainter', 'NR', 'Shy milkman Burleigh Sullivan accidentally knocks out drunken Speed McFarlane, a champion boxer who was flirting with Burleigh''s sister. The newspapers get hold of the story and photographers even catch Burleigh knock out Speed again. Speed''s crooked manager decides to turn Burleigh into a fighter. Burleigh doesn''t realize that all of his opponents have been asked to take a dive. Thinking he really is a great fighter, Burleigh develops a swelled head which puts a crimp in his relationship with pretty nightclub singer Polly Pringle. He may finally get his comeuppance when he challenges Speed for the title.', 'Shy milkman Burleigh Sullivan accidentally knocks out drunken Speed McFarlane, a champion boxer who was flirting with Burleigh''s sister. The newspapers get hold of the story and photographers even catch Burleigh knock out Speed again. Speed''s crooked manager decides to turn Burleigh into a fighter. Burleigh doesn''t realize that all of his opponents have been asked to take a dive. Thinking he really is a great fighter, Burleigh develops a swelled head which puts a crimp in his relationship with pretty nightclub singer Polly Pringle. He may finally get his comeuppance when he challenges Speed for the title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paB1nPmu7Ax1rRugC8IKKA42cFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109235'),
  ('404123958829041124', 'The Kid from Chaaba', 1998, 'Drama', 'Christophe Ruggia', null, 'Bouzid Negnoug, Mohamed Fellag, Nabil Ghalem, Galamelah Lagra, Kenza Bouanika, Amina Medjoubi, Lounès Tazairt, François Morel', null, 'Le Gone du Chaâba (The Kid of the Chaaba), translated into English as Shantytown Kid by Naima Wolf, is an autobiographical novel by Azouz Begag about his life as a young Algerian boy growing up in a shantytown next to Lyon, France, called the Chaâba by its inhabitants. The story covers a period of approximately three years in the life of the protagonist and deals with issues developing from the clash between two cultures, that of France and that of North Africa, as well as the difficulties of finding a cultural identity between the two. The story focuses on the cultural differences between the Arab and French communities, as well as how the two groups react to each other', 'Le Gone du Chaâba (The Kid of the Chaaba), translated into English as Shantytown Kid by Naima Wolf, is an autobiographical novel by Azouz Begag about his life as a young Algerian boy growing up in a shantytown next to Lyon, France, called the Chaâba by its inhabitants. The story covers a period of approximately three years in the life of the protagonist and deals with issues developing from the clash between two cultures, that of France and that of North Africa, as well as the difficulties of finding a cultural identity between the two. The story focuses on the cultural differences between the Arab and French communities, as well as how the two groups react to each other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2CvrHEyJtYaSwIgUmmmQsRFcHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60559'),
  ('926484683987034272', 'The Kid from Texas', 1950, 'Western', 'Kurt Neumann, Charles Van Enger', 'Robert Hardy Andrews, Karl Kamb', 'Audie Murphy, Gale Storm, Albert Dekker, Shepperd Strudwick, Will Geer, William Talman, Martín Garralaga, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'Billy the Kid becomes embroiled in Lincoln County, NM, land wars. When rancher who gave him a break is killed by rival henchman, Billy vows revenge. New employer takes advantage of his naivety to kill rivals, lets the Kid take rap. Kid takes to the hills with friends until caught. Escapes hanging but remains in area to be near employer''s young wife with whom he''s infatuated', 'Billy the Kid becomes embroiled in Lincoln County, NM, land wars. When rancher who gave him a break is killed by rival henchman, Billy vows revenge. New employer takes advantage of his naivety to kill rivals, lets the Kid take rap. Kid takes to the hills with friends until caught. Escapes hanging but remains in area to be near employer''s young wife with whom he''s infatuated', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vNgf4qFj03RUnuAU3U8RoPCa0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38664'),
  ('316772306197355216', 'The Kid Stays in the Picture', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Nanette Burstein, Brett Morgen, John Bailey', null, 'Robert Evans', 'R', 'Documentary about legendary Paramount producer Robert Evans, based on his famous 1994 autobiography.', 'Documentary about legendary Paramount producer Robert Evans, based on his famous 1994 autobiography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQd4tf308KGwbUZeoDLPxgYqhiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29047'),
  ('1100508258786891629', 'The Kid Who Would Be King', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Paul Jennings, Fraser Fennell-Ball, Stewart Hamilton', 'Joe Cornish', 'Louis Ashbourne Serkis, Dean Chaumoo, Tom Taylor, Rhianna Dorris, Denise Gough, Angus Imrie, Patrick Stewart, Rebecca Ferguson', 'PG', 'Old-school magic meets the modern world when young Alex stumbles upon the mythical sword Excalibur. He soon unites his friends and enemies, and they become knights who join forces with the legendary wizard Merlin. Together, they must save mankind from the wicked enchantress Morgana and her army of supernatural warriors.', 'Old-school magic meets the modern world when young Alex stumbles upon the mythical sword Excalibur. He soon unites his friends and enemies, and they become knights who join forces with the legendary wizard Merlin. Together, they must save mankind from the wicked enchantress Morgana and her army of supernatural warriors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBuvLX6zynQP0sjyqbXV4jNaZ4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454294'),
  ('75983667827437927', 'The Kid with a Bike', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Cécile de France, Thomas Doret, Jérémie Renier, Fabrizio Rongione, Olivier Gourmet, Egon Di Mateo, Baptiste Sornin, Samuel De Rijk', null, 'Abandoned by his father, a young boy is left in the hands of an unqualified childcare provider.', 'Abandoned by his father, a young boy is left in the hands of an unqualified childcare provider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uRiWyYSAYYScTRe9HP7BHpOQvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63831'),
  ('545184041422575656', 'The Kidnappers', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'George Pollock, Stanley Hosgood, John Wakefield', null, 'Jean Anderson, Adrienne Corri, Theodore Bikel, Duncan Macrae, Vincent Winter, Jon Whiteley, Francis de Wolff, Christopher Beeny', null, 'After losing their father in the Boer War, orphaned brothers Harry and Davy must leave their home in Scotland to live with their grandmother and cantankerous grandfather in Nova Scotia. The boys want nothing more than a pet dog, but their grandfather refuses to get them one. Then, when the brothers find an abandoned baby, they decide to keep it – but the foundling may not have been abandoned after all.', 'After losing their father in the Boer War, orphaned brothers Harry and Davy must leave their home in Scotland to live with their grandmother and cantankerous grandfather in Nova Scotia. The boys want nothing more than a pet dog, but their grandfather refuses to get them one. Then, when the brothers find an abandoned baby, they decide to keep it – but the foundling may not have been abandoned after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVXE6qp0rI73yWxFqZTrxsTeoDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47675'),
  ('142442133209234952', 'The Kidnappers Foil', 1930, 'Crime, Family, Music', 'Melton Barker', null, null, null, 'The Kidnappers Foil was an American short film. It was made by Melton Barker numerous times between the 1930s to 1970s. Each iteration featured small-town children as actors (a different small-town in each iteration), the parents of whom paid Barker a fee in exchange for appearing in the film. The plot of the film centered on a well-to-do girl being kidnapped, and then escaping, a pair of hoodlums.', 'The Kidnappers Foil was an American short film. It was made by Melton Barker numerous times between the 1930s to 1970s. Each iteration featured small-town children as actors (a different small-town in each iteration), the parents of whom paid Barker a fee in exchange for appearing in the film. The plot of the film centered on a well-to-do girl being kidnapped, and then escaping, a pair of hoodlums.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9P5eKZuUPDp1JYiXsWyRDgyEwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168952'),
  ('194145107840255002', 'The Kidnapping', 1934, 'Drama', 'Dimitri Kirsanoff, Viktor Gluck, Oskar Schnirch', 'Benjamin Fondane, Stefan Markus', 'Dita Parlo, Geymond Vital, Jeanne Marie-Laurent, Auguste Bovério, Dyk Rudens, Hans Kaspar Ilg, Nadia Sibirskaïa, Lucas Gridoux', null, 'Hans has killed the dog of Firmin, a shepherd. Wild with rage, Firmin kidnaps Elsi, Hans'' fiancée and locks her up at his home. Hans, a peddler, vows to find the missing girl. This is what he does and he manages, with the help of Mânu, the village idiot, to give Elsi a letter. On seeing her, the changeling falls in love at first sight with the young woman. Elsi soon realizes that Mânu can become her instrument of vengeance.', 'Hans has killed the dog of Firmin, a shepherd. Wild with rage, Firmin kidnaps Elsi, Hans'' fiancée and locks her up at his home. Hans, a peddler, vows to find the missing girl. This is what he does and he manages, with the help of Mânu, the village idiot, to give Elsi a letter. On seeing her, the changeling falls in love at first sight with the young woman. Elsi soon realizes that Mânu can become her instrument of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH3cxG2EqoBSCtBy7q11TLyTkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191347'),
  ('123399205767529870', 'The Kidnapping of Michel Houellebecq', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Didier Abot, Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Michel Houellebecq, Mathieu Nicourt, Maxime Lefrançois, Françoise Lebrun, Luc Schwarz, Veran Mauberret, Ginette Suchotzky, André Suchotzky', null, 'In September 2011 writer Michel Houellebecq briefly disappeared off the face of the earth. Wild rumours began circulating on the Internet that he’d been abducted by Al-Qaeda or aliens from outer space. Some Twitter users even expressed relief that the controversial author was suddenly no longer around. This film now reveals what really happened: Three tough guys variously with impressive hairstyles and bodybuilder physiques carried off the star intellectual, taking him out of the daily stress of dodging autograph hunters and having his flat renovated and bringing him to a beautiful rural underdog idyll, full of dog grooming, bodybuilding demonstrations, junk cars and Polish sausages. But who was to pay the ransom?', 'In September 2011 writer Michel Houellebecq briefly disappeared off the face of the earth. Wild rumours began circulating on the Internet that he’d been abducted by Al-Qaeda or aliens from outer space. Some Twitter users even expressed relief that the controversial author was suddenly no longer around. This film now reveals what really happened: Three tough guys variously with impressive hairstyles and bodybuilder physiques carried off the star intellectual, taking him out of the daily stress of dodging autograph hunters and having his flat renovated and bringing him to a beautiful rural underdog idyll, full of dog grooming, bodybuilding demonstrations, junk cars and Polish sausages. But who was to pay the ransom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Liu58WXxqNaY58oThNrmd8IlgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255533'),
  ('611261381057475118', 'The Kidnapping of the President', 1980, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Mendeluk, Mike Molloy', 'Richard Murphy', 'William Shatner, Hal Holbrook, Van Johnson, Ava Gardner, Maury Chaykin, Elizabeth Shepherd, Miguel Fernandes, Cindy Girling', 'R', 'A South American quasi-revolutionary/guerilla/terrorist and a misled, admiring girl compatriot manage to kidnap the U.S. President during a diplomatic visit to Toronto.', 'A South American quasi-revolutionary/guerilla/terrorist and a misled, admiring girl compatriot manage to kidnap the U.S. President during a diplomatic visit to Toronto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep51bKbJC5J39Xy0iP4WhPi29ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107355'),
  ('951557562525862407', 'The Kids Are All Right', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lisa Cholodenko, Igor Jadue-Lillo', 'Stuart Blumberg, Lisa Cholodenko', 'Julianne Moore, Annette Bening, Mark Ruffalo, Mia Wasikowska, Josh Hutcherson, Yaya DaCosta, Kunal Sharma, Eddie Hassell', 'R', 'Two women, Nic and Jules, brought a son and daughter into the world through artificial insemination. When one of their children reaches age, both kids go behind their mothers'' backs to meet with the donor. Life becomes so much more interesting when the father, two mothers and children start to become attached to each other.', 'Two women, Nic and Jules, brought a son and daughter into the world through artificial insemination. When one of their children reaches age, both kids go behind their mothers'' backs to meet with the donor. Life becomes so much more interesting when the father, two mothers and children start to become attached to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ5XqZc82dDCcGjxY7voRKjhaKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39781'),
  ('247743196195692629', 'The Kids Are Alright 2', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Inés de León', 'Marta González de Vega, Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Leo Harlem, El Cejas, Alan Miranda, Eneko Otero, Luna Fulgencio, Javier García, Sirena Segura', null, 'A year ago, Ricardo and Felipe, in charge of taking the children to a camp, stayed outside the train leaving the children inside. Clara no longer trusts them and this year she decides to take the children personally with the help of her friend Susana. However, now they will be the ones who, as a result of an accident, are separated from the children.', 'A year ago, Ricardo and Felipe, in charge of taking the children to a camp, stayed outside the train leaving the children inside. Clara no longer trusts them and this year she decides to take the children personally with the help of her friend Susana. However, now they will be the ones who, as a result of an accident, are separated from the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6JFR8Yc5Y2ylS2mK42Gd1gbblY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892068'),
  ('755924685095631270', 'The Kids Are Alright: Destination Asturias', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ángel Iguacel, Sara Mazkiarán, Santiago Segura', 'Ingrid Morley-Pegge, Charly de Witte, Benjamin Euvrard', 'Santiago Segura, Leo Harlem, El Cejas, David Guapo, Alan Miranda, Eneko Otero, Luna Fulgencio, Javier García', null, 'When Ricardo, a responsible father, decides to personally take his son to a camp in Asturias, other parents propose that he should also take care of their children. When the train is about to leave, Felipe, a flamboyant individual and grandfather of two of the children, shows up at the station.', 'When Ricardo, a responsible father, decides to personally take his son to a camp in Asturias, other parents propose that he should also take care of their children. When the train is about to leave, Felipe, a flamboyant individual and grandfather of two of the children, shows up at the station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxK9GyYqEN8224PxSdkOKYbLPZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800823'),
  ('25655815471956818', 'The Kids Are Back', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Hugo Lara', 'Claudia González-Rubio, Hugo Lara', 'Fernando Luján, Carmen Maura, Cecilia Suárez, Irene Azuela, Erick Elías, Esmeralda Pimentel, Diana Bovio, Francisco De La Reguera', null, 'A retired couple will have to defend their home against an unpredicted menace: Their kids moving back.', 'A retired couple will have to defend their home against an unpredicted menace: Their kids moving back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A32jM9IB3UFDQuAk2nbHnqxsZue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484150'),
  ('299020989505230039', 'The Kids in the Bikes', 2020, 'Drama', 'Marcos Rostagno, María Gabriela Vidal, Inés María Barrionuevo', 'María Gabriela Vidal', 'Carla Gusolfino, Ignacio Pedrone, Carolina Godoy, Erika Cuello, Miguel Ángel Simmons, Catalina Pereyra, Nicolás Cucinelli, Martina López Vidal', null, 'Throughout Córdoba, Argentina, there is a wave of looting, and the police are taking several young people. In the midst of this hectic period, teenage Juliana becomes pregnant by her boyfriend, Lautaro. Juliana wants to have an abortion, but she is afraid to do it with pills and they do not have money to pay for an intervention.', 'Throughout Córdoba, Argentina, there is a wave of looting, and the police are taking several young people. In the midst of this hectic period, teenage Juliana becomes pregnant by her boyfriend, Lautaro. Juliana wants to have an abortion, but she is afraid to do it with pills and they do not have money to pay for an intervention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRCEzxMAvNJT0uB3Xx2UYRkQ5PM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763316'),
  ('878479070698387092', 'The Kill Room', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Nicol Paone, Bartosz Nalazek', 'Jonathan Jacobson', 'Uma Thurman, Joe Manganiello, Samuel L. Jackson, Maya Hawke, Debi Mazar, Dree Hemingway, Amy Keum, Candy Buckley', 'R', 'A hitman, his boss, an art dealer and a money-laundering scheme that accidentally turns the assassin into an overnight avant-garde sensation, one that forces her to play the art world against the underworld.', 'A hitman, his boss, an art dealer and a money-laundering scheme that accidentally turns the assassin into an overnight avant-garde sensation, one that forces her to play the art world against the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciEZWh4fkq394ToQBr91UDUK45O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958006'),
  ('54492675786901902', 'The Kill Team', 2019, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Dan Krauss, Stéphane Fontaine, Eva Ferradas', 'Dan Krauss', 'Nat Wolff, Alexander Skarsgård, Adam Long, Jonathan Whitesell, Brian Marc, Osy Ikhile, Rob Morrow, Anna Francolini', 'R', 'When Andrew Briggman — a young soldier in the US Army during the invasion of Afghanistan — witnesses the murderous behavior of fellow soldiers, under the direction of a malevolent Sergeant, he faces a moral dilemma. His increasingly-violent platoon becomes suspicious that someone in their ranks has turned on them, and Andrew begins to fear for his safety. A fictionalized dramatization based on a true story.', 'When Andrew Briggman — a young soldier in the US Army during the invasion of Afghanistan — witnesses the murderous behavior of fellow soldiers, under the direction of a malevolent Sergeant, he faces a moral dilemma. His increasingly-violent platoon becomes suspicious that someone in their ranks has turned on them, and Andrew begins to fear for his safety. A fictionalized dramatization based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLRZbtrbV51oQuvqNeK6vhb6btV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489245'),
  ('375388609149826181', 'The Kill-Off', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maggie Greenwald, Declan Quinn', 'Maggie Greenwald', 'Loretta Gross, Steve Monroe, Cathy Haase, Andrew Lee Barrett, Jackson Sims, Jorja Fox, William Jess Russell, Seán O''Sullivan', 'NR', 'In a seedy New Jersey nightclub, gossip turns to murder when the owner Pete hires exotic dancer Danny Lee, who starts up an affair with barfly Ralph, much to the chagrin of his bedridden wife, Luane.', 'In a seedy New Jersey nightclub, gossip turns to murder when the owner Pete hires exotic dancer Danny Lee, who starts up an affair with barfly Ralph, much to the chagrin of his bedridden wife, Luane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVAr5MSGPbuGcthCPQXSqrzspfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66924'),
  ('841701580196626963', 'The Killer', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Woo, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Hui Wai-Kwok', 'John Woo', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Sally Yeh, Paul Chu Kong, Kenneth Tsang, Shing Fui-On, Tommy Wong, James Ha Chim-Si', 'R', 'Mob assassin Jeffrey is no ordinary hired gun; the best in his business, he views his chosen profession as a calling rather than simply a job. So, when beautiful nightclub chanteuse Jennie is blinded in the crossfire of his most recent hit, Jeffrey chooses to retire after one last job to pay for his unintended victim''s sight-restoring operation. But when Jeffrey is double-crossed, he reluctantly joins forces with a rogue policeman to make things right.', 'Mob assassin Jeffrey is no ordinary hired gun; the best in his business, he views his chosen profession as a calling rather than simply a job. So, when beautiful nightclub chanteuse Jennie is blinded in the crossfire of his most recent hit, Jeffrey chooses to retire after one last job to pay for his unintended victim''s sight-restoring operation. But when Jeffrey is double-crossed, he reluctantly joins forces with a rogue policeman to make things right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hTxlSqMAHBXAh1eB69ir0BXhzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10835'),
  ('547640750373807940', 'The Killer', 2008, 'Thriller', 'Cédric Anger, Caroline Champetier, Matthieu Allart', 'Cédric Anger', 'Gilbert Melki, Grégoire Colin, Mélanie Laurent, Sophie Cattani, Xavier Beauvois, Jeanne Allard', null, 'Leo Zimmermann, a business man from Paris dotes on his daughter. He proposes a strange offer to his killer when he is in town to execute Zimmermann.', 'Leo Zimmermann, a business man from Paris dotes on his daughter. He proposes a strange offer to his killer when he is in town to execute Zimmermann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqsKtC43YlN8mGWjrHdPwpYJVrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49946'),
  ('219098832190975566', 'The Killer', 2017, 'Action, Western', 'Fabricio Tadeu, Marcelo Galvão', 'Marcelo Galvão', 'Diogo Morgado, Maria de Medeiros, Etienne Chicot, Paulo Gorgulho, Marat Descartes, Daniela Galli, Mel Lisboa, Deto Montenegro', null, 'In lawless badlands, reclusive Cabeleira sets out to discover the fate of his gunman father and grows to be a feared assassin himself.', 'In lawless badlands, reclusive Cabeleira sets out to discover the fate of his gunman father and grows to be a feared assassin himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPvW6PchT6Dsss3sStKilnhKvGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466190'),
  ('868444572452651470', 'The Killer', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Lorenz Plassmann, Marie d''Hallivillée, Andrea Hachuel', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Michael Fassbender, Tilda Swinton, Charles Parnell, Arliss Howard, Kerry O''Malley, Sophie Charlotte, Emiliano Pernia, Gabriel Polanco', 'R', 'After a fateful miss, an assassin battles his employers, and himself, on an international manhunt he insists isn''t personal.', 'After a fateful miss, an assassin battles his employers, and himself, on an international manhunt he insists isn''t personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipkcgvN7h3yZnbYowthloHLKsf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800158'),
  ('1044476049757580905', 'The Killer', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'John Woo, Julien Dara, Nicolas Brisset', 'John Woo', 'Nathalie Emmanuel, Omar Sy, Sam Worthington, Diana Silvers, Saïd Taghmaoui, Angeles Woo, Éric Cantona, Tchéky Karyo', 'R', 'Zee is a feared contract killer known as "the Queen of the Dead," but when she refuses to murder a young blind woman, she finds herself hunted both by criminal colleagues and a determined police detective.', 'Zee is a feared contract killer known as "the Queen of the Dead," but when she refuses to murder a young blind woman, she finds herself hunted both by criminal colleagues and a determined police detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PCnxKZZIVRanWb710pNpYVkCSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970347'),
  ('460626637224455206', 'The Killer Condom', 1996, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Martin Walz, Lysanne Thibodeau, Johannes von Gwinner', 'Ralf König, Martin Walz, Mario Kramp', 'Udo Samel, Peter Lohmeyer, Iris Berben, Marc Richter, Leonard Lansink, Evelyn Künneke, Hella von Sinnen, Heribert Sasse', null, 'In New York City, detective Luigi Mackeroni investigates a string of mysterious penile mutilations at the Hotel Quickie. After Mackeroni attempts to have a tryst with a gigolo he meets in the lobby, a carniverous condom bites off his right testicle and flees, which sets the detective off on a quest to stop the predatory prophylactic once and for all.', 'In New York City, detective Luigi Mackeroni investigates a string of mysterious penile mutilations at the Hotel Quickie. After Mackeroni attempts to have a tryst with a gigolo he meets in the lobby, a carniverous condom bites off his right testicle and flees, which sets the detective off on a quest to stop the predatory prophylactic once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2zHRRaP7fjIGQBC2ZS9jl5BjPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10542'),
  ('1142644044466941526', 'The Killer Elite', 1975, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Sam Peckinpah, Philip H. Lathrop, Ron Hobbs', 'Stirling Silliphant, Marc Norman', 'James Caan, Robert Duvall, Arthur Hill, Bo Hopkins, Mako, Burt Young, Gig Young, Tom Clancy', 'PG', 'Mike Locken is one of the principal members of a group of freelance spies. A significant portion of their work is for the CIA, and while on a case for them one of his friends turns on him and shoots him in the elbow and knee. His assignment, to protect someone, goes down in flames. He is nearly crippled, but with braces is able to again become mobile. For revenge as much as anything else, Mike goes after his ex-friend.', 'Mike Locken is one of the principal members of a group of freelance spies. A significant portion of their work is for the CIA, and while on a case for them one of his friends turns on him and shoots him in the elbow and knee. His assignment, to protect someone, goes down in flames. He is nearly crippled, but with braces is able to again become mobile. For revenge as much as anything else, Mike goes after his ex-friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gmeoOGo173bXXeiqmInWunipPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31604'),
  ('1115262422214849512', 'The Killer Eye', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler, Brad Jacques', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Neal Marshall Stevens, Matthew Jason Walsh', 'Jacqueline Lovell, Jonathan Norman, Nanette Bianchi, Costas Koromilas, Blake Bailey, Ryan Van Steenis, Dave Oren Ward, Roland Martinez', 'R', 'A mad scientist''s experiment goes awry, turning a homeless man''s eyeball into a giant killing machine that has an insatiable appetite for young women.', 'A mad scientist''s experiment goes awry, turning a homeless man''s eyeball into a giant killing machine that has an insatiable appetite for young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6TD8iJMU6f8OXm0YFJ24FHAYPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64921'),
  ('670862127088201098', 'The Killer Inside Me', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Burt Kennedy, William A. Fraker', 'Robert Chamblee, Edward Mann', 'Stacy Keach, Susan Tyrrell, Tisha Sterling, Keenan Wynn, Don Stroud, Charles McGraw, John Dehner, Pepe Serna', 'R', 'Haunted by visions from his abusive childhood, Montana deputy sheriff Lou Ford gradually exhibits the signs of a homicidal schizophrenic.', 'Haunted by visions from his abusive childhood, Montana deputy sheriff Lou Ford gradually exhibits the signs of a homicidal schizophrenic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ofya1doZ40KFCNK6WZ4yXHnO5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37415'),
  ('738924294750733392', 'The Killer Inside Me', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind, Yann Sobezynski', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Casey Affleck, Kate Hudson, Jessica Alba, Ned Beatty, Tom Bower, Simon Baker, Bill Pullman, Elias Koteas', 'R', 'Deputy Sheriff Lou Ford is a pillar of the community in his small west Texas town, patient and apparently thoughtful. Some people think he is a little slow and maybe boring, but that is the worst they say about him. But then nobody knows about what Lou calls his "sickness": He is a brilliant, but disturbed sociopathic sadist.', 'Deputy Sheriff Lou Ford is a pillar of the community in his small west Texas town, patient and apparently thoughtful. Some people think he is a little slow and maybe boring, but that is the worst they say about him. But then nobody knows about what Lou calls his "sickness": He is a brilliant, but disturbed sociopathic sadist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhmdzywgGF9cvoLPuW8qqDn0Gtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37414'),
  ('286542736982370168', 'The Killer Is Loose', 1956, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Budd Boetticher, Dolph Zimmer, Lucien Ballard', 'Harold Medford', 'Joseph Cotten, Rhonda Fleming, Wendell Corey, Alan Hale Jr., Michael Pate, John Larch, Dee J. Thompson, John Beradino', 'NR', 'A savings-and-loan bank is robbed; later, a police wiretap identifies meek bank teller Leon Poole as the inside man. In capturing him, detective Sam Wagner accidentally kills Poole''s young wife, and at his trial Poole swears vengeance against Wagner. Poole begins his plans to get revenge when he escapes his captors.', 'A savings-and-loan bank is robbed; later, a police wiretap identifies meek bank teller Leon Poole as the inside man. In capturing him, detective Sam Wagner accidentally kills Poole''s young wife, and at his trial Poole swears vengeance against Wagner. Poole begins his plans to get revenge when he escapes his captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpBlgwCmotclMPMqYlCJJ15l9lj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27999'),
  ('460886815928021491', 'The Killer Is Not Alone', 1975, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jesús García de Dueñas, Fernando Arribas', 'Jesús García de Dueñas, Jesús Torbado', 'Lola Flores, Teresa Rabal, David Carpenter, James Philbrook, Maria Rohm, Francisco Pierrá, José Vivó, María José Cantudo', null, 'Julio, an only child belonging to a wealthy family, murders a prostitute who tries to seduce him. He, in childhood, suffered severe trauma and this causes serious problems with women. Because of this, runs away and stays in a boarding house in Madrid, where he meets Monica, the daughter of the owner, who maintains relationships that seek to build on for help in their desperate situation. As his obsession for killing is increasing.', 'Julio, an only child belonging to a wealthy family, murders a prostitute who tries to seduce him. He, in childhood, suffered severe trauma and this causes serious problems with women. Because of this, runs away and stays in a boarding house in Madrid, where he meets Monica, the daughter of the owner, who maintains relationships that seek to build on for help in their desperate situation. As his obsession for killing is increasing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gBWd0RjrgtJ31msVL9SXhlO3ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102717'),
  ('139188692585562147', 'The Killer Is on the Phone', 1972, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alberto De Martino, Joe D''Amato', 'Adriano Bolzoni, Renato Izzo, Lorenzo Manning', 'Telly Savalas, Anne Heywood, Osvaldo Ruggieri, Giorgio Piazza, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Rossella Falk, Antonio Guidi, Roger Van Hool', 'R', 'A woman whose husband was murdered five years previously, is stalked by his killer, who wants to eliminate her as a potential witness. What he doesn''t know is that the shock of his murder caused her to have amnesia, and she doesn''t remember anything.', 'A woman whose husband was murdered five years previously, is stalked by his killer, who wants to eliminate her as a potential witness. What he doesn''t know is that the shock of his murder caused her to have amnesia, and she doesn''t remember anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tukUYVVDt5ouKzvrhgkhuL8hvl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105109'),
  ('322141942690531253', 'The Killer Is One of Thirteen', 1973, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Javier Aguirre, Francisco Fraile, Juan Antonio Arévalo', 'Javier Aguirre, Alberto S. Insúa', 'Patty Shepard, Simón Andreu, José María Prada, Trini Alonso, Dyanik Zurakowska, Jack Taylor, Paul Naschy, Ramiro Oliveros', null, 'A recent widow has invited a group of family friends to her large and secluded country home. However, what the guests don''t know is that the reason they''ve been assembled is that their host suspects one of them might be her husband''s killer and she''s intent on uncovering the identity of his murderer. As the guests begin to suspect each other, revealing long-kept and sinister secrets in the process, an unknown, black-gloved killer begins bumping them off in a variety of nasty ways.', 'A recent widow has invited a group of family friends to her large and secluded country home. However, what the guests don''t know is that the reason they''ve been assembled is that their host suspects one of them might be her husband''s killer and she''s intent on uncovering the identity of his murderer. As the guests begin to suspect each other, revealing long-kept and sinister secrets in the process, an unknown, black-gloved killer begins bumping them off in a variety of nasty ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHa8x03G2oD7RVlHfqDtfvC5IOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30422'),
  ('214550923311363545', 'The Killer Is Still Among Us', 1986, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Camillo Teti, Giuseppe Bernardini', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Mariangela D''Abbraccio, Riccardo Parisio Perrotti, Giovanni Visentin, Luigi Mezzanotte, Roberto Sanna, Francesco Capitano, Yvonne D''Abbraccio, Oresto Antonio Rotundo', null, 'During a spree of violent killings, a young woman writing a thesis in criminology begins to suspect that her new boyfriend, who is a forensic pathologist, might be a serial killer.', 'During a spree of violent killings, a young woman writing a thesis in criminology begins to suspect that her new boyfriend, who is a forensic pathologist, might be a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uPVKGpUeth1YnjAjojqG6YK71o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85139'),
  ('699736513937168256', 'The Killer Must Kill Again', 1975, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Luigi Cozzi, Paolo Tortorella, Luciano Sacripanti', 'Luigi Cozzi, Daniele Del Giudice', 'George Hilton, Antoine Saint-John, Femi Benussi, Cristina Galbó, Eduardo Fajardo, Teresa Velázquez, Alessio Orano, Dario Griachi', null, 'Giorgio Mainardi, a womanizer, plans to rid himself of his wealthy wife Norma. He happens to see a sinister figure disposing of a body and seizes the opportunity to make a deal in which the killer will murder Norma. The deed is done but a young couple, Luca and Laura, unwittingly steal the killer''s car, complete with Norma''s corpse in the boot. They head for the beach and break into an abandoned old house. The killer tracks them down and while Luca is out having sex with a blonde stranger, he terrorises and rapes Laura. When the young man and the blonde turn up for a threesome they are both quickly despatched. After a struggle, Laura manages to fatally wound her attacker. Back in the city, the police become increasingly suspicious of Giorgio Mainardi...', 'Giorgio Mainardi, a womanizer, plans to rid himself of his wealthy wife Norma. He happens to see a sinister figure disposing of a body and seizes the opportunity to make a deal in which the killer will murder Norma. The deed is done but a young couple, Luca and Laura, unwittingly steal the killer''s car, complete with Norma''s corpse in the boot. They head for the beach and break into an abandoned old house. The killer tracks them down and while Luca is out having sex with a blonde stranger, he terrorises and rapes Laura. When the young man and the blonde turn up for a threesome they are both quickly despatched. After a struggle, Laura manages to fatally wound her attacker. Back in the city, the police become increasingly suspicious of Giorgio Mainardi...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtzcnTq7rTDOcJCP4VIVHFHOCsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63026'),
  ('663370365315668925', 'The Killer of Dolls', 1975, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Miguel Madrid, Pablo Ripoll, Ángel G. Gauna', 'Miguel Madrid', 'David Rocha, Inma de Santis, Helga Liné, Elisenda Ribas, Marina Ferri, Antonio Molino Rojo, Lupe Rocha, Salvador Buchila', null, 'A groundskeeper''s son, who is mentally unstable due to childhood trauma, goes on a murdering spree where his perception of reality is distorted by imagining people as mannequins and vice versa.', 'A groundskeeper''s son, who is mentally unstable due to childhood trauma, goes on a murdering spree where his perception of reality is distorted by imagining people as mannequins and vice versa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gphYBMY1iRkbMZ5qKduW4cqten.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97311'),
  ('211176202987072961', 'The Killer of Swordsmen', 2025, 'Action', 'Li Bingyuan', 'Li Bingyuan', 'Li Bingyuan, Sun Yiran', null, 'HAN YUEREN, known as DRUNKEN BLADE in Jianghu, traveled to a desolate desert town to repay the kindness of a meal back then. At the time, the town was being ravaged by swords bandits. The killing intent of Lady Boss also emerges.', 'HAN YUEREN, known as DRUNKEN BLADE in Jianghu, traveled to a desolate desert town to repay the kindness of a meal back then. At the time, the town was being ravaged by swords bandits. The killing intent of Lady Boss also emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FaWQH639tVJHJKkbNmLOWR1ccD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1553949'),
  ('526651687400218466', 'The Killer Reserved Nine Seats', 1974, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Giuseppe Bennati, Giuseppe Aquari', 'Giuseppe Bennati, Paolo Levi, Biagio Proietti', 'Chris Avram, Rosanna Schiaffino, Eva Czemerys, Lucretia Love, Paola Senatore, Gaetano Russo, Eduardo Filipone, Howard Ross', null, 'A rich man gathers together friends and relatives at the abandoned theatre he owns, but the party isn''t fun for long since apparently one of them is a murderer.', 'A rich man gathers together friends and relatives at the abandoned theatre he owns, but the party isn''t fun for long since apparently one of them is a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HOnC0eePbpjLPqhh7LJyD2yaxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99438'),
  ('467445582778502297', 'The Killer Shrews', 1959, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ray Kellogg, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Jay Simms', 'James Best, Ingrid Goude, Ken Curtis, Gordon McLendon, Baruch Lumet, Judge Henry Dupree, Alfredo de Soto', 'NR', 'Trapped on a remote island by a hurricane, a group discover a doctor has been experimenting on creating half sized humans. Unfortunately, his experiments have also created giant shrews, who when they have run out of small animals to eat, turn on the humans.', 'Trapped on a remote island by a hurricane, a group discover a doctor has been experimenting on creating half sized humans. Unfortunately, his experiments have also created giant shrews, who when they have run out of small animals to eat, turn on the humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2agTmqPg2we1gd4Fr1p2UNAMORI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43109'),
  ('97336492995485461', 'The Killer That Stalked New York', 1950, 'Thriller', 'Earl McEvoy, Joseph F. Biroc, James Nicholson', 'Harry Essex', 'Evelyn Keyes, Charles Korvin, William Bishop, Dorothy Malone, Lola Albright, Barry Kelley, Carl Benton Reid, Ludwig Donath', null, 'In New York, Sheila Bennet and her spouse, Matt Krane, are trying to unload a trove of rare jewels they smuggled into America from Cuba, but the police are hot on the couple''s trail. Meanwhile, government officials begin a desperate search for an unknown individual who is infecting the city with smallpox.', 'In New York, Sheila Bennet and her spouse, Matt Krane, are trying to unload a trove of rare jewels they smuggled into America from Cuba, but the police are hot on the couple''s trail. Meanwhile, government officials begin a desperate search for an unknown individual who is infecting the city with smallpox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JD63sXu6WxWlpDBZRgbQxTGifc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32205'),
  ('416935373057176574', 'The Killer Who Never Kills', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Wan Chi-Man, Lee Fung-Bok', 'Wan Chi-Man', 'Jam Hsiao, Zaizai Lin, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Chrissie Chau Sau-Na, Huang Licheng, Chang Kuo-Chu, Ma Nien-Hsien, Chao Cheng-Ping', null, 'Trevor Ou is The Killer Who Never Kills, an assassin who earns the trust of his targets before snuffing their lives – and he does it without killing them! Trevor fakes the deaths of his targets and gives them new identities, but when his first target Grace returns – and reveals her love for him – Trevor may need to find a more permanent solution.', 'Trevor Ou is The Killer Who Never Kills, an assassin who earns the trust of his targets before snuffing their lives – and he does it without killing them! Trevor fakes the deaths of his targets and gives them new identities, but when his first target Grace returns – and reveals her love for him – Trevor may need to find a more permanent solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uInpexVHmMIpf9WTNVjkXnLWgPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84819'),
  ('993094725007676079', 'The Killer''s Game', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'J.J. Perry, Flavio Martínez Labiano, William Paul Clark', 'James Coyne, Rand Ravich', 'Dave Bautista, Sofia Boutella, Terry Crews, Pom Klementieff, Daniel Bernhardt, Scott Adkins, Andrew Galloway, Marko Zaror', 'R', 'When top hitman Joe Flood is diagnosed with a terminal illness, he decides to take matters into his own hands – by taking a hit out on himself. But when the very hitmen he hired also target his ex-girlfriend, he must fend off an army of assassin colleagues and win back the love of his life before it''s too late.', 'When top hitman Joe Flood is diagnosed with a terminal illness, he decides to take matters into his own hands – by taking a hit out on himself. But when the very hitmen he hired also target his ex-girlfriend, he must fend off an army of assassin colleagues and win back the love of his life before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bKlTeOUr5AKrLky8mwWvlQqyVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507241'),
  ('61121752169674606', 'The Killers', 1946, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Siodmak, Elwood Bredell, Melville Shyer', 'John Huston, Richard Brooks', 'Edmond O''Brien, Burt Lancaster, Ava Gardner, Albert Dekker, Sam Levene, Vince Barnett, Virginia Christine, Jack Lambert', null, 'Two hit men walk into a diner asking for a man called "the Swede". When the killers find the Swede, he''s expecting them and doesn''t put up a fight. Since the Swede had a life insurance policy, an investigator, on a hunch, decides to look into the murder. As the Swede''s past is laid bare, it comes to light that he was in love with a beautiful woman who may have lured him into pulling off a bank robbery overseen by another man.', 'Two hit men walk into a diner asking for a man called "the Swede". When the killers find the Swede, he''s expecting them and doesn''t put up a fight. Since the Swede had a life insurance policy, an investigator, on a hunch, decides to look into the murder. As the Swede''s past is laid bare, it comes to light that he was in love with a beautiful woman who may have lured him into pulling off a bank robbery overseen by another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXnuc6pW01s1MDwb6QwBWg2JQeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14638'),
  ('691857461216535371', 'The Killers', 1956, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marika Beiku, Andrei Tarkovsky, Aleksandr Gordon', 'Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Yuliy Fayt, Aleksandr Gordon, Valentin Vinogradov, Vadim Novikov, Yuriy Dubrovin, Andrei Tarkovsky, Vasiliy Shukshin, Ermengeld Konovalov', null, 'The Killers is a 1956 student film by the Soviet and Russian film director Andrei Tarkovsky and his fellow students Marika Beiku and Aleksandr Gordon. The film is based on the short story "The Killers" by Ernest Hemingway, written in 1927. It was Tarkovsky''s first film, produced when he was a student at the State Institute of Cinematography.', 'The Killers is a 1956 student film by the Soviet and Russian film director Andrei Tarkovsky and his fellow students Marika Beiku and Aleksandr Gordon. The film is based on the short story "The Killers" by Ernest Hemingway, written in 1927. It was Tarkovsky''s first film, produced when he was a student at the State Institute of Cinematography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oOz7UIQpz9d7rshhEEnukPgsw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48775'),
  ('247836389831338701', 'The Killers', 1964, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Don Siegel, Milton Feldman, Richard L. Rawlings', 'Gene L. Coon', 'Lee Marvin, Angie Dickinson, John Cassavetes, Clu Gulager, Claude Akins, Norman Fell, Ronald Reagan, Virginia Christine', null, 'A hit man and his partner try to find out why their latest victim, a former race-car driver, did not try to get away.', 'A hit man and his partner try to find out why their latest victim, a former race-car driver, did not try to get away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IeXjRmUZ2pnSFMRh0ZXpu3Nkmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24229'),
  ('998205558147801173', 'The Killing Fields', 1984, 'Drama, History, War', 'Chris Menges, Roland Joffé, Martin Atkinson', 'Bruce Robinson', 'Sam Waterston, Haing S. Ngor, John Malkovich, Julian Sands, Craig T. Nelson, Spalding Gray, Bill Paterson, Athol Fugard', 'R', 'New York Times reporter Sydney Schanberg is on assignment covering the Cambodian Civil War, with the help of local interpreter Dith Pran and American photojournalist Al Rockoff. When the U.S. Army pulls out amid escalating violence, Schanberg makes exit arrangements for Pran and his family. Pran, however, tells Schanberg he intends to stay in Cambodia to help cover the unfolding story — a decision he may regret as the Khmer Rouge rebels move in.', 'New York Times reporter Sydney Schanberg is on assignment covering the Cambodian Civil War, with the help of local interpreter Dith Pran and American photojournalist Al Rockoff. When the U.S. Army pulls out amid escalating violence, Schanberg makes exit arrangements for Pran and his family. Pran, however, tells Schanberg he intends to stay in Cambodia to help cover the unfolding story — a decision he may regret as the Khmer Rouge rebels move in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cX6Bv7natnZwQjsV9bLL8mmWjkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625'),
  ('1015582251162942067', 'The Killing Floor', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Martina Radwan, Chris Carroll, Nicholas R. Bell', null, 'Marc Blucas, Shiri Appleby, Reiko Aylesworth, Joel Leffert, Jeffrey Carlson, Bethany Butler, Andrew Weems, Allison McAtee', null, 'A literary agent moves into a penthouse apartment. Soon after the move, he receives crime scene photographs that seem to have taken place in his new apartment. Next he receives a series of stalker videotapes that document his every move.', 'A literary agent moves into a penthouse apartment. Soon after the move, he receives crime scene photographs that seem to have taken place in his new apartment. Next he receives a series of stalker videotapes that document his every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mq7X4O63QKoL69gR80eyrPvSsop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9898'),
  ('371143844452889653', 'The Killing Game', 1967, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Alain Jessua, Vincent Gardair, Alain Le Botmel', 'Alain Jessua', 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Claudine Auger, Michel Duchaussoy, Eléonore Hirt, Guy Saint-Jean, Anna Gaylor, Nancy Holloway, Régine', null, 'Two cartoonists meet a playboy who lives out the fantasies created in their cartoons. He hires them to create a new comic strip. As they work on the new strip, the playboy begins to live it out. Unfortunately, the new strip deals with murder.', 'Two cartoonists meet a playboy who lives out the fantasies created in their cartoons. He hires them to create a new comic strip. As they work on the new strip, the playboy begins to live it out. Unfortunately, the new strip deals with murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbyaemesm1y4Q0c4mI6EEf4vVXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78815'),
  ('1051687030962675935', 'The Killing Game', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tōru Murakawa, Yōichi Sai, Seizō Sengen', 'Koji Harima, Susumu Saji', 'Yūsaku Matsuda, Yutaka Nakajima, Gajirō Satō, Kai Ato, Hitoshi Ōmae, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Kahori Takeda, Daisuke Kuwabara', null, 'The second movie of Tôru Murakawa''s "Game" trilogy. After making a sensational hit, a hitman has gone into hiding for five years. When he comes back he bumps into two women that he has spared five years ago. Two rival yakuza bosses hire Narumi to kill the other. Will Narumi''s sense of chivalry entrap him again?', 'The second movie of Tôru Murakawa''s "Game" trilogy. After making a sensational hit, a hitman has gone into hiding for five years. When he comes back he bumps into two women that he has spared five years ago. Two rival yakuza bosses hire Narumi to kill the other. Will Narumi''s sense of chivalry entrap him again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udJTXLR8Ejuy8Si0cBbGJEP24yC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344553'),
  ('69442476282881910', 'The Killing Jar', 2010, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mark Young', 'Mark Young', 'Amber Benson, Michael Madsen, Harold Perrineau, Kevin Gage, Lew Temple, Jake Busey, Danny Trejo, Lindsey Axelsson', null, 'A stranger armed with a shotgun takes seven patrons hostage in a remote roadside diner. But as the body count increases, the desperate survivors discover that one of the hostages may be even more dangerous than their captor.', 'A stranger armed with a shotgun takes seven patrons hostage in a remote roadside diner. But as the body count increases, the desperate survivors discover that one of the hostages may be even more dangerous than their captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLVr18muLwkSyrq4YL2M9WG6tHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43754'),
  ('977441157296963955', 'The Killing Kind', 1974, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Curtis Harrington, Mario Tosi', 'Tony Crechales, George Edwards', 'Ann Sothern, John Savage, Luana Anders, Ruth Roman, Cindy Williams, Sue Bernard, Marjorie Eaton, Peter Brocco', 'R', 'A twisted ex-convict moves into his mother''s boardinghouse.', 'A twisted ex-convict moves into his mother''s boardinghouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ignhpS8k64YJEOMbOJOGFAkSOrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47678'),
  ('347105094338877235', 'The Killing Machine', 1995, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'David Mitchell, David Pelletier', 'David Mitchell', 'Jeff Wincott, Michael Ironside, Terri Hawkes, Calista Carradine, Richard Fitzpatrick, Jeff Pustil, Michael Copeman, David Bolt', 'R', 'Harlin Garret loses his memory and finds himself closed in a facility claimed to belong to the state security services. The manager of this place tells Garrett he used to be a killer for the mob but Garrett refuses to believe. Then he is forced to kill people that are a "Risk to the state security", but the whole story gets complicated when Garret falls in love with one of his victims...', 'Harlin Garret loses his memory and finds himself closed in a facility claimed to belong to the state security services. The manager of this place tells Garrett he used to be a killer for the mob but Garrett refuses to believe. Then he is forced to kill people that are a "Risk to the state security", but the whole story gets complicated when Garret falls in love with one of his victims...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5jTUSPP29WN2jGrPJXImfxMXk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145081'),
  ('210978333576316085', 'The Killing of a Chinese Bookie', 1976, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'John Cassavetes, Mitch Breit, Al Ruban', 'John Cassavetes', 'Ben Gazzara, Timothy Carey, Seymour Cassel, Robert Phillips, Morgan Woodward, Al Ruban, Azizi Johari, Haji', 'R', 'Cosmo Vittelli, the proprietor of a sleazy, low-rent Hollywood cabaret, has a real affection for the women who strip in his peepshows and the staff who keep up his dingy establishment. He also has a major gambling problem that has gotten him in trouble before. When Cosmo loses big-time at an underground casino run by mobster Mort, he isn''t able to pay up. Mort then offers Cosmo the chance to pay back his debt by knocking off a pesky, Mafia-protected bookie.', 'Cosmo Vittelli, the proprietor of a sleazy, low-rent Hollywood cabaret, has a real affection for the women who strip in his peepshows and the staff who keep up his dingy establishment. He also has a major gambling problem that has gotten him in trouble before. When Cosmo loses big-time at an underground casino run by mobster Mort, he isn''t able to pay up. Mort then offers Cosmo the chance to pay back his debt by knocking off a pesky, Mafia-protected bookie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lShPFOAbQ6y6oFYUfecmrj7BUu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32040'),
  ('446209845732963491', 'The Killing of a Sacred Deer', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Thimios Bakatakis, Atilla Salih Yücer', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Efthimis Filippou', 'Colin Farrell, Nicole Kidman, Barry Keoghan, Raffey Cassidy, Sunny Suljic, Bill Camp, Alicia Silverstone, Herb Caillouet', 'R', 'Dr. Steven Murphy is a renowned cardiovascular surgeon who presides over a spotless household with his wife and two children. Lurking at the margins of his idyllic suburban existence is Martin, a fatherless teen who insinuates himself into the doctor''s life in gradually unsettling ways.', 'Dr. Steven Murphy is a renowned cardiovascular surgeon who presides over a spotless household with his wife and two children. Lurking at the margins of his idyllic suburban existence is Martin, a fatherless teen who insinuates himself into the doctor''s life in gradually unsettling ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4DGlsc9g0h5AyoyvvAuIRnofN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399057'),
  ('831005997096302869', 'The Killing of America', 1981, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Sheldon Renan, Peter Smokler, Robert Charlton', 'Leonard Schrader, Chieko Schrader', 'Chuck Riley, Ed Dorris, Thomas Noguchi, Sirhan Sirhan, Wayne Henley, Ed Kemper, Susan Atkins, David Berkowitz', 'R', 'A documentary of the decline of America, composed of archival material and exclusive footage, carnage, madness, and mayhem with an unapologetic sincerity on the factual depiction of violence in the industrialized nation of the United States. Featuring a juxtaposition of detailed accounts of terrible acts, brutal behavior, and interviews from experts and convicted killers alike.', 'A documentary of the decline of America, composed of archival material and exclusive footage, carnage, madness, and mayhem with an unapologetic sincerity on the factual depiction of violence in the industrialized nation of the United States. Featuring a juxtaposition of detailed accounts of terrible acts, brutal behavior, and interviews from experts and convicted killers alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVc7VKfZqxrJhNvIvXxX6DuT6lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95006'),
  ('1145614623424822350', 'The Killing of an Egg', 1977, 'Animation', 'Paul Driessen', 'Paul Driessen', 'Peter Bierman', null, 'This animated short film is about a guy who is about to eat a soft-boiled egg. As he''s cracking the egg, he can hear a voice coming from within--telling him to STOP! Every time he hits the egg, someone from within the egg yells at him.', 'This animated short film is about a guy who is about to eat a soft-boiled egg. As he''s cracking the egg, he can hear a voice coming from within--telling him to STOP! Every time he hits the egg, someone from within the egg yells at him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sytgNhEQwXfrBBXgD0NQIBtv5qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48269'),
  ('915831143598883244', 'The Killing of John Lennon', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', 'Andrew Piddington, Nick Justin, Roger Eaton', 'Andrew Piddington', 'Jonas Ball, Joe Abbate, Gail Kay Bell, J. Francis Curley, Nicole Delorey, Sofia Dubrawsky, Krisha Fairchild, Vera Felice', null, 'The film follows the travels and accounts of Mark Chapman (Jonas Ball) and gives the watcher an insight into his mind. It starts with him in Hawaii and how he does not fit in with anyone including his job; family; friends etc. He says he is searching for a purpose in his life and that it has no direction. He seeks refuge in the public library where he finds the book, ''The Catcher in the Rye''. He becomes obsessed with the book and believes that he himself is the protaganist in the book, Holden Caulfield. He believes the ideas in the book reflect his own personal life and how he does not fit in anywhere and he reads it constantly. He then finds another book in the library about The Beatles singer John Lennon and begins a personal hatred for him.', 'The film follows the travels and accounts of Mark Chapman (Jonas Ball) and gives the watcher an insight into his mind. It starts with him in Hawaii and how he does not fit in with anyone including his job; family; friends etc. He says he is searching for a purpose in his life and that it has no direction. He seeks refuge in the public library where he finds the book, ''The Catcher in the Rye''. He becomes obsessed with the book and believes that he himself is the protaganist in the book, Holden Caulfield. He believes the ideas in the book reflect his own personal life and how he does not fit in anywhere and he reads it constantly. He then finds another book in the library about The Beatles singer John Lennon and begins a personal hatred for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gV15wMko8RJ5o4O8uQpvBO2mx1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44054'),
  ('849307050530639131', 'The Killing of Kenneth Chamberlain', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Camrin Petramale, Moira Begale, Jason Nimako-Boateng', 'David Midell', 'Frankie Faison, Enrico Natale, Ben Marten, Angela Peel, Tom McElroy, LaRoyce Hawkins, Christopher R Ellis, Anika Noni Rose', null, 'Based on the true story of the events that led to the death of Kenneth Chamberlain Sr., an elderly African American veteran with bipolar disorder, who was killed during a conflict with police officers who were dispatched to check on him.', 'Based on the true story of the events that led to the death of Kenneth Chamberlain Sr., an elderly African American veteran with bipolar disorder, who was killed during a conflict with police officers who were dispatched to check on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b3Ge0P70fEMiV7nRzyaaIaqO4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647557'),
  ('876916766493482838', 'The Killing of Satan', 1983, 'Horror, Action', 'Efren C. Piñon', 'Joe Mari Avellana', 'Ramon Revilla Sr., Elizabeth Oropesa, George Estregan, Paquito Diaz, Cecille Castillo, Charlie Davao', null, 'A Filipino-made horror-fantasy movie about a man who is chosen by his dead uncle to battle the forces of evil. He fights a being called "The Prince of Magic," who shoots rays from his hands, makes heads spin around and hypnotizes people. He finally faces Satan himself and engages him in a battle of magic', 'A Filipino-made horror-fantasy movie about a man who is chosen by his dead uncle to battle the forces of evil. He fights a being called "The Prince of Magic," who shoots rays from his hands, makes heads spin around and hypnotizes people. He finally faces Satan himself and engages him in a battle of magic', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfxit02xQ1DzH7ZBqabk7Y6Stu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74829'),
  ('134195360048658496', 'The Killing of Sister George', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Lukas Heller', 'Beryl Reid, Susannah York, Coral Browne, Ronald Fraser, Patricia Medina, Hugh Paddick, Cyril Delevanti, William Beckley', 'R', 'When June Buckridge arrives at her London flat and announces ''They are going to murder me'', her long-time lover and doll-cuddling flat mate Alice ''Childie'' McNaught realizes that things are going to change. For June is referring to her character ''Sister George'', a lovable nurse she portrays in a popular daytime serial. To make matters worse, the widowed executive at the BBC responsible for the decision to kill off Sister George - Mercy Croft is also a predatory lesbian who is after Childie and will stop at nothing to get what she wants.', 'When June Buckridge arrives at her London flat and announces ''They are going to murder me'', her long-time lover and doll-cuddling flat mate Alice ''Childie'' McNaught realizes that things are going to change. For June is referring to her character ''Sister George'', a lovable nurse she portrays in a popular daytime serial. To make matters worse, the widowed executive at the BBC responsible for the decision to kill off Sister George - Mercy Croft is also a predatory lesbian who is after Childie and will stop at nothing to get what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9Cyc6mde7pthv7M2xvk3wmfAHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54575'),
  ('413626239430158788', 'The Killing of Two Lovers', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Machoian, Oscar Ignacio Jiménez', 'Robert Machoian', 'Clayne Crawford, Sepideh Moafi, Chris Coy, Avery Pizzuto, Arri Graham, Ezra Graham, Jonah Graham, Bruce Graham', 'R', 'In a rural Utah town, David, a father of four, grapples with his separation from wife Nikki as she pursues a new relationship.', 'In a rural Utah town, David, a father of four, grapples with his separation from wife Nikki as she pursues a new relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y3EmEl00UjmFvu2jP67JK0At2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653712'),
  ('3847549366225001', 'The Killing Room', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jonathan Liebesman, Lukas Ettlin, Seth Hansen', 'Ann Peacock, Gus Krieger', 'Nick Cannon, Timothy Hutton, Shea Whigham, Chloë Sevigny, Peter Stormare, Clea DuVall, Bill Stinchcomb, Meade Patton', 'R', 'Four volunteers sign up for what initially appears to be a typical paid research study, only to discover that they''ve unwittingly become involved with a classified government program that was said to have been terminated nearly two decades ago.', 'Four volunteers sign up for what initially appears to be a typical paid research study, only to discover that they''ve unwittingly become involved with a classified government program that was said to have been terminated nearly two decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntBo3n4sz2T0JwTJX3GGZ2d2bfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20777'),
  ('108088936572503130', 'The Killing Secret', 1997, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Noel Nosseck, Paul Maibaum, Robert Sonntag', 'Rob Fresco', 'Ari Meyers, Soleil Moon Frye, Tess Harper, Mark Kassen, John O''Hurley, Cindy Pickett, Erika Flores, Todd Rulapaugh', 'PG', 'A pregnant teen is murdered and a popular high-school senior is suspected. But will his girlfriend stick by him to prove his innocence despite the fact she has bonded with the victim''s mother?', 'A pregnant teen is murdered and a popular high-school senior is suspected. But will his girlfriend stick by him to prove his innocence despite the fact she has bonded with the victim''s mother?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0wJwqO7y4evwOfAkxual25QO0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47691'),
  ('704867394239538263', 'The Killing Time', 1987, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Rick King, Paul Goldsmith, Curtis Collins', 'Don Bohlinger, Bruce Franklin Singer, James Nathan', 'Beau Bridges, Kiefer Sutherland, Wayne Rogers, Camelia Kath, Joe Don Baker, Janet Carroll, Gracie Harrison, Harvey Vernon', 'R', 'After a psychopath murders a man who was on his way to a job as a deputy sheriff in a small California town, he assumes the deputy''s identity and arrives in town to start his new ''job''. What he doesn''t know is that the recently appointed sheriff and his mistress are plotting to murder her evil husband—and blame it on the new deputy.', 'After a psychopath murders a man who was on his way to a job as a deputy sheriff in a small California town, he assumes the deputy''s identity and arrives in town to start his new ''job''. What he doesn''t know is that the recently appointed sheriff and his mistress are plotting to murder her evil husband—and blame it on the new deputy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qeMJxptbXVDuCQeGkomZmEMw76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32039'),
  ('66659905798836184', 'The Killing Tree', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Rhys Frake-Waterfield, Vince Knight', 'Craig McLearie', 'Sarah Alexandra Marks, Marcus Massey, Judy Tcherniak, Sarah T. Cohen, Kelly Rian Sanson, Ella Starbuck, Lauren Staerck, May Kelly', null, 'On Christmas Eve, a scorned widow casts an ancient spell to resurrect her executed husband. However, when the spell goes wrong, the husband is brought back as an Evil Christmas Tree. Hell-bent on getting revenge on the one who caused his execution, the body count keeps rising as the Tree hunts her down.', 'On Christmas Eve, a scorned widow casts an ancient spell to resurrect her executed husband. However, when the spell goes wrong, the husband is brought back as an Evil Christmas Tree. Hell-bent on getting revenge on the one who caused his execution, the body count keeps rising as the Tree hunts her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqEg5vYEO92wMzhKgBvBD913fK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980128'),
  ('886318135081537138', 'The Killing Zone', 1991, 'Action', 'Addison Randall, Cole S. McKay, Steve Rockmael', 'Addison Randall', 'Deron McBee, Armando Silvestre, James Dalesandro, Agustín Bernal, Melissa Moore, Sydne Squire, Deborah Dare, Quentin Gutierrez', null, 'Convict is recruited from a chain gang to help capture a Mexican drug lord.', 'Convict is recruited from a chain gang to help capture a Mexican drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZe6VU6BiBm6mFzxrKt0xlvOzmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271144'),
  ('570727599465551584', 'The Killings at Outpost Zeta', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Emenegger, Allan Sandler, José Louis Mignone', 'Peter Dawson', 'Gordon Devol, Jacqueline Ray, Jackson Bostwick, Stan Wojno, Hildy Brooks, Judith Doty, Barbara Minkus, Robert Emenegger', null, 'A team of men and women investigate the mysterious deaths of two previous expeditions to a strategically important but barren world.', 'A team of men and women investigate the mysterious deaths of two previous expeditions to a strategically important but barren world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJtKDaDrlY7alViS1swsuHHyw5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143777'),
  ('116040413655372569', 'The Kindergarten Teacher', 2018, 'Drama', 'Sara Colangelo, Pepe Avila del Pino', 'Nadav Lapid', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal, Parker Sevak, Gael García Bernal, Michael Chernus, Rosa Salazar, Ajay Naidu, Anna Baryshnikov, Daisy Tahan', 'R', 'Lisa Spinelli is a Staten Island teacher who is unusually devoted to her students. When she discovers one of her five-year-olds is a prodigy, she becomes fascinated with the boy, ultimately risking her family and freedom to nurture his talent.', 'Lisa Spinelli is a Staten Island teacher who is unusually devoted to her students. When she discovers one of her five-year-olds is a prodigy, she becomes fascinated with the boy, ultimately risking her family and freedom to nurture his talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwavkdZb2xNRh5Y9MHhkZJ2UaHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489927'),
  ('265824143335019882', 'The Kindness of Strangers', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sebastian Blenkov, Lone Scherfig', 'Lone Scherfig', 'Zoe Kazan, Andrea Riseborough, Tahar Rahim, Caleb Landry Jones, Jay Baruchel, Bill Nighy, David Dencik, Jack Fulton', null, 'Clara and her two sons escape from her abusive husband with little more than their car and plan to start over in New York. After the car towed away, the family meets Alice, who gets them into an emergency shelter. While stealing food at a Russian restaurant called ‘Winter Palace’, Clara meets Marc, who has been given the chance to help the old eatery regain its former glory. The ‘Winter Palace’ soon becomes a place of unexpected encounters between people who are all undergoing some sort of crisis and whom fate has now brought together.', 'Clara and her two sons escape from her abusive husband with little more than their car and plan to start over in New York. After the car towed away, the family meets Alice, who gets them into an emergency shelter. While stealing food at a Russian restaurant called ‘Winter Palace’, Clara meets Marc, who has been given the chance to help the old eatery regain its former glory. The ‘Winter Palace’ soon becomes a place of unexpected encounters between people who are all undergoing some sort of crisis and whom fate has now brought together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E9CB9YdhBl2q9tMqqXfKgf9hyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520390'),
  ('186455157272045610', 'The Kindred', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jeffrey Obrow, Stephen Carpenter, Stephen Carpenter', 'John Penney, Joseph Stefano, Stephen Carpenter', 'David Allen Brooks, Rod Steiger, Amanda Pays, Talia Balsam, Kim Hunter, Timothy Gibbs, Peter Frechette, Julia Montgomery', 'R', 'Amanda''s deathbed request to her son, John, was for him to destroy all the lab notes etc. from her last experiment. She also blurts out he had a brother. At the funeral John meets Melissa, who claims to be his mother''s biggest fan. Together with some of John''s friends they go to Amanda''s house, but none are prepared for what they find there.', 'Amanda''s deathbed request to her son, John, was for him to destroy all the lab notes etc. from her last experiment. She also blurts out he had a brother. At the funeral John meets Melissa, who claims to be his mother''s biggest fan. Together with some of John''s friends they go to Amanda''s house, but none are prepared for what they find there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDMUr5IQWAwUpFZFFxltLuAIb7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48660'),
  ('154732203984431854', 'The Kindred', 2021, 'Horror', 'Jamie Patterson, Jonay Sevillano Regalado', 'Christian J. Hearn', 'April Pearson, Blake Harrison, James Cosmo, Samantha Bond, Steve Oram, Robbie Gee, James Dreyfus, Patrick Bergin', null, 'After her father’s suicide, a young mother investigates what led to his death. But when she is haunted by spirits and unearths an unsolved mystery from 30 years ago, she discovers a dark family history that could prove deadly for her child.', 'After her father’s suicide, a young mother investigates what led to his death. But when she is haunted by spirits and unearths an unsolved mystery from 30 years ago, she discovers a dark family history that could prove deadly for her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99PE8haWB7nLky627wJBsWn2awJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854188'),
  ('39411897403282372', 'The Kinematograph', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', 'Tomek Bagiński', 'Mateusz Skutnik, Tomek Bagiński', 'Tim Everett, Melanie O''Connell, Maxim Baldry, Ben Bishop, Annika Boecker', null, 'A 19th-century inventor is close to perfecting motion pictures but doesn''t want to reveal his invention to the public until he can show films with sound and color.', 'A 19th-century inventor is close to perfecting motion pictures but doesn''t want to reveal his invention to the public until he can show films with sound and color.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i4xXK71FWjyE92QPZJwsASbJNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145051'),
  ('1020037072717497420', 'The King', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ravi K. Chandran, Shaji Kailas', 'Renji Panicker', 'Mammootty, Murali, Vani Viswanath, K. B. Ganesh Kumar, Vijayaraghavan, Kollam Thulasi, Devan, Kuthiravattam Pappu', null, 'The King is a 1995 Malayalam action thriller film. Directed by Shaji Kailas and written by Renji Panicker with Mammootty in the title role as district collector.', 'The King is a 1995 Malayalam action thriller film. Directed by Shaji Kailas and written by Renji Panicker with Mammootty in the title role as district collector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2y2whF3xMXOr2xmxWI3lJB5LfXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237728'),
  ('368827432193338681', 'The King', 2002, 'Drama', 'Nikos Grammatikos', 'Nikos Grammatikos, Nikos Panayotopoulos', 'Vangelis Mourikis, Marilita Lambropoulou, Minas Hatzisavvas, Babis Giotopoulos, Vivi Koka, Tasos Nousias, Evangelia Adreadaki, Kostas Kalokairinos', null, 'A 35-year old man, just released from jail, decides to make a clean break from the big city and his troubled past. He retreats to the abandoned village his father came from and moves into an old, collapsing house. Alone, far from the bigger village and doing petty jobs to survive, he will strive to find himself once more. Amidst a haze of suspicion and scorn by villagers who treat him an intruder, his past catches up to him in the form of his girlfriend from Athens. Conflict is inescapable', 'A 35-year old man, just released from jail, decides to make a clean break from the big city and his troubled past. He retreats to the abandoned village his father came from and moves into an old, collapsing house. Alone, far from the bigger village and doing petty jobs to survive, he will strive to find himself once more. Amidst a haze of suspicion and scorn by villagers who treat him an intruder, his past catches up to him in the form of his girlfriend from Athens. Conflict is inescapable', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZhd0CFnpqUx4jCFNf0ilpZuN00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237506'),
  ('104771926590440656', 'The King', 2006, 'Drama', 'James Marsh, Eigil Bryld', 'James Marsh, Milo Addica', 'Gael García Bernal, William Hurt, Pell James, Paul Dano, Laura Harring, Derek Alvarado, Monica Peña, Milo Addica', 'R', 'When Elvis Valderez is honourably discharge from the Navy, he heads to the small town of Corpus Christi in Texas. There he introduces himself to Pastor David Sandow, his long-lost father, soon becoming a stalwart member of the church.', 'When Elvis Valderez is honourably discharge from the Navy, he heads to the small town of Corpus Christi in Texas. There he introduces himself to Pastor David Sandow, his long-lost father, soon becoming a stalwart member of the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/936i1LOZJARcpCh3sdBch7wBXBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20021'),
  ('717932774525298032', 'The King', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Giovanni Columbu', 'Giovanni Columbu, Michele Columbu', 'Pietrina Mennea, Antonio Forma, Luca Todde', null, 'Transposing the story of the Passion of Jesus to Sardinia, Su Re draws for the very first time on the four gospels of Matthew, Mark, Luke and John together. Giovanni Columbu''s distinct view is shot in a landscape unaffected by modernity and played out by an amateur cast, offering still new insights into the life of Christ.', 'Transposing the story of the Passion of Jesus to Sardinia, Su Re draws for the very first time on the four gospels of Matthew, Mark, Luke and John together. Giovanni Columbu''s distinct view is shot in a landscape unaffected by modernity and played out by an amateur cast, offering still new insights into the life of Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ibffwHQMJCNeNHvfqKQj0OhMmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158954'),
  ('645916733717181635', 'The King', 2017, 'Crime, Action', 'Han Jae-rim, Kim Jun-su, Lee Tae-sung', 'Han Jae-rim', 'Zo In-sung, Jung Woo-sung, Bae Sung-woo, Kim A-joong, Ryu Jun-yeol, Kim Eui-sung, Jung Eun-chae, Kim So-jin', null, 'A young Korean man surpasses his difficult childhood by becoming a powerful prosecutor, but soon learns that real power comes at a price.', 'A young Korean man surpasses his difficult childhood by becoming a powerful prosecutor, but soon learns that real power comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97UeWeCYcK9gkiZLPNJIj0JDRFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434724'),
  ('414086087346686835', 'The King', 2019, 'Drama, History, War', 'David Michôd, Adam Arkapaw, Steve E. Andrews', 'David Michôd, Joel Edgerton', 'Timothée Chalamet, Joel Edgerton, Sean Harris, Tom Glynn-Carney, Lily-Rose Depp, Thomasin McKenzie, Robert Pattinson, Ben Mendelsohn', 'R', 'England, 15th century. Hal, a capricious prince who lives among the populace far from court, is forced by circumstances to reluctantly accept the throne and become Henry V.', 'England, 15th century. Hal, a capricious prince who lives among the populace far from court, is forced by circumstances to reluctantly accept the throne and become Henry V.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u0QBGUbZcBW59VEAdmeFl9g98N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504949'),
  ('142109725185945418', 'The King and Four Queens', 1956, 'Western, Comedy, Mystery, Adventure', 'Raoul Walsh, Tom Connors Jr., Lucien Ballard', 'Margaret Fitts, Richard Alan Simmons', 'Clark Gable, Eleanor Parker, Jean Willes, Jo Van Fleet, Barbara Nichols, Sara Shane, Roy Roberts, Arthur Shields', 'NR', 'Opportunistic con man Dan Kehoe ingratiates himself with the cantankerous mother of four outlaws and their beautiful widows in order to find their hidden gold.', 'Opportunistic con man Dan Kehoe ingratiates himself with the cantankerous mother of four outlaws and their beautiful widows in order to find their hidden gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6lTWootXbnAH0HwPcEkShId9jH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43310'),
  ('441734173580410668', 'The King and I', 1956, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy, Eli Dunn', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Deborah Kerr, Yul Brynner, Rita Moreno, Martin Benson, Terry Saunders, Rex Thompson, Patrick Adiarte, Alan Mowbray', 'G', 'Widowed Welsh mother Anna Leonowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.', 'Widowed Welsh mother Anna Leonowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUfaP0lLaMpZzp5CrHyII5Vd7cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16520'),
  ('913658036508351202', 'The King and I', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Music, Romance', 'Richard Rich', 'Peter Bakalian, Jacqueline Feather, David Seidler', 'Miranda Richardson, Martin Vidnovic, Ian Richardson, Darrell Hammond, Christiane Noll, Adam Wylie, Sean Smith, Kenny Baker', 'G', 'Widowed Welsh mother Anna Loenowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.', 'Widowed Welsh mother Anna Loenowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbEA2LEFh1MX9EraNQSiq9ajs24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47288'),
  ('543545800521471317', 'The King and the Clown', 2005, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'An Tae-jin, Lee Joon-ik, Han Ki-eop', 'Choi Seok-hwan', 'Kam Woo-sung, Lee Joon-gi, Jung Jin-young, Kang Sung-yeon, Yoo Hai-jin, Jang Hang-seon, Jeong Seok-yong, Lee Seung-hun', null, 'Two clowns living in Korea''s Chosun Dynasty get arrested for staging a play that satirizes the king. They are dragged to the palace and threatened with execution but are given a chance to save their lives if they can make the king laugh.', 'Two clowns living in Korea''s Chosun Dynasty get arrested for staging a play that satirizes the king. They are dragged to the palace and threatened with execution but are given a chance to save their lives if they can make the king laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilNM1LndM1ybOid2wYd2FhjsKIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45035'),
  ('664675947972745936', 'The King and the Jester', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'French short about King Francis I and his jester Triboulet, who form the basis for Hugo''s play Le roi s''amuse (and Verdi''s opera Rigoletto).', 'French short about King Francis I and his jester Triboulet, who form the basis for Hugo''s play Le roi s''amuse (and Verdi''s opera Rigoletto).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYB83MjfvOSqJc4Vq57aEP9wcpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196592'),
  ('734699520614306591', 'The King and the Trapalhões', 1979, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Adriano Stuart', 'Victor Lustosa', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Mário Cardoso, Heloísa Millet, Carlos Kurt, Felipe Levy', null, 'In a city of the East, the throne of the young king Amad is usurped by the evil Vizir Jafar. The king is imprisoned, and in prison he meets the famous thieves of the kingdom: Abdul, Abel, Abol and Abil. With the help of these thieves, the king flees and, during the escape, knows the princess Alina, by which he falls passionately in love. The Vizir possesses magical powers, faced by the heroes with the help of the genie of a lamp found by Abdul. With the help of the genius, the four friends are transported to the twentieth century, where they cause much confusion and end up being arrested.', 'In a city of the East, the throne of the young king Amad is usurped by the evil Vizir Jafar. The king is imprisoned, and in prison he meets the famous thieves of the kingdom: Abdul, Abel, Abol and Abil. With the help of these thieves, the king flees and, during the escape, knows the princess Alina, by which he falls passionately in love. The Vizir possesses magical powers, faced by the heroes with the help of the genie of a lamp found by Abdul. With the help of the genius, the four friends are transported to the twentieth century, where they cause much confusion and end up being arrested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yONCqje3LpI0oYob9pxg758C2d7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303651'),
  ('44943328802362217', 'The King Is Alive', 2000, 'Drama', 'Kristian Levring, Jens Schlosser', 'Kristian Levring, Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Romane Bohringer, David Calder, Jennifer Jason Leigh, David Bradley, Brion James, Miles Anderson, Bruce Davison, Janet McTeer', 'R', 'Stranded in the heat of a barren African desert, eleven bus-passengers shelter in the remnants of an abandoned town. As rescue grows more remote by the day and anxiety deepens, an idea emerges: why not stage a play. However the choice of King Lear only manages to plunge this disparate group of travelers into turmoil as they struggle to overcome both nature''s wrath and their own morality.', 'Stranded in the heat of a barren African desert, eleven bus-passengers shelter in the remnants of an abandoned town. As rescue grows more remote by the day and anxiety deepens, an idea emerges: why not stage a play. However the choice of King Lear only manages to plunge this disparate group of travelers into turmoil as they struggle to overcome both nature''s wrath and their own morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktnT4AsCy2tG3lld3DDdiLPzT3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10613'),
  ('916166949549814032', 'The King Is Dancing', 2000, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Gérard Corbiau, Gérard Simon', 'Gérard Corbiau, Ève de Castro, Andrée Corbiau', 'Benoît Magimel, Boris Terral, Tchéky Karyo, Colette Emmanuelle, Cécile Bois, Claire Keim, Johan Leysen, Idwig Stephane', null, 'Louis XIV, the French sun-king has two passions, establishing absolute rule over the realm -after decades of religious/civil wars- by divine right and artistic brilliancy as a dancer', 'Louis XIV, the French sun-king has two passions, establishing absolute rule over the realm -after decades of religious/civil wars- by divine right and artistic brilliancy as a dancer', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGsB3KkqSezLo66alEC16FSWn3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44947'),
  ('45326202751917524', 'The King Maker', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Lek Kitaparaporn, Jiradech Samniangsanor', 'Sean Casey', 'Gary Stretch, John Rhys-Davies, Cindy Sirinya Bishop, Dom Hetrakul, Nirut Sirijanya, Yoe Hassadeevichit, Dean Alexandrou, Akara Amarttayakul', 'R', '1547. Fernando de Gama, a young "Soldier of Fortune" from Portugal, set sail for the Orient in an effort to find a man who murdered his father and, with luck, like many of their compatriots, to make his fortune. A vicious storm in the Indian Ocean almost ended his plans when he was on the ship sank. The sole survivor, he was washed up on a tropical beach only to be captured by Arab slavers and taken to Ayutthaya in the kingdom of Siam, where he was offered for sale as a slave.', '1547. Fernando de Gama, a young "Soldier of Fortune" from Portugal, set sail for the Orient in an effort to find a man who murdered his father and, with luck, like many of their compatriots, to make his fortune. A vicious storm in the Indian Ocean almost ended his plans when he was on the ship sank. The sole survivor, he was washed up on a tropical beach only to be captured by Arab slavers and taken to Ayutthaya in the kingdom of Siam, where he was offered for sale as a slave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apCrFv2DJKvrKHsP2HeKmgIQiG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26684'),
  ('777194245593916767', 'The King of Algiers', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elias Belkeddar, André Chemetoff', 'Thomas Bidegain', 'Reda Kateb, Benoît Magimel, Meriem Amiar, Haroun Attalah, Amani Bentarki, Maria Bentoumi, Bilel Bouzidi, Zina Bouzid', null, 'Omar, better known as Omar the Strawberry, is an old-fashioned bandit. Forced to flee to Algeria, he makes a living out of petty crime, accompanied by his famous sidekick Roger. After decades of ruling the French criminal underworld, they must come to terms with their new life together, which until now has been one of debauchery and violence.', 'Omar, better known as Omar the Strawberry, is an old-fashioned bandit. Forced to flee to Algeria, he makes a living out of petty crime, accompanied by his famous sidekick Roger. After decades of ruling the French criminal underworld, they must come to terms with their new life together, which until now has been one of debauchery and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPYhy4sRlZnyqe9lb6Dh5uunh0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995767'),
  ('836155810942215865', 'The King of Boxers', 1972, 'Action', 'Kung Min', null, 'Meng Fei, Yasuaki Kurata, Nard Poowanai, Maggie Lee, Pawana Chanajit, Wong Ching, Lau Kong, Yuen Shun-Yi', null, 'A King Boxer named Chow (Meng Fei) visits a friend in Thailand. She introduces him to her boyfriend, who''s a Thai boxer. Chow saves the Thai boxer from some thugs and the two become friends. Chow teaches him the knife style. Meanwhile back in China, Chow''s brother and sister look after his kung fu school. A Japanese martial artist (Kurata) visits the school looking for Chow. Kurata fights and beats his brother instead and develops strong liking for Chow''s sister. Chow returns to China and has to defend his school''s honor against Kurata.', 'A King Boxer named Chow (Meng Fei) visits a friend in Thailand. She introduces him to her boyfriend, who''s a Thai boxer. Chow saves the Thai boxer from some thugs and the two become friends. Chow teaches him the knife style. Meanwhile back in China, Chow''s brother and sister look after his kung fu school. A Japanese martial artist (Kurata) visits the school looking for Chow. Kurata fights and beats his brother instead and develops strong liking for Chow''s sister. Chow returns to China and has to defend his school''s honor against Kurata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o53KXHyQNeS70yRNEGf6elC1196.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88029'),
  ('998462588334788492', 'The King of Escape', 2009, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Alain Guiraudie', 'Alain Guiraudie, Laurent Lunetta, Frédérique Moreau', 'Hafsia Herzi, Ludovic Berthillot, Luc Palun, Pascal Aubert, Jean Toscane, François Clavier, Pierre Laur, Georges Vaur', null, '43-year-old Armand Lacourtade, a man who sells farm machines in the country, is getting sick of his homosexual life. When he encounters a young girl called Curly, he changes sides. Chased by her parents and the police, they brave all dangers to live this forbidden love and become an odd couple. But is it really what Armand dreamed about?', '43-year-old Armand Lacourtade, a man who sells farm machines in the country, is getting sick of his homosexual life. When he encounters a young girl called Curly, he changes sides. Chased by her parents and the police, they brave all dangers to live this forbidden love and become an odd couple. But is it really what Armand dreamed about?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ9QTedkbBUR5HkwVVcmulTfJUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43616'),
  ('720952606942390056', 'The King of Fighters', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Gordon Chan, David Leitch, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Rita Augustine, Matthew Ryan Fischer, Chris Chow', 'Monique Ganderton, Maggie Q, Sean Faris, Ray Park, Will Yun Lee, David Leitch, Françoise Yip, Hiro Kanagawa', 'NR', 'The surviving members of three legendary fighting clans are whisked away to other dimensions by an evil power. As the fighters enter each new world, they battle that universe''s native defenders, while the force that summoned them seeks to find a way to invade and infect our world.', 'The surviving members of three legendary fighting clans are whisked away to other dimensions by an evil power. As the fighters enter each new world, they battle that universe''s native defenders, while the force that summoned them seeks to find a way to invade and infect our world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDI6PbIjeEdLUoPHGaZqDMV9Fdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44571'),
  ('249306126717859644', 'The King of Jokgu', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Woo Moon-gi, Kwon O-kwang, Lee Kun-sol', 'Kim Tae-gon', 'Ahn Jae-hong, Hwang Seung-eon, Jung Woo-sik, Kang Bong-sung, Hwang Mi-young, Park Ho-san, Ryu Hye-rin, Jin Tae-cheol', null, 'When Man-seob comes back to school after completing military service, he organizes the school''s Jokgu team to win Anna''s heart.', 'When Man-seob comes back to school after completing military service, he organizes the school''s Jokgu team to win Anna''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjk2rmg37dj59Q0Oi6U975tl4Em.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286702'),
  ('215744979417178733', 'The King of Kings', 1927, 'Drama, History', 'Cecil B. DeMille, J. Peverell Marley, D.W. Griffith', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'H.B. Warner, Dorothy Cumming, Ernest Torrence, Joseph Schildkraut, James Neill, Joseph Striker, Robert Edeson, Sidney D''Albrook', 'NR', 'The King of Kings is the Greatest Story Ever Told as only Cecil B. DeMille could tell it. In 1927, working with one of the biggest budgets in Hollywood history, DeMille spun the life and Passion of Christ into a silent-era blockbuster. Featuring text drawn directly from the Bible, a cast of thousands, and the great showman’s singular cinematic bag of tricks, The King of Kings is at once spectacular and deeply reverent—part Gospel, part Technicolor epic.', 'The King of Kings is the Greatest Story Ever Told as only Cecil B. DeMille could tell it. In 1927, working with one of the biggest budgets in Hollywood history, DeMille spun the life and Passion of Christ into a silent-era blockbuster. Featuring text drawn directly from the Bible, a cast of thousands, and the great showman’s singular cinematic bag of tricks, The King of Kings is at once spectacular and deeply reverent—part Gospel, part Technicolor epic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJThyOfQVeEctEVVtK3LTDVL5S6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49633'),
  ('685768645716765010', 'The King of Kings', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Drama, Adventure', 'Jang Seong-ho, Kim Woo-hyung, Jamie Thomason', 'Jang Seong-ho', 'Oscar Isaac, Kenneth Branagh, Uma Thurman, Pierce Brosnan, Roman Griffin Davis, Forest Whitaker, Ben Kingsley, Mark Hamill', 'PG', 'Charles Dickens tells his young son Walter the greatest story ever told, and what begins as a bedtime tale becomes a life-changing journey. Through vivid imagination, the boy walks alongside Jesus, witnessing His miracles, facing His trials, and understanding His ultimate sacrifice.', 'Charles Dickens tells his young son Walter the greatest story ever told, and what begins as a bedtime tale becomes a life-changing journey. Through vivid imagination, the boy walks alongside Jesus, witnessing His miracles, facing His trials, and understanding His ultimate sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccw7CCIAvcZV431CP7NhHAHuiHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181107'),
  ('250247185712088442', 'The King of Kong: A Fistful of Quarters', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Seth Gordon, Seth Gordon', 'Seth Gordon', 'Steve Wiebe, Billy Mitchell, Walter Day, Mark Alpiger, Greg Bond, Craig Glenday, Brian Kuh, Robert Mruczek', 'PG-13', 'In this hilarious arcade showdown, a humble novice goes head-to-head against the reigning Donkey Kong champ in a confrontation that rocks the gaming world to its processors! For over 20 years, Billy Mitchell has owned the throne of the Donkey Kong world. No one could beat his top score until now. Newcomer Steve Wiebe claims to have beaten the unbeatable, but Mitchell isn''t ready to relinquish his crown without a fight. Go behind the barrels as the two battle it out in a vicious war to earn the title of the true King of Kong.', 'In this hilarious arcade showdown, a humble novice goes head-to-head against the reigning Donkey Kong champ in a confrontation that rocks the gaming world to its processors! For over 20 years, Billy Mitchell has owned the throne of the Donkey Kong world. No one could beat his top score until now. Newcomer Steve Wiebe claims to have beaten the unbeatable, but Mitchell isn''t ready to relinquish his crown without a fight. Go behind the barrels as the two battle it out in a vicious war to earn the title of the true King of Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wACtXGiO08EBbJhqsD2nUzPsrKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13958'),
  ('35509316436835314', 'The King of Laughter', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Luca Federico, Anna Elisabetta Conti, Mario Martone', 'Mario Martone, Ippolita Di Majo', 'Toni Servillo, Maria Nazionale, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Antonia Truppo, Eduardo Scarpetta, Roberto De Francesco, Lino Musella, Paolo Pierobon', null, 'In early 20th-century Naples, a theatrical parody lands beloved thespian and playwright Eduardo Scarpetta in court, facing a malicious lawsuit that could compromise his freedom of expression and the economic security of his extended family—including his son''s, young Eduardo De Filippo.', 'In early 20th-century Naples, a theatrical parody lands beloved thespian and playwright Eduardo Scarpetta in court, facing a malicious lawsuit that could compromise his freedom of expression and the economic security of his extended family—including his son''s, young Eduardo De Filippo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdQYDpjWdg5YvnJ4i8LC0BHkKsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668408'),
  ('256812809134765263', 'The King of Marvin Gardens', 1972, 'Drama', 'Bob Rafelson, László Kovács, Michael Haley', 'Jacob Brackman, Bob Rafelson', 'Jack Nicholson, Bruce Dern, Ellen Burstyn, Julia Anne Robinson, Scatman Crothers, Charles LaVine, John P. Ryan, Sully Boyar', 'R', 'Jason Staebler lives on the Boardwalk and fronts for the local mob in Atlantic City. He is a dreamer who asks his brother David, a radio personality from Philadelphia, to help him build a paradise on a Pacific Island, which might be just another of his pie-in-the-sky schemes. Inevitably, complications begin to pile up.', 'Jason Staebler lives on the Boardwalk and fronts for the local mob in Atlantic City. He is a dreamer who asks his brother David, a radio personality from Philadelphia, to help him build a paradise on a Pacific Island, which might be just another of his pie-in-the-sky schemes. Inevitably, complications begin to pile up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JpKFEp9niY90Qgz7xhcIGAOifK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50627'),
  ('516103170012624902', 'The King of Masks', 1995, 'Drama', 'Wu Tianming, Mu Deyuan', 'Minglun Wei', 'Zhu Xu, Zhou Ren-Ying, Zhao Zhi-Gang, Zhang Rui-Yang, Chen Li, Wong Siu-Kei, Dung Kin-Laam, Pan Hong', null, 'Wang Bianlian is an aging street performer known as the King of Mask for his mastery of Sichuan Change Art in a true story. His wife left him with and infant son over 30 years ago. The son died from illness at age 10. This left Wang a melancholy loner aching for a male descendent to learn his rare and dying art.', 'Wang Bianlian is an aging street performer known as the King of Mask for his mastery of Sichuan Change Art in a true story. His wife left him with and infant son over 30 years ago. The son died from illness at age 10. This left Wang a melancholy loner aching for a male descendent to learn his rare and dying art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3fOMjcR74WdZlYOyug6Q7H1XmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25471'),
  ('53299305167758928', 'The King of Pigs', 2011, 'Animation, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Yang Ik-june, Oh Jung-se, Kim Hye-na, Park Hee-von, Kim Kkob-bi, Jo Yeong-Bin, Heo Ji-woong, Kyung-soon', null, 'Two friends, Jung Jong-suk and Hwang Kyung-min, meet after several years and talk about their time in school, which left them scarred.', 'Two friends, Jung Jong-suk and Hwang Kyung-min, meet after several years and talk about their time in school, which left them scarred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o93tMT3eyeOXBZ8F8TiGQWUq3Ta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91088'),
  ('644269786794504416', 'The King of Snipers', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, War', 'Chris Huo Suiqiang', 'Shen Lei, Wei Xiuliang', 'Yang Xing, Henry Prince Mak, Li Donghe, Guo Muhan, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Du Kang, Jackson Liu, Rui Xiu', null, 'The genius sniper Anna is forced to accept an assassination assignment. In the process, she gradually finds her true calling to fight for kindness and to defend a greater love. Tai, a special agent for the UN army, stands up for justice when drug lords try to harm innocent citizens. The two join forces to block the bill to legalize drug cultivation and distribution in Libiwala. They fight to the death with the drug lord Luo Jie and eventually foil his plans, protecting the people from the drugs. This is the exciting story of them working together to save a nation.', 'The genius sniper Anna is forced to accept an assassination assignment. In the process, she gradually finds her true calling to fight for kindness and to defend a greater love. Tai, a special agent for the UN army, stands up for justice when drug lords try to harm innocent citizens. The two join forces to block the bill to legalize drug cultivation and distribution in Libiwala. They fight to the death with the drug lord Luo Jie and eventually foil his plans, protecting the people from the drugs. This is the exciting story of them working together to save a nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5C85R0Bc6RL51PnPv2HIvpSMJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078023'),
  ('19534220166604633', 'The King of Staten Island', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Judd Apatow, Robert Elswit, Eddie Griffith', 'Judd Apatow, Pete Davidson, Dave Sirus', 'Pete Davidson, Marisa Tomei, Bill Burr, Bel Powley, Maude Apatow, Steve Buscemi, Pamela Adlon, Action Bronson', 'R', 'Scott has been a case of arrested development ever since his firefighter father died when he was seven. He''s now reached his mid-20s having achieved little, chasing a dream of becoming a tattoo artist that seems far out of reach. As his ambitious younger sister heads off to college, Scott is still living with his exhausted ER nurse mother and spends his days smoking weed, hanging with the guys — Oscar, Igor and Richie — and secretly hooking up with his childhood friend Kelsey. But when his mother starts dating a loudmouth firefighter named Ray, it sets off a chain of events that will force Scott to grapple with his grief and take his first tentative steps toward moving forward in life.', 'Scott has been a case of arrested development ever since his firefighter father died when he was seven. He''s now reached his mid-20s having achieved little, chasing a dream of becoming a tattoo artist that seems far out of reach. As his ambitious younger sister heads off to college, Scott is still living with his exhausted ER nurse mother and spends his days smoking weed, hanging with the guys — Oscar, Igor and Richie — and secretly hooking up with his childhood friend Kelsey. But when his mother starts dating a loudmouth firefighter named Ray, it sets off a chain of events that will force Scott to grapple with his grief and take his first tentative steps toward moving forward in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQFjMmE3K9AX5QrBL1SXIxYQ9jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579583'),
  ('327464236349917670', 'The King of the Hill', 2008, 'Thriller, Action', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego', 'Javier Gullón', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, María Valverde, Thomas Riordan, Andrés Juste, Pablo Menasanch, Francisco Olmo, Manuel Sánchez Ramos', null, 'Quim drives around an isolated rural area through a maze of lanes. When he drives into the woods, he gets lost. Trying to find his direction, he suddenly gets shot from the hill. On his escape from gunshots, he meets Bea, an attractive young woman, who apparently is lost as well. Suspicious of each other, they join forces to run away through the forest, unprotected, cold, hunted...', 'Quim drives around an isolated rural area through a maze of lanes. When he drives into the woods, he gets lost. Trying to find his direction, he suddenly gets shot from the hill. On his escape from gunshots, he meets Bea, an attractive young woman, who apparently is lost as well. Suspicious of each other, they join forces to run away through the forest, unprotected, cold, hunted...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idQRgWr21C9kVLtQWScMcpJhRYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14657'),
  ('74769554807294019', 'The King of the Kickboxers', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Lo Yuen-Ming, Viking Chiu', 'Keith W. Strandberg', 'Loren Avedon, Billy Blanks, Keith Cooke, Jerry Trimble, Richard Jaeckel, Don Stroud, Sherrie Rose, William Long Jr.', 'R', 'Jake, a New York policeman poses as an actor to expose the making of martial-arts death movies in Thailand.', 'Jake, a New York policeman poses as an actor to expose the making of martial-arts death movies in Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srDVrofFvU8lC9MVNZn17cmqNRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68895'),
  ('955696895707982173', 'The King of the Neighborhood', 1950, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Agustín Martínez Solares', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Juan García', 'Germán Valdés, Silvia Pinal, Marcelo Chávez, Famie Kaufman, Juan García, Joaquín García Vargas, Ramón Valdés, José Ortega', null, 'A poor man becomes a modern Robin Hood, robbing the rich to give to the poor.', 'A poor man becomes a modern Robin Hood, robbing the rich to give to the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rILVrf8bAjacrxJRzoxFgkLTa9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118003'),
  ('814982245624477342', 'The King of the Street Cleaners', 1977, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Zeki Ökten, Erbil Altanay, Ahmet Sezerel', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Şener Şen, Ayşen Gruda, İhsan Yüce, Erdal Özyağcılar, İlyas Salman, Nejat Gürçen, Türker Tekin', null, 'Going through his daily routine in a stereotypical neighborhood, a street cleaner falls in love with a charwoman. Unfortunately for him, so does his superior officer.', 'Going through his daily routine in a stereotypical neighborhood, a street cleaner falls in love with a charwoman. Unfortunately for him, so does his superior officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UPESBpPY2N8ZqMTKlvAYHBtzCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80961'),
  ('412709315994156416', 'The King of the Streets', 2012, 'Action', 'Yue Song', 'Yue Song', 'Yue Song, Yang Jun, Li Yu-Fei, Kang En, Yang Jianping, Li Chang-Hai, Hou Xu, Yu Xin', null, 'Yue Feng is a young thug with exceptional streetfighting abilities. He will stop at nothing to defeat all challengers - until, in an tragic accident, he kills a fellow competitor and is sent to prison. Eight years later, Yue Feng emerges a changed man. He no longer fights, and is looking for a new life of peace and fulfillment. But it''s brutal on the streets, and redemption doesn''t come easy. His brotherhood is destroyed, family members murdered, and a loved one humiliated - a deadly chain reaction that leaves him no choice but to unleash his power in the name of justice.', 'Yue Feng is a young thug with exceptional streetfighting abilities. He will stop at nothing to defeat all challengers - until, in an tragic accident, he kills a fellow competitor and is sent to prison. Eight years later, Yue Feng emerges a changed man. He no longer fights, and is looking for a new life of peace and fulfillment. But it''s brutal on the streets, and redemption doesn''t come easy. His brotherhood is destroyed, family members murdered, and a loved one humiliated - a deadly chain reaction that leaves him no choice but to unleash his power in the name of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akLfMvYhj2BXyYWeU1lZtvkkjNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208567'),
  ('806062980613061858', 'The King of the Toad', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Harold de Vasten', 'Harold de Vasten', 'Luis Alberto Posada, Laura Gabrielle Castaño, Sebastián Peñaloza, Martín Hortúa, Enrique González, Catalina Iglesias, Viña Machado', null, 'A young woman heads to Colombia in search of her father and funds for her mom, only to find herself in a sapo tournament and a wild family adventure.', 'A young woman heads to Colombia in search of her father and funds for her mom, only to find herself in a sapo tournament and a wild family adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKOZID4nBALexiJsIoG7BTLIyTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761030'),
  ('629118391841484248', 'The King Tide', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Connor Johnson, Cassidy Barry, Jamie Pitt', 'William Woods, Albert Shin', 'Frances Fisher, Clayne Crawford, Lara Jean Chorostecki, Aden Young, Alix West Lefler, Michael Greyeyes, Ryan McDonald, Kathryn Greenwood', null, 'After the mayor of an idyllic island village discovers a child with mysterious powers awash on their shores, the once peaceful community devolves into civil war, torn over the belief that the child is the next saviour.', 'After the mayor of an idyllic island village discovers a child with mysterious powers awash on their shores, the once peaceful community devolves into civil war, torn over the belief that the child is the next saviour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyl8EoIza5wJJjfaaJHB4o1VzNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159477'),
  ('1091390950884114100', 'The King''s Avatar: For the Glory', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Drama', 'Juansheng Shi, Zhiwei Deng', 'Yucong Li, Mei Er, Zhang Wen', 'Ajie, Wen jingyuan, Zhang Zhe, Baomu Zhongyang, Shun Zi, Zhang Jing Yu, Xi Zi, Liu Sicen', null, 'In this prequel to the animated series The King''s Avatar, Ye Xiu enters into the pro gaming world of Glory, and competes in the first Pro League series tournament.', 'In this prequel to the animated series The King''s Avatar, Ye Xiu enters into the pro gaming world of Glory, and competes in the first Pro League series tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibaBs2k3I57TIHd6rBOxhWdHmcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613200'),
  ('540945279196410090', 'The King''s Case Note', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Kim Hyeong-yong, Moon Hyun-sung, Kim Dong-young', 'Kang Hyeon-seong', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Ahn Jae-hong, Kim Hie-won, Gyeong Su-jin, Jung Hae-in, Ju Jin-mo, Jang Young-nam, Kim Hong-pa', null, 'A clever king of Joseon and his brilliant chronicler hunt for the truth behind a crime that threatens the throne and the stability of the country.', 'A clever king of Joseon and his brilliant chronicler hunt for the truth behind a crime that threatens the throne and the stability of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12stTEgtogXWvWsgepVFj8ENf6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451914'),
  ('1048780769868925398', 'The King''s Choice', 2016, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Erik Poppe, John Christian Rosenlund', 'Harald Rosenløw-Eeg, Jan Trygve Røyneland', 'Jesper Christensen, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Karl Markovics, Tuva Novotny, Arthur Hakalahti, Svein Tindberg, Andreas Lust, Katharina Schüttler', null, 'On 9 April 1940, German soldiers arrive in the city of Oslo. The King of Norway faces a choice that will change his country forever. The King''s Choice is a story about the three most dramatic days in Norway''s history, the royal family''s escape and King Haakon''s difficult choice after Nazi Germany''s invasion of Norway.', 'On 9 April 1940, German soldiers arrive in the city of Oslo. The King of Norway faces a choice that will change his country forever. The King''s Choice is a story about the three most dramatic days in Norway''s history, the royal family''s escape and King Haakon''s difficult choice after Nazi Germany''s invasion of Norway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qulAxlraNWYrvtq2lIi6AakbeUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396616'),
  ('858407520810736466', 'The King''s Daughter', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Steven Desbrow, Vincent Gallot, Sean McNamara', 'Barry Berman, James Schamus', 'Pierce Brosnan, Kaya Scodelario, Benjamin Walker, William Hurt, Julie Andrews, Fan Bingbing, Pablo Schreiber, Ben Lloyd-Hughes', 'PG', 'King Louis XIV''s quest for immortality leads him to capture and steal a mermaid''s life force, a move that is further complicated by his illegitimate daughter''s discovery of the creature.', 'King Louis XIV''s quest for immortality leads him to capture and steal a mermaid''s life force, a move that is further complicated by his illegitimate daughter''s discovery of the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZ3ZxAjy26ZEo3WM4JFdOkoE5sS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245842'),
  ('35528860773468456', 'The King''s Daughters', 2000, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Thomas Mauch, Patricia Mazuy', 'Patricia Mazuy, Yves Thomas', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Jean-François Balmer, Nina Meurisse, Morgane Moré, Bernard Waver, Jeanne Le Bigot, Mathilde Lechasles', null, 'Late 17th Century: Anne de Grandcamp and Lucie de Fontenelle, two little girls from Normandy, arrive at the Saint-Cyr school founded by Madame de Maintenon for educating the daughters of impoverished nobles ruined in wars and making them into free women. Madame de Maintenon is the secret wife of Louis XIV, and empowered by his support, she offers "her" two hundred fifty girls a playful and avant-garde education. Anne and Lucie, two inseparable friends, allow themselves to be carried away by the promise of a bright future. But Maintenon has arrived at the pinnacle of power through scheming and debasing herself and she now fears the fires of hell. She is counting on her model school to atone for her past sins.', 'Late 17th Century: Anne de Grandcamp and Lucie de Fontenelle, two little girls from Normandy, arrive at the Saint-Cyr school founded by Madame de Maintenon for educating the daughters of impoverished nobles ruined in wars and making them into free women. Madame de Maintenon is the secret wife of Louis XIV, and empowered by his support, she offers "her" two hundred fifty girls a playful and avant-garde education. Anne and Lucie, two inseparable friends, allow themselves to be carried away by the promise of a bright future. But Maintenon has arrived at the pinnacle of power through scheming and debasing herself and she now fears the fires of hell. She is counting on her model school to atone for her past sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrdYpzVh7149RmTXSkcxLMJwiaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76265'),
  ('946924180304842600', 'The King''s Letters', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Hong Seung-chul, Cho Chul-hyun, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Lee Song-won, Geum Jung-yeon, Cho Chul-hyun', 'Song Kang-ho, Park Hae-il, Jeon Mi-seon, Choi Deok-moon, Jung Hae-kyun, Kim Jun-han, Cha Rae-hyung, Oh Hyeon-kyeong', null, 'In the 15th century, despite so many accomplishments he has made for the people, King Sejong, his biggest goal is still remaining; the invention of original letters that can be read and written by all the people. But courtiers who want to dominate the knowledge and the power, are against his will and discourage his belief. Frustrated King Sejong hears about a bonze Sinmi a phonogram expert, and secretly brings him in the palace.', 'In the 15th century, despite so many accomplishments he has made for the people, King Sejong, his biggest goal is still remaining; the invention of original letters that can be read and written by all the people. But courtiers who want to dominate the knowledge and the power, are against his will and discourage his belief. Frustrated King Sejong hears about a bonze Sinmi a phonogram expert, and secretly brings him in the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuYQgRziV15TjXqWRKFt2n0MXJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572988'),
  ('646889233825025316', 'The King''s Man', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Chris Peters, Doug J. Meerdink, Emma Vane', 'Matthew Vaughn, Karl Gajdusek', 'Ralph Fiennes, Gemma Arterton, Rhys Ifans, Matthew Goode, Tom Hollander, Harris Dickinson, Daniel Brühl, Djimon Hounsou', 'R', 'As a collection of history''s worst tyrants and criminal masterminds gather to plot a war to wipe out millions, one man must race against time to stop them.', 'As a collection of history''s worst tyrants and criminal masterminds gather to plot a war to wipe out millions, one man must race against time to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMjSfMUuCkCE7z5fzGtjeDusPD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476669'),
  ('1053678635535491442', 'The King''s Musketeers', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Alberto Mangiante, Tani Canevari, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Nicola Baldoni', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Valerio Mastandrea, Rocco Papaleo, Sergio Rubini, Margherita Buy, Alessandro Haber, Matilde Gioli, Giulia Bevilacqua', null, 'In 17th-century France, the Queen brings the Three Musketeers — Athos, Porthos, Aramis, and an aging d''Artagnan — back from retirement for one last job: saving her son Louis and the whole kingdom.', 'In 17th-century France, the Queen brings the Three Musketeers — Athos, Porthos, Aramis, and an aging d''Artagnan — back from retirement for one last job: saving her son Louis and the whole kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR249tNy0JNAMvG3P3oSSWTPhTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565413'),
  ('755821553225535649', 'The King''s Speech', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Tom Hooper, Danny Cohen, David Hindle', 'David Seidler', 'Colin Firth, Geoffrey Rush, Helena Bonham Carter, Guy Pearce, Timothy Spall, Michael Gambon, Jennifer Ehle, Derek Jacobi', 'R', 'The King''s Speech tells the story of the man who became King George VI, the father of Queen Elizabeth II. After his brother abdicates, George (''Bertie'') reluctantly assumes the throne. Plagued by a dreaded stutter and considered unfit to be king, Bertie engages the help of an unorthodox speech therapist named Lionel Logue. Through a set of unexpected techniques, and as a result of an unlikely friendship, Bertie is able to find his voice and boldly lead the country into war.', 'The King''s Speech tells the story of the man who became King George VI, the father of Queen Elizabeth II. After his brother abdicates, George (''Bertie'') reluctantly assumes the throne. Plagued by a dreaded stutter and considered unfit to be king, Bertie engages the help of an unorthodox speech therapist named Lionel Logue. Through a set of unexpected techniques, and as a result of an unlikely friendship, Bertie is able to find his voice and boldly lead the country into war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVNKXVQFukBaCz6ML7GH3kiPlQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45269'),
  ('1139273003408993468', 'The King''s Surrender', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Christian Stangassinger, Philipp Leinemann', 'Philipp Leinemann', 'Ronald Zehrfeld, Mišel Matičević, Mohamed Issa, Hendrik Duryn, Tilman Strauss, Oliver Konietzny, Frederick Lau, Bernhard Schütz', null, 'Violent youth gangs and a police force way out of its depth. When a police operation goes awry and two policemen die, the powder keg threatens to ignite as the SWAT team knows only one goal: revenge - irrespective of the law.', 'Violent youth gangs and a police force way out of its depth. When a police operation goes awry and two policemen die, the powder keg threatens to ignite as the SWAT team knows only one goal: revenge - irrespective of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehtoBRjvBl96x0ZkK4l9liF0Jr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294483'),
  ('132603288938141643', 'The King''s Thief', 1955, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Saunders, Yakima Canutt, Robert Z. Leonard', 'Christopher Knopf', 'Ann Blyth, Edmund Purdom, David Niven, George Sanders, Roger Moore, John Dehner, Sean McClory, Tudor Owen', 'NR', 'An ex-soldier turned highwayman uncovers a plot to take control of England from King Charles II.', 'An ex-soldier turned highwayman uncovers a plot to take control of England from King Charles II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQeipqZpnuz9Aq0Hrfm6jVhkRyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79646'),
  ('1081368784191987218', 'The King''s Warden', 2026, 'History, Drama', 'Chang Hang-jun, Lee Jae-hyuk, Choi Young-hwan', 'Hwang Sung-goo, Chang Hang-jun', 'Yoo Hai-jin, Park Ji-hoon, Yoo Ji-tae, Jeon Mi-do, Kim Min, Park Ji-hwan, Lee Jun-hyuk, Ahn Jae-hong', 'NR', 'In a remote mountain village of 15th-century Joseon, humble headman Heung-do hears a rumor that any village hosting an exiled nobleman will be blessed with abundance and fortune. Hoping to bring prosperity to his impoverished community, he eagerly submits a petition to host one—unaware that his guest is none other than the fallen monarch, deposed boy-king Danjong.', 'In a remote mountain village of 15th-century Joseon, humble headman Heung-do hears a rumor that any village hosting an exiled nobleman will be blessed with abundance and fortune. Hoping to bring prosperity to his impoverished community, he eagerly submits a petition to host one—unaware that his guest is none other than the fallen monarch, deposed boy-king Danjong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CnVA1jAA64Q3qNVAW8DekCu19b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321179'),
  ('751802157434624820', 'The King''s Whore', 1990, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Axel Corti, Gernot Roll', 'Axel Corti, Frederic Raphael, Daniel Vigne', 'Timothy Dalton, Valeria Golino, Stéphane Freiss, Robin Renucci, Margaret Tyzack, Eleanor David, Paul Crauchet, Leonardo Ruta', null, 'Set in the 17th-century, an Italian nobleman weds an impoverished countess, who is wooed by the King of Piedmont and faces pressure from his entire court to succumb to his wishes.', 'Set in the 17th-century, an Italian nobleman weds an impoverished countess, who is wooed by the King of Piedmont and faces pressure from his entire court to succumb to his wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY5VLwdBc3Iua6H6GaM4ScFdCyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71623'),
  ('502079171796059514', 'The Kingdom', 1994, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Lars von Trier, Eric Kress, Morten Arnfred', 'Niels Vørsel, Lars von Trier', 'Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Kirsten Rolffes, Holger Juul Hansen, Søren Pilmark, Ghita Nørby, Jens Okking, Otto Brandenburg, Annevig Schelde Ebbe', null, 'At The Kingdom, Denmark''s most technologically advanced hospital, a number of strange and otherworldly events begin occurring, much to the dismay of its doctors and patients. A ghostly ambulance appears and disappears, the voice of a little girl calls to a patient in an elevator shaft, and a doctor''s fetus begins growing at an alarming rate.', 'At The Kingdom, Denmark''s most technologically advanced hospital, a number of strange and otherworldly events begin occurring, much to the dismay of its doctors and patients. A ghostly ambulance appears and disappears, the voice of a little girl calls to a patient in an elevator shaft, and a doctor''s fetus begins growing at an alarming rate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfXVe3dSvkR3YAp3g6E5q2R5swy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22137'),
  ('996867550585337400', 'The Kingdom', 2007, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Peter Berg, Mauro Fiore, Phil Neilson', 'Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Chris Cooper, Jason Bateman, Ali Suliman, Jeremy Piven, Ashraf Barhom, Richard Jenkins', 'R', 'A team of U.S. government agents is sent to investigate the bombing of an American facility in the Middle East.', 'A team of U.S. government agents is sent to investigate the bombing of an American facility in the Middle East.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CSiRnMRLuKT58JiOGzQ7p1oa1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4349'),
  ('1116519927337227610', 'The Kingdom', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Antoine Cormier, Julie Flament, Julien Colonna', 'Julien Colonna, Jeanne Herry', 'Ghjuvanna Benedetti, Saveriu Santucci, Anthony Morganti, Andrea Cossu, Thomas Bronzini de Caraffa, Pascale Mariani, Toussaint Martinetti, Eric Ettori', null, 'Lesia, a teenager, is taken by a man to a villa where her fugitive father and his men are hiding. A war erupts, leading to death and a chase where father and daughter bond.', 'Lesia, a teenager, is taken by a man to a villa where her fugitive father and his men are hiding. A war erupts, leading to death and a chase where father and daughter bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sR2P5P5SE8wZwMsfsLCO7J7Drp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079311'),
  ('896012660940285235', 'The Kingdom II', 1998, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Horror, Comedy, Drama', 'Lars von Trier, Eric Kress, Morten Arnfred', 'Niels Vørsel, Lars von Trier', 'Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Kirsten Rolffes, Holger Juul Hansen, Søren Pilmark, Ghita Nørby, Jens Okking, Birthe Neumann, Otto Brandenburg', null, 'The mutant fetus is born. Dr. Helmer comes under heavy scrutiny for a botched operation that left a patient braindead, and begins to dabble in the dark arts in order to ward off those seeking an end to his career. Hypochondriac Mrs. Drusse finally does have something bad happen to her medically when an ambulance hits her.', 'The mutant fetus is born. Dr. Helmer comes under heavy scrutiny for a botched operation that left a patient braindead, and begins to dabble in the dark arts in order to ward off those seeking an end to his career. Hypochondriac Mrs. Drusse finally does have something bad happen to her medically when an ambulance hits her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giq4mcpAeBduy6cPE6V1tvS6SuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22140'),
  ('8632955559968602', 'The Kingdom of Diamonds', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Tapan Chatterjee, Rabi Ghosh, Utpal Dutt, Soumitra Chatterjee, Santosh Dutta, Kamu Mukherjee, Alpana Gupta, Sunil Sarkar', null, 'When Goopy and Bagha learn about Hirak Raja''s tyranny, they try to set him right with the help of Udayan, a school teacher, and their magical powers.', 'When Goopy and Bagha learn about Hirak Raja''s tyranny, they try to set him right with the help of Udayan, a school teacher, and their magical powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlAftRRDUvN7BP8UVdhYiWFJ1Md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206789'),
  ('623563768783401443', 'The Kingdom of Dreams and Madness', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Mami Sunada, Mami Sunada', 'Mami Sunada', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Isao Takahata, Toshio Suzuki, Hideaki Anno, Yoshiaki Nishimura, Joe Hisaishi, Goro Miyazaki, Michiyo Yasuda', null, 'Follows the behind-the-scenes work of Studio Ghibli, focusing on the notable figures Hayao Miyazaki, Isao Takahata, and Toshio Suzuki.', 'Follows the behind-the-scenes work of Studio Ghibli, focusing on the notable figures Hayao Miyazaki, Isao Takahata, and Toshio Suzuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ice7zuzzwcuKO5SJG7aTqYZC3EI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252511'),
  ('131376699996770121', 'The Kingdom of the Fairies', 1903, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès, Marguerite Thévenard, Bleuette Bernon, André Deed, Durafour', null, 'At the royal court, a prince is presenting the princess whom he is pledged to marry when a witch suddenly appears. Though driven off, the witch soon returns, summons some of her servants, and carries off the princess. A rescue party is quickly organized, but the unfortunate captive has been taken to a strange, forbidding realm, from where it will be impossible to rescue her without some special help.', 'At the royal court, a prince is presenting the princess whom he is pledged to marry when a witch suddenly appears. Though driven off, the witch soon returns, summons some of her servants, and carries off the princess. A rescue party is quickly organized, but the unfortunate captive has been taken to a strange, forbidding realm, from where it will be impossible to rescue her without some special help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MgxM4zp5pCKHe8sDFVygb696xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32673'),
