  ('684104617340221135', 'The Kings of Summer', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jordan Vogt-Roberts, Ross Riege', 'Chris Galletta', 'Nick Robinson, Gabriel Basso, Moisés Arias, Nick Offerman, Erin Moriarty, Craig Cackowski, Alison Brie, Megan Mullally', 'R', 'Three restless teenagers run away to the woods for the summer, determined to escape their parents and live by their own rules. In a hidden clearing, they build a makeshift house and attempt to create an independent life, testing their friendship, freedom, and the challenges of living off the land.', 'Three restless teenagers run away to the woods for the summer, determined to escape their parents and live by their own rules. In a hidden clearing, they build a makeshift house and attempt to create an independent life, testing their friendship, freedom, and the challenges of living off the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dcIbwJuxlEnzLe0EaGFvsh4ZdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156700'),
  ('15981081297540208', 'The Kings of the World', 2022, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Laura Mora, David Gallego', 'María Camila Arias, Laura Mora', 'Carlos Andres Castañeda, Brahian Acevedo, Davinson Florez, Cristian Campaña, Cristian David, Luis Eduardo Benjumea', null, 'Rá, Culebro, Sere, Winny and Nano. Five boys who live on the streets of Medellín. Five kings with no kingdom, no law, no family, set out on a journey in search of the promised land. A subversive tale told through a wild and endearing clan, somewhere between reality and delirium. A journey to nowhere, where everything happens.', 'Rá, Culebro, Sere, Winny and Nano. Five boys who live on the streets of Medellín. Five kings with no kingdom, no law, no family, set out on a journey in search of the promised land. A subversive tale told through a wild and endearing clan, somewhere between reality and delirium. A journey to nowhere, where everything happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iK46b6jYIKvaakp7qKt0BKexN53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848112'),
