  ('20832285655871630', 'The Kiss', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Feyder, William H. Daniels', 'Hanns Kräly', 'Greta Garbo, Conrad Nagel, Anders Randolf, Holmes Herbert, Lew Ayres, George Davis, Symona Boniface, Allan Cavan', 'NR', 'An unhappily married woman is caught up in scandal and murder when her affection toward a young man is misinterpreted.', 'An unhappily married woman is caught up in scandal and murder when her affection toward a young man is misinterpreted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t82WbEYJwKgnq9yKu9IQRxZk2f9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30631'),
  ('345959797846977361', 'The Kiss', 1981, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Bruno Barreto, Murilo Salles, José Joaquim Salles', 'Doc Comparato', 'Ney Latorraca, Tarcísio Meira, Christiane Torloni, Lídia Brondi, Thelma Reston, Flávio São Thiago, Nelson Caruso, Renato Coutinho', null, 'When a pedestrian is hit by a bus, the simple clerk Arandir runs and kisses the moribund in a gesture of sympathy and unconditional pure love. Opportunist photographer Amado Pinheiro witnesses the scene and sees the opportunity to sell newspaper and, together with the despicable and abusive chief of police Cunha, accuses Arandir of homosexuality.', 'When a pedestrian is hit by a bus, the simple clerk Arandir runs and kisses the moribund in a gesture of sympathy and unconditional pure love. Opportunist photographer Amado Pinheiro witnesses the scene and sees the opportunity to sell newspaper and, together with the despicable and abusive chief of police Cunha, accuses Arandir of homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e70ma7N3AQHiG0BJdh66JfwqWOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183855'),
  ('661077672846491670', 'The Kiss', 1988, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Pen Densham, Steve M. Davison, Henry J. Bronchtein', 'Tom Ropelewski, Stephen Volk', 'Meredith Salenger, Joanna Pacula, Mimi Kuzyk, Nicholas Kilbertus, Sabrina Boudot, Shawn Levy, Peter Dvorsky, Jan Rubeš', 'R', 'After the death of her mother, a teenage girl is faced with bizarre supernatural occurrences when her mother''s estranged sister arrives and begins to infiltrate her and her father''s lives.', 'After the death of her mother, a teenage girl is faced with bizarre supernatural occurrences when her mother''s estranged sister arrives and begins to infiltrate her and her father''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGsdpuVjToJxoCRmKpIsCkQd90d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57744'),
  ('865561085191203392', 'The Kiss', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bille August, Sebastian Blenkov, Peter Hingebjerg', 'Bille August, Greg Latter', 'Esben Smed, Clara Rosager, Lars Mikkelsen, Rosalinde Mynster, David Dencik, Kurt Dreyer, Klaus Tilsted Søndergaard, Henrik Blauner Clausen', null, 'A romantic drama set in Denmark in 1913, the story follows Anton, a noble and conscientious young man whose top priority is to complete his training as a cavalry officer. During a training session, he orders his platoon to help Baron von Løvenskjold and finds himself invited to a ball at the castle, where he meets the baron’s beautiful daughter Edith who has been in an accident and ended up in a wheelchair.', 'A romantic drama set in Denmark in 1913, the story follows Anton, a noble and conscientious young man whose top priority is to complete his training as a cavalry officer. During a training session, he orders his platoon to help Baron von Løvenskjold and finds himself invited to a ball at the castle, where he meets the baron’s beautiful daughter Edith who has been in an accident and ended up in a wheelchair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMeBWGON5bKJkQRZm9k5stP6LF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030009'),
  ('93581405083385347', 'The Kiss Before the Mirror', 1933, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'James Whale, Karl Freund, W. Franke Harling', 'William Anthony McGuire', 'Nancy Carroll, Frank Morgan, Paul Lukas, Gloria Stuart, Jean Dixon, Donald Cook, Charley Grapewin, Walter Pidgeon', 'NR', 'When a famous doctor kills his adulterous wife, he is defended by his best friend, an attorney who suspects that his own wife is having an affair.', 'When a famous doctor kills his adulterous wife, he is defended by his best friend, an attorney who suspects that his own wife is having an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i05JVBCIAFcunQ1YX9An2TfEuUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139805'),
  ('426258998049284359', 'The Kiss in the Tunnel', 1899, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Albert Smith, George Albert Smith', null, 'Laura Bayley, George Albert Smith', null, 'Produced and directed by George Albert Smith, the film shows a couple sharing a brief kiss as their train passes through a tunnel. The Kiss in the Tunnel is said to mark the beginnings of narrative editing. It is in fact, two films in one, hence the 2 min length. Firstly, the G.A. Smith film here for the central cheeky scene in the carriage. The train view footage however is Cecil Hepworth''s work, entitled ''View From An Engine Front - Shilla Mill Tunnel'', edited into two halves in order to provide a visual narrative of the train entering the tunnel before the kiss and then leaving afterwards. More information about the filming of the phantom train ride can be found searching for the Hepworth film separately.', 'Produced and directed by George Albert Smith, the film shows a couple sharing a brief kiss as their train passes through a tunnel. The Kiss in the Tunnel is said to mark the beginnings of narrative editing. It is in fact, two films in one, hence the 2 min length. Firstly, the G.A. Smith film here for the central cheeky scene in the carriage. The train view footage however is Cecil Hepworth''s work, entitled ''View From An Engine Front - Shilla Mill Tunnel'', edited into two halves in order to provide a visual narrative of the train entering the tunnel before the kiss and then leaving afterwards. More information about the filming of the phantom train ride can be found searching for the Hepworth film separately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwdF4ih4E88Icfdk2nKTDMdUd3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143819'),
  ('210491900562110674', 'The Kiss of Death', 1973, 'Crime, Action', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Yau Kei', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'Chen Ping, Lo Lieh, Fan Mei-Sheng, Chan Shen, Chiang Tao, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Lin Wen-Wei, Lily Chen Ching', null, 'One night a textile worker is sexually assaulted by five deviants. The young lady tries to cope with the aftermath of this dramatic event but her life is ruined. Like a shattered vase, the pieces can be put back together but it''ll never be the same. Cheng get''s a job as a bar girl. She meets the club''s owner who was a former kung-fu fighter until he was crippled. Cheng uses her position as a B-girl to go after the losers who raped her, She soon learns from a sleazy doctor that she has contracted a dark V.D. called Viet-Nam Rose. Crushed, she begs Lo Lieh to teach her kung-fu. At first he refuses until he learns her secret. Furious, Lo Lieh teaches her his deadly fight techniques (such as a groin crunching blow).', 'One night a textile worker is sexually assaulted by five deviants. The young lady tries to cope with the aftermath of this dramatic event but her life is ruined. Like a shattered vase, the pieces can be put back together but it''ll never be the same. Cheng get''s a job as a bar girl. She meets the club''s owner who was a former kung-fu fighter until he was crippled. Cheng uses her position as a B-girl to go after the losers who raped her, She soon learns from a sleazy doctor that she has contracted a dark V.D. called Viet-Nam Rose. Crushed, she begs Lo Lieh to teach her kung-fu. At first he refuses until he learns her secret. Furious, Lo Lieh teaches her his deadly fight techniques (such as a groin crunching blow).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0Rm6rprOlEtbcSrw72ZbebXLHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107893'),
  ('152617327342001212', 'The Kiss of Death', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Leigh', 'Mike Leigh', 'David Threlfall, Kay Adshead, Angela Curran, John Wheatley, Clifford Kershaw, Marlene Sidaway, Eileen Denison, Brian Pollitt', null, 'Trevor is an extremely shy undertaker''s assistant. He always tags along with his good friend Ronnie, when he goes to the pub with his girlfriend Sandra. Sandra introduces Trevor to her more forward friend Linda. Linda has a difficult time getting Trevor to go out with her, but she finally gets him to go to a disco; he won''t dance, so Linda dances with Ronnie.', 'Trevor is an extremely shy undertaker''s assistant. He always tags along with his good friend Ronnie, when he goes to the pub with his girlfriend Sandra. Sandra introduces Trevor to her more forward friend Linda. Linda has a difficult time getting Trevor to go out with her, but she finally gets him to go to a disco; he won''t dance, so Linda dances with Ronnie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7ivFMJCpfBPl1BKgarXkmtsUUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188076'),
  ('1102879280130998301', 'The Kiss of Her Flesh', 1968, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Roberta Findlay, Michael Findlay', 'Roberta Findlay, Michael Findlay', 'Uta Erickson, Janet Banzet, Michael Findlay, Donna Stone, Rita Vance, Susan Landau, Earl Hindman, Roberta Findlay', null, 'Richard has lost what little sanity he had left, instead putting all emphasis on seeking out and brutally slaying any and every woman who crosses his path. However, this time he might have met his match as his deceased wife''s sister, Maria, is hellbent on putting an end to his orgiastic rampage.', 'Richard has lost what little sanity he had left, instead putting all emphasis on seeking out and brutally slaying any and every woman who crosses his path. However, this time he might have met his match as his deceased wife''s sister, Maria, is hellbent on putting an end to his orgiastic rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0wRqPjlubXaemLwBMqGe3mnb0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95010'),
  ('973218512746003608', 'The Kiss of the Vampire', 1963, 'Horror', 'Alan Hume, Don Sharp', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Edward de Souza, Jennifer Daniel, Noel Willman, Barry Warren, Clifford Evans, Jacquie Wallis, Isobel Black, Stan Simmons', null, 'Honeymooning in Bavaria, a young couple becomes stranded and is forced to stay the night in the area. Doctor Ravna, owner of the impressive chateau that sits imposingly above the village, invites them to dinner that evening. Their association with Ravna and his charming, beautiful family is to prove disastrous.', 'Honeymooning in Bavaria, a young couple becomes stranded and is forced to stay the night in the area. Doctor Ravna, owner of the impressive chateau that sits imposingly above the village, invites them to dinner that evening. Their association with Ravna and his charming, beautiful family is to prove disastrous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RHWz6frLuTxuRW3Kh0YosOhdir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39222'),
  ('1063354744767524175', 'The Kissing Booth', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Andre Weavind, Robyn Glaser, David Tumahole', 'Vince Marcello', 'Joey King, Joel Courtney, Jacob Elordi, Molly Ringwald, Stephen Jennings, Carson White, Meganne Young, Frances Sholto-Douglas', 'PG-13', 'When teenager Elle''s first kiss leads to a forbidden romance with the hottest boy in high school, she risks her relationship with her best friend.', 'When teenager Elle''s first kiss leads to a forbidden romance with the hottest boy in high school, she risks her relationship with her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcQNnnXgKLacoYF4LNWgkNiDXPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454983'),
  ('1148785171431064655', 'The Kissing Booth 2', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tony McLeod, George Amos, J.D. van Brakel', 'Vince Marcello, Jay Arnold', 'Joey King, Jacob Elordi, Joel Courtney, Molly Ringwald, Taylor Zakhar Perez, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, Meganne Young, Stephen Jennings', 'PG-13', 'With college decisions looming, Elle juggles her long-distance romance with Noah, changing relationship with bestie Lee and feelings for a new classmate.', 'With college decisions looming, Elle juggles her long-distance romance with Noah, changing relationship with bestie Lee and feelings for a new classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb7wQv0adK3kjOUr9n93mANHhPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583083'),
  ('716823047084626335', 'The Kissing Booth 3', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bianca Vandewalle, Rudy Van Zyl, Tony McLeod', 'Vince Marcello, Jay Arnold', 'Joey King, Joel Courtney, Jacob Elordi, Molly Ringwald, Taylor Zakhar Perez, Meganne Young, Maisie Richardson-Sellers, Stephen Jennings', 'PG-13', 'It’s the summer before Elle heads to college, and she has a secret decision to make. Elle has been accepted into Harvard, where boyfriend Noah is matriculating, and also Berkeley, where her BFF Lee is headed and has to decide if she should stay or not.', 'It’s the summer before Elle heads to college, and she has a secret decision to make. Elle has been accepted into Harvard, where boyfriend Noah is matriculating, and also Berkeley, where her BFF Lee is headed and has to decide if she should stay or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7xcqnMDVQ5v1hJBm3AZ5YikNe6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727745'),
  ('866974769647144703', 'The Kitchen', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Auszura, Grant M Guilliams, Blythe R.D. Quinlan', 'Andrea Berloff', 'Melissa McCarthy, Tiffany Haddish, Elisabeth Moss, Domhnall Gleeson, Bill Camp, Margo Martindale, Common, James Badge Dale', 'R', 'The mobster husbands of three 1978 Hell''s Kitchen housewives are sent to prison by the FBI. Left with little but a sharp ax to grind, the ladies take the Irish mafia''s matters into their own hands — proving unexpectedly adept at everything from running the rackets to taking out the competition… literally.', 'The mobster husbands of three 1978 Hell''s Kitchen housewives are sent to prison by the FBI. Left with little but a sharp ax to grind, the ladies take the Irish mafia''s matters into their own hands — proving unexpectedly adept at everything from running the rackets to taking out the competition… literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3smhHvnczXg8E2WzysRVKIXSYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487680'),
  ('218269207249713297', 'The Kitchen', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Adventure, Comedy', 'Kibwe Tavares, Daniel Kaluuya, Wyatt Garfield', 'Daniel Kaluuya, Joe Murtagh', 'Kane Robinson, Jedaiah Bannerman, Hope Ikpoku Jnr, Teija Kabs, Demmy Ladipo, Cristale, BACKROAD GEE, Rasaq Kukoyi', 'R', 'Izi''s close to escaping The Kitchen, one of London''s last remaining housing estates. But when young Benji enters his life, he faces some hard decisions.', 'Izi''s close to escaping The Kitchen, one of London''s last remaining housing estates. But when young Benji enters his life, he faces some hard decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tV0hK1BiqYrYlehChv4WJXIWgmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956262'),
  ('26911006852197642', 'The Kite', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Randa Chahal Sabbag, Alain Levent, Dominique Brenguier', 'Randa Chahal Sabbag', 'Flavia Bechara, Maher Bsaibes, Randa Asmar, Renée Dick, Julia Kassar, Liliane Nemri, Ziad Rahbani, Nayef Naji', null, 'A young 15 year old girl, Lamia, lives in a southern Lebanese village on the border with Israel. She is given in marriage to her cousin on the other side of the border. As Lamia crosses the barbed wire she also passes from childhood into adulthood, as brutal as our countries and the events that are to follow.', 'A young 15 year old girl, Lamia, lives in a southern Lebanese village on the border with Israel. She is given in marriage to her cousin on the other side of the border. As Lamia crosses the barbed wire she also passes from childhood into adulthood, as brutal as our countries and the events that are to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqKKR7peDlwySZgWVW1viYbP5ry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44086'),
  ('66032734722331530', 'The Kite Runner', 2007, 'Drama', 'Marc Forster, Roberto Schaefer', 'David Benioff', 'Ahmad Khan Mahmoodzada, Atossa Leoni, Khalid Abdalla, Elham Ehsas, Homayoun Ershadi, Saïd Taghmaoui, Mustafa Haidari, Shaun Toub', 'PG-13', 'After spending years in California, Amir returns to his homeland in Afghanistan to help his old friend Hassan, whose son is in trouble.', 'After spending years in California, Amir returns to his homeland in Afghanistan to help his old friend Hassan, whose son is in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dom2esWWW8C9jS2v7dOhW48LwHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7979'),
  ('1099323066517625761', 'The Kiyosu Conference', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Koki Mitani, Hideo Yamamoto, Shozo Katashima', 'Koki Mitani', 'Fumiyo Kohinata, Koji Yakusho, Yo Oizumi, Kyoka Suzuki, Koichi Sato, Eisuke Sasai, Yūsuke Iseya, Miki Nakatani', null, 'After the forced suicide of Nobunaga Oda at the Incident at Honnō-ji, powerful figures Katsuie Shibata, Hideyoshi Toyotomi, Nagahide Niwa and Tsuneoki Ikeda meet to decide on a successor. The conference would become Japan''s first group made political decision. The meeting was known as the Kiyosu Kaigi.', 'After the forced suicide of Nobunaga Oda at the Incident at Honnō-ji, powerful figures Katsuie Shibata, Hideyoshi Toyotomi, Nagahide Niwa and Tsuneoki Ikeda meet to decide on a successor. The conference would become Japan''s first group made political decision. The meeting was known as the Kiyosu Kaigi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j93ksoocaIbfE8ZWmqC5fMVBECC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229113'),
  ('799270724346481943', 'The Klansman', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Terence Young, Lloyd Ahern Sr., Larry Shaw', 'Millard Kaufman, Samuel Fuller', 'Richard Burton, Lee Marvin, Cameron Mitchell, Lola Falana, Linda Evans, Luciana Paluzzi, O. J. Simpson, David Huddleston', 'R', 'A small southern town has just been rocked by a tragedy: a young white woman has been raped by a black man. When young black man Garth witnesses the Ku Klux Klan''s violent retaliation against his innocent friend, Garth declares a one-man war on the Klan and hunts them down one-by-one.', 'A small southern town has just been rocked by a tragedy: a young white woman has been raped by a black man. When young black man Garth witnesses the Ku Klux Klan''s violent retaliation against his innocent friend, Garth declares a one-man war on the Klan and hunts them down one-by-one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dqY2dRGc27rXuYwJL7ipMDs5WB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77765'),
  ('384245795040783973', 'The Klondike Kid', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey plays piano in the Klondike Bar. He rescues a depressed, half-frozen Minnie. Pegleg Pierre comes storming in and steals her away, after a gun battle. A dogsled chase follows, with Pluto pulling Mickey''s sled. There''s a battle at Pete''s cabin that features a sequence with Pete and Mickey wearing bedsprings and bouncing. Meanwhile, Pluto, chasing a rabbit, makes a giant snowball that sends the cabin downhill and eventually traps Pete.', 'Mickey plays piano in the Klondike Bar. He rescues a depressed, half-frozen Minnie. Pegleg Pierre comes storming in and steals her away, after a gun battle. A dogsled chase follows, with Pluto pulling Mickey''s sled. There''s a battle at Pete''s cabin that features a sequence with Pete and Mickey wearing bedsprings and bouncing. Meanwhile, Pluto, chasing a rabbit, makes a giant snowball that sends the cabin downhill and eventually traps Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st8FAeaBj9LtVnuwSXVTwBqimKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156458'),
  ('899325242804464468', 'The Knack... and How to Get It', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Lester, David Watkin, Roy Millichip', 'Charles Wood', 'Rita Tushingham, Ray Brooks, Michael Crawford, Donal Donnelly, William Dexter, Charles Dyer, Margot Thomas, John Bluthal', null, 'A nebbish schoolteacher begs his smooth (and misogynistic) pal to teach him ''the knack'' – how to score with women. Serendipitously, the men meet up with a new girl in town, as well as a friendly lunatic who can’t help but paint things white.', 'A nebbish schoolteacher begs his smooth (and misogynistic) pal to teach him ''the knack'' – how to score with women. Serendipitously, the men meet up with a new girl in town, as well as a friendly lunatic who can’t help but paint things white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO2dJcCISY6lujaU4Qew3RzSErJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42744'),
  ('828480310572614302', 'The Kneeling Goddess', 1947, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Alex Phillips, James L. Fields', 'Tito Davison', 'María Félix, Arturo de Córdova, Rosario Granados, Fortunio Bonanova, Carlos Martínez Baena, Rafael Alcayde, Eduardo Casado, Luis Mussot', null, 'Antonio, a millionaire, gifts his wife a statue of a naked, kneeling woman for their wedding anniversary.', 'Antonio, a millionaire, gifts his wife a statue of a naked, kneeling woman for their wedding anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9kCPVcyLlFe9qqPxFE42seCXB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181081'),
  ('404214355747175555', 'The Knife', 1961, 'Drama', 'Fons Rademakers', 'Hugo Claus', 'Reitze van der Linden, Louise Videc, Ellen Vogel, Paul Camermans', null, 'A boy is resentful of his mother''s budding romance with the best friend of her late husband, and is torn and confused about his emerging feelings for Toni, a young girl in his neighborhood. His fascination with an antique Oriental knife leads him to steal it and he uses it to try to impress Toni while at the same time trying to break up his mother''s relationhip.', 'A boy is resentful of his mother''s budding romance with the best friend of her late husband, and is torn and confused about his emerging feelings for Toni, a young girl in his neighborhood. His fascination with an antique Oriental knife leads him to steal it and he uses it to try to impress Toni while at the same time trying to break up his mother''s relationhip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH7qOytGyQ57M978zT2SntSZxU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191054'),
  ('709917742968260284', 'The Knife', 1999, 'Drama', 'Miroslav Lekić', 'Vuk Drašković, Igor Bojović, Slobodan Stojanović', 'Žarko Laušević, Bojana Maljević, Aleksandar Berček, Ljiljana Blagojević, Petar Božović, Velimir Živojinović, Nikola Kojo, Josif Tatić', null, 'In attempt to find out who he is and where his roots lie, Alija Osmanović discovers something far deeper and more important. He slowly discovers an evil that follows him as his destiny regardless of what his ancestors were called. Trying to find the reasons for this evil, he finds himself in a vicious circle. Running away from an irrational fear within him, he eventually finds the road to his faith.', 'In attempt to find out who he is and where his roots lie, Alija Osmanović discovers something far deeper and more important. He slowly discovers an evil that follows him as his destiny regardless of what his ancestors were called. Trying to find the reasons for this evil, he finds himself in a vicious circle. Running away from an irrational fear within him, he eventually finds the road to his faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0Cdbn7asKIFp0ajFxQvYN3Bi5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51128'),
  ('39336122936758283', 'The Knight Before Christmas', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Monika Mitchell, Greg Gardiner, Stephen Bélanger', 'Cara J. Russell', 'Vanessa Hudgens, Josh Whitehouse, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Harry Jarvis, Ella Kenion, Isabelle Franca, Mimi Gianopulos, Jean-Michel Le Gal', null, 'A medieval English knight is magically transported to present day where he ends up falling for a high school science teacher.', 'A medieval English knight is magically transported to present day where he ends up falling for a high school science teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivymBQYzYqZoLhvgYg77gSzXKsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611207'),
  ('1009580180798969766', 'The Knight Didi and the Princess Lili', 2006, 'Family, Adventure', 'Marcus Figueiredo', 'Renato Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, Livian Aragão, Guilherme Berenguer, Camila Rodrigues, Vera Holtz, Werner Schünemann, Alexandre Zacchia, Sérgio Mamberti', null, 'This adventure movie features Didi as King''s Lindolfo groom and valet, a faithful servant to the royal family. After the King''s death, his evil brother Jafar tries to seize the throne. He plots for his son Galante to marry young princess Lili, but Didi won''t let him get away so easily with his plans. The clumsy valet fights bravely to keep the kingdom safe from Jafar, and he''s eager to do anything to help princess Lili and her childhood sweetheart Juan, who is a commoner, to be together.', 'This adventure movie features Didi as King''s Lindolfo groom and valet, a faithful servant to the royal family. After the King''s death, his evil brother Jafar tries to seize the throne. He plots for his son Galante to marry young princess Lili, but Didi won''t let him get away so easily with his plans. The clumsy valet fights bravely to keep the kingdom safe from Jafar, and he''s eager to do anything to help princess Lili and her childhood sweetheart Juan, who is a commoner, to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3ufh2NXLzfzLYfbX0pisDCocrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146538'),
