  ('377466575188472952', 'The Knight of Shadows: Between Yin and Yang', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yan Jia', 'Boham Liu', 'Jackie Chan, Zhong Chuxi, Ethan Juan, Austin Lin, Qiao Shan, Charles Luu, Lance Luu, Mark Luu', 'PG', 'Pu Songling, a legendary demon hunter, is asked to investigate the mysterious disappearances of young girls from a small village. When he discovers evil forces are kidnapping the girls to feast on their souls, he sets out to save humanity from the inhuman invasion journeying through hidden worlds and colorful dimensions.', 'Pu Songling, a legendary demon hunter, is asked to investigate the mysterious disappearances of young girls from a small village. When he discovers evil forces are kidnapping the girls to feast on their souls, he sets out to save humanity from the inhuman invasion journeying through hidden worlds and colorful dimensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2n0On0tEvlPiXVqajPYbPYJtn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512901'),
  ('850151244380367985', 'The Knight of the Snow', 1912, 'Adventure, Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'One of the last films Georges Méliès made. By now, he was under contract for his former rival Pathé, where he made a few of his most lavish productions, including this one. Here, Méliès performed in front of the camera as the Devil […]. His incarnation of Satan this time is a sprightly antagonist who kidnaps a princess by locking her in a cage and taking off through the sky in a dragon-pulled carriage. […]', 'One of the last films Georges Méliès made. By now, he was under contract for his former rival Pathé, where he made a few of his most lavish productions, including this one. Here, Méliès performed in front of the camera as the Devil […]. His incarnation of Satan this time is a sprightly antagonist who kidnaps a princess by locking her in a cage and taking off through the sky in a dragon-pulled carriage. […]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GhQ6FveRbqUba3lm6MrVjPjEVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193889'),
  ('993707781627734473', 'The Knights of the Round Bed', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Gerardo Sofovich', 'Gerardo Sofovich, Hugo Sofovich', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Mariquita Gallegos, Adolfo García Grau, Chico Novarro, Javier Portales, Tristán, Haydée Padilla', null, 'Alberto, Jorge, Ricardo and Tristan are employees of a shoe store, all are married and share the friendship also between their wives. The 4 friends, faithful to the rogue style of Buenos Aires, go out of their way to have love affairs with the beautiful customers of the shoe store, and for that purpose one day they decide to rent, secretly, an apartment to use as a "bulín". The problems begin from then on, as everyone wants to be the first to release it and then, successively, take turns for their adventures. As is to be expected, it does not take long for the first entanglements to appear, while their wives seem to begin to suspect the adventures of these four typical Buenos Aires chantas.', 'Alberto, Jorge, Ricardo and Tristan are employees of a shoe store, all are married and share the friendship also between their wives. The 4 friends, faithful to the rogue style of Buenos Aires, go out of their way to have love affairs with the beautiful customers of the shoe store, and for that purpose one day they decide to rent, secretly, an apartment to use as a "bulín". The problems begin from then on, as everyone wants to be the first to release it and then, successively, take turns for their adventures. As is to be expected, it does not take long for the first entanglements to appear, while their wives seem to begin to suspect the adventures of these four typical Buenos Aires chantas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ3ZNM7UnxUcfITM8VWwujYHY1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316071'),
  ('273676590055968149', 'The Knock Out Cop', 1973, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Steno, Silvano Ippoliti, Mino Giarda', 'Lucio De Caro', 'Bud Spencer, Adalberto Maria Merli, Raymond Pellegrin, Juliette Mayniel, Mario Pilar, Enzo Cannavale, Angelo Infanti, Jho Jhenkins', null, 'Inspector “Flatfoot” Rizzo investigates crime and corruption in Naples.', 'Inspector “Flatfoot” Rizzo investigates crime and corruption in Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAwumFuN4fi9At4cBfmQ25WjMhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11048'),
  ('985696554156585728', 'The Knocking', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joonas Pajunen, Max Seeck, Matti Eerikäinen', 'Max Seeck, Joonas Pajunen', 'Inka Kallén, Saana Koivisto, Pekka Strang, Janina Berman, Olga Temonen, Niko Saarela, Linnea Skog, Hilma Temonen', null, 'Three adult siblings return to their childhood home, where their parents were allegedly murdered many years ago. Their plan is to get the house and estate ready to be sold but an evil force tries to prevent them from doing so.', 'Three adult siblings return to their childhood home, where their parents were allegedly murdered many years ago. Their plan is to get the house and estate ready to be sold but an evil force tries to prevent them from doing so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrVCIJQLzGnqK76u9aEJyEcYuz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869523'),
  ('95876806964677731', 'The Knockout', 1914, 'Comedy', 'Mack Sennett, Frank D. Williams', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Minta Durfee, Edgar Kennedy, Charlie Chaplin, Al St. John, Dan Albert, Charles Avery, Joe Bordeaux', 'NR', 'To show his girl how brave he is, Pug challenges the champion to a fight. Charlie referees, trying to avoid contact with the two monsters.', 'To show his girl how brave he is, Pug challenges the champion to a fight. Charlie referees, trying to avoid contact with the two monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qmp5csuIU3w3hpTgr4N9SwDWqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53385'),
  ('229059651253564856', 'The Knot', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Yin Li, Wang Xiaolie', 'Liu Heng', 'Chen Kun, Vivian Hsu, Li Bingbing, Ronald Chin Han, Yang Kuei-mei, Gua Ah-leh, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Steven Cheung Chi-Hang', null, 'They fell in love; Chen Qiushui was 20. Wang Biyun was 18. When Qiushui fled Taiwan after the 228 Massacre, Biyun gave him a gold engagement ring and they promised to meet again. Qiushui served as an army doctor during the Korean War, where he met Wang Jindi, a nurse from Shanghai who fell in love with him instantly. Years had gone by, Qiushui married Jindi and settled in Tibet. While in Taiwan, Biyun buried Qiushui''s mother and continued to pray for his return. Flashback to modern time, Biyun is living in New York. Her niece played by Isabella Leong, a writer, has travelled to Tibet to find out what happened to Qiushui. Through the pictures she sends back via internet, Biyun finally gets to see the familiar face once again.', 'They fell in love; Chen Qiushui was 20. Wang Biyun was 18. When Qiushui fled Taiwan after the 228 Massacre, Biyun gave him a gold engagement ring and they promised to meet again. Qiushui served as an army doctor during the Korean War, where he met Wang Jindi, a nurse from Shanghai who fell in love with him instantly. Years had gone by, Qiushui married Jindi and settled in Tibet. While in Taiwan, Biyun buried Qiushui''s mother and continued to pray for his return. Flashback to modern time, Biyun is living in New York. Her niece played by Isabella Leong, a writer, has travelled to Tibet to find out what happened to Qiushui. Through the pictures she sends back via internet, Biyun finally gets to see the familiar face once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG11nQ8KaHdQYqDE69O1R1zKuxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206624'),
  ('133467552355579921', 'The Knowledge', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Bob Brooks', 'Jack Rosenthal', 'Mick Ford, Kim Taylforth, Nigel Hawthorne, Michael Elphick, David Ryall, Jonathan Lynn, Maureen Lipman, Lesley Joseph', null, 'Four men attempt "The Knowledge" examination to qualify as London taxi drivers.', 'Four men attempt "The Knowledge" examination to qualify as London taxi drivers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIhnZZ9GlEmvcMbgDosnSDtY6Uc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211195'),
  ('22070785687902895', 'The Kodai Family', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Masato Hijikata', 'Arisa Kaneko', 'Haruka Ayase, Takumi Saitoh, Kiko Mizuhara, Shotaro Mamiya, Mao Daichi, Masachika Ichimura, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Takuro Ohno', null, 'Kie Hirano is an ordinary OL who often daydreams. Mitsumasa Kodai at the same company as Kie Hirano, but he is an elite salaryman. He is the eldest son in the Kodai family and he is also telepathic. Mitsumasa Kodai got his special ability to read other people''s mind from his British grandmother. Mitsumasa becomes attracted to Kie''s warm heart and her dreamy temperament. They begin to date and enjoy their days together, but Mitsumasa Kodai''s mother calls.', 'Kie Hirano is an ordinary OL who often daydreams. Mitsumasa Kodai at the same company as Kie Hirano, but he is an elite salaryman. He is the eldest son in the Kodai family and he is also telepathic. Mitsumasa Kodai got his special ability to read other people''s mind from his British grandmother. Mitsumasa becomes attracted to Kie''s warm heart and her dreamy temperament. They begin to date and enjoy their days together, but Mitsumasa Kodai''s mother calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGJkmBUm2kMKYha770mbUAnD8pF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391642'),
  ('685197819827468757', 'The Kovak Box', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'Daniel Monzón, Carles Gusi', null, 'Timothy Hutton, Lucía Jiménez, David Kelly, Georgia Mackenzie, Gary Piquer, Annette Badland, Ana Asensio, Molly Malcolm', null, 'David Norton is used to being in control. As a best-selling author, he decides the fate of his characters, their lives and their deaths. But what happens when his fictional world becomes all too real?', 'David Norton is used to being in control. As a best-selling author, he decides the fate of his characters, their lives and their deaths. But what happens when his fictional world becomes all too real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUrutQD8Xaaf1byXupXDCVPq1lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13686'),
  ('886684140537292127', 'The Krays', 1990, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Peter Medak, Alex Thomson, Simon Moseley', 'Philip Ridley', 'Gary Kemp, Martin Kemp, Billie Whitelaw, Tom Bell, Susan Fleetwood, Charlotte Cornwell, Kate Hardie, Avis Bunnage', 'R', 'Twins Ronnie and Reggie Kray are raised in east London, under the influence of their hateful but doting mother Violet. As they grow up, Ronnie''s violent nature takes over, and Reggie follows his brother''s lead. The two become notorious crime lords who rule over the East End club scene. But at the height of their power, the brothers veer into different lives, giving the older crime bosses a chance to reclaim what the Krays took from them.', 'Twins Ronnie and Reggie Kray are raised in east London, under the influence of their hateful but doting mother Violet. As they grow up, Ronnie''s violent nature takes over, and Reggie follows his brother''s lead. The two become notorious crime lords who rule over the East End club scene. But at the height of their power, the brothers veer into different lives, giving the older crime bosses a chance to reclaim what the Krays took from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7GqmnQJRWXYs8Y8uXma6p7Amcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21344'),
  ('560914030696045323', 'The Kremlin Letter', 1970, 'Thriller, Action', 'John Huston, Edward Scaife', 'John Huston, Gladys Hill', 'Bibi Andersson, Patrick O''Neal, Richard Boone, Nigel Green, Dean Jagger, Lila Kedrova, Micheál Mac Liammóir, Barbara Parkins', 'PG', 'After an unauthorized letter suggesting U.S. support for a Russian attack on China is sent to Moscow, a former naval officer and his team go undercover to retrieve it. Their plans are disrupted when a cunning politician raids their hideout.', 'After an unauthorized letter suggesting U.S. support for a Russian attack on China is sent to Moscow, a former naval officer and his team go undercover to retrieve it. Their plans are disrupted when a cunning politician raids their hideout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSxhK4AJTupQIiODuhfxR2YqUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45817'),
  ('1082897665265889884', 'The Kreutzer Sonata', 1956, 'Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Roland Sarver, Jacques Rivette', null, 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Éric Rohmer, Françoise Martinelli, Jean-Luc Godard, André Bazin, Charles L. Bitsch, Claude Chabrol, Marc Laferrière', null, 'Some time after marrying a sensual girl, Pozdnychev realizes the only link to his spouse is that of physical love. When a violinist with whom his wife plays regularly the “Sonata to Kreutzer” appears, the young woman blooms in a new passion. From then on, her husband is eaten away by jealousy.', 'Some time after marrying a sensual girl, Pozdnychev realizes the only link to his spouse is that of physical love. When a violinist with whom his wife plays regularly the “Sonata to Kreutzer” appears, the young woman blooms in a new passion. From then on, her husband is eaten away by jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zAixEsFiWarNKXRMv93xiAc40Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256105'),
  ('955946481920207016', 'The Kung Fu Instructor', 1979, 'Action', 'Sun Chung, Man Man, Lam Nai-Choi', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Wong Yu, Ku Feng, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Ai Fei, Chiang Tao, Shum Lo', null, 'Two rival clans have unsuccessfully tried to hire the master of the good clan to teach his clan. Not willing to take no for an answer, they frame the master for a dirty deed that he didn''t commit, which forces him to kill a man in battle. The townspeople attempt to kill him and he is forced to flee to the evil clan.', 'Two rival clans have unsuccessfully tried to hire the master of the good clan to teach his clan. Not willing to take no for an answer, they frame the master for a dirty deed that he didn''t commit, which forces him to kill a man in battle. The townspeople attempt to kill him and he is forced to flee to the evil clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIySYg3MBIJ4f0IVUOfiEeXYyUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141138'),
  ('966039711504847810', 'The Kung Fu Kids II', 1986, 'Action', 'Chen Chi-Hwa', 'Chin-jing Chou, Ku Yun Sin', 'Chen Hui-Lou, Tso Shiao-Hu, Dick Wei', null, 'Get set for more kung foolery with everybody''s favorite warrior waifs! After being trained as unbeatable kung fu fighters by their cantankerous grandpa, the three kung fu kids move to the big city and become adored media stars. Then they discover the nice old lady who took them in is actually their gradma herself a magical kung fu master! So, when grandpa shows up to claim the kids, granny challenges the old man to a hilarious, no holds barred battle to decide once and for all who''s champ. Join the high kickin, special effects filled fun and adventure with the Young Dragons in Young Dragons The Kung Fu Kids II', 'Get set for more kung foolery with everybody''s favorite warrior waifs! After being trained as unbeatable kung fu fighters by their cantankerous grandpa, the three kung fu kids move to the big city and become adored media stars. Then they discover the nice old lady who took them in is actually their gradma herself a magical kung fu master! So, when grandpa shows up to claim the kids, granny challenges the old man to a hilarious, no holds barred battle to decide once and for all who''s champ. Join the high kickin, special effects filled fun and adventure with the Young Dragons in Young Dragons The Kung Fu Kids II', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIgijdmVlxeR2DaVe9jZeLNVinY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266874'),
  ('669240715561405640', 'The Kunoichi: Ninja Girl', 2011, 'Action, History', 'Seiji Chiba, Kensuke Sonomura', null, 'Rina Takeda, Mayu Onomura, Shiho Fujisawa, Kotono, Mitsuki Koga, Kentarō Shimazu, Masanori Mimoto', null, 'In 16th century feudal Japan the war between the Iga clan and the Kouga clan continues unabated. Typically for such violent disputes it is the women who suffer the most – in this case lowly castrated Kouga clan ninjas are kidnapping woman from their rivals’ lands and transporting them back to their own, with the intent to use them as concubines. Unfortunately for a trio of inept Kouga ninjas, one of the women they’ve kidnapped is Kisaragi (Rina Takeda), a skilled ninja with a long standing vendetta since her mother was kidnapped when she was just a baby.', 'In 16th century feudal Japan the war between the Iga clan and the Kouga clan continues unabated. Typically for such violent disputes it is the women who suffer the most – in this case lowly castrated Kouga clan ninjas are kidnapping woman from their rivals’ lands and transporting them back to their own, with the intent to use them as concubines. Unfortunately for a trio of inept Kouga ninjas, one of the women they’ve kidnapped is Kisaragi (Rina Takeda), a skilled ninja with a long standing vendetta since her mother was kidnapped when she was just a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQyBX04OoRPqG1sAc1USP9Fr5ii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96077'),
  ('117894644593622582', 'The Kyoto Connection', 1973, 'Drama, Action', 'Sadao Nakajima', 'Sadao Nakajima, Takeo Kaneko', 'Christina Lindberg, Ichiro Araki, Masaharu Arikawa, Yurie Hidaka, Takuzō Kawatani, Masataka Iwao', null, 'Christina, on arriving in Japan, acquaints a Japanese man at the airport who looks like a sap. He takes her to his apartment where he brutally rapes her and keeps her hostage and bound in chains. Christina''s alluring beauty eventually enchants the rapist and he is soon consulting his ''How to Stimulate a Woman'' sex book in an effort to please her...', 'Christina, on arriving in Japan, acquaints a Japanese man at the airport who looks like a sap. He takes her to his apartment where he brutally rapes her and keeps her hostage and bound in chains. Christina''s alluring beauty eventually enchants the rapist and he is soon consulting his ''How to Stimulate a Woman'' sex book in an effort to please her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYnIGu8jCUb8FEoqicQjxdCoK4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76942'),
  ('955973403146304181', 'The L-Shaped Room', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bryan Forbes, Douglas Slocombe, John Quested', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Leslie Caron, Tom Bell, Brock Peters, Bernard Lee, Avis Bunnage, Patricia Phoenix, Cicely Courtneidge, Verity Edmett', null, 'Jane is young, French, pregnant and unmarried. Bucking convention, she is uninterested in settling with her baby''s father or getting an abortion. After renting a room in a dingy London boarding house, Jane befriends the odd group of inhabitants and starts an affair with one boarder, Toby. As Jane''s pregnancy threatens her new relationship, and the reality of single motherhood approaches, she is forced to decide what to do about both her baby and her budding romance.', 'Jane is young, French, pregnant and unmarried. Bucking convention, she is uninterested in settling with her baby''s father or getting an abortion. After renting a room in a dingy London boarding house, Jane befriends the odd group of inhabitants and starts an affair with one boarder, Toby. As Jane''s pregnancy threatens her new relationship, and the reality of single motherhood approaches, she is forced to decide what to do about both her baby and her budding romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie8EArW3CjO2gLMYtJEMLU4CAQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76000'),
  ('1023585982447656123', 'The Labyrinth', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Song Woon, Kim Dong-cheon', 'Ha Kyung-jin, Jeon Seong-soo', 'Kang Chan-hee, Park You-na, Jang Kwang, Lee Hye-Ran, Song Ji-oh', null, 'A fantasy horror movie about high school students struggling to save their friends from evil spirits that are causing strange phenomena late at night at their school. Hee Min is the heir of the greatest exorcist in Korea, who is not yet aware of his own powers. So Young is a girl who is keeping a secret about the curse that is afflicting their school.', 'A fantasy horror movie about high school students struggling to save their friends from evil spirits that are causing strange phenomena late at night at their school. Hee Min is the heir of the greatest exorcist in Korea, who is not yet aware of his own powers. So Young is a girl who is keeping a secret about the curse that is afflicting their school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unwIxyxinKI6qAoWnsyZCvMB62y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850805'),
  ('1053925497306395128', 'The Labyrinth of Grisaia', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Thriller', 'Motoki Tanaka, Jin Aketagawa, Yuya Kumazawa', null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Akane Tomonaga, Satoshi Tsuruoka, Natsumi Yanase, Hiroko Taguchi, Kei Mizusawa, Erika Narumi', null, 'Yuuji makes the unexpected decision to pursue promotion within the institution he works for. He meets with JB to discuss the documents he submitted for review as a part of the promotion process, documents pertaining to his own past.', 'Yuuji makes the unexpected decision to pursue promotion within the institution he works for. He meets with JB to discuss the documents he submitted for review as a part of the promotion process, documents pertaining to his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFEA6f7Gw6NEmLGHvqyIBQDloCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335659'),
  ('568695781627687916', 'The Labyrinth of Love', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe D''Amato', 'Leslie Wong', 'Monica Carpanese, Steven Rogers, Lora Luna, Mike Monty, Muriel Lim, Ricky Jonez, Liezl Santos', null, 'Valerie, a maid of French descent (Monica Seller), comes to work for a family in Saigon of the 1930s/40s. One by one, she seduces the members of the family: the dame de la maison, the widower, young gay sonny with his friend from university, and grandpa.', 'Valerie, a maid of French descent (Monica Seller), comes to work for a family in Saigon of the 1930s/40s. One by one, she seduces the members of the family: the dame de la maison, the widower, young gay sonny with his friend from university, and grandpa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8sTu91Z91nDSH9Tsfzx4MCtcI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396362'),
  ('628368953602296177', 'The Lacemaker', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Goretta, Jean Boffety, Laurent Ferrier', 'Claude Goretta', 'Isabelle Huppert, Yves Beneyton, Florence Giorgetti, Renate Schroeter, Annemarie Düringer, Michel de Ré, Monique Chaumette, Jean Obé', null, 'Pomme is a meek and mild French beautician whose life takes a fateful turn during a vacation to Normandy. She becomes the lover of middle-class literature-student François. The relationship sours when François takes her home to meet his parents, thanks in no small part to their differing social backgrounds.', 'Pomme is a meek and mild French beautician whose life takes a fateful turn during a vacation to Normandy. She becomes the lover of middle-class literature-student François. The relationship sours when François takes her home to meet his parents, thanks in no small part to their differing social backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aW7jaQr0TtijQfRauxXcG9wG4aS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56935'),
  ('992979050220944457', 'The Ladies Club', 1986, 'Horror, Drama, Crime', 'Janet Greek, Adam Greenberg', 'Fran Lewis Ebeling, Paul Mason', 'Karen Austin, Diana Scarwid, Christine Belford, Bruce Davison, Shera Danese, Beverly Todd, Marilyn Kagan, Kit McDonough', 'R', 'A policewoman who was raped forms a vigilante group of various rape victims. They abduct and castrate men who have committed repeated violations of women and gotten away with it through legal technicalities.', 'A policewoman who was raped forms a vigilante group of various rape victims. They abduct and castrate men who have committed repeated violations of women and gotten away with it through legal technicalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXPmpO7OCpQknNRRMNXeav1EJk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159031'),
  ('224987699675977439', 'The Ladies Get Their Say', 2009, 'Drama', 'Enzo Monteleone, Matteo Albano', 'Cristina Comencini', 'Margherita Buy, Isabella Ferrari, Marina Massironi, Paola Cortellesi, Carolina Crescentini, Valeria Milillo, Claudia Pandolfi, Alba Rohrwacher', null, 'Every Thursday a group of ladies would gather to play cards and discuss their loves, lives and children while their daughters played in the next room. Thirty years later, the daughters meet at a funeral for one of the mothers. Like their mothers, they discuss their hopes, dreams and fears.', 'Every Thursday a group of ladies would gather to play cards and discuss their loves, lives and children while their daughters played in the next room. Thirty years later, the daughters meet at a funeral for one of the mothers. Like their mothers, they discuss their hopes, dreams and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egYT29RiP72xlmLD0FKWiuAdVDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58714'),
  ('74834719114469033', 'The Ladies Man', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Bill Richmond, Jerry Lewis, Mel Brooks', 'Jerry Lewis, Helen Traubel, Pat Stanley, Kathleen Freeman, George Raft, Harry James, Marty Ingels, Buddy Lester', 'NR', 'After his girl leaves him for someone else, Herbert gets really depressed and starts searching for a job. He finally finds one in a big house which is inhabited by many, many women. Can he live in the same home with all these females?', 'After his girl leaves him for someone else, Herbert gets really depressed and starts searching for a job. He finally finds one in a big house which is inhabited by many, many women. Can he live in the same home with all these females?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c15TotHYrXPZSzjZCBfbup3fz4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28333'),
  ('756454897708757273', 'The Ladies Man', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Reginald Hudlin, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Tim Meadows, Harper Steele, Dennis McNicholas', 'Tim Meadows, Karyn Parsons, Billy Dee Williams, John Witherspoon, Jill Talley, Lee Evans, Will Ferrell, Sofia Milos', 'R', 'Because of his salacious language, late-night radio advice-show host Leon Phelps, along with his sweet and loyal producer Julie, is fired from his Chicago gig. Leon gets a letter from a former lover promising a life of wealth, but he doesn''t know who she is. Can Leon find his secret sugar-mama? What about Julie?', 'Because of his salacious language, late-night radio advice-show host Leon Phelps, along with his sweet and loyal producer Julie, is fired from his Chicago gig. Leon gets a letter from a former lover promising a life of wealth, but he doesn''t know who she is. Can Leon find his secret sugar-mama? What about Julie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKMhGSwydCVjrOWwggDlSvcgzCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16888'),
  ('412085806486308660', 'The Lady', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast', 'Rebecca Frayn', 'Susan Wooldridge, Michelle Yeoh, David Thewlis, Jonathan Raggett, Jonathan Woodhouse, Benedict Wong, Htun Lin, Agga Poechit', 'R', 'The story of Aung San Suu Kyi as she becomes the core of Burma''s democracy movement, and her relationship with her husband, writer Michael Aris.', 'The story of Aung San Suu Kyi as she becomes the core of Burma''s democracy movement, and her relationship with her husband, writer Michael Aris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAtFlDKS7VP1EQ3nGs8Rv2GUuTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77878'),
  ('536107085554274948', 'The Lady and the Beard', 1931, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara, Akira Kiyosuke', 'Lex Neal', 'Tokihiko Okada, Hiroko Kawasaki, Chōko Iida, Satoko Date, Ichirō Tsukida, Toshiko Iizuka, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Takeshi Sakamoto', null, 'Graduate Okajima finds his old-fashioned beard makes life difficult in a comedy exploring the tension between tradition and modernity.', 'Graduate Okajima finds his old-fashioned beard makes life difficult in a comedy exploring the tension between tradition and modernity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evVF36mxvTuenWaSicyjYvB0HCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88270'),
  ('1012767531487406302', 'The Lady and the Duke', 2001, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Éric Rohmer, Diane Baratier', 'Éric Rohmer, Éric Rohmer, Grace Elliott', 'Lucy Russell, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Rosette, Marie Rivière, Charlotte Véry, Léonard Cobiant, François Marthouret, Caroline Morin', 'PG-13', 'Grace Dalrymple Elliot is a British aristocrat trapped in Paris during the French Revolution. Determined to maintain her stiff upper lip and pampered life despite the upheaval, Grace continues her friendship with the Duke of Orléans while risking her life and liberty to protect a fugitive.', 'Grace Dalrymple Elliot is a British aristocrat trapped in Paris during the French Revolution. Determined to maintain her stiff upper lip and pampered life despite the upheaval, Grace continues her friendship with the Duke of Orléans while risking her life and liberty to protect a fugitive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKKrgVngsgJPVVKuh3GjWugQPbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2894'),
  ('918814368223471932', 'The Lady and the Highwayman', 1988, 'Action, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'John Hough, Terry Cole', 'Terence Feely', 'Emma Samms, Oliver Reed, Claire Bloom, Christopher Cazenove, Hugh Grant, Lysette Anthony, Michael York, John Mills', null, 'During one of his robberies, a highwayman, who steals from the rich and gives to the poor, falls in love with an aristocratic lady. Now, he is forced to choose between his true love or his true cause.', 'During one of his robberies, a highwayman, who steals from the rich and gives to the poor, falls in love with an aristocratic lady. Now, he is forced to choose between his true love or his true cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Fz0SNFjhch7zWnZpLqu6Z5quMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59171'),
