  ('647521001267913451', 'The Lady and the Reaper', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Javier Recio Garcia', 'Javier Recio Garcia', null, null, 'A sweet old lady is living alone in her farm, waiting for the arrival of death to meet her beloved husband again. One night, while sleeping, her life fades out and she is invited to cross death''s door. Bue when she is about to do so, the old lady wakes up inside a hospital''s ward, as an arrogant doctor has taken her back to life and he will fight hard against death to recover the old lady''s life at any cost.', 'A sweet old lady is living alone in her farm, waiting for the arrival of death to meet her beloved husband again. One night, while sleeping, her life fades out and she is invited to cross death''s door. Bue when she is about to do so, the old lady wakes up inside a hospital''s ward, as an arrogant doctor has taken her back to life and he will fight hard against death to recover the old lady''s life at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBSeKa7RR4Ry48JvRVwi3Dc9KKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62967'),
  ('555330086248093274', 'The Lady and the Tramp', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Angelos Sideratos', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Petros Lohaitis, Floretta Zana, Eleni Zafeiriou, Joly Garbi, Nikos Rizos', null, 'Rena’s father insists on marrying her off to the son of a shipowner. Rena, however, doesn’t even want to hear about it, so she runs away and disguises herself as a boy named Pipis. As such, she meets a poor fisherman, Lefteris, and helps him on his way to Ioannina.', 'Rena’s father insists on marrying her off to the son of a shipowner. Rena, however, doesn’t even want to hear about it, so she runs away and disguises herself as a boy named Pipis. As such, she meets a poor fisherman, Lefteris, and helps him on his way to Ioannina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGDkBD2ucutmUnubpdA7Uvdg7Oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301494'),
  ('104765024133242747', 'The Lady Assassin', 1983, 'Action', 'Philip Ma Kam-Cheung, Tony Lou Chun-Ku', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku', 'Tony Liu Tian-jue, Leanne Liu, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Jason Pai Piao, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Ku Feng, Cheung King-Yu, Richard Yuen Tak', null, 'Veteran action actor and director Lu Chun-ku set his sights on a tale of Ching Dynasty royal intrigue as an excuse to hire his favorite action stars, gather three choreographers, and film one fight-filled conspiracy after another. Liu Hsueh-hua is the title character caught between battling princes. Then there''s award-winning actor Ku Feng, "Bastard Swordsman" Hsu Shao-chiang, "King of Shaw Brothers'' Screen Villains" Wang Lung-wei, "Venom" Sun Chien, and even the director shows up to get his kicks in this danger-fraught adventure.', 'Veteran action actor and director Lu Chun-ku set his sights on a tale of Ching Dynasty royal intrigue as an excuse to hire his favorite action stars, gather three choreographers, and film one fight-filled conspiracy after another. Liu Hsueh-hua is the title character caught between battling princes. Then there''s award-winning actor Ku Feng, "Bastard Swordsman" Hsu Shao-chiang, "King of Shaw Brothers'' Screen Villains" Wang Lung-wei, "Venom" Sun Chien, and even the director shows up to get his kicks in this danger-fraught adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoPUdTUAFXrvdGkNq7mzn3r2emz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66977'),
  ('124279637241321302', 'The Lady Banker', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bernard Zitzermann, Francis Girod', 'Francis Girod, Georges Conchon', 'Romy Schneider, Marie-France Pisier, Claude Brasseur, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jean Carmet, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Jacques Fabbri, Daniel Mesguich', null, 'Ambitious Emma Eckhert successfully makes her way into a world previously reserved for men: that of high finance. She quickly becomes popular with small savers, but leads a scandalous life that will cost her.', 'Ambitious Emma Eckhert successfully makes her way into a world previously reserved for men: that of high finance. She quickly becomes popular with small savers, but leads a scandalous life that will cost her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scH4ltzCx8DqqB5AXERbQdq22Ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4370'),
  ('808168715999636876', 'The Lady Confesses', 1945, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Sam Newfield, Jack Greenhalgh, Harold E. Knox', 'Helen Martin', 'Mary Beth Hughes, Hugh Beaumont, Edmund MacDonald, Claudia Drake, Emmett Vogan, Barbara Slater, Edward Howard, Dewey Robinson', 'NR', 'An estranged wife shows up after a nearly 7 years of disappearance -- thought to be dead, to prevent her husband from marrying his new love until someone kills her.', 'An estranged wife shows up after a nearly 7 years of disappearance -- thought to be dead, to prevent her husband from marrying his new love until someone kills her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XpyEfyJcR5GKYtNKL7GtSLlJzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48286'),
  ('1091561293033726729', 'The Lady Eve', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Preston Sturges, Victor Milner, Barton Adams', 'Preston Sturges', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Henry Fonda, Charles Coburn, Eugene Pallette, William Demarest, Eric Blore, Melville Cooper, Martha O''Driscoll', null, 'It''s no accident when wealthy Charles falls for Jean. Jean is a con artist with her sights set on Charles'' fortune. Matters complicate when Jean starts falling for her mark. When Charles suspects Jean is a gold digger, he dumps her. Jean, fixated on revenge and still pining for the millionaire, devises a plan to get back in Charles'' life. With love and payback on her mind, she re-introduces herself to Charles, this time as an aristocrat named Lady Eve Sidwich.', 'It''s no accident when wealthy Charles falls for Jean. Jean is a con artist with her sights set on Charles'' fortune. Matters complicate when Jean starts falling for her mark. When Charles suspects Jean is a gold digger, he dumps her. Jean, fixated on revenge and still pining for the millionaire, devises a plan to get back in Charles'' life. With love and payback on her mind, she re-introduces herself to Charles, this time as an aristocrat named Lady Eve Sidwich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJYD3CMgKtv12hazSHc7xt3i2uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3086'),
  ('996808657204431119', 'The Lady from Shanghai', 1947, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson, Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles', 'Rita Hayworth, Orson Welles, Everett Sloane, Glenn Anders, Ted de Corsia, Erskine Sanford, Gus Schilling, Carl Frank', null, 'A romantic drifter gets caught between a corrupt tycoon and his voluptuous wife.', 'A romantic drifter gets caught between a corrupt tycoon and his voluptuous wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whqdqWavNMSoeXTx1X3DauO1LG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3766'),
  ('2227470170361836', 'The Lady from the Shanghai Cinema', 1987, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Guilherme de Almeida Prado, Cláudio Portioli, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Guilherme de Almeida Prado', 'Maitê Proença, Antônio Fagundes, José Mayer, Paulo Villaça, José Lewgoy, Miguel Falabella, Jorge Dória, Sérgio Mamberti', null, 'After meeting a beguiling woman in a movie theater, a realtor becomes embroiled in a mysterious plot involving murder, double identities and movies.', 'After meeting a beguiling woman in a movie theater, a realtor becomes embroiled in a mysterious plot involving murder, double identities and movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnE6dduy7oec66jqws6zE2Zo34l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70147'),
  ('564265005844714532', 'The Lady Gambles', 1949, 'Drama', 'Russell Metty, Michael Gordon, Frank Shaw', 'Roy Huggins', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Robert Preston, Stephen McNally, Edith Barrett, John Hoyt, Elliott Sullivan, John Harmon, Philip Van Zandt', 'NR', 'When Joan Boothe accompanies husband-reporter David to Las Vegas, she begins gambling to pass the time while he is doing a story. Encouraged by the casino manager, she gets hooked on gambling, to the point where she "borrows" David''s expense money to pursue her addiction. This finally breaks up their marriage, but David continues trying to help her.', 'When Joan Boothe accompanies husband-reporter David to Las Vegas, she begins gambling to pass the time while he is doing a story. Encouraged by the casino manager, she gets hooked on gambling, to the point where she "borrows" David''s expense money to pursue her addiction. This finally breaks up their marriage, but David continues trying to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFEGxjrXUjGn2spUfwrQ30XWQ0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36376'),
  ('351821382115296514', 'The Lady Hermit', 1971, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Yeh Shen, Lam Kwok-Cheung', 'Yip Yat-Fong', 'Cheng Pei-Pei, Lo Lieh, Shih Szu, Wang Hsieh, Chao Hsiung, Chuan Yuan, Fang Mian, Cliff Lok', null, 'A young Kung Fu student seeks a reclusive teacher so that she may learn to defeat the evil Black Demon. She doesn''t realize that the servant woman she befriends is actually the kung fu master she seeks. After Black Demons henchmen attack, the master reveals herself and eventually takes on the student to train her so that they may both defeat the villain. A love triangle complicates things when another student asks for training as well.', 'A young Kung Fu student seeks a reclusive teacher so that she may learn to defeat the evil Black Demon. She doesn''t realize that the servant woman she befriends is actually the kung fu master she seeks. After Black Demons henchmen attack, the master reveals herself and eventually takes on the student to train her so that they may both defeat the villain. A love triangle complicates things when another student asks for training as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BYHJw5DQo2g37l2C0caHE1TgUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40486'),
  ('937050865490866102', 'The Lady Improper', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jessey Tsang Tsui-shan, Becky Leung Suet-Ying, Hammer Chui Yuk-Sin', 'Jessey Tsang Tsui-shan, Link Sng', 'Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Wu Kang-ren, Cynthia Ho, Ashina Kwok, Alex Lam Tak-Shun, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Deep Ng Ho-Hong, Sham Ka-Ki', null, 'A woman with a seemingly ideal life, Siu Man is abandoned by her husband partly due to her fear of intimacy. After several life crises, she decides to reboot her life by taking over her father’s restaurant. Siu Man eventually finds herself attracted to her new chef, a free spirit who treats cooking as serious philosophy. Tired of the shackles she placed on herself, Siu Man embarks on a journey of self-discovery and sexual liberation.', 'A woman with a seemingly ideal life, Siu Man is abandoned by her husband partly due to her fear of intimacy. After several life crises, she decides to reboot her life by taking over her father’s restaurant. Siu Man eventually finds herself attracted to her new chef, a free spirit who treats cooking as serious philosophy. Tired of the shackles she placed on herself, Siu Man embarks on a journey of self-discovery and sexual liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BcPyI6cQnD6AQJcnfolChxG2kp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569037'),
  ('1029312273411405317', 'The Lady in Black', 1958, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Arne Mattsson, Sven Nykvist', 'Folke Mellvig, Lars Widding', 'Karl-Arne Holmsten, Annalisa Ericson, Nils Hallberg, Anita Björk, Sven Lindberg, Isa Quensel, Lena Granhagen, Sif Ruud', null, 'The married detective couple John and Kajsa Hillman goes on a vacation to Holmfors mill where a friend of Kajsa''s lives with her husband. When a young woman is found murdered it is clear that this is another case for the Hillmans.', 'The married detective couple John and Kajsa Hillman goes on a vacation to Holmfors mill where a friend of Kajsa''s lives with her husband. When a young woman is found murdered it is clear that this is another case for the Hillmans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTbFN052n9GXudJZucchrzwZrD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74569'),
  ('833028563432684138', 'The Lady in Question', 1940, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Charles Vidor, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Jan Lustig', 'Brian Aherne, Rita Hayworth, Glenn Ford, Irene Rich, George Coulouris, Lloyd Corrigan, Evelyn Keyes, Edward Norris', 'NR', 'When a jury member takes in the defendant he couldn''t convict, she has a bad influence on his son.', 'When a jury member takes in the defendant he couldn''t convict, she has a bad influence on his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6chs1m8taCibvVTVaNrEmmGHyKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56598'),
  ('841187745267222302', 'The Lady in Red', 1979, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Drama', 'Lewis Teague, Daniel Lacambre', 'John Sayles', 'Pamela Sue Martin, Robert Conrad, Louise Fletcher, Robert Hogan, Laurie Heineman, Glenn Withrow, Rod Gist, Peter Hobbs', 'R', 'A farm girl''s life turns upside down after she moves to Chicago and becomes trapped in a vicious cycle of prostitution and crime.', 'A farm girl''s life turns upside down after she moves to Chicago and becomes trapped in a vicious cycle of prostitution and crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6By21xOmC2JfEnco2WFWDrDGsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39771'),
  ('951141996212424741', 'The Lady in the Car with Glasses and a Gun', 1970, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Claude Renoir, Anatole Litvak, Francis Pernet', null, 'Samantha Eggar, Oliver Reed, Stéphane Audran, John McEnery, Bernard Fresson, Yves Pignot, Marcel Bozzuffi, Jacques Fabbri', null, 'Dany Longo is red-haired, beautiful, disturbed, passionate--and nearsighted. As she speeds through the south of France in a purloined Thunderbird on an errand for her employer and his wife, no one, including Dany herself, knows where she is headed--or why she is going there.', 'Dany Longo is red-haired, beautiful, disturbed, passionate--and nearsighted. As she speeds through the south of France in a purloined Thunderbird on an errand for her employer and his wife, no one, including Dany herself, knows where she is headed--or why she is going there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZAgtHIszX5W22jNxKwmR1yMYKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5953'),
  ('1019974581043972586', 'The Lady in the Car with Glasses and a Gun', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Manuel Dacosse, Joann Sfar', 'Gilles Marchand, Patrick Godeau', 'Freya Mavor, Stacy Martin, Benjamin Biolay, Elio Germano, Thierry Hancisse, Sandrine Laroche, Frederic Etherlinck, François-Dominique Blin', null, 'She’s the most beautiful, most short-sighted, most sentimental, most perplexing, most obstinate, most untrustworthy and most troubling of heroines. The lady in the car has never seen the sea. On the run from the police, she keeps telling herself that she’s not crazy… Only...', 'She’s the most beautiful, most short-sighted, most sentimental, most perplexing, most obstinate, most untrustworthy and most troubling of heroines. The lady in the car has never seen the sea. On the run from the police, she keeps telling herself that she’s not crazy… Only...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXSL3rD2BKcUMACoh8tA6LKyEW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330298'),
  ('908847847974451277', 'The Lady in the Portrait', 2017, 'Drama', 'Charles de Meaux, Charles de Meaux, Dong Jinsong', 'Charles de Meaux, Michel Fessler', 'Melvil Poupaud, Fan Bingbing, Wu Yue, King Shih-chieh, Huang Jue, Thibault de Montalembert, Féodor Atkine, Li Ruixue', null, 'An empress commissions a painting of herself from a French outsider in hopes of stirring her husband''s interest in this lavish period piece. The Lady in the Portrait is a period yarn evoking the unique rapport between a French missionary and the Manchurian Empress whose portrait he''s ordered to paint.', 'An empress commissions a painting of herself from a French outsider in hopes of stirring her husband''s interest in this lavish period piece. The Lady in the Portrait is a period yarn evoking the unique rapport between a French missionary and the Manchurian Empress whose portrait he''s ordered to paint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JSPK70f4c2T5GTJLFGWfLFt4tN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480647'),
  ('745964096957764151', 'The Lady in the Van', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicholas Hytner, Andrew Dunn', 'Alan Bennett', 'Maggie Smith, Alex Jennings, Frances de la Tour, Gwen Taylor, Dominic Cooper, James Corden, Roger Allam, Samuel Anderson', 'PG-13', 'The true story of the relationship between Alan Bennett and the singular Miss Shepherd, a woman of uncertain origins who ‘temporarily’ parked her van in Bennett’s London driveway and proceeded to live there for 15 years.', 'The true story of the relationship between Alan Bennett and the singular Miss Shepherd, a woman of uncertain origins who ‘temporarily’ parked her van in Bennett’s London driveway and proceeded to live there for 15 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqz4CGInI1bysFH674HYWtQSmYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328589'),
  ('847613219096977413', 'The Lady is the Boss', 1983, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang, Huang Pa-Ching', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Lee Tai-Hang, Huang Pa-Ching', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Ku Feng, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Cheung Chin-Pang, Hsiao Ho, Wong Yu, Robert Mak Tak-Law', null, 'Wong Hsia Yuan is an old-fashioned martial arts master who''s so behind the times that he''d rather his school be destroyed than change its ways. He may get his wish, thanks to the young, beautiful, intelligent Chan Mei Ling, who arrives from the states to open a new branch of the school. Armed with an unfamiliar, modern way of thinking, Mei Ling goes about recruiting new students in strange, and sometimes questionably legal ways. Yuan is furious, but when the local triads enter the picture, the two put their differences aside to take back the neighborhood.', 'Wong Hsia Yuan is an old-fashioned martial arts master who''s so behind the times that he''d rather his school be destroyed than change its ways. He may get his wish, thanks to the young, beautiful, intelligent Chan Mei Ling, who arrives from the states to open a new branch of the school. Armed with an unfamiliar, modern way of thinking, Mei Ling goes about recruiting new students in strange, and sometimes questionably legal ways. Yuan is furious, but when the local triads enter the picture, the two put their differences aside to take back the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gESyoSjTiGIqsU4fLQDAiQ7FELy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124326'),
  ('121243037082081957', 'The Lady Medic', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Nando Cicero, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Nando Cicero, Francesco Milizia', 'Edwige Fenech, Alvaro Vitali, Alfredo Pea, Carlo Delle Piane, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Mario Carotenuto, Guerrino Crivello, Angelo Pellegrino', null, 'A man is desperately trying to avoid mandated military service, but a sexy medic proves to be his undoing.', 'A man is desperately trying to avoid mandated military service, but a sexy medic proves to be his undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmPaCxAvfT3fmS2K812bslUjxUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127748'),
  ('268513626595721196', 'The Lady of Heaven', 2021, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Mike Brewster, Sarah Trevis, Mark Roper', 'Sheikh Al-Habib', 'Ray Fearon, Yasmin Mwanza, Lucas Bond, Christopher Sciueref, Oscar Salem, Chris Jarman, Matthew Brenher, Mark Anthony Brighton', 'R', 'Two stories separated by 1400 years. After losing his mother in the midst of a war-torn country, an Iraqi child learns the importance and power of patience by discovering the historical story of Lady Fatima and her suffering.', 'Two stories separated by 1400 years. After losing his mother in the midst of a war-torn country, an Iraqi child learns the importance and power of patience by discovering the historical story of Lady Fatima and her suffering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7pZEzOKDGalpH5fTWZnVO9yKLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748618'),
  ('608242482542726189', 'The Lady of Monza', 1969, 'Drama', 'Eriprando Visconti', 'Eriprando Visconti, Giampiero Bona', 'Anne Heywood, Hardy Krüger, Antonio Sabàto, Luigi Pistilli, Carla Gravina, Anna Maria Alegiani, Margarita Lozano, Giovanna Galletti', null, 'A true story taken from the archives of the archdiocese of Milan. Based on the life of Marianna De Leyva, better known as "The Nun of Monza," a 17th century nun accused of and tried by the church for breaking celibacy and plotting murder.', 'A true story taken from the archives of the archdiocese of Milan. Based on the life of Marianna De Leyva, better known as "The Nun of Monza," a 17th century nun accused of and tried by the church for breaking celibacy and plotting murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr2VZgBQWvqGCkLb1PQStSIpDPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124395'),
  ('78731463189178660', 'The Lady of Musashino', 1951, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Shigeaki Hidaka, Masao Tamai', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Yukiko Todoroki, Masayuki Mori, Akihiko Katayama, So Yamamura, Eitarō Shindō, Kiyoko Hirai, Minako Nakamura', null, 'In post-war Japan, Michiko, a disillusioned young woman trapped in a loveless marriage, confides in her younger cousin, Tsutomo, and the two become close, but decide not to consummate their affair. He instead becomes involved with the flirtatious Tomiko, who is also conducting an affair with Michiko''s husband. When Michiko finds that her husband has abandoned her, she decides to take her fate into her own hands.', 'In post-war Japan, Michiko, a disillusioned young woman trapped in a loveless marriage, confides in her younger cousin, Tsutomo, and the two become close, but decide not to consummate their affair. He instead becomes involved with the flirtatious Tomiko, who is also conducting an affair with Michiko''s husband. When Michiko finds that her husband has abandoned her, she decides to take her fate into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7baSmUbZ72usyX3XLk1SJvxR5Hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45998'),
  ('978422938827551457', 'The Lady of Silence: The Mataviejitas Murders', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'María José Cuevas, Axel Pedraza', 'Miguel León', 'Juana Barraza, Ted Bundy, Jeffrey Dahmer, Aileen Wuornos, John Wayne Gacy', 'R', 'Between 1998 and 2005, a wave of murders targeting elderly women hit Mexico City, triggering the hunt for — and capture — of a most unlikely suspect.', 'Between 1998 and 2005, a wave of murders targeting elderly women hit Mexico City, triggering the hunt for — and capture — of a most unlikely suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB6ez9v9HzSLplIy6m00SPIkuH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142216'),
  ('255253824105205467', 'The Lady of the Black Moons', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Samir A. Khouri', 'Samir A. Khouri', 'Nahed Yousri, Hussein Fahmy, Adel Adham, Shahinaz Taha, Theodora Rasi, Phillip Aqiqi, Dean Turner, Johny Gharu', null, 'In the depths of loneliness and despair, beautiful Aida visits her "tailor," Victoria, a woman who runs a sensual house where erotic fantasies are fulfilled. After satisfying her desires in the arms of one of Victoria''s young men, Aida has a haunting nightmare where she envisions herself as a witch who, during a full moon, has the power to destroy her lovers'' sensitivity.', 'In the depths of loneliness and despair, beautiful Aida visits her "tailor," Victoria, a woman who runs a sensual house where erotic fantasies are fulfilled. After satisfying her desires in the arms of one of Victoria''s young men, Aida has a haunting nightmare where she envisions herself as a witch who, during a full moon, has the power to destroy her lovers'' sensitivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJnW67gxRTskIEOvJhEixatGxm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180347'),
  ('651266578422102668', 'The Lady Refuses', 1931, 'Romance, Drama', 'George Archainbaud, Leo Tover, Max Steiner', 'Wallace Smith', 'Betty Compson, John Darrow, Gilbert Emery, Margaret Livingston, Ivan Lebedeff, Edgar Norton, Daphne Pollard, Halliwell Hobbes', 'NR', 'A wealthy London nobleman hires a pretty but poor young woman to distract his playboy son from marrying a golddigger. Complications ensue when the girl and the father begin to fall for each other, and things get even more complicated when the son declares his love for her, too.', 'A wealthy London nobleman hires a pretty but poor young woman to distract his playboy son from marrying a golddigger. Complications ensue when the girl and the father begin to fall for each other, and things get even more complicated when the son declares his love for her, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvDkn6SDLDZJ75cbxNbUbqsW1EE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156357'),
  ('698651240417926587', 'The Lady Says No', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Ross, James Wong Howe', 'Robert Russell', 'Joan Caulfield, David Niven, James Robertson Justice, Lenore Lonergan, Frances Bavier, Peggy Maley, Henry Jones, Jeff York', 'NR', 'The feminist author of a national best-seller titled The Lady Says No meets a sexist magazine photographer and decides she''d rather say yes.', 'The feminist author of a national best-seller titled The Lady Says No meets a sexist magazine photographer and decides she''d rather say yes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7le4L0MxyenoVX3AdHkBr9ee01j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123432'),
  ('411187185637400507', 'The Lady Shogun and Her Men', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Drama, History', 'Fuminori Kaneko, Tokushō Kikumura, Yoshimasa Fujie', 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Ko Shibasaki, Maki Horikita, Tadayoshi Okura, Aoi Nakamura, Hiroshi Tamaki, Mitsuko Baisho, Emi Wakui', null, 'In the year 1716 a mysterious epidemic stickens men in the country of Japan, dropping the population of men to 1/4th of its prior state. With the drastic reduction of men, the gender roles have become reversed in Japan. Woman become the dominant members of society and males are sought out for the ability to produce children. A young man named Unoshin Mizuno hopes to marry childhood sweetheart Onobu, but due to class differences realizes this is almost impossible. To raise his social status and also save his poor family, Unoshin Mizuno enters the Ohoku (inner chambers of the Shugun''s castle) and attempts to vie among 3,000 other men for the affection of the female shogun. What Unoshin Mizuno quickly learns about the Ohoku is that the men there are all beautiful, but highly ambitious and conniving. In this environment, the 7th shogun Tokugawa passes away and the new shogun Yoshimune Tokugawa takes the thrown and enters the Ohoku.', 'In the year 1716 a mysterious epidemic stickens men in the country of Japan, dropping the population of men to 1/4th of its prior state. With the drastic reduction of men, the gender roles have become reversed in Japan. Woman become the dominant members of society and males are sought out for the ability to produce children. A young man named Unoshin Mizuno hopes to marry childhood sweetheart Onobu, but due to class differences realizes this is almost impossible. To raise his social status and also save his poor family, Unoshin Mizuno enters the Ohoku (inner chambers of the Shugun''s castle) and attempts to vie among 3,000 other men for the affection of the female shogun. What Unoshin Mizuno quickly learns about the Ohoku is that the men there are all beautiful, but highly ambitious and conniving. In this environment, the 7th shogun Tokugawa passes away and the new shogun Yoshimune Tokugawa takes the thrown and enters the Ohoku.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIPvglQc3yBSFP4Wst5CWt4SDeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63462'),
  ('642974785426884730', 'The Lady Vanishes', 1938, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jack E. Cox, Alfred Hitchcock, Maurice Carter', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Margaret Lockwood, Michael Redgrave, Paul Lukas, May Whitty, Basil Radford, Naunton Wayne, Cecil Parker, Linden Travers', 'NR', 'On a train headed for England a group of travelers is delayed by an avalanche. Holed up in a hotel in a fictional European country, young Iris befriends elderly Miss Froy. When the train resumes, Iris suffers a bout of unconsciousness and wakes to find the old woman has disappeared. The other passengers ominously deny Miss Froy ever existed, so Iris begins to investigate with another traveler and, as the pair sleuth, romantic sparks fly.', 'On a train headed for England a group of travelers is delayed by an avalanche. Holed up in a hotel in a fictional European country, young Iris befriends elderly Miss Froy. When the train resumes, Iris suffers a bout of unconsciousness and wakes to find the old woman has disappeared. The other passengers ominously deny Miss Froy ever existed, so Iris begins to investigate with another traveler and, as the pair sleuth, romantic sparks fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1t9LB76LvEARPanfEzXmkm7fwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940'),
  ('87366149564371329', 'The Lady Vanishes', 1979, 'Mystery, Thriller, Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Page, Douglas Slocombe, Philip Martell', 'George Axelrod', 'Cybill Shepherd, Elliott Gould, Angela Lansbury, Herbert Lom, Arthur Lowe, Ian Carmichael, Gerald Harper, Jenny Runacre', 'PG', 'On the eve of World War II, zany heiress Amanda Kelly travels by train to Switzerland. While passing through Germany, she meets a sweet elderly lady, who suddenly vanishes. Distraught, she questions her fellow passengers who claim that the woman was never there. Unsure if it''s all in her mind or if there''s a more sinister plot afoot, Amanda teams up with photographer Robert Condon to discover the truth.', 'On the eve of World War II, zany heiress Amanda Kelly travels by train to Switzerland. While passing through Germany, she meets a sweet elderly lady, who suddenly vanishes. Distraught, she questions her fellow passengers who claim that the woman was never there. Unsure if it''s all in her mind or if there''s a more sinister plot afoot, Amanda teams up with photographer Robert Condon to discover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xw0GhX9M3zjbFd7OeYdNHrmZSiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4706'),
  ('61046649077132197', 'The Lady Without Camelias', 1953, 'Drama', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Enzo Serafin, Francesco Maselli', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Francesco Maselli, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Lucia Bosè, Andrea Checchi, Gino Cervi, Ivan Desny, Alain Cuny, Monica Clay, Anna Carena, Enrico Glori', null, 'A Milanese shop assistant becomes an overnight film sensation when fate lands her the leading role in a prominent producer''s romantic drama.', 'A Milanese shop assistant becomes an overnight film sensation when fate lands her the leading role in a prominent producer''s romantic drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOBo0a99Y8FHzAZO2feS888or1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93863'),
  ('89925638572854800', 'The Ladykillers', 1955, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alexander Mackendrick, Otto Heller, Dock Mathieson', 'William Rose', 'Alec Guinness, Cecil Parker, Herbert Lom, Peter Sellers, Danny Green, Katie Johnson, Jack Warner, Philip Stainton', 'NR', 'Five oddball criminals planning a bank robbery rent rooms on a cul-de-sac from an octogenarian widow under the pretext that they are classical musicians.', 'Five oddball criminals planning a bank robbery rent rooms on a cul-de-sac from an octogenarian widow under the pretext that they are classical musicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LJ6ZV59Q92LAJAbmb7xm9dUBGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5506'),
  ('786537070141351512', 'The Ladykillers', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, Roger Deakins', 'William Rose', 'Tom Hanks, Irma P. Hall, Marlon Wayans, J.K. Simmons, Tzi Ma, Ryan Hurst, Diane Delano, George Wallace', 'R', 'An eccentric, if not charming Southern professor and his crew pose as a band in order to rob a casino, all under the nose of his unsuspecting landlord – a sharp old woman.', 'An eccentric, if not charming Southern professor and his crew pose as a band in order to rob a casino, all under the nose of his unsuspecting landlord – a sharp old woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4g9R39NCp6VaYFrw6q8JwKNW9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5516'),
  ('263147395200340447', 'The Lair', 2022, 'Horror, Action', 'Jeremy Zimmermann, Luke Bryant, Neil Marshall', 'Neil Marshall, Charlotte Kirk', 'Charlotte Kirk, Jonathan Howard, Jamie Bamber, Mark Strepan, Hadi Khanjanpour, Leon Ockenden, Harry Taurasi, Adam Bond', null, 'Royal Air Force pilot Lt. Kate Sinclair is on her final flight mission when her jet is shot down over one of the most dangerous rebel strongholds in Afghanistan. She finds refuge in an abandoned underground bunker where deadly man-made creatures known as Ravagers — half-human, half-alien, and hungry for human flesh — are awakened.', 'Royal Air Force pilot Lt. Kate Sinclair is on her final flight mission when her jet is shot down over one of the most dangerous rebel strongholds in Afghanistan. She finds refuge in an abandoned underground bunker where deadly man-made creatures known as Ravagers — half-human, half-alien, and hungry for human flesh — are awakened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifRFLx83Xk1DcwAS3OScgI6HmWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760204'),
  ('738475923722379136', 'The Lair of the White Worm', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ken Russell, Dick Bush, Christopher Hall', 'Ken Russell', 'Amanda Donohoe, Hugh Grant, Catherine Oxenberg, Peter Capaldi, Sammi Davis, Stratford Johns, Paul Brooke, Imogen Claire', 'R', 'When an archaeologist uncovers a strange skull in a foreign land, the residents of a nearby town begin to disappear, leading to further inexplicable occurrences.', 'When an archaeologist uncovers a strange skull in a foreign land, the residents of a nearby town begin to disappear, leading to further inexplicable occurrences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhL5Z8srwSXJuosfBqei9Dxv41C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11347'),
  ('131100431896768155', 'The Lake', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'David Jackson, Denis Maloney, Steve Love', null, 'Yasmine Bleeth, Linden Ashby, Stanley Anderson, Haley Joel Osment, Susanna Thompson, Dewey Weber, Matt Beck, Caroline Lagerfelt', null, 'Jackie Ivers is a Los Angeles nurse who returns home to the small town of San Vicente to find that her friends and family have taken on bizarrely different personalities. Jackie notices that everyone who goes into the town''s lake come out different...', 'Jackie Ivers is a Los Angeles nurse who returns home to the small town of San Vicente to find that her friends and family have taken on bizarrely different personalities. Jackie notices that everyone who goes into the town''s lake come out different...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngjgXyO09hULP4fD7RGYiszH7XB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261624'),
  ('120921499360049307', 'The Lake', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Björn Blixt, Hans Åke Gabrielsson', 'Hans Iveberg', 'Regina Lund, Mikael Rundquist, Fredrik Hammar, Björn Gedda, Maria Lundqvist, Gösta Bredefeldt, Mats Rudal, Chatarina Larsson', null, 'A thriller set in a Swedish village. Lisa comes back from London to sell a house left to her by her father. He mysteriously disappeared in the forest in the winter and is presumed dead in an accident. Lisa suspects there is more to the story as her father was disliked in the village. The old hunting lodge by the lake hides a secret. When Lisa starts her search for the truth painful facts about her father, herself and the village will be revealed.', 'A thriller set in a Swedish village. Lisa comes back from London to sell a house left to her by her father. He mysteriously disappeared in the forest in the winter and is presumed dead in an accident. Lisa suspects there is more to the story as her father was disliked in the village. The old hunting lodge by the lake hides a secret. When Lisa starts her search for the truth painful facts about her father, herself and the village will be revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4LUsftIWS9TPV3KgyjckiQZfzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146507'),
  ('1053642463870775115', 'The Lake', 2022, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Wade Muller, Phensiri Klangsurin, Aqing Xu', 'Lee Thongkham', 'Theerapat Sajakul, Sushar Manaying, Supansa Wedkama, Thanachat Tullayachat, Wanmai Chatborirak, Vithaya Pansringarm, Palita Chueasawathee, Amnaj Wajaon', null, 'A little girl brings back the big egg she finds by a nearby lake to her home. However, the egg belongs to a mysterious and dangerous creature, and it soon starts searching for it.', 'A little girl brings back the big egg she finds by a nearby lake to her home. However, the egg belongs to a mysterious and dangerous creature, and it soon starts searching for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0K4yiqZ6so3spK6DG82LsXZh6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709716'),
  ('2770819730167125', 'The Lake', 2026, 'Adventure, Drama, Sport', 'Fabrice Aragno, Joseph Areddy, Patrick Tresch, Robert-Jan Lacombe', 'Fabrice Aragno', 'Clotilde Courau, Bernard Stamm, Léa Célestine Bernasconi, Adèle Beaulieu', null, 'A couple pours all their energy into competing in a multi-day sailing race across a vast lake.', 'A couple pours all their energy into competing in a multi-day sailing race across a vast lake.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpqSsqg1xaI81C0ujOrvhRJCCBuQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:le-lac-2026'),
  ('932996344422770492', 'The Lake House', 2006, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Alejandro Agresti, Alar Kivilo, Josh McLaglen', 'Kim Eun-jeong, Yeoh Gee-na', 'Keanu Reeves, Sandra Bullock, Christopher Plummer, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Dylan Walsh, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Lynn Collins', 'PG', 'When architect Alex Wyler moves into an unusual glass house on stilts over a lake, he discovers a note from the previous tenant in the mailbox--but no one''s lived in the house for years. He replies and soon discovers that he''s corresponding with a doctor named Kate Forster. Their correspondence, only through the ''magical'' mailbox, turns romantic and their paths cross in unexpected ways, but when they try to truly connect, danger looms. They must try to unravel the mystery behind their extraordinary romance before it''s too late.', 'When architect Alex Wyler moves into an unusual glass house on stilts over a lake, he discovers a note from the previous tenant in the mailbox--but no one''s lived in the house for years. He replies and soon discovers that he''s corresponding with a doctor named Kate Forster. Their correspondence, only through the ''magical'' mailbox, turns romantic and their paths cross in unexpected ways, but when they try to truly connect, danger looms. They must try to unravel the mystery behind their extraordinary romance before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHpc1118dYWLnHZleGhwZxRbpae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2044'),
  ('783204636394901555', 'The Lake Vampire', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Carl Zitelmann, Gerard Uzcategui', 'Carl Zitelmann', 'Miguelángel Landa, Sócrates Serrano, Eduardo Gulino, Abilio Torres, Javier Vidal, Javier Vidal, Paul Gámez, Carla Müller', null, 'Desperate to find a subject for his next novel, Ernesto Navarro follows the tracks of a mysterious killer, a man obsessed with drinking human blood and becoming immortal.', 'Desperate to find a subject for his next novel, Ernesto Navarro follows the tracks of a mysterious killer, a man obsessed with drinking human blood and becoming immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9DLismw9vXF3TFD2w47ToQtBMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528886'),
  ('101153186798149398', 'The Lamb', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kutluğ Ataman', 'Kutluğ Ataman', 'Nesrin Cavadzade, Cahit Gök, Nursel Köse, Mert Taştan, Sila Lara Cantürk, Taner Birsel, Güven Kıraç, Şerif Sezer', null, 'In a small village, young Mert is about to get traditionally circumcised, but the family does not have the money to follow up with the circumcision celebration. The family wants to be able to serve lamb meat to the guests at the celebration. Mert’s older sister scares him that if they cannot afford a lamb the father will slaughter him instead.', 'In a small village, young Mert is about to get traditionally circumcised, but the family does not have the money to follow up with the circumcision celebration. The family wants to be able to serve lamb meat to the guests at the celebration. Mert’s older sister scares him that if they cannot afford a lamb the father will slaughter him instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKMUE8RLdg6IPN0xyACG6VZPUhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255280'),
  ('507068104902323484', 'The Lamb', 2020, 'Drama', 'Fabrizio La Palombara, Mario Piredda', 'Mario Piredda, Giovanni Galavotti', 'Nora Stassi, Luciano Curreli, Piero Marcialis, Michele Atzori', null, 'Anita is sixteen and she’s facing a difficult situation: her mother died of leukemia and now Jacopo, her father, is also sick: his need for a bone-marrow transplant is increasingly urgent, but the average waiting period for a donor is many months. Anita isn’t compatible, and neither is Tonino, her grandfather shepherd who lives in the nearby tableland, close to a military base which affect the area since the Sixties. There is uncle Gaetano: being Jacopo’s brother the probability that he is compatible is higher, but Gaetano is a hothead and he and Jacopo haven’t had any relationship at all: an old grudge, which they don’t want to forget, is keeping them apart.', 'Anita is sixteen and she’s facing a difficult situation: her mother died of leukemia and now Jacopo, her father, is also sick: his need for a bone-marrow transplant is increasingly urgent, but the average waiting period for a donor is many months. Anita isn’t compatible, and neither is Tonino, her grandfather shepherd who lives in the nearby tableland, close to a military base which affect the area since the Sixties. There is uncle Gaetano: being Jacopo’s brother the probability that he is compatible is higher, but Gaetano is a hothead and he and Jacopo haven’t had any relationship at all: an old grudge, which they don’t want to forget, is keeping them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Xv2uwLpgu0Po3jd6ToJIo3qMtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680692'),
  ('737224767008051309', 'The Lamp', 1959, 'Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Krzysztof Romanowski', 'Roman Polanski', 'Roman Polanski', null, 'In waning winter light, a doll maker works in his shop, a kerosene lamp beside him, a jumble of dolls and doll parts, whole and broken, surrounding him. There are noises, too: a cuckoo clock chirps the workday''s end. The artisan completes a repair and leaves, shuttering the shop from outside. Back inside, whispering begins. What else is in store for the shop''s seemingly lifeless denizens?', 'In waning winter light, a doll maker works in his shop, a kerosene lamp beside him, a jumble of dolls and doll parts, whole and broken, surrounding him. There are noises, too: a cuckoo clock chirps the workday''s end. The artisan completes a repair and leaves, shuttering the shop from outside. Back inside, whispering begins. What else is in store for the shop''s seemingly lifeless denizens?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usNbYhy8Qj5BL9acN5ddm86Y5BI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104141'),
  ('1040676771536402571', 'The Land', 1970, 'Drama', 'Youssef Chahine, Abdel Halim Nasr, Daoud Abdel Sayed', 'Abd El Rahman El Sharqawy', 'Nagwa Ibrahim, Ezzat Al Alaily, Mahmoud El Meligy, Yehia Chahine, Hamdy Ahmed, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Salah El-Saadany, Ali Al Sharif', null, 'Set in 1933, the mayor informs the peasants that the share of irrigation of their land will be split equally between them and feudal lord Mahmoud Bey. The peasants send Mohamed Effendi to submit a petition to the government. Mahmoud Bey then proposes a project that would require taking part of the peasants'' lands.', 'Set in 1933, the mayor informs the peasants that the share of irrigation of their land will be split equally between them and feudal lord Mahmoud Bey. The peasants send Mohamed Effendi to submit a petition to the government. Mahmoud Bey then proposes a project that would require taking part of the peasants'' lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/serzJZX1jK5i8lYHEUcWxHJPknC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123648'),
  ('630058760439665022', 'The Land Before Time', 1988, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Don Bluth, Sue Shakespeare, David J. Steinberg', 'Stu Krieger', 'Gabriel Damon, Candace Hutson, Will Ryan, Judith Barsi, Helen Shaver, Pat Hingle, Bill Erwin, Burke Byrnes', 'G', 'An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.', 'An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSC2wxFj3ZgrIHlIaePeuHN4igo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12144'),
  ('293248499328839520', 'The Land Before Time II: The Great Valley Adventure', 1994, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Roy Allen Smith, Graham Morris', 'Dev Ross, John Loy, John Ludin', 'Scott McAfee, Candace Hutson, Heather Hogan, Jeff Bennett, Rob Paulsen, Linda Gary, Kenneth Mars, John Ingle', 'G', 'This time, while building a hideaway in their new home of the Great Valley, Littlefoot and the gang rescue a mysterious egg from two scheming egg-nappers and make a starling surprise - and new friend - when the egg hatches.', 'This time, while building a hideaway in their new home of the Great Valley, Littlefoot and the gang rescue a mysterious egg from two scheming egg-nappers and make a starling surprise - and new friend - when the egg hatches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lIkU6gbqMx4oRDGegawLdQdLJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15997'),
  ('298536857538680510', 'The Land Before Time III: The Time of the Great Giving', 1995, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Roy Allen Smith, Frederik Du Chau, Graham Morris', 'Dev Ross', 'Scott McAfee, Candace Hutson, Heather Hogan, Jeff Bennett, Rob Paulsen, John Ingle, Linda Gary, Whit Hertford', 'G', 'When a sudden shortage of water threatens all life in the great valley, The gang of young dinosaur must cooperate with a group of bullies to make a risky journey outside the valley and find the cause.', 'When a sudden shortage of water threatens all life in the great valley, The gang of young dinosaur must cooperate with a group of bullies to make a risky journey outside the valley and find the cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abcJUBDHi6hxibSgm2bxYK1wAZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19004'),
  ('986852410792217730', 'The Land Before Time IV: Journey Through the Mists', 1996, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Roy Allen Smith, Graham Morris', 'Dev Ross', 'John Ingle, Candace Hutson, Heather Hogan, Rob Paulsen, Jeff Bennett, Scott McAfee, Kenneth Mars, Linda Gary', 'G', 'When Littlefoot grandfather falls ill, The dinosaurs only way to cure him is a flower in the forbidding land of mist which hold unexpecting perils and danger.', 'When Littlefoot grandfather falls ill, The dinosaurs only way to cure him is a flower in the forbidding land of mist which hold unexpecting perils and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqBhPAvSwPCZq4Kg79CvxGrU7nj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19164'),
  ('358737593566903592', 'The Land Before Time IX: Journey to Big Water', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'Dev Ross', 'John Ingle, Kenneth Mars, Miriam Flynn, Thomas Dekker, Anndi McAfee, Aria Noelle Curzon, Rob Paulsen, Tress MacNeille', 'G', 'Littlefoot befriends with a mysterious, fun-loving dolphin-like creature named Mo, who is trapped in "new water" caused by heavy rain. The gang then goes on an adventure to the "big water" to bring Mo home.', 'Littlefoot befriends with a mysterious, fun-loving dolphin-like creature named Mo, who is trapped in "new water" caused by heavy rain. The gang then goes on an adventure to the "big water" to bring Mo home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QEVfflbBR20AuKp7FEnTeqiv78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25556'),
  ('82005482011628620', 'The Land Before Time V: The Mysterious Island', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'John Ingle, Brandon La Croix, Aria Noelle Curzon, Rob Paulsen, Anndi McAfee, Jeff Bennett, Kenneth Mars, Miriam Flynn', 'G', 'Littlefoot and his friends the gang in their next when a swarm of leaf gobblers had destroyed their homes and this forces them to find a new home but yet find an mysterious island.', 'Littlefoot and his friends the gang in their next when a swarm of leaf gobblers had destroyed their homes and this forces them to find a new home but yet find an mysterious island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlsJfYQ3dwzvr6kwG60P0nh59Sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19165'),
  ('152015394441582461', 'The Land Before Time VI: The Secret of Saurus Rock', 1998, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Charles Grosvenor, Hangduk Cho, Choi Gwi Don', 'John Loy, Libby Hinson', 'Thomas Dekker, Kenneth Mars, Anndi McAfee, Aria Noelle Curzon, Jeff Bennett, Nancy Cartwright, Sandy Fox, Miriam Flynn', 'G', 'Legends claim that Saurus Rock keeps bad luck out of the Great Valley. Is it really true? Could the mysterious Longneck named Doc be the famous Lone Dinosaur, who can defeat a Sharptooth with his lasso-like tail To find out, Littlefoot and company must cross the great Valley and face a dangerous Sharptooth themselves!', 'Legends claim that Saurus Rock keeps bad luck out of the Great Valley. Is it really true? Could the mysterious Longneck named Doc be the famous Lone Dinosaur, who can defeat a Sharptooth with his lasso-like tail To find out, Littlefoot and company must cross the great Valley and face a dangerous Sharptooth themselves!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gULz0vkjx3VrN9aJGjQ7EduSNx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17337'),
  ('1071813854206037905', 'The Land Before Time VII: The Stone of Cold Fire', 2000, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'Len Uhley', 'Thomas Dekker, Kenneth Mars, Miriam Flynn, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Aria Noelle Curzon, Anndi McAfee, John Ingle', 'G', 'Littlefoot and his pals set off in search of a "stone of cold fire" that fell from the night sky. Since he''s the only one who has seen it though, nobody really believes him. Petrie''s uncle Pterano offers support only because he thinks the stone has secret powers and wants it for himself but conceals this from the rest. The young dinos must figure out the truth, before Pterano gets the power.', 'Littlefoot and his pals set off in search of a "stone of cold fire" that fell from the night sky. Since he''s the only one who has seen it though, nobody really believes him. Petrie''s uncle Pterano offers support only because he thinks the stone has secret powers and wants it for himself but conceals this from the rest. The young dinos must figure out the truth, before Pterano gets the power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waUASz6cHXXDVIUomIIwqsGGjzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24102'),
  ('423245337021172906', 'The Land Before Time VIII: The Big Freeze', 2001, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'John Ingle, Rob Paulsen, Thomas Dekker, Anndi McAfee, Jeff Bennett, Susan Krebs, Jeremy Suarez, Kenneth Mars', 'G', 'When the dinosaur families get trapped in a valley by an ice storm, one family of "spike tail" dinosaurs volunteers to leave since they consume more food than the others. Meanwhile, the young dinos and a new adult dinosaur named Mr. Thicknose, head out to bring back their friend Spike, who has left his friends to be with members of his own species.', 'When the dinosaur families get trapped in a valley by an ice storm, one family of "spike tail" dinosaurs volunteers to leave since they consume more food than the others. Meanwhile, the young dinos and a new adult dinosaur named Mr. Thicknose, head out to bring back their friend Spike, who has left his friends to be with members of his own species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztofs0LZY9Q6Ni3HEwibdZoewpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25587'),
  ('1055165262470775280', 'The Land Before Time X: The Great Longneck Migration', 2003, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'John Ingle, Alec Medlock, Kenneth Mars, Miriam Flynn, Aria Noelle Curzon, Jeff Bennett, Brandon de Paul, James Garner', 'G', 'A bedtime story leads Littlefoot and his grandparents on a journey to a new land, where Littlefoot discovers someone who vanished before he was born: his father! Now Littlefoot must decide between two worlds. Will he leave to be with his friends in the Great Valley, or stay behind and start a new life with his father?', 'A bedtime story leads Littlefoot and his grandparents on a journey to a new land, where Littlefoot discovers someone who vanished before he was born: his father! Now Littlefoot must decide between two worlds. Will he leave to be with his friends in the Great Valley, or stay behind and start a new life with his father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSwUyNrm4KaFwrM5ilY2ZWY5bEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24554'),
  ('292644870070302492', 'The Land Before Time XI: Invasion of the Tinysauruses', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'Aaron Spann, Jeff Bennett, Aria Noelle Curzon, Anndi McAfee, Rob Paulsen, John Ingle, Michael Clarke Duncan, Miriam Flynn', 'G', 'Littlefoot and his friends return in another adventure. But this time, they aren''t the smallest dinosaurs in the valley anymore.', 'Littlefoot and his friends return in another adventure. But this time, they aren''t the smallest dinosaurs in the valley anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zREv4ST6lZUcxWIy2LPJKB011Gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24556'),
  ('1033011614257120042', 'The Land Before Time XII: The Great Day of the Flyers', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'John Ingle, Nick Price, Frank Welker, Aria Noelle Curzon, Rob Paulsen, Camryn Manheim, Anndi McAfee, Kenneth Mars', 'G', 'As the Great Day of the Flyers nears, the Great Valley''s flying youngsters are eager to participate in the annual exhibition to show off their skills. Everyone, that is, except free-spirited pterodactyl Petrie, whose individualism causes problems when it comes to staying in formation. Enter his dinosaur pals Littlefoot, Cera, Spike and Ducky, who encourage Petrie to embrace his uniqueness.', 'As the Great Day of the Flyers nears, the Great Valley''s flying youngsters are eager to participate in the annual exhibition to show off their skills. Everyone, that is, except free-spirited pterodactyl Petrie, whose individualism causes problems when it comes to staying in formation. Enter his dinosaur pals Littlefoot, Cera, Spike and Ducky, who encourage Petrie to embrace his uniqueness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WKZksck9oLWBQnSZYdmrhaY3At.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31933'),
  ('244947867352591637', 'The Land Before Time XIII: The Wisdom of Friends', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Jamie Mitchell, Charles Grosvenor', 'John Loy', 'Cody Arens, Logan Arens, Jeff Bennett, Anndi McAfee, Aria Noelle Curzon, Cuba Gooding Jr., Sandra Oh, Pete Sepenuk', 'G', 'Littlefoot learns a series of important lessons following an incident that nearly costs his grandmother her life. Soon afterwards, three dinosaurs arrive claiming they have lost their way.', 'Littlefoot learns a series of important lessons following an incident that nearly costs his grandmother her life. Soon afterwards, three dinosaurs arrive claiming they have lost their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weRDZgqsJbxrM90wq5entBV4ah2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39961'),
  ('1098043355185650633', 'The Land Before Time XIV: Journey of the Brave', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Jessie Hsiung, Tony Tupilano, Bunis Yang', 'Cliff Ruby, Elana Lesser', 'Felix Avitia, Anndi McAfee, Aria Noelle Curzon, Jeff Bennett, Rob Paulsen, Barry Bostwick, Miriam Flynn, Damon Wayans Jr.', 'G', 'On a day known to the dinosaurs as "Treasure Day", Bron becomes stuck in the Mysterious Beyond. This event urges the young Longneck Littlefoot to take his friends on a quest to the Fire Mountain to save his father. Along the way, they befriend a Flyer.', 'On a day known to the dinosaurs as "Treasure Day", Bron becomes stuck in the Mysterious Beyond. This event urges the young Longneck Littlefoot to take his friends on a quest to the Fire Mountain to save his father. Along the way, they befriend a Flyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahmppHBvgDrIg5EcFe16XqpWroE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339526'),
  ('407431957804218841', 'The Land Girls', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'David Leland, Henry Braham, Michael Elliott', 'Keith Dewhurst, David Leland', 'Catherine McCormack, Rachel Weisz, Anna Friel, Steven Mackintosh, Paul Bettany, Nicholas Le Prevost, Lucy Akhurst, Celia Bannerman', 'R', 'During World War II, the organisation "The Women''s Land Army" recruited women to work on British farms while the men were off to war. Three such "land girls" of different social backgrounds - quiet Stella, young hairdresser Prue, and Cambridge graduate Ag - become best friends in spite of their different backgrounds.', 'During World War II, the organisation "The Women''s Land Army" recruited women to work on British farms while the men were off to war. Three such "land girls" of different social backgrounds - quiet Stella, young hairdresser Prue, and Cambridge graduate Ag - become best friends in spite of their different backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfdj6Wx8vCDNZbzmIRR2hDn5mAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17044'),
  ('45792346864791178', 'The Land of Happiness', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Markku Pölönen, Kari Sohlberg, Nadja Pyykkö', 'Markku Pölönen', 'Katariina Kaitue, Pertti Koivula, Anja Pohjola, Veikko Tiitinen, Tuula Väänänen, Taisto Reimaluoto, Reijo Taipale, Leo Raivio', null, 'Nostalgic comedy set in the early 1960s, when the tango was all the rage. The "prodigal son" Tenho returns from his unlucky adventures in the city back to his parents'' farm. Tenho becomes the laughing stock of local men until he scores the hottest girl in the village. A hot romance flares up between Tenho and the sensuous milkmaid Virva, accompanied by popular Finnish tango tunes.', 'Nostalgic comedy set in the early 1960s, when the tango was all the rage. The "prodigal son" Tenho returns from his unlucky adventures in the city back to his parents'' farm. Tenho becomes the laughing stock of local men until he scores the hottest girl in the village. A hot romance flares up between Tenho and the sensuous milkmaid Virva, accompanied by popular Finnish tango tunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAevqFmAgO5XoyZtTEuYIiwkzHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55500'),
  ('933697482940182685', 'The Land of Hope', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sion Sono, Shigenori Miki, Satoshi Yoshida', 'Sion Sono', 'Isao Natsuyagi, Naoko Ohtani, Jun Murakami, Megumi Kagurazaka, Yutaka Shimizu, Hikari Kajiwara, Daikichi Sugawara, Takashi Yamanaka', null, 'An old couple, their only son, the son''s wife, a young man and his lover live peacefully in a village. Then, a terrifying earthquake strikes that causes a nearby nuclear station to explode. The residents must evacuate, but the family lives on a farm, with only half of the area designated as an evacuation area.', 'An old couple, their only son, the son''s wife, a young man and his lover live peacefully in a village. Then, a terrifying earthquake strikes that causes a nearby nuclear station to explode. The residents must evacuate, but the family lives on a farm, with only half of the area designated as an evacuation area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL8FpQ1VpOPtfHg2Q174AIsDSVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110396'),
  ('581726560733321067', 'The Land of Rain Trees', 2015, 'Romance', 'Yoshishige Miyake, Hiro''o Yanagida, Jun Yokoishi', 'Hiro Arikawa', 'Mariya Nishiuchi, Yuta Tamamori, Kanna Mori, Ren Osugi, Atsuko Takahata, Yumi Aso, Yumi Aso, Kenichi Yajima', null, 'Nobuyuki Sakisaka (Yuta Tamamori) is a salaryman. When he was in middle school student, he read light novel "Fairy Game”. He still has that light novel, because he was so shocked by the ending. One day, Nobuyuki Sakisaka browses the internet and comes across the blog "Rein Tsuri no Kuni.” He learns that the blog writer, Rika Hitomi (Mariya Nishiuchi), also was shocked by the ending in light novel "Fairy Game." Nobuyuki and Rika soon begin to exchange emails. Nobuyuki wants to meet Rika, but she refuses due to her secret.', 'Nobuyuki Sakisaka (Yuta Tamamori) is a salaryman. When he was in middle school student, he read light novel "Fairy Game”. He still has that light novel, because he was so shocked by the ending. One day, Nobuyuki Sakisaka browses the internet and comes across the blog "Rein Tsuri no Kuni.” He learns that the blog writer, Rika Hitomi (Mariya Nishiuchi), also was shocked by the ending in light novel "Fairy Game." Nobuyuki and Rika soon begin to exchange emails. Nobuyuki wants to meet Rika, but she refuses due to her secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cy4PefoTCDVnNPkcS8PY4qVuctE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401909'),
  ('980415832959317092', 'The Land of Sometimes', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Leon Joosen, Nick Cooke', 'Tony Nottage, Martin Casella, Tim Rice', 'Ewan McGregor, Helena Bonham Carter, Alisha Weir, Andrei Shen, Mel Brooks', 'Not Rated', 'Twins Alfie and Elise find a magical Wish Watch on Christmas Eve and are swept by the Wish Collector into the musical Land of Sometimes, where they learn that wishes have consequences.', 'Twins Alfie and Elise find a magical Wish Watch on Christmas Eve and are swept by the Wish Collector into the musical Land of Sometimes, where they learn that wishes have consequences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FuEZAx4Rk42hv8bfrXC9pyQPWErw.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-land-of-sometimes'),
  ('809527321414083801', 'The Land of Steady Habits', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nicole Holofcener, Alar Kivilo', 'Nicole Holofcener', 'Ben Mendelsohn, Edie Falco, Thomas Mann, Elizabeth Marvel, Connie Britton, Michael Gaston, Josh Pais, Natalie Gold', null, 'After leaving his wife and his job to find happiness, Anders begins a clumsy, heartbreaking quest to reassemble the pieces of his fractured life.', 'After leaving his wife and his job to find happiness, Anders begins a clumsy, heartbreaking quest to reassemble the pieces of his fractured life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2cdubbzgDBIVG8lELeQUq50qiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452731'),
  ('374260892203453620', 'The Land of the People', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian', 'Artavazd Peleshian', null, null, 'This is the subject of ongoing discovery of the beauty of the world, that man makes in his life and in his work, which is being developed as part of a big city, presented during a day''s work. This film starts and ends with the rotating image of the sculpture of Rodin the Thinker; this famous sculpture has long since become the symbol of the unchanging expression of human thought.', 'This is the subject of ongoing discovery of the beauty of the world, that man makes in his life and in his work, which is being developed as part of a big city, presented during a day''s work. This film starts and ends with the rotating image of the sculpture of Rodin the Thinker; this famous sculpture has long since become the symbol of the unchanging expression of human thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zrr4NFnV0zS7w4jzuYE3OkUQt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183714'),
  ('396130599343327350', 'The Land That Time Forgot', 1974, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Kevin Connor, Alan Hume', 'James Cawthorn, Michael Moorcock', 'Doug McClure, John McEnery, Susan Penhaligon, Keith Barron, Anthony Ainley, Godfrey James, Bobby Parr, Declan Mulholland', 'PG', 'During World War I, a German U-boat sinks a British passenger ship and takes the survivors aboard. After getting lost in fog, the submarine surfaces near the unknown island of Caprona, a lost world where they find dinosaurs and Neanderthals.', 'During World War I, a German U-boat sinks a British passenger ship and takes the survivors aboard. After getting lost in fog, the submarine surfaces near the unknown island of Caprona, a lost world where they find dinosaurs and Neanderthals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jtm4aP4kj4vHimFfnLqjnm8LqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27085'),
  ('1132161510266810620', 'The Land That Time Forgot', 2009, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'C. Thomas Howell, Mark Atkins, Xavier S. Puslowski', 'Darren Dalton', 'C. Thomas Howell, Timothy Bottoms, Lindsey McKeon, Darren Dalton, Stephen Blackehart, Christopher Showerman, Patrick Gorman, Scott Subiono', null, 'Shipwrecked castaways stumble upon the mysterious island of Caprona in the Bermuda Triangle, confronting man-eating dinosaurs and a stranded German U-Boat crew while trying to escape.', 'Shipwrecked castaways stumble upon the mysterious island of Caprona in the Bermuda Triangle, confronting man-eating dinosaurs and a stranded German U-Boat crew while trying to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq5AbTpijfLBKMnhTq6cjGQ8kea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21260'),
  ('844011012654726337', 'The Land Unknown', 1957, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Virgil W. Vogel, Ellis W. Carter, Joseph E. Kenney', 'László Görög', 'Jock Mahoney, Shirley Patterson, William Reynolds, Henry Brandon, Douglas Kennedy, Phil Harvey, Kenner G. Kemp, Bing Russell', null, 'Navy Commander Alan Roberts is assigned to lead an expedition to Little America in Antarctica to investigate reports of a mysterious warm water inland lake discovered a decade earlier. His helicopter and its small party, including reporter Maggie Hathaway, is forced down into a volcanic crater by a fierce storm. They find themselves trapped in a lush tropical environment that has survived from prehistoric times.', 'Navy Commander Alan Roberts is assigned to lead an expedition to Little America in Antarctica to investigate reports of a mysterious warm water inland lake discovered a decade earlier. His helicopter and its small party, including reporter Maggie Hathaway, is forced down into a volcanic crater by a fierce storm. They find themselves trapped in a lush tropical environment that has survived from prehistoric times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kJNx5GJTnp2rLZV8I3Aq4rVL4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43716'),
  ('391122336100401272', 'The Landlady', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A landlady is taunted by neighborhood kids.', 'A landlady is taunted by neighborhood kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elfDN8C1UNIH5hIB0eoE9kn6gF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119973'),
  ('769101391145515355', 'The Landlady', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Darko Šuvak, W. Scott Wolf, Robert Malenfant', 'Frank Wehwaldt, George Saunders', 'Talia Shire, Jack Coleman, Bruce Weitz, Melissa Behr, Bette Ford, Dee Freeman, Nathan Le Grand, Luisa Leschin', 'R', 'Melanie decides that one of her tenants would be perfect as her husband and decides to eliminate everyone who might interfere in her plans.', 'Melanie decides that one of her tenants would be perfect as her husband and decides to eliminate everyone who might interfere in her plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wua3sS1CO2A7iKLmmJ21lN9zRz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60781'),
  ('1027085305831926827', 'The Landlord', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hal Ashby, Kurt Baker, Norman I. Cohen', 'Bill Gunn', 'Beau Bridges, Lee Grant, Diana Sands, Pearl Bailey, Walter Brooke, Louis Gossett Jr., Marki Bey, Mel Stewart', null, 'At the age of twenty-nine, Elgar Enders "runs away" from home. This running away consists of buying a building in a black ghetto in the Park Slope section of Brooklyn. Initially, his intention is to evict the black tenants and convert the building into a posh flat. But Elgar is not one to be bound by yesterday''s urges, and soon he has other thoughts on his mind.', 'At the age of twenty-nine, Elgar Enders "runs away" from home. This running away consists of buying a building in a black ghetto in the Park Slope section of Brooklyn. Initially, his intention is to evict the black tenants and convert the building into a posh flat. But Elgar is not one to be bound by yesterday''s urges, and soon he has other thoughts on his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DoDKRMIRki2ft2D9bZGa1zzgVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64828'),
  ('186478785076340404', 'The Landlord', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Carmine D''Antuono, Mariano Laurenti, Federico Zanni', 'Bruno Corbucci, Alessandro Parenzo', 'Gloria Guida, Fran Fullenwider, Lino Banfi, Enzo Cannavale, Vittorio Caprioli, Adolfo Celi, Giancarlo Dettori, Giuseppe Pambieri', null, 'Giorgia and her sister inherit a villa and decide to turn it into a pension. When the sister orders the advertising, the brochure, together with the name, Pension Paradise, leads people to believe it is a whore house.', 'Giorgia and her sister inherit a villa and decide to turn it into a pension. When the sister orders the advertising, the brochure, together with the name, Pension Paradise, leads people to believe it is a whore house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkTdk6i62BntDLedBUiZFjbYpi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290618'),
  ('26034027280776611', 'The Landlord', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Adam McKay, Drew Antzis, Drew Antzis', 'Adam McKay, Will Ferrell', 'Will Ferrell, Adam McKay, Pearl McKay', null, 'An angry landlord hassles her behind-in-rent tenant.', 'An angry landlord hassles her behind-in-rent tenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvmHEJlo0gaOdPGHLd9bermaGls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43631'),
  ('73014133192156458', 'The Landlords', 2012, 'Drama', 'Edoardo Gabbriellini, Daria D''Antonio', 'Edoardo Gabbriellini, Valerio Mastandrea, Michele Pellegrini', 'Elio Germano, Valerio Mastandrea, Gianni Morandi, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Lorenzo Rivola, Francesca Rabbi, Mauro Marchese, Alina Gulyalyeva', null, 'Two construction-workers, the brothers Cosimo and Elia are hired by a famous singer to do some work on his rural mansion, before he''s due to make his big career comeback-concert in his home city. It all seems like an easy enough job, but the small town community doesn''t like strangers.', 'Two construction-workers, the brothers Cosimo and Elia are hired by a famous singer to do some work on his rural mansion, before he''s due to make his big career comeback-concert in his home city. It all seems like an easy enough job, but the small town community doesn''t like strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnKrQoS67306l8XefEQGjQpx4Ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169692'),
  ('772384531056756060', 'The Laplace''s Demon', 2019, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Giordano Giulivi', 'Giordano Giulivi, Duccio Giulivi', 'Silvano Bertolin, Ferdinando D''Urbano, Duccio Giulivi, Carlotta Mazzoncini, Simone Moscato, Walter Smorti, Simone Valeri, Alessandro Zonfrilli', 'R', 'A glass in free fall. Have you ever thought if it is possible to calculate into how many pieces it can break into? After numerous experiments, a team of researchers succeeds in doing just this apparently impossible task. Attracted to their experiment, a mysterious professor invites the scientists in his isolated mansion to know more about their studies. However, when they arrive, they are not greeted by their host but they are faced with a strange model of the mansion, in which some absolutely normal but incredible actions are acted. The researchers will soon understand to be involved in a new experiment in which they''ll have to play a very different role than usual: that of the glass in free fall.', 'A glass in free fall. Have you ever thought if it is possible to calculate into how many pieces it can break into? After numerous experiments, a team of researchers succeeds in doing just this apparently impossible task. Attracted to their experiment, a mysterious professor invites the scientists in his isolated mansion to know more about their studies. However, when they arrive, they are not greeted by their host but they are faced with a strange model of the mansion, in which some absolutely normal but incredible actions are acted. The researchers will soon understand to be involved in a new experiment in which they''ll have to play a very different role than usual: that of the glass in free fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5N5nKIrW3i1hzVADCl5RTSqsZE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461775'),
  ('357395814661151505', 'The Laramie Project', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Moisés Kaufman, Terry Stacey', 'Stephen Wangh, Moisés Kaufman', 'Dylan Baker, Tom Bower, Clancy Brown, Steve Buscemi, Jeremy Davies, Clea DuVall, Peter Fonda, Janeane Garofalo', null, '"The Laramie Project" is set in and around Laramie, Wyoming, in the aftermath of the murder of 21-year-old Matthew Shepard. To create the stage version of "The Laramie Project," the eight-member New York-based Tectonic Theatre Project traveled to Laramie, Wyoming, recording hours of interviews with the town''s citizens over a two-year period. The film adaptation dramatizes the troupe''s visit, using the actual words from the transcripts to create a portrait of a town forced to confront itself.', '"The Laramie Project" is set in and around Laramie, Wyoming, in the aftermath of the murder of 21-year-old Matthew Shepard. To create the stage version of "The Laramie Project," the eight-member New York-based Tectonic Theatre Project traveled to Laramie, Wyoming, recording hours of interviews with the town''s citizens over a two-year period. The film adaptation dramatizes the troupe''s visit, using the actual words from the transcripts to create a portrait of a town forced to confront itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Aj4DdvSZp7XRpIVbBXN3EccDwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19448'),
  ('324656512158120653', 'The Lark', 1964, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Nikita Kurikhin, Leonid Menaker, Nikolay Zhilin', 'Sergey Orlov, Mikhail Dudin', 'Vyacheslav Gurenkov, Gennadiy Yukhtin, Valeriy Pogoreltsev, Valentīns Skulme, Bruno O''Ya, Ervin Abel, Žanis Katlaps, Heino Mandri', null, 'Russian prisoners of war commandeer a tank and lead the Nazis on a cross-country chase in this World War II adventure drama. The Russians use their own tanks so the Nazis can use them as target practice to test a new anti-tank weapon. Knowing that death is near, the brave Russians run amok and tear down German monuments before heading out to a field where female slave laborers are working.', 'Russian prisoners of war commandeer a tank and lead the Nazis on a cross-country chase in this World War II adventure drama. The Russians use their own tanks so the Nazis can use them as target practice to test a new anti-tank weapon. Knowing that death is near, the brave Russians run amok and tear down German monuments before heading out to a field where female slave laborers are working.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijbdsqbeCusiiAstPNLmaDs0zpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198819'),
  ('1036796911165052053', 'The Lark Farm', 2007, 'History, Drama', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani', 'Paz Vega, Moritz Bleibtreu, Alessandro Preziosi, Ángela Molina, Arsinée Khanjian, Tchéky Karyo, Mariano Rigillo, Hristo Shopov', null, 'The Lark Farm is set in a small Turkish town in 1915. It deals with the genocide of Armenians, looking closely at the fortunes, or rather, misfortunes of one wealthy Armenian family.', 'The Lark Farm is set in a small Turkish town in 1915. It deals with the genocide of Armenians, looking closely at the fortunes, or rather, misfortunes of one wealthy Armenian family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyEo8Hywxa1W4Yav4DkXiqHpr1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2361'),
  ('875787048130764586', 'The Larva Island Movie', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Ahn Byoung-wook', 'Jeong Mi-rin, Park Keun-hong, Koh Tae-wook', 'Hong Bum-ki, Kang Shin-hyung, Eddy Lee, Ahn Hyo-min, Kim Yeon-woo, Choi Nak-yoon, Tom Wayland, Erica D. Schroeder', null, 'Back at home, Chuck relates the island shenanigans of his larva pals Red and Yellow to a skeptical reporter in this movie sequel to the hit cartoon.', 'Back at home, Chuck relates the island shenanigans of his larva pals Red and Yellow to a skeptical reporter in this movie sequel to the hit cartoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHdxICUIRGoJjK67aOp3ykvL8ZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718867'),
  ('1077337074027227227', 'The Las Vegas Story', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Harry J. Wild, Robert Stevenson', 'Earl Felton, Harry Essex, Paul Jarrico', 'Jane Russell, Victor Mature, Vincent Price, Hoagy Carmichael, Brad Dexter, Gordon Oliver, Jay C. Flippen, Will Wright', 'NR', 'When newlyweds visit Las Vegas, the wife''s shady past comes to the surface.', 'When newlyweds visit Las Vegas, the wife''s shady past comes to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjLqvTC16CoWAir5ynyokARszzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26283'),
  ('578355920473649385', 'The Las Vegas Strangler', 1968, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Collins, William G. Troiano', 'Oliver Drake, June Drake', 'John "Bud" Cardos, Robert Dix, Richard Jeffries, Gillian Simpson, June Drake, Jackie De Witt, Perry Dell, Cay Conway', null, 'Previously lost proto-slasher that chronicles the life of murderous psychotic, Jeff Murray, whose perverted mother obsession leads him on a blood-soaked rampage across the glitter of Sin City.', 'Previously lost proto-slasher that chronicles the life of murderous psychotic, Jeff Murray, whose perverted mother obsession leads him on a blood-soaked rampage across the glitter of Sin City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryb4d5NkttCVrvvlwrHHkg5GUbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777573'),
  ('1018521053519824022', 'The Lascivious Wotan', 1971, null, 'Otto Muehl', null, null, null, 'A subversive and experimental film by Otto Muehl.', 'A subversive and experimental film by Otto Muehl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hEmmpD3D5NT6Aw6duND19IItP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147412'),
  ('219299908725363719', 'The Last 10 Years', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michihito Fujii, Gen Osaka', 'Yoshikazu Okada', 'Nana Komatsu, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Yuki Yamada, Satoru Iguchi, Haru Kuroki, Tetsushi Tanaka, Hideko Hara, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'Twenty-year-old Matsuri Takabayashi learns that she only has ten years to live due to an incurable disease. She decides to not dwell on her life and not to fall in love—until she meets a man named Kazuto Manabe at a school reunion.', 'Twenty-year-old Matsuri Takabayashi learns that she only has ten years to live due to an incurable disease. She decides to not dwell on her life and not to fall in love—until she meets a man named Kazuto Manabe at a school reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJFUBE5VGjQaTLuyhf4Hb926mn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876797'),
  ('488820679893799540', 'The Last Act', 1955, 'War, Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Günther Anders', 'Fritz Habeck, Erich Maria Remarque', 'Albin Skoda, Oskar Werner, Lotte Tobisch, Willy Krause, Erland Erlandsen, Kurt Jaggberg, Eduard Köck, Curt Eilers', null, 'Albin Skoda embodies a frantic Adolf Hitler in his last days, scrambling to keep the Third Reich alive as morale within the bunker wanes and Berlin is encircled by enemy troops. Based on Michael A. Musmanno''s book Ten Days to Die, Oscar Werner costars as fictional Nazi Hauptmann Wüst, a disillusioned middleman.', 'Albin Skoda embodies a frantic Adolf Hitler in his last days, scrambling to keep the Third Reich alive as morale within the bunker wanes and Berlin is encircled by enemy troops. Based on Michael A. Musmanno''s book Ten Days to Die, Oscar Werner costars as fictional Nazi Hauptmann Wüst, a disillusioned middleman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qek5nqZbrMIDM49RJLJooG1d1uX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202432'),
  ('285604580462220057', 'The Last Adventure', 1967, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Enrico, Jean Boffety', 'José Giovanni, Robert Enrico', 'Alain Delon, Lino Ventura, Joanna Shimkus, Serge Reggiani, Hans Meyer, Jean Darie, Jean Trognon, Odile Poisson', null, 'Two adventurers and best friends, Roland and Manu, are the victims of a practical joke that costs Manu his pilot''s license. With seeming contrition, the jokesters tell Roland and Manu about a crashed plane lying on the ocean floor off the coast of Congo stuffed with riches. The adventurers set off to find the loot.', 'Two adventurers and best friends, Roland and Manu, are the victims of a practical joke that costs Manu his pilot''s license. With seeming contrition, the jokesters tell Roland and Manu about a crashed plane lying on the ocean floor off the coast of Congo stuffed with riches. The adventurers set off to find the loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsl3EbF6gwKEihyffIXXcVlvOx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11396'),
  ('90486307553493662', 'The Last Airbender', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Andrew Lesnie, John Rusk', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Noah Ringer, Dev Patel, Nicola Peltz Beckham, Jackson Rathbone, Shaun Toub, Aasif Mandvi, Cliff Curtis, Seychelle Gabriel', 'PG', 'The story follows the adventures of Aang, a young successor to a long line of Avatars, who must put his childhood ways aside and stop the Fire Nation from enslaving the Water, Earth and Air nations.', 'The story follows the adventures of Aang, a young successor to a long line of Avatars, who must put his childhood ways aside and stop the Fire Nation from enslaving the Water, Earth and Air nations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl9JJ8288bNsY8oqT1SpQh1w2mb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10196'),
  ('570441336205893165', 'The Last Alarm', 1940, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'William West', 'Al Martin', 'J. Farrell MacDonald, Warren Hull, Polly Ann Young, Mary Gordon, George Pembroke, Joel Friedkin, Bruce MacFarlane, Eddie Hart', 'NR', 'A recently retired fire captain suffers from boredom, until one of his friends is killed battling an arson fire. It becomes his purpose in life to track down the arsonist. As he gets closer to finding the killer, things become dangerous for him and his family.', 'A recently retired fire captain suffers from boredom, until one of his friends is killed battling an arson fire. It becomes his purpose in life to track down the arsonist. As he gets closer to finding the killer, things become dangerous for him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f85m4smPVONAppY71tYHz9wvo9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152275'),
  ('15424956058294577', 'The Last American Hero', 1973, 'Drama', 'Lamont Johnson, Frederic W. Brost, Barry Stern', 'Tom Wolfe, Bill Kerby, William Roberts', 'Jeff Bridges, Valerie Perrine, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Ned Beatty, Gary Busey, Lane Smith, Ed Lauter, William Smith', 'PG', 'A young hell raiser quits his moonshine business and tries to become the best NASCAR racer the south has ever seen. Loosely based on the true story of NASCAR driver Junior Johnson.', 'A young hell raiser quits his moonshine business and tries to become the best NASCAR racer the south has ever seen. Loosely based on the true story of NASCAR driver Junior Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PEOlAC6KDaj0WxWPw87kan3Kmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31605'),
  ('28256025561578997', 'The Last American Virgin', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Boaz Davidson, Adam Greenberg, Mark Allan', 'Boaz Davidson', 'Lawrence Monoson, Diane Franklin, Steve Antin, Joe Rubbo, Louisa Moritz, Brian Peck, Kimmy Robertson, Tessa Richarde', 'R', 'The friendship of a group of young friends struggling with teen sex, drugs, and work is jeopardized by a romantic interest which may turn pals into bitter rivals.', 'The friendship of a group of young friends struggling with teen sex, drugs, and work is jeopardized by a romantic interest which may turn pals into bitter rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttGdSGgYDUGnPpJNyG2qGs4cd3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27088'),
  ('493842218384658735', 'The Last Angry Man', 1959, 'Drama', 'Daniel Mann, James Wong Howe, Irving J. Moore', 'Gerald Green', 'Paul Muni, David Wayne, Betsy Palmer, Luther Adler, Claudia McNeil, Joby Baker, Joanna Moore, Nancy R. Pollock', null, 'Dr. Sam Abelman is a Jewish doctor contentedly spending his autumn years serving his own Brooklyn neighborhood. But when his nephew, would-be journalist Myron, writes an article about him, it draws the attention of a producer, Woodrow Thrasher, who believes Dr. Abelman a good candidate for a TV show. The doctor, however, is suspicious of the whole enterprise, thinking both Myron and Thrasher are simply out to make a fast buck.', 'Dr. Sam Abelman is a Jewish doctor contentedly spending his autumn years serving his own Brooklyn neighborhood. But when his nephew, would-be journalist Myron, writes an article about him, it draws the attention of a producer, Woodrow Thrasher, who believes Dr. Abelman a good candidate for a TV show. The doctor, however, is suspicious of the whole enterprise, thinking both Myron and Thrasher are simply out to make a fast buck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPo335bwfQePltlDtxuWc0rjwwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126781'),
  ('906134012072034831', 'The Last Assault', 1985, 'War', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Titus Popovici', 'Mircea Albulescu, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Ştefan Iordache, Vladimir Găitan, Ion Besoiu, Valentin Uritescu, Anda Onesa, George Alexandru', null, 'The film tells about the period when Romania joined the Allies against the Axis in WW2.', 'The film tells about the period when Romania joined the Allies against the Axis in WW2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruAtiF84I1GxELJ0HZYpkdFpVIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341265'),
  ('52084861367132665', 'The Last Ball in November', 1989, 'Drama', 'Dan Pița', 'Dan Pița', 'Ştefan Iordache, Sergiu Tudose, Gabriela Baciu, Valentin Popescu, Florian Potra, Gioni Popovici, Cătălina Murgea, Victoria Cociaș', null, 'The film is the story of Prince Cantacuzin’s hidden love for his pupil he mentored since early adolescence, until her being married by her stepfather. Daria Mazu, coming from an unfortunate family, with an epileptic brother and a drunker stepfather.', 'The film is the story of Prince Cantacuzin’s hidden love for his pupil he mentored since early adolescence, until her being married by her stepfather. Daria Mazu, coming from an unfortunate family, with an epileptic brother and a drunker stepfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koEhcsVBXXSrJvVdR4dkbIxdvrt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409374'),
  ('999521397738642693', 'The Last Battle', 1983, 'Science Fiction', 'Luc Besson, Patrick Alessandrin, Carlo Varini', 'Pierre Jolivet, Luc Besson', 'Pierre Jolivet, Jean Bouise, Fritz Wepper, Jean Reno, Christiane Krüger, Maurice Lamy, Pierre Carrive, Jean-Michel Castanié', null, 'The plot explores the devastation of civilization and issues of brutality, hostility and isolation. Pierre Jolivet stars as the main character (identified only as "The Man" in the end credits) who is menaced by "The Brute" (played by Jean Reno) on his journey through a world filled by people rendered nearly mute by some unknown incident.', 'The plot explores the devastation of civilization and issues of brutality, hostility and isolation. Pierre Jolivet stars as the main character (identified only as "The Man" in the end credits) who is menaced by "The Brute" (played by Jean Reno) on his journey through a world filled by people rendered nearly mute by some unknown incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ag3cM67YCiOIyc0MLVNnDZ0avf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19184'),
  ('428800020770612404', 'The Last Battle', 1993, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Juan Antonio de la Riva', 'Ramón Obón, Fernando Galiana', 'Jorge Russek, Ivy Goulart, Leo Michelin, Valdir Fernandes, Margarita Isabel', null, 'A group of boys, roughly seven to eleven years of age, go skinny-dipping in a river near their small Mexican town one afternoon and there find themselves the butt of an old vagabond''s practical joke, the man stealing all their clothes from them. Humiliated about having to walk home in the buff, the tykes decide to get even, declare war. Yet, as the generations battle it out, a mutual respect develops, the depth of which is evident once the man has a heart attack during one of his romps with the kids. Will the boys'' older pal recuperate so that they can engage in one final battle.', 'A group of boys, roughly seven to eleven years of age, go skinny-dipping in a river near their small Mexican town one afternoon and there find themselves the butt of an old vagabond''s practical joke, the man stealing all their clothes from them. Humiliated about having to walk home in the buff, the tykes decide to get even, declare war. Yet, as the generations battle it out, a mutual respect develops, the depth of which is evident once the man has a heart attack during one of his romps with the kids. Will the boys'' older pal recuperate so that they can engage in one final battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lz9wcwGZFl4zmaP7TS0pwSHLdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301894'),
  ('353365614023797807', 'The Last Big Thing', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dan Zukovic, M. David Mullen', null, 'Dan Zukovic, Mark Ruffalo, Sibel Ergener, James Lorinz, Yul Vazquez, Louis Mustillo, Blaine Capatch, Pamela Dickerson', 'R', 'From a bland tract house on the outskirts of Los Angeles, Simon Geist (with occasional help from his platonic girlfriend Darla) wages war against all of modern American popular culture. Geist starts up a magazine called "The Next Big Thing", which he uses to confront and insult upcoming actors, comics, models and rock bands. As Geist''s mysterious Underground Agenda escalates, will he become the "last big thing", or be co-opted by the very forces he is railing against? Written by Van Film Fest', 'From a bland tract house on the outskirts of Los Angeles, Simon Geist (with occasional help from his platonic girlfriend Darla) wages war against all of modern American popular culture. Geist starts up a magazine called "The Next Big Thing", which he uses to confront and insult upcoming actors, comics, models and rock bands. As Geist''s mysterious Underground Agenda escalates, will he become the "last big thing", or be co-opted by the very forces he is railing against? Written by Van Film Fest', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWacMZJuVBXxjlH5MoogNGd4B1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55180'),
  ('293394623389351669', 'The Last Billionaire', 1934, 'Comedy', 'René Clair, Rudolph Maté, Louis Née', 'René Clair', 'Max Dearly, Sinoël, Paul Ollivier, Marthe Mellot, Charles Redgie, Renée Saint-Cyr, Marcel Carpentier, Raymond Cordy', null, 'The Last Billionaire is a 1934 French comedy film directed by René Clair and starring Max Dearly, Marthe Mellot and Renée Saint-Cyr. The film is based on a fictional small European kingdom which is on the verge of going broke. Its French title is Le dernier milliardaire.', 'The Last Billionaire is a 1934 French comedy film directed by René Clair and starring Max Dearly, Marthe Mellot and Renée Saint-Cyr. The film is based on a fictional small European kingdom which is on the verge of going broke. Its French title is Le dernier milliardaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9o4o8J4i1KvHL5wtnbS4EdjKi64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163468'),
  ('489420124288951589', 'The Last Black Man in San Francisco', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ethan Caflisch, Joe Talbot, Adam Newport-Berra', 'Joe Talbot, Rob Richert', 'Jimmie Fails, Jonathan Majors, Rob Morgan, Tichina Arnold, Mike Epps, Finn Wittrock, Danny Glover, Willie Hen', 'R', 'Jimmie Fails dreams of reclaiming the Victorian home his grandfather built in the heart of San Francisco. Joined on his quest by his best friend Mont, Jimmie searches for belonging in a rapidly changing city that seems to have left them behind.', 'Jimmie Fails dreams of reclaiming the Victorian home his grandfather built in the heart of San Francisco. Joined on his quest by his best friend Mont, Jimmie searches for belonging in a rapidly changing city that seems to have left them behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow9zjibNrz5TYVZ6cqwmvCR1YX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522039'),
  ('905972385078683458', 'The Last Blockbuster', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Zeke Kamm, Taylor Morden, Lance Rand', 'Zeke Kamm', 'Sandi Harding, Lauren Lapkus, Kevin Smith, Samm Levine, Ione Skye, Adam Brody, Brian Posehn, Paul Scheer', null, 'A documentary on the last remaining Blockbuster Video in Bend, Oregon.', 'A documentary on the last remaining Blockbuster Video in Bend, Oregon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnsryyae99q7YmbKaH4sqmZS2Qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694681'),
  ('272122513077269613', 'The Last Blood', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Wong Jing, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Wong Jing', 'Alan Tam, Andy Lau, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, May Lo Mei-Wei, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Jackson Liu, Chui Sau-Lai', null, 'Lui Tai, an Interpol agent, is assigned to protect the Daka Lama, a famous religious leader who''s targeted for death by a militant Japanese terrorist group. When the Daka Lama is injured, Lui Tai embarks on a quest to find a suitable blood donor.', 'Lui Tai, an Interpol agent, is assigned to protect the Daka Lama, a famous religious leader who''s targeted for death by a militant Japanese terrorist group. When the Daka Lama is injured, Lui Tai embarks on a quest to find a suitable blood donor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Mol5sn4Jd8fiUvX4rd7i9XdwbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45460'),
  ('1109713049644887321', 'The Last Bolshevik', 1994, 'Documentary, History', 'Chris Marker, Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', 'Aleksandr Medvedkin, Nikolai Izvolov, Léonor Graser, Yuli Raizman, Antonina Pirojkova, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Michael Pennington', null, 'A documentary on Soviet filmmaker Aleksandr Medvedkin, examining his tumultuous career, the rediscovery of his masterpiece Happiness, and Russia''s struggles over the course of the 20th Century.', 'A documentary on Soviet filmmaker Aleksandr Medvedkin, examining his tumultuous career, the rediscovery of his masterpiece Happiness, and Russia''s struggles over the course of the 20th Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VHcgSUQh1P6f71KIauQtRCRdlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98498'),
  ('1037227086089621884', 'The Last Border', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Kimmo Taavila', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Pia Tikka', 'Jolyon Baker, Jürgen Prochnow, Fanny Bastien, Kari Väänänen, Matti Pellonpää, Soli Labbart, Clas-Ove Bruun, Jussi Lampi', null, 'One man''s quest for revenge in a post-apocalyptic world', 'One man''s quest for revenge in a post-apocalyptic world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97xhlpNK8CQxcDlVmaMBHiPxUEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103989'),
  ('598999924716856299', 'The Last Boy', 2019, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Richard Swingle, Robyn Henderson, Charlie King', 'Perry Bhandal', 'Luke Goss, Flynn Allen, Peter Guinness, Matilda Freeman, Jennifer Scott, Aneta Piotrowska, Anna Wilson-Jones, Lowri Walton', null, 'The world at an end, a dying mother sends her young son on a quest to find the place that grants wishes.', 'The world at an end, a dying mother sends her young son on a quest to find the place that grants wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o5WVpjAffERCTkrAmpqNlieAMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573632'),
  ('762438199619074763', 'The Last Boy on Earth', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Nicolás Onetti', 'Nicolás Onetti', 'Camilo Levigne, Hugo Quiril, Raymond E. Lee, Paulo Vilela, Carole Brana, Arben Bajraktaraj, Maru Valdivielso, Octavi Pujades', null, 'In a distant future, a mysterious boy becomes the central figure in the search for a new hope. Who is this kid? Why is everyone looking for it? Sometimes it is better not to know certain answers…', 'In a distant future, a mysterious boy becomes the central figure in the search for a new hope. Who is this kid? Why is everyone looking for it? Sometimes it is better not to know certain answers…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXHYWMaxG0Gs5PJMKX6M8AZnZ5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856273'),
  ('550234293850545637', 'The Last Boy Scout', 1991, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tony Scott, Ward Russell, Donald J. Lee Jr.', 'Shane Black', 'Bruce Willis, Damon Wayans, Chelsea Field, Noble Willingham, Taylor Negron, Danielle Harris, Halle Berry, Bruce McGill', 'R', 'Somewhere in Los Angeles, the city of broken dreams, a stripper is murdered. Now, the private detective she had hired and her ex-footballer boyfriend are going to find her murderer... if they don''t kill each other first. But the more they dig, the deeper they become enmeshed in a web of extortion, blackmail and corrupt politics hidden beneath the surface of professional football.', 'Somewhere in Los Angeles, the city of broken dreams, a stripper is murdered. Now, the private detective she had hired and her ex-footballer boyfriend are going to find her murderer... if they don''t kill each other first. But the more they dig, the deeper they become enmeshed in a web of extortion, blackmail and corrupt politics hidden beneath the surface of professional football.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glPswihcZYoAQ4YM2uJF4UACy8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9319'),
  ('761892491053411636', 'The Last Breath', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joachim Hedén', 'Nick Saltrese', 'Kim Spearman, Jack Parr, Alexander Arnold, Erin Mullen, Arlo Carter, Julian Sands, Maxime Durand', null, 'A group of old college friends reunite on a Caribbean scuba diving trip exploring the wreckage of a WWII battleship and find themselves trapped inside the underwater labyrinth of rusted metal surrounded by great white sharks.', 'A group of old college friends reunite on a Caribbean scuba diving trip exploring the wreckage of a WWII battleship and find themselves trapped inside the underwater labyrinth of rusted metal surrounded by great white sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC892vhMsNwcIUX5UfrsTSy9IL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241674'),
  ('258727705508062487', 'The Last Bridge', 1954, 'War, Drama', 'Helmut Käutner, Elio Carniel', 'Helmut Käutner, Norbert Kunze', 'Maria Schell, Bernhard Wicki, Carl Möhner, Barbara Rütting, Tilla Durieux, Fritz Eckhardt, Pavle Minčić, Horst Hächler', null, 'A German nurse gets sent to the front because she gives medical aid to a wounded Yugoslav partisan during World War II.', 'A German nurse gets sent to the front because she gives medical aid to a wounded Yugoslav partisan during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euG8g6N9vOiYDjpCghLAhzEnNAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73052'),
  ('663880541706103549', 'The Last Broadcast', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Stefan Avalos, Lance Weiler', 'Lance Weiler, Stefan Avalos', 'David Beard, Jim Seward, Stefan Avalos, Lance Weiler, Rein Clabbers, Michele Pulaski, Tom Brunt, Mark Rublee', 'NR', 'In December 1995, a four-man team from the public-access program, "Fact or Fiction", braved the New Jersey''s desolate Pine Barrens determined to deliver a live broadcast of the legendary Jersey Devil. Only one came out alive. It took the jury ninety minutes to sentence the lone survivor to life in prison. One year later, a filmmaker decides to mount his own investigation...', 'In December 1995, a four-man team from the public-access program, "Fact or Fiction", braved the New Jersey''s desolate Pine Barrens determined to deliver a live broadcast of the legendary Jersey Devil. Only one came out alive. It took the jury ninety minutes to sentence the lone survivor to life in prison. One year later, a filmmaker decides to mount his own investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wexVSBnfx4fggSmLxzn1kc51Q5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34288'),
  ('134491180342522218', 'The Last Bullet', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Petre Sălcudeanu, Titus Popovici', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Jean Constantin, Amza Pellea, Ilarion Ciobanu, Sebastian Papaiani, Ion Besoiu, George Constantin, Marga Barbu', null, 'A continuation of a story started in the drama "With Clean Hands" (1972). Commissioner Miclovan''s last cartridge is still hot in the pocket of Roman. Left without Miclovan''s support, dead in action, Commissioner Roman wants to see his murderer, a very powerful local mafia and smuggler, Mr. Semaca, acquitted by the court for lack of evidence, punished. But before dealing with Semaca, Roman receives a new mission, this time undercover: the capture of a German spy still active in the country, suspected to be hiding in a monastery. In this mission, Commissioner Roman also has a helper, Oarca, a former underwriter who proves good at everything and especially at car chases on serpentine...', 'A continuation of a story started in the drama "With Clean Hands" (1972). Commissioner Miclovan''s last cartridge is still hot in the pocket of Roman. Left without Miclovan''s support, dead in action, Commissioner Roman wants to see his murderer, a very powerful local mafia and smuggler, Mr. Semaca, acquitted by the court for lack of evidence, punished. But before dealing with Semaca, Roman receives a new mission, this time undercover: the capture of a German spy still active in the country, suspected to be hiding in a monastery. In this mission, Commissioner Roman also has a helper, Oarca, a former underwriter who proves good at everything and especially at car chases on serpentine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfjAKjoGXi5PhgAyQoS1Ncvz48F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224084'),
  ('39153440751427016', 'The Last Bus', 2021, 'Drama', 'George Geddes, Mark Lacey, Sean Boyle', 'Joe Ainsworth', 'Timothy Spall, Phyllis Logan, Natalie Mitson, Ben Ewing, Patricia Panther, Saskia Ashdown, Colin McCredie, Marnie Baxter', null, 'Widower Tom, on the recent passing of his wife Mary, uses his free bus pass to travel the length of Britain from John O''Groats in Caithness to Land''s End in Cornwall, their shared birthplace, using only local buses. It''s an incident-fuelled nostalgia trip and his encounters with local people make him a media phenomenon. Tom is totally unaware and to his surprise on arrival at Land’s End he’s greeted as a celebrity.', 'Widower Tom, on the recent passing of his wife Mary, uses his free bus pass to travel the length of Britain from John O''Groats in Caithness to Land''s End in Cornwall, their shared birthplace, using only local buses. It''s an incident-fuelled nostalgia trip and his encounters with local people make him a media phenomenon. Tom is totally unaware and to his surprise on arrival at Land’s End he’s greeted as a celebrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAGnAzOXrtqbj2PBAsxetVcVJvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642546'),
  ('74038094565451038', 'The Last Butterfly', 1991, 'Drama', 'Karel Kachyňa, Jiří Krejčík, Miloš Kohout', 'Ota Hofman, Karel Kachyňa', 'Tom Courtenay, Brigitte Fossey, Ingrid Held, Freddie Jones, Milan Kňažko, Josef Kemr, Drahomíra Fialková, Pavel Bobek', null, 'Stage mime Antoine Moreau is compelled by the Gestapo to put on a performance for the children of Terezin, a "model" concentration camp, to convince the Red Cross observers that the camp is truly what it seems. Reluctant at first, Moreau slowly learns the true nature of the camp, including the meaning of the "transports" on which people leave. With a world-class orchestra (made up of people interned in the camp) and a cast of children, Moreau stages a show to end all shows.', 'Stage mime Antoine Moreau is compelled by the Gestapo to put on a performance for the children of Terezin, a "model" concentration camp, to convince the Red Cross observers that the camp is truly what it seems. Reluctant at first, Moreau slowly learns the true nature of the camp, including the meaning of the "transports" on which people leave. With a world-class orchestra (made up of people interned in the camp) and a cast of children, Moreau stages a show to end all shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD7E1tqDKEsQfsDdz5CTJNi9wz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108970'),
  ('409801692897059684', 'The Last Cartridges', 1897, 'War', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'An incident of the Franco-Prussian War. It shows the bombardment of a house at Bazeille. It is the animated reproduction of de Neuville''s celebrated painting.', 'An incident of the Franco-Prussian War. It shows the bombardment of a house at Bazeille. It is the animated reproduction of de Neuville''s celebrated painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGgMalVehCMkBrMWAwvRI4WOJmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194604'),
  ('1140228126254022692', 'The Last Casino', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Gill, Bernard Couture', 'Steven Westren', 'Charles Martin Smith, Katharine Isabelle, Kris Lemche, Julian Richings, Albert Chung, Normand D''Amour, Jacques Godin, Roy Lund', 'PG-13', 'A University teacher finds three bright students and decides to teach them how to count cards to make lots of money. As they learn how to play the casinos, things get tricky when the debt owing teacher informs them that their front man wants restitution for loses in about a weeks time. The three students decide to hit all the major casinos in Ontario and Quebec until discovered.', 'A University teacher finds three bright students and decides to teach them how to count cards to make lots of money. As they learn how to play the casinos, things get tricky when the debt owing teacher informs them that their front man wants restitution for loses in about a weeks time. The three students decide to hit all the major casinos in Ontario and Quebec until discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgcpfMJ59TbWKFgrPLzqTZqclN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22085'),
  ('423846909204893806', 'The Last Castle', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Rod Lurie, Shelly Johnson, Mic Rodgers', 'David Scarpa, Graham Yost', 'Robert Redford, James Gandolfini, Mark Ruffalo, Delroy Lindo, Clifton Collins Jr., Kristen Shaw, Paul Calderon, Brian Goodman', 'R', 'A court-martialed general rallies together 1200 inmates to rise against the system that put him away.', 'A court-martialed general rallies together 1200 inmates to rise against the system that put him away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYnUfauPVK6g8IRO2REYl4TUZ2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2100'),
  ('167218005254340291', 'The Last Challenge', 1967, 'Western', 'Richard Thorpe, Erich von Stroheim Jr., Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Robert Emmett Ginna, John Sherry', 'Glenn Ford, Angie Dickinson, Chad Everett, Gary Merrill, Jack Elam, Delphi Lawrence, Royal Dano, Kevin Hagen', 'NR', 'An upstart outlaw baits a legendary gunslinger, now a marshal in love with a saloon keeper.', 'An upstart outlaw baits a legendary gunslinger, now a marshal in love with a saloon keeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DUeh0W111OtnOD83916AsdkAH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105059'),
  ('189714616722889257', 'The Last Chance', 1945, 'Drama, War', 'Leopold Lindtberg, Emil Berna, Elizabeth Montagu', 'Elizabeth Montagu, David Wechsler, Richard Schweizer', 'Ewart G. Morrison, John Hoy, Ray Reagan, Luisa Rossi, Giuseppe Galeati, Romano Calò, Leopold Biberti, Sigfrit Steiner', 'PG-13', 'Escaping a Nazi prison train in war-torn Italy, an American and a British soldier set out for the Swiss border and find themselves leading a multi-national party of refugees for the Italian underground.', 'Escaping a Nazi prison train in war-torn Italy, an American and a British soldier set out for the Swiss border and find themselves leading a multi-national party of refugees for the Italian underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvBwSwRhMR03a5kYzRiicgdslw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101772'),
  ('168860010994299292', 'The Last Chase', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Martyn Burke', 'Roy Moore, Christopher Crowe, Martyn Burke', 'Lee Majors, Burgess Meredith, Chris Makepeace, Alexandra Stewart, Trudy Young, Diane D''Aquila, George Touliatos, Harvey Atkin', 'PG', 'Twenty years after the American people have been told the oil has run out and disease has scared them into complacency, the United States has become a fascist state. One man, former race car driver Franklyn Hart, now a puppet spokesman for public transportation, rebuilds his race car and sets off to California from Boston where people have returned to living life like they were twenty years prior.', 'Twenty years after the American people have been told the oil has run out and disease has scared them into complacency, the United States has become a fascist state. One man, former race car driver Franklyn Hart, now a puppet spokesman for public transportation, rebuilds his race car and sets off to California from Boston where people have returned to living life like they were twenty years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K7uld44ek6TQEHXkzHUz5xI9Jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35453'),
  ('872932650585582291', 'The Last Circus', 2010, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Kiko de la Rica', 'Álex de la Iglesia', 'Carlos Areces, Carolina Bang, Antonio de la Torre, Manuel Tallafé, Enrique Villén, Santiago Segura, Alejandro Tejerías, Manuel Tejada', 'R', 'A trapeze artist must decide between her lust for Sergio, the Happy Clown, or her affection for Javier, the Sad Clown, both of whom are deeply disturbed.', 'A trapeze artist must decide between her lust for Sergio, the Happy Clown, or her affection for Javier, the Sad Clown, both of whom are deeply disturbed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbpp2G4cpGG8jqCqhEBwvjQ0Y6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56812'),
  ('772931465803749077', 'The Last Client', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund', 'Anders Rønnow Klarlund, Jacob Weinreich', 'Signe Egholm Olsen, Anton Hjejle, Dan Zahle, Sara Fanta Traore, Anders Mossling, Jimmi Andersen, Bertram Lyng Engelsted Jarkilde, Silan Maria Budak Rasch', null, 'Renowned psychologist Susanne (Signe Egholm Olsen) is caught in a living nightmare when her new client (Anton Hjejle) turns out to be a wanted serial killer.', 'Renowned psychologist Susanne (Signe Egholm Olsen) is caught in a living nightmare when her new client (Anton Hjejle) turns out to be a wanted serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUhZzMpHAMgdRgLbsvBIqhY7fKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934287'),
  ('167041782550139477', 'The Last Command', 1928, 'Drama, History, War, Romance', 'Bert Glennon, Josef von Sternberg', 'John F. Goodrich, Herman J. Mankiewicz, Ernst Lubitsch', 'Emil Jannings, Evelyn Brent, William Powell, Jack Raymond, Nicholas Soussanin, Michael Visaroff, Fritz Feld, Harry Cording', null, 'A former Imperial Russian general and cousin of the Czar ends up in Hollywood as an extra in a movie directed by a former revolutionary.', 'A former Imperial Russian general and cousin of the Czar ends up in Hollywood as an extra in a movie directed by a former revolutionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKb5bFIwEzDtT3km99lqQBGNFCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52679'),
  ('360165949101069876', 'The Last Contract', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Kjell Sundvall, Kjell Lagerroos, Martin Cronström', 'Kjell Sundvall, Steve Jansson', 'Mikael Persbrandt, Michael Kitchen, Pernilla August, Reine Brynolfsson, Bjørn Floberg, Jacqueline Ramel, Leif Andrée, Cecilia Ljung', null, 'Young police officer Roger is on the trail of the international master assassin, while the assassin follows his plan to murder Swedish Prime Minister Olof Palme.', 'Young police officer Roger is on the trail of the international master assassin, while the assassin follows his plan to murder Swedish Prime Minister Olof Palme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yMK11qu9W1NbNg12pVbYDVL6A9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80782'),
  ('918890628528875555', 'The Last Couplet', 1957, 'Drama, Music', 'Juan de Orduña, José F. Aguayo, Juan Solano', 'Antonio Mas Guindal, Jesús María de Arozamena', 'Sara Montiel, Armando Calvo, Enrique Vera, Julia Martínez, Matilde Muñoz Sampedro, José Moreno, Laly del Amo, Aurora García Alonso', null, 'A musical drama featuring a tragic love story. Relates a singer''s rise to fame and her subsequent downfall because of the death of her lover.', 'A musical drama featuring a tragic love story. Relates a singer''s rise to fame and her subsequent downfall because of the death of her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQFXoHYAeVJ8HbWdq9XZz8u4D66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80146'),
  ('372822279320517662', 'The Last Crooked Mile', 1946, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Philip Ford, Alfred S. Keller, Morton Scott', 'Jerry Sackheim', 'Don ''Red'' Barry, Ann Savage, Adele Mara, Tom Powers, John Miljan, Sheldon Leonard, Nestor Paiva, Ben Welden', 'NR', 'A mystery grows after a bank robbery car leads investigators to a carnival sideshow.', 'A mystery grows after a bank robbery car leads investigators to a carnival sideshow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBFTaMhb3AUOUNLqBvXYPhmpN6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70306'),
  ('1097475669578428925', 'The Last Cruise', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Luisa Conlon, Hannah Olson', null, 'Rebecca Frasure, Kent Frasure, Cheryl Molesky, Paul Molesky', null, 'Using intimate footage recorded by passengers and crew, The Last Cruise is a first-person account of the nightmare that transpired aboard the ill-fated Diamond Princess cruise ship, which set sail from Japan on the earliest days of the COVID-19 pandemic.', 'Using intimate footage recorded by passengers and crew, The Last Cruise is a first-person account of the nightmare that transpired aboard the ill-fated Diamond Princess cruise ship, which set sail from Japan on the earliest days of the COVID-19 pandemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sN3mSwzLqjAWHyNdJy1v5gaX5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800394'),
  ('255095707139991607', 'The Last Dance', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Colin Nutley, Jens Fischer', 'Colin Nutley', 'Helena Bergström, Reine Brynolfsson, Ewa Fröling, Peter Andersson, Rikard Wolff, Stellan Skarsgård, Philip Jackson, Peter Marshall', null, 'Blackpool, a dancing contest, a dead woman. This is the opening scene of this movie, which then continues by telling us the story preceding this sad accident - or is it a murder? We will get to know the tensed relationship of the dancing contestant couple Tove and Claes, and see how there lives are affected by Liselott and Lennart, their opponents and friends.', 'Blackpool, a dancing contest, a dead woman. This is the opening scene of this movie, which then continues by telling us the story preceding this sad accident - or is it a murder? We will get to know the tensed relationship of the dancing contestant couple Tove and Claes, and see how there lives are affected by Liselott and Lennart, their opponents and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Rec9QFPWNzGXgqkdRa6SExfnuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136238'),
  ('187179897393908092', 'The Last Dance', 2024, 'Drama', 'Anselm Chan Mau-Yin, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Tang Sui Yan', 'Anselm Chan Mau-Yin, Cheng Wai-Kei, Wong Fong Yi Feibi', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Michelle Wai Si-Nga, Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Ching-Hin Chan, Katrina Chan Pei-Shin, Catherine Chau, Che Chun-Hei', null, 'Despite the pandemic sending most industries into recession, debt-ridden wedding planner Dominic (Dayo WONG) gets a miraculous chance to turn things around when a funeral planner retires and passes the baton to him. His creative gimmicks for funerals help his business find unexpected success, but Dominic’s biggest obstacle is winning the approval of respected and sternly traditional Taoist priest, Master Man (Michael HUI). After some unordinary funerals, Dominic gradually understands Master Man’s code of ethics and the meaning behind each farewell.', 'Despite the pandemic sending most industries into recession, debt-ridden wedding planner Dominic (Dayo WONG) gets a miraculous chance to turn things around when a funeral planner retires and passes the baton to him. His creative gimmicks for funerals help his business find unexpected success, but Dominic’s biggest obstacle is winning the approval of respected and sternly traditional Taoist priest, Master Man (Michael HUI). After some unordinary funerals, Dominic gradually understands Master Man’s code of ethics and the meaning behind each farewell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ret10DkYVs45Ooa8yvU23x3L5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226141'),
  ('982788305452105058', 'The Last Day', 2004, 'Drama', 'Rodolphe Marconi, Hélène Louvart', 'Rodolphe Marconi', 'Mélanie Laurent, Gaspard Ulliel, Nicole Garcia, Bruno Todeschini, Thibault Vinçon, Daniel Berlioux, Christophe Malavoy, Alysson Paradis', 'NR', 'At Christmas time, 19-year-old Simon returns home to visit his dysfunctional family with Louise, a fearless girl he met during his train ride. While Simon struggles to cope with the growing distance between him and his parents, he starts to examine his feelings when Louise develop a liaison of her own with his childhood friend Mathieu.', 'At Christmas time, 19-year-old Simon returns home to visit his dysfunctional family with Louise, a fearless girl he met during his train ride. While Simon struggles to cope with the growing distance between him and his parents, he starts to examine his feelings when Louise develop a liaison of her own with his childhood friend Mathieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbFoWHvaAoJvy17ZUZC5401Uec2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8772'),
  ('985759878444162', 'The Last Day of Summer', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Jan Laskowski', 'Tadeusz Konwicki', 'Irena Laskowska, Jan Machulski', null, 'A subtle tale of a confrontation between two lonely people, one from which true understanding cannot seemingly result.', 'A subtle tale of a confrontation between two lonely people, one from which true understanding cannot seemingly result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chKKuonrLhBekRaZYQgZcpGz5mM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227245'),
  ('70012214732311032', 'The Last Day of Summer', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Blair Treu, Brian Sullivan', 'Kent Pierce', 'Jansen Panettiere, Jon Kent Ethridge, Eli Vargas, Alexandra Krosney, Denyse Tontz, Brendan Miller, Daniel Samonas, Creagen Dow', 'NR', 'Luke Malloy is freaking out. He doesn''t want tomorrow to come because tomorrow means starting Middle School...saying goodbye to summer break and hello to homework. And even worse, hello to getting picked on by Meat, the terrible torturer of new kids. Luke''s dread of tomorrow is casting a shadow on his enjoyment of his last day of summer, so he makes a wish that the Last Day of Summer would last forever... that his one last perfect day of fun and freedom would never end. But when his wish comes true, he discovers that he''s stuck repeating the day over and over again, which, as Luke quickly learns, isn''t any better. What do you do when the "ultimate do-over" isn''t all it''s cracked up to be?', 'Luke Malloy is freaking out. He doesn''t want tomorrow to come because tomorrow means starting Middle School...saying goodbye to summer break and hello to homework. And even worse, hello to getting picked on by Meat, the terrible torturer of new kids. Luke''s dread of tomorrow is casting a shadow on his enjoyment of his last day of summer, so he makes a wish that the Last Day of Summer would last forever... that his one last perfect day of fun and freedom would never end. But when his wish comes true, he discovers that he''s stuck repeating the day over and over again, which, as Luke quickly learns, isn''t any better. What do you do when the "ultimate do-over" isn''t all it''s cracked up to be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0WWVJ5nf8BcR4hXYJBs7T81eXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57865'),
  ('917536011494182816', 'The Last Days', 1998, 'Documentary, History', 'James Moll', null, 'Bill Basch, Martin Basch, Randolph Braham, Alice Lok Cahana, Renee Firestone, Irene Zisblatt, Tom Lantos, Michael Cahana', 'PG-13', 'Five Jewish Hungarians, now US citizens, tell their stories: before March 1944, when Nazis began to exterminate Hungarian Jews, months in concentration camps, and visiting childhood homes more than 50 years later. An historian, a Sonderkommando, a doctor who experimented on Auschwitz prisoners, and US soldiers who were part of the liberation in April 1945.', 'Five Jewish Hungarians, now US citizens, tell their stories: before March 1944, when Nazis began to exterminate Hungarian Jews, months in concentration camps, and visiting childhood homes more than 50 years later. An historian, a Sonderkommando, a doctor who experimented on Auschwitz prisoners, and US soldiers who were part of the liberation in April 1945.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWr6QDDcO2HHKqvJvgsJ1hQz4Gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20595'),
  ('11829304807249624', 'The Last Days', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Andrzej Wajda, Paweł Edelman', 'Andrzej Wajda, Jan Nowina-Zarzycki, Piotr Wereśniak', 'Bogusław Linda, Daniel Olbrychski, Grażyna Szapołowska, Andrzej Seweryn, Marek Kondrat, Krzysztof Kolberger, Sergey Shakurov, Jerzy Bińczycki', null, 'Romance brings two warring families together in this historical drama. As citizens fight for independence in 1810s Lithuania, Tadeusz, the son of a murderer, and Zosia, a young woman, come together for a wedding against a backdrop of changing politics, ancient traditions, and the uncertain future of a country.', 'Romance brings two warring families together in this historical drama. As citizens fight for independence in 1810s Lithuania, Tadeusz, the son of a murderer, and Zosia, a young woman, come together for a wedding against a backdrop of changing politics, ancient traditions, and the uncertain future of a country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUhFR2DQLpt8YWMvEMVTa55bIEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4966'),
  ('997598153756434991', 'The Last Days', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor, Daniel Aranyó', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Jose Coronado, Marta Etura, Leticia Dolera, Mikel Iglesias, Ivan Massagué, Pere Ventura, Lluís Soler', null, 'A mysterious epidemic spreads across the planet. Humanity develops an irrational fear of open spaces that causes instant death. Soon, the world population is trapped inside buildings. As Barcelona descends into chaos, Marc sets off on a quest to find Julia, his missing girlfriend, without ever going outside.', 'A mysterious epidemic spreads across the planet. Humanity develops an irrational fear of open spaces that causes instant death. Soon, the world population is trapped inside buildings. As Barcelona descends into chaos, Marc sets off on a quest to find Julia, his missing girlfriend, without ever going outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRKybTUmEy3ZHS2o2ZDUCGyRAAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168138'),
  ('401556882962804424', 'The Last Days of American Crime', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Olivier Megaton, Daniel Aranyó', 'Karl Gajdusek', 'Edgar Ramírez, Michael Pitt, Anna Brewster, Sharlto Copley, Tamer Burjaq, Neels Clasen, Tony Caprari, Kate Normington', 'R', 'In the not-too-distant future, as a final response to crime and terrorism, the U.S. government plans to broadcast a signal that will make it impossible for anyone to knowingly break the law.', 'In the not-too-distant future, as a final response to crime and terrorism, the U.S. government plans to broadcast a signal that will make it impossible for anyone to knowingly break the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygCQnDEqUEIamBpdQdDYnFfxvgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339095'),
  ('513377456244168671', 'The Last Days of Chez Nous', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gillian Armstrong, John Martin, Charlotte Dirickx', 'Helen Garner', 'Lisa Harrow, Bruno Ganz, Kerry Fox, Miranda Otto, Kiri Paramore, Bill Hunter, Lex Marinos, Mickey Camilleri', 'R', 'The story of sisters Vicki and Beth, when Vicki begins an affair with Beth''s intriguing French husband.', 'The story of sisters Vicki and Beth, when Vicki begins an affair with Beth''s intriguing French husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvgJvwtiSbMAoeMxtfuV4eVk17I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41772'),
  ('90291034762124735', 'The Last Days of Disco', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Whit Stillman, John Thomas, Cas Donovan', 'Whit Stillman', 'Chloë Sevigny, Kate Beckinsale, Chris Eigeman, Mackenzie Astin, Matt Keeslar, Robert Sean Leonard, Jennifer Beals, Matt Ross', 'R', 'Two young women and their friends spend spare time at an exclusive nightclub in 1980s New York.', 'Two young women and their friends spend spare time at an exclusive nightclub in 1980s New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lReaAZCsA0GXvJrxzSMsFxwgh6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16980'),
  ('787637426527813035', 'The Last Days of Emma Blank', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex van Warmerdam, Tom Erisman', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Marlies Heuer, Eva van de Wijdeven, Annet Malherbe, Gene Bervoets, Marwan Kenzari, Gijs Naber, Alex van Warmerdam', null, 'In a large country home, the owner Emma Blank is very ill and is cared for by her household staff: Haneveld the head housekeeper, Bella the cook, Gonnie the maid and Meier the man-servant. Despite her desperate need for loving care, Emma is a steely, avaricious dictator whose demands become ever more absurd, to the extent that her staff are driven to madness. That is, until the day they discover that they stand to inherit nothing whereupon they drop their charade of caring and concern and instead plot their revenge...', 'In a large country home, the owner Emma Blank is very ill and is cared for by her household staff: Haneveld the head housekeeper, Bella the cook, Gonnie the maid and Meier the man-servant. Despite her desperate need for loving care, Emma is a steely, avaricious dictator whose demands become ever more absurd, to the extent that her staff are driven to madness. That is, until the day they discover that they stand to inherit nothing whereupon they drop their charade of caring and concern and instead plot their revenge...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSuiA2UpxySDupnFW4TqJD5BJI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42346'),
  ('67729964425443013', 'The Last Days of Frank and Jesse James', 1986, 'TV Movie, Action, Drama, Western', 'William A. Graham', 'Bill Stratton', 'Johnny Cash, Kris Kristofferson, Marcia Cross, Gail Youngs, David Allan Coe, Andy Stahl, June Carter Cash, Ed Bruce', 'PG', 'This movie looks at the last years (not days, as implied in the title) of famous outlaws, Frank and Jesse James. The film opens in 1877 with the brothers trying to settle down after 15 years of thievery. Frank is shown to be a book-loving and family-oriented man, while brother Jesse is a money-hungry womanizer. The movie follows their lives through Jesse''s death at the hands of the "rotten little coward" Bob Ford and Frank''s death in 1892.', 'This movie looks at the last years (not days, as implied in the title) of famous outlaws, Frank and Jesse James. The film opens in 1877 with the brothers trying to settle down after 15 years of thievery. Frank is shown to be a book-loving and family-oriented man, while brother Jesse is a money-hungry womanizer. The movie follows their lives through Jesse''s death at the hands of the "rotten little coward" Bob Ford and Frank''s death in 1892.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wZ0RsR966ddGx7BWeiZqO2Q727.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55220'),
  ('28017180437472206', 'The Last Days of Frankie the Fly', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Markle, Phil Parmet', 'Dayton Callie', 'Dennis Hopper, Daryl Hannah, Michael Madsen, Kiefer Sutherland, Dayton Callie, Charles Carroll, Jack McGee, Karen Roe', null, 'Dreaming of ascending the underworld ladder and gaining revenge on his sadistic boss, Sal, a Mafia flunky, Frankie, tries to take a step in the right direction by "saving" an exploited, drug-addicted porn actress, Margaret.', 'Dreaming of ascending the underworld ladder and gaining revenge on his sadistic boss, Sal, a Mafia flunky, Frankie, tries to take a step in the right direction by "saving" an exploited, drug-addicted porn actress, Margaret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TpztUZFGGy7UTdAqhZYvcBQzhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21119'),
  ('344778923345709155', 'The Last Days of Humanity', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Alessandro Gagliardo, Enrico Ghezzi', null, 'Toni Servillo, Adelchi Ghezzi, Enrico Ghezzi, Aura Ghezzi', null, 'The panorama of human affairs encounters the “man with a movie camera”. His playground has no boundaries, his curiosity no limits. Characters, situations and places pitch camp in the life of a humanity that is at once the viewer and the thing viewed. But what are the last days of this humanity? Have they already passed? Are they now or still to come?', 'The panorama of human affairs encounters the “man with a movie camera”. His playground has no boundaries, his curiosity no limits. Characters, situations and places pitch camp in the life of a humanity that is at once the viewer and the thing viewed. But what are the last days of this humanity? Have they already passed? Are they now or still to come?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjmVmVN6XhIMZC8L6oKNogINWsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004675'),
  ('343028569653558450', 'The Last Days of Patton', 1986, 'War, Drama, TV Movie', 'Delbert Mann, Dennis C. Lewiston', 'William Luce', 'George C. Scott, Richard Dysart, Murray Hamilton, Ed Lauter, Kathryn Leigh Scott, Horst Janson, Daniel Benzali, Ron Berglas', null, 'Gen. George S. Patton now works a desk job for the U.S. military after World War II. In the midst of dealing with the difficulty of adapting to his dramatic change of lifestyle, Patton is involved in an auto wreck that leaves him in critical condition. While his body fails him, Patton introspectively reminisces about his relationship with his spouse, Beatrice; his childhood; and his days on the WWI battlefields.', 'Gen. George S. Patton now works a desk job for the U.S. military after World War II. In the midst of dealing with the difficulty of adapting to his dramatic change of lifestyle, Patton is involved in an auto wreck that leaves him in critical condition. While his body fails him, Patton introspectively reminisces about his relationship with his spouse, Beatrice; his childhood; and his days on the WWI battlefields.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqgkn5cr5mUNh3czr4XhXinQ77i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139262'),
  ('769001115148383131', 'The Last Days of Pompeii', 1908, 'Drama, History', 'Arturo Ambrosio, Luigi Maggi, Roberto Omegna', 'Roberto Omegna', 'Luigi Maggi, Umberto Mozzato, Lydia De Roberti, Ernesto Vaser, Mirra Principi, Roberto Omegna', null, 'Pompeii 79AD, mere days before the Vesuvian eruption. Glaucus and Jone are in love with each other. Arbaces, the Egyptian High Priest, is determined to conquer Jone. Glaucus purchases Nydia, the blind and long-suffering slave. Nydia falls in love with Glaucus and asks Arbaces for his help. He gives her a potion to make Glaucus fall in love with her-- In fact, a poison which will cause violent insanity.', 'Pompeii 79AD, mere days before the Vesuvian eruption. Glaucus and Jone are in love with each other. Arbaces, the Egyptian High Priest, is determined to conquer Jone. Glaucus purchases Nydia, the blind and long-suffering slave. Nydia falls in love with Glaucus and asks Arbaces for his help. He gives her a potion to make Glaucus fall in love with her-- In fact, a poison which will cause violent insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bDaGr1bjSuX5pv1wJXX1HhOuL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284799'),
  ('947227917943081353', 'The Last Days of Pompeii', 1913, 'Drama, Action', 'Eleuterio Rodolfi, Mario Caserini', 'Mario Caserini', 'Ubaldo Stefani, Fernanda Negri Pouget, Eugenio Tettoni Fior, Antonio Grisanti, Cesare Gani-Carini, Vitale Di Stefano, Maria Brioschi, Carlo Campogalliani', null, 'Well-respected Pompeiian Glaucus performs an act of kindness by purchasing Nydia, a blind slave being mistreated by her owner. Nydia falls in love with her new master, but he only has eyes for Ione. Ione in turn is lusted after by Arbace, an Egyptian high priest of Isis. When Nydia beseeches Isis for help in capturing Glaucus'' heart, Arbace gives her a "love" potion-- an elixir made to drive Glaucus mad, securing Ione for himself. Ultimately, Mount Vesuvius will end their lives and seal their fates in a terrible, glorious eruption.', 'Well-respected Pompeiian Glaucus performs an act of kindness by purchasing Nydia, a blind slave being mistreated by her owner. Nydia falls in love with her new master, but he only has eyes for Ione. Ione in turn is lusted after by Arbace, an Egyptian high priest of Isis. When Nydia beseeches Isis for help in capturing Glaucus'' heart, Arbace gives her a "love" potion-- an elixir made to drive Glaucus mad, securing Ione for himself. Ultimately, Mount Vesuvius will end their lives and seal their fates in a terrible, glorious eruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4HhfyXRV2MLEcbreKJD0V7sUlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133123'),
  ('947825947271847961', 'The Last Days of Pompeii', 1935, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Ernest B. Schoedsack, J. Roy Hunt', 'Ruth Rose', 'Preston Foster, Alan Hale, Basil Rathbone, John Wood, Louis Calhern, David Holt, Dorothy Wilson, Wyrley Birch', 'NR', 'In this action-filled spectacle set in ancient Pompeii, a blacksmith becomes a Roman gladiator, though his rise to wealth and power is jeopardized by his son''s Christianity and the eruption of Vesuvius.', 'In this action-filled spectacle set in ancient Pompeii, a blacksmith becomes a Roman gladiator, though his rise to wealth and power is jeopardized by his son''s Christianity and the eruption of Vesuvius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwvCu5Bc03BEcEZoWMRhlrI22nI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170558'),
  ('417020571576144738', 'The Last Days of Pompeii', 1959, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Mario Bonnard, Sergio Corbucci, Duccio Tessari', 'Ennio De Concini, Sergio Leone, Duccio Tessari', 'Steve Reeves, Christine Kaufmann, Fernando Rey, Barbara Carroll, Anne-Marie Baumann, Mimmo Palmara, Guillermo Marín, Carlo Tamberlani', 'NR', 'Glaucus, a demobilized centurion returns home to Pompeii to find his father murdered by a gang of black-hooded Christian robbers that terrorizes the city and he decides to investigate the matter while the nearby volcano threatens to erupt.', 'Glaucus, a demobilized centurion returns home to Pompeii to find his father murdered by a gang of black-hooded Christian robbers that terrorizes the city and he decides to investigate the matter while the nearby volcano threatens to erupt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcukiLNn4B8GLEhnj4CKUWsW4lD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43098'),
  ('1106442169685454460', 'The Last Days on Mars', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Robbie Ryan, Ruairi Robinson, Alex Oakley', 'Clive Dawson', 'Liev Schreiber, Elias Koteas, Romola Garai, Olivia Williams, Johnny Harris, Goran Kostić, Tom Cullen, Yusra Warsama', 'R', 'On the last day of the first manned mission to Mars, a crew member of Tantalus Base believes he has made an astounding discovery – fossilized evidence of bacterial life. Unwilling to let the relief crew claim all the glory, he disobeys orders to pack up and goes out on an unauthorized expedition to collect further samples. But a routine excavation turns to disaster when the porous ground collapses and he falls into a deep crevice. His devastated colleagues attempt to recover his body. However, when another vanishes, they start to suspect that the life-form they have discovered is not without danger.', 'On the last day of the first manned mission to Mars, a crew member of Tantalus Base believes he has made an astounding discovery – fossilized evidence of bacterial life. Unwilling to let the relief crew claim all the glory, he disobeys orders to pack up and goes out on an unauthorized expedition to collect further samples. But a routine excavation turns to disaster when the porous ground collapses and he falls into a deep crevice. His devastated colleagues attempt to recover his body. However, when another vanishes, they start to suspect that the life-form they have discovered is not without danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxcQkAhpn8cvJTsU8PXblI5Qq8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190847'),
  ('248546398070214093', 'The Last Deadly Mission', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Olivier Marchal, Denis Rouden', null, 'Daniel Auteuil, Olivia Bonamy, Catherine Marchal, Francis Renaud, Gérald Laroche, Guy Lecluyse, Philippe Nahon, Moussa Maaskri', null, 'A washed-up Marseilles cop (Auteuil) earns a chance at redemption by protecting a woman from the man who killed her parents as he is about to be released from prison.', 'A washed-up Marseilles cop (Auteuil) earns a chance at redemption by protecting a woman from the man who killed her parents as he is about to be released from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eo0VXzqKA5xkWUVDGqgaEzIpo8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14765'),
  ('169205883999900313', 'The Last Deal', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jonathan Salemi, Dominic López', 'Jonathan Salemi', 'Sala Baker, Gigi Gustin, Anthony Molinari, Mike Ferguson, Clark Moore, Conner Floyd, Sofia Masson, Linda Burzynski', 'R', 'A blackmarket cannabis dealer gets squeezed out of the business when marijuana becomes legal, and is forced to make one last deal with the people he should trust the least.', 'A blackmarket cannabis dealer gets squeezed out of the business when marijuana becomes legal, and is forced to make one last deal with the people he should trust the least.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAjw1FsPVGxmZoEFkuGTv4WRrgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1042163'),
  ('259518660267854859', 'The Last Death', 2012, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'David Ruiz', 'David Ruiz', 'Kuno Becker, Álvaro Guerrero, Carlos Bracho, Claudette Maillé, Alexandra de la Mora, Manolo Cardona, Emilio Guerrero, Guillermo Larrea', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quYraiIFpATsq2MBcNNQPR0jHzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122240'),
  ('234452708285605292', 'The Last Descent', 2016, 'Drama', 'Isaac Halasima, Matt Cropper', 'Isaac Halasima', 'Chadwick Hopson, Alexis Johnson, Landon Henneman, Jyllian Petrie, Jacob Omer, Mason D. Davis, Ben Lokey', 'PG', 'In 2009 John Jones entered Nutty Putty Cave with his brother Josh. What happened next has been a topic of much discussion and controversy ever since. Over 127 rescuers responded to the call for aid, and each one has their own take on the events. A story about love, life, and human connection. Ultimately it is the story about how clearly you can see what matters most when you are at the edge of life and death. Made with cooperation from members of John''s immediate family.', 'In 2009 John Jones entered Nutty Putty Cave with his brother Josh. What happened next has been a topic of much discussion and controversy ever since. Over 127 rescuers responded to the call for aid, and each one has their own take on the events. A story about love, life, and human connection. Ultimately it is the story about how clearly you can see what matters most when you are at the edge of life and death. Made with cooperation from members of John''s immediate family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqmxWYRLXhZorcZmnGCTZIRkaHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412605'),
  ('112755177273069719', 'The Last Detail', 1973, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hal Ashby, Michael Chapman, Alan Hopkins', 'Robert Towne', 'Jack Nicholson, Otis Young, Randy Quaid, Clifton James, Carol Kane, Michael Moriarty, Luana Anders, Kathleen Miller', 'R', 'Two Navy men are ordered to bring a young offender to prison, but decide to show him one last good time along the way.', 'Two Navy men are ordered to bring a young offender to prison, but decide to show him one last good time along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQoNkO99qfaBjh5aoA0pKau1prp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14886'),
  ('453182864710780143', 'The Last Diamond', 2014, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Eric Barbier, Denis Rouden', 'Marie Eynard, Eric Barbier, Trân-Minh Nam', 'Yvan Attal, Bérénice Bejo, Jean-François Stévenin, Antoine Basler, Jacques Spiesser, Annie Cordy, Michel Israël, Charlie Dupont', 'PG-13', 'Simon, a burglar on probation, agreed to go on the biggest shot of his life: The flight of the "Florentine", a mythical diamond set auction by its owners. To succeed, he must approach Julia, expert diamond for sale which is a considerable personal and family issue. Beyond a jigsaw particularly daring, Julia Simon will lead to a destiny she could not imagine.', 'Simon, a burglar on probation, agreed to go on the biggest shot of his life: The flight of the "Florentine", a mythical diamond set auction by its owners. To succeed, he must approach Julia, expert diamond for sale which is a considerable personal and family issue. Beyond a jigsaw particularly daring, Julia Simon will lead to a destiny she could not imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpsQKT0YHlDQ6Rzv0xbpPEfbe13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269714'),
  ('503182843174079596', 'The Last Dinosaur', 1977, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alexander Grasshoff, Tsugunobu Kotani, Minoru Kurita', 'William Overgard', 'Richard Boone, Joan Van Ark, Steven Keats, Luther Rackley, Masumi Sekiya, William Ross, Carl Hansen, Nancy Magsig', null, 'Wealthy big game hunter (Boone), along with his group, gets trapped in pre-historic times where they are stalked by a ferocious dinosaur.', 'Wealthy big game hunter (Boone), along with his group, gets trapped in pre-historic times where they are stalked by a ferocious dinosaur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onz1bppwALlHmBMUJsN53Rkgs7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71692'),
  ('941601340562111568', 'The Last Dive', 1992, 'Drama', 'João César Monteiro, Dominique Chapuis', 'Friedrich Hölderlin, João César Monteiro', 'Fabienne Babe, Canto e Castro, Dinis Gomes, Francesca Prandi, Rita Blanco, Catarina Lourenço, Ana Vaz da Silva, Luis Miguel Cintra', null, 'Eloi, a paunchy middle-aged man, finds Samuel, a young sad sack, about to kill himself by plunging into the sea. Eloi takes Samuel under his wing, giving him a hot meal and bringing him to a seedy night club to introduce him to Esperança, who is said to be the most beautiful sex worker in Lisbon—and is also Eloi’s daughter.', 'Eloi, a paunchy middle-aged man, finds Samuel, a young sad sack, about to kill himself by plunging into the sea. Eloi takes Samuel under his wing, giving him a hot meal and bringing him to a seedy night club to introduce him to Esperança, who is said to be the most beautiful sex worker in Lisbon—and is also Eloi’s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rRUju5FnUmbFm0v1VvknTcqOqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83226'),
  ('459733954328872948', 'The Last Dolphin King', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ernest Riera, Luis Ansorena Hervés, Alfredo de Juan', 'Ernest Riera, Luis Ansorena Hervés', null, 'R', 'This documentary traces the career of renowned Spanish dolphin trainer José Luis Barbero and the events leading up to his shocking death in 2015.', 'This documentary traces the career of renowned Spanish dolphin trainer José Luis Barbero and the events leading up to his shocking death in 2015.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eALBxCLwgOECIbEVH8aa5UAWLW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046532'),
  ('248539909306749189', 'The Last Dragon', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Schultz, James A. Contner, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Louis Venosta', 'Taimak, Vanity, Christopher Murney, Julius Carry, Faith Prince, Leo O''Brien, Mike Starr, Jim Moody', 'PG-13', 'A young man searches for the "master" to obtain the final level of martial arts mastery known as the glow. Along the way he must fight an evil martial arts expert and rescue a beautiful singer from an obsessed music promoter.', 'A young man searches for the "master" to obtain the final level of martial arts mastery known as the glow. Along the way he must fight an evil martial arts expert and rescue a beautiful singer from an obsessed music promoter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5QnLY30gXlZ8luiJE3quDs1WNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13938'),
  ('368586579144817765', 'The Last Dragonslayer', 2016, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Adam Etherington, Jamie Magnus Stone', 'Jasper Fforde, Tom Edge', 'Ellise Chappell, Andrew Buchan, Richard E. Grant, Adeel Akhtar, Matt Berry, John Bradley, Pauline Collins, Genevieve Gaunt', null, 'In a fantasy world where magic is being superceded by technology, an orphaned teen discovers her destiny to become a dragonslayer.', 'In a fantasy world where magic is being superceded by technology, an orphaned teen discovers her destiny to become a dragonslayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aqqYXoLTER1N2mR9MD5CNGqxhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431742'),
  ('115267675021992719', 'The Last Drive-In Theater', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Iberê Carvalho, André Carvalheira', 'Iberê Carvalho, Zepedro Gollo', 'Breno Nina, Othon Bastos, Rita Assemany, Fernanda Rocha, Chico Sant''anna, André Deca, Rosanna Viegas, Vinícius Ferreira', null, 'When returning to his hometown with his ill mother, Marlombrando meets again his father and the Drive-in cinema where he spent his childhood. Almeida keeps the cinema functioning with the assistance of only two employees: Paula, who takes care of the projection and the snack bar; Jose, an old friend of Almeida, who helps selling tickets at the cashier and cleaning up the place. The arrival of Marlombrando and the demolition threatening of the Drive-in will bring new directions to their lives.', 'When returning to his hometown with his ill mother, Marlombrando meets again his father and the Drive-in cinema where he spent his childhood. Almeida keeps the cinema functioning with the assistance of only two employees: Paula, who takes care of the projection and the snack bar; Jose, an old friend of Almeida, who helps selling tickets at the cashier and cleaning up the place. The arrival of Marlombrando and the demolition threatening of the Drive-in will bring new directions to their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAYEXuXvcRutBqfy0LpQNPH5Mfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314563'),
  ('811155941191826031', 'The Last Drop', 2006, 'Action, Crime, History, War', 'Maxime Alexandre, Colin Teague', null, 'Billy Zane, Neil Newbon, Michael Madsen, Alexander Skarsgård, Neil Jackson, Tommy Flanagan, Nick Moran, Laurence Fox', null, 'Different factions in WWII-era Holland race to find a stash of Nazi gold.', 'Different factions in WWII-era Holland race to find a stash of Nazi gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMzMmrzi0ATCICWlszQOm1OMJjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2911'),
  ('491021194251061775', 'The Last Duel', 2021, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Dariusz Wolski, Stéphane Cressend, Cristina Onori', 'Nicole Holofcener, Ben Affleck, Matt Damon', 'Matt Damon, Adam Driver, Jodie Comer, Ben Affleck, Harriet Walter, Marton Csokas, Alex Lawther, William Houston', 'R', 'King Charles VI declares that Knight Jean de Carrouges settle his dispute with his squire, Jacques Le Gris, by challenging him to a duel.', 'King Charles VI declares that Knight Jean de Carrouges settle his dispute with his squire, Jacques Le Gris, by challenging him to a duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjrJE0fpzPvX8saJXj8VNfcjBoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617653'),
  ('26639698559895736', 'The Last Elvis', 2012, 'Drama, Music', 'Armando Bo, Javier Julia, Martín Porta', 'Armando Bo, Nicolás Giacobone', 'John McInerny, Margarita Lopez, Griselda Siciliani, Alberto Ajaka, Germán de Silva, Cristina Blanco, Patricia Camponovo, Lucrecia Carrillo', null, 'In the unique world of the Buenos Aires celebrity-impersonator scene, “Elvis” Gutiérrez is a star. By day, though, he must contend with a dead-end factory job and an ex-wife who worries about how his obsessive behavior affects their young daughter, Lisa Marie. Feeling more connected to his persona as the King than to his own family, Gutiérrez retreats from reality until a tragic accident interrupts his plans and forces him to grapple with his real-world responsibilities.', 'In the unique world of the Buenos Aires celebrity-impersonator scene, “Elvis” Gutiérrez is a star. By day, though, he must contend with a dead-end factory job and an ex-wife who worries about how his obsessive behavior affects their young daughter, Lisa Marie. Feeling more connected to his persona as the King than to his own family, Gutiérrez retreats from reality until a tragic accident interrupts his plans and forces him to grapple with his real-world responsibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjbNhUHzj4nZtBpMyY7n2D9n4DC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84302'),
  ('305091549025657979', 'The Last Emperor', 1987, 'Drama, History', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Vittorio Storaro, Nicoletta Peyran', 'Mark Peploe, Bernardo Bertolucci', 'John Lone, Joan Chen, Peter O''Toole, Ruocheng Ying, Victor Wong, Dennis Dun, Ryuichi Sakamoto, Maggie Han', 'PG-13', 'A dramatic history of Pu Yi, the last of the Emperors of China, from his lofty birth and brief reign in the Forbidden City, the object of worship by half a billion people; through his abdication, his decline and dissolute lifestyle; his exploitation by the invading Japanese, and finally to his obscure existence as just another peasant worker in the People''s Republic.', 'A dramatic history of Pu Yi, the last of the Emperors of China, from his lofty birth and brief reign in the Forbidden City, the object of worship by half a billion people; through his abdication, his decline and dissolute lifestyle; his exploitation by the invading Japanese, and finally to his obscure existence as just another peasant worker in the People''s Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TILJhdeJAaEyDiwvJZMo9SQBoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746'),
  ('1118669705315558801', 'The Last Employee', 2011, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Alexander Adolph, Jutta Pohlmann', 'Alexander Adolph', 'Christian Berkel, Bibiana Beglau, Jule Ronstedt, Gundi Ellert, Helmfried von Lüttichau, Leopold Conzen, Paul Faßnacht, Heinz-Josef Braun', null, 'David Bottcher, a lawyer on a long hiatus for recovery from a mental illness, starts working as a liquidator for a firm. Things start going wrong when an employee he dismisses starts stalking him.', 'David Bottcher, a lawyer on a long hiatus for recovery from a mental illness, starts working as a liquidator for a firm. Things start going wrong when an employee he dismisses starts stalking him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KrrG8UeKSotChqaObKGWr3OiCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114880'),
  ('114529850368054725', 'The Last Execution', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nikolai von Graevenitz, Franziska Stünkel', 'Franziska Stünkel', 'Lars Eidinger, Devid Striesow, Luise Heyer, Paula Kalenberg, Peter Benedict, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Andreas Schröders, Moritz Jahn', null, 'The ambitious scientist Franz Walter doesn''t hesitate when he is promised a professorship at the university. He immediately accepts, pledges absolute loyalty to the system and agrees to work for the GDR''s foreign intelligence service until he can take up his new position. Together with his colleague Dirk, he is sent on foreign assignments to West Germany. Franz soon has to use blackmail to get innocent people to talk. But his superiors go even further: GDR refugees and their relatives are targeted to be psychologically destroyed, forged letters, medical diagnoses, surveillance and wiretapping are on the agenda. However, this is more than Franz can bear: he feels powerless and increasingly isolates himself. When he then decides to steal secret documents for a later defection to the West, this results in an unfortunate chain reaction leading to his arrest and ultimately to his execution...', 'The ambitious scientist Franz Walter doesn''t hesitate when he is promised a professorship at the university. He immediately accepts, pledges absolute loyalty to the system and agrees to work for the GDR''s foreign intelligence service until he can take up his new position. Together with his colleague Dirk, he is sent on foreign assignments to West Germany. Franz soon has to use blackmail to get innocent people to talk. But his superiors go even further: GDR refugees and their relatives are targeted to be psychologically destroyed, forged letters, medical diagnoses, surveillance and wiretapping are on the agenda. However, this is more than Franz can bear: he feels powerless and increasingly isolates himself. When he then decides to steal secret documents for a later defection to the West, this results in an unfortunate chain reaction leading to his arrest and ultimately to his execution...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZZExOfjt668GsQzey3dIN7ZOD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802121'),
  ('757877777641928274', 'The Last Executioner', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Wade Muller, Tom Waller', 'Don Linder', 'Vithaya Pansringarm, Penpak Sirikul, David Asavanond, Thira Chutikul, Suchada Rojmanothum, Jaran Petcharoen, Pisan Akaraseranee, Tanyarat Pradittan', null, 'Inspired by real events, The Last Executioner is the story of Chavoret Jaruboon, the last person in Thailand whose job it was to execute by gun. A rock musician who adored Elvis, but took a ''respectable'' job to support the family he loved devotedly, and then constantly tried to reconcile the good and bad karma that came from this decision.', 'Inspired by real events, The Last Executioner is the story of Chavoret Jaruboon, the last person in Thailand whose job it was to execute by gun. A rock musician who adored Elvis, but took a ''respectable'' job to support the family he loved devotedly, and then constantly tried to reconcile the good and bad karma that came from this decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwtgAiLrKA0OeaKRrvvZY4Op6Uo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333933'),
  ('111091073868804', 'The Last Exorcism', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Daniel Stamm, Zoltan Honti', 'Huck Botko, Andrew Gurland', 'Patrick Fabian, Ashley Bell, Iris Bahr, Louis Herthum, Caleb Landry Jones, Tony Bentley, Shanna Forrestall, Justin Shafer', 'PG-13', 'After years of performing “exorcisms” and taking believers’ money, Reverend Marcus travels to rural Louisiana with a film crew so he can dispel what he believes is the myth of demonic possession. The dynamic reverend is certain that this will be another routine “exorcism” on a disturbed religious fanatic but instead comes upon the blood-soaked farm of the Sweetzer family and a true evil he would have never thought imaginable.', 'After years of performing “exorcisms” and taking believers’ money, Reverend Marcus travels to rural Louisiana with a film crew so he can dispel what he believes is the myth of demonic possession. The dynamic reverend is certain that this will be another routine “exorcism” on a disturbed religious fanatic but instead comes upon the blood-soaked farm of the Sweetzer family and a true evil he would have never thought imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOo9tgGjxdsQEgqc6g7E1NL8460.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38358'),
  ('16592950138413779', 'The Last Exorcism Part II', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly, Brendan Steacy', 'Ed Gass-Donnelly, Damien Chazelle', 'Ashley Bell, Julia Garner, Andrew Sensenig, Spencer Treat Clark, Judd Lormand, Muse Watson, Raeden Greer, Erica Michelle Singleton', 'PG-13', 'As Nell Sweetzer tries to build a new life, the evil force that once possessed her returns with an even more horrific plan.', 'As Nell Sweetzer tries to build a new life, the evil force that once possessed her returns with an even more horrific plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/260ztSWhGIYSLAjDC6smFWcdUSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146203'),
  ('190804060742726696', 'The Last Exploits of the Olsen Gang', 1974, 'Family, Comedy, Crime', 'Erik Balling, Tom Hedegaard', 'Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Ove Sprogøe, Morten Grunwald, Poul Bundgaard, Kirsten Walther, Axel Strøbye, Ole Ernst, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Ove Verner Hansen', null, 'The Olsen Gang has finally made it. They are in Mallorca, having fulfilled their dream. Almost, that is. They don''t have any money, so Egon has to open a safe at a restaurant to get some. As usual, however, Egon ends up in prision. When they return to Denmark, he has a new plan.', 'The Olsen Gang has finally made it. They are in Mallorca, having fulfilled their dream. Almost, that is. They don''t have any money, so Egon has to open a safe at a restaurant to get some. As usual, however, Egon ends up in prision. When they return to Denmark, he has a new plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2W9SStOJnFvYn7FIWB75g6IvpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12269'),
  ('17938359029780014', 'The Last Face', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sean Penn, Barry Ackroyd, Darryl Hammer', 'Erin Dignam', 'Charlize Theron, Javier Bardem, Jean Reno, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Jared Harris, Hopper Penn, Denise Newman, Mark De Villiers', 'R', 'Miguel, a heroic Spanish doctor, puts himself in harm''s way to deliver medical treatment to the victims of military uprisings in Africa.', 'Miguel, a heroic Spanish doctor, puts himself in harm''s way to deliver medical treatment to the victims of military uprisings in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egOM3BJgA44fR6YdiQJD51iQ4On.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287904'),
