  ('108534236860023419', 'The Last Fashion Show', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Carlo Vanzina, Carlo Tafani', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina, Franco Ferrini', 'Francesco Montanari, Vanessa Hessler, Richard E. Grant, Giselda Volodi, Virginie Marsan, Claudine Wilde, Paolo Seganti, Mario Cordova', null, 'The triumph of the designer Federico Marinoni in the world of Milanese fashion was marred by the tragic death of the maison''s main model and the designer''s muse, Alexandra Larsson, who was hit by a hit-and-run car while on her way to celebrate her consecration as a top model .', 'The triumph of the designer Federico Marinoni in the world of Milanese fashion was marred by the tragic death of the maison''s main model and the designer''s muse, Alexandra Larsson, who was hit by a hit-and-run car while on her way to celebrate her consecration as a top model .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40gZFLeGIfYpCdcX0evspAWhntq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71928'),
  ('1009560169172343786', 'The Last Fine Day', 2011, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Johannes Fabrick, Helmut Pirnat', 'Dorothee Schön', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Matilda Merkel, Nick Julius Schuck, Julia Koschitz, Lavinia Wilson, Heide Simon, Natascha Paulick, Martin Armknecht', null, 'The phone call from Sybille was usual. Her family didn''t even know that this call just started their last fine day...', 'The phone call from Sybille was usual. Her family didn''t even know that this call just started their last fine day...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4V4loIeb6QC0kVzlIh9OVf1XkLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143818'),
