  ('1038762188397183055', 'The Last Fleksnes', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bo Hermansson, Erling Thurmann-Andersen', 'Bo Hermansson, Rolv Wesenlund', 'Rolv Wesenlund, Aud Schønemann, Finn Mehlum, Per Christensen, Britt Langlie, Kjersti Døvigen, Marit Kolbræk, Julie Ege', null, 'Based on the television sitcom Fleksnes Fataliteter. Marve Fleksnes (Wesenlund) lives a comfortable life with his mother (Schønemann), but misses a woman in his life. He is afraid he might become the last Fleksnes. His mother enrols him in a charm school, where he excels. At the same time, a young lady moves into the apartment across the hall.', 'Based on the television sitcom Fleksnes Fataliteter. Marve Fleksnes (Wesenlund) lives a comfortable life with his mother (Schønemann), but misses a woman in his life. He is afraid he might become the last Fleksnes. His mother enrols him in a charm school, where he excels. At the same time, a young lady moves into the apartment across the hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpezxUjklUwYJ0iQxsVdZ0SfwDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55154'),
  ('944227998323915076', 'The Last Flight', 1931, 'Drama', 'William Dieterle, Sidney Hickox', 'John Monk Saunders', 'Richard Barthelmess, David Manners, Johnny Mack Brown, Helen Chandler, Elliott Nugent, Yola d''Avril, Walter Byron, Luis Alberni', 'NR', 'Cary, Shep, Bill, and Francis are pilots during World War I. The four friends, haunted by the devastation of the war, head to Paris instead of home, where they meet Nikki, an eccentric and wealthy young woman. Nikki is drawn to Cary, and the five friends, tagged by the boorish reporter, Frink, drink their way from Paris to Lisbon.', 'Cary, Shep, Bill, and Francis are pilots during World War I. The four friends, haunted by the devastation of the war, head to Paris instead of home, where they meet Nikki, an eccentric and wealthy young woman. Nikki is drawn to Cary, and the five friends, tagged by the boorish reporter, Frink, drink their way from Paris to Lisbon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUxjKqeZCEBJd0vE3CBf8bXUG15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99732'),
  ('341564471931532315', 'The Last Flight', 2009, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Karim Dridi, Antoine Monod', 'Pascal Arnold, Karim Dridi', 'Marion Cotillard, Guillaume Canet, Guillaume Marquet, Fred Epaud, Saïdou Abatcha, Michaël Vander-Meiren, Nabil Imtital, Halimata Graille', 'PG', 'Aviator Marie Vallières de Beaumont goes on a journey to find her lover Bill Lancaster after his plane disappears in the Sahara. After her plane is forced down in the Ténéré she meets Lieutenant Antoine Chauvet of the French Camel Corps who joins in the hunt for Lancaster. As the two endure hardships in the desert, they begin to develop feelings for each other.', 'Aviator Marie Vallières de Beaumont goes on a journey to find her lover Bill Lancaster after his plane disappears in the Sahara. After her plane is forced down in the Ténéré she meets Lieutenant Antoine Chauvet of the French Camel Corps who joins in the hunt for Lancaster. As the two endure hardships in the desert, they begin to develop feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9snMDPL6jKB4HZv4xwa535QQup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37779'),
  ('944997369225320084', 'The Last Flight', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benni Setiawan, Fahmy J. Saad, Andy Japra, Saptadji, Gazwani Altrisa, Widhi Susila Utama', 'Benni Setiawan', 'Jerome Kurnia, Nadya Arina, Aghniny Haque, Nasya Marcella, Devina Bertha', null, 'Beautiful flight attendant Tiara is romantically involved with Captain Deva Angkasa, a young pilot who was her high school friend, who is also in a relationship with Nadia, a very obsessive and ambitious young celebrity on Instagram. Three of them are involved in a love scandal and emotional manipulation.', 'Beautiful flight attendant Tiara is romantically involved with Captain Deva Angkasa, a young pilot who was her high school friend, who is also in a relationship with Nadia, a very obsessive and ambitious young celebrity on Instagram. Three of them are involved in a love scandal and emotional manipulation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkR8PxWKerRaN7xp6kVVESyUzqsn.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-flight-2026'),
  ('601545220594133686', 'The Last Flight of Noah''s Ark', 1980, 'Adventure, Family', 'Charles Jarrott, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'Elliott Gould, Geneviève Bujold, Rick Schroder, Tammy Lauren, John Fujioka, Vincent Gardenia, Yuki Shimoda, John P. Ryan', 'G', 'The only chance to escape a desert island is to convert the plane carrying many different animals into a boat.', 'The only chance to escape a desert island is to convert the plane carrying many different animals into a boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8fwghn06GmErA71Oepje1FaSBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35101'),
  ('928151031192110356', 'The Last Forest', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Luiz Bolognesi, Davi Kopenawa Yanomami', 'Davi Kopenawa Yanomami', 'Davi Kopenawa Yanomami, Ehuana Yaira Yanomami, Pedrinho Yanomami, Joselino Yanomami, Nilson Wakari Yanomami, Júnior Wakari Yanomami', null, 'In powerful images, alternating between documentary observation and staged sequences, and dense soundscapes, Luiz Bolognesi documents the Indigenous community of the Yanomami and depicts their threatened natural environment in the Amazon rainforest.', 'In powerful images, alternating between documentary observation and staged sequences, and dense soundscapes, Luiz Bolognesi documents the Indigenous community of the Yanomami and depicts their threatened natural environment in the Amazon rainforest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi2TElUd5OI5uhcHlurPFWpoY26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795780'),
  ('1032592585875365143', 'The Last Four Days', 1974, 'War, Drama, History', 'Carlo Lizzani, Roberto Gerardi', 'Fabio Pittorru, Carlo Lizzani', 'Rod Steiger, Lisa Gastoni, Franco Nero, Henry Fonda, Lino Capolicchio, Massimo Sarchielli, Andrea Aureli, Rodolfo Dal Pra', 'PG', 'In 1945, the dictator of fascist Italy and Hitler''s close ally Benito Mussolini faces defeat. In a desperate attempt to avoid capture, he tries to flee the country with his lover Claretta Petacci, but Italian partisans are on their tail.', 'In 1945, the dictator of fascist Italy and Hitler''s close ally Benito Mussolini faces defeat. In a desperate attempt to avoid capture, he tries to flee the country with his lover Claretta Petacci, but Italian partisans are on their tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qolbewwAZWIz0DEnRRJOXJJzG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61212'),
  ('1035445359318760828', 'The Last Foxtrot in Burbank', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Charles Band, Jory Valian', 'Frank Ray Perilli, Sammy Vaughn, Bill Haggard', 'Michael Pataki, Sherry Denton, Merlouch Drabin, I. William Quinn, Sally Marr, Simmy Bow, Richard Band', null, 'Cult director Charles Band brings you this "Last Tango in Paris" spoof with editing by acclaimed filmmaker John Carpenter.', 'Cult director Charles Band brings you this "Last Tango in Paris" spoof with editing by acclaimed filmmaker John Carpenter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uLbhTxZWGNVhvo0tmffaaygIy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651595'),
  ('1150649503031802180', 'The Last Frenzy', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rina Wu, Simu Feng', 'Rina Wu', 'Jia Bing, Tan Zhuo, Xiao Shenyang, Yu Yang, Dong Baoshi, Jackie Li, Zhang Baiqiao, Li Zongheng', null, 'Jia You Wei, a middle-aged man who has accomplished nothing, is diagnosed with a brain tumor and has only ten days left to live. He sells his old house, rumored to be demolished and reunites with several others who used to live there. They decide to indulge themselves in the final ten days of their lives. In this way, the quintet who parted ways 22 years ago in the family compound gathered together once again, only to realize that each of them has faced their own hardships in life.', 'Jia You Wei, a middle-aged man who has accomplished nothing, is diagnosed with a brain tumor and has only ten days left to live. He sells his old house, rumored to be demolished and reunites with several others who used to live there. They decide to indulge themselves in the final ten days of their lives. In this way, the quintet who parted ways 22 years ago in the family compound gathered together once again, only to realize that each of them has faced their own hardships in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkyYQ1G47kUGL1JNsuS26d6p93I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1225862'),
  ('788718747684653949', 'The Last Front', 2024, 'War, Drama, Action, History, Thriller', 'Julien Hayet-Kerknawi, Xavier Van D’Huynslager', 'Kate Wood', 'Iain Glen, Sasha Luss, Joe Anderson, David Calder, James Downie, Koen De Bouw, Julian Kostov, Leander Vyvey', null, 'In a Belgian village during the start of World War I, the Lambert family finds themselves thrust into the heart of the conflict in The Last Front. Leonard Lambert, a devoted husband and father, grapples with protecting his family as German forces advance to their village. Amidst the war, a tender love story blossoms between Adrien Lambert, Leonard''s son, and Louise Janssen, a local villager.', 'In a Belgian village during the start of World War I, the Lambert family finds themselves thrust into the heart of the conflict in The Last Front. Leonard Lambert, a devoted husband and father, grapples with protecting his family as German forces advance to their village. Amidst the war, a tender love story blossoms between Adrien Lambert, Leonard''s son, and Louise Janssen, a local villager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajxdxMVGpMO3QCvOPYUfMgDX0jL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633425'),
  ('229313607541782940', 'The Last Frontier', 1955, 'Western', 'Anthony Mann, William C. Mellor, Sam Nelson', 'Russell S. Hughes, Philip Yordan', 'Victor Mature, Guy Madison, Robert Preston, James Whitmore, Anne Bancroft, Russell Collins, Peter Whitney, Pat Hogan', 'NR', 'Three trappers become scouts for a cavalry captain who loses his fort to a hated colonel.', 'Three trappers become scouts for a cavalry captain who loses his fort to a hated colonel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKGgDmIh5BHPMKGK8dmsbJXBckI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4938'),
  ('936303803875897883', 'The Last Frontier', 2020, 'War, Drama, History', 'Andrey Gurkin, Vadim Shmelyov, Dmitry Galperin', 'Vadim Shmelyov, Igor Ugolnikov', 'Aleksey Bardukov, Evgeniy Dyatlov, Sergei Bezrukov, Lyubov Konstantinova, Artem Gubin, Igor Yudin, Guram Bablishvili, Dmitry Solomykin', null, 'The story of the Podolsk cadets’ heroic stand outside Moscow in October 1941. Cadets were sent to the Ilyinsky line, fighting alongside units from the Soviet 43rd Army to hold back the German advance until reinforcements arrived. Hopelessly outnumbered, young men laid down their lives in a battle lasting almost two weeks to obstruct the far superior German forces advancing towards Moscow. Around 3,500 cadets and their commanding officers were sent to hold up the last line of defense outside Moscow. Most of them remained there for eternity.', 'The story of the Podolsk cadets’ heroic stand outside Moscow in October 1941. Cadets were sent to the Ilyinsky line, fighting alongside units from the Soviet 43rd Army to hold back the German advance until reinforcements arrived. Hopelessly outnumbered, young men laid down their lives in a battle lasting almost two weeks to obstruct the far superior German forces advancing towards Moscow. Around 3,500 cadets and their commanding officers were sent to hold up the last line of defense outside Moscow. Most of them remained there for eternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHsSgvOsKkrmIynVzR8aDd3Lewm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579831'),
  ('805032554229533159', 'The Last Full Measure', 2020, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Todd Robinson, Iris Hampton, Byron Werner', 'Todd Robinson', 'Sebastian Stan, Christopher Plummer, William Hurt, Ed Harris, Zach Roerig, Samuel L. Jackson, Jeremy Irvine, Peter Fonda', 'R', 'The incredible true story of Vietnam War hero William H. Pitsenbarger, a U.S. Air Force Pararescuemen medic who personally saved over sixty men. Thirty-two years later, Pentagon staffer Scott Huffman investigates a Congressional Medal of Honor request for Pitsenbarger and uncovers a high-level conspiracy behind the decades-long denial of the medal, prompting Huffman to put his own career on the line to seek justice for the fallen airman.', 'The incredible true story of Vietnam War hero William H. Pitsenbarger, a U.S. Air Force Pararescuemen medic who personally saved over sixty men. Thirty-two years later, Pentagon staffer Scott Huffman investigates a Congressional Medal of Honor request for Pitsenbarger and uncovers a high-level conspiracy behind the decades-long denial of the medal, prompting Huffman to put his own career on the line to seek justice for the fallen airman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMG8c80lyEkBXVgyHVqsdQhjgf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442065'),
  ('1126842816779132023', 'The Last Game', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Adri Rudi, Bjordi Mezini, Spiro Nino, Anxhi Rumani', 'Klaudia Brahimaj', 'Kiara Tito, Kamela Brahimaj, Isli Lamuca, Era Muçolli, Gazmend Nela', null, 'Luizi, a forgotten singer, suddenly becomes famous overnight and all of Albania goes crazy. In order to protect his fame and win the heart of Kiara, the girl he loves, he must keep a lie alive, one that drags them both into a chain of hilarious and chaotic situations.', 'Luizi, a forgotten singer, suddenly becomes famous overnight and all of Albania goes crazy. In order to protect his fame and win the heart of Kiara, the girl he loves, he must keep a lie alive, one that drags them both into a chain of hilarious and chaotic situations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7hXaFsSSPqxVPriSoB6OrJJ7UjB.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-game-2026-1'),
  ('1092857428997637282', 'The Last Gangster', 1937, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Edward Ludwig, William H. Daniels', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Edward G. Robinson, James Stewart, Rose Stradner, Lionel Stander, Douglas Scott, John Carradine, Sidney Blackmer, Grant Mitchell', 'NR', 'A crime boss goes searching for his ex-wife and son after a ten-year prison stint. His old gang has other plans though, and use the child to try and make him disclose the location of the loot he hid before going to the slammer.', 'A crime boss goes searching for his ex-wife and son after a ten-year prison stint. His old gang has other plans though, and use the child to try and make him disclose the location of the loot he hid before going to the slammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCNrlUTdwr7cNgy4mFuFF31uDNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28712'),
  ('1027745271749445775', 'The Last GunFight', 2025, 'Action', 'James Bamford, Ivan Vatsov', 'J. D. Zeik', 'Jon Voight, Adam Woodward, Charlotte Vega, Eloise Lovell Anderson, Daniel Bernhardt, Brock Pierce, Shaina West, Alix Villaret', 'R', '​In a ruthless underground tournament, the world''s top assassins fight to the death. But hidden among them is a rogue crew with its own deadly agenda: infiltrate the competition, survive the bloodbath, and take down the mastermind pulling the strings.', '​In a ruthless underground tournament, the world''s top assassins fight to the death. But hidden among them is a rogue crew with its own deadly agenda: infiltrate the competition, survive the bloodbath, and take down the mastermind pulling the strings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ElOux95K8mfK1kuxK6K4A8MulM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465038'),
  ('347203950443878806', 'The Last Hail M.A.R.Y.', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Juliette Cecile, Esmeree Sterling, Brennen Amonett, Canyon Prince, Bianca Foscht', 'Not Rated', 'When the planet Mercury is swallowed up by the Sun''s gravitational pull, a team aboard the Interplanetary Space Station must race to reverse the effect before Venus, and even Earth, are destroyed forever.', 'When the planet Mercury is swallowed up by the Sun''s gravitational pull, a team aboard the Interplanetary Space Station must race to reverse the effect before Venus, and even Earth, are destroyed forever.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcfdW5WWJLYaSujtofK25camHnPz.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-hail-m-a-r-y-2026'),
  ('817557108041478428', 'The Last Hammer Blow', 2014, 'Drama', 'Claire Mathon, Alix Delaporte', 'Alix Delaporte, Alain Le Henry', 'Romain Paul, Clotilde Hesme, Grégory Gadebois, Candela Peña, Farida Rahouadj, Farid Bendali, Tristán Ulloa, Mireia Vilapuig', null, 'When he first enters the Montpellier Opera House, Victor knows nothing about music. Nor does he know his father, Samuel Rovinski, who is there to conduct Mahler’s 6th symphony. To change the course of his suddenly uncertain future, for Nadia his mother, for Luna whom he has fallen in love with, Victor has decided to step out of the shadows. He’ll go as far as he needs to.', 'When he first enters the Montpellier Opera House, Victor knows nothing about music. Nor does he know his father, Samuel Rovinski, who is there to conduct Mahler’s 6th symphony. To change the course of his suddenly uncertain future, for Nadia his mother, for Luna whom he has fallen in love with, Victor has decided to step out of the shadows. He’ll go as far as he needs to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM0IH25bigtk1zdaT5ncHICppA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283699'),
