  ('505883565498496968', 'The Last Kiss', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gabriele Muccino, Marcello Montarsi, Francesco Vedovati', 'Gabriele Muccino', 'Stefano Accorsi, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Stefania Sandrelli, Martina Stella, Claudio Santamaria, Giorgio Pasotti, Marco Cocci, Pierfrancesco Favino', 'R', 'Giulia and Carlo have been happy together for three years, but Giulia''s announcement that she is pregnant sends him into a secret panic. Terrified at his imminent entry into the adult world of irreversible responsibilities, Carlo finds himself tempted by a bewitching 18-year-old girl, Francesca, whom he meets by chance at a wedding. The possibility of one last youthful crazy fling before the impending prison of parenthood proves to be too attractive to resist.', 'Giulia and Carlo have been happy together for three years, but Giulia''s announcement that she is pregnant sends him into a secret panic. Terrified at his imminent entry into the adult world of irreversible responsibilities, Carlo finds himself tempted by a bewitching 18-year-old girl, Francesca, whom he meets by chance at a wedding. The possibility of one last youthful crazy fling before the impending prison of parenthood proves to be too attractive to resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPrhgVQfvopYaZVCowf4Tqm4UPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12308'),
  ('747242395642374794', 'The Last Kiss', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tony Goldwyn, Pedro Gandol, Roxanna Macedo', 'Paul Haggis, Gabriele Muccino', 'Zach Braff, Jacinda Barrett, Casey Affleck, Rachel Bilson, Michael Weston, Eric Christian Olsen, Marley Shelton, Lauren Lee Smith', 'R', 'Michael has a great job, has his 4 best friends, and is in love with a beautiful girl at 30. He loves Jenna but his life seems predictable until someone else enters his life. It seems that everybody''s having relationship problems.', 'Michael has a great job, has his 4 best friends, and is in love with a beautiful girl at 30. He loves Jenna but his life seems predictable until someone else enters his life. It seems that everybody''s having relationship problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXEoGmvSuYSgdLzwuIPniK08VX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7511'),
  ('614083520287024493', 'The Last Kumite', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Taim M. Adams, Annika Sala, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Sean David Lowe, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Mathis Landwehr, Kurt McKinney, Billy Blanks, Matthias Hues, Cynthia Rothrock, Michel Qissi, David Kurzhal, Monia Moula', null, 'When Karate champion Michael Rivers wins the last tournament of his career, shady businessman Ron Hall offers him the opportunity to fight in an illegal Kumite in Bulgaria against the world’s best martial artists. When Michael declines, Hall has his daughter kidnapped and, in order to rescue her, Rivers is left with no choice but to compete in the deadly tournament. Arriving in Bulgaria, he finds out that he is not the only fighter whose loved one was taken. Rivers enlists the help of trainers Master Loren, and Julie Jackson but will it be enough for him to win the tournament and save his daughter’s life?', 'When Karate champion Michael Rivers wins the last tournament of his career, shady businessman Ron Hall offers him the opportunity to fight in an illegal Kumite in Bulgaria against the world’s best martial artists. When Michael declines, Hall has his daughter kidnapped and, in order to rescue her, Rivers is left with no choice but to compete in the deadly tournament. Arriving in Bulgaria, he finds out that he is not the only fighter whose loved one was taken. Rivers enlists the help of trainers Master Loren, and Julie Jackson but will it be enough for him to win the tournament and save his daughter’s life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDkaJgsPoSqa2cMe2hW2HAfyWwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115623'),
  ('841976475938265184', 'The Last Lap at Monza', 1989, 'Drama', 'Aleksandar Bošković', 'Dušan Prelević ''Prele''', 'Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Vesna Stanojević, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Predrag Ejdus, Josif Tatić, Dragan Maksimović, Goran Sultanović, Olivera Marković', null, 'The story of an outsider who spent seven years in prison for robbery. Eternal rebel, unsatisfied with the system and people around him.', 'The story of an outsider who spent seven years in prison for robbery. Eternal rebel, unsatisfied with the system and people around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWt8MCAVEx0GqYkJI6IB8IalfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144974'),
  ('366707042660566036', 'The Last Laugh', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Greg Pritikin, Steve Gainer, Mike De La Vina', 'Greg Pritikin', 'Chevy Chase, Richard Dreyfuss, Andie MacDowell, Kate Micucci, Chris Parnell, George Wallace, Lewis Black, Richard Kind', null, 'After moving to a retirement home, restless talent manager Al reconnects with long-ago client Buddy and coaxes him back out on the comedy circuit.', 'After moving to a retirement home, restless talent manager Al reconnects with long-ago client Buddy and coaxes him back out on the comedy circuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CSGJd80ajL7G7BIusniFi8XtFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571451'),
  ('530306970070185489', 'The Last Laugh', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sean Patrick Burke, Jeremy Berg, Chris Joseph Taylor', 'Jeremy Berg', 'Steve Vanderzee, Lowell Deo, Meranda Long, Marcus Leppard, Nick Sage Palmieri, Tonya M. Skoog, Luke Schuck, Jeffrey Arrington', null, 'A stand-up comedian on the verge of breakout success must make a terrible choice when he discovers a murderer on the loose in the theater where he''s about to perform his biggest show.', 'A stand-up comedian on the verge of breakout success must make a terrible choice when he discovers a murderer on the loose in the theater where he''s about to perform his biggest show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7qw3OFHLpBXIdesEwRFwcEOK0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735580'),
  ('11573040411088308', 'The Last Legion', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, War', 'Doug Lefler, Marco Pontecorvo, Elio Luciano', 'Jez Butterworth, Tom Butterworth', 'Colin Firth, Ben Kingsley, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Peter Mullan, Kevin McKidd, John Hannah, Iain Glen, Thomas Brodie-Sangster', 'PG-13', 'As the Roman empire crumbles, young Romulus Augustus flees the city and embarks on a perilous voyage to Britain to track down a legion of supporters.', 'As the Roman empire crumbles, young Romulus Augustus flees the city and embarks on a perilous voyage to Britain to track down a legion of supporters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2jaEoOsTEMqSskBJm3gfcuxNEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9703'),
  ('617491891395602946', 'The Last Leprechaun', 1998, 'Fantasy, Family', 'David Lister, Vincent G. Cox', 'Paul Matthews', 'Veronica Hamel, Jack Scalia, David Warner, Mick Walter, Brittney Bomann, Andrew J. Ferchland, Wilson Dunster, Jocelyn Broderick', null, 'Ethel and Tommy Barrick are sent to Ireland to spend the summer with their new stepmother. Once there, they discover her to be an evil, power-seeking witch, with real magical powers and a hatred for all things green.', 'Ethel and Tommy Barrick are sent to Ireland to spend the summer with their new stepmother. Once there, they discover her to be an evil, power-seeking witch, with real magical powers and a hatred for all things green.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DSq4WUrnwNuABZdsSH5ldIXi5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151742'),
  ('248106381289063176', 'The Last Letter from Your Lover', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Steel, Ben Howard, Aaron Hartley', 'Nick Payne, Esta Spalding', 'Shailene Woodley, Felicity Jones, Callum Turner, Joe Alwyn, Nabhaan Rizwan, Ncuti Gatwa, Emma Appleton, Christian Brassington', null, 'A young journalist in London becomes obsessed with a series of letters she discovers that recounts an intense star-crossed love affair from the 1960s.', 'A young journalist in London becomes obsessed with a series of letters she discovers that recounts an intense star-crossed love affair from the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDKK51YdOfu9pTmSRw7sHUhGFxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638449'),
  ('62792891474976117', 'The Last Lions', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Dereck Joubert, Dereck Joubert', 'Dereck Joubert', 'Jeremy Irons', null, 'In Botswana''s Okavango Delta, an ostracized lioness and her two cubs must fight alone to survive - overcoming all manner of hazards. Their only defense is to escape to Duba Island -- and with that, an unknown future. The setting for this epic tale is one of the last regions where lions can live in the wild. Faced with dwindling land and increasing pressure from hunting, lions - like our lone lioness and her cubs - are approaching the brink of extinction.', 'In Botswana''s Okavango Delta, an ostracized lioness and her two cubs must fight alone to survive - overcoming all manner of hazards. Their only defense is to escape to Duba Island -- and with that, an unknown future. The setting for this epic tale is one of the last regions where lions can live in the wild. Faced with dwindling land and increasing pressure from hunting, lions - like our lone lioness and her cubs - are approaching the brink of extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNxqoeTfHReYbHbhigir85J21Nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53505'),
  ('795698704035739886', 'The Last Little Red Riding Hood', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy, Music', 'Jan Kounen, Tetsuo Nagata, William Gally', 'Carlo De Boutiny, Jan Kounen', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Gérald Weingand, Diana Payne-Myers, Stéphane Chivot, Marc Caro, Alexandra Gonin, Christopher Steel, Ivan Merat-Barboff', null, 'A old red riding hood, badly crippled after killing a monster many years ago, comes up with a sinister plan to dance again.', 'A old red riding hood, badly crippled after killing a monster many years ago, comes up with a sinister plan to dance again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5XFR7Df3a9VqsEMXQHWtPhIjGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82143'),
  ('912752002876159211', 'The Last Lovecraft: Relic of Cthulhu', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror, Adventure', 'Henry Saine', null, 'Kyle Davis, Devin McGinn, Gregg Lawrence, Edmund Lupinski, Leah McKendrick, Richard Riehle, Oren Skoog, Martin Starr', null, 'Jeff, a down on his luck office worker finds out he is the last living relative of horror novelist H.P. Lovecraft. What he doesn''t know is that Lovecraft''s monsters are real and will soon threaten the very existence of mankind. Jeff and his best friend Charlie are forced to embark on a perilous adventure and they enlist the help of high school acquaintance, Paul, a self proclaimed Lovecraft specialist. Together the three unlikely heroes must protect an alien relic and prevent the release of an acient evil, known as Cthulhu.', 'Jeff, a down on his luck office worker finds out he is the last living relative of horror novelist H.P. Lovecraft. What he doesn''t know is that Lovecraft''s monsters are real and will soon threaten the very existence of mankind. Jeff and his best friend Charlie are forced to embark on a perilous adventure and they enlist the help of high school acquaintance, Paul, a self proclaimed Lovecraft specialist. Together the three unlikely heroes must protect an alien relic and prevent the release of an acient evil, known as Cthulhu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBrh6CTYhCXkcmGWyDfUgj814m7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53237'),
  ('517658012736510347', 'The Last Man', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Ortega, Rodrigo H. Vila, Gimena Joao', 'Rodrigo H. Vila', 'Hayden Christensen, Harvey Keitel, Marco Leonardi, Justin Kelly, Liz Solari, Fernán Mirás, Rafael Spregelburd, Raymond E. Lee', 'R', 'Tov Matheson is a war veteran with PTSD who perceives that the apocalypse is coming. After starting a relationship with a dubious Messiah, he leaves his normal life and begins the construction of a shelter underground, training himself, in an extreme way, at the cost of losing everything and making people believe he is insane. When he also believes it, something extraordinary happens.', 'Tov Matheson is a war veteran with PTSD who perceives that the apocalypse is coming. After starting a relationship with a dubious Messiah, he leaves his normal life and begins the construction of a shelter underground, training himself, in an extreme way, at the cost of losing everything and making people believe he is insane. When he also believes it, something extraordinary happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBrr6RwxmfjZyWTEe3AaguEKbMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472715'),
  ('878250277872516724', 'The Last Man on Earth', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ubaldo Ragona, Sidney Salkow, Carlo Grandone', 'Ubaldo Ragona, Richard Matheson, William F. Leicester', 'Vincent Price, Franca Bettoia, Emma Danieli, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Umberto Raho, Christi Courtland, Antonio Corevi, Ettore Ribotta', null, 'When a disease turns all of humanity into the living dead, the last man on earth becomes a reluctant vampire hunter.', 'When a disease turns all of humanity into the living dead, the last man on earth becomes a reluctant vampire hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0zIz963wNxAqqxiKYdZS9cRScT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21159'),
  ('343173125835856707', 'The Last Man on Earth', 2011, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Gian Alfonso Pacinotti, Vladan Radović, Elisa Becchere', 'Gian Alfonso Pacinotti', 'Gabriele Spinelli, Anna Bellato, Teco Celio, Stefano Scherini, Roberto Herlitzka, Vincenzo Illiano, Paolo Mazzarelli, Luca Marinelli', null, 'The story of the latest week on the earth before the announce of the landing of an extraterrestrial society on earth seen by the eyes of a misogynist man with only the desire solitude and routine.', 'The story of the latest week on the earth before the announce of the landing of an extraterrestrial society on earth seen by the eyes of a misogynist man with only the desire solitude and routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzQcLwEFkadrGufUCAQtWVyl81l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73869'),
  ('783221801516508437', 'The Last Man on Earth', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Jesús David Jordan Valdés, Lina María Rosas', 'Dago García', 'Jhon Álex Toro, Laura Acuña, Rodrigo Candamil, Jeka Garcés, Walter Luengas, Alberto Barrero, Juliana Gómez, María Alejandra Ladino Quintero', null, 'In a comedy set during the Christmas novena of a company, Piquiña, an ugly and boastful man, tries to conquer Liliana, the woman desired by all. Convinced of his charm, he goes after her, but Liliana rejects him with a blunt phrase: she would only be with him if he were the last man on Earth.', 'In a comedy set during the Christmas novena of a company, Piquiña, an ugly and boastful man, tries to conquer Liliana, the woman desired by all. Convinced of his charm, he goes after her, but Liliana rejects him with a blunt phrase: she would only be with him if he were the last man on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7hjC7UebawduaVSqnekvyjQ7JI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069913'),
  ('161037524083191085', 'The Last Man on Planet Earth', 1999, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Les Landau', 'Kenneth Biller', 'Julie Bowen, Paul Francis, L. Scott Caldwell, Elizabeth Dennehy, Tom Hallick, Kimberlee Peterson, Veronica Cartwright, Tamlyn Tomita', 'PG-13', 'During a war with Afghanistan, a weapon called the "Y-bomb" was used, which resulted in the deaths of 97% of the world''s men. Feeling that they were better off without males, the women of Earth decided to outlaw men because they were too violent. 20 years later, scientist Hope Chase, fearing for the future of the species, conducts a cloning experiment to produce a new male of the species, whom she names Adam. When Adam reaches maturity, he soon finds himself on the run from the FBI, and hiding out with small rebel bands of the last remaining men.', 'During a war with Afghanistan, a weapon called the "Y-bomb" was used, which resulted in the deaths of 97% of the world''s men. Feeling that they were better off without males, the women of Earth decided to outlaw men because they were too violent. 20 years later, scientist Hope Chase, fearing for the future of the species, conducts a cloning experiment to produce a new male of the species, whom she names Adam. When Adam reaches maturity, he soon finds himself on the run from the FBI, and hiding out with small rebel bands of the last remaining men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDtQ9ytAhOHPswNmlWrKzk35IQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293027'),
  ('507883787335331756', 'The Last Man on the Moon', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'Mark Craig', 'Mark Craig, Eugene Cernan', 'Eugene Cernan', null, 'The 1960s was an extraordinary time for the United States. Unburdened by post-war reparations, Americans were preoccupied with other developments like NASA, the game-changing space programme that put Neil Armstrong on the moon. Yet it was astronauts like Eugene Cernan who paved the uneven, perilous path to lunar exploration. A test pilot who lived to court danger, he was recruited along with 14 other men in a secretive process that saw them become the closest of friends and adversaries. In this intensely competitive environment, Cernan was one of only three men who was sent twice to the moon, with his second trip also being NASA’s final lunar mission. As he looks back at what he loved and lost during the eight years in Houston, an incomparably eventful life emerges into view. Director Mark Craig crafts a quietly epic biography that combines the rare insight of the surviving former astronauts with archival footage and otherworldly moonscapes.', 'The 1960s was an extraordinary time for the United States. Unburdened by post-war reparations, Americans were preoccupied with other developments like NASA, the game-changing space programme that put Neil Armstrong on the moon. Yet it was astronauts like Eugene Cernan who paved the uneven, perilous path to lunar exploration. A test pilot who lived to court danger, he was recruited along with 14 other men in a secretive process that saw them become the closest of friends and adversaries. In this intensely competitive environment, Cernan was one of only three men who was sent twice to the moon, with his second trip also being NASA’s final lunar mission. As he looks back at what he loved and lost during the eight years in Houston, an incomparably eventful life emerges into view. Director Mark Craig crafts a quietly epic biography that combines the rare insight of the surviving former astronauts with archival footage and otherworldly moonscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blQ4h5gcVWYKYVm9bykVmhWXvHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276537'),
  ('1097611432629798263', 'The Last Manhunt', 2022, 'Western, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'J.P. Alvarez, Christian Camargo', 'Thomas Pa''a Sibbett', 'Martin Sensmeier, Mainei Kinimaka, Jason Momoa, Zahn McClarnon, Lily Gladstone, Raoul Max Trujillo, Brandon Oakes, Christian Camargo', 'R', 'In 1909, Willie Boy and his love Carlota go on the run after he accidentally shoots her father in a confrontation gone terribly wrong. With President Taft coming to the area, the local sheriff leads two Native American trackers seeking justice for their “murdered” tribal leader.', 'In 1909, Willie Boy and his love Carlota go on the run after he accidentally shoots her father in a confrontation gone terribly wrong. With President Taft coming to the area, the local sheriff leads two Native American trackers seeking justice for their “murdered” tribal leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95Bn6HZBBJcG7LOBMAzNH0gmLih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754452'),
  ('266971013875638994', 'The Last Mark', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Reem Morsi', 'Cheryl Meyer', 'Alexia Fast, Shawn Doyle, Josh Cruddas, Bryce Hodgson, Jonas Chernick, Jasmin Geljo, Diane Johnstone, Andre Richards', 'NR', 'After a young woman witnesses a mob hit, a seasoned assassin and his psychotic partner must track her down before she turns them in, but she proves to be the hardest mark to kill.', 'After a young woman witnesses a mob hit, a seasoned assassin and his psychotic partner must track her down before she turns them in, but she proves to be the hardest mark to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdX4qg9cKX4satMaQm8BOJxnDC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865370'),
  ('401599801042405668', 'The Last Married Couple in America', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Gilbert Cates, Ralph Woolsey', 'John Herman Shaner', 'George Segal, Natalie Wood, Richard Benjamin, Valerie Harper, Bob Dishy, Dom DeLuise, Marilyn Sokol, Priscilla Barnes', 'R', 'Jeff and Mari Thompson are contently married, but they are stunned to see many of their friends and neighbors going through separations and divorces. Seemingly surrounded by people with domestic problems, Jeff and Mari begin to question their own relationship.', 'Jeff and Mari Thompson are contently married, but they are stunned to see many of their friends and neighbors going through separations and divorces. Seemingly surrounded by people with domestic problems, Jeff and Mari begin to question their own relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an6BPi08YI8fL2DGwvgb1vkVyyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75891'),
  ('760791863607779811', 'The Last Match', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antonio Hens', 'Abel González Melo', 'Milton García, Reinier Díaz, Jenifer Rodríguez, Beatriz Méndez, Mirta Ibarra, Toni Cantó, Carlos Enrique Almirante, Antonio Alonso Ramírez', 'NR', 'Cuba is not a country for young gays. Teen rent boy Reinier falls in love with a mate in the slum soccer field in their neighbourhood in Havana. Although obsessed with moneymaking to hold up his baby, teen wife, and wife''s grandma, gambler Reinier always fails to get the stroke of luck he looks for. At the same time he cannot help being infatuated by Yosvani. Handsome Yosvani will give up his older, wealthy girlfriend (whom he hooked up to pay for a lavish life in the big city), and the work he does for her father, a loan thug, so much in love he is with Reinier. But the boys would fight hard to keep this love in the reckless Havana streets.', 'Cuba is not a country for young gays. Teen rent boy Reinier falls in love with a mate in the slum soccer field in their neighbourhood in Havana. Although obsessed with moneymaking to hold up his baby, teen wife, and wife''s grandma, gambler Reinier always fails to get the stroke of luck he looks for. At the same time he cannot help being infatuated by Yosvani. Handsome Yosvani will give up his older, wealthy girlfriend (whom he hooked up to pay for a lavish life in the big city), and the work he does for her father, a loan thug, so much in love he is with Reinier. But the boys would fight hard to keep this love in the reckless Havana streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncUhKX6zCb3Y6NJay93CROVFYgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201277'),
  ('712850496746696399', 'The Last Matinee', 2020, 'Horror', 'Marcelo Brigante, Valentina Degener, Victoria Fernández', 'Maximiliano Contenti, Manuel Facal', 'Luciana Grasso, Ricardo Islas, Franco Durán, Julieta Spinelli, Bruno Salvati, Vladimir Knazevs, Daiana Carigi, Patricia Porzio', 'NR', 'In 1993, spectators at the last screening of a horror film at a downtown cinema fall one by one into the hands of a sadistic and ruthless killer.', 'In 1993, spectators at the last screening of a horror film at a downtown cinema fall one by one into the hands of a sadistic and ruthless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KCBYIII8SlUcTuvD6JSHwQSfQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739291'),
  ('253051212146862207', 'The Last Men', 2023, 'War, Drama, History', 'David Oelhoffen, Zazie Carcedo, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Laurent Gaudé, Jean Vautrin, Jacques Perrin', 'Guido Caprino, Andrzej Chyra, Nuno Lopes, Wim Willaert, Francesco Casisa, Axel Granberger, Felix Meyer, Yann Goven', null, 'March 1945. The Japanese army launches a sudden and extremely brutal assault against the French garrisons in the Far East. Thousands of civilians and soldiers were executed. Hunted by the Japanese enemy, a column of legionnaires already weakened by alcohol and disease decides to enter the jungle to try to reach China and the allied bases.', 'March 1945. The Japanese army launches a sudden and extremely brutal assault against the French garrisons in the Far East. Thousands of civilians and soldiers were executed. Hunted by the Japanese enemy, a column of legionnaires already weakened by alcohol and disease decides to enter the jungle to try to reach China and the allied bases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3LNb4BKXK52wxyGbKCP4w9E64u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978073'),
  ('1010132941420763081', 'The Last Mercenary', 2021, 'Action, Comedy', 'René-Pierre Rouaux, Thierry Arbogast, Tetiana Vladzimirska', 'Ismaël Sy Savané, David Charhon', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Alban Ivanov, Samir Decazza, Assa Sylla, Éric Judor, Patrick Timsit, Miou-Miou, Djimo Salim', null, 'A legendary secret service agent comes out of hiding and returns to France to help the son he''s never met get out of trouble.', 'A legendary secret service agent comes out of hiding and returns to France to help the son he''s never met get out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttpKJ7XQxDZV252KNEHXtykYT41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729720'),
  ('535558466289861714', 'The Last Message', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Jimmy Yu Chun, Chiu Tin', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Lau Tin-Chi, Louis Sit', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Sam Hui, Roy Chiao, Eileen Humphreys, Lau Yat-Fan, James Tien Chun, Joseph Koo, Hong Ga-Yan', null, 'Li (Sam Hui) works at a sanitarium as a male nurse, and Ah Tim (Michael Hui) is a handy man. One day, a bearded old man is sent into the sanitarium with a large bag. Ah Tim manages to steal the bag, and finds antique fragments inside. When the old man dies, the pair learn from his daughter that there is a sunken vessel that is loaded with much more than they already have, so they decide to go after the sunken treasure.', 'Li (Sam Hui) works at a sanitarium as a male nurse, and Ah Tim (Michael Hui) is a handy man. One day, a bearded old man is sent into the sanitarium with a large bag. Ah Tim manages to steal the bag, and finds antique fragments inside. When the old man dies, the pair learn from his daughter that there is a sunken vessel that is loaded with much more than they already have, so they decide to go after the sunken treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6xCu8Go1LIhoSuh4V4XVQqiuMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155897'),
  ('803500444937672778', 'The Last Metro', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'François Truffaut, Néstor Almendros, Emmanuel Clot', 'François Truffaut, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Catherine Deneuve, Gérard Depardieu, Jean Poiret, Andréa Ferréol, Paulette Dubost, Jean-Louis Richard, Maurice Risch, Heinz Bennent', 'PG', 'In occupied Paris, an actress wed to a Jewish theater owner must keep him hidden from the Nazis while doing both of their jobs.', 'In occupied Paris, an actress wed to a Jewish theater owner must keep him hidden from the Nazis while doing both of their jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8KMFg9PiD9GSIHXlzast2WhZex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1716'),
  ('787843638111457533', 'The Last Mile', 1932, 'Drama', 'Samuel Bischoff, Arthur Edeson', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Preston Foster, Howard Phillips, George E. Stone, Noel Madison, Alan Roscoe, Paul Fix, Alec B. Francis, Albert J. Smith', null, 'Richard Walters is condemned to death for a murder he claims not to have committed. He arrives on death row just before a brutal inmate leads the other convicts in a violent uprising. Walters gets caught up in the riot, while on the outside his friends are trying to find evidence of his innocence.', 'Richard Walters is condemned to death for a murder he claims not to have committed. He arrives on death row just before a brutal inmate leads the other convicts in a violent uprising. Walters gets caught up in the riot, while on the outside his friends are trying to find evidence of his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDZKdzYvUwHYrvwizDzh3tcwwCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69857'),
