  ('1035990075035771638', 'The Last Mimzy', 2007, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Robert Shaye, J. Michael Muro', 'Bruce Joel Rubin, Toby Emmerich', 'Joely Richardson, Timothy Hutton, Rainn Wilson, Michael Clarke Duncan, Kathryn Hahn, Rhiannon Leigh Wryn, Chris O''Neil, Kirsten Alter', 'PG', 'Two siblings begin to develop special talents after they find a mysterious box of toys, and soon their parents and even their teacher are drawn into a strange new world – and find a task ahead of them that is far more important than any of them could imagine.', 'Two siblings begin to develop special talents after they find a mysterious box of toys, and soon their parents and even their teacher are drawn into a strange new world – and find a task ahead of them that is far more important than any of them could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnLXcQFx4hSKDNG1P6RMz4v5jje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2267'),
