  ('199733817311114495', 'The Last Movie Painter', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Walter Bencini, Walter Bencini, Diego Falconieri', 'Walter Bencini', 'Aurelio De Laurentiis, Carlo Verdone, Dario Argento, Enrico Vanzina, Federico Mauro, Giovanni Bogani, Goffredo Fofi, Maurizio Baroni', null, 'A fantastic journey through the world of Renato Casaro, one of the most important illustrators that the world’s film poster industry has ever known.', 'A fantastic journey through the world of Renato Casaro, one of the most important illustrators that the world’s film poster industry has ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oF8yTC219r5TWZRAHuTd1U5fKOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661818'),
  ('136948925570122871', 'The Last Movie Star', 2018, 'Drama', 'Adam Rifkin, Scott Winig', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Burt Reynolds, Ariel Winter, Chevy Chase, Clark Duke, Ellar Coltrane, Nikki Blonsky, Kathleen Nolan, Juston Street', 'R', 'An aging screen icon gets lured into accepting an award at a rinky-dink film festival in Nashville, Tenn., sending him on a hilarious fish-out-of-water adventure and an unexpectedly poignant journey into his past.', 'An aging screen icon gets lured into accepting an award at a rinky-dink film festival in Nashville, Tenn., sending him on a hilarious fish-out-of-water adventure and an unexpectedly poignant journey into his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxuk1SKCPFqcMFHnItIlXizwJ7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451204'),
  ('368053866205442329', 'The Last New Year''s Eve', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicola Gidoni, Gianluca Mazzella, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Marco Risi, Niccolò Ammaniti', 'Monica Bellucci, Francesca D''Aloja, Marco Giallini, Antonella Steni, Silvio Vannucci, Patrizia Pezza, Mario Patanè, Carmen Giardina', null, 'New year''s eve at "The Islands" condos. An aging countess''s party is crashed by the soccer team from her gigolo''s town. While dressing for a dinner party, the wealthy Guilia discovers her husband''s affair with her best friend and vows revenge. Next door, a family prepares their vintage Dodge for a drive through the streets. A call girl ties up a lawyer while, unbeknownst to him, three men await the right moment to break into his office. Across the hall, a woman downs pills in a lonely suicide attempt. Two young men hide out in a bedroom smoking dope; one of them has some dynamite. As midnight approaches, each group draws closer to grotesque tragedy.', 'New year''s eve at "The Islands" condos. An aging countess''s party is crashed by the soccer team from her gigolo''s town. While dressing for a dinner party, the wealthy Guilia discovers her husband''s affair with her best friend and vows revenge. Next door, a family prepares their vintage Dodge for a drive through the streets. A call girl ties up a lawyer while, unbeknownst to him, three men await the right moment to break into his office. Across the hall, a woman downs pills in a lonely suicide attempt. Two young men hide out in a bedroom smoking dope; one of them has some dynamite. As midnight approaches, each group draws closer to grotesque tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKetwjFc7PNWgprnLfbD0JbLNsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52676'),
  ('221149751390181190', 'The Last Night of Sandra M.', 2023, 'Drama', 'Borja de la Vega', 'Borja de la Vega', 'Claudia Traisac, Georgina Amorós, Núria Prims, Nicolás Illoro, Rafa Castejón, Pep Ambròs, Ramon Pujol, Beatriz Arjona', null, 'Freely inspired by the life of the actress Sandra Mozarowsky, who died in 1977 when she fell from the terrace of her house in Madrid, the story will focus on the day before the accident, in which loneliness, fear and anguish in the face of a situation desperate mix with his dreams and ambitions.', 'Freely inspired by the life of the actress Sandra Mozarowsky, who died in 1977 when she fell from the terrace of her house in Madrid, the story will focus on the day before the accident, in which loneliness, fear and anguish in the face of a situation desperate mix with his dreams and ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycBwDgJJ40dTE52fWBliqQKFD43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017438'),
  ('565451798084410286', 'The Last of England', 1987, 'Drama', 'Derek Jarman, Derek Jarman', 'Derek Jarman', 'Tilda Swinton, Spencer Leigh, ''Spring'' Mark Adley, Gerrard McArthur, Jonny Phillips, Gay Gaynor, Matthew Hawkins, Nigel Terry', null, 'The artist''s personal commentary on the decline of his country in a language closer to poetry than prose. A dark meditation on London under Thatcher.', 'The artist''s personal commentary on the decline of his country in a language closer to poetry than prose. A dark meditation on London under Thatcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hndDDerUhEe0PYIFlpG9Kz2dzah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41970'),
  ('776818548607364005', 'The Last of His Tribe', 1992, 'Drama, Western, TV Movie', 'Harry Hook, Martin Fuhrer', 'Stephen Harrigan', 'Jon Voight, Graham Greene, David Ogden Stiers, Jack Blessing, Anne Archer, Daniel Benzali, Christianne Hauber, Charles Martinet', null, 'Ishi, the last Yahi Indian of California, must leave his homeland and learn to navigate the world of the white man in order to survive.', 'Ishi, the last Yahi Indian of California, must leave his homeland and learn to navigate the world of the white man in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zil2Jj2tfLRFCf0YDqRUb6ngL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412296'),
  ('989152065556224479', 'The Last of Mrs. Cheyney', 1929, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sidney Franklin, William H. Daniels', 'Hanns Kräly', 'Norma Shearer, Basil Rathbone, George Barraud, Herbert Bunston, Hedda Hopper, Moon Carroll, Madeline Seymour, Cyril Chadwick', 'NR', 'There is a big charity function at the house of Mrs. Cheyney and a lot of society is present. With her rich husband, deceased, rich old Lord Elton and playboy Lord Arthur Dilling are both very interested in the mysterious Fay. Invited to the house of Mrs. Webley, Fay is again the center of attention for Arthur and Elton with her leaning towards stuffy old Elton. When Arthur sees Charles, Fay''s Butler, lurking in the gardens, he remembers that Charles was a thief caught in Monte Carlo and he figures that Fay may be more interested in the pearls of Mrs. Webley, which she is. After Fay takes the pearls, but before she can toss them out the window, she is caught by Arthur who is very disappointed in how things are turning out.', 'There is a big charity function at the house of Mrs. Cheyney and a lot of society is present. With her rich husband, deceased, rich old Lord Elton and playboy Lord Arthur Dilling are both very interested in the mysterious Fay. Invited to the house of Mrs. Webley, Fay is again the center of attention for Arthur and Elton with her leaning towards stuffy old Elton. When Arthur sees Charles, Fay''s Butler, lurking in the gardens, he remembers that Charles was a thief caught in Monte Carlo and he figures that Fay may be more interested in the pearls of Mrs. Webley, which she is. After Fay takes the pearls, but before she can toss them out the window, she is caught by Arthur who is very disappointed in how things are turning out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqCEIEtvVVpW3yltemtU9HpHfNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246292'),
  ('644727819946358373', 'The Last of Mrs. Cheyney', 1937, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Boleslawski, George J. Folsey, Edward Woehler', 'Leon Gordon, Samson Raphaelson, Monckton Hoffe', 'Joan Crawford, William Powell, Robert Montgomery, Frank Morgan, Jessie Ralph, Nigel Bruce, Colleen Clare, Benita Hume', 'NR', 'A chic American jewel thief falls in love with one of her marks, an English lord.', 'A chic American jewel thief falls in love with one of her marks, an English lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFhy8ZyEY0in5QZZtrIh4jvtW1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53857'),
  ('550000491017064881', 'The Last of Robin Hood', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Wash Westmoreland, Richard Glatzer, Michael Simmonds', 'Richard Glatzer, Wash Westmoreland', 'Dakota Fanning, Susan Sarandon, Kevin Kline, Patrick St. Esprit, Sean Flynn, Max Casella, Ben Winchell, Matt Kane', 'R', 'Errol Flynn, the swashbuckling Hollywood star and notorious ladies man, flouted convention all his life, but never more brazenly than in his last years when, swimming in vodka and unwilling to face his mortality, he undertook a liaison with an aspiring actress, Beverly Aadland. The two had a high-flying affair that spanned the globe and was enabled by the girl''s fame-obsessed mother, Florence. It all came crashing to an end in October 1959, when events forced the relationship into the open, sparking an avalanche of publicity castigating Beverly and her mother - which only fed Florence''s need to stay in the spotlight.', 'Errol Flynn, the swashbuckling Hollywood star and notorious ladies man, flouted convention all his life, but never more brazenly than in his last years when, swimming in vodka and unwilling to face his mortality, he undertook a liaison with an aspiring actress, Beverly Aadland. The two had a high-flying affair that spanned the globe and was enabled by the girl''s fame-obsessed mother, Florence. It all came crashing to an end in October 1959, when events forced the relationship into the open, sparking an avalanche of publicity castigating Beverly and her mother - which only fed Florence''s need to stay in the spotlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iL7iNCgyQqconH8CCTwdbEccZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214091'),
  ('68060882334430362', 'The Last of Sheila', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Herbert Ross, William C. Gerrity, Mishka Cheyko', 'Anthony Perkins, Stephen Sondheim', 'Richard Benjamin, Dyan Cannon, James Coburn, Joan Hackett, James Mason, Ian McShane, Raquel Welch, Yvonne Romain', 'PG', 'A year after Sheila is killed in a hit-and-run, her multimillionaire husband invites a group of friends to spend a week on his yacht playing a scavenger hunt-style mystery game—but the game turns out to be all too real and all too deadly.', 'A year after Sheila is killed in a hit-and-run, her multimillionaire husband invites a group of friends to spend a week on his yacht playing a scavenger hunt-style mystery game—but the game turns out to be all too real and all too deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTwaBz4wByO8qcYqWaBuRLeCTC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26331'),
  ('250379667963888810', 'The Last of the Chupacabras', 2021, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Jessica Mendez Siqueiros, Meena Singh', 'Jessica Mendez Siqueiros', 'Melba Martinez, Cici Lau, Seven True-Divine Purnell, William Knight', null, 'In a world where culture has nearly ceased to exist, one lone Mexican-American struggling to carry on her traditions unknowingly summons a dark and ancient creature to protect her.', 'In a world where culture has nearly ceased to exist, one lone Mexican-American struggling to carry on her traditions unknowingly summons a dark and ancient creature to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/td6NkIilMiRz3WLAD3XX6aTsMfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818361'),
  ('500710271458768405', 'The Last of the Fast Guns', 1958, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Phil Bowles, Alex Phillips', 'David P. Harmon', 'Jock Mahoney, Gilbert Roland, Linda Cristal, Eduard Franz, Lorne Greene, Carl Benton Reid, Edward Platt, Eduardo Noriega', 'NR', 'A rich, dying Easterner hires gunfighter Brad Ellison to find his brother and heir in Mexico. En route, it becomes clear to Ellison that his is a dying profession. At a remote rancho, Ellison enlists ranch foreman Miles Lang to help him search the hills where the missing man is rumored to have lived. They find nothing ...except that someone wants to kill them; and Ellison becomes wrapped in a maze of double crosses.', 'A rich, dying Easterner hires gunfighter Brad Ellison to find his brother and heir in Mexico. En route, it becomes clear to Ellison that his is a dying profession. At a remote rancho, Ellison enlists ranch foreman Miles Lang to help him search the hills where the missing man is rumored to have lived. They find nothing ...except that someone wants to kill them; and Ellison becomes wrapped in a maze of double crosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBVwIH85MsV4pOC0wODWp3xKgSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148847'),
  ('967323571712022753', 'The Last of the Finest', 1990, 'Crime', 'John Mackenzie, David R. Ellis, Richard Coad', 'Jere Cunningham, George Armitage, Thomas Lee Wright', 'Brian Dennehy, Joe Pantoliano, Jeff Fahey, Bill Paxton, Michael C. Gwynne, Henry Stolow, Guy Boyd, Henry Darrow', 'R', 'An elite group of vice cops are fired from the L.A.P.D. for being over-zealous in their war against drugs. It is immediately apparent that some of their superiors are involved in the drug ring. Banded together, four of the banned cops (which quickly becomes three when one is killed early) band together to fight the drug ring undercover. They gain capital for weapons by ripping off minor drug dealers. Then well-armed they go after the kingpin (Boyd).', 'An elite group of vice cops are fired from the L.A.P.D. for being over-zealous in their war against drugs. It is immediately apparent that some of their superiors are involved in the drug ring. Banded together, four of the banned cops (which quickly becomes three when one is killed early) band together to fight the drug ring undercover. They gain capital for weapons by ripping off minor drug dealers. Then well-armed they go after the kingpin (Boyd).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8EfhcI5BVtiv2Qh0McmL5pCA4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123770'),
  ('635315902958062369', 'The Last of the High Kings', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Keating, Bernd Heinl', 'David Keating, Gabriel Byrne', 'Jared Leto, Catherine O''Hara, Christina Ricci, Gabriel Byrne, Stephen Rea, Colm Meaney, Lorraine Pilkington, Jason Barry', null, 'It is 1977, Dublin rocks to the music of Thin Lizzy and the world is stunned by the death of Elvis Presley. Frankie, caught between acne and adulthood, has just completed his final exams in school. Convinced he will fail, he survives the summer organising a beach party, having lustful thoughts about two girls he believes are unobtainable and fending off the advances from a visiting American family friend, all whilst coping with his oddball family.', 'It is 1977, Dublin rocks to the music of Thin Lizzy and the world is stunned by the death of Elvis Presley. Frankie, caught between acne and adulthood, has just completed his final exams in school. Convinced he will fail, he survives the summer organising a beach party, having lustful thoughts about two girls he believes are unobtainable and fending off the advances from a visiting American family friend, all whilst coping with his oddball family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSdzsYKg1wpmYpflD1ZEq5Cf9rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63564'),
  ('153070429892111186', 'The Last of the Just', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Manuel Carballo', 'Manu Díez, Manuel Carballo', 'Diego Martín, Antonio Dechent, Goya Toledo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Brian Thompson, Federico Luppi, Raúl Méndez, Ana Claudia Talancón', null, 'A religious thriller that centers on a theory: 30 people have been chosen by God to maintain the balance of world as we know it. These "Chosen Ones" have been methodically exterminated throughout history and it is now time to take out the last of the them.', 'A religious thriller that centers on a theory: 30 people have been chosen by God to maintain the balance of world as we know it. These "Chosen Ones" have been methodically exterminated throughout history and it is now time to take out the last of the them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0MSij5oHQ2OwVCuqn8SybrLSCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41528'),
  ('339339213755934433', 'The Last of the Mohicans', 1920, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Maurice Tourneur, Philip R. Du Bois, Charles Van Enger', 'Robert Dillon', 'Wallace Beery, Barbara Bedford, Alan Roscoe, Lillian Hall, Henry Woodward, James Gordon, George Hackathorne, Nelson McDowell', 'NR', 'As Alice and Cora Munro attempt to find their father, a British officer in the French and Indian War, they are set upon by French soldiers and their cohorts, Huron tribesmen led by the evil Magua. Fighting to rescue the women are Chingachgook and his son Uncas, the last of the Mohican tribe, and their white ally, the frontiersman Natty Bumppo, known as Hawkeye.', 'As Alice and Cora Munro attempt to find their father, a British officer in the French and Indian War, they are set upon by French soldiers and their cohorts, Huron tribesmen led by the evil Magua. Fighting to rescue the women are Chingachgook and his son Uncas, the last of the Mohican tribe, and their white ally, the frontiersman Natty Bumppo, known as Hawkeye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNpjv5byJM8H83JJwPLMDyB095t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71065'),
  ('1067459635385264024', 'The Last of the Mohicans', 1936, 'Western, Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'George B. Seitz, Robert H. Planck, Clem Beauchamp', 'Philip Dunne', 'Randolph Scott, Binnie Barnes, Heather Angel, Henry Wilcoxon, Bruce Cabot, Phillip Reed, Robert Barrat, Hugh Buckler', 'NR', 'The story is set in the British province of New York during the French and Indian War, and concerns—in part—a Huron massacre (with passive French acquiescence) of between 500 to 1,500 Anglo-American troops, who had honorably surrendered at Fort William Henry, plus some women and servants; the kidnapping of two sisters, daughters of the British commander; and their rescue by the last Mohicans.', 'The story is set in the British province of New York during the French and Indian War, and concerns—in part—a Huron massacre (with passive French acquiescence) of between 500 to 1,500 Anglo-American troops, who had honorably surrendered at Fort William Henry, plus some women and servants; the kidnapping of two sisters, daughters of the British commander; and their rescue by the last Mohicans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6QezyupjtlFdEazInKtujn6eAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23108'),
  ('1017637758701262071', 'The Last of the Mohicans', 1992, 'Action, History, Romance, War', 'Michael Mann, Dante Spinotti, Michael Waxman', 'Michael Mann, Christopher Crowe, Philip Dunne', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Madeleine Stowe, Jodhi May, Russell Means, Wes Studi, Eric Schweig, Steven Waddington, Maurice Roëves', 'R', 'In war-torn colonial America, in the midst of a bloody battle between British, the French and Native American allies, the aristocratic daughter of a British Colonel and her party are captured by a group of Huron warriors. Fortunately, a group of three Mohican trappers comes to their rescue.', 'In war-torn colonial America, in the midst of a bloody battle between British, the French and Native American allies, the aristocratic daughter of a British Colonel and her party are captured by a group of Huron warriors. Fortunately, a group of three Mohican trappers comes to their rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzJMPWRtZveBkxXOv3ucWhoJuyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9361'),
  ('826469748560499720', 'The Last of the Sea Women', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Sue Kim, Justin Turkowski, Iris Ng', null, 'Jang Soon-duk, Kang Joo-hwa, Woo Jeong-min, Lee Geum-ok, Jeong Young-ae, Park In-sook, Lee Hee-soon, Ko Im-saeng', 'PG', 'On the shores of Jeju Island, a fierce group of South Korean divers fight to save their vanishing culture from looming threats.', 'On the shores of Jeju Island, a fierce group of South Korean divers fight to save their vanishing culture from looming threats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a75Q8ebNNqAQ8Mm4n863Gl9dOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036573'),
  ('826825550185531049', 'The Last of the Unjust', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Caroline Champetier, William Lubtchansky, Claude Lanzmann', 'Claude Lanzmann', 'Benjamin Murmelstein, Claude Lanzmann', 'PG-13', 'A place: Theresienstadt. A unique place of propaganda which Adolf Eichmann called the "model ghetto", designed to mislead the world and Jewish people regarding its real nature, to be the last step before the gas chamber. A man: Benjamin Murmelstein, last president of the Theresienstadt Jewish Council, a fallen hero condemned to exile, who was forced to negotiate day after day from 1938 until the end of the war with Eichmann, to whose trial Murmelstein wasn''t even called to testify. Even though he was without a doubt the one who knew the Nazi executioner best. More than twenty-five years after Shoah, Claude Lanzmann''s new film reveals a little-known yet fundamental aspect of the Holocaust, and sheds light on the origins of the "Final Solution" like never before.', 'A place: Theresienstadt. A unique place of propaganda which Adolf Eichmann called the "model ghetto", designed to mislead the world and Jewish people regarding its real nature, to be the last step before the gas chamber. A man: Benjamin Murmelstein, last president of the Theresienstadt Jewish Council, a fallen hero condemned to exile, who was forced to negotiate day after day from 1938 until the end of the war with Eichmann, to whose trial Murmelstein wasn''t even called to testify. Even though he was without a doubt the one who knew the Nazi executioner best. More than twenty-five years after Shoah, Claude Lanzmann''s new film reveals a little-known yet fundamental aspect of the Holocaust, and sheds light on the origins of the "Final Solution" like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nPrHWKyARBwgXEHKgpfkVL3QTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179146'),
  ('1022032668732789029', 'The Last One and then We Go', 2015, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Noé Santillán-López, Mario Gallegos, Valeria Villalobos', 'Mauricio Argüelles, César Rodríguez', 'Héctor Bonilla, José Sefami, Hernán Mendoza, Roberto Medina, Mauricio Argüelles, César Rodríguez, Ernesto Loera, Oliver Nava', null, 'A group of mariachis receives a letter to be part of the National Mariachi Contest in Mexico City. In order to be able to win they will need to travel together and solve their differences since their prime was 30 years ago.', 'A group of mariachis receives a letter to be part of the National Mariachi Contest in Mexico City. In order to be able to win they will need to travel together and solve their differences since their prime was 30 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzNDERhGjQwXCDnrB5dIJjiBWO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342571'),
  ('918179748576567512', 'The Last One for the Road', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Sossai, Ciro Scognamiglio, Massimiliano Kuveiller', 'Francesco Sossai, Adriano Candiago', 'Filippo Scotti, Sergio Romano, Pierpaolo Capovilla, Roberto Citran, Andrea Pennacchi, Giuseppe Messina, Denis Fasolo, Tommaso Gianesini', null, 'A couple of jovial life-long drunkards run into a shy architecture undergrad, whose way of seeing things will be transformed as the trio wanders from pub to pub in search of a buried treasure.', 'A couple of jovial life-long drunkards run into a shy architecture undergrad, whose way of seeing things will be transformed as the trio wanders from pub to pub in search of a buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1462322'),
  ('648736614867978175', 'The Last One of the Six', 1941, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Georges Lacombe, Robert Lefebvre', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot', 'Pierre Fresnay, Michèle Alfa, Suzy Delair, Jean Tissier, Jean Chevrier, Lucien Nat, André Luguet, Georges Rollin', null, 'Paris, France. Commissaire Wens is put in charge of the investigation into the murder of one of six friends who, in the past, made a very profitable promise.', 'Paris, France. Commissaire Wens is put in charge of the investigation into the murder of one of six friends who, in the past, made a very profitable promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5VjDMSqB0lSFSXNOhRRRZX0xtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142977'),
  ('872909388277180537', 'The Last Ottoman: Knockout Ali', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, War, History', 'Mustafa Şevki Doğan', 'Baykut Badem, Mehmet E. Soyarslan', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Cansu Dere, Engin Şenkan, Levent Öktem, Anna Babkova, John Baker, Emin Boztepe, Öner Erkan', null, 'After the First World War, the Allies occupy Istanbul. The protagonist, Yandim Ali is a rogue, discharged from the navy, who doesn''t believe that the country can be saved, until he meets Mustafa Kemal (Ataturk), who plans to start a resistance in Anatolia against the occupying Allies, as well as the collaborators of an Ottoman government, that exists only on paper.', 'After the First World War, the Allies occupy Istanbul. The protagonist, Yandim Ali is a rogue, discharged from the navy, who doesn''t believe that the country can be saved, until he meets Mustafa Kemal (Ataturk), who plans to start a resistance in Anatolia against the occupying Allies, as well as the collaborators of an Ottoman government, that exists only on paper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la8LmZSfBgGZKd7uDssR7EjAHCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54269'),
  ('337613710111910401', 'The Last Outlaw', 1993, 'TV Movie, Action, Western', 'Geoff Murphy, Jack Conroy', 'Eric Red', 'Mickey Rourke, Dermot Mulroney, Ted Levine, John C. McGinley, Steve Buscemi, Keith David, Daniel Quinn, Gavan O''Herlihy', null, 'The story follows a band of former Confederate soldiers who were part of a cavalry unit. Their commander, Graff, had once been a heroic and staunch supporter of the Southern cause, but after losing his family, he became coldhearted and ruthless. His second-in-command is Eustis, whom Graff has trained on the strategies of leadership and combat command.', 'The story follows a band of former Confederate soldiers who were part of a cavalry unit. Their commander, Graff, had once been a heroic and staunch supporter of the Southern cause, but after losing his family, he became coldhearted and ruthless. His second-in-command is Eustis, whom Graff has trained on the strategies of leadership and combat command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnLWFKZSvH1fNtjSCdgGP2WOqRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20333'),
  ('519614217921588429', 'The Last Page', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Terence Fisher, Walter J. Harvey, Jimmy Sangster', 'Frederick Knott', 'George Brent, Diana Dors, Marguerite Chapman, Raymond Huntley, Peter Reynolds, Eleanor Summerfield, Meredith Edwards, Harry Fowler', 'NR', 'A married bookstore owner is blackmailed after he makes a pass at his new sexy blonde clerk.', 'A married bookstore owner is blackmailed after he makes a pass at his new sexy blonde clerk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cU0R3VewoCYq0S4mnhgeuPnngyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48407'),
  ('492480116291127386', 'The Last Paradiso', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rocco Ricciardulli, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Rocco Ricciardulli', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Gaia Bermani Amaral, Valentina Cervi, Antonio Gerardi, Giovanni Cirfiera, Giuseppe Nardone, Teresa Fiorentino, Donato Demita', 'NR', 'In 1950s Italy, a farmer''s dream of improving workers’ living conditions collapses when he falls for a landowner''s daughter. Based on true events.', 'In 1950s Italy, a farmer''s dream of improving workers’ living conditions collapses when he falls for a landowner''s daughter. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blB1T2zUAqP9Qv8dyoB9Xn7W7qI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746422'),
  ('784346440694763444', 'The Last Party', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Constanza Buchanan, Sabrina García, Leandro Mark', 'Lucas Bucci, Nicolás Silbert, Tomás Sposato', 'Nicolás Vázquez, Alan Sabbagh, Benjamín Amadeo, Eva De Dominici, César Bordón, Julián Kartun, Paula Carruega, Luciano Rosso', null, 'Alan, Dante and Pedro are three friends who grew up together from an early age. One of them ends a long relationship with his girlfriend and remains disconsolate. His two friends decide to lift his spirits by organizing a party.', 'Alan, Dante and Pedro are three friends who grew up together from an early age. One of them ends a long relationship with his girlfriend and remains disconsolate. His two friends decide to lift his spirits by organizing a party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmK2r1Jwp5bBqtDTjkpm8UDtG00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438797'),
  ('823833728150370485', 'The Last Patrol', 2000, 'Action', 'Sheldon Lettich, David Gurfinkel', 'Stephen Brackley, Pamela K. Long', 'Dolph Lundgren, Sherri Alexander, Joe Michael Burke, Rebecca Cross, Brook Susan Parker, Juliano Mer-Khamis, Ze''ev Revach, Ishai Golan', null, 'After a massive earthquake destroys Los Angeles, a new order is formed. But disagreement among the ranks leads to more war and disruption, and The Last Patrol must bring order if there''s to be any hope for the future.', 'After a massive earthquake destroys Los Angeles, a new order is formed. But disagreement among the ranks leads to more war and disruption, and The Last Patrol must bring order if there''s to be any hope for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FuDl1n7okqzQX3OvXnk1iGknQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60489'),
  ('82350027488565189', 'The Last Pedestrian', 1960, 'Comedy, Music', 'Wilhelm Thiele, Kurt Grigoleit', 'Wilhelm Thiele, Eckart Hachfeld', 'Heinz Erhardt, Christine Kaufmann, Käthe Haack, Ernst Waldow, Hans Hessling, Michael Lenz, Peter Wegen, Willy Reichert', null, 'Heinz Erhardt wanders through the Black Forest as a photographer for a magazine. On the train he meets a young girl who from now on does not leave his side.', 'Heinz Erhardt wanders through the Black Forest as a photographer for a magazine. On the train he meets a young girl who from now on does not leave his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqkK94sAjORrFI6pR8rgn73bNIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72008'),
  ('629567306636001850', 'The Last Performance', 1929, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Pál Fejős, Hal Mohr', 'Walter Anthony, Tom Reed', 'Conrad Veidt, Mary Philbin, Leslie Fenton, Fred MacKaye, Eddie Boland, Anders Randolf, Sam De Grasse, Gusztáv Pártos', null, 'A middle-aged magician is in love with his beautiful young assistant. She, on the other hand, is in love with the magician''s young protege, who turns out to be a bum and a thief.', 'A middle-aged magician is in love with his beautiful young assistant. She, on the other hand, is in love with the magician''s young protege, who turns out to be a bum and a thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GnQ6Sao5NITgRJmnrCFbZUljBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84713'),
  ('725195420518286772', 'The Last Pig', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cristian Pirjol, Aron Lehmann', 'Aron Lehmann, Carlos V. Irmscher', 'Golo Euler, Rosalie Thomass, Herbert Knaup, Thorsten Merten, Heinz-Josef Braun, Christoph Maria Herbst, Daniel Zillmann, Eva Bay', null, 'Plum out of luck, Swabian farmer Huber’s farm goes under. Then his girlfriend Birgit takes over her father’s newly-acquired firm – in former East Germany. That''s reason enough for Huber to bail on his debts and head out on a road trip through southwest Germany.', 'Plum out of luck, Swabian farmer Huber’s farm goes under. Then his girlfriend Birgit takes over her father’s newly-acquired firm – in former East Germany. That''s reason enough for Huber to bail on his debts and head out on a road trip through southwest Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpLWmUnJ6EyH2ZG3DH7nlvB3r8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402899'),
  ('563366207481270935', 'The Last Posse', 1953, 'Western', 'Burnett Guffey, Alfred L. Werker', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Broderick Crawford, John Derek, Charles Bickford, Wanda Hendrix, Warner Anderson, Henry Hull, Will Wright, Tom Powers', 'NR', 'A posse''s pursuit of bank robbers ends with loot missing and a sheriff (Broderick Crawford) wounded.', 'A posse''s pursuit of bank robbers ends with loot missing and a sheriff (Broderick Crawford) wounded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXjo1x8jENMytUtusKcQUc1A6jX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113225'),
  ('88770940110826327', 'The Last Princess', 2008, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Shinji Higuchi, Katsuro Onoue, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Jun Matsumoto, Hiroshi Abe, Masami Nagasawa, Kippei Shiina, Miyagawa Daisuke, Arata Furuta, Takaya Kamikawa, Masahiro Komoto', null, 'After the Akizuku clan fall in defeat to rival clan Yamana, Princess Yuki and General Rokurota take cover in a hidden fortress, along with their clan and gold treasury. Fortuitously stumbling into the hideaways, brash young miner Takezo and his bumbling sidekick Shinhachi hatch a daring plan to help transport the gold out of enemy terrain – in exchange for a share of the stash, of course. With assassins hot in pursuit, Yuki disguises as a male and ventures into the real world with Rukurota and her peasant companions, getting her first taste of danger, toil, and budding romance with the strong-minded and willful Takezo.', 'After the Akizuku clan fall in defeat to rival clan Yamana, Princess Yuki and General Rokurota take cover in a hidden fortress, along with their clan and gold treasury. Fortuitously stumbling into the hideaways, brash young miner Takezo and his bumbling sidekick Shinhachi hatch a daring plan to help transport the gold out of enemy terrain – in exchange for a share of the stash, of course. With assassins hot in pursuit, Yuki disguises as a male and ventures into the real world with Rukurota and her peasant companions, getting her first taste of danger, toil, and budding romance with the strong-minded and willful Takezo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7InHi5EsxYP4wsf7BSI9uBFtSY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44056'),
  ('643752358385092916', 'The Last Princess', 2016, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Hur Jin-ho, Lee Tae-yoon, Park Yoo-young', 'Seo You-min, Choi Geun-ho, Kim Hyeon-jeong', 'Son Ye-jin, Park Hae-il, Ra Mi-ran, Jung Sang-hoon, Kim So-hyun, Baek Yoon-sik, Park Joo-mi, Ahn Nae-sang', null, 'Under the oppressive Japanese colonial rule, Deok-hye, the last Princess of the declining Joseon Dynasty, is forced to move to Japan. She spends her days missing home, while struggling to maintain dignity as a princess. After a series of failed tries, Deok-hye makes her final attempt to return home with help of her childhood sweetheart, Jang-han.', 'Under the oppressive Japanese colonial rule, Deok-hye, the last Princess of the declining Joseon Dynasty, is forced to move to Japan. She spends her days missing home, while struggling to maintain dignity as a princess. After a series of failed tries, Deok-hye makes her final attempt to return home with help of her childhood sweetheart, Jang-han.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLPHjuCySL3re0qtdz3XJQdx61I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408360'),
  ('806812062743940655', 'The Last Prom', 1980, null, 'Gene McPherson', null, 'Sheelagh Bevan, Jamie Bozian, Mary LeClair, Ron Bohmer, Mary Haas, Don Haas, Bill Hartnett', null, 'Prom night, teenage drivers and alcohol.', 'Prom night, teenage drivers and alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7c3gpauNrqYzumRTdfmUECbfH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128998'),
  ('518993079012903447', 'The Last Prometheus of Donbas', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Anton Shtuka', 'Anton Shtuka', null, null, 'These are captured moments from the life of a Ukrainian industrial giant from the East, which no longer exists due to the Russian offensive. A story of heroic energy workers at the last operating power plant in eastern Ukraine, only 10 km from the frontline. Under constant shelling, they risk their lives to keep the lights on until the plant''s destruction and forced evacuation, echoing historical parallels from 1941.', 'These are captured moments from the life of a Ukrainian industrial giant from the East, which no longer exists due to the Russian offensive. A story of heroic energy workers at the last operating power plant in eastern Ukraine, only 10 km from the frontline. Under constant shelling, they risk their lives to keep the lights on until the plant''s destruction and forced evacuation, echoing historical parallels from 1941.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7em9hFYMvR2f2jpAEFR6SxOpper.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-prometheus-of-donbas'),
  ('28866052600217972', 'The Last Prosecco', 2017, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Massimo Moschin, Giaime Grieco, Giulia Forcolini', 'Fulvio Ervas, Marco Pettenello, Antonio Padovan', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Teco Celio, Liz Solari, Roberto Citran, Silvia D''Amico, Rade Šerbedžija, Babak Karimi, Gisella Burinato', null, 'The suicide of a prominent wine producer unleashes a series of mysterious murders.', 'The suicide of a prominent wine producer unleashes a series of mysterious murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7H6KoD51Inyv7QVBjf3wdOlqv1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480483'),
  ('687861782739240007', 'The Last Queen', 2023, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'Damien Ounouri, Adila Bendimerad, Marie-Laurence Attias', 'Adila Bendimerad, Damien Ounouri', 'Adila Bendimerad, Dali Benssalah, Dimitri Boetto, Mohamed Tahar Zaoui, Imen Noel, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Yanis Aouine, Ahmed Zitouni', null, '1516, Legend has it that the king of Algiers had a wife named Zaphira. When the pirate Aroudj Barbarossa arrives to liberate the city from the Spaniards, he is determined to conquer Zaphira as well as the kingdom itself. But is Zaphira willing to let him, or is she plotting for herself?', '1516, Legend has it that the king of Algiers had a wife named Zaphira. When the pirate Aroudj Barbarossa arrives to liberate the city from the Spaniards, he is determined to conquer Zaphira as well as the kingdom itself. But is Zaphira willing to let him, or is she plotting for herself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Q8vDgmohdmHCmxRJz4OgUPRl6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958161'),
  ('695085235867651830', 'The Last Recipe', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yoshinori Oshima, Yojiro Takita', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Go Ayano, Aoi Miyazaki, Daigo Nishihata, Yutaka Takenouchi, Yoshi Oida, Onodera Akira', null, 'A famous chef who is tasked with tracking down a 70-year-old missing recipe.', 'A famous chef who is tasked with tracking down a 70-year-old missing recipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jimifrBUXRLRJgPlkvEY1YntnJm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458909'),
  ('24626688483318439', 'The Last Relic', 1970, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Grigori Kromanov, Jüri Garšnek, Margit Ojasoon', 'Arvo Valton', 'Aleksandr Goloborodko, Ingrīda Andriņa, Elza Radziņa, Rolan Bykov, Eve Kivi, Uldis Vazdiks, Raivo Trass, Peeter Jakobi', null, 'A medieval love story with lots of adventures. The times are troubled - there''s a revolt of peasants going on. To secure its safety a monastery chases for a relics of a holy Brigitte. A nobleman promises to get it if he gets beautiful Agnes as a reward. But she fells in love with a handsome adventurer. The monastery has to act shrewd now and play double game. The movie is still the best achievement of the Estonian cinema. Based on a novel.', 'A medieval love story with lots of adventures. The times are troubled - there''s a revolt of peasants going on. To secure its safety a monastery chases for a relics of a holy Brigitte. A nobleman promises to get it if he gets beautiful Agnes as a reward. But she fells in love with a handsome adventurer. The monastery has to act shrewd now and play double game. The movie is still the best achievement of the Estonian cinema. Based on a novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2oYdi3bOjSwbHk8IfnmTDQPqkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47150'),
  ('968880811276382026', 'The Last Remake of Beau Geste', 1977, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Marty Feldman, Gerry Fisher', 'Marty Feldman', 'Ann-Margret, Marty Feldman, Michael York, Peter Ustinov, James Earl Jones, Trevor Howard, Henry Gibson, Terry-Thomas', 'PG-13', 'Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.', 'Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GwMgIuOKxf1TCdgZGDQ56Kvyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55628'),
  ('714558473854791579', 'The Last Repair Shop', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ben Proudfoot, Kris Bowers, David Feeney-Mosier', null, 'Dana Atkinson, Duane Michaels, Paty Moreno, Steve Bagmanyan, Ken Burget, Vincent Womack, Boris Karloff, Tom Parker', 'PG', 'In a warehouse in the heart of Los Angeles, a dwindling handful of devoted craftspeople maintain more than 80,000 student musical instruments, the largest remaining workshop in America of its kind. Meet four unforgettable characters whose broken-and-repaired lives have been dedicated to bringing so much more than music to the schoolchildren of this city.', 'In a warehouse in the heart of Los Angeles, a dwindling handful of devoted craftspeople maintain more than 80,000 student musical instruments, the largest remaining workshop in America of its kind. Meet four unforgettable characters whose broken-and-repaired lives have been dedicated to bringing so much more than music to the schoolchildren of this city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BWy7bgE4nTXf7hhooFNqVBJXgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171861'),
  ('985583009788150220', 'The Last Resort', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brandon Nutt, Mark Bashian, Ryan Reels', 'Nathaniel Bozen, Nathan Oliver, Martina Papinchak', 'America Olivo, Paulie Redding, Marissa Tait, Sita Young, Arianne Zucker, Nick Ballard, Jeremy Glazer, Ian Patrick Williams', null, 'They were looking for the ultimate getaway, they planned for the perfect paradise vacation; what they’re about to get is a trip no one is prepared for. When a group of five girlfriends heads for the tropics, they relax, hit the beach and step out for a night of partying. All is fun and games, until someone gets hurt. Robbed by their tour guide and left for dead, the girls take shelter in a deserted Mexican resort that is haunted by the unspeakable atrocities of past.', 'They were looking for the ultimate getaway, they planned for the perfect paradise vacation; what they’re about to get is a trip no one is prepared for. When a group of five girlfriends heads for the tropics, they relax, hit the beach and step out for a night of partying. All is fun and games, until someone gets hurt. Robbed by their tour guide and left for dead, the girls take shelter in a deserted Mexican resort that is haunted by the unspeakable atrocities of past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYeIUrFnfxC1ehdd3AHPeyakTR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21166'),
  ('947631835709146911', 'The Last Resort', 2026, 'Drama', 'Maria Sødahl, John-Erling Holmenes Fredriksen, Maria Sodahl', 'Maria Sødahl, Eske Troelstrup, Therese Hasman, Maria Sodahl', 'Esben Smed, Danica Ćurčić, Sif Lucca Gersby, Chili Olivia Jensen, Antonio Estrada', null, 'A family is enjoying their dream vacation. When they meet a man in need of help, they decide to assist him. Gradually, as he asks for more, and as they get more involved, they start fearing for their own safety.', 'A family is enjoying their dream vacation. When they meet a man in need of help, they decide to assist him. Gradually, as he asks for more, and as they get more involved, they start fearing for their own safety.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsFCBISiMYavYtCVXfoyQq0iTGd1.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-resort-2026'),
  ('26066265510924618', 'The Last Ride', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Guy Norman Bee, Karl Herrmann', null, 'Dennis Hopper, Will Patton, Fred Ward, Nadine Velazquez, Peter Onorati, David Douglas, Jesse Rodriguez, Chris Carmack', 'NR', 'After thirty years in prison, ex-con Ronnie recruits his grandson to exact revenge on Darryl, the cop who put him behind bars. Standing in their way is Ronnie''s son, whom Darryl raised.', 'After thirty years in prison, ex-con Ronnie recruits his grandson to exact revenge on Darryl, the cop who put him behind bars. Standing in their way is Ronnie''s son, whom Darryl raised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qu4ZA2bzvzNSCbpOFrLmFbi53A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42584'),
  ('1046724750930534266', 'The Last Ride', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Han Ki-eop, Nam Dae-joong, Na Seung-yong', 'Nam Dae-joong', 'Ryu Deok-hwan, Ahn Jae-hong, Kim Dong-young, Jeon No-min, Jeon Mi-seon, Lee Han-wi, Lee Byeong-heon, Han Kuk-jin', null, 'Go-hwan, who suffers from Lou Gehrig''s disease realizes that he is going to die. When his best friends ask him what his wish is, he tells them he wants to have sex for the first and last time in his life.', 'Go-hwan, who suffers from Lou Gehrig''s disease realizes that he is going to die. When his best friends ask him what his wish is, he tells them he wants to have sex for the first and last time in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b3QJ7vxCSkFngpHkAXcNvTGGE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388619'),
  ('929744966723833951', 'The Last Rifleman', 2023, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jody Wiltshire, Mark McCauley, Terry Loane', 'Kevin Fitzpatrick', 'Pierce Brosnan, Clémence Poésy, John Amos, Jürgen Prochnow, Ian McElhinney, Tara Lynne O''Neill, Samuel Bottomley, Desmond Eastwood', null, 'A WWII veteran escapes his care home in Northern Ireland and embarks on an arduous but inspirational journey to France to attend the 75th anniversary of the D-Day landings, finding the courage to face the ghosts of his past.', 'A WWII veteran escapes his care home in Northern Ireland and embarks on an arduous but inspirational journey to France to attend the 75th anniversary of the D-Day landings, finding the courage to face the ghosts of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/co1GhkWdgt2J0LRTEJjHntkMrj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763144'),
  ('1063426639234857349', 'The Last Rite', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Leroy Kincaide', 'Leroy Kincaide', 'Johnny Fleming, Tara Hoyos-Martinez, Bethan Waller, Kit Smith, Deborah Blake, Hella Stichlmair, Ian MacNaughton', 'R', 'Based on True Events: Suffering from sleep paralysis, a medical student falls prey to a demonic force that wants to rip her apart from within. Torn between sanity and the unknown, she''s left with no alternative but to contact a local priest for help.', 'Based on True Events: Suffering from sleep paralysis, a medical student falls prey to a demonic force that wants to rip her apart from within. Torn between sanity and the unknown, she''s left with no alternative but to contact a local priest for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YAperQbfpJETfpPn6ezlWOm1sx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744742'),
  ('1051988754273677381', 'The Last Rodeo', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jon Avnet, Denis Lenoir', 'Neal McDonough, Jon Avnet, Derek Presley', 'Neal McDonough, Mykelti Williamson, Sarah Jones, Christopher McDonald, Daylon Swearingen, Graham Harvey, Ruve McDonough, Kamen Casey', 'PG', 'A retired rodeo legend risks it all to save his grandson. Facing his own painful past and the fears of his family, he enters a high-stakes bullriding competition as the oldest contestant ever. Along the way, he reconciles old wounds with his estranged daughter and proves that true courage is found in the fight for family.', 'A retired rodeo legend risks it all to save his grandson. Facing his own painful past and the fears of his family, he enters a high-stakes bullriding competition as the oldest contestant ever. Along the way, he reconciles old wounds with his estranged daughter and proves that true courage is found in the fight for family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62nu9AEIeyDNCQ2xJabq7gwb2zR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380682'),
  ('563661048873621413', 'The Last Ronin', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Shigemichi Sugita, Mutsuo Naganuma', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Koji Yakusho, Koichi Sato, Hitomi Miyauchi, Koji Yamamoto, Jun Fubuki, Kunie Tanaka, Masatô Ibu, Yoshi Oida', null, '16 years after the fateful "revenge of the Forty-seven Ronin," involving samurais from the Ako domain who avenged their leader and then commited seppuku (ritual suicide), the sole survivor of that incident, Kichiemon Terasaka (Koichi Sato) traverses the country on a mission. His purpose is to find the families of the fallen samurais and spread the truth of the ronin uprising.', '16 years after the fateful "revenge of the Forty-seven Ronin," involving samurais from the Ako domain who avenged their leader and then commited seppuku (ritual suicide), the sole survivor of that incident, Kichiemon Terasaka (Koichi Sato) traverses the country on a mission. His purpose is to find the families of the fallen samurais and spread the truth of the ronin uprising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TClwLBKxcwipqN2BBWOTjIZO7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82916'),
  ('439037477590951937', 'The Last Round', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Stelvio Massi, Franco Delli Colli, Danilo Massi', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Luc Merenda, Carlos Monzón, Mariangela Giordano, Gianni Dei, Luisa Maneri, Leonora Fani, Giampiero Albertini, Mario Brega', null, 'Stelvio Massi''s crime thriller centers on a drifter who sets out to help blue-collar workers rise up against the two powerful families who are exploiting them. After settling in an industrial town and witnessing the cruelty of the factory owners, ex-mercenary Marco (Carlos Monzón) assumes the role of union agitator. When a violent confrontation erupts, the labor leader is driven to bring down the corrupt clans.', 'Stelvio Massi''s crime thriller centers on a drifter who sets out to help blue-collar workers rise up against the two powerful families who are exploiting them. After settling in an industrial town and witnessing the cruelty of the factory owners, ex-mercenary Marco (Carlos Monzón) assumes the role of union agitator. When a violent confrontation erupts, the labor leader is driven to bring down the corrupt clans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vleNhtwRG9FUEoZQ9e7Q0s8xxBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90802'),
  ('552936081424177026', 'The Last Run', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Fleischer, Stefano Capriati, Roy Stevens', 'Alan Sharp', 'George C. Scott, Tony Musante, Trish Van Devere, Colleen Dewhurst, Aldo Sambrell, Antonio Tarruella, Robert Coleby, Pat Zurica', 'PG', 'A former mob getaway driver from Chicago has retired to a peaceful life in a Portuguese fishing village. He is asked to pull off one last job - to drive a dangerous crook and his girlfriend to France.', 'A former mob getaway driver from Chicago has retired to a peaceful life in a Portuguese fishing village. He is asked to pull off one last job - to drive a dangerous crook and his girlfriend to France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhZ9a6fwQQTvQXBV2ab3peJ2KxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72447'),
  ('919706332384629681', 'The Last Samurai', 1974, 'Drama, Action', 'Kenji Misumi, Akira Masuda, Masao Kosugi', 'Takeo Kunihiro, Kenji Misumi', 'Hideki Takahashi, Ken Ogata, Teruhiko Saigō, Masaomi Kondo, Keiko Matsuzaka, Kiwako Taichi, Asao Sano, Ayako Honami', null, 'The film follows the story of Sugi Toranosuke, a ronin, who returns to his home town of Edo many years after his attempted suicide as a sickly child. Rescued and adopted by a master swordsman, he has grown into a master swordsman and a very kind gentleman. The time is around 1868 the year that the nails were finally put into the coffin containing the feudal system that nurtured and sustained the samurai. Sugi is confused and unsure about what is happening but his teacher wants him out of the chaos of the multiple power struggles between the various clans.', 'The film follows the story of Sugi Toranosuke, a ronin, who returns to his home town of Edo many years after his attempted suicide as a sickly child. Rescued and adopted by a master swordsman, he has grown into a master swordsman and a very kind gentleman. The time is around 1868 the year that the nails were finally put into the coffin containing the feudal system that nurtured and sustained the samurai. Sugi is confused and unsure about what is happening but his teacher wants him out of the chaos of the multiple power struggles between the various clans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9tLV3xXLyt3VDmeatq9zJVARkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70385'),
  ('1071404401768642633', 'The Last Samurai', 2003, 'Drama, Action, War', 'John Toll, Edward Zwick, Allen Kupetsky', 'Edward Zwick, Marshall Herskovitz, John Logan', 'Tom Cruise, Ken Watanabe, Timothy Spall, Tony Goldwyn, Hiroyuki Sanada, Koyuki, Shin Koyamada, Billy Connolly', 'R', 'Nathan Algren is an American hired to instruct the Japanese army in the ways of modern warfare, which finds him learning to respect the samurai and the honorable principles that rule them. Pressed to destroy the samurai''s way of life in the name of modernization and open trade, Algren decides to become an ultimate warrior himself and to fight for their right to exist.', 'Nathan Algren is an American hired to instruct the Japanese army in the ways of modern warfare, which finds him learning to respect the samurai and the honorable principles that rule them. Pressed to destroy the samurai''s way of life in the name of modernization and open trade, Algren decides to become an ultimate warrior himself and to fight for their right to exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8jmJPs5eZBARmnuEEvZwbjwyz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616'),
  ('415746312267460655', 'The Last Schnitzel', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Resmiye Emir, Alp Korfalı, İsmet Kurtuluş', 'Kaan Arıcı, İsmet Kurtuluş, Onur Koralp', 'Haluk Bilginer, Şevket Süha Tezel, Serkan Keskin, Gökçen Gökçebağ, Cem Zeynel Kılıç, Ömer Akgüllü, Ahmet Kürşat Öçalan, Emir Tayla', null, 'The world is ending, but the president of The Grand Turkish Republic won’t let that happen until he has a chicken schnitzel. Gleefully silly science fiction satire with political bite.', 'The world is ending, but the president of The Grand Turkish Republic won’t let that happen until he has a chicken schnitzel. Gleefully silly science fiction satire with political bite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0j9alz5pdUR68cYVJ2rQagk7Xj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475373'),
  ('742591573089235267', 'The Last Screening', 2011, 'Horror, Drama', 'Laurent Achard', 'Laurent Achard, Frédérique Moreau', 'Pascal Cervo, Karole Rocher, Brigitte Sy, Nicolas Pignon, Mireille Roussel, Noël Simsolo, Charlotte Van Kemmel, Austin Morel', null, 'Sylvain, a young man, devotes his life to small, local movie theater destined to be shut down. He lives in the theater''s basement and is the theater programer, projectionist, and ticket seller. Each night, after the last screening, he leaves the building to carry out a ritual killing.', 'Sylvain, a young man, devotes his life to small, local movie theater destined to be shut down. He lives in the theater''s basement and is the theater programer, projectionist, and ticket seller. Each night, after the last screening, he leaves the building to carry out a ritual killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIhvRlnCrw6AC1KDNPj1PBIF2JH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86810'),
  ('667794110110541780', 'The Last Sect', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jonathan Dueck', null, 'David Carradine, Natalie Brown, Deborah Odell, Julian Richings, Sebastien Roberts, Jordan Van Dyck, Christine Tizzard, Megan Fahlenbock', null, 'A seductively lethal vampire sect leader has been battling famed vampire hunter Van Helsing''s descendent for decades. But now she and her bloodthirsty followers face extinction unless they can find a willing victim who will ensure their future survival. It''s up to Van Helsing to stop the blood from flowing in this thrilling, action-packed duel to the death!', 'A seductively lethal vampire sect leader has been battling famed vampire hunter Van Helsing''s descendent for decades. But now she and her bloodthirsty followers face extinction unless they can find a willing victim who will ensure their future survival. It''s up to Van Helsing to stop the blood from flowing in this thrilling, action-packed duel to the death!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKNlpWqmOVVo3AqamVGG4C4WkKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29691'),
  ('289559929255700512', 'The Last Seduction', 1994, 'Thriller, Crime, Romance, Drama', 'John Dahl, Jeffrey Jur, Eric Heffron', 'Steve Barancik', 'Linda Fiorentino, Peter Berg, Bill Pullman, Bill Nunn, J.T. Walsh, Dean Norris, Herb Mitchell, Michael Raysses', 'R', 'A devious femme fatale steals her husband’s drug money and hides out in a small town where she meets the perfect dupe for her next scheme.', 'A devious femme fatale steals her husband’s drug money and hides out in a small town where she meets the perfect dupe for her next scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK8IiJDkz2Tv6DwaK60vJVHKH85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25284'),
