  ('282762016686281128', 'The Last Sentinel', 2007, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Garrett Warren, Nicholas Lee', 'Jesse V. Johnson', 'Don Wilson, Katee Sackhoff, Bokeem Woodbine, Keith David, Dawnn Lewis, Matthew R. Anderson, Booboo Stewart, Nils Allen Stewart', 'R', 'No emotion. No fear. No pain. They were the perfect soldiers to protect civilization until the drone police became the perfect enemy. With little hope left for mankind, Tallis, an electronically enhanced soldier, rescues a survivor from a failed resistance mission. She will have to learn to fight and think like a machine for the final battle to save the human race.', 'No emotion. No fear. No pain. They were the perfect soldiers to protect civilization until the drone police became the perfect enemy. With little hope left for mankind, Tallis, an electronically enhanced soldier, rescues a survivor from a failed resistance mission. She will have to learn to fight and think like a machine for the final battle to save the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGTvkPokYNy5RrhWbY0xJr4LEJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14789'),
  ('469476417115257142', 'The Last Shark', 1981, 'Horror', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Alberto Spagnoli, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Vincenzo Mannino, Marc Princi', 'James Franciscus, Vic Morrow, Micaela Pignatelli, Joshua Sinclair, Giancarlo Prete, Stefania Girolami Goodwin, Gian Marco Lari, Gail Moore', 'PG', 'When a 35-foot great white shark begins to wreak havoc on a seaside town, the mayor, not wanting to endanger his gubernatorial campaign, declines to act, so a local shark hunter and horror author band together to stop the beast.', 'When a 35-foot great white shark begins to wreak havoc on a seaside town, the mayor, not wanting to endanger his gubernatorial campaign, declines to act, so a local shark hunter and horror author band together to stop the beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1w1oiwRmV1GpGSwt7g0pDiOHddz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40383'),
