  ('894381061682363594', 'The Last Sin Eater', 2007, 'Drama', 'Michael Landon Jr., Robert Seaman', 'Michael Landon Jr.', 'Louise Fletcher, Henry Thomas, Soren Fulton, A.J. Buckley, Stewart Finlay-McLennan, Liana Liberato, Lisa Lackey, Peter Wingfield', 'PG-13', 'In seeking her own redemption from the one man of whom she is most afraid, 10-year-old Cadi Forbes discovers a secret sin haunting her community of Welsh immigrants in 1850s Appalachia.', 'In seeking her own redemption from the one man of whom she is most afraid, 10-year-old Cadi Forbes discovers a secret sin haunting her community of Welsh immigrants in 1850s Appalachia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSFmT13VqhdVqRhU08ADMxy8cGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9916'),
