  ('372471449372417439', 'The Last Son', 2021, 'Western, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'David Gallego, Tim Sutton', 'Greg Johnson', 'Sam Worthington, mgk, Thomas Jane, Heather Graham, Emily Marie Palmer, Kim DeLonghi, Danny Bohnen, Scotty Bohnen', 'R', 'Isaac LeMay, a murderous outlaw, learns he is cursed by a prophecy: one of his children will kill him. To prevent this, he hunts down each of his estranged children, including long-lost son Cal. With bounty hunters and Sheriff Solomon on his tail, LeMay must find a way to stop his children and end the curse.', 'Isaac LeMay, a murderous outlaw, learns he is cursed by a prophecy: one of his children will kill him. To prevent this, he hunts down each of his estranged children, including long-lost son Cal. With bounty hunters and Sheriff Solomon on his tail, LeMay must find a way to stop his children and end the curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RRzcE0uZo7gObuoEiJJnKqvspl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729577'),
  ('575616322585662627', 'The Last Song', 2010, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Julie Anne Robinson, John Lindley', 'Jeff Van Wie, Nicholas Sparks', 'Miley Cyrus, Greg Kinnear, Bobby Coleman, Liam Hemsworth, Hallock Beals, Kelly Preston, Nick Lashaway, Carly Chaikin', 'PG', 'A drama centered on a rebellious girl who is sent to a Southern beach town for the summer to stay with her father. Through their mutual love of music, the estranged duo learn to reconnect.', 'A drama centered on a rebellious girl who is sent to a Southern beach town for the summer to stay with her father. Through their mutual love of music, the estranged duo learn to reconnect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76twEOHXAM2oKnvZYBI5bP6GeDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35690'),
  ('29173762410459653', 'The Last Spark of Hope', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Piotr Biedroń, Tomasz Wójcik', 'Piotr Biedroń', 'Magdalena Wieczorek, Jacek Beler', null, 'A woman, who may be the last human on Earth, struggles to survive with only her robot companion. As she battles the harsh realities of her existence, the stakes intensify when her once-trusted robot turns against her.', 'A woman, who may be the last human on Earth, struggles to survive with only her robot companion. As she battles the harsh realities of her existence, the stakes intensify when her once-trusted robot turns against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCVGpkaewRij5dime4Ws5XxY8sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153470'),
  ('740432428820348724', 'The Last Stage', 1948, 'Drama', 'Wanda Jakubowska, Tadeusz Zając, Zbigniew Niemczynowski', 'Gerda Schneider, Wanda Jakubowska', 'Wanda Bartówna, Huguette Faget, Tatyana Guretskaya, Antonina Gordon-Górecka, Mariya Vinogradova, Barbara Drapińska, Barbara Fijewska, Maria Anna Redlichówna', null, 'Poland, during World War II. Martha Weiss, a Jewish woman, arrives at the Auschwitz extermination camp with her family. She is assigned the role of interpreter, but her loved ones are much less fortunate.', 'Poland, during World War II. Martha Weiss, a Jewish woman, arrives at the Auschwitz extermination camp with her family. She is assigned the role of interpreter, but her loved ones are much less fortunate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8qSmyUPvsNzUCJ0ESkuez1n1UK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121141'),
  ('561268631555685533', 'The Last Stand', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Darrin Prescott, Kim Jee-woon, Kim Ji-yong', 'Jeffrey Nachmanoff, George Nolfi', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Johnny Knoxville, Jaimie Alexander, Zach Gilford, Kristen DeVore Rakes, Christiana Leucas, Diana R. Lupo, John Patrick Amedori', 'R', 'Ray Owens is sheriff of the quiet US border town of Sommerton Junction after leaving the LAPD following a bungled operation. Following his escape from the FBI, a notorious drug baron, his gang, and a hostage are heading toward Sommerton Junction where the police are preparing to make a last stand to intercept them before they cross the border. Owens is reluctant to become involved but ultimately joins in with the law enforcement efforts.', 'Ray Owens is sheriff of the quiet US border town of Sommerton Junction after leaving the LAPD following a bungled operation. Following his escape from the FBI, a notorious drug baron, his gang, and a hostage are heading toward Sommerton Junction where the police are preparing to make a last stand to intercept them before they cross the border. Owens is reluctant to become involved but ultimately joins in with the law enforcement efforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tP4r47v8v6mEj5X5RuG9y8Frbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76640'),
  ('432351722627337280', 'The Last Stand of Ellen Cole', 2024, 'Action, Adventure', 'Derek Lee, Clif Prowse, Jan Klompje', 'Tim Walker', 'Lin Shaye, Liz Caribel Sierra, Craig Tate, Ty Olsson, Karan Gill, Hart Bochner, Sean Owen Roberts, Tanner Bornowsky', null, 'When an evil contractor goes to extreme measures to evict a testy tenant who is standing in the way of his new project, he fails to take into account that this seemingly harmless old woman is a trained killer and will do anything to protect her beloved home.', 'When an evil contractor goes to extreme measures to evict a testy tenant who is standing in the way of his new project, he fails to take into account that this seemingly harmless old woman is a trained killer and will do anything to protect her beloved home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq1pGVQ2t3Cy4v7sA4LRhNjtZuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1411773'),
  ('860697947300419902', 'The Last Starfighter', 1984, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Nick Castle, King Baggot, Brian E. Frankish', 'Jonathan R. Betuel', 'Lance Guest, Robert Preston, Chris Hebert, Kay E. Kuter, Dan Mason, Dan O''Herlihy, Catherine Mary Stewart, Barbara Bosson', 'PG', 'Video game expert Alex Rogan finds himself transported to another planet after conquering the video game The Last Starfighter, only to find out it was just a test. He was recruited to join the team of best Starfighters to defend their world from the attack.', 'Video game expert Alex Rogan finds himself transported to another planet after conquering the video game The Last Starfighter, only to find out it was just a test. He was recruited to join the team of best Starfighters to defend their world from the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7oAHTjtYnIEQjJs62IONRufooq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11884'),
  ('813006201567849965', 'The Last Station', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Hoffman, Sebastian Edschmid', 'Michael Hoffman', 'Helen Mirren, Christopher Plummer, Paul Giamatti, James McAvoy, John Sessions, Patrick Kennedy, Kerry Condon, Anne-Marie Duff', 'R', 'A historical drama that illustrates Russian author Leo Tolstoy''s struggle to balance fame and wealth with his commitment to a life devoid of material things. The Countess Sofya, wife and muse to Leo Tolstoy, uses every trick of seduction on her husband''s loyal disciple, whom she believes was the person responsible for Tolstoy signing a new will that leaves his work and property to the Russian people.', 'A historical drama that illustrates Russian author Leo Tolstoy''s struggle to balance fame and wealth with his commitment to a life devoid of material things. The Countess Sofya, wife and muse to Leo Tolstoy, uses every trick of seduction on her husband''s loyal disciple, whom she believes was the person responsible for Tolstoy signing a new will that leaves his work and property to the Russian people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nf9cYwKcvxTbSsCz4o6eRJ8P0IH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36811'),
  ('272553933738106372', 'The Last Stop in Yuma County', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Francis Galluppi, Mac Fisken, Mazzin Chaudhari', 'Francis Galluppi', 'Jim Cummings, Jocelin Donahue, Richard Brake, Nicholas Logan, Michael Abbott Jr., Sierra McCormick, Ryan Masson, Connor Paolo', 'R', 'While awaiting the next fuel truck at a middle-of-nowhere Arizona rest stop, a traveling young knife salesman is thrust into a high-stakes hostage situation by the arrival of two similarly stranded bank robbers with no qualms about using cruelty—or cold, hard steel—to protect their bloodstained, ill-gotten fortune.', 'While awaiting the next fuel truck at a middle-of-nowhere Arizona rest stop, a traveling young knife salesman is thrust into a high-stakes hostage situation by the arrival of two similarly stranded bank robbers with no qualms about using cruelty—or cold, hard steel—to protect their bloodstained, ill-gotten fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6ae2MMh8PpSamO3cIttLM5B18v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047020'),
  ('770836130965169022', 'The Last Suit', 2017, 'Drama', 'Katarzyna Winecka, Teresa Violetta Buhl, Pablo Solarz', 'Pablo Solarz, Ana García Blaya', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Ángela Molina, Olga Bołądź, Julia Beerhold, Martín Piroyansky, Jan Mayzel, Maciej Grubich, Michał Sikorski', null, 'Cranky, crafty and always immaculately dressed, aged master tailor Abraham Bursztein finds himself facing his winter years in a retirement home after discovering his children have sold his home out from under him. Not one to go quietly, Abraham unexpectedly travels to Poland in order to deliver a suit to a childhood friend who saved his life during the Nazi occupation.', 'Cranky, crafty and always immaculately dressed, aged master tailor Abraham Bursztein finds himself facing his winter years in a retirement home after discovering his children have sold his home out from under him. Not one to go quietly, Abraham unexpectedly travels to Poland in order to deliver a suit to a childhood friend who saved his life during the Nazi occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNwaVIZQUOXPmYnNDZ7Tz3HQFvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466614'),
  ('787373547719360579', 'The Last Summer', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'William Bindley', 'Scott Bindley, William Bindley, Alaman Diadhiou', 'KJ Apa, Maia Mitchell, Jacob Latimore, Halston Sage, Tyler Posey, Mario Revolori, Sosie Bacon, Gage Golightly', 'PG-13', 'Standing on the precipice of adulthood, a group of friends navigate new relationships, while reexamining others, during their final summer before college.', 'Standing on the precipice of adulthood, a group of friends navigate new relationships, while reexamining others, during their final summer before college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAn3MRAUwbjVApN3qYkvsTEOAvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502292'),
