  ('201624761115464726', 'The Last Supper', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mauro Borrelli, Vladislav Opelyants', 'Mauro Borrelli, John Collins', 'Jamie Ward, James Oliver Wheatley, Charlie MacGechan, Nathalie Rapti Gomez, James Faulkner, Robert Knepper, Daniel Fathers, Batoul Marie Prenant', 'PG-13', 'In the days leading to betrayal, a gathering of disciples unravels into a web of secrets and hidden motives. As tensions simmer beneath the surface, trust is tested, and loyalty is questioned. The Last Supper becomes a night where nothing is as it seems, and every glance hides a deeper truth.', 'In the days leading to betrayal, a gathering of disciples unravels into a web of secrets and hidden motives. As tensions simmer beneath the surface, trust is tested, and loyalty is questioned. The Last Supper becomes a night where nothing is as it seems, and every glance hides a deeper truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fulEdvN5u6mIpwig7HcBnYpkJEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380415'),
  ('181340107832638668', 'The Last Survivors', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Seamus Tierney, Samantha Stauber, Tom Hammock', 'Jacob Forman, Tom Hammock', 'Haley Lu Richardson, Booboo Stewart, Max Charles, Nicole Fox, Michael Welch, Jon Gries, Michael Massee, Rena Owen', null, 'In the near future, society collapses and water becomes scarce. When a greedy water baron starts violently clearing out survivors, Kendal, a 17-year-old teenager, fights the baron''s henchman to keep a well open.', 'In the near future, society collapses and water becomes scarce. When a greedy water baron starts violently clearing out survivors, Kendal, a 17-year-old teenager, fights the baron''s henchman to keep a well open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ssq3vz2fgHR2xTPDKxPJMcEvIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270771'),
  ('108320491149239614', 'The Last Temptation of Christ', 1988, 'Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Jay Cocks', 'Willem Dafoe, Harvey Keitel, Paul Greco, Steve Shill, Verna Bloom, Barbara Hershey, Roberts Blossom, Barry Miller', 'R', 'Jesus, a humble Judean carpenter beginning to see that he is the son of God, is drawn into revolutionary action against the Roman occupiers by Judas -- despite his protestations that love, not violence, is the path to salvation. The burden of being the savior of mankind torments Jesus throughout his life, leading him to doubt.', 'Jesus, a humble Judean carpenter beginning to see that he is the son of God, is drawn into revolutionary action against the Roman occupiers by Judas -- despite his protestations that love, not violence, is the path to salvation. The burden of being the savior of mankind torments Jesus throughout his life, leading him to doubt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L4qwrC1mipZXJfU5oRgQWChLv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11051'),
  ('795439497412629158', 'The Last Theft', 1987, 'Crime', 'Jiří Barta, Jan Malíř, Zdeněk Pospíšil', 'Jiří Barta, Václav Mergl', 'František Husák, Zdeněk Martínek, Ivan Vojtek', null, 'A man breaks into a large, seemingly abandoned old house to plunder the gold received. But the house is really abandoned?', 'A man breaks into a large, seemingly abandoned old house to plunder the gold received. But the house is really abandoned?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KDqakVdgdW6NwKN64sQSK4PFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104342'),
  ('732877190139590942', 'The Last Thing He Wanted', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michelle Malley Campos, Alexandra Burgos, Alex Scricco', 'Marco Villalobos, Dee Rees', 'Anne Hathaway, Ben Affleck, Rosie Perez, Willem Dafoe, Edi Gathegi, Mel Rodriguez, Onata Aprile, Toby Jones', 'R', 'At the turning point of the Iran-Contra affair, Elena McMahon, a fearless investigative journalist covering the 1984 US presidential campaign, puts herself in danger when she abandons her assigned task in order to fulfill the last wish of her ailing father, a mysterious man whose past activities she barely knows.', 'At the turning point of the Iran-Contra affair, Elena McMahon, a fearless investigative journalist covering the 1984 US presidential campaign, puts herself in danger when she abandons her assigned task in order to fulfill the last wish of her ailing father, a mysterious man whose past activities she barely knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mDbGqi8mloDdxkviq13SKCfuFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505225'),
  ('243759278019847161', 'The Last Thing Mary Saw', 2021, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'David Kruta, Edoardo Vitaletti, Greg Tango', 'Edoardo Vitaletti', 'Stefanie Scott, Isabelle Fuhrman, Rory Culkin, Judith Roberts, Carolyn McCormick, Michael Laurence, Shane Coffey, Dawn McGee', 'R', 'Winter, 1843. A young woman is under investigation following the mysterious death of her family''s matriarch. Her recollection of the events sheds new light on the ageless forces behind the tragedy.', 'Winter, 1843. A young woman is under investigation following the mysterious death of her family''s matriarch. Her recollection of the events sheds new light on the ageless forces behind the tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mA6Vztb6ZkcQq8GiOpePWqQGMDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681986'),
  ('366064694460448778', 'The Last Time', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Caleo, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Michael Caleo', 'Michael Keaton, Brendan Fraser, Daniel Stern, Amber Valletta, Richard Kuhlman, Alexis Cruz, Neal McDonough, David Jensen', 'R', 'Ted Ryker is the top salesman in the New York office of a business machine company; the corporate stock lives by quarterly sales numbers, the competition is keen, and the economy may be in a downturn. Ted''s company is marking time until a new product is ready – probably in a few months. Into the mix comes a new hire, a callow Midwesterner named Jamie, who''s come East with his fiancée Belisa.', 'Ted Ryker is the top salesman in the New York office of a business machine company; the corporate stock lives by quarterly sales numbers, the competition is keen, and the economy may be in a downturn. Ted''s company is marking time until a new product is ready – probably in a few months. Into the mix comes a new hire, a callow Midwesterner named Jamie, who''s come East with his fiancée Belisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPz2CcAWin7X6QfruYj2hWMGvHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27683'),
  ('94348440980380520', 'The Last Time I Committed Suicide', 1997, 'Drama', 'Stephen Kay, Laurel Smith, Sholto J. Roeg', 'Stephen Kay', 'Thomas Jane, Keanu Reeves, Adrien Brody, John Doe, Claire Forlani, Jim Haynie, Marg Helgenberger, Lucinda Jenney', 'R', 'Neal Cassady is living the beat life during the 1940s, working at The Tire Yard and philandering around town. However, he has visions of a happy life with kids and a white picket fence. When his girlfried, Joan, tries to kill herself he gets scared and runs away. But when Joan reappears will he take the chance at that happiness, or will he turn his back on it?', 'Neal Cassady is living the beat life during the 1940s, working at The Tire Yard and philandering around town. However, he has visions of a happy life with kids and a white picket fence. When his girlfried, Joan, tries to kill herself he gets scared and runs away. But when Joan reappears will he take the chance at that happiness, or will he turn his back on it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AM1oDIlsWBBLYecetUAHOWv9dW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34941'),
  ('609038464844350278', 'The Last Time I Saw Macao', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'João Rui Guerra da Mata, João Pedro Rodrigues, João Rui Guerra da Mata', 'João Rui Guerra da Mata, João Pedro Rodrigues', 'Cindy Scrash, João Rui Guerra da Mata, João Pedro Rodrigues, Maria João Guerra da Mata, Lydie Bárbara, Raphaël Lefèvre, Nuno Carvalho, Hoi Kem Foo', null, 'A filmmaker returns to Macao, China, to help a friend who is in trouble.', 'A filmmaker returns to Macao, China, to help a friend who is in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWVqXkLj2hHK6f7xeh115X8IoAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128120'),
  ('656515961510930604', 'The Last Time I Saw Paris', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Brooks, Joseph Ruttenberg, William Shanks', 'Philip G. Epstein, Julius J. Epstein, Richard Brooks', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Van Johnson, Walter Pidgeon, Donna Reed, Eva Gabor, Kurt Kasznar, George Dolenz, Roger Moore', 'NR', 'Reporter Charles Wills, in Paris to cover the end of World War II, falls for the beautiful Helen Ellswirth following a brief flirtation with her sister, Marion. After he and Helen marry, Charles pursues his novelistic ambition while supporting his new bride with a deadening job at a newspaper wire service. But when an old investment suddenly makes the family wealthy, their marriage begins to unravel — until a sudden tragedy changes everything.', 'Reporter Charles Wills, in Paris to cover the end of World War II, falls for the beautiful Helen Ellswirth following a brief flirtation with her sister, Marion. After he and Helen marry, Charles pursues his novelistic ambition while supporting his new bride with a deadening job at a newspaper wire service. But when an old investment suddenly makes the family wealthy, their marriage begins to unravel — until a sudden tragedy changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rerbqTR085seifQjy7bpnEJJ9qI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57575'),
  ('355026389257074573', 'The Last Time We Were Children', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Adventure', 'Leopoldo Pescatore, Claudio Bisio, Italo Petriccione', 'Claudio Bisio, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Alessio Di Domenicantonio, Vincenzo Sebastiani, Carlotta De Leonardis, Lorenzo McGovern Zaini, Federico Cesari, Marianna Fontana, Claudio Bisio, Antonello Fassari', null, 'Rome, summer 1943. Four children play war while the bombs of real war explode around them. Italo is the rich son of the Federal, Cosimo has his father in confinement and an atavistic hunger, Vanda is an orphan and a believer, Riccardo comes from a wealthy Jewish family. They are different but they don''t know it and between them "the greatest friendship in the world" is born, impervious to the divisions of history that bloodies Europe. But on October 16 the Jewish boy is taken away by the Germans together with over a thousand people from the Ghetto. Thanks to Italo''s father Federale, the three friends believe they know where he is and, to honor the "spit pact", decide to leave in secret to convince the Germans to free their friend. Yet another imaginative mission becomes reality, the three children travel alone in an Italy exhausted by war, among disbanded soldiers, deserters, occupying German troops, exhausted and hungry populations.', 'Rome, summer 1943. Four children play war while the bombs of real war explode around them. Italo is the rich son of the Federal, Cosimo has his father in confinement and an atavistic hunger, Vanda is an orphan and a believer, Riccardo comes from a wealthy Jewish family. They are different but they don''t know it and between them "the greatest friendship in the world" is born, impervious to the divisions of history that bloodies Europe. But on October 16 the Jewish boy is taken away by the Germans together with over a thousand people from the Ghetto. Thanks to Italo''s father Federale, the three friends believe they know where he is and, to honor the "spit pact", decide to leave in secret to convince the Germans to free their friend. Yet another imaginative mission becomes reality, the three children travel alone in an Italy exhausted by war, among disbanded soldiers, deserters, occupying German troops, exhausted and hungry populations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcqZ0x2PwXx9B7a4Kk3LFdineoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080936'),
  ('1087456409426318341', 'The Last Tomahawk', 1965, 'Western', 'Harald Reinl', 'James Fenimore Cooper, J. Joachim Bartsch', 'Daniel Martín, Joachim Fuchsberger, Karin Dor, Anthony Steffen, Carl Lange, Kurt Großkurth, Marie France, Ricardo Rodrigues', null, 'As Alice and Cora Munro attempt to find their father, a British officer in the French and Indian War, they are set upon by French soldiers and their cohorts, Huron tribesmen led by the evil Magua. Fighting to rescue the women are Chingachgook and his son Unkas, the last of the Mohican tribe, and their white ally, the frontiersman Natty Bumppo, known as Falkenauge.', 'As Alice and Cora Munro attempt to find their father, a British officer in the French and Indian War, they are set upon by French soldiers and their cohorts, Huron tribesmen led by the evil Magua. Fighting to rescue the women are Chingachgook and his son Unkas, the last of the Mohican tribe, and their white ally, the frontiersman Natty Bumppo, known as Falkenauge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTlpua1OzT54mK6hkEFbl005rcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91103'),
