  ('174314158627186389', 'The Last Turning', 1939, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Pierre Chenal, Henri Calef, Christian Matras', 'Henri Torrès, Charles Spaak', 'Fernand Gravey, Michel Simon, Corinne Luchaire, Marcel Vallée, Auguste Bovério, René Bergeron, Charles Blavette, Georges Douking', null, 'Frank, a hobo, ends up in a garage-truck stop in the middle of nowhere. Nick Marino, its older, kind and naive owner, is married to Cora, a sexy and mercenary woman half his age. Frank, although not a fan of hard work, accepts Nick''s offer to work for him. Of course, it is not for Nick''s sake that the young man becomes his attendant, but for the love of Cora under whose spell he has fallen at once. It does not take long before Cora, who despises her husband, asks her lover to help her get rid of him. Frank is reluctant at first but ...', 'Frank, a hobo, ends up in a garage-truck stop in the middle of nowhere. Nick Marino, its older, kind and naive owner, is married to Cora, a sexy and mercenary woman half his age. Frank, although not a fan of hard work, accepts Nick''s offer to work for him. Of course, it is not for Nick''s sake that the young man becomes his attendant, but for the love of Cora under whose spell he has fallen at once. It does not take long before Cora, who despises her husband, asks her lover to help her get rid of him. Frank is reluctant at first but ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2t5gpcoZdtcLCHExooIbPo2GaMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62566'),
  ('146128955135346785', 'The Last Tycoon', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elia Kazan, Gary Daigler, Daniel McCauley', 'Harold Pinter', 'Robert De Niro, Tony Curtis, Robert Mitchum, Jeanne Moreau, Jack Nicholson, Donald Pleasence, Ray Milland, Dana Andrews', 'PG', 'Monroe Stahr, a successful movie producer, pursues a beautiful and elusive young woman — all the while working himself to death.', 'Monroe Stahr, a successful movie producer, pursues a beautiful and elusive young woman — all the while working himself to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sETEj1ieRCH4suyaW7D3q4XfFWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37774'),
  ('907324560180956483', 'The Last Tycoon', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Wong Jing, Yang Zhenyu, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Lui Koon-Nam, Wong Jing', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Huang Xiaoming, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Yuan Quan, Yuan Li, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Kimmy Tong Fei', 'NR', 'Cheng, a young man who is set up by the chief of police, must leave the life he knows and Qiu, the woman he loves, to start again. After escaping prison Cheng quickly and violently moves his way up the ladder of Shanghais criminal underworld to become on the most powerful mob bosses in Shanghais history. But fame and notoriety take their toll when Cheng finds himself stuck between the looming Japanese army and the scheming local secret service. Matters are only made worse when he bumps into the love of his life QIU, along with her writer husband. Will love re-kindle in the dusk of an era?', 'Cheng, a young man who is set up by the chief of police, must leave the life he knows and Qiu, the woman he loves, to start again. After escaping prison Cheng quickly and violently moves his way up the ladder of Shanghais criminal underworld to become on the most powerful mob bosses in Shanghais history. But fame and notoriety take their toll when Cheng finds himself stuck between the looming Japanese army and the scheming local secret service. Matters are only made worse when he bumps into the love of his life QIU, along with her writer husband. Will love re-kindle in the dusk of an era?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK1oJPyyXtsNpYyyIet8H2WUj1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156643'),
  ('187227088715545261', 'The Last Unicorn', 1982, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr., Michael Pakleppa', 'Peter S. Beagle', 'Mia Farrow, Alan Arkin, Tammy Grimes, Jeff Bridges, Christopher Lee, Angela Lansbury, Robert Klein, Keenan Wynn', 'G', 'A unicorn learns from a riddle-speaking butterfly that she is supposedly the last of her kind, all the others having been herded away by the monstrous Red Bull. The unicorn sets out to discover the truth behind the butterfly''s words. She is eventually joined on her quest by Schmendrick, a second-rate magician, and Molly Grue, a middle-aged woman who dreamed all her life of seeing a unicorn. Their journey leads them far from home, all the way to the castle of King Haggard.', 'A unicorn learns from a riddle-speaking butterfly that she is supposedly the last of her kind, all the others having been herded away by the monstrous Red Bull. The unicorn sets out to discover the truth behind the butterfly''s words. She is eventually joined on her quest by Schmendrick, a second-rate magician, and Molly Grue, a middle-aged woman who dreamed all her life of seeing a unicorn. Their journey leads them far from home, all the way to the castle of King Haggard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MRHFtXTjxC74MGCzHACcuqvHiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10150'),
  ('196094584526295975', 'The Last Vacation', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Leenhardt, Philippe Agostini', 'Roger Leenhardt', 'Odile Versois, Michel François, Jean Lara, Renée Devillers, Pierre Dux, Frédéric Munié, Raymond Farge, Marcelle Monthil', null, 'A schoolboy remembers his last holiday in the big house of his family in the country, before it was sold.', 'A schoolboy remembers his last holiday in the big house of his family in the country, before it was sold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2e5cF1fHMEbHqoUfOfgoqWqZeSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159725'),
  ('1112263151030109698', 'The Last Valley', 1971, 'History, War, Drama', 'James Clavell, Norman Warwick, John Wilcox', 'James Clavell', 'Michael Caine, Omar Sharif, Florinda Bolkan, Nigel Davenport, Per Oscarsson, Madeleine Hinde, Yorgo Voyagis, Miguel Alejandro', 'PG', 'People in a small German village in the last valley to remain untouched by the devastating Thirty Years'' War try to exist in peace with a group of soldiers occupying the valley.', 'People in a small German village in the last valley to remain untouched by the devastating Thirty Years'' War try to exist in peace with a group of soldiers occupying the valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCUBbKRjpFbw8eiCL44EXrv4Ya4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42525'),
  ('155865434260856243', 'The Last Vampyre', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie, Horror', 'Tim Sullivan, David Odd', 'Jeremy Paul', 'Jeremy Brett, Edward Hardwicke, Juliet Aubrey, Roy Marsden, Keith Barron, Elizabeth Spriggs, Richard Dempsey, Maurice Denham', null, 'Sherlock Holmes investigates strange and tragic happenings in a village that appear linked to a man who seems to be like a vampire.', 'Sherlock Holmes investigates strange and tragic happenings in a village that appear linked to a man who seems to be like a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeA3oqd4DQcZF2DncxekWaDuaD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61692'),
  ('660378281798721882', 'The Last Vermeer', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Dan Friedkin, Richard Goodwin, Remi Adefarasin', 'John Orloff, Mark Fergus, Hawk Ostby', 'Guy Pearce, Claes Bang, Vicky Krieps, Roland Møller, August Diehl, Karl Johnson, Andrew Havill, Paul Bentall', 'R', 'A soldier and member of the Dutch resistance investigates stolen art in the wake of the Second World War, including a Vermeer sold to the Nazis by a flamboyant forger.', 'A soldier and member of the Dutch resistance investigates stolen art in the wake of the Second World War, including a Vermeer sold to the Nazis by a flamboyant forger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CKxIyEIdHgkQzDixn68Hvwua90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622977'),
  ('90024235374075450', 'The Last Victim', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller, Western, Mystery, Action', 'Lukasz Pruchnik, Naveen A. Chathapuram', 'Ashley James Louis', 'Ali Larter, Ron Perlman, Ralph Ineson, Tahmoh Penikett, Kyle Schmid, Dakota Daulby, Tom Stevens, Trish Allen', null, 'Set in the American Southwest, Sheriff Hickey tries to solve the worst case he has seen in his small town, likely caused by a violent local gang led by a fearsome criminal.', 'Set in the American Southwest, Sheriff Hickey tries to solve the worst case he has seen in his small town, likely caused by a violent local gang led by a fearsome criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkMotc2mM4VuJmMPWUkZ8niEFbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866254'),
  ('1027219486342544382', 'The Last Viking', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Sebastian Blenkov, Djamila Hansen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Sofie Gråbøl, Søren Malling, Bodil Jørgensen, Lars Brygmann, Nicolas Bro, Kardo Razzazi', null, 'After serving fourteen years for robbery, Anker is released from prison and reunites with his mentally ill brother Manfred, who alone knows where the stolen money is hidden but has forgotten its location, sending them on a journey to recover the loot and confront who they are.', 'After serving fourteen years for robbery, Anker is released from prison and reunites with his mentally ill brother Manfred, who alone knows where the stolen money is hidden but has forgotten its location, sending them on a journey to recover the loot and confront who they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92ztdPsf98i0tLcONIX92yuh3MQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1295400'),
  ('390613174046527756', 'The Last Voyage', 1960, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Andrew L. Stone, Harrold Weinberger, Hal Mohr', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Robert Stack, Dorothy Malone, George Sanders, Edmond O''Brien, Woody Strode, Jack Kruschen, Joel Marston, George Furness', 'NR', 'The S. S. Claridon is scheduled for her five last voyages after thirty-eight years of service. After an explosion in the boiler room, Captain Robert Adams is reluctant to evacuate the steamship. While the crew fights to hold a bulkhead between the flooded boiler room and the engine room and avoid the sinking of the vessel, the passenger Cliff Henderson struggles against time trying to save his beloved wife Laurie Henderson, who is trapped under a steel beam in her cabin, with the support of the crew member Hank Lawson.', 'The S. S. Claridon is scheduled for her five last voyages after thirty-eight years of service. After an explosion in the boiler room, Captain Robert Adams is reluctant to evacuate the steamship. While the crew fights to hold a bulkhead between the flooded boiler room and the engine room and avoid the sinking of the vessel, the passenger Cliff Henderson struggles against time trying to save his beloved wife Laurie Henderson, who is trapped under a steel beam in her cabin, with the support of the crew member Hank Lawson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4hwHvo4KdaQK4fRjvFH5hkTXMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37605'),
  ('505134562112693298', 'The Last Voyage of the Demeter', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Tom Stern, Toby Spanton, Wolfgang Metschan', 'Zak Olkewicz, Bragi F. Schut', 'Corey Hawkins, Aisling Franciosi, David Dastmalchian, Javier Botet, Liam Cunningham, Chris Walley, Jon Jon Briones, Stefan Kapičić', 'R', 'The crew of the merchant ship Demeter attempts to survive the ocean voyage from Carpathia to London as they are stalked each night by a merciless presence onboard the ship.', 'The crew of the merchant ship Demeter attempts to survive the ocean voyage from Carpathia to London as they are stalked each night by a merciless presence onboard the ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrtbv6Cew7qC7k9GsYSf5uSmuKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635910'),
  ('508054669678314613', 'The Last Wagon', 1956, 'Western', 'Delmer Daves, Wilfrid M. Cline, Joseph E. Rickards', 'James Edward Grant, Delmer Daves, Gwen Bagni', 'Richard Widmark, Felicia Farr, Susan Kohner, Tommy Rettig, Stephanie Griffin, Ray Stricklyn, Nick Adams, Carl Benton Reid', 'NR', 'When a handful of settlers survive an Apache attack on their wagon train they must put their lives into the hands of Comanche Todd, a white man who has lived with the Comanches most of his life and is wanted for the murder of three men.', 'When a handful of settlers survive an Apache attack on their wagon train they must put their lives into the hands of Comanche Todd, a white man who has lived with the Comanches most of his life and is wanted for the murder of three men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FHbwL1RZCeAsBRSBVuxYRj9Mhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44921'),
  ('444931439546221300', 'The Last Waltz', 1978, 'Documentary, Music', 'Martin Scorsese, James Quinn, Linda McMurray', 'Mardik Martin', 'Robbie Robertson, Rick Danko, Levon Helm, Richard Manuel, Garth Hudson, Eric Clapton, Neil Diamond, Bob Dylan', 'PG', 'Martin Scorsese''s documentary intertwines footage from The Band''s incredible farewell tour with probing backstage interviews and featured performances by Eric Clapton, Bob Dylan, Joni Mitchell, Van Morrison, and other rock legends.', 'Martin Scorsese''s documentary intertwines footage from The Band''s incredible farewell tour with probing backstage interviews and featured performances by Eric Clapton, Bob Dylan, Joni Mitchell, Van Morrison, and other rock legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K7CFH0AIHnGrA4yQjPCoIB5CmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13963'),
  ('46599012128327843', 'The Last War', 1961, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Shūe Matsubayashi, Rokurô Nishigaki, Yasuyoshi Tajitsu', 'Takeshi Kimura, Toshio Yasumi', 'Frankie Sakai, Akira Takarada, Yuriko Hoshi, Nobuko Otowa, Yumi Shirakawa, Chishū Ryū, Jerry Itō, Eijirō Tōno', null, 'A Japanese family is torn apart by the tensions of an avoidable nuclear world war between the superpowers.', 'A Japanese family is torn apart by the tensions of an avoidable nuclear world war between the superpowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Au9xiOTYLmc7Y1zTlAHTgtlxO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79551'),
  ('509990647313737123', 'The Last Warning', 1928, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Leni, Hal Mohr, Joseph Cherniavsky', 'Tom Reed, Thomas F. Fallon', 'Laura La Plante, Montagu Love, Roy D''Arcy, Margaret Livingston, John Boles, Burr McIntosh, Mack Swain, Bert Roach', 'NR', 'A producer decides to reopen a theater, that had been closed five years previously when one of the actors was murdered during a performance, by staging a production of the same play with the remaining members of the original cast.', 'A producer decides to reopen a theater, that had been closed five years previously when one of the actors was murdered during a performance, by staging a production of the same play with the remaining members of the original cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebytaLUSQSYSUrDUVako5rln7t7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84712'),
  ('824793454427036015', 'The Last Warrior', 2017, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Lamara Soghomonyan, Nikolay Bogachev, Filipp Lamshin', 'Dmitry Yan, Pavel Danilov, Igor Tudvasev', 'Viktor Horinyak, Mila Syvatska, Ekaterina Vilkova, Konstantin Lavronenko, Sergey Burunov, Elena Yakovleva, Svetlana Kolpakova, Aleksandr Semchev', null, 'Ivan is an ordinary guy who is transferred from modern Moscow to the fantasy world Belogorye. In this parallel universe where characters of Russian fairy tales live, magic is an integral part of daily life, and arguments are settled with the help of sword . Unexpectedly, Ivan finds himself in the middle of a battle between good and evil, and he must discover why everyone thinks that he must play the main role in upcoming events...', 'Ivan is an ordinary guy who is transferred from modern Moscow to the fantasy world Belogorye. In this parallel universe where characters of Russian fairy tales live, magic is an integral part of daily life, and arguments are settled with the help of sword . Unexpectedly, Ivan finds himself in the middle of a battle between good and evil, and he must discover why everyone thinks that he must play the main role in upcoming events...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFEHcmPuI95aoeNrWXCVnA4oI5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471968'),
  ('164881311994630767', 'The Last Warrior', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy, History, Adventure', 'Rustam Mosafir, Dmitriy Karnachik, Nelly Ivanova', 'Rustam Mosafir, Vadim Golovanov', 'Aleksey Faddeev, Vitaly Kravchenko, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Vasilisa Izmaylova, Aleksandr Patsevich, Yuriy Tsurilo, Andrey Permyakov, Viktor Solovyov', null, 'A new era is about to begin in Eastern Europe. Scythians, the proud warriors, are all but gone and most of the few remaining descendants have become ruthless mercenary assassins. Lutobor, a warrior who becomes involved in intertribal conflicts, sets off on a perilous journey to save his family guided by a captive Scythian.', 'A new era is about to begin in Eastern Europe. Scythians, the proud warriors, are all but gone and most of the few remaining descendants have become ruthless mercenary assassins. Lutobor, a warrior who becomes involved in intertribal conflicts, sets off on a perilous journey to save his family guided by a captive Scythian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQeYTkq8Joz3hlogYrioCxU7aTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458027'),
  ('198125364222518944', 'The Last Warrior: Emissary of Darkness', 2021, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Yuliya Zherdina, Filipp Lamshin, Yuliya Drobysheva', 'Vitaly Shlyappo', 'Viktor Horinyak, Mila Syvatska, Ekaterina Vilkova, Elena Yakovleva, Konstantin Lavronenko, Evgeniy Dyatlov, Timofey Tribuntsev, Alesya Lukyanova', null, 'Now that Ivan is about to turn 21, he is now grown up and finally old enough to marry the beautiful Vasilisa. But when Vasilisa is kidnapped and trapped in modern Moscow, Ivan and his friends must travel to the present day to rescue her.', 'Now that Ivan is about to turn 21, he is now grown up and finally old enough to marry the beautiful Vasilisa. But when Vasilisa is kidnapped and trapped in modern Moscow, Ivan and his friends must travel to the present day to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDlUJj8Xuwl3JeehLtLweGDDJhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598014'),
  ('1139268602230311892', 'The Last Warrior: Root of Evil', 2020, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Aleksey Kosorotov, Mikhail Vikhrov, Yuliya Drobysheva', 'Dmitry Yan, Pavel Danilov, Vasily Kutsenko', 'Viktor Horinyak, Mila Syvatska, Ekaterina Vilkova, Elena Yakovleva, Konstantin Lavronenko, Evgeniy Dyatlov, Timofey Tribuntsev, Pavel Davydov', 'PG', 'Peace and tranquility have set in Belogorie. The evil was defeated and Ivan is now enjoying his well-deserved fame. He is surrounded by his family, friends and small wonders from the modern world that help him lead a comfortable life. Luckily, he has his Magic Sword to cut a gap between the worlds to get some supplies quite regularly. But when an ancient evil rises and the existence of the magic world is put to danger, Ivan has to team up with his old friends and his new rivals. They will set out on a long journey beyond the known world to find a way to defeat the enemies and to return peace to Belogorie.', 'Peace and tranquility have set in Belogorie. The evil was defeated and Ivan is now enjoying his well-deserved fame. He is surrounded by his family, friends and small wonders from the modern world that help him lead a comfortable life. Luckily, he has his Magic Sword to cut a gap between the worlds to get some supplies quite regularly. But when an ancient evil rises and the existence of the magic world is put to danger, Ivan has to team up with his old friends and his new rivals. They will set out on a long journey beyond the known world to find a way to defeat the enemies and to return peace to Belogorie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VJSIAhSn4qUsg5nOj4MhQhF5wQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589754'),
  ('267884348707666298', 'The Last Wave', 1977, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Russell Boyd, Peter Weir, John Robertson', 'Peter Weir, Petru Popescu, Tony Morphett', 'Richard Chamberlain, Olivia Hamnett, David Gulpilil, Frederick Parslow, Vivean Gray, Athol Compton, Peter Carroll, Walter Amagula', 'PG', 'A Sydney lawyer defends five Aboriginal people in a ritualised taboo murder and in the process learns disturbing truths about himself and premonitions.', 'A Sydney lawyer defends five Aboriginal people in a ritualised taboo murder and in the process learns disturbing truths about himself and premonitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UwdJ0EMXirUuNFaohfK023Nuyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72277'),
  ('867931362907759425', 'The Last Wedding', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kari Sohlberg, Markku Pölönen, Nadja Pyykkö', 'Markku Pölönen', 'Martti Suosalo, Henrika Andersson, Rauha Valkonen, Jarmo Mäkinen, Matt Varjo, Pertti Koivula, Esko Nikkari, Esko Hukkanen', null, 'Pekka arrives back to his home village of Jerusalem to celebrate the last wedding of the village. His own marriage seems to have reached a dead end. The people of the village gather to prepare for the event, and the bitter spectrum of all human life, with its joys and sorrows, is condensed into one summer''s day.', 'Pekka arrives back to his home village of Jerusalem to celebrate the last wedding of the village. His own marriage seems to have reached a dead end. The people of the village gather to prepare for the event, and the bitter spectrum of all human life, with its joys and sorrows, is condensed into one summer''s day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21y2esavPVdSgPGtew5vn8GyGDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51038'),
  ('633240813549327995', 'The Last Week of September', 2024, 'Drama', 'Gianni De Blasi, Giorgio Giannoccaro', 'Antonella Gaeta, Pippo Mezzapesa, Gianni De Blasi', 'Diego Abatantuono, Biagio Venditti, Marit Nissen, Roberta Mattei, Debora Boccuni, Guendalina Losito, Pinuccio Sinisi, Monica Contini', null, 'Pietro Rinaldi, an elderly writer, widower and tired of life, plans to commit suicide on his birthday. After the sudden and tragic death of his daughter and son-in-law, Pietro will have to look after his teenage nephew Mattia.', 'Pietro Rinaldi, an elderly writer, widower and tired of life, plans to commit suicide on his birthday. After the sudden and tragic death of his daughter and son-in-law, Pietro will have to look after his teenage nephew Mattia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJgiwCkMgycIldUjnx19cc4AnHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190397'),
  ('809411990638147296', 'The Last Whale Singer', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Musical', 'Reza Memari, Jaromír Malý, Steven Majaury, Pavel Hrubos', 'Reza Memari', 'Flemming Stein, Philipp A. Reinheimer, Laura Pfister, Philippa Jarke, Toufik Abdedaim', 'PG', 'When a monstrous creature escapes from a melting iceberg, a self-doubting teenage humpback whale must face his fears and dive into the darkest depths with his friends, to discover a mystical song that can save the oceans from destruction.', 'When a monstrous creature escapes from a melting iceberg, a self-doubting teenage humpback whale must face his fears and dive into the darkest depths with his friends, to discover a mystical song that can save the oceans from destruction.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FweB3f1cXLB7O4gbYPhEwHFMqQo3.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-last-whale-singer-2026'),
  ('950953386048014644', 'The Last Will and Testament of Rosalind Leigh', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rodrigo Gudiño, Samy Inayeh', 'Rodrigo Gudiño', 'Aaron Poole, Vanessa Redgrave, Julian Richings, Stephen Eric McIntyre, Charlotte Sullivan, Sarah Illiatovitch-Goldman, Rodrigo Gudiño', 'NR', 'The story of Leon, an antiques collector who inherits a house from his estranged mother only to discover that she had been living in a shrine devoted to a mysterious cult. Soon, Leon comes to suspect that his mother''s oppressive spirit still lingers within her home and is using items in the house to contact him with an urgent message.', 'The story of Leon, an antiques collector who inherits a house from his estranged mother only to discover that she had been living in a shrine devoted to a mysterious cult. Soon, Leon comes to suspect that his mother''s oppressive spirit still lingers within her home and is using items in the house to contact him with an urgent message.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xlE1Stlkzd2vLdPpAqm4z5wlPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106717'),
  ('359378145387865911', 'The Last Will Be the Last', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Laura Greco, Riccardo Antonaroli, Valeria Puddu', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Furio Andreotti, Gianni Corsi', 'Paola Cortellesi, Alessandro Gassmann, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Stefano Fresi, Ilaria Spada, Federico Torre, Giorgio Caputo, Irma Carolina Di Monte', null, 'Luciana is a factory worker married to the love of her life. She is living the simple and quiet life she’s always desired: she works and she is deeply in love with her husband Stefano, even if he doesn’t always have a job and they both need to struggle to keep on going. They are happy and always on each other’s side, but shortly after she finds out she’s pregnant, she gets fired and her world starts falling apart. After having tried to have a baby for years, the joy of impending motherhood lasts only a few months. Begging for help but with no one ready to listen to her, completely desperate and shattered, Luciana decides to kidnap the managing director of her former company, asking for the justice she deserves.', 'Luciana is a factory worker married to the love of her life. She is living the simple and quiet life she’s always desired: she works and she is deeply in love with her husband Stefano, even if he doesn’t always have a job and they both need to struggle to keep on going. They are happy and always on each other’s side, but shortly after she finds out she’s pregnant, she gets fired and her world starts falling apart. After having tried to have a baby for years, the joy of impending motherhood lasts only a few months. Begging for help but with no one ready to listen to her, completely desperate and shattered, Luciana decides to kidnap the managing director of her former company, asking for the justice she deserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtqMPJWTpfo1XC42At1pvVeIyPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367999'),
  ('603552071619494831', 'The Last Winter', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Larry Fessenden, G. Magni Ágústsson', 'Larry Fessenden, Robert Leaver', 'Ron Perlman, James Le Gros, Connie Britton, Zach Gilford, Kevin Corrigan, Jamie Harrold, Pato Hoffmann, John Speredakos', 'PG-13', 'In the Arctic region of Northern Alaska, an oil company''s advance team struggles to establish a drilling base that will forever alter the pristine land. After one team member is found dead, a disorientation slowly claims the sanity of the others as each of them succumbs to a mysterious fear.', 'In the Arctic region of Northern Alaska, an oil company''s advance team struggles to establish a drilling base that will forever alter the pristine land. After one team member is found dead, a disorientation slowly claims the sanity of the others as each of them succumbs to a mysterious fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDHwjlPWcyNEkfgOVwIz3IaUNXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15667'),
  ('1022528622014191347', 'The Last Witch Hunter', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Breck Eisner, Dean Semler, Patrick Loungway', 'Cory Goodman, Matt Sazama, Burk Sharpless', 'Vin Diesel, Elijah Wood, Rose Leslie, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Julie Engelbrecht, Michael Caine, Joseph Gilgun, Isaach de Bankolé', 'PG-13', 'The modern world holds many secrets, but by far the most astounding is that witches still live among us; vicious supernatural creatures intent on unleashing the Black Death upon the world and putting an end to the human race once and for all. Armies of witch hunters have battled this unnatural enemy for centuries, including Kaulder, a valiant warrior who many years ago slayed the all-powerful Witch Queen, decimating her followers in the process. In the moments right before her death, the Queen cursed Kaulder with immortality, forever separating him from his beloved wife and daughter. Today, Kaulder is the last living hunter who has spent his immortal life tracking down rogue witches, all the while yearning for his long-lost family.', 'The modern world holds many secrets, but by far the most astounding is that witches still live among us; vicious supernatural creatures intent on unleashing the Black Death upon the world and putting an end to the human race once and for all. Armies of witch hunters have battled this unnatural enemy for centuries, including Kaulder, a valiant warrior who many years ago slayed the all-powerful Witch Queen, decimating her followers in the process. In the moments right before her death, the Queen cursed Kaulder with immortality, forever separating him from his beloved wife and daughter. Today, Kaulder is the last living hunter who has spent his immortal life tracking down rogue witches, all the while yearning for his long-lost family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dS9YdnJkxtKE2PKCSsxTaO7Jpf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274854'),
  ('785072962464924522', 'The Last Witness', 1960, 'Crime, Drama', 'Wolfgang Staudte', 'Robert A. Stemmle, Thomas Keck', 'Martin Held, Hanns Lothar, Ellen Schwiers, Jürgen Goslar, Adelheid Seeck, Werner Hinz, Lore Hartling, Siegfried Wischnewski', null, 'Director Wolfgang Staudte who left East Germany in 1953 to make movies in West Germany, takes a few swipes at the West German judicial system in this fairly effective courtroom drama about the murder of a four-month-old baby. Police almost immediately arrest the mother Ingrid who is the mistress of the father, a rich business VIP married to another woman. His position and wealth keep him insulated from suspicion. A hot-shot lawyer has to overcome the unaccountably biased perceptions of the police, the judge, the prosecutor and almost everyone else in the judicial system. The defence lawyer, driven to an extreme, knows he has to find the real killer or his client will be convicted.', 'Director Wolfgang Staudte who left East Germany in 1953 to make movies in West Germany, takes a few swipes at the West German judicial system in this fairly effective courtroom drama about the murder of a four-month-old baby. Police almost immediately arrest the mother Ingrid who is the mistress of the father, a rich business VIP married to another woman. His position and wealth keep him insulated from suspicion. A hot-shot lawyer has to overcome the unaccountably biased perceptions of the police, the judge, the prosecutor and almost everyone else in the judicial system. The defence lawyer, driven to an extreme, knows he has to find the real killer or his client will be convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YyZ80TEvNL5anZ4UyK2A7tscWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198961'),
  ('86272635302814902', 'The Last Witness', 1980, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama, War', 'Lee Doo-yong, Jung Il-sung, Cha Jung-nam', 'Yoon Sam-yook', 'Hah Myung-joong, Jeong Yun-hui, Choi Bool-am, Lee Dae-geun, Han Hye-suk, Bob Hyeon Gil-su, Sin Dong-wuk, Yun Il-ju', null, 'Detective Oh goes searching for the murderer of Yang, a small-time brewer bludgeoned to death by a quiet riverside with no witnesses, no apparent motive. As he wanders about the winter landscape of South Jeolla Province and Seoul, he finds himself caught in a story of treachery, rape and murder.', 'Detective Oh goes searching for the murderer of Yang, a small-time brewer bludgeoned to death by a quiet riverside with no witnesses, no apparent motive. As he wanders about the winter landscape of South Jeolla Province and Seoul, he finds himself caught in a story of treachery, rape and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncPR4utrtyBZ6gvJ8UnYQTRFv0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223610'),
  ('504796199463322231', 'The Last Witness', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Bae Chang-ho, Lee Seung Gu, Kim Yun-su', 'Bae Chang-ho', 'Lee Jung-jae, Ahn Sung-ki, Lee Mi-yeon, Jung Jun-ho, Park Won-sang, Kim Soo-ro, Kang Seong-jin, Lee Ki-young', null, 'Based on a true story and a legendary Korean novel, this movie follows Detective Oh (superstar Lee Jung Jae) and his investigation into the mysterious murder of a North Korean. His investigation leads him to a diary, which was written by a nun who - along with her boyfriend - helped lead the escape of North Korean POWs held captive during the Korean War. Detective Oh eventually becomes emotionally involved with the case and pursues the writer of the diary and her long-lost boyfriend, hoping to crack the case and learn more about the story of the POWs.', 'Based on a true story and a legendary Korean novel, this movie follows Detective Oh (superstar Lee Jung Jae) and his investigation into the mysterious murder of a North Korean. His investigation leads him to a diary, which was written by a nun who - along with her boyfriend - helped lead the escape of North Korean POWs held captive during the Korean War. Detective Oh eventually becomes emotionally involved with the case and pursues the writer of the diary and her long-lost boyfriend, hoping to crack the case and learn more about the story of the POWs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1ovLKtY3LN2wbsxhsRSEXJfbC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148873'),
  ('141451762683327221', 'The Last Witness', 2018, 'History, Thriller', 'Piotr Szkopiak, Edward Ames, Grantly Butters', 'Piotr Szkopiak, Paul Szambowski', 'Alex Pettyfer, Robert Więckiewicz, Talulah Riley, Michael Gambon, Henry Lloyd-Hughes, Piotr Stramowski, Gwilym Lee, Chris Walker', null, 'An ambitious young journalist uncovers the horrific slaughter of 22,000 Polish officers during World War II, a secret kept hidden for far too many years.', 'An ambitious young journalist uncovers the horrific slaughter of 22,000 Polish officers during World War II, a secret kept hidden for far too many years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4d6UHuQ2gpsaN38pMSZ42Fj6hi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519956'),
  ('853540765334063805', 'The Last Women Standing', 2015, 'Romance', 'Luo Luo, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Luo Luo', 'Shu Qi, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, King Shih-chieh, Pan Hong, Lynn Hung Doi-Lam, Hao Lei', null, 'For the thirtysomething Sheng Ruxi, whose surname unmistakably echoes the slang term "sheng nu" (leftover women), the wait for a perfect partner is growing more despairing by the day. With an ultra-anxious mother who would rather die than see her daughter stay single, Ruxi is further annoyed by the doctor she’s fixed up with. Could her new colleague, the dashing 25-year-old Ma Sai, offer last-minute salvation?', 'For the thirtysomething Sheng Ruxi, whose surname unmistakably echoes the slang term "sheng nu" (leftover women), the wait for a perfect partner is growing more despairing by the day. With an ultra-anxious mother who would rather die than see her daughter stay single, Ruxi is further annoyed by the doctor she’s fixed up with. Could her new colleague, the dashing 25-year-old Ma Sai, offer last-minute salvation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krp7jLzQDWGhwvMX1rKvsQfGvxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367877'),
  ('235444619556656910', 'The Last Word', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Geoffrey Haley, Kees Van Oostrum', 'Geoffrey Haley', 'Winona Ryder, Wes Bentley, Ray Romano, Gina Hecht, A.J. Trauth, Katherine Boecher, John Billingsley, Alison Moir', 'R', 'An odd-but-gifted poet, Evan Merck makes his living writing suicide notes for the soon-to-be departed. So when he meets Charlotte, the free-spirited sister of his latest client, Evan has no choice but to lie about his relationship to her late, lamented brother.', 'An odd-but-gifted poet, Evan Merck makes his living writing suicide notes for the soon-to-be departed. So when he meets Charlotte, the free-spirited sister of his latest client, Evan has no choice but to lie about his relationship to her late, lamented brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Aou5FwwTlMhiS63J49vcOoVCwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17175'),
  ('451404903075586871', 'The Last Word', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Pellington, Eric Koretz', 'Stuart Ross Fink', 'Shirley MacLaine, Amanda Seyfried, Anne Heche, Thomas Sadoski, Philip Baker Hall, Adina Porter, Sarah Baker, Tom Everett Scott', 'R', 'A retired businesswoman – who tries to control everything around her – decides to write her own obituary. A young journalist takes up the task of finding out the truth, and the result is a life-altering friendship.', 'A retired businesswoman – who tries to control everything around her – decides to write her own obituary. A young journalist takes up the task of finding out the truth, and the result is a life-altering friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvwBd0nsW5OqTs4ndEJLQY62leF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396810'),
  ('56863936480512131', 'The Last: Naruto the Movie', 2014, 'Action, Romance, Animation', 'Tetsuya Nishio, Hirofumi Suzuki, Hidetsugu Ito', 'Maruo Kyozuka', 'Junko Takeuchi, Nana Mizuki, Jun Fukuyama, Chie Nakamura, Showtaro Morikubo, Kazuhiko Inoue, Akira Ishida, Hideaki Tezuka', 'PG-13', 'Two years after the events of the Fourth Great Ninja War, the moon that Hagoromo Otsutsuki created long ago to seal away the Gedo Statue begins to descend towards the world, threatening to become a meteor that would destroy everything on impact. Amidst this crisis, a direct descendant of Kaguya Otsutsuki named Toneri Otsutsuki attempts to kidnap Hinata Hyuga but ends up abducting her younger sister Hanabi. Naruto and his allies now mount a rescue mission before finding themselves embroiled in a final battle to decide the fate of everything.', 'Two years after the events of the Fourth Great Ninja War, the moon that Hagoromo Otsutsuki created long ago to seal away the Gedo Statue begins to descend towards the world, threatening to become a meteor that would destroy everything on impact. Amidst this crisis, a direct descendant of Kaguya Otsutsuki named Toneri Otsutsuki attempts to kidnap Hinata Hyuga but ends up abducting her younger sister Hanabi. Naruto and his allies now mount a rescue mission before finding themselves embroiled in a final battle to decide the fate of everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAQ8O5Uw6FedtlCbJTutenzPVKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317442'),
  ('736472951894411206', 'The Late Bloomer', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Pollak, Akis Konstantakopoulos', 'Kyle Cooper, Paul A. Kapla, Gary Rosen', 'Johnny Simmons, Brittany Snow, J.K. Simmons, Jane Lynch, Maria Bello, Beck Bennett, Kumail Nanjiani, Paul Wesley', 'R', 'A sex therapist goes through puberty after the successful removal of a benign tumor resting against his pituitary gland. He experiences all the changes and effects of puberty over a three-week period.', 'A sex therapist goes through puberty after the successful removal of a benign tumor resting against his pituitary gland. He experiences all the changes and effects of puberty over a three-week period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al9PDW3lxsDGNnphpVWdO9GvSGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413471'),
  ('142766728537267871', 'The Late Edwina Black', 1951, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Maurice Elvey, Stephen Dade, Kenneth Rick', 'Charles Frank, David Evans', 'David Farrar, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Roland Culver, Jean Cadell, Mary Merrall, Harcourt Williams, Charles Heslop, Ronald Adam', 'NR', 'When a sickly Victorian woman dies suddenly, a postmortem reveals that her body contains a fatal dose of arsenic. Suspicion falls on her husband and her companion, who are lovers. Inspector Martin of Scotland Yard solves the mystery of her death... over a cup of tea.', 'When a sickly Victorian woman dies suddenly, a postmortem reveals that her body contains a fatal dose of arsenic. Suspicion falls on her husband and her companion, who are lovers. Inspector Martin of Scotland Yard solves the mystery of her death... over a cup of tea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32el8iZFAPKPyx12ogXVVrmKt7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146660'),
  ('929124363803724361', 'The Late George Apley', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Joseph LaShelle, F.E. ''Johnny'' Johnston', 'Philip Dunne', 'Ronald Colman, Peggy Cummins, Vanessa Brown, Mildred Natwick, Richard Haydn, Nydia Westman, Percy Waram, Richard Ney', 'NR', 'Bostonites George and Catherine Apley live a proper life in a social circle. However, their daughter Eleanor''s love for Howard Boulton and their son John''s union with Myrtle threatens their home.', 'Bostonites George and Catherine Apley live a proper life in a social circle. However, their daughter Eleanor''s love for Howard Boulton and their son John''s union with Myrtle threatens their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqZaTf6J1N3jLxJC7WM6qHJAOQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181537'),
  ('570967206126199075', 'The Late Mathias Pascal', 1925, 'Drama', 'Marcel L''Herbier, Fédote Bourgasoff, Jean Letort', 'Marcel L''Herbier', 'Ivan Mosjoukine, Marcelle Pradot, Lois Moran, Marthe Mellot, Pauline Carton, Irma Perrot, Michel Simon, Pierre Batcheff', null, 'Mathias Pascal, only son of a once-rich family, marries beautiful Romalinda, who has a terrible mother-in-law. She controls her daughter, and soon his home life becomes a nightmare. His only moments of lights are his mother and baby, but both die on the same day. Shocked, he leaves his hometown and goes to Monte Carlo, where he wins a fortune at the casino. Returning home, he reads his own obituary in a paper. They have found a corpse in a creek and connected it with his disappearance. Mathias, noticing that he is now free from all ties to his old life, decides to start a new one.', 'Mathias Pascal, only son of a once-rich family, marries beautiful Romalinda, who has a terrible mother-in-law. She controls her daughter, and soon his home life becomes a nightmare. His only moments of lights are his mother and baby, but both die on the same day. Shocked, he leaves his hometown and goes to Monte Carlo, where he wins a fortune at the casino. Returning home, he reads his own obituary in a paper. They have found a corpse in a creek and connected it with his disappearance. Mathias, noticing that he is now free from all ties to his old life, decides to start a new one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1krAySpyph0GxcS4Hp7EHGgKNH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66148'),
  ('11792328214710718', 'The Late Shift', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Betty Thomas, Richard Graves, Robert Lorenz', 'George Armitage, Bill Carter', 'John Michael Higgins, Daniel Roebuck, Kathy Bates, Bob Balaban, Ed Begley Jr., Peter Jurasik, Reni Santoni, John Kapelos', 'R', 'David Letterman vies with Jay Leno and his manager to succeed Johnny Carson, retiring from "The Tonight Show."', 'David Letterman vies with Jay Leno and his manager to succeed Johnny Carson, retiring from "The Tonight Show."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qDU1GxN5jOkA0s4rwgaMu9hfNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30330'),
  ('1070684554683524097', 'The Late Show', 1977, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy', 'Robert Benton, Charles Rosher Jr., Tommy Thompson', 'Robert Benton', 'Art Carney, Lily Tomlin, Bill Macy, Eugene Roche, Joanna Cassidy, John Considine, Ruth Nelson, John Davey', 'PG', 'Over-the-hill gumshoe in Los Angeles seeks to avenge the killing of an old pal, another detective who was involved in a case concerning a murdered broad, stolen stamps, a nickel-plated handgun, a cheating dolly, and a kidnapped pussycat.', 'Over-the-hill gumshoe in Los Angeles seeks to avenge the killing of an old pal, another detective who was involved in a case concerning a murdered broad, stolen stamps, a nickel-plated handgun, a cheating dolly, and a kidnapped pussycat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qii8jbAjid9MzBx7tUJf7URf8LO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42228'),
  ('1015189031864925016', 'The Latest Scams of El Torete', 1980, 'Action, Crime', 'Juan Gelpí, José Antonio de la Loma, Federico Canudas', 'José Antonio de la Loma', 'Ángel Fernández Franco, Bernard Seray, Berta Cabré, Isabel Mestres, Fernando Guillén, Simón Andreu, Carlos Lucena, Fredy Ripers', null, 'While the Torete rob banks, the Heifer, another delinquent who has not noticed it, enters the same place to rob him. After failing the coup, both decide to associate.', 'While the Torete rob banks, the Heifer, another delinquent who has not noticed it, enters the same place to rob him. After failing the coup, both decide to associate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4Y6XXHE1pHV7ML1XTbACP7eBjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132008'),
