  ('771932899650553479', 'The Laurel-Hardy Murder Case', 1930, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'James Parrott, George Stevens, Walter Lundin', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Frank Austin, Stanley Blystone, Bobby Burns, Rosa Gore, Dorothy Granger, Dell Henderson', 'NR', 'The boys think their days of fishing to feed themselves have come to an end, when Stan''s rich uncle Ebenezer dies leaving a large estate. But they soon learn that Ebenezer was murdered and all the relatives, including Stan, are suspects.', 'The boys think their days of fishing to feed themselves have come to an end, when Stan''s rich uncle Ebenezer dies leaving a large estate. But they soon learn that Ebenezer was murdered and all the relatives, including Stan, are suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akjxjGVkVcxFydmHQXVP5rTAJFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48822'),
  ('1105253176971987563', 'The Lavender Hill Mob', 1951, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Charles Crichton, Norman Priggen, Stephen Dalby', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Alec Guinness, Stanley Holloway, Sidney James, Alfie Bass, Marjorie Fielding, Edie Martin, John Salew, Ronald Adam', 'NR', 'A meek bank clerk who oversees the shipments of bullion joins with an eccentric neighbor to steal gold bars and smuggle them out of the country.', 'A meek bank clerk who oversees the shipments of bullion joins with an eccentric neighbor to steal gold bars and smuggle them out of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4mZyim3CwXHu0zVhXjfK8fqoN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32961'),
  ('479489605328927088', 'The Law', 1959, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jules Dassin, Jacques Deray, Nino Zanchin', 'Jules Dassin', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Pierre Brasseur, Marcello Mastroianni, Melina Mercouri, Yves Montand, Raf Mattioli, Vittorio Caprioli, Lidia Alfonsi', null, 'A gorgeous housekeeper turns the tables on the men in a small Mediterranean coastal town by using their own vicious drinking game.', 'A gorgeous housekeeper turns the tables on the men in a small Mediterranean coastal town by using their own vicious drinking game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t72s3vbVbhEVbGxYhdRMKQPXEb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80677'),
  ('1084370714748482675', 'The Law', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Idrissa Ouedraogo, Pierre-Laurent Chénieux, Jean Monsigny', 'Idrissa Ouedraogo', 'Rasmané Ouédraogo, Ina Cissé, Roukietou Barry, Assane Ouedraogo, Sibidou Sidibe, Moumouni Ouedraogo, Mariam Barry, Seydou Ouedraogo', null, 'Saga returns to his village after an extended absence to discover that his father has taken Nogma, Saga''s promised bride, for himself. Still in love with each other, the two begin an affair, although it would be considered incestuous.', 'Saga returns to his village after an extended absence to discover that his father has taken Nogma, Saga''s promised bride, for himself. Still in love with each other, the two begin an affair, although it would be considered incestuous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj2UAI0eWxhtqX7K4HatWZmM3tH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65482'),
  ('367366036740020100', 'The Law', 2014, 'History, TV Movie', 'Christian Faure, Jean-Pierre Hervé', 'Fanny Burdino, Samuel Doux, Mazarine Pingeot', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Lionel Abelanski, Lorànt Deutsch, Laure Killing, Flore Bonaventura, Lannick Gautry, Aurélia Petit, Anne Girouard', null, 'Directed by French Director Christian Faure and released in 2014, The Law brilliantly traces three days, in late Fall 1974, of stormy debate in the French National Assembly, around a bill which would make "voluntary termination of pregnancy" legal. Behind this bill stands a lone woman brilliantly played by a remarkable Emmanuelle Devos (also in The Other Son): Simone Veil the Minister of Health in the Jacques Chirac government during the presidency of Valéry Giscard d''Estaing. During these three days of violent debate Veil, a Jew and Holocaust survivor, is spared nothing: political negotiations, solitude, sparring arguments, insults and violence to her family. In spite of all of this, Veil never wavers.', 'Directed by French Director Christian Faure and released in 2014, The Law brilliantly traces three days, in late Fall 1974, of stormy debate in the French National Assembly, around a bill which would make "voluntary termination of pregnancy" legal. Behind this bill stands a lone woman brilliantly played by a remarkable Emmanuelle Devos (also in The Other Son): Simone Veil the Minister of Health in the Jacques Chirac government during the presidency of Valéry Giscard d''Estaing. During these three days of violent debate Veil, a Jew and Holocaust survivor, is spared nothing: political negotiations, solitude, sparring arguments, insults and violence to her family. In spite of all of this, Veil never wavers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qefiPO2XSxw65LhapWkcv06rQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329402'),
  ('1151405684121834624', 'The Law and Jake Wade', 1958, 'Western', 'John Sturges, Robert Surtees', 'William Bowers', 'Robert Taylor, Richard Widmark, Patricia Owens, Robert Middleton, Henry Silva, DeForest Kelley, Burt Douglas, Eddie Firestone', 'NR', 'Jake Wade breaks Clint Hollister out of jail to pay off an old debt, though it''s clear there is some pretty deep hostility between them. They part, and Jake returns to his small-town marshal''s job and his fiancée only to find he has been tracked there by Hollister. It seems they were once in a gang together and Jake knows where the proceeds of a bank hold-up are hidden. Hollister and his sidekicks make off into the hills, taking along the trussed-up marshal and his kidnapped bride-to-be to force the lawman to show them where the loot is.', 'Jake Wade breaks Clint Hollister out of jail to pay off an old debt, though it''s clear there is some pretty deep hostility between them. They part, and Jake returns to his small-town marshal''s job and his fiancée only to find he has been tracked there by Hollister. It seems they were once in a gang together and Jake knows where the proceeds of a bank hold-up are hidden. Hollister and his sidekicks make off into the hills, taking along the trussed-up marshal and his kidnapped bride-to-be to force the lawman to show them where the loot is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbQLht5Wu6gOeJPd04yaG9HEmT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44766'),
  ('173974321129269784', 'The Law and the Fist', 1964, 'War, Drama', 'Edward Skórzewski, Jerzy Hoffman, Włodzimierz Kamiński', 'Józef Hen', 'Gustaw Holoubek, Zofia Mrozowska, Hanna Skarżanka, Wiesław Gołas, Zdzisław Maklakiewicz, Ryszard Pietruski, Jerzy Przybylski, Wiesława Kwaśniewska', null, 'At the end of World War Two, Polish people move to the western lands vacated by Germans. But some ruthless profiteers pose as government representatives and intend to make off with loot from a deserted town they took over. One honest man stands up against them because he believes these goods belong to the people.', 'At the end of World War Two, Polish people move to the western lands vacated by Germans. But some ruthless profiteers pose as government representatives and intend to make off with loot from a deserted town they took over. One honest man stands up against them because he believes these goods belong to the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21jtE5H4sHWi9DMloPhT7rdccYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69822'),
  ('358751079610942177', 'The Law Is the Law', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Christian-Jaque, Alberto Cardone, Raymond Villette', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Christian-Jaque', 'Totò, Fernandel, Nino Besozzi, Noël Roquevert, Leda Gloria, Nathalie Nerval, Luciano Marin, Albert Dinan', null, 'Assola is an imaginary village on the border between Italy and France and the borderline crosses the village itself. The French customs agent Ferdinand is always trying to catch the Italian smuggler Giuseppe. Giuseppe discovers that Ferdinand was actually born in Italy and therefore he can''t be a French customs agent.', 'Assola is an imaginary village on the border between Italy and France and the borderline crosses the village itself. The French customs agent Ferdinand is always trying to catch the Italian smuggler Giuseppe. Giuseppe discovers that Ferdinand was actually born in Italy and therefore he can''t be a French customs agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGDcPVt5TeCP5U8jrLFKuQNy2Ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56544'),
  ('310288310082020125', 'The Lawless', 1950, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, J. Roy Hunt, Howard Pine', 'Daniel Mainwaring', 'Macdonald Carey, Gail Russell, Johnny Sands, Lee Patrick, John Hoyt, Lalo Rios, Maurice Jara, Walter Reed', null, 'A newspaper editor takes on the cause of oppressed migrant Mexican fruit pickers.', 'A newspaper editor takes on the cause of oppressed migrant Mexican fruit pickers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vxU3ot1tyPsJE6cSw5tEZ7SGJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64456'),
  ('806524926227501966', 'The Lawless Breed', 1952, 'Western', 'Raoul Walsh, Joseph Gershenson, William Holland', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Rock Hudson, Julie Adams, Mary Castle, John McIntire, Hugh O''Brian, Dennis Weaver, Forrest Lewis, Lee Van Cleef', 'NR', 'After being released from prison, ex-gunfighter John Wesley Hardin hopes to have his autobiography published in order to rehabilitate his tarnished reputation.', 'After being released from prison, ex-gunfighter John Wesley Hardin hopes to have his autobiography published in order to rehabilitate his tarnished reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjjbx5SCnKynd5bsMjX9pBUdyUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99224'),
  ('614057376141800070', 'The Lawless Frontier', 1934, 'Action, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Sheila Terry, Jack Rockwell, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Jay Wilsey, Gordon De Main, Earl Dwire, Lloyd Whitlock', 'NR', 'Tobin is after the bandit Zanti who killed his parents. He finds him just as Zanti is about to kill Dusty and kidnap Ruby. Saving the two, he goes after Zanti. He catches him but Zanti escapes the Sheriff''s handcuff''s and this time Tobin has to chase him into the desert.', 'Tobin is after the bandit Zanti who killed his parents. He finds him just as Zanti is about to kill Dusty and kidnap Ruby. Saving the two, he goes after Zanti. He catches him but Zanti escapes the Sheriff''s handcuff''s and this time Tobin has to chase him into the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Vcv5AXFwUo931w7Ip0H32fIOAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49640'),
  ('513889928600642678', 'The Lawless Nineties', 1936, 'Western', 'Joseph Kane', 'Joseph F. Poland', 'John Wayne, Ann Rutherford, Harry Woods, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Al Bridge, Fred ''Snowflake'' Toones, Etta McDaniel, Tom Brower', null, 'Federal Agents Tipton and Bridger have been sent to Wyoming where the vote on statehood is imminent. Plummer and his gang are out to make sure the vote fails. When Plummer''s men kill Bridger, Tipton fights on. He sends fake telegrams that trap some of Plummer''s men. Then he organizes the ranchers and on election day they descend on the town barricaded by Plummer''s gang.', 'Federal Agents Tipton and Bridger have been sent to Wyoming where the vote on statehood is imminent. Plummer and his gang are out to make sure the vote fails. When Plummer''s men kill Bridger, Tipton fights on. He sends fake telegrams that trap some of Plummer''s men. Then he organizes the ranchers and on election day they descend on the town barricaded by Plummer''s gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXbCaOO4LZieLSuIZ0xNER3hYpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121372'),
  ('1029161449030467368', 'The Lawnmower Man', 1987, 'Horror', 'James Gonis', 'Michael De Luca', 'E.D. Phillips, Andy Clark, Helen Hanft, Tony Disante, Robert Tossberg, Becky Taub, Neil Schimmel, Michael Albert', null, 'Short film / "Dollar Baby" version of the Stephen King short story from 1987.', 'Short film / "Dollar Baby" version of the Stephen King short story from 1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IEjYUaviFctoYtaVMn91K8r727.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281621'),
  ('950442282141867074', 'The Lawnmower Man', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Brett Leonard, Russell Carpenter, Gimel Everett', 'Brett Leonard, Gimel Everett', 'Jeff Fahey, Pierce Brosnan, Jenny Wright, Mark Bringelson, Geoffrey Lewis, Jeremy Slate, Dean Norris, Colleen Coffey', 'R', 'A simple man is turned into a genius through the application of computer science.', 'A simple man is turned into a genius through the application of computer science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDACpFww9vkeyYOj5xrfJuxoQdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10163'),
  ('604074741535797418', 'The Laws of Thermodynamics', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mateo Gil, Sergi Vilanova', 'Mateo Gil', 'Vito Sanz, Berta Vázquez, Chino Darín, Victoria Luengo, Irene Escolar, Josep Maria Pou, Andrea Ros, David Martín Surroca', null, 'Manel, a physicist working on his PhD thesis, accidentally fall in love with Elena, a young model and aspiring actress.', 'Manel, a physicist working on his PhD thesis, accidentally fall in love with Elena, a young model and aspiring actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtGxNRKQoQauWJkkRlnhvkEwyB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437029'),
  ('140794728649004786', 'The Lawyer', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maher Rady, Raafat El Mehi, Yousef Abu Saif', 'Raafat El Mehi', 'Adel Emam, Yousra, Esaad Younes, Hussein ElSherbiny, Salah Nazmi, Mohamed ElSharqawy, Hamdy Youssef, Youssef Eid', null, 'After getting sentenced with one month in prison for contempt of court, the lawyer Sbankh tries to take advantage of his jail time to establish many relations, most notably with drug dealer Hassouna,and Salim Abu Zaid, one of the centers of power in the 60s.', 'After getting sentenced with one month in prison for contempt of court, the lawyer Sbankh tries to take advantage of his jail time to establish many relations, most notably with drug dealer Hassouna,and Salim Abu Zaid, one of the centers of power in the 60s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqJgxyyvboG045t1g7ZE7qeFlcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193578'),
  ('770347610775534489', 'The Layover', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William H. Macy, Mark Irwin', 'David Hornsby, Lance Krall', 'Kate Upton, Alexandra Daddario, Matt Barr, Matt Jones, Kal Penn, Michael Benyaer, Emy Aneke, Joe Nuñez', 'R', 'When their plane is rerouted due to a hurricane warning, two single female best friends find themselves competing for the same guy during an extended layover in St. Louis.', 'When their plane is rerouted due to a hurricane warning, two single female best friends find themselves competing for the same guy during an extended layover in St. Louis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb9osnqanXRpkpm1bnSqAhKoq5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339404'),
  ('937088146042481888', 'The Lazarus Child', 2004, 'Drama, Horror', 'Graham Theakston, Lukas Strebel', 'Ronald Bass', 'Andy Garcia, Frances O''Connor, Angela Bassett, Harry Eden, Geraldine McEwan, Daniella Byrne, Christopher Shyer, Jaimz Woolvett', null, 'A desperate couple uses a doctor''s controversial method to revive their comatose daughter.', 'A desperate couple uses a doctor''s controversial method to revive their comatose daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sq0p0uNCjV0LiRoODhXBeD3dxSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37944'),
  ('347252518288066026', 'The Lazarus Effect', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'David Gelb, Michael Fimognari', 'Luke Dawson, Jeremy Slater', 'Mark Duplass, Olivia Wilde, Donald Glover, Evan Peters, Sarah Bolger, Amy Aquino, Ray Wise, Sean T. Krishnan', 'PG-13', 'Medical researcher Frank, his fiancee Zoe and their team have achieved the impossible: they have found a way to revive the dead. After a successful, but unsanctioned, experiment on a lifeless animal, they are ready to make their work public. However, when their dean learns what they''ve done, he shuts them down. Zoe is killed during an attempt to recreate the experiment, leading Frank to test the process on her. Zoe is revived -- but something evil is within her.', 'Medical researcher Frank, his fiancee Zoe and their team have achieved the impossible: they have found a way to revive the dead. After a successful, but unsanctioned, experiment on a lifeless animal, they are ready to make their work public. However, when their dean learns what they''ve done, he shuts them down. Zoe is killed during an attempt to recreate the experiment, leading Frank to test the process on her. Zoe is revived -- but something evil is within her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aq0TOLvITU3iWRUfxlRc83lMz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243940'),
  ('63370225761349541', 'The Lazarus Project', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Charles Crossin, Markian Saray', 'John Glenn', 'Paul Walker, Piper Perabo, Lambert Wilson, Linda Cardellini, Shawn Hatosy, Bob Gunton, Malcolm Goodwin, Brooklynn Proulx', 'PG-13', 'After Ben Garvey foolishly turned back to crime, he thought his life was over when he was sentenced to death by lethal injection. But his death sentence isn''t quite what it seems, as Ben regains consciousness near an eerie psychiatric ward, where he''s told he''s been hired as the groundskeeper. With the state of his soul in question, and the love for his wife and daughter all the more real and powerful, Ben must figure out if he''s truly cheated death, or if he''s become part of something far more sinister.', 'After Ben Garvey foolishly turned back to crime, he thought his life was over when he was sentenced to death by lethal injection. But his death sentence isn''t quite what it seems, as Ben regains consciousness near an eerie psychiatric ward, where he''s told he''s been hired as the groundskeeper. With the state of his soul in question, and the love for his wife and daughter all the more real and powerful, Ben must figure out if he''s truly cheated death, or if he''s become part of something far more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxf1AkFJskLrBM2WGwf8FpGcbiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13825'),
  ('60541405319903331', 'The Lead', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Villeneuve, Philippe Gagnon', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Perrey Reeves, Kim Shaw, Gord Rand, Bruce Dinsmore, Kristin Booth, Marc Bendavid, Amanda Chiu, Sandra Lee', null, 'Sasha wants to be a star news reporter but is stuck covering community events at the local TV station. However, when she is kidnapped and held captive, she suddenly becomes the story.', 'Sasha wants to be a star news reporter but is stuck covering community events at the local TV station. However, when she is kidnapped and held captive, she suddenly becomes the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9ZWrxoznoMFBW1mlj8NA0f17er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661437'),
  ('157364401711485616', 'The Lead Shoes', 1949, 'Drama', 'Sidney Peterson', null, 'Harlan Jackson', null, 'In "The Lead Shoes", we can neither thrust in our eyes nor our ears to help us understand how time flows or how space is. Therefore, Peterson forces us to take both space and time as relative experiences. The consistent disorientation in the film and our consistent inability to perceive them in absolute terms become the main subject of the film. Peterson makes us aware that space and time are more complicated than we think they are and they should be experienced in a more open-minded way. —Yoel Meranda', 'In "The Lead Shoes", we can neither thrust in our eyes nor our ears to help us understand how time flows or how space is. Therefore, Peterson forces us to take both space and time as relative experiences. The consistent disorientation in the film and our consistent inability to perceive them in absolute terms become the main subject of the film. Peterson makes us aware that space and time are more complicated than we think they are and they should be experienced in a more open-minded way. —Yoel Meranda', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0MOlAaVYXV2ii37MKEA5p7bXHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149072'),
  ('1139961045140056257', 'The Leaden Echo and the Golden Echo', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Margaret Tait', null, 'Margaret Tait', null, 'A film interpretation of the poem ''The Leaden Echo and the Golden Echo'' by Gerard Manley Hopkins. Margaret Tait speaks the poem throughout the film.', 'A film interpretation of the poem ''The Leaden Echo and the Golden Echo'' by Gerard Manley Hopkins. Margaret Tait speaks the poem throughout the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUt3kEW4alf4lxqVQgThjvpI2Qv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368930'),
  ('789078583183066957', 'The Leader, His Driver, and the Driver''s Wife', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield', null, 'Nick Broomfield, Eugène Terre''Blanche, J.P. Meyer, Anita Meyer', null, 'Nick Broomfield tries to interview Eugene Terre''Blanche, leader of the sinister neo-nazi AWB Afrikaner Party in South Africa. Cameras capture awkward interactions with skittish AWB supporters, combat training of militant youth, and the coveted interview itself. Broomfield''s access to these events is made possible by the leader''s driver, whose wavering allegiance to the movement is explored as well.', 'Nick Broomfield tries to interview Eugene Terre''Blanche, leader of the sinister neo-nazi AWB Afrikaner Party in South Africa. Cameras capture awkward interactions with skittish AWB supporters, combat training of militant youth, and the coveted interview itself. Broomfield''s access to these events is made possible by the leader''s driver, whose wavering allegiance to the movement is explored as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6QNPfTmBJADDKJmAZ8umamLZn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63309'),
  ('787511479091402541', 'The Leading Man', 1996, 'Thriller', 'John Duigan, Jean-François Robin', 'Virginia Duigan', 'Jon Bon Jovi, Anna Galiena, Lambert Wilson, Thandiwe Newton, Barry Humphries, David Warner, Patricia Hodge, Diana Quick', 'R', 'Successful playwright Felix Webb has a new play, ''The Hit Man'', in rehearsal. Directed by his old friend Humphrey, it is already being hailed as a masterpiece; but Felix can''t enjoy his success. He has fallen passionately in love with Hilary, a beautiful, fiesty young actress, and is preparing to desert his perfect family, his wife Elena and three lively children. His intolerable situation is further complicated when Humphrey casts Hilary as one of the leads in ''The Hit Man''. Enter Robin Grange, a charismatic young Hollywood actor making his London theatre debut. Robin is attractive, charming and dangerous, and soon inveigles his way into everyone''s life. He ingratiates himself with the cast and, quickly grasping Felix''s dilemma, sets about weaving his web of mischief. He suggests that if he were to seduce Elena, she would be distracted from Felix''s affair, regain her self respect, and perhaps even willingly part from the unfaithful husband to whom she clings...', 'Successful playwright Felix Webb has a new play, ''The Hit Man'', in rehearsal. Directed by his old friend Humphrey, it is already being hailed as a masterpiece; but Felix can''t enjoy his success. He has fallen passionately in love with Hilary, a beautiful, fiesty young actress, and is preparing to desert his perfect family, his wife Elena and three lively children. His intolerable situation is further complicated when Humphrey casts Hilary as one of the leads in ''The Hit Man''. Enter Robin Grange, a charismatic young Hollywood actor making his London theatre debut. Robin is attractive, charming and dangerous, and soon inveigles his way into everyone''s life. He ingratiates himself with the cast and, quickly grasping Felix''s dilemma, sets about weaving his web of mischief. He suggests that if he were to seduce Elena, she would be distracted from Felix''s affair, regain her self respect, and perhaps even willingly part from the unfaithful husband to whom she clings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Aywawe75W7VKip12gWuiBOiDiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46338'),
  ('78799294331747407', 'The League of Extraordinary Gentlemen', 2003, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Norrington, Dan Laustsen, Matthew Gratzner', 'James Robinson', 'Sean Connery, Naseeruddin Shah, Shane West, Peta Wilson, Stuart Townsend, Jason Flemyng, Tony Curran, Richard Roxburgh', 'PG-13', 'To prevent a world war from breaking out, famous characters from Victorian literature band together to do battle against a cunning villain.', 'To prevent a world war from breaking out, famous characters from Victorian literature band together to do battle against a cunning villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdAuVFP63XXxnb983ry2pLCKd9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8698'),
  ('160272242907538428', 'The League of Five', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Marvick Núñez, Eric Cabello, Roberto Jaimes', 'Acán Coen, David Israel Hernández, Luis Antonio Ávalos', 'Regina Blandón, Mario Iván Martínez, José Ángel Torres, Mariana Treviño', null, 'A group of mexican super heroes decide to join forces to combat the forces of evil.', 'A group of mexican super heroes decide to join forces to combat the forces of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiiO479azBVzsCRkwbQvBXgmYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593298'),
  ('293409983953879826', 'The League of Gentlemen', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Basil Dearden, Arthur Ibbetson, Terence A. Clegg', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Jack Hawkins, Nigel Patrick, Roger Livesey, Richard Attenborough, Bryan Forbes, Kieron Moore, Terence Alexander, Norman Bird', 'NR', 'Involuntarily-retired Colonel Hyde recruits seven other dissatisfied ex-servicemen for a special project. Each of the men has a skeleton in the cupboard, is short of money, and is a service-trained expert in his field. The job is a bank robbery, and military discipline and planning are imposed by Hyde and second-in-command Race on the team, although civilian irritations do start getting in the way.', 'Involuntarily-retired Colonel Hyde recruits seven other dissatisfied ex-servicemen for a special project. Each of the men has a skeleton in the cupboard, is short of money, and is a service-trained expert in his field. The job is a bank robbery, and military discipline and planning are imposed by Hyde and second-in-command Race on the team, although civilian irritations do start getting in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lJvpL5Z3qZxegmJHUpjGsWROtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46724'),
  ('206550078654183545', 'The League of Gentlemen''s Apocalypse', 2005, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steve Bendelack, Rob Kitzmann', 'Steve Pemberton, Jeremy Dyson, Reece Shearsmith', 'Mark Gatiss, Steve Pemberton, Reece Shearsmith, Michael Sheen, Danielle Tilley, Bruno Langley, Alan Morrissey, Liana O''Cleirigh', null, 'The fictional world of Royston Vasey is facing apocalypse and the only way to avert disaster is for our nightmarish cast of characters to find a way into the real world and confront their creators. From present day Soho to the fictional film world of 17th Century Britain, the residents must overcome countless bizarre obstacles in their bid to return Royston Vasey to safety.', 'The fictional world of Royston Vasey is facing apocalypse and the only way to avert disaster is for our nightmarish cast of characters to find a way into the real world and confront their creators. From present day Soho to the fictional film world of 17th Century Britain, the residents must overcome countless bizarre obstacles in their bid to return Royston Vasey to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3XYo7xdxg9QRecUZ1VpsfmZnxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19723'),
  ('759893710026714516', 'The Learning Tree', 1969, 'Drama', 'Gordon Parks, Burnett Guffey, Jack Aldworth', 'Gordon Parks', 'Kyle Johnson, Alex Clarke, Estelle Evans, Dana Elcar, Mira Waters, Joel Fluellen, Malcolm Atterbury, Richard Ward', 'PG', 'The story, set in Kansas during the 1920''s, covers less than a year in the life of a black teenager, and documents the veritable deluge of events which force him into sudden manhood. The family relationships and enmities, the fears, frustrations and ambitions of the black teenager in small-town America are explored with a strong statement about human values.', 'The story, set in Kansas during the 1920''s, covers less than a year in the life of a black teenager, and documents the veritable deluge of events which force him into sudden manhood. The family relationships and enmities, the fears, frustrations and ambitions of the black teenager in small-town America are explored with a strong statement about human values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxA20n5Oiy4Xx9nAqeXAMJ00S2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91737'),
  ('762344697397676758', 'The Leather Boys', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sidney J. Furie, Gerald Gibbs, Roy Baird', 'Gillian Freeman', 'Rita Tushingham, Colin Campbell, Dudley Sutton, Gladys Henson, Avice Landone, Lockwood West, Betty Marsden, Martin Matthews', null, 'Reggie and Dot are a young South London couple who get married before they really get to know each other. After the marriage, they quickly begin to drift apart. Dot seems content to pursue her own interests, until Reggie meets Pete, a fellow cyclist, and begins to explore his own identity.', 'Reggie and Dot are a young South London couple who get married before they really get to know each other. After the marriage, they quickly begin to drift apart. Dot seems content to pursue her own interests, until Reggie meets Pete, a fellow cyclist, and begins to explore his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9oYKhfxQYLu3Itkm4d4eeYBhaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140008'),
  ('411474301066298185', 'The Leatherneck', 1929, 'War, Drama', 'Howard Higgin', 'John W. Krafft, Elliott J. Clawson', 'William Boyd, Alan Hale, Robert Armstrong, Fred Kohler, Diane Ellis, Jimmy Aldine, Paul Weigel, Jules Cowles', 'NR', 'A film about male bonding. At the end of WW I, two Americans befriend a simple minded German and win him over into becoming an American. All three are still peacetime officers in the US Marines when an unscrupulous character steals Boyd''s girl and his two buddies go off to rescue her. When they don''t come back, Boyd goes after them to rescue all. This is all done in flashback from a court martial trial for desertion.', 'A film about male bonding. At the end of WW I, two Americans befriend a simple minded German and win him over into becoming an American. All three are still peacetime officers in the US Marines when an unscrupulous character steals Boyd''s girl and his two buddies go off to rescue her. When they don''t come back, Boyd goes after them to rescue all. This is all done in flashback from a court martial trial for desertion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dptsjP73Ihbe2cXbagVBXjxyy73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173572'),
  ('1117230306549614798', 'The Ledge', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Matthew Chapman, Bobby Bukowski', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Charlie Hunnam, Liv Tyler, Terrence Howard, Patrick Wilson, Jaqueline Fleming, Mike Pniewski, Jillian Batherson, Dean J. West', 'R', 'A thriller in which a battle of philosophies between a fundamentalist Christian and an atheist escalates into a lethal battle of wills.', 'A thriller in which a battle of philosophies between a fundamentalist Christian and an atheist escalates into a lethal battle of wills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTaDS6CTIfZ5MH189ub6oE1FATk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63493'),
  ('146824420903377049', 'The Ledge', 2022, 'Thriller, Adventure', 'Vladimir Vladica Ilić, Howard J. Ford', 'Tom Boyle', 'Brittany Ashworth, Nathan Welsh, Anaïs Parello, Louis Boyer, Ben Lamb, David Wayman', 'R', 'A rock climbing adventure between two friends turns into a terrifying nightmare. After Kelly captures the murder of her best friend on camera, she becomes the next target of a tight knit group of friends who will stop at nothing to destroy the evidence and anyone in their way.', 'A rock climbing adventure between two friends turns into a terrifying nightmare. After Kelly captures the murder of her best friend on camera, she becomes the next target of a tight knit group of friends who will stop at nothing to destroy the evidence and anyone in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S99eCSnRFfeZJmDaIGIZF58H7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924482'),
  ('688699747062838276', 'The Leech Woman', 1960, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Edward Dein, Ellis W. Carter', 'David Duncan', 'Coleen Gray, Grant Williams, Phillip Terry, Gloria Talbott, John van Dreelen, Estelle Hemsley, Kim Hamilton, Arthur Batanides', 'NR', 'An endocrinologist in a dysfunctional marriage with an aging, alcoholic wife journeys to Africa seeking a drug that will restore youth.', 'An endocrinologist in a dysfunctional marriage with an aging, alcoholic wife journeys to Africa seeking a drug that will restore youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xMaV4WLDdFQtc3VZiNfy9ViE0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52745'),
  ('176674395526235161', 'The Left Ear', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alec Su, Zhao Fei, Hao Fang-wei', 'Rao Xueman', 'Chen Duling, Ou Hao, Ma Sichun, Yang Yang, Guan Xiaotong, Duan Bowen, Hu Xia, Bao Wenjing', null, 'Li Er, a 17 year old girl who has great difficulty hearing out of her left ear, is rejected after confessing her love to a boy, Xu yi. Instead the boy is in love with Li Bala, a girl who is in fact in love with Zhang Yang. Li Er befriends Li Bala, who dies due to an accident. As the movie progresses, Li Er overcomes her hatred of Zhang Yang, whom she blamed for Li Bala''s death.', 'Li Er, a 17 year old girl who has great difficulty hearing out of her left ear, is rejected after confessing her love to a boy, Xu yi. Instead the boy is in love with Li Bala, a girl who is in fact in love with Zhang Yang. Li Er befriends Li Bala, who dies due to an accident. As the movie progresses, Li Er overcomes her hatred of Zhang Yang, whom she blamed for Li Bala''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb5HkB37ux425QntqjeWBcdth2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334973'),
  ('85093422950551724', 'The Left Hand of God', 1955, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Franz Planer, Edward Dmytryk, Ben Kadish', 'Alfred Hayes', 'Humphrey Bogart, Gene Tierney, Lee J. Cobb, Agnes Moorehead, E.G. Marshall, Jean Porter, Carl Benton Reid, Victor Sen Yung', 'NR', 'A man in priestly robes, seemingly the long-awaited Father O''Shea, arrives at a little-frequented Catholic mission in 1947 China. Though the man seems curiously uncomfortable with his priestly duties, his tough tactics prove very successful in the Seven Villages, as around them China disintegrates in civil war and revolution. But he has a secret, and his friendship with mission nurse Anne (an attractive war widow) seems to be taking on an unpriestly tone.', 'A man in priestly robes, seemingly the long-awaited Father O''Shea, arrives at a little-frequented Catholic mission in 1947 China. Though the man seems curiously uncomfortable with his priestly duties, his tough tactics prove very successful in the Seven Villages, as around them China disintegrates in civil war and revolution. But he has a secret, and his friendship with mission nurse Anne (an attractive war widow) seems to be taking on an unpriestly tone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyWW2SCaCvBJfSW7gPvhy4fVtDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63618'),
  ('189993117549386100', 'The Left Handed Gun', 1958, 'Western', 'Russell Saunders, Arthur Penn, J. Peverell Marley', 'Leslie Stevens', 'Paul Newman, Lita Milan, John Dehner, Hurd Hatfield, James Congdon, James Best, Colin Keith-Johnston, John Dierkes', 'NR', 'When a crooked sheriff murders his employer, William "Billy the Kid" Bonney decides to avenge the death by killing the man responsible, throwing the lives of everyone around him into turmoil, and endangering the General Amnesty set up by Governor Wallace to bring peace to the New Mexico Territory.', 'When a crooked sheriff murders his employer, William "Billy the Kid" Bonney decides to avenge the death by killing the man responsible, throwing the lives of everyone around him into turmoil, and endangering the General Amnesty set up by Governor Wallace to bring peace to the New Mexico Territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxTgWHP7CX32eFmi5nNSE7Kwwy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42402'),
  ('303900191929063830', 'The Left-Handed Woman', 1978, 'Drama', 'Peter Handke, Peter Stephan Jungk, F.C. Maye', 'Peter Handke', 'Edith Clever, Markus Mühleisen, Bruno Ganz, Michael Lonsdale, Angela Winkler, Ines Des Longchamps, Philippe Caizergues, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'Mourning for a lost relationship can be every bit as devastating as mourning for someone who has died. In this drama based on the director''s own novel, a couple with an unhappy marriage agree to a trial separation. They try to patch things up, and at the same time other relationships begin to develop for them.', 'Mourning for a lost relationship can be every bit as devastating as mourning for someone who has died. In this drama based on the director''s own novel, a couple with an unhappy marriage agree to a trial separation. They try to patch things up, and at the same time other relationships begin to develop for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec9NHlUjOOLwEYBCimoq2uaZHO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198511'),
  ('828946710463412728', 'The Leg', 1991, 'War, Drama', 'Nikita Tyagunov, Sergei Lyubchenko, Yuriy Galyatkin', 'Nadezhda Kozhushanaya', 'Ivan Okhlobystin, Pyotr Mamonov, Ivan Zakhava, Natalya Petrova, Farhad Mahmudov, Lyudmila Larionova, Sherali Abdulkajsov, Oksana Mysina', null, 'The film''s protagonist Valera - cheerful guy from Moscow, who at age 19 learned a whole hell of war in Afghanistan, where he lost a leg. Returning from the war, he had no idea what a nightmare for him is just beginning.', 'The film''s protagonist Valera - cheerful guy from Moscow, who at age 19 learned a whole hell of war in Afghanistan, where he lost a leg. Returning from the war, he had no idea what a nightmare for him is just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAdB5SZ5pWvuQSPp1YAxya4ZOjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287882'),
  ('739144766661358843', 'The Legacy', 1978, 'Horror', 'Dick Bush, Alan Hume, Richard Marquand', 'Jimmy Sangster, Paul Wheeler, Patrick Tilley', 'Katharine Ross, Sam Elliott, Roger Daltrey, John Standing, Ian Hogg, Margaret Tyzack, Charles Gray, Lee Montague', 'R', 'A couple attempts to unravel a sinister plot within the English countryside estate of a dying man who has gathered an eclectic and notable group of house guests.', 'A couple attempts to unravel a sinister plot within the English countryside estate of a dying man who has gathered an eclectic and notable group of house guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYlDAZvB8g06PGGEOQIQcCVlHOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42215'),
  ('383972102725863352', 'The Legacy of a Whitetail Deer Hunter', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jody Hill, Eric Treml', 'John Carcieri, Jody Hill, Danny McBride', 'Josh Brolin, Danny McBride, Scoot McNairy, Montana Jordan, William Cowboy Reed, Carrie Coon', null, 'A star of hunting videos strives to bond with his 12-year-old son on a wilderness trip but learns familial connections can''t be forced.', 'A star of hunting videos strives to bond with his 12-year-old son on a wilderness trip but learns familial connections can''t be forced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOHduIbPV196GU0LMB1NFyR3IRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311307'),
  ('1016772283565518937', 'The Legacy of the Siren', 2012, 'History, Drama', 'Thomas Nennstiel, Rainer Lauter', 'Caroline Hecht', 'Alexandra Neldel, Götz Otto, Bert Tischendorf, Julie Engelbrecht, Nadja Becker, Michael Steinocher, Florence Kasumba, Ill-Young Kim', null, 'Michel must go to dangerous lengths to save his wife and newborn child from the intrigues of the king’s mistress in this historical drama.', 'Michel must go to dangerous lengths to save his wife and newborn child from the intrigues of the king’s mistress in this historical drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ao99UIW9iwiTblyLaFU7WMNVvnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143394'),
  ('227042774500014650', 'THE LEGEND & BUTTERFLY', 2023, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Keishi Otomo, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Takuya Kimura, Haruka Ayase, Hideaki Ito, Miki Nakatani, Takumi Saitoh, Hio Miyazawa, Somegoro Ichikawa, Kinya Kitaoji', 'R', 'Oda Nobunaga and Nōhime were originally married to mend a hostile relationship between neighbouring regions. Unfortunately, they were like oil and water, making for a somewhat unhappy marriage. When Oda''s enemy, Imagawa Yoshimoto, attacks Owari with his vast army, Oda is devastated by the overwhelming gap in military strength. However, Nohime encourages him not to despair, and the pair draw up a tactical plan that will allow them to overcome the odds.', 'Oda Nobunaga and Nōhime were originally married to mend a hostile relationship between neighbouring regions. Unfortunately, they were like oil and water, making for a somewhat unhappy marriage. When Oda''s enemy, Imagawa Yoshimoto, attacks Owari with his vast army, Oda is devastated by the overwhelming gap in military strength. However, Nohime encourages him not to despair, and the pair draw up a tactical plan that will allow them to overcome the odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVkRjq1FBSlNI6olwVUNUm2m7R2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990365'),
  ('896712521104359050', 'The Legend II', 1993, 'Action, Comedy', 'Corey Yuen, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, John Chan Kin-Chung', 'Jet Li, Josephine Siao Fong-Fong, Michele Reis, Amy Kwok, Ji Chunhua, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Corey Yuen, Peter Chan Lung', null, 'The hero Fong Sai Yuk becomes involved in the secret brotherhood "The Red Flower", who are trying to overthrow the Manchurian emperor and re-establishing the Ming dynasty. The social upheaval is combined with Sai Yuk''s personal moral conflict about how to conform to the rigid regime of the brotherhood and on top of that sort out his difficult love life, saddled with two presumptive wives.', 'The hero Fong Sai Yuk becomes involved in the secret brotherhood "The Red Flower", who are trying to overthrow the Manchurian emperor and re-establishing the Ming dynasty. The social upheaval is combined with Sai Yuk''s personal moral conflict about how to conform to the rigid regime of the brotherhood and on top of that sort out his difficult love life, saddled with two presumptive wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioG9sQbDV1yqOvB7EDlF6jBMKCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17811'),
  ('605921745655455330', 'The Legend Is Born: Ip Man', 2010, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Herman Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Mandy Ngai Man-Yin', 'Erica Li, Eric Lee', 'Dennis To Yu-Hang, Crystal Huang Yi, Yuen Biao, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Rose Chan Ka-Wun, Ip Chun, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Bernice Liu Bik-Yee', 'NR', 'The remarkable true story of the early life of Ip Man, the formidable kung fu genius who would become Bruce Lee''s mentor; beginning at the start of his journey from his initial training through to the ultimate battle to become supreme master of the art of Wing Chun.', 'The remarkable true story of the early life of Ip Man, the formidable kung fu genius who would become Bruce Lee''s mentor; beginning at the start of his journey from his initial training through to the ultimate battle to become supreme master of the art of Wing Chun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekJxJ037GWBrqIR8FX7Kh7daaR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44249'),
  ('370797739313250693', 'The Legend of 1900', 1998, 'Drama, Music', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Lajos Koltai, Jeremy Zimmermann', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Tim Roth, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Mélanie Thierry, Bill Nunn, Gabriele Lavia, Clarence Williams III, Peter Vaughan, Niall O''Brien', 'R', 'Musician Max Tooney goes to sell his prized Conn trumpet to a music shop, where he plays the instrument one last time. The shopkeeper recognises the song as one on a record matrix he found and asks who the piece is by. Tooney tells the story of an infant found abandoned in the first class dining room of the four-stacker ocean-liner SS Virginian on 1 January 1900. Danny Boodman, a coal-man from the boiler room, names the boy Danny Boodman T. D. Lemon 1900, after himself, the fruit crate the boy was found in, and the year, and raises him as his own.', 'Musician Max Tooney goes to sell his prized Conn trumpet to a music shop, where he plays the instrument one last time. The shopkeeper recognises the song as one on a record matrix he found and asks who the piece is by. Tooney tells the story of an infant found abandoned in the first class dining room of the four-stacker ocean-liner SS Virginian on 1 January 1900. Danny Boodman, a coal-man from the boiler room, names the boy Danny Boodman T. D. Lemon 1900, after himself, the fruit crate the boy was found in, and the year, and raises him as his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOcbJ5pxokOPDRgieVDbsFMrCc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10376'),
  ('581591074671212138', 'The Legend of a Mask', 1991, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'José Buil', 'José Buil', 'Héctor Bonilla, María Rojo, Roberto Cobo, Damián Alcázar, Gina Morett, Héctor Ortega, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Juan Carlos Colombo', null, 'A reporter starts investigating the life of the recently deceased wrestler "The Masked Angel"', 'A reporter starts investigating the life of the recently deceased wrestler "The Masked Angel"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1369HfgJ8LjeEQljaoxEbKrVyB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347641'),
  ('569608877655947587', 'The Legend of Al, John and Jack', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Massimo Venier, Aldo Baglio, Giacomo Poretti', 'Giacomo Poretti, Walter Fontana, Aldo Baglio', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Aldo Maccione, Antonio Catania, Giovanni Esposito, Ivano Marescotti, Frank Crudele', null, 'Hapless Depression-era gangsters Al, John and Jack find out their boss wants to get rid of them and come up with a plan to sell him to the FBI, but Al''s short-term memory loss could make it difficult.', 'Hapless Depression-era gangsters Al, John and Jack find out their boss wants to get rid of them and come up with a plan to sell him to the FBI, but Al''s short-term memory loss could make it difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7Xb04P1uCUJ1LADWD5RfqWGyDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38397'),
  ('251484730483922766', 'The Legend of Bagger Vance', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Robert Redford, Michael Ballhaus, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Jeremy Leven', 'Matt Damon, Will Smith, Charlize Theron, Bruce McGill, Joel Gretsch, J. Michael Moncrief, Peter Gerety, Wilbur Fitzgerald', 'PG-13', 'World War I has left golfer Rannulph Junuh a poker-playing alcoholic, his perfect swing gone. Now, however, he needs to get it back to play in a tournament to save the financially ravaged golf course of a long-ago sweetheart. Help arrives in the form of mysterious caddy Bagger Vance.', 'World War I has left golfer Rannulph Junuh a poker-playing alcoholic, his perfect swing gone. Now, however, he needs to get it back to play in a tournament to save the financially ravaged golf course of a long-ago sweetheart. Help arrives in the form of mysterious caddy Bagger Vance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jKjh9PZvHJYYtCycQmTbBoZVV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4958'),
  ('268199941770541735', 'The Legend of Barney Thomson', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Carlyle, Fabian Wagner', 'Colin McLaren, Richard Cowan', 'Robert Carlyle, Emma Thompson, Ray Winstone, Ashley Jensen, James Cosmo, Tom Courtenay, Kevin Guthrie, Martin Compston', null, 'Barney Thomson, awkward, diffident, Glasgow barber, lives a life of desperate mediocrity and his uninteresting life is about to go from 0 to 60 in five seconds, as he enters the grotesque and comically absurd world of the serial killer.', 'Barney Thomson, awkward, diffident, Glasgow barber, lives a life of desperate mediocrity and his uninteresting life is about to go from 0 to 60 in five seconds, as he enters the grotesque and comically absurd world of the serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33GSk2lz3V16Zq0vFx0MTmeu3tQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283596'),
