  ('725978730903272567', 'The Legend of Bhagat Singh', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, K. V. Anand', 'Anjum Rajabali', 'Ajay Devgn, Amrita Rao, Sushant Singh, Akhilendra Mishra, D. Santosh, Bhaswar Chatterjee, Raj Babbar, Farida Jalal', null, 'Born in British India, Bhagat Singh witnesses numerous atrocities during his childhood and grows up to become one of the most fearless freedom fighters in the country.', 'Born in British India, Bhagat Singh witnesses numerous atrocities during his childhood and grows up to become one of the most fearless freedom fighters in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOd8woHbZUDn9HheKTkSQHFNTZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31525'),
